SUMMARY:Resume Fundamentals for Co-op (In-Person)
DESCRIPTION:The York University Co-op Program provides students with opportunities for paid, hands-on learning and valuable industry experience. We encourage you to visit the Co-operative Education website to review program details and confirm that you meet the academic requirements.\nResume Fundamentals for Co-op\nThe session will cover several fundamental resume topics to help you prepare for your co-op job search including:\n\nResume and cover letter basics\nEmployers’ expectations in a co-op resume and cover letter\nTips for resume format, content, and do’s and don’ts that specifically target co-op level positions.\n\nJoin in Person:\nFriday, October 9\n2:00 p.m. – 3:00 p.m.\n1014 Victor Phillip Dahdelah Building\nRegister Here [icon name=”chevron-right” class=”small pl-2″]\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/resume-fundamentals-for-co-op-in-person-2/
CATEGORIES:Co-op &amp; Career Centre,Co-op Mandatory Sessions (CCC),Information Sessions (CCC),Resume Fundamentals
LOCATION:1014 Victor Philip Dahdaleh Building
END:VEVENT
