SUMMARY:Economics Alumni Gathering
DESCRIPTION:We’re excited to announce the launch of our Economics Student Alumni Association—an initiative created to strengthen the connections between our alumni and students, celebrate the paths our graduates have taken, and create new opportunities for our community to reconnect and engage.\nTo celebrate, we’re hosting our inaugural Economics Alumni Gathering in Toronto’s Financial District. Alumni will have an opportunity to reconnect with former classmates, meet fellow Economics alumni, exchange ideas, and build new relationships within our growing community.\nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday, Oct. 15\nTime: 6:30 p.m. – 10 p.m.\nLocation: Oria on King, 220 King St W Toronto, ON M5V 3M2, Canada\nRefreshments will be served.\n
