SUMMARY:Fundamentals of Google’s Notebook LM
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop, you will learn to use Googles Notebook LM to build a study system that maximizes your limited time by transforming ebooks, digital notes and other sources into a personalized knowledge base. \nWe will cover how to generate custom study aids including: podcasts, mind maps, reports and others. You’ll also discover how to balance a busy schedule with efficient active-learning tools like AI-generated practice quizzes, flashcards and a Socratic tutor that simplifies complex academic topics. \nDate: Thursday November 17th, 2026 \nTime: 1:00pm – 2:00pm \nLocation: Zoom  \nRegister here: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/GCAjMJRiRLaLOiEIgiTKvg \n
