SUMMARY:Biotechnology (Graduate Diploma) – International Students Only
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Biotechnology ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/8nBBj01dTxOf1uInOxIx-Q ), or Biotechnology Management ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/8nBBj01dTxOf1uInOxIx-Q )? We invite you to attend our program information session!\nThe Master of Biotechnology Management is a graduate program designed to provide students who hold a Bachelor of Science degree in Biology, Biological Sciences, Biotechnology, Life Science, or related discipline, and have little/no work experience in Biotechnology, with practical interdisciplinary training in Biotechnology and Management to enhance their competitiveness and employability in the biotechnology management related sectors. Students are awarded two credentials upon completion of the program requirements, a Master of Biotechnology Management and a Graduate Diploma in Management.\nThe Graduate Diploma in Biotechnology (GDB) is a graduate certification designed for students who hold a Bachelor of Science degree in Biology, Biological Sciences, Biotechnology, Life Science, or related discipline, and have little/no work experience in Biotechnology, to enhance their competitiveness and employability in the biotechnology sector. The Graduate Diploma in Biotechnology is designed to provide professional preparation for our graduates to fill current labor needs in the biotechnology sector and strengthen the Canadian economy.\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\nRegistration Required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/8nBBj01dTxOf1uInOxIx-Q ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/biotechnology-graduate-diploma-international-students-only/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies,Faculty of Graduate Studies (Programs),Graduate Diploma in Biotechnology,Graduate Program in Biotechnology Management
LOCATION:(URL will be provided in the email confirmation)
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FGS_Banner_1-7-48.png
END:VEVENT
