SUMMARY:Information Systems & Technology (MAIST)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Information Systems & Technology ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/sIAVzn_RTryS36Y-hFv2WQ )? We invite you to attend our program session!\nThe Master of Arts in Information Systems & Technology (MAIST) is an innovative graduate program dedicated to the study of Information Technologies and their application to solving business and societal problems. Working with faculty experts from several departments at York University, students can choose courses and research projects from many IT areas. A major feature of the program is its flexibility and the option for students to choose courses from other programs that complement our IT courses. The program is designed for both working professionals and research-oriented students. Offered in both part-time and full-time format.\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\nRegistration Required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/sIAVzn_RTryS36Y-hFv2WQ ).\n
