SUMMARY:English (MA, PhD)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in English ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/Nxeb3HF-SK2VVAF3ajxsFA )? We invite you to attend our program session!\nThe tradition of our Graduate Program in English is to challenge the idea of tradition itself. Always questioning the limits and limitations of established knowledge, our award-winning faculty is proud of its reputation for adventurous, interdisciplinary, and innovative approaches to the study of literature. Over the past three generations, our forward-thinking research and engaging teaching methodologies have helped shape literary scholarship across the world.\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\nRegistration Required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/Nxeb3HF-SK2VVAF3ajxsFA ).\n
