SUMMARY:Science & Technology Studies (MA, PhD)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Science & Technology Studies ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/19TqNOwPSRqLDATAHoljlg )? We invite you to attend our program session!\nYork’s Science & Technology Studies (STS) Graduate Program is the first English–speaking STS program in Canada offering advanced training leading to both MA and PhD degrees. Students in this program are encouraged to draw connections across traditional disciplinary boundaries as they examine and analyze the role of science, technology, and innovation in our societies, cultures, and economies. An MA or PhD degree in STS from York is extremely versatile and is a fitting background for careers that require insight into the complexities of scientific and technological societies and economies (e.g. policy, law, business, academia, charities, etc.)\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at  fgsapply@yorku.ca ( http://Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Science & Technology Studies? We invite you to attend our program session! York’s Science & Technology Studies (STS) Graduate Program is the first English–speaking STS program in Canada offering advanced training leading to both MA and PhD degrees. Students in this program are encouraged to draw connections across traditional disciplinary boundaries as they examine and analyze the role of science, technology, and innovation in our societies, cultures, and economies. An MA or PhD degree in STS from York is extremely versatile and is a fitting background for careers that require insight into the complexities of scientific and technological societies and economies (e.g. policy, law, business, academia, charities, etc.) Learn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs Still have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca. ).\nRegistration Required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/19TqNOwPSRqLDATAHoljlg ).\n
