SUMMARY:History (MA, PhD)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in History ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/1eJjFJLSReSggkTEmU4f1A )? We invite you to attend our program information session!\nYork’s Graduate Program in History is distinguished by a vibrant intellectual climate embracing a wide range of geographical and thematic areas of historical research. Long known for its strength in Canadian History, the program also offers areas of research in Comparative, Global and Transnational History, Africa, the Caribbean and Latin America and the History of the Ancient World. York’s faculty include leading scholars who have won major prizes for their research and publications.\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\nRegistration Required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/1eJjFJLSReSggkTEmU4f1A ).\n
