SUMMARY:Health (MA, PhD)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Health ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/I-8YL6xJQfukmGEVcU1NaA )? We invite you to attend our program session!\nThe Graduate Program in Health is an exciting learning environment that focuses on real-world and applied research questions related to health. It is theoretically informed and research-based. The program examines the effects of health policies, health systems health care programs and practices, norms, organizations, and decision-making on health outcomes that are often inequitable. The program emphasizes how societal, economic, political, organizational, and cultural processes influence health. The program offers two fields of specialization: Health Policy & Equity and Health System Management & Health Data Analytics.\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\nRegistration Required. ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/I-8YL6xJQfukmGEVcU1NaA )\n
