SUMMARY:Scholars’ Hub | Reclaim Your Commute: Find balance and well-being on the way 
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Winny Shen, Associate Professor of Organization Studies, Schulich School of Business\nYour commute could be more than just getting from point A to point B. In this session, we’ll explore how commuting can be transformed from a daily drain into a valuable part of your day—whether as a time to decompress, prepare for what’s ahead, or simply enjoy a few moments to yourself. You’ll learn practical, research-backed ways to make your commute more enjoyable and support your overall well-being.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/scholars-hub-reclaim-your-commute-find-balance-and-well-being-on-the-way/
