SUMMARY:Career Ready: International Student Conference
DESCRIPTION:\nInternational students: Are you ready to take the next step in building your career in Canada?\nThe Career Ready –  International Student Conference (CRC) 2026 is designed specifically for international undergraduate students who want to build confidence, expand their professional networks and prepare for success in the Canadian job market.\nHear from employers about how you can prepare for the rapidly changing hiring landscape, practice your networking with alumni over lunch and connect with professionally-minded international student peers.\nLook forward to:\n\nInteractive workshops\nAlumni networking opportunities\nEmployer panelist insights\nProfessional headshots for all student attendees\n\nThe cost to participate at this event is $15.00 per student. \nLearn More & Register [icon name=”chevron-right” class=”small pl-2″]\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/career-ready-international-student-conference/
CATEGORIES:Co-op &amp; Career Centre
LOCATION:Schulich Executive Dining Room, Schulich School of Business (York University, Keele Campus)
