SUMMARY:Climate Café & Climate Fresk Event
DESCRIPTION:The collaborative Climate Café & Climate Fresk combines two proven approaches to engaging about climate change:\nClimate Fresk is an interactive workshop that helps participants understand the science, causes, and impacts of climate change through collaborative learning. Using information based on IPCC research, you’ll work with others to explore how climate systems are connected and gain a deeper understanding of today’s climate challenges.Climate Café provides a safe space to talk about how you are being impacted, share thoughts and feelings, and begin to identify how you can take meaningful climate action.\nTogether this combined event gives you the knowledge you need, process the emotions you have and builds your resilience to take action for the benefit of you, your community and our planet.\nHelp us test out this novel idea, while developing your skills and having fun! Drinks and snacks will be provided.\n—\nMonday 5th October, 2026 – 2:30 PM\nOrganized by WIL – Wellness Impact Lab and The Office of Sustainability.\nFormat: In-Person\nAudience: York Community\nLimited Spots available – We will contact you with the event details following your registration.\nRegister Online\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/climate-cafe-climate-fresk-event/
CATEGORIES:Sustainability,Well-being,Well-being Week
END:VEVENT
