SUMMARY:IMSTA FESTA Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Join IMSTA (International Music Software Trade Association) as they host IMSTA FESTA, a celebration of music technology packed with Panels, Workshops & Master Classes, Song Reviews, Demonstrations and more. Hosting industry experts in an environment where music-makers can network, interact and learn with each other face-to-face, this annual one-day event is not to be missed. IMSTA FESTA is a FREE event open to everyone in the music making community!\nRegister for IMSTA FESTA and each Master Class separately in order to reserve your spot.\nAdmission is FREE with REGISTRATION.\nDate: Saturday, October 17, 2026\nTime: 11:00 a.m. – 6:00 p.m.\nLocation: Accolade East Building ( https://maps.app.goo.gl/CtWT2wE9W39zzJwQ9 ) | York University\nRegister HERE ( https://imsta.org/2026_TO#register )\nAlso FREE Breakfast for the first 100 visitors starting at 10:30am.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/imsta-festa-toronto/
