SUMMARY:Common Hour: Accolade Trio
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a dynamic midday escape featuring the Accolade Trio, York University’s premier faculty-in-residence ensemble. Clarinetist Patricia Wait ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/people/patricia-wait/ ), cellist Mark Chambers ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/people/mark-chambers/ ), and pianist Elizabeth Acker ( https://solidaridadtango.ca/elizabeth-acker ) take the stage to breathe vibrant life into classical and contemporary masterpieces. Don’t miss this exceptional hour of brilliant chamber music, performing live at the Tribute Communities Recital Hall.\nDate: Thursday, January 14\nLocation: Tribute Communities Recital Hall ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/tribute-communities-recital-hall/ )\nTime: 12:30 – 1:30 p.m.\nFree Admission\n
