SUMMARY:Drop-In Information Sessions: Master of Athletic Therapy (MAT)
DESCRIPTION:York University’s Master of Athletic Therapy (MAT) is a full-time, six-term graduate program offered through the School of Kinesiology & Health Science in the Faculty of Health. Designed to meet the evolving demands of the athletic therapy profession, the MAT combines rigorous academic coursework with extensive clinical and field-based learning experiences. Join a virtual drop-in session to connect directly with MAT faculty, learn more about the program, and get answers to your program and admissions questions.\nZOOM LINK TO JOIN: yorku.zoom.us/my/matinfo ( https://yorku.zoom.us/my/matinfo )\n\n\nUPCOMING DROP-IN SESSIONS:\n\nSeptember 23, 10:00 to 11:00 a.m.\nSeptember 30, 10:00 to 11:00 a.m.\nOctober 7, 10:00 to 11:00 a.m.\nOctober 13, 9:00 to 10:00 a.m.\nOctober 16, 1:00 to 2:00 p.m.\nOctober 16, 3:00 to 4:00 p.m.\nOctober 21, 10:00 to 11:00 a.m.\nOctober 28, 10:00 to 11:00 a.m.\nNovember 4, 10:00 to 11:00 a.m.\nNovember 11, 10:00 to 11:00 a.m.\n\n\n\n
