SUMMARY:De las Nubes a Aquí / From the Clouds to Here
DESCRIPTION:Sensorium ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/sensorium/ ), AMPD ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/ ) and York International ( https://www.yorku.ca/international/ ) are thrilled to present: De las Nubes a Aquí / From the Clouds to Here.\nIn May 2026, 23 York University students travelled to Costa Rica to take part in the PANF 3030/5030 Global Eco-Arts Residency Course. This 10-day intensive course comprised a series of workshops, gallery tours, creative class-based exercises, community interactions, and participation in a local community festival at York University’s Las Nubes Eco-Campus and surrounding areas. Through these experiences, students were introduced to themes of environmental and community-based art, food sovereignty, site-specific art, and the ethics of community engagement.\nDe la Nubes a Aquí/ From the Clouds to Here highlights some of the student-created art that was inspired by this course and the Las Nubes Eco-Campus in Costa Rica.\nDATES: October 5 – 16, 2026 | Opening Reception: October 8 (6:00 – 8:00 p.m.)\nTIME: 10:00 a.m. – 4:00 p.m.\nLOCATION: Gales Gallery ( https://virtualtour.ampd.yorku.ca/yorku/visual-art-art-history/gales-gallery ), 105 Accolade West, Keele Campus\nFREE Admission\nRSVP HERE ( https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSconKYbF7Pz9NV1hue14RPZE5d92y6BQM2cu9F3YBRApAVW7A/viewform )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/de-las-nubes-a-aqui/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:Gales Gallery, 105 Accolade West Building (ACW), York University @ 89 York Blvd., Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/lasn2.jpg
END:VEVENT
