SUMMARY:Dance Innovations 2026
DESCRIPTION:Dance Innovations 2026 features the new choreographic works from fourth year BFA dance majors performed by students engaged in all levels of York’s programs in Dance.\nStudents are guided by faculty at every level of creation, performance, lighting design and production and it is the students who collaborate to run Dance Innovations, staged in the McLean Performance Studio, November 25 – 28.\nDance Innovations\nSeries A: November 25 (6:30 p.m.) | November 27 (8:30 p.m.) | November 28 (5:00 p.m.)\nSeries B: November 25 (8:30 p.m.) | November 26 (6:30 p.m.) | November 28 (7:00 p.m.)\nSeries C: November 26 (8:30 p.m.) | November 27 (6:30 p.m.) | November 28 (9:00 p.m.)\nFeatures new choreographic works by fourth year students with student lighting design and production support.\nLocation: McLean Performance Studio ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/mclean-performance-studio/ )\nTickets ( https://secure1.tixhub.com/yorku/online/index.asp ): $25.00 (regular) | $15.00 (students)\nAdvance (until Sunday Nov 22nd): $ 20.00\nLimited Seating\nBox Office: 416-736-5888 | ampd.yorku.ca/boxoffice ( http://ampd.yorku.ca/perform/boxoffice )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/dance-innovations-2026/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:McLean Performance Studio, 244 Accolade East Building, York University @ 83 York Blvd. Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/dance.jpg
END:VEVENT
