SUMMARY:LA&PS Grad Café:  Stop, Egg Drop and Roll Challenge
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a fun way to meet fellow Graduate Students? Are you feeling crafty and looking for an entertaining activity to test your skills? Do you want to win fabulous (chocolate bar) prizes?\nIf you answered yes to any of these questions, then you are going to love our “Stop! Egg Drop, and Roll Challenge”! Use the materials provided to create a safety shell (pun intended) to protect a hard-boiled egg from a 1 metre drop. Experience the thrill of chocolate bar laced victory… if your egg survives.\nRegistration is required.  Register Now!\n \n
