SUMMARY:Global Health (PhD) Program Information Session
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Global Health ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/oc9nSUFxR32F4KHQyY0FOw )? We invite you to attend our program session!\nThe Doctoral Program in the School of Global Health will prepare future leaders in research, practice, and policy-related scholarly pursuits, who contribute to transformational change in global health. The program will cultivate critical and solutions-focused inquiry, enabling students to engage in interdisciplinary original research that provides a foundation for advancing the next generation of leadership needed to address the global health challenges of the 21st century.\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\nRegistration Required. ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/oc9nSUFxR32F4KHQyY0FOw )\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/global-health-phd-2026/
