SUMMARY:Theatre, Dance & Performance Studies (MA, PhD)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Theatre, Dance & Performance Studies ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/lz2mhm3ST62q9wY81ZC2-w )? We invite you to attend our program session!\nThe MA and PhD programs in Theatre, Dance, and Performance Studies emphasize our collective interest in theatre, dance, performance, and cultural politics. Students explore performances across a broad range of periods and cultural contexts, both on stage and in everyday life, to highlight the cultural, political, material and ideological dimensions of performance practices. Specializations include: Canadian Theatre & Cultural Politics; Postcolonialism & Globalization; Critical Pedagogy & Community Engagement; Embodiment & Cultural Memory.\nYork’s program is a leader in the field of Theatre, Dance, and Performance Studies graduate training, both in Canada and internationally. Our curriculum, taught by internationally recognized and award-winning faculty, is guided by an innovative, socially engaged, and interdisciplinary vision for graduate research.\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\nRegistration Required. ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/lz2mhm3ST62q9wY81ZC2-w )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/theatre-dance-performance-studies-ma-phd-2/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies,Faculty of Graduate Studies (Programs),Graduate Program in Theatre, Dance &amp; Performance Studies
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FGS_Banner_1-7-2.png
