SUMMARY:Black Inclusion: Historic and Current Efforts to Dismantle Anti-Black Racism (Dismantling Anti-Black Racism)
DESCRIPTION:This session will follow the birth and development of anti-Black racism both globally and locally, and the historic and on-going efforts to dismantle it. Through case-studies and scenarios, participants will be offered tools and examples of how to respond to anti-Black racism in effective and sustainable ways.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/black-inclusion-historic-and-current-efforts-to-dismantle-anti-black-racism-dismantling-anti-black-racism/
