DESCRIPTION:Discover how the Writing Centre can support you throughout your academic journey. This introductory workshop will introduce you to the Writing Centre’s services, resources, and approach to writing instruction.\nLearn how we can help you develop stronger reading, writing, critical thinking, and communication skills—regardless of your faculty, discipline, course, or assignment. You’ll explore opportunities to access workshops, resources, and individualized writing support, while learning strategies to become a more confident, independent writer.\nWhether you’re brainstorming ideas, developing an assignment, or looking for ways to improve your written communication, the Writing Centre is here to work with you.\nRegister Here: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/OsPV6RQ6Rw29gmKYeQ9uIw\n
