SUMMARY:Experience Grad York – Graduate Studies Virtual Open House
DESCRIPTION:Graduate Studies is where the next generation of careers and ideas are born. Come explore!\nThinking about your next chapter? Whether you’re exploring a career change or pursuing a new passion, there’s no better place to take that step than right here at York. The Faculty of Graduate Studies (FGS) invites York alumni to Experience Grad York ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ )– a free, multi-day online event from Tuesday October 13 – Friday October 16.\nWith sessions designed to guide you through every stage of graduate education, this is your chance to see how returning to York for a master’s or PhD can open new doors.\nHere are some of our popular EGY events:\nDean’s Session: Everything You Should Know About Grad School (That They Never Told You)\nGeneral Graduate Admissions Drop In Hour – Virtual\nA Day in the Life of a Graduate Student\nHow to Pay for Grad School: Funding, Scholarships, Bursaries, OSAP, and more\nI Didn’t Get In To Grad School at York (Or, I’m Afraid I Won’t). What Now?\nPlus – most graduate programs run an hour long program specific session! Find these sessions here.\nNote: This is a virtual event; all sessions will be via Zoom. Registration is required. ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ )\nQuestions? Reach out to our Graduate Recruitment Team at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA ( mailto:FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/experience-grad-york-graduate-studies-virtual-open-house/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni
LOCATION:Online (Zoom)
