SUMMARY:Build Your Future with EllisDon: Careers in Construction & Rotational Co-op Opportunities
DESCRIPTION:Join EllisDon for an engaging information session to explore exciting career opportunities in the construction and infrastructure industry. As one of Canada’s leading construction services companies, EllisDon is shaping communities through innovative projects in healthcare, education, residential, commercial, infrastructure, and technology sectors across North America.\nDuring this session, you’ll learn about the wide range of career paths available to students and new graduates, gain insight into the evolving construction industry, and hear how your skills can contribute to building the spaces where people live, work, learn, and connect.\nWe’ll also introduce our new 12-16 month Rotational Co-op Program, launching in May 2027. Designed for students interested in gaining broad industry experience, this program offers the opportunity to rotate through multiple business areas, build technical and professional skills, and develop a deeper understanding of the construction lifecycle while working alongside industry leaders.\nWhether you’re studying engineering, construction management, business, technology, or a related discipline, this session is a great opportunity to discover what your future at EllisDon could look like.\n\nRegister Here [icon name=”chevron-right” class=”small pl-2″] ( https://yorku-csm.symplicity.com/students/?s=event&ss=is&mode=form&id=e7627f96bc880a46784d3e2b1d10c684 )\nTo register, you must log in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/ ) with your Passport York credentials.\n \n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/build-your-future-with-ellisdon/
CATEGORIES:Co-op &amp; Career Centre,Job Search (CCC),Networking Opportunities (CCC)
LOCATION:DB 1014, Victor Phillip Dahdaleh Building
END:VEVENT
