SUMMARY:Courting & Consent – A Workshop
DESCRIPTION:In this virtual workshop, we’ll look at how dating and courtship have changed in the digital age and explore practical ways to navigate consent in online and offline interactions. Register here:\nConsent Week: Courting and Consent Workshop  – Fill out form ( https://forms.cloud.microsoft/r/ZexzPSddgg )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/courting-consent-a-workshop/
CATEGORIES:Students,The Centre
END:VEVENT
