SUMMARY:Courting & Consent Chat
DESCRIPTION:How have dating, relationships, and consent evolved in the digital age? Join us for an open, facilitated conversation where we’ll explore consent in both online and offline interactions. Together, we’ll co-create a shared understanding of what consent means, reflect on real-life experiences, and learn from one another in a welcoming, respectful space. Whether you’re looking to share, listen, or learn, this is an opportunity to engage in meaningful dialogue and build practical skills for navigating relationships with care and respect.  \nCome connect, reflect, and be part of the conversation. \nLimited spaces, register now. Light snacks provided.  \nConsent Week: Courting and Consent Chat – Fill out form ( https://forms.cloud.microsoft/r/588HJB8f3H )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/courting-consent-chat/
ORGANIZER;CN=The Centre for Sexual Violence Response, Support &amp; Education:MAILTO:thecentre@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Students,The Centre
END:VEVENT
