SUMMARY:Rooted in Consent
DESCRIPTION:What does healthy consent look like to you? Stop by the Rooted in Consent Tree in Central Square and help our community grow a shared vision of respect, communication, and boundaries. Plant a thought. Grow a culture of consent.\nAlso learn about our Consent Week Challenge when you stop by for a chance to win a Tim Horton’s gift card!\n
