SUMMARY:Ace the Interview: Software Engineering Interview Prep with Veeva Systems
DESCRIPTION:Software Engineering Students: \nJoin Veeva Systems for an interactive workshop designed to equip you with actionable strategies to conquer both technical and behavioral interview stages.\nWhat to Expect\n\nDiscover Veeva: Learn about Veeva’s mission as a Public Benefit Corporation, the Engineering Development Program (EDP), and upcoming entry-level opportunities.\nResume & Application Process: Sharing best practices on how to prepare your resume and application before hitting submit!\nTechnical Interview Breakdown: Get expert tips on navigating online coding assessments, communicating your thought process out loud, managing time complexity, and leveraging resources like LeetCode and NeetCode.\nBehavioral Deep Dive: Discover how to stand out by structuring your “origin story,” tying your project experiences to core company values, and mastering the STAR framework.\nLive Q&A & Breakout Networking: Ask questions directly to Veeva’s team and build your network in small-group breakout rooms.\n\nWho Should Attend? Students interested in Associate Software Engineer or Intern Software Engineer positions, now or in the future.\n\nRegister Here [icon name=”chevron-right” class=”small pl-2″] ( https://yorku-csm.symplicity.com/students/?s=event&ss=is&mode=form&id=1815f22bfd80c9ff1330652b77696bbb )\nTo register, you must log in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/ ) with your Passport York credentials.\n \n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/ace-the-software-engineering-interview-veeva/
CATEGORIES:Co-op &amp; Career Centre,Interview Prep (CCC),Job Search (CCC),Networking Opportunities (CCC)
LOCATION:DB 1014, Victor Phillip Dahdaleh Building
END:VEVENT
