SUMMARY:Glendon Steps Challenge
DESCRIPTION:Get moving and join our steps challenge during Fall Well-Being Week! Whether you’re walking across campus, taking the stairs to class or getting out for an activity with friends, every step counts. Set your own goal and challenge yourself to move a little more each day. Challenge runs Monday, October 5-Friday, October 9. A winner for a Glendon prize pack will be randomly chosen from all student participants.\nOrganized by Office of Student Affairs, Glendon.\nFormat: Hybrid\nAudience: Glendon Students, Staff and Faculty\nRegister Online\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/glendon-steps-challenge-2/
CATEGORIES:Glendon,Well-being,Well-being Week
