SUMMARY:Health Education & Promotion Tabling
DESCRIPTION:Eating well doesn’t have to break the bank! Stop by the Vari Hall Kiosk to join Health Education & Promotion ( https://students.yorku.ca/counselling/health-education-promotion ) for interactive activities, fun prizes and practical tips for shopping flyers, finding deals and saving money on meals.\n
