SUMMARY:AMPD Fall Open House 2026
DESCRIPTION:We are thrilled to welcome prospective students and families to visit our campuses in person at our 2026 Fall Open House ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/fall-open-house ).\nExperience all that AMPD ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/ ) has to offer as you discover our exciting programs, welcoming community and hands-on learning opportunities.\nIn this dynamic event at York University’s Keele campus, guests will have the opportunity to explore the School of the Arts, Media, Performance and Design ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/ ). Tour our world-class facilities ( https://virtualtour.ampd.yorku.ca/yorku/home/tours/ ), meet with AMPD professors, students, and staff, and discover our innovative programs in fields such as Film and Media Arts ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-film-and-media-arts/ ), Music ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-music/ ), Visual Art and Art History ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-visual-art-and-art-history/ ), Design ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-design/ ), Computational Arts ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-computational-arts/ ), Theatre, Dance and Performance ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-theatre-dance-and-performance/ ) and Integrative Arts ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/integrative-arts/?gad_source=1&gclid=Cj0KCQjw99e4BhDiARIsAISE7P_yUXVkAW7BmJBwXke9KGCK4981L0NcI1oiEoOVoVtY8wWZMjS1VcgaAkQhEALw_wcB&gclsrc=aw.ds ). Take advantage of this event to learn about unique creative opportunities, from interdisciplinary collaborations to the latest in technology. You’ll also have the chance to connect with our current student ambassadors while exploring our classrooms, studios, art galleries, practice rooms, and performance spaces. Plus, get insights into the audition process and have your portfolio reviewed on the spot!\nAdmissions representatives will also be available to guide you through the application process, discuss financial aid options, and introduce you to essential student support services that will enhance your experience on campus. Bring all of your questions about life on campus, clubs, events, athletics and more. We can’t wait to see you!\nAMPD Fall Campus Day \nSaturday, October 24, 2026\n9:00 a.m. – 2:30 p.m.\nAccolade West Building  ( https://maps.info.yorku.ca/2010/06/accolade-west/ )(Main Lobby)\n89 York Boulevard, York University Keele Campus\nRegister HERE  ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/york-university-fall-open-house-2026-tickets-1993137611249?aff=oddtdtcreator )\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/ampd-fall-open-house-2026/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:Accolade West Building, York University @ 89 York Blvd. Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/fallcampus.jpg
END:VEVENT
