SUMMARY:Scotiabank Recruitment Session: Scotia on Campus
DESCRIPTION:\nScotia on Campus is BACK!\nJoin us at our interactive Scotia on Campus event and learn how you can land your next internship, co-op, or new graduate position!\nThis is your opportunity to gain insights into Scotiabank’s unique recruitment process and introduce yourself to the Campus Recruitment Team.\nFind the co-op, internship or new graduate program that will help you reach your full potential. We have opportunities for students in ALL fields of study enterprise-wide. Your next job could be in Commercial Banking, Wealth Management, Strategic Functions, Technology, Global Banking and Markets, and more!\n\nRegister Here [icon name=”chevron-right” class=”small pl-2″]\nTo register, you must log in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/ ) with your Passport York credentials.\n\n
