SUMMARY:The Future of Global Health and Innovation
DESCRIPTION:The Global Strategy Lab invites you to a special fireside chat on the future of global health with John-Arne Røttingen, Chief Executive Officer of the Wellcome Trust, and Julie Delahanty, President of the International Development Research Centre (IDRC).\nThis is a unique opportunity to sit down with two of the field’s leading funders. With global health at an inflection point, Røttingen and Delahanty bring their combined decades at the helm of the world’s most influential health and development organizations to an exchange you won’t want to miss.\nThe event will open with remarks from York University President Lisa Philipps and will be moderated by Global Strategy Lab Founder and York University Professor Steven Hoffman.\nFor more information and to register: The Future of Global Health and Innovation – Global Strategy Lab ( https://www.globalstrategylab.org/events/fireside-chat-the-future-of-global-health/ )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/the-future-of-global-health-and-innovation/
ORGANIZER;CN=Dahdaleh Institute for Global Health Research:MAILTO:dighr@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Health,ORUs,Research &amp; Innovation
LOCATION:Tribute Communities Recital Hall @ Accolade East Building 83 York Boulevard, Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/The-Future-of-Global-Health-and-Innovation.png
END:VEVENT
