SUMMARY:Money Matters for Mature Students
DESCRIPTION:Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students and Student Financial Services have collaborated to bring you a special workshop for mature students. Students will learn from Financial Services at York U about information related to OSAP, scholarships, bursaries, FAAS Application, budgeting, accessing student accounts, senior tuition waiver etc.\nRegistration is needed. Register Here: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/46TORVMMTtyHrZs3o4O2YA ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/46TORVMMTtyHrZs3o4O2YA )\n
