SUMMARY:Period Pop-up
DESCRIPTION:Stop by our Period Pop-Up Table to learn more about menstrual health and well-being! Explore modern approaches to menstrual health and learn strategies to normalize conversations around periods.\nThis event will have demonstrations of reusable menstrual products and tips to manage menstrual symptoms. This event will also include a free creative paint session to destigmatize and normalize conversations around periods.\nSign up for an opportunity for a free sewing workshop to make your own reusable menstrual pad! No experience required.\nOrganized by Markham Student Services\nLocation: West Atrium, Markham Campus\nFormat: Drop-In In-Person Event\nAudience: York Community\n
