SUMMARY:Healthcare Careers Decoded: Is This the Right Program for Me?
DESCRIPTION:Not sure if you’re in the right program? Wondering what careers are actually available in healthcare beyond the ones you hear about most? Thinking about transferring programs, pursuing graduate studies, or exploring a different direction?\nJoin the YFS Wellness Centre and Nurse Decoded for an honest and interactive conversation exploring the many pathways into healthcare and how to determine which profession may be the right fit for you.\nThe session will feature healthcare professionals from a variety of disciplines sharing their personal journeys, career realities, and lessons learned, followed by an open audience discussion where no question is off limits.\nTopics include:\nWhat different healthcare professionals actually do\nCareer pathways, educational requirements, and opportunities for growth\nTransferable skills and how one degree can lead to many different careers\nChanging directions, returning to school, and career pivots\nCommon misconceptions about healthcare professions\nAdvice for students questioning whether they’re in the right program\nLive audience Q&A with healthcare professionals\nWhether you’re considering nursing, rehabilitation, mental health, medicine, allied health, public health, or simply exploring your options, this session is designed to help you make more informed decisions about your future with confidence.\nOrganized by YFS Wellness Centre\nLocation: Rm 109 Second Student Centre\n\nFormat: Drop-In In-Person Event\nAudience: York Community\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/healthcare-careers-decoded-is-this-the-right-program-for-me/
CATEGORIES:Well-being,Well-being Week
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:York University
CLASS:PUBLIC
