SUMMARY:Plant-Powered Burger Week: 10% Off Vegetarian & Vegan Burgers
DESCRIPTION:In celebration of Well-being Week, YU Eats is offering 10% off all vegetarian and vegan burgers at participating grill stations across campus. From October 5 to 9, enjoy delicious plant-powered burgers at Central Grill (Central Square Market), Stong Grill (Stong Dining Hall), and Grill House (Winters Dining Hall).\nMade with ingredients such as beans, legumes, vegetables, and other protein-rich plant foods, these burgers are a delicious way to explore plant-based eating while enjoying a satisfying and flavourful meal.\nOrganized by Food and Vending Services\nLocation: Central Square Market, Stong Dining Hall, and Winters Dining Hall\n\n\n\n\nTime: All well-being week, during operating hours of participating stations\n\n\nFormat: In-Person Drop In Event\nAudience: York Community\n\n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/plant-powered-burger-week-10-off-vegetarian-vegan-burgers/
CATEGORIES:Well-being,Well-being Week
