SUMMARY:YU Eats Well-being Smoothie Promo: 10% Off All Smoothies
DESCRIPTION:In celebration of Well-being Week, YU Eats is offering 10% off all smoothies to help keep you energized, nourished, and feeling your best throughout the day.\nFrom October 5 to 9, visit Markham Café, Stong Dining Hall, Winters Dining Hall, or Glendon Dining Hall and enjoy a convenient, fibre-rich, nutrient-dense snack between classes, meetings or after a workout. This campus-wide promotion is a simple way to treat yourself while fueling your well-being throughout the week.\n\n\n\n\nOrganized by Food and Vending Services.\n\nLocation:\n\n\n\n\nMarkham Café, Stong Dining Hall, Winters Dining Hall, and Glendon Dining Hall\n\n\n\n\n\nAvailable all day and all week while supplies last.\n\n\n\n\n \nFormat: In-Person Drop In Event\nAudience: York Community\nRegister Online\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/yu-eats-well-being-smoothie-promo-10-off-all-smoothies/
