SUMMARY:Production Interviews – Vanier College Productions’ 2026-2027 Season!
DESCRIPTION:Are you looking for a creative community at York? Do you like to support with technical elements of theatrical productions? We’re looking for TECHNICIANS, STAGE MANAGERS, DESIGNERS, USHERS and MORE to join Vanier College Productions (VCP) a theatre/arts community within LA&PS! ✨🎭\nNO PRIOR EXPERIENCE REQUIRED.\nProduction Interviews\n🗓️ Sept. 15 @ 4:00-5:00pm\n🗓️ Sept. 17 @ 4:00-5:00pm\n🗓️ Sept. 21 @ 3:30-4:30pm\n🗓️ Sept. 21 @ 5:30-6:30pm\n📍 Fred Thury Studio Theatre, 258 Vanier College\nPlease sign up if you are interested in helping with PRODUCTION ROLES such as the following:\n• Stage Managers, Technicians, Designers\n• Builders, Painters\n• Set, Costumes, Props, Lighting, Sound\n• Front of House, Marketing, Graphic Design\n• Videographers, Photographers, Video Editing\n• Anti-Racism, Accessibility & Inclusion Support\nReturning VCP Company Members are STRONGLY ENCOURAGED to sign up on the FIRST day of interviews.\nTo learn more about the interview process & how to prepare visit tinyurl.com/vcp-interviews\nPlease only sign up for ONE spot 🙂\n***IF ALL TIMESLOTS ARE FULL, PLEASE EMAIL VCP@YORKU.CA AND WE’LL HELP YOU GET SIGNED UP***\nLearn More\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/production-interviews-vanier-college-productions-2026-2027-season-824/
ORGANIZER;CN=Vanier College Productions:MAILTO:smendes@yorku.ca, vcp@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:LA&amp;PS Colleges,LA&amp;PS Student Success,LA&amp;PS Students All,LA&amp;PS Vanier College Productions
