SUMMARY:General Auditions – Vanier College Productions’ 2026-2027 Season!
DESCRIPTION:Are you looking for a creative community at York? Do you like to ACT, SING, DANCE? We’re looking for PERFORMERS, COMEDIANS, BIPOC ARTISTS, TECHNICIANS, and CREW to join Vanier College Productions (VCP) a theatre/arts community within LA&PS! ✨🎭\nNO PRIOR EXPERIENCE REQUIRED.\nAuditions\n🗓️ Sept. 14 – 17 | 6 – 9:30 p.m. | Fred Thury Studio Theatre, 258 Vanier College\nPlease sign up to AUDITION for ANY or ALL of the following shows/groups:\n• Vanier Improv Company (VIC)\no Rehearsals – TUE & THUR (6:30-9:30pm)\no Shows – Tuesdays (8:00 pm)\n• Play (Lady Audley’s Secret)\no Rehearsals – SUN (6:00-9:30pm), MON & WED (6:30-9:30pm)\no Tech/Shows – Nov. 21-29\n• Musical TBA\no Rehearsals – SUN (6:00-9:30pm), MON & WED (6:30-9:30pm)\no Tech/Shows – Feb. 20 – Mar. 7\n• Show Choir\no Rehearsals – TUE & THUR (6:30-9:30pm)\no Tech/Shows – Mar. 12-21\nReturning VCP Company Members are STRONGLY ENCOURAGED to sign up on the FIRST day of auditions.\nCALLBACK AUDITIONS will take place on Sept. 21-24th between 6:00-10:00pm. If you are called back for an audition during these times, attendance is mandatory in order to be considered for a role in the show/group.\nTo learn about what to prepare for your audition visit tinyurl.com/vcp-auditions\nPlease only sign up for ONE spot 🙂\n***IF ALL TIMESLOTS ARE FULL, PLEASE EMAIL VCP@YORKU.CA AND WE’LL HELP YOU GET SIGNED UP***\nLearn More\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/general-auditions-vanier-college-productions-2026-2027-season/
ORGANIZER;CN=Vanier College Productions:MAILTO:smendes@yorku.ca, vcp@yorku.ca
