SUMMARY:Meals Made Easy: Protein Bean Salad Edition
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Friday, October 9 from 3:00 PM–4:30 PM in the JD Wellness Studio (MK1025) at Markham Campus for a hands-on cooking workshop where you’ll make your own protein-packed bean salad!\nWhat’s the deal? We provide the ingredients, tools, and instructions, you learn an easy, budget-friendly meal, make it yourself, and get to eat it at the end. No cooking experience needed.\nReady to cook? Register here to reserve your spot! Space is limited to 16 participants, so pre-registration is required.\nCost: FREE for current fitness members, $5 for recreation members, and $15 for non-members.\n
