SUMMARY:The Markham Picnic & Hike
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Saturday, October 3 for a guided hike from York University’s Markham Campus to Milne Dam Conservation Park!\nWhat are we actually doing? Hiking scenic local trails, meeting new people, stopping for a picnic, playing lawn games, and making our way back to campus together. No hiking experience needed, just bring proper footwear, water, and be ready to move.\nCheck-in starts at 8:45 AM at the first-floor welcome desk, and we leave at 9:00 AM sharp.\nAnd yes, snacks will be included and there’s a special giveaway gift waiting for you at the end 🎁\nReady to hike? Register here ( https://reconline.yorkulions.ca/Program/GetProgramDetails?courseId=1be423d9-27e8-41df-b34b-fb53c55fa55c ) to reserve your spot! Registration is free, but space is limited.\n
