DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join us for a General Graduate Studies Admissions Drop In Hour!\nJoin us ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_0E9RFQEfQdS_guzPMnzxpg ) to ask any questions that you might have about York University and our graduate admissions process. Participants in this group session are able to ask questions via chat, and a representative will answer each question out loud.\nPLEASE NOTE: During these sessions we will not be able to answer any questions about Schulich School of Business programs, Osgoode Law School programs, or the Graduate Diploma in Professional Accounting.\nFor all other questions about graduate diplomas, master’s programs, and doctoral degrees, we look forward to having you attend the event.\nIf you have any accessibility requirements for this event, please let us know at fgsapply@yorku.ca  ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca )\nRegistration is required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_0E9RFQEfQdS_guzPMnzxpg ).\n
