SUMMARY:Looking Forward: Applying to Graduate School at York in 2029
DESCRIPTION:This session ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_smrppsUwTUiD2u2IfL1a8g ) will go over how to best prepare for graduate school applications when you still have a few years to go before formally applying. We’ll talk about application requirements and how you can start, or continue, to meet and exceed them.\nThis session is meant for folks who are currently in their undergraduate program, and plan on applying to graduate studies at least two years in the future if not more.\nYou are also welcome to attend if you are no longer in an undergraduate program, but still do not plan on applying to graduate studies for at least two years in the future if not more.\nIf you are interested in applying for a graduate program starting in September 2026, we invite you to check out any of the Faculty Admissions sessions being held during Experience Grad York: https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/  ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ )\nIf you have any accessibility requirements for this event, please let us know at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\nRegistration is required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_smrppsUwTUiD2u2IfL1a8g ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/looking-forward-applying-to-graduate-school-at-york-in-2029-2/
