SUMMARY:Share Your Ride: Real Stories, Real Savings
DESCRIPTION:York University’s Parking & Transportation Services, in partnership with the Office of Sustainability and Smart Commute, invites the York community to participate in Smart Commute Month this September.\nSmart Commute Month encourages sustainable transportation choices, including walking, cycling, public transit and carpooling.\nCurious about carpooling but not sure how to make it work with your schedule? Join Share Your Ride: Real Stories, Real Savings to hear from commuters, employers and Smart Commute representatives about how sharing a ride can save money, reduce commute stress and make daily travel more enjoyable.\nRegistration is required. One attendee will receive a $50 gift card.\nWhile participating in Smart Commute Month, complete the annual survey ( https://ca.mar.medallia.com/surveys/take/?e=90017607&s=361&p=1&l=en&h=998D7835199663D&d=l ) by Sept. 30 for a chance to win a $50 e-gift card. Log a trip ( https://www.smartcommute.ca/public/publicpage.aspx?itemname=logmytrips ) through the Smart Commute Tool for an additional contest entry.\nRegister for Share Your Ride ( https://events.teams.microsoft.com/event/801e3a23-86f2-48bc-b3f0-f329a5156471@c868558f-a1c1-46fc-821d-aed53bb48125?source=copyLinkLegacyShareLinkDialog )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/share-your-ride-real-stories-real-savings/
CATEGORIES:Sustainability
END:VEVENT
