SUMMARY:TreeTop Trekking Event
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for an exciting day in the trees! Join us for a fun outdoor adventure filled with aerial courses, obstacles, and challenges as we make our way through the treetops. It’s a great opportunity to try something new, challenge yourself, and spend a fun day outdoors with friends.\nPlease keep in mind that this activity takes place high above the ground.\nParticipant Requirements\nFor everyone’s safety, participants must meet the following requirements:\n\nMinimum height: 55 inches\nMaximum weight: 250 lbs\nParticipants should be comfortable with heights and being active throughout the course.\n\nSchedule\n\n9:30 AM: Depart from Tait McKenzie Centre (please arrive 15 minutes early)\n10:30 AM: Arrive and begin the Treetop Trekking course\n10:30 AM – 1:30 PM: Treetop Trekking adventure\n1:30 PM: Lunch/snack break\n2:00 PM: Depart for Tait McKenzie Centre\nApproximately 3:00–4:00 PM: Return to Tait McKenzie Centre\n\nCome ready for a fun and adventurous day with friends! Wear comfortable athletic clothing and closed-toe shoes, and bring water, snacks, and a lunch. Most importantly, come ready to try something new and enjoy the day outdoors!\nRegistration is required: https://reconline.yorkulions.ca/Program/GetProgramDetails?courseId=f559d020-b9d7-487f-92a5-89a0d97a3f17\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/treetop-trekking-event/
ORGANIZER;CN=Athletics &amp; Recreation:MAILTO:
CATEGORIES:Athletics &amp; Recreation
LOCATION:Tait McKenzie Center @ 1 Thompson Rd, North York
END:VEVENT
