SUMMARY:Indigenous Community Gathering
DESCRIPTION:On Tuesday, September 29, Indigenous community members are invited to gather at Skennen’kó:wa Gamig ( https://map.concept3d.com/?id=1200#!m/654728?share ) from 11:30 a.m. to 3:30 p.m. This gathering will offer space for community members to be in relationship with one another, with no formal agenda beyond creating time and space to be together in community. A sacred fire with a fire keeper is being planned, and medicines, beading materials and time for a shared meal will be available in the space. Please note this event is for community members who self-identify as Indigenous.\n
