SUMMARY:Sensorium Meet & Greet
DESCRIPTION:Sensorium: Centre for Digital Art and Technology ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/sensorium/ ) invites all members and prospective members, to join us for a  Fall Meet & Greet in the Sensorium Loft Space to mark the beginning of the semester. This event will be a fantastic opportunity to meet each other informally, learn more about the Sensorium and CERLAC communities, their upcoming events, and ways to get involved. Light refreshments will be served.\nDATE: Monday, September 28\nTIME: 4:00 p.m. – 5:00 p.m.\nLOCATION: Sensorium Loft, Room M333, 4th floor, Goldfarb Centre for Fine Arts (CFA), York University\nFree. RSVP HERE  ( https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScM3zYpNQKQ_srMF-KA8IfAmiHYMHO1F5J_q1_Kl62sXo3ZGw/viewform )\nIf you’d like to attend the La Última Cachada film screening before the Sensorium Meet and Greet, please let us know on your RSVP.\n
