SUMMARY:Teaching Kitchen – A Trip to Maloca Garden
DESCRIPTION:Step into nature and join us for a unique Teaching Kitchen experience at Maloca Garden! \nThis month, York U Dietitian Dahlia Abou El Hassan and Phyllis Novak, Director of Maloca Community and Native Plant Gardens, invite you to explore the journey from garden to table. Tour the garden, harvest fresh ingredients, and learn how plants can be transformed into a delicious, comforting cup of tea. \nWhether you’re a gardening enthusiast or simply curious to learn something new, this event is for everyone! \n\nDate: Wednesday, September 16, 2026 \nTime: 2:00 PM – 4:00 PM \nLocation: Maloca Garden \n\nSpots are limited, so mark your calendars and register now. We can’t wait to see you there! \n
