SUMMARY:Tubman Open House 2026
DESCRIPTION:Date: Thursday September 17, 2026\nTime: 12:00pm – 3:00pm EDT\nLocation: Tubman Resource Room (314 York Lanes, 3rd Floor)\nRegistration link: https://research.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=317202\n \nWelcome back! The Harriet Tubman Institute is happy to invite you to our 2026 Open House on September 17th, 2026. This yearly event is an opportunity to learn about Tubman’s research and initiatives, hear from campus partners, network with students and faculty, and take a tour of Black spaces at York. All are welcome to connect and celebrate the new academic year with us!\n \nSchedule:\n12:00-2:00pm: Presentations from Tubman & Student Groups\n2:00-3:00: Networking activities\n
