SUMMARY:Modes of Delivery Intensive: (Re)Designing the Mode of Course Delivery for Authentic Assessment (Online, Oct. 13)
DESCRIPTION:Generative Artificial Intelligence (GenAI) has made take-home and online assessment unreliable. Rethinking entire course assessment strategies that address this challenge and align with the mode of course delivery is the focus of this intensive.\nThe modes of delivery intensive is a full day, virtual event that includes sharing innovative ideas for course design across each mode of delivery (in-person, blended, online). Participants will engage in a process of making deep, substantive, robust changes to their courses, assessments, or teaching practices.\nRegister via YULearn (requires Passport York login)\n*Please note, if you are unable to register via Passport York (e.g. you are in between contracts, or a participant external to York) register via Zoom\nMore information is available on the Teaching Commons Website.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/modes-of-delivery-intensive-redesigning-the-mode-of-course-delivery-for-authentic-assessment-online-oct-13/
ORGANIZER;CN=Teaching Commons:MAILTO:teaching@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Faculty Affairs,Teaching &amp; Learning
LOCATION:Online via Zoom.
END:VEVENT
