SUMMARY:First Year Lunch Break: Paint Your Own Tote
DESCRIPTION:\nJoin us for a relaxed First Year Lunch Break where you can enjoy a free meal and style a custom canvas tote bag. Come design a durable tote that’s perfect for carrying your campus textbooks, tech gear, or daily essentials. We will have a variety of craft supplies ready, so you can easily put together a look that completely reflects your own personal style. It’s a great chance to step away from your studies, bounce design ideas off fellow students, and head to your next class with a personalized accessory and a few new friends.\nRegister Now\n
