SUMMARY:First Year Lunch Break: Creating Friendship Bracelets
DESCRIPTION:\nJoin us for a relaxed First Year Lunch Break where you can enjoy a free meal and create your very own friendship bracelet. Come create bracelet for your friend perfect for creating lifelong friendship, creating great memories, and building strong connections. We will have a variety of craft supplies ready, so you can easily put together a bracelet that completely captures the bond of friendship. It’s a great chance to step away from your studies, bounce design ideas off fellow students, and head to your next class with a personalized accessory and a few new friends.\nRegister Now\n
