SUMMARY:First Year Lunch Break: Create a Motivation Board (in collab with Academic Honesty)
DESCRIPTION:\nJoin us for a relaxing First Year Lunch Break, where you can enjoy a free meal, connect with fellow first-year students, and create a personalized motivation board or bookmark to keep you inspired throughout the semester. As midterms approach, take a moment to reflect on your goals, celebrate your progress, and fill your board or bookmark with encouraging quotes, affirmations, reminders, and aspirations that will help you stay focused and motivated. We’ll provide all the supplies you need to design a board that reflects what drives you, whether it’s academic success, personal growth, self-care, or future ambitions. This is also a great opportunity to unwind, enjoy meaningful conversations, and build new friendships in a welcoming, low-pressure environment. Leave feeling refreshed, re-energized, and ready to tackle the rest of the semester with confidence.\nRegister Now\n
URL:https://forms.cloud.microsoft/pages/responsepage.aspx?id=GBNTNBFw1E-H8KQ4FsSb0KiiOcKC3hVKuD7DvmSHyblUODhJU1hOTlNUNVAwOFZGQzFYR1cyT09JTiQlQCN0PWcu&OR=EXCEL-WEB.BODY.NT&CT=1788194329051&route=shorturl
