SUMMARY:Markham Campus – Undergraduate Academic Orientation
DESCRIPTION:\n\nStart your YorkU Markham journey! Meet classmates, explore campus resources, and prepare for your first year.\n\n\n\n\nStarting university is a big milestone, and we’re excited to welcome you to the Markham Campus community. Academic Orientation is designed to help you feel prepared, connected, and confident before classes begin.\nThroughout the day, you will:\n\nMeet other incoming students\nConnect with Peer Mentors, staff, and faculty\nLearn more about your academic program\nExplore campus resources and services\nDiscover ways to get involved in campus life\nStart building your community at Markham Campus\n\nWhether you already know exactly what to expect or have no idea where to begin, this event is for you.\nWe can’t wait to welcome you to Markham Campus!\nhttps://www.eventbrite.ca/e/2026-markham-campus-undergraduate-academic-orientation-tickets-1990186325875?aff=oddtdtcreator\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/markham-campus-undergraduate-academic-orientation/
