SUMMARY:Top 30 Alumni Under 30 – Nominations Information Session
DESCRIPTION:Interested in nominating an outstanding young York alum or submitting a self-nomination? Join us on September 28 at 12 p.m. ET for a virtual information session to learn about York University’s Top 30 Alumni Under 30 program.\nDuring this session, you’ll learn:\n\nEligibility requirements for nominees and nominators\nThe nomination and selection process\nTips for preparing a strong nomination package\nKey dates for the 2027 nomination cycle\nAn opportunity to ask questions during a live Q&A\n\nFor general information on the program and the nomination form, please visit: https://www.yorku.ca/alumniandfriends/connect/top-30-alumni-under-30/\nDate: Monday, September 28\nTime: 12 p.m. ET\nLocation: Zoom (virtual)\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/top-30-alumni-under-30-nominations-information-session/
