SUMMARY:First Year Lunch Break: Sculp Your Own Clay Animal (in collab with Student Accessibility Services)
DESCRIPTION:\nJoin us for a relaxed First Year Lunch Break where you can enjoy a free meal and sculpt your own mini clay animals. Use an array of colorful clay, sculpting tools, paints, and other creative materials to bring your favorite tiny creatures and inspirations for the year ahead to life. You can mix different shapes, vibrant colours, and cute decorative details to design a miniature figure that reflects your personality. This hands-on activity is a fun, low stress way to unwind between classes and express yourself while crafting a unique keepsake. It’s also a great opportunity to meet new friends, spark conversations, and build connections in a welcoming, low-pressure environment.\nRegister Now\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/first-year-lunch-break-sculp-your-own-clay-animal-in-collab-with-student-accessibility-services/
