SUMMARY:Mid-Career Conversations | Get Clear, Get Hired: Defining your next career move
DESCRIPTION:Many professionals launch a job search by updating their resume, refreshing their LinkedIn profile, and applying to job postings – without first identifying a clear target. Without clarity, it’s easy to spend hours on job boards, submit generic applications, and network without purpose. Yet one of the most important predictors of a successful job search is having a focused understanding of where you’re headed and why. \nJoin Lisa Petsinis (BA ’91), Alumni Career Coach on Sept. 23 for Mid-Career Conversations where she will help mid-career professionals understand why career clarity matters, identify the questions that help them define a realistic and motivating direction, and see how a clear target can strengthen every aspect of their job search from their resume and LinkedIn profile to networking, and interview performance.\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/mid-career-conversations-get-clear-get-hired-defining-your-next-career-move/
