SUMMARY:STEM Futures Career Fair
DESCRIPTION:Explore a mix of interdisciplinary job opportunities offered by STEM organizations. The STEM Futures Career Fair is your chance to speak directly with employers and discover career paths to support your goals – no matter your program!\nConnect with diverse organizations who are hiring for a range of co-op, internship, summer, part-time and full-time opportunities, spanning technology, education, government, engineering, construction, information technology and more.\n\nRegister Here [icon name=”chevron-right” class=”small pl-2″]\n\nAdvance registration is not required for this event. However, if you’re planning to attend the fair, click “Attending” to receive helpful pre-event tips and information!\n
