SUMMARY:Level Up | Landing Your First Management Role
DESCRIPTION:Thinking about taking the leap into leadership? On Sept. 29, join a panel of York alumni as they share how they landed on their first management roles, the challenges they faced, and the lessons they learned along the way. Ask questions during a live Q & A and gain insights to help take the next step in your career.\nFeaturing alumni speakers: \n\nWasi Syed Babar (BA ’20, MPPAL ’25), Senior Program Manager, City of Toronto,\nSammie Dhillon (MMgt ’22, MBA ’24), Manager, Lean Process Transformation Services, KPMG\n\n
