SUMMARY:Analyze your Assignment
DESCRIPTION:Understand your professor’s expectations. Start brainstorming and formulate a plan.\nThe Write Now! series consists of four workshops, each of which focuses on one aspect of the writing process:\nWorkshop 1: Analyze Your Assignment\nWorkshop 2: Construct an Argument\nWorkshop 3: Meaningful Citations\nWorkshop 4: Effective Editing\nAt the end of each workshop, you’ll receive access to a quiz, which you will need to complete within 72 hours of the workshop date. If you pass the quiz, you will receive a badge, which will be recorded on the Write Now! eClass site.\nIf you attend all four workshops and pass each workshop’s quiz within one academic calendar year, you’ll attain a Certificate of Completion that can be added to your resume and professional networking sites, such as LinkedIn.\nRegister Now\n \n \n \n
