SUMMARY:5K Walk or Run
DESCRIPTION:The Markham 5K Walk or Run is a guided outdoor program that supports physical activity, stress reduction and community connection.\nParticipants may work toward completing a continuous 5K run or join the group for a casual, low-pressure walk. The program welcomes all activity and experience levels. Check-in and warm-up begin at 2:45 p.m., and the group departs at 3 p.m.\nThis program takes place outdoors and may be cancelled due to an official weather advisory or unsafe trail conditions. Registered participants will be notified of cancellations by email.\nRegister your sport now! ( https://reconline.yorkulions.ca/Program/GetProgramDetails?courseId=12f937c9-4e5a-48f9-9fed-aaf9ffffbb0b )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/5k-walk-or-run/
