SUMMARY:Peer Mentorship Day (Markham Campus)
DESCRIPTION:Discover peer mentorship supports from across York, all in one place! Connect with peer mentors from Markham Campus in the 1st Floor West Atrium  to ask questions and explore mentorship opportunities. Chat with students who have been in your position and gain valuable insights, tips and advice that go beyond websites and textbooks.\nVisit the 1st Floor West Atrium during Peer Mentorship Day to:\n\nmeet peer mentors from across York;\nexplore supports;\nsign up for a mentorship program (or learn how to become a mentor!);\nmake a friendship bracelet;\nand more.\n\nWednesday, Sept. 23 \n10 a.m. to 2 p.m. \nNo registration required. \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/peer-mentorship-day-2/
CATEGORIES:Markham Campus,Students
LOCATION:Markham Campus 1st Floor Atrium
