SUMMARY:Sociology Lecture Series: Celebrating the Book “Anti-Asian Racism and the COVID-19 Pandemic in Canada ”
DESCRIPTION:Join the co-authors of Anti-Asian Racism and the COVID-19 Pandemic in Canada as they draw on historical and empirical research, examining the revival of long‑standing racial stereotypes, their social impacts, and the ways Asian communities have responded through resistance and solidarity. \nSpeakers: Guida C. Man, Muyang Li, Chandrima Chakraborty, X. Alvin Yang, Sibo Chen  & Henry Yu   \nRegister Now\n
