SUMMARY:Sociology Lecture Series: Celebrating the Book “The Reality of Knowledge: Towards a Critical Realist Sociology of Knowledge”
DESCRIPTION:Join Associate Professor Philip D. Walsh as he discusses his new book, The Reality of Knowledge. Drawing on the history of the discipline, Walsh presents a critical realist rethinking of the sociology of knowledge, exploring topics such as human cognition, universities, objectivity and everyday knowledge, while highlighting its convergence with Norbert Elias’s work. \nTo sign up and learn more about the other events in the series, click below.\nRegister Now\n
