SUMMARY:Bridging Talent – Networking & Hiring Event for Newcomers
DESCRIPTION:Are you a newcomer who is looking to connect with employers and explore job opportunities in York Region? Join us at Bridging Talent, a free networking and hiring event co-hosted by the York University IEP Program and CICS as part of York Region’s Welcoming Week initiative.\n• Date and time: September 18, 2026 | 10:30 am – 3:00 pm\n• Location: York University Markham Campus (1st and 2nd Floor Atrium) Markham, Ontario\n• Cost: Free\nEvent Highlights\nYou will meet with employer face-to-face from sectors including IT, finance and banking, insurance, municipal government, marketing, warehousing, home care and more\nParticipating employers are interested in hiring newcomer talent and are committed to inclusive hiring practices.\n• Submit your resume directly to participating employers\n• Onsite interview opportunities, where available\n• Free professional headshot/photo booth for your LinkedIn and professional profile (limited spots)\nWhether you are actively job searching or looking to expand your professional network, this is a great opportunity to make meaningful career connections.\nRegister Now\n
URL:https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/1997615874856?aff=oddtdtcreator
