DESCRIPTION:Online workshop, 15 January 2027, 10-11:30 am ET\nThis workshop can count towards the Teaching Commons’ Certificates in AI Pedagogies. Learn more at our website: https://www.yorku.ca/teachingcommons/certificates/#AIPedagogies\nIn this workshop we examine the risks of efficiency-driven AI use and explore how to reframe AI as a tool for learning, reflection, and deeper engagement. Join us for strategies to connect with and motivate your students while engaging them with AI.\nVisit YULearn to register: https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=2144 ( https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=2144 )\n
