SUMMARY:Hidden Costs: AI’s Environmental and Infrastructural Impact on Education Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Online workshop 10 November, 2026, 3:00-4:30 pm ET\nThis workshop can count towards the Teaching Commons’ Certificates in AI Pedagogies. Learn more at our website: https://www.yorku.ca/teachingcommons/certificates/#AIPedagogies\nIn this workshop we critically examine the material, environmental, and infrastructural dimensions of AI (e.g., energy consumption, data storage, hardware demands), and what this means for responsible pedagogy in a climate-conscious academy.\nVisit YULearn to register: https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=2143 ( https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=2143 )\n
