SUMMARY:1:1 Drop-In Sessions for Graduate Admissions (In-Person)
DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join us for a Graduate Admissions 1:1 Drop In Session, in person!\nJoin us to ask any questions that you might have about York University and our graduate admissions process.\nRegistration is required ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/11-sessions-for-graduate-admissions-in-person-registration-required-tickets-1967745236974?aff=oddtdtcreator ).\nThis event is not being held in the main FGS office. Registration is required for event location info.\nWhile you are welcome to drop in at any point during the session, attendees will be seen on a first-come-first-serve basis. When you arrive, please add your name to the sign in sheet, and we will see participants one-by-one. We cannot guarantee a specific meeting time. If you are interested in a (timed) 1:1 online appointment ( https://bookings.cloud.microsoft/book/ONLINEProspectiveGraduateStudentMeeting@yuoffice.yorku.ca/?ismsaljsauthenabled ) (linked) , we offer those as well.\nPLEASE NOTE: During these sessions we will not be able to answer any questions about Schulich School of Business programs, the Graduate Diploma in Professional Accounting, or Osgoode Law School Professional LLM programs (either Part Time, or Full Time).\nFor all other questions about graduate diplomas, master’s programs, and doctoral degrees, we look forward to having you attend.\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nFor any questions, please email us at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA.\n
