SUMMARY:FGS SSHRC Doctoral and OGS Scholarship Writing Workshop
DESCRIPTION:The Faculty of Graduate Studies is pleased to host the Summer 2026 Scholarship Writing Workshop for SSHRC and OGS doctoral applicants. This session is designed to help students prepare competitive applications for the upcoming scholarship competitions, this interactive workshop will feature expert faculty members with extensive grant writing and Tri-Council funding experience and previous SSHRC award recipients who will share their insights and advice. Zoom details will be shared with participants upon registration.\nDigital Badge Opportunity\nAttend and participate in this workshop to be eligible for a digital badge recognizing your professional development and engagement.\nDate: Friday, August 21, 2026\nTime: 9:00 a.m.-12:00 p.m.\nLocation: Online Zoom\nRegistration is required. ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tkbP5L8RRX-dHZHLOXBevQ )\n
