SUMMARY:Drop-In Co-op Support (Virtual)
DESCRIPTION:Want to connect with a Co-op Coordinator? Join a Co-op Drop-in! It’s the easiest & fastest way to get your questions answered. The drop-in will be structured as follows:\n\nLassonde, Science, EUC, Health, and Markham students: 11:00am-12:00pm\nKeele LA&PS students: 11:30am-12:00pm\nStudents in other faculties are kindly asked to contact their faculty regarding experiential education opportunities.\n\nStudents from Lassonde, Science, EUC, Health, and Markham can attend starting at 11:00 a.m., while Keele LA&PS students join in the second half of the hour.\nSession Format: This session is conducted in a group format in order to reduce wait times and to facilitate collaborative and group learning. Breakout rooms are available where students can meet with Co-op Coordinators privately to discuss specific circumstances. Typically there is a queue for these and we encourage students to join the drop-in time early. To ensure we provide support to as many students as possible these meetings are from 5-10 minutes in duration.\n \nJoin via Zoom using your PPY York U Log-in account: https://yorku.zoom.us/my/askcoop\nHaving trouble logging in? Please make sure you’re using your PPY York U login. When you select SSO (Single Sign-On), you should be prompted to sign in with your PPY credentials. If you use a different login, you may not be able to access the system.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/drop-in-co-op-support-virtual/
CATEGORIES:Co-op &amp; Career Centre,Co-op Drop-in (CCC),Information Sessions (CCC)
