SUMMARY:Time Management for Student Success
DESCRIPTION:Turn your syllabus into a success plan!\nTake control of your semester with the 3As of Time Management: Awareness, Arrangement, and Adaptation.\nBring your syllabus and learn how to identify key deadlines, plan backwards from major assignments, and create a calendar that helps you stay organized, reduce stress, and succeed all term long.\n\nDate: Thursday, September 24, 2026\nTime: 4:30 pm to 5:30 pm\nLocation: Room 2050, Markham Campus\n\nRegister by filling out this form: Time Management for Student Success (September 24, 2026) – Fill out form ( https://forms.cloud.microsoft/r/62MrJv86qp )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/time-management-for-student-success/
