SUMMARY:GENIAL Student Entrepreneurship Competition
DESCRIPTION:We are inviting you to our 2026 GENIAL Student Entrepreneurship Competition!\n\nNetwork with entrepreneurs and professionals across various industries\nGet inspired by our keynote speakers\nEnjoy refreshments at free cocktail reception\n\nThursday, September 24, 2026, 5:30-8:30p.m.\nCentre of Excellence @Glendon Campus\nShuttle buses are available: Glendon – Keele Shuttle Services ( https://www.yorku.ca/transportation/glendon-keele-shuttle/ )\nRegistration is required. To RSVP, visit https://2026GENIALpitch.eventbrite.ca\nIf you have any questions, please contact Josie at josiehu@yorku.ca.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/genial-student-entrepreneurship-competition-4/
ORGANIZER;CN=Glendon GENIAL:MAILTO:carmeli@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Colleges,Divisions and Special Areas,Faculties,Faculty of Health,Faculty of Liberal Arts &amp; Professional Studies,Faculty of Science,Glendon,Glendon Centre de carrière et de développement de compétences,Glendon Centre de rédaction et de compétences,Glendon Diplômés et amis,Glendon Double diplôme en études internationales et administration des affaires,Glendon Éducation,Glendon Études françaises,Glendon Études sur la sexualité,Glendon Étudiants actuels,Glendon Formation continue,Glendon Futurs étudiants,Glendon Le Salon francophone,Glendon Linguistique et sciences du langage,Glendon Maîtrise en affaires publiques et internationales (MAPI),Glendon Programme d'anglais,Glendon Programme d'économie et commerce,Glendon Programme d'espagnol (études hispaniques),Glendon Programme d'études canadiennes,Glendon Programme d'études des femmes et de genre,Glendon Programme d'études internationales,Glendon Programme d'histoire,Glendon Programme de biologie,Glendon Programme de communications,Glendon Programme de mathématiques,Glendon Programme de philosophie,Glendon Programme de science économique,Glendon Programme de sciences politiques,Glendon Programme de sociologie,Glendon Programme de théâtre et arts visuels,Glendon Programme de traduction,Glendon Psychologie,Glendon Recherche,Goldfarb Gallery,Graduate Program in Political Science,LA&amp;PS Advancement,Lassonde School of Engineering,Osgoode Hall Law School,School of Continuing Studies,School of Medicine,School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design,Schulich School of Business,Students
