TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:STEAM Mix & Mingle
DESCRIPTION:Join us in Room 2050, Markham Campus to participate in fun activities including Music and Math, Art and Math and Science and Math\n\nMeet fellow innovators from science, tech, engineering, arts, and math. Discover how your field intersects with others.\nEnjoy snacks, games, and interactive stations while mingling with like-minded peers.\nLearn about opportunities to get involved in STEAM related projects\n\n\nDate: Wednesday, September 23, 2026\nTime: 6:00 pm to 8:00 pm\nLocation: Room 2050, Markham Campus  Fill out this form to register.\nRegister by September 21st: https://forms.cloud.microsoft/r/BmhNeC7MrZ  ( https://forms.cloud.microsoft/r/BmhNeC7MrZ )\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/steam-mix-mingle/
