SUMMARY:Fall Convocation
DESCRIPTION:Convocation is the formal ceremony for the conferral of degrees, diplomas and certificates. It is also a time-honoured tradition that celebrates every student’s academic accomplishments. Convocation is a commemoration of your life at York and an opportunity to share this significant milestone with your family and friends.\nVisit the Convocation website ( https://www.yorku.ca/convocation/ ) for all the relevant information about convocation including the many ways you can celebrate this special occasion and the full ceremony schedule ( https://www.yorku.ca/convocation/ceremonies/ ).\n
