SUMMARY:LA&PS Get Spooky
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a fun way to take a break, get into the Halloween spirit, and meet new friends? Join us for Let’s Get Spooky! 🎃\nDesigned especially for first-year LA&PS students, this festive drop-in event is the perfect place to connect with classmates, unwind from your studies, and enjoy an afternoon of spooky fun. Put your problem-solving skills to the test in our Halloween-themed escape room, explore interactive games and challenges, get creative with hands-on crafts, strike a pose at our photo booth, and take part in a scavenger hunt full of surprises. You’ll also find board games, cozy Halloween vibes, and plenty of opportunities to relax and socialize.\nAnd of course, no Halloween celebration would be complete without free pizza, treats, and festive snacks!\nWhether you stay for the whole event or just stop by between classes, there’s something for everyone. Come dressed in your Halloween spirit, bring your friends, and make some new ones along the way.\nWe can’t wait to celebrate with you! 👻🍬\nRegister Now\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/laps-get-spooky-612-686/
ORGANIZER;CN=LA&amp;PS Colleges:MAILTO:lapscolleges@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:LA&amp;PS Colleges,LA&amp;PS Department of Anthropology,LA&amp;PS Department of Communication &amp; Media Studies,LA&amp;PS Department of Economics,LA&amp;PS Department of English,LA&amp;PS Department of Equity Studies,LA&amp;PS Department of French Studies,LA&amp;PS Department of History,LA&amp;PS Department of Humanities,LA&amp;PS Department of Languages, Literatures &amp; Linguistics,LA&amp;PS Department of Philosophy,LA&amp;PS Department of Politics,LA&amp;PS Department of Social Science,LA&amp;PS Department of Sociology,LA&amp;PS Founders College,LA&amp;PS McLaughlin College,LA&amp;PS New College,LA&amp;PS School of Administrative Studies,LA&amp;PS School of Gender, Sexuality and Women's Studies,LA&amp;PS School of Human Resources Management,LA&amp;PS School of Information Technology,LA&amp;PS School of Public Policy &amp; Administration,LA&amp;PS School of Social Work,LA&amp;PS SCOLAPS,LA&amp;PS SNACK,LA&amp;PS Student Success,LA&amp;PS Students-Undergrad,LA&amp;PS Vanier College
LOCATION:152 Founders Assembly Hall, Founders College
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LAPS-Get-Spooky-1_Erica-Alusio.png
