SUMMARY:Love That For You
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\nLooking for a fun way to connect with other first-year students and spread a little positivity this semester? Join us for LA&PS Love That for You! 💖\nThis Valentine’s-inspired celebration is all about friendship, self-care, and creating meaningful connections in a welcoming and inclusive environment. Drop in to meet new people, take a break from your studies, and enjoy an afternoon filled with feel-good activities designed just for LA&PS first-year students.\nGet creative by making Valentine’s cards, crafting colourful pipe-cleaner flowers, and exploring other hands-on activities. Capture memories with friends at our photo booth, and spend some time with therapy dogs for the ultimate stress-relieving study break.\nOf course, there will also be free food, snacks, and plenty of opportunities to relax, socialize, and enjoy the positive vibes. Whether you come with friends or arrive on your own, you’ll find a welcoming community ready to celebrate kindness, connection, and belonging. Stay for the whole event or drop in between classes, we’d love to see you there!\nWe can’t wait to celebrate with you! 💕✨\n\nRSVP\n\n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/love-that-for-you-268/
ORGANIZER;CN=LA&amp;PS Colleges Student Engagement:MAILTO:lapscolleges@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:LA&amp;PS Colleges
LOCATION:152 Founders Assembly Hall, Founders College
