SUMMARY:GRAD@YorkU 2026 – Social Fair
DESCRIPTION:Are you an incoming graduate student? If so, we look forward to meeting you at GRAD@YorkU 2026: Incoming Student Social Fair\nThis event will be an opportunity for you to meet with our FGS team and campus partners, to learn about a variety of resources and services available to support your graduate journey. We will have representatives from various academic and administrative services across the University. This event is being hosted in collaboration with the York University Libraries.\nWhen: Tuesday, September 8 from 12:00-1:30 p.m.\nWhere: Scott Library, 2nd Floor Collaboratory Space (Keele Campus)\nRegistration is required as space is limited: RSVP Form ( https://fgs.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=335002 ) (link)\nNote: A light lunch will be served.\nIf you have any questions, please email us at FGSINFO@YORKU.CA  ( mailto:FGSINFO@YORKU.CA )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/gradstudies-orientation-2026/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
