SUMMARY:LA&PS Graduate Experience Presents: Introduction to Personal Finances and Budgeting Webinar
DESCRIPTION:Managing finances can be challenging at any stage in life, but it can be even more challenging as a graduate student or an international student living abroad for the first time.  Help us help you by participating in this informative webinar to learn valuable information that will help you create effective budgets, make smart financial decisions, and manage your personal finances.\nThe webinar will be led by Simon Belz, Senior Manager, Priority Segment Partnerships, Students and Skilled Trades Client Strategy, with CIBC.\nRegistration Required:  Introduction to Personal Finances and Budgeting Webinar ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/k4Tsfp3ZTemtvRH7P5o4xA#/registration )\n
