SUMMARY:Lassonde Academic Orientation
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to York University and the Lassonde School of Engineering!\n\nConnect with fellow incoming students in your program\nMeet upper-year students\nExplore Campus and Lassonde Spaces\nLearn about how to get involved outside of the classroom\nGet tips on how to succeed in your classes\nMeet Faculty members\nDiscover the resources available to you as a student\n\nWhile Academic Orientation is Mandatory for incoming Lassonde Students, you are able to choose ONE of the two days available to attend, as well as the timeslots for each Academic Orientation session. ***Please only sign up for one day***\n\nRegister now for Lassonde Academic Orientation!\n\n\n\n
