SUMMARY:“Find My Class Tours” for new Science & Engineering students
DESCRIPTION:Are you a new student? We know it can be scary navigating a big university and figuring out where you’ll need to go. On your Find My Class Tour, upper year students will lead small groups of new students around campus to locate your classrooms and help answer any questions you may have.\n1) Select a tour time slot through Doodle.\n\nSelect Your Time\n\n2) Email us your class schedule at bcorient@yorku.ca\n\nSubmit Your Class Schedule\n\n3) On the day of your scheduled tour, arrive at Bethune College 5-10 minutes before your scheduled start time. Don’t worry, we’ll provide directions!\nPlease note:\n\nTo sign-up for a Find My Class Tour, you must first be enrolled in your Fall courses.\nThese tours are limited to students starting their studies at York University in Fall 2026.\nRegister early as spaces are limited.\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/find-my-class-tours-for-new-science-engineering-students/
