SUMMARY:LA&PS Grad Café: Loom Bands on the Run
DESCRIPTION:Take a break and get crafty with fellow LA&PS graduate students! Come create stunning bracelets using a wide variety of colorful bands, all while sipping tea and enjoying light refreshments in a fun way to destress and connect with other grad students.\nRegistration is required:  Grad Café Loom Bands on The Run ( https://laps.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=3096683 )\n
