SUMMARY:Peer Mentorship Day (Keele Campus)
DESCRIPTION:Discover peer mentorship supports from across York, all in one place! Connect with peer mentors from Keele Campus in the Vari Hall Rotunda to ask questions and explore mentorship opportunities. Chat with students who have been in your position and gain valuable insights, tips and advice that go beyond websites and textbooks.\nVisit the Vari Hall Rotunda during Peer Mentorship Day to:\n\nmeet peer mentors from across York;\nexplore supports;\nsign up for a mentorship program (or learn how to become a mentor!);\nmake a friendship bracelet;\nand more.\n\nWednesday, Sept. 23 \n10 a.m. to 2 p.m. \nNo registration required. \n
