SUMMARY:Lecture: SEIR Models with Host Heterogeneity
DESCRIPTION:Join Professor Andrea Pugliese for a talk on how differences in individual susceptibility can change epidemic dynamics and reduce predicted outbreak size using modified SEIR models.\nDate: February 5, 2026\nTime: 10:30-11:30 a.m.\nLocation: LIAM Lab, Room 227, Kinsmen Building, York University\nMORE INFO ( https://www.yorku.ca/science/ai-publichealth/wp-content/uploads/sites/1022/2026/03/Distinguished-Lecture-Series-Prof.-Andrea-Pugliese.pptx )\n
