SUMMARY:LA&PS Graduate Student & Alumni Mixer – Balancing Graduate Work with Family Commitments
DESCRIPTION:Pursuing a graduate degree requires an incredible amount of work and commitment, as does looking after the responsibilities that come with raising children or supporting parents, partners, and dependents who need more consistent care. Trying to manage these challenges can seem overwhelming.\nJoin us at this Graduate Student & Alumni Mixer to learn from those who have walked in your shoes and connect with those who are facing similar circumstances. Find solace, community, and inspiration to help you on your graduate student journey.\nRegistration is required:  Graduate Student & Alumni Mixer – Balancing Graduate Work with Family Commitments ( https://laps.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=3110985 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/la-alumni-mixer-balancing-graduate-work-with-family-commitments/
ORGANIZER;CN=LA&amp;PS Colleges Graduate Experience (New College):MAILTO:msestito@yorku.ca
