SUMMARY:Reboot Your Final: Alternative Approaches to Tests and Exams (Online – 2 Nov.-4 Dec., 2026)
DESCRIPTION:This course can count toward the Certificate of Proficiency in Teaching for eLearning: https://www.yorku.ca/teachingcommons/certificates/\nLooking to rethink your tests and exams? Interested in exploring alternative assessments that might replace a traditional final? Join us for a fully online course in the practical pedagogy of alternative assessment strategies. Participants will learn by doing as they workshop their own current assessment plans in light of best practices for online, remote, blended, and in-person teaching. This course is actively facilitated by a Teaching Commons instructor, and participants will be able to ask questions and access further support and resources by email, in online office hours, or through the course eClass site at any point.\nVisit our registration page to learn more and to sign up: https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=2124 ( https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=2124 )\n
