SUMMARY:LA&PS Graduate Student Wellness Day 2026
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Thursday, August 6th, for a fun and informative morning in the company of your fellow graduate students.\nActivities include:\n\nA Campus Walk covering important places for Graduate Students (10:00am – 11:30am leaving from the York University Subway Station)\nGraduate Health & Wellness Sessions (11:45am to 1:30pm in room 109 Atkinson) including:\n\n\nHealth promotion workshop led by Student Counselling Health & Well-being\nStress management workshop\nGuest speaker session\n\nJoin us on August 6th to:\n\nLearn valuable coping tools\nMeet fellow graduate students\nDiscover campus supports\nDiscover ways to improve your work-life balance\n\nRegistration is required:  Register Here\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/graduate-student-wellness-day-2026/
