DESCRIPTION:As a new LA&PS Graduate Student, we know you have a lot of questions, and we are here to help.\nJoin us on August 5th from 10:00am-11:00am to discover and learn about:\n\nLA&PS Graduate Experience Programs and Events\nGraduate Student Wellness Services\nStudent Counselling, Health, & Well-being\nLA&PS Global Community Engagement\n\nIn addition to the above, the webinar will also include a Q & A session with current LA&PS Graduate Students, who can share their tips, experiences, and advice to help make your graduate journey a successful one.\nJoin us to kick-start your graduate experience with all the tools you need for success!\nRegister Here\nNote:  The Zoom link will be sent near the date of the webinar.\n
