SUMMARY:2026 LA&PS Academic Orientation
DESCRIPTION:Start your journey at LA&PS by attending the 2026 Faculty of LA&PS Orientation this fall, designed specifically for first-year students to help you feel confident, comfortable, and excited as you begin university life. The event will take place on Wednesday, September 2, from 10:00 a.m. to 3:30 p.m. at York University, Keele Campus, with your arrival location provided upon registration.\nYou will have the opportunity to connect with your academic program, meet professors, explore campus resources, and get to know your College Council. Whether you are looking to make new friends, access support, or simply learn your way around campus, this is an important first step toward feeling at home at university. We look forward to welcoming you as you begin your journey of learning, growth, and new experiences.\nRegister Now\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/2026-laps-academic-orientation/
