DESCRIPTION:Get ready to start your journey in the Faculty of Liberal Arts & Professional Studies (LA&PS) by joining one of our virtual Welcome Webinars on Monday, August 14 from 10 to 11 AM. These interactive sessions are designed to help incoming students feel confident and prepared for their first year at York University. Learn about LA&PS, discover the academic and student supports available to you, gain tips for a successful transition to university, and find out how to connect with other students in your program. You’ll also have the opportunity to meet our Peer Support Team, hear from experienced upper-year students, and ask any questions before the semester begins.\nRegister Now\n
