SUMMARY:LA&PS Graduate Wellness Seminar: Exercise
DESCRIPTION:Join Alicia Koebel, MFSc, BA, Pn1, Mental Wellness Professional and Coordinator, Fitness & Lifestyles with Athletics & Recreation, to learn the fundamentals of exercise. Learn the differences between cardio, resistance training, functional training, and flexibility. Learn what to consider when starting an exercise plan and how to start your own exercise journey!\nRegistration is required:  Graduate Health & Wellness Seminar: Exercise ( https://laps.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=2998904 )\nIf you have any questions, please contact Marco at msestito@yorku.ca.\n
