SUMMARY:LA&PS Graduate Health & Wellness Program: Breath Work & Yoga Nidra
DESCRIPTION:Yoga Nidra – this isn’t traditional yoga poses, it is a focus on breath work, body scans, and visualization, with the main goal to be relaxation and tension release, similar to breath work.\nHeld weekly every Wednesday in July & August from 5 – 6 p.m. in ATK 109.\nRegistration is required: Graduate Health & Wellness Initiative: Breath Work and Yoga Nidra Tickets, Multiple dates | Eventbrite ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/graduate-health-wellness-initiative-breath-work-and-yoga-nidra-tickets-1985449567102?aff=oddtdtcreator&keep_tld=true )\nIf you have any questions, please email Marco, at msestito@yorku.ca.\n
