SUMMARY:Weekly Virtual Grad Writing Hub
DESCRIPTION:Join fellow graduate students in a supportive, distraction-free virtual space dedicated to making steady progress on your writing. Whether you’re working on a thesis, dissertation, article, or other academic projects, this weekly session, every Friday from 12pm-2pm, will follow the pomodoro technique to get you on track with your writing.\nRegistration is required:  Grad Writing Hub 2026/2027 ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/R4EHtDJpShaHAsUgwrSHWg#/registration )\nShould you have any questions, please email Marco at msestito@yorku.ca\n
