SUMMARY:Discover Financial Aid @ Markham Campus (Virtual)
DESCRIPTION:Starting your journey at the Markham Campus? Join us for an informative and engaging session designed to help you understand the financial support available to you as a new student. 💰\nIn this interactive session, Student Support & Advising will walk you through key financial aid resources, including scholarships, awards, bursaries, and government funding options like OSAP. You’ll also learn about student employment opportunities and important financial deadlines to help you stay on track throughout the academic year. \nHosted by Student Life, this session will include fun icebreakers, live polls, and games (with prizes!) to keep things engaging while you learn. You’ll also have the opportunity to submit questions in advance or ask them live during the session. \nRegister to attend via Eventbrite ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/discover-financial-aid-markham-campus-tickets-1991724184652?aff=oddtdtcreator ).\n
