SUMMARY:Information Session for Graduate Nursing Programs
DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in pursuing your graduate education in Nursing? We invite you to join our virtual Graduate Nursing Information Session to learn more about York University’s Graduate Nursing programs.\nOur graduate program offers cutting-edge innovation grounded in foundational nursing values—designed for nurses who want to become leaders, educators, and advanced nurse practitioners. The program integrates relational principles with theoretical knowledge in areas such as transformational and organizational leadership, caring and narrative pedagogies, global and local policy, and human health experiences.\nEvent Details\n\nDate: November 10, 2026\nTime: 6:00–7:00 p.m.\nLocation: Virtual (Zoom)\nJoin link: yorku.zoom.us/s/94632597264 ( https://yorku.zoom.us/s/94632597264 )\n\nLearn More\n\nProgram information: futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nAdmissions questions: fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca )\n\n
