SUMMARY:York Day Alumni Dinner at the National Bank Open
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the annual York Day Alumni Dinner at the National Bank Open and celebrate with other alumni tennis fans. Enjoy delicious food, snap a picture at our photo booth, and earn a chance at winning exciting door prizes!\nDate: Tuesday, August 4\nTime: 5 – 7 p.m.\nLocation: VIP Lounge presented by Mercedes-Benz, Sobey’s Stadium at York University, 1 Shoreham Drive, North York, ON, M2N 3A6\nCost: $30 for adults, $15 for children\nSpecial guest: A player from the tournament will join us for an exclusive Q & A with attendees.\nAlumni can also enjoy discounts on sessions on August 4.\nYork Day Bonus (August 4):\n40% off lower bowl tickets for the day session\n25% off lower bowl tickets for the evening session\nVIP Lounge access included with these sessions\nPurchase tickets ( https://am.ticketmaster.com/nbopentoronto/promotional-page?id=NTQ5MQ== )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/york-day-alumni-dinner/
