SUMMARY:Navigating Bursaries, Scholarships and Awards at York university
DESCRIPTION:Thousands of dollars in scholarships, bursaries, and awards are available to mature students at York — but only if you know the differences between each, where to find them, when to apply and specific eligibility requirements.\nThis workshop gives you everything you need: a full breakdown of available funding, what differentiates each one, a walkthrough of the Financial Aid, Awards & Scholarships system (FAAS), all the key deadlines, eligibility details and direct contacts to get the support you need.\n\nJuly 14, 2026 at 12:00am via Zoom (Online) – Registration\n\n \n\nLink:\nhttps://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/n9v6BK-yQGOH-CtsGGFCfw\n\n
