SUMMARY:OSAP Made Simple: From Eligibility to Application
DESCRIPTION:Returning to school as a mature or part-time student? Let’s talk about funding. Get insights into OSAP and engage in conversations about eligibility, how your funding is calculated, and how to apply. Understand your OSAP now so you can focus on your studies, not the paperwork – no matter where you are in the application process.\n*NOTE: Already applied for OSAP? No problem! You can still attend this session. It is relevant because it teaches you how the amount is calculated, the processing time/details of the funds, and how the monies come to you.\nJuly 8, 2026 at 11:00am via Zoom (Online)\nRegistration Link: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/Mq2J_MggQUyf10eFOQWW8g\n
