SUMMARY:Analyze that! How to make sense of your assignment instructions
DESCRIPTION:Do you ever feel uncertain about what your assignment instructions are asking you to do, or feel overwhelmed by the idea of starting or completing yet another assignment? This session will help you work through your assignments more efficiently and effectively by learning how to break instructions down in to smaller, more manageable parts, prioritize key components, relate the assignment to your course material, clarify what common terms used in assignment instructions really mean, and make a checklist to ensure you satisfy all requirements.\nNo RSVPs.\nJust click to join!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/analyze-that-how-to-make-sense-of-your-assignment-instructions-4-471-634/
