SUMMARY:Transfer Student Orientation
DESCRIPTION:Transfer Student Success at York: Issues, Strategies, and Resources\nJoin us to explore strategies for Transfer Student success at York!\nThis orientation session will highlight the issues transfer students face as they transition to university, explore strategies for transfer student success, and provide an overview of campus resources that can support academic and personal success at York.\nLearning Outcomes\n\nLearn about the prevailing issues faced by transfer students\n\n\nApply a range of strategies to support your academic and personal success\n\n\nIdentify a range of campus resources that will support their well-being and success at York\n\nDate: Thursday August 20th, 2026, 6:00 p.m. – 8:00 p.m.\nLocation: VH A (In-Person)\nRSVP Here: https://machform.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=407619 ( https://machform.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=407619 )\nRegistration begins at 5:30 p.m.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/transfer-student-orientation-2/
ORGANIZER;CN=ACMAPS:MAILTO:acmaps@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Orientation and Transition,Student Leaders at Markham (SLAM),Student Life,the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students
