SUMMARY:Mature Student Orientation
DESCRIPTION:Kick‑start your journey as a mature learner at York University with our Mature Student Orientation! Connect with ACMAPS staff, Peer Mentors, and members of the York University Mature Student Organization while discovering the supports, resources, and strategies that will help you thrive. Learn about time management, planning your course load, and what it means to be a successful mature student—all in a welcoming, community‑focused environment.\nRSVP Here: https://machform.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=407032  ( https://machform.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=407032 )\nRegistration begins at 5:30 p.m.\nVari Hall “A”\n
