DESCRIPTION:Summer is here, and we’re taking Social Circle to the waterfront patio at Harbourfront. Join us for an evening of great food, lively conversation, and meaningful connections at our upcoming Level Up | Social Circle Dinner: Summer Patio Edition on July 8! ☀️🍻\nWhether you’re looking to expand your social circle, make new friends, or grow your professional network, this casual get-together is the perfect opportunity.\nHosted by Young Alumni Ambassadors:\n\nCrystal Heidari (BSc ’17, JD ’20), Associate at McCarthy Hansen & Company LLP.\nArjun Rattan (BCom ’23), Financial Coordinator, Region of Peel\n\nEvent Details:\nDate: Wednesday, July 8\nTime: 6:30-8:30 p.m.\nLocation: Amsterdam Brewhouse | South Building, 245 Queens Quay W, Toronto\nCost: guests are required to pay for their own food and drink\n
