DESCRIPTION:Soccer fever is hitting Toronto this summer and you’re invited to join us for an evening of thrilling soccer, delicious food, lively conversation, and meaningful connections at our upcoming Level Up | Social Circle Dinner: Soccer Quarterfinals Edition on July 9!⚽🏆\nWhether you’re looking to expand your social circle, make new friends, or grow your professional network, this casual get-together is the perfect opportunity. Come watch the Quarterfinals game with fellow York alumni and soccer fans!\nHosted by Young Alumni Ambassadors: \n\nLetty Wong (BA ‘16), Freelance Digital Marketing Consultant \nMahi Rane (BA ’25), Retail and Digital Shelf Excellence, Philips \n\nDate: Thursday, July 9\nTime: 4–7 p.m.\nLocation: St. Louis Bar & Grill, 595 Bay St., A09, Toronto\nCost: Guests are responsible for their own meals\n \n
