SUMMARY:How to be a Trans Ally in the Classroom & Workplace
DESCRIPTION:If you think you have never met someone trans, think again. In the store, on the bus, in the classroom, and in the workplace – trans folks of all kinds are everywhere. Hate and discriminiation is rapidly increasing in the world and trans folks are in desperate need of good allies.\nJoin this workshop created and run by Brian Ginther to learn more about trans folks you live alongside and how you can support them and their community. All are welcome.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/how-to-be-a-trans-ally-in-the-classroom-workplace/
