SUMMARY:Astro Fair 2026
DESCRIPTION:Allan I. Carswell Observatory presents Astro Fair 2026!\nJoin us for an unforgettable family-friendly evening celebrating astronomy! Watch sunspots cross the Sun in real time, build your own astronomically accurate fortune teller, and take part in various science activities. Your ticket includes access to the Astronomy in Action Planetarium, telescope viewing, interactive exhibits, and astronomy booths. All proceeds will support observatory repairs and student shifts at the Allan I. Carswell Observatory.\nDate: Saturday, August 29, 2026\nTime: 6:00 PM – 11:00 PM\nLocation: York University Keele Campus\nTickets and Information: yorku.ca/science/observatory/astrofair2026\nAll areas of the event are suitable for ages 5+, but younger children should be accompanied by an adult.\nWe look forward to seeing you at Astro Fair 2026!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/astro-fair-2026/
ORGANIZER;CN=Allan I. Carswell Observatory:MAILTO:observe@yorku.ca
