SUMMARY:A Soirée for Curious Minds – The Past Never Dies: VAMPIRES and The Historical Periods They Inhabit
DESCRIPTION:You are cordially invited to A Soirée for Curious Minds, an intimate series presented in partnership with the Rosedale United Church. Each event features a Glendon professor sharing their expertise on engaging and timely topics.\nUp Next:\n\nMay 26: The Past Never Dies: Vampires and The Historical Periods They Inhabit  –Prof. Valérie Florentin\n\nRegister here! ( https://www.rosedaleunited.org/events/a-soiree-for-curious-minds-lecture-4/2026-05-26 )\n\n\n\n***Our community can enjoy a special rate: 50% off tickets with the promo code YorkU-Staff\nEach evening begins with live piano music to welcome you, followed by a thought-provoking talk and engaging discussions on literature, culture, psychology, or politics.\nNo pretension, just inspiring ideas, lively conversation, and plenty to think about.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/a-soiree-for-curious-minds-the-past-never-dies-vampires-and-the-historical-periods-they-inhabit/
