SUMMARY:Job Opportunities and Professional Development: Building Your Future at LA&PS
DESCRIPTION:Prepare for your future career with this engaging webinar designed to introduce the wide range of job opportunities and professional development opportunities available to international students at LA&PS. Join staff and current students from various units as they showcase programs, services, and resources that will help you build essential professional skills and gain experience. Learn about experiential education opportunities, including the Co-op program at LA&PS, discover the Get Ready to Graduateworkshop series designed to support international students in career preparation, and explore the Academic Communication & Excellence (ACE) certificate, which provides valuable skills and hands-on project experiences you can highlight on your resume and in interviews. This session will equip you with the tools and strategies to confidently plan your career and achieve your professional goals.\nRegister Now\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/job-opportunities-and-professional-development-building-your-future-at-laps/
CATEGORIES:LA&amp;PS Future Students
LOCATION:Online Zoom
END:VEVENT
