SUMMARY:Your LA&PS First Year Academic Toolkit for Success
DESCRIPTION:Discover the wide range of academic support and resources available to help you succeed at LA&PS in this informative webinar designed for international students. Hear from staff members across various units as they introduce services and programs tailored to support your academic journey. Learn about peer tutoring support initiatives like PASS and SNACK, which focus on popular courses, and explore academic writing support provided by our Writing Centre. Gain insight into the Academic Communication & Excellence (ACE) certificate, designed to strengthen your academic foundations, communication skills, and professional competencies, and familiarize yourself with resources to uphold academic integrity. This session will equip you with the tools and knowledge to excel academically and make the most of your time at LA&PS.\nRegister Now\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/your-laps-first-year-academic-toolkit-for-success/
