SUMMARY:York University Markham Campus at York Region Pride 2026
DESCRIPTION:The York University Markham Campus is excited to participate in York Region Pride Festival 2026 on Saturday, June 13, 2026 (4:00pm to 700:pm) in Newmarket. We invite students, staff and faculty to join us to march as we celebrate inclusion, diversity, and community. Please complete this form to express interest in participating (Participation is limited due to capacity): York University Markham Campus at York Region Pride 2026 🌈 ( https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=GBNTNBFw1E-H8KQ4FsSb0GNerGlWx21PjnmxupiriiBUQVZGWFo4MFpXU0NKRDBIQTlZUEgxNTFSMC4u )\nPlease check York Pride website for more details: https://yorkpride.ca/\n
