SUMMARY:Ask Me Anything: Drop-In Sessions – LA&PS International Students
DESCRIPTION:Are you an LA&PS international student looking for support? Whether you have questions about course enrolment, are planning your arrival in Canada, or looking to explore the various opportunities at LA&PS, our team is here to help. Join us online every Tuesday at 9 a.m. EDT to chat with a member of our Global Community & Engagement team and get answers. No registration needed — just log on and drop in.\nThese sessions are open to both current and incoming students.\nJoin Online on Tuesdays\n
