SUMMARY:CIAN Satellite Symposium “Cognition and Action”
DESCRIPTION:The Centre for Integrative and Applied Neuroscience (CIAN) at York University will host its Satellite Symposium, Cognition and Action, on June 4 to 5.\n\nThis event brings together researchers, students, and trainees to explore the neural and behavioural foundations of perception, decision‑making, and action across basic and applied domains.\n\nThe program will feature keynote talks, invited presentations, and approximately 50 poster presentations by trainees, highlighting emerging research in areas such as visuomotor control, cognitive‑motor integration, and multisensory processing.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/cian-satellite-symposium-cognition-and-action/
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies (Programs),Faculty of Health,ORUs
