SUMMARY:Empowering Access: Career Resource Fair
DESCRIPTION:An accessibility‑focused career fair with practical tools, candid talks and hands-on workshops designed to help build career readiness.\nEmpowering Access: Career Resource Fair is a full day of career self-advocacy and skill‑building, including real talk about work, access and what comes next. Expect networking opportunities, engaging workshops, and plenty of chances to connect, ask questions and learn about career accessibility in an inclusive space. Come for the resources, stay for the conversations—and leave feeling more confident about your career journey.\nRegister now! ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/empowering-access-career-resource-fair-tickets-1988638877415?aff=oddtdtcreator )\n \n \nHosted as part of the National AccessAbility Week 2026 event series. Find more info about events, participating employers, organizations and enter our contest on the National AccessAbility Week 2026 webpage ( https://students.yorku.ca/accessibility/national-accessability-week/2026 ).\n
URL:https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/empowering-access-career-resource-fair-tickets-1988638877415?aff=oddtdtcreator
