SUMMARY:CSBBCS Meeting 2026
DESCRIPTION:The Centre for Integrative and Applied Neuroscience (CIAN) is delighted to host the 2026 Annual Meeting of the Canadian Society for Brain, Behaviour and Cognitive Science (CSBBCS), taking place June 1 to 3 at York University’s Keele Campus.\n\nThis premier conference brings together experts from across Canada and internationally to share cutting‑edge research in brain, behavioural, and cognitive sciences through a dynamic program of talks, posters, and scholarly discussion.  The event will be followed by a “Cognition and Action” satellite symposium (June 4–5), featuring presentations from leading scholars across institutions alongside dedicated poster sessions that highlight innovative research from trainees and emerging scientists.\n\nRegistration (for CSBBCS members only) here ( https://www.csbbcs.org/meetings/2026-meeting ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/csbbcs-meeting-2026/
