DESCRIPTION:Start your journey in the Faculty of Liberal Arts and Professional Studies (LA&PS) with confidence! This interactive, in-person orientation experience is designed to welcome first-year students and help you get connected early.\nYou’ll learn about key academic and wellbeing supports, meet LA&PS peer mentors, make friends, and explore resources across campus through a brief presentation, tabling, and fun engagement activities. Drop by for helpful information, make connections, and enjoy some snacks while discovering what’s available to support your success in LA&PS.\nRegister Now\nIf you have any questions, please feel free to contact us by email at lapsfye@yorku.ca.\n
