SUMMARY:Osgoode’s Internationally Trained Lawyers Day
DESCRIPTION:\n\nConnect and celebrate internationally trained talent in Canada at Osgoode’s Internationally Trained Lawyers Day (OITLD)\n\n\n\n\nThis is a unique event that brings together diverse, internationally trained talent with experienced members of the Canadian legal community to discuss tips and strategies on how to make your international training stand out in the Canadian legal landscape.\nDesigned for lawyers and law graduates from around the globe, as well as those navigating the process of accreditation or licensing independently, Osgoode’s Internationally Trained Lawyers Day provides comprehensive insights into the unique paths and partnerships available to help you thrive in the Canadian legal profession. If you’re looking for clarity, support, and a roadmap to success, OITLD is the must-attend event for internationally trained lawyers in Canada.\nTake advantage of early bird pricing until April 30. Register today! ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/osgoodes-internationally-trained-lawyers-day-oitld-2026-tickets-1984766104848?aff=yfileeventlisting )\n\n\n
