SUMMARY:A Soirée for Curious Minds
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to A Soirée for Curious Minds, an intimate series presented in partnership by Glendon College and the Rosedale United Church. Each event features a professor sharing their expertise on engaging and timely topics.\nUp Next:\n\nApril 14: Dear John (Love, Robin Hood) – Prof. Igor Djordjevic\nRegister here ( https://www.rosedaleunited.org/events/a-soiree-for-curious-minds-lecture-2/2026-04-14 )\nMay 5: The Persistence of Stories in Thought – Prof. Buddhika Bellana\nMay 26: The Past Never Dies: Vampires and History – Prof. Valérie Florentin\n\nEach evening begins with live piano music to welcome you, followed by a thought-provoking talk and engaging discussions on literature, culture, psychology and politics.\nNo pretension, just inspiring ideas, lively conversation and plenty to think about.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/a-soiree-for-curious-minds-2/
CATEGORIES:Glendon,Glendon Alumni &amp; Friends,Glendon Biology,Glendon Business Economics,Glendon Canadian Studies,Glendon Career &amp; Skills Development Centre,Glendon Centre de carrière et de développement de compétences,Glendon Centre de rédaction et de compétences,Glendon Communications,Glendon Continuing Education,Glendon Current Students,Glendon Diplômés et amis,Glendon Double diplôme en études internationales et administration des affaires,Glendon Drama and Creative Arts,Glendon Economics,Glendon Education,Glendon Éducation,Glendon English Studies,Glendon Études françaises,Glendon Études sur la sexualité,Glendon Étudiants actuels,Glendon Formation continue,Glendon Future Students,Glendon Futurs étudiants,Glendon Gender &amp; Women’s Studies,Glendon Hispanic Studies,Glendon History,Glendon International Studies,Glendon International Studies &amp; Business Administration Dual Degree,Glendon Le Salon francophone,Glendon Linguistics &amp; Language Studies,Glendon Linguistique et sciences du langage,Glendon Maîtrise en affaires publiques et internationales (MAPI),Glendon Masters in Public &amp; International Affairs,Glendon Mathematics,Glendon Philosophy,Glendon Political Science,Glendon Programme d'anglais,Glendon Programme d'économie et commerce,Glendon Programme d'espagnol (études hispaniques),Glendon Programme d'études canadiennes,Glendon Programme d'études des femmes et de genre,Glendon Programme d'études internationales,Glendon Programme d'histoire,Glendon Programme de biologie,Glendon Programme de communications,Glendon Programme de mathématiques,Glendon Programme de philosophie,Glendon Programme de science économique,Glendon Programme de sciences politiques,Glendon Programme de sociologie,Glendon Programme de théâtre et arts visuels,Glendon Programme de traduction,Glendon Psychologie,Glendon Psychology,Glendon Recherche,Glendon Research,Glendon Salon Francophone,Glendon Sexuality Studies,Glendon Sociology,Glendon Writing Centre
