SUMMARY:President’s Reception in London
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Wednesday, May 13, for an opportunity to meet York’s President and Vice-Chancellor Lisa Philipps at her first President’s Reception in London.\nThis is a great opportunity to connect with other alumni, expand your professional network and learn about the latest developments from your alma mater.\nWhether you graduated recently or many years ago, we would love to see you.\nPresident’s Reception in London\nDate: Wednesday, May 13\nTime: 6:30-8:30 p.m.\nLocation: The Groucho Club, 45 Dean St, London W1D 4QB, United Kingdom\n
