SUMMARY:TRCA Headquarters Sustainable Building Tour
DESCRIPTION:An exclusive guided tour of a landmark green building\nJoin us for a behind-the-scenes tour of the Toronto and Region Conservation Authority (TRCA) Headquarters, a cutting-edge model of sustainable design and innovation.\nOpened in 2025, this state-of-the-art facility is designed to achieve LEED Platinum, WELL Silver, and Zero Carbon certifications. Learn how features such as geothermal heating, solar chimneys, water walls, and a wood-first construction approach are shaping the future of sustainable buildings.\n📅 Date: Tuesday, April 14\n🕐 Time: 1 to 2:30 p.m.\n📍 Location: 5 Shoreham Drive\n📌 Meet & check-in at Reception\nRegistration required\n
