SUMMARY:The Japanese Left Today and the Return to Marx’s Capital
DESCRIPTION:The world is facing war, economic shocks, deep inequalities, and ecological crises; these challenges affect us all. Join Kazuo Shii for a compelling discussion on why our society’s dominant systems need a profound transformation, and discover why Marx’s Capital is relevant now more than ever.\nRefreshments will be served at 17:00.\nRegister Now\n \n
