SUMMARY:New global data about Ecological Footprint and Biocapacity 1961 to 2025
DESCRIPTION:This webinar will profile the latest research about Ecological Footprint and Biocapacity of all countries, and the world, from 1961 to 2025. Attendees will hear from researchers at the Ecological Footprint Initiative at York University, and at University of Iceland, who co-authored this dataset, for the Footprint Data Foundation. Hosted by the International Ecological Footprint Learning Lab.\nRegister for the event ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_OGXMZbWlRr-8ymqHG6ckUg#/registration  Guest Data Name: International Ecological Footprint Learning Lab Partnership  Email: iefll@footprintpartnership.net  Move upMove downToggle panel: Yoast SEO SEO Readability Schema Social Focus keyphraseHelp on choosing the perfect focus keyphrase(Opens in a new browser tab) Get related keyphrases(Opens in a new browser tab)  Search appearance Determine how your post should look in the search results. Preview as: Mobile resultDesktop result Url preview:  York University Events Calendar events.yorku.ca› events › new-global-data-about-ecological-footprint-and-biocapacity-1961-2025 SEO title preview: New global data about Ecological Footprint and Biocapacity 1961 to ... Meta description preview: Mar 30, 2026 － Please provide a meta description by editing the snippet below. If you don’t, Google will try to find a relevant part of your post to show in the search results. SEO title Use AI Insert variable Title Page Separator Site title   Slug new-global-data-about-ecological-footprint-and-biocapacity-1961-2025 Meta description Use AI Insert variable    SEO analysisEnter a focus keyphrase to calculate the SEO score  Premium SEO analysis Premium  Add related keyphrase Premium  Track SEO performance  Internal linking suggestions Premium  Cornerstone content  Advanced  Insights Move upMove downToggle panel: Excerpt Excerpt Excerpts are optional hand-crafted summaries of your content that can be used in your theme. Learn more about manual excerpts.  Move upMove downToggle pa