SUMMARY:A Soirée for Curious Minds
DESCRIPTION:You’re invited to A Soirée for Curious Minds, an intimate series presented in partnership with the Rosedale United Church. Each event features a Glendon professor sharing their expertise on engaging and timely topics.\nUp Next:\n\nMarch 31, 7 p.m: Populism in Canada: How Different Are We, Really? – Prof. Rémi Vivès\nRegister here! ( https://www.rosedaleunited.org/events/a-soiree-for-curious-minds-lecture-1/2026-03-31 )\n\nEach evening begins with live piano music to welcome you, followed by a thought-provoking talk and engaging discussions on literature, culture, psychology, and politics.\nNo pretension, just inspiring ideas, lively conversation, and plenty to think about.\n
