SUMMARY:Career Exploration: What Can I Do with My Degree? Webinar
DESCRIPTION:Not sure what career options your degree might lead to? Join this webinar to learn how the skills you are developing in your degree, and the experiences you are gaining at York, are helping you build a foundation for your future. You will learn how to create a personalized list of options that considers your career wants, your favourite skills, and your deepest interests, and how you can use these clues to find a suitable career goal or direction! You’ll also be introduced to online resources and York’s campus supports to help you succeed. \nTo register for this session, sign in to Experience York ( https://careers.yorku.ca/experience-york-online-job-posting-and-registration-system ) with your Passport York credentials and visit Career Centre Events > Workshops & Webinars.\n
