SUMMARY:Radiate: DESN Grad Exhibition Show 2026
DESCRIPTION:The DESN Class of 2026 at York University invites friends, family, designers, and industry professionals to their Grad Exhibition, Radiate.\nWe are a team of 44 designers united in creativity – refining pixels, perfecting typography, and bringing this exhibition to life from the ground up.\nDate | Time: April 24, 2025 (3:00 – 9:00 p.m.) and April 25, 2025 (12:00  – 7:00 p.m.)\nLocation: Transmission Studios ( https://transmissionstudios58.com/ ) (58 Berkeley St, Toronto, ON M5A 2W6)\nRegister HERE ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/desn-2026-grad-show-tickets-1984703272916?aff=oddtdtcreator ) for your FREE ticket\nTo us, Radiate is a space where we allow our humanity to shine, celebrating not only our work but also the creative sparks that radhttps://www.desn.ca/2026iate from within us. DESN is where we converged, and it is now time for us to move outward, where our creative sparks can shine even brighter and reach the world around us. This exhibition marks our four years of growth within DESN, and we warmly invite all friends, family, designers, and industry professionals to share this milestone with us!\nWe can’t wait to welcome you at our grad show!\nSOCIALS\nInstagram ( https://www.instagram.com/radiate.2026/ )\nLinkedIn ( https://www.linkedin.com/company/desn-grad-show/ )\nTikTok ( https://www.tiktok.com/@radiate.2026 )\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/radiate-desn-grad-exhibition-show-2026/
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies,School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:58 Berkeley St, Toronto, ON M5A 2W6
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/radiate.jpg
