DESCRIPTION:This presentation is customized for York’s Faculty of Education students only.\nAre you wondering what career options your education degree might lead to? Join us to learn how the skills  you are developing in your degree, and the experiences you are gaining while at York, will help you build a foundation for your future! You will also be introduced to online resources and York’s hybrid campus supports to help you succeed. Facilitated by York’s Career Centre. Partnership of the Career Centre and York’s Faculty of Education Students’ Association (FESA).\nRegister on Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/entityRedirect.htm?eventId=5513 )\nIf you have trouble accessing the direct registration link above, please first sign in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm ) with your Passport York credentials and visit Career Centre Events > Workshops & Webinars.\n** PLEASE NOTE THIS WILL BE AN ONLINE WEBINAR**\nTo participate in a webinar, you will need a computer (with speakers or headphones), internet access, and a Zoom desktop application (Zoom) installed on your computer. After registering for the event, you will receive the webinar URL and meeting ID in a reminder email. On the day of the event, you will join the webinar and ask your questions via chat, or, you can participate via telephone at 1.647.558.0588\n
