SUMMARY:Not Just Grad School! Exploring Pathways to Further Education Webinar
DESCRIPTION:Join this webinar to explore the further education landscape and gain tips on how to research graduate programs, post-degree college programs, skilled trades, and potential schools of interest. You will also be introduced to online resources and York’s campus supports to help you succeed. \n** PLEASE NOTE THIS WILL BE AN ONLINE WEBINAR**\nTo participate in a webinar, you will need a computer (with speakers or headphones), internet access, and a Zoom desktop application (Zoom) installed on your computer. After registering for the event, you will receive the webinar URL and meeting ID in a reminder email. On the day of the event, you will join the webinar and ask your questions via chat, or, you can participate via telephone at 1.647.558.0588\n
