SUMMARY:The Urbanists Link Up Program
DESCRIPTION:The Urbanists Link Up is a youth-led research program exploring how city change impacts Black communities across the GTA and how we can respond creatively and collectively.\nWhat We’ll You Do\n\nDocument community stories through photography, media, art and storytelling\nExplore issues like gentrification, displacement, transit and public space\nDevelop your research skills, urban planners, artists and environmental/urban experts\n\nWho is this for\n\nBlack Youth ages 15 to 25\nInterested in film, photography, art-based research, environmental studies, or urban planning\nCurious about how cities change – hand how communities can shape that change\n\nProgram Details\n\nSaturday April 18\nBi-Weekly Workshops (Virtual + Person)\nLocation: Communities within the GTA\n\nContact Us\nemail: the urbanistslinkup@gmail.com\ninstagram: @tuluproj\nApplication Link\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/the-urbanists-link-up-program/
