DESCRIPTION:Join ACMAPS for a relaxed and uplifting social gathering created especially for mature students and student-parents. Bring your children along and enjoy an hour of light-hearted fun and connection.\nWe’ll have lawn games like giant Jenga, ladder golf, cornhole, kid-friendly axe-throwing and classic board games. It’s a chance to unwind, laugh, meet others and let the kids burn off some energy in a safe and welcoming space. Refreshments/snacks will be provided.\nRegister here ( https://machform.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=398845 ) (waiver form required upon registration):\n\nLocation – Upper Gym & TM316 (Classroom)\n
