DESCRIPTION:This virtual event is part of #SDGMonthCanada and is open to all post-secondary students across Canada. We would be delighted for your institution to participate, please share this opportunity with your students.\nNational SDG Trivia is a fun and interactive online competition hosted on Kahoot, where students test their knowledge of the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs), compete with peers nationwide, and win prizes — all while learning more about sustainability.\nEvent Details:\nDate: March 24\nTime: 1 to 2 p.m.\nLocation: Online (via Zoom)\nEligibility: Open to all post-secondary students in Canada\nRegistration Link: https://survey.ucalgary.ca/jfe/form/SV_23QyDTyRP94cTfo\nParticipant registration is mandatory. The Zoom link will be shared with registered participants closer to the event date\n
