SUMMARY:Connected Minds Book Launch
DESCRIPTION:\nJoin us for the Connected Minds Book Launch on Thursday, March 26 from 11:00 a.m. to 2 p.m. at the York University Bookstore. This engaging event brings together leading authors to explore how humanity, technology, and justice intersect in an increasingly networked world.\nThe program will feature excerpts from three books by their authors, followed by a dynamic panel discussion and an opportunity for attendees to ask questions and engage directly with the speakers. Through these readings and conversations, guests will hear from scholars whose work advances equity, interdisciplinary research, and meaningful community impact.\nAttendees will also have time to network with researchers, students, and community members while celebrating innovative and socially responsible scholarship. Light refreshments will be provided.\nThis event is open to the public and free to attend; however, registration is required.\nRegister here ( https://connectedminds.jotform.com/260496557429874 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/connected-minds-book-launch/
ORGANIZER;CN=Connected Minds:MAILTO:connectedmindsinfo@yorku.ca
