SUMMARY:Identity and Justice: Presentation with Judge Michelle O’Bonsawin
DESCRIPTION:Michelle O’Bonsawin, Justice of the Supreme Court of Canada, lawyer and law professor, will speak about her Indigenous (Abenaki) and Franco-Ontarian identity, her professional career and current legal issues affecting Indigenous and Franco-Ontarian communities.\nThe presentation will take place on Thursday, March 26 from 4 to 5 p.m.\nThe presentation will be virtual and will take place on Zoom.\nZoom link  ( https://yorku.zoom.us/j/97256236441 )and Meeting ID: 972 5623 6441\nThe presentation will be in French with simultaneous interpretation in English available.\n \n
