SUMMARY:Tabling Event – Accessible Glendon Clubs for You and Me
DESCRIPTION:🌱 Got an Idea for a Club? Let’s Make It Happen.\nEver wondered why it’s so hard to start or re-register a club at Glendon?\nHave you thought about creating something sustainability-focused but didn’t know where to begin?\nJoin us on March 17 from 3:30 to 6:30 p.m. at the Cafeteria Entrance of Glendon Campus to talk about how we can make club registration more accessible, inclusive, and supportive for students like you.\n✨ Share your experiences\n✨ Tell us what barriers you’ve faced\n✨ Learn about sustainability clubs on campus\n✨ Help shape real recommendations that will be submitted to Student Services and student leadership\nWe’re working to improve the process so that creative, environmental, and community-driven ideas don’t get stuck in paperwork.\nWhether you’re part of a club, thinking about starting one, or just curious — stop by, chat with us, and be part of the change.\nSnacks and drinks will be provided! 🧀🧃🍪\nLet’s build a more accessible Glendon together 🌍\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/tabling-event-accessible-glendon-clubs-for-you-and-me/
ORGANIZER;CN=Glendon Office of Experiential Education:MAILTO:ee@glendon.yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Glendon
LOCATION:Glendon Campus @ 2275 Bayview Ave.
