SUMMARY:From Food Scraps to Soil: A Composting Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Food scraps don’t have to be wasted, they can become soil. Stop by to learn how composting turns everyday organic waste into a powerful tool for sustainability. We’ll introduce a three-stage compost system and vermicomposting, highlight their environmental benefits, and demonstrate how these practices help build a circular economy on campus.\n
