SUMMARY:Reflect & Feast with Greg Loft
DESCRIPTION:As part of Inclusion Week and Well-Being Week, join us for an in‑person Indigenous restorative session rooted in care and community connection. This gathering invites participants to slow down, reflect and engage in collective healing as we navigate the fractures of the world we live in today.\nThrough story, dialogue and gentle restorative practice, we will explore what it means to mend relationships – with ourselves, with one another and with the lands that sustain us.\nOpen to all, however priority will be given to Indigenous community members.\n
