SUMMARY:National Institute of Informatics (NII) (Japan) Info Session
DESCRIPTION:We would like to invite you to join an NII Info Session:\nTime: Thursday, March 19 at 11 a.m. to noon\nLocation: In-person at Lassonde BERG 125\nIn this Info Session, you will have the opportunities to learn more about NII, and their research pillars and collaboration with Lassonde, especially the funded NII internship for Lassonde postgraduate students in Tokyo.\nTargeted audience: Lassonde faculty and postgraduate students\nSpeakers:\n– Emmanuel Planas, deputy director, Global Liaison Office, National Institute of Informatics (NII), Tokyo\n– York Lassonde NII alumni: Jing Li, Ph.D candidate\n– Lassonde faculty/staff and York International\nRegistration is required, and the deadline to RSVP  ( https://yorkinternational.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=1065518 )for the event is Friday, March 10\n
