SUMMARY:Job Search and Networking for Mature Students
DESCRIPTION:Want to be more effective in getting the job you want? Find out how to uncover and create career opportunities by learning how employers fill job openings. Learn how to uncover hidden opportunities and build relationships that maximize your job search efforts.  Wondering how using LinkedIn effectively can enhance your job search? Curious about how to leverage LinkedIn’s features to build your professional network? Attend this webinar to find out more.\nThis event has been postponed. Please look out in the near future for a new registration link!\n
