DESCRIPTION:This workshop invites participants to explore how our current choices shape future possibilities. Through degrowth principles and speculative fiction, we’ll examine how the values, resources and visions we carry with us shape processes of collective design.\nFacilitator: Eliane Howarth \nTime: 11:30 a.m. to 2:30 p.m. \nLocation: VH 2009\nHosted in: Lina Brand Correa’s Ecological Economics (ENVS 3511) \n
