SUMMARY:Rooted in Place
DESCRIPTION:This presentation illustrates Scarborough through the narratives and images of people who live there. Learn about suburban community-building, place-specific relationships and memories, and the liveliness of everyday stories. \nFacilitator: Esmond Lee\nTime: 4 to 5:20 p.m.\nLocation: HNES 140\nHosted in: Laura Taylor’s Planning Suburbs (GEOG 4130)\n \n \n
