SUMMARY:Maloca Makings: Seed Studio
DESCRIPTION:This tactile and sensory gathering focuses on collective care through seed work. Participants will experience the small but powerful lessons embedded in tiny seeds, fostering connection, patience, and shared learning through hands-on, community-centered creation.\nFacilitator: Phyllis Novak\nTime: 4 to 6 p.m.\nLocation: EUC Lounge (HNES 136)\nHosted weekly by Maloca Gardens\n \n
