SUMMARY:Eco-Arts on Screen
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a screening of three short films with a strong throughline of relationships to land and water. The films, Young Lives and the River (Felipe Montoya and the Partnership for Youth and Planetary Wellbeing), High Roads (Giuliana Racco), and Rooting Belonging (Anna Long and Kate Kolo) capture the strength and wonder of everyday life, rooted in the Térraba watershed, Palestine and Barcelona, and Toronto.\nTime: 3 to 5 p.m.\nLocation: Sensorium Flex Space (CFA 326)\nCo-presented with Sensorium.\n
