SUMMARY:Writing Our Heritage (Part Two)
DESCRIPTION:Welcome back to the second part Writing Our Heritage. Focusing on sharing and curating cultural stories, participants will discuss what makes a compelling story and collaboratively build storyboards. We will learn how to craft meaningful narratives that highlight heritage, develop our own cultural story, and share it with the other participants. The session emphasizes storytelling as a collective and relational process, helping us connect deeply with our cultural identity and learn from others’ experiences.\nFacilitator: Zainab Gaafar\nTime: 10 to 11:30 a.m.\nLocation: Black Community Space (HNES 248)\n \n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/writing-our-heritage-part-two/
