TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Eco-Arts Outside: Sit By the Fire With Me and Spilling Chai
DESCRIPTION:Join us later in March for an exciting outdoor double performance. These participatory performances offer the warmth of lit mulberry kindling in Raquel Mendes’ Sit By the Fire With Me, and of chai in Deepikah’s Spilling Chai. Through sweet notes of song and spices, we will learn about spirit, more-than-human relationships and reciprocity, and cultural translation, storytelling and reconnecting in the context of urban life. Performers: Raquel Mendes and Deepikah\nTime: 3 to 5 p.m.\nLocation: Location on Keele Campus TBD\nRegister through Evenbrite ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/sit-by-the-fire-with-me-and-spilling-chai-tickets-1983837396055 ). \nThose registered will receive more information about the event’s location the day before. \n
