DESCRIPTION:Experience dynamic performances across styles and genres, brought to life by our exceptional students and faculty. These drop-in sessions, along with our faculty concert, offer a chance to experience what makes York U Music bold, creative, and inspiring. Whether you’re a prospective student, a music lover, or simply curious, come discover the energy, talent, and community that define our program.\nDATE: Saturday, March 14, 2026\nTIME:\nDrop-in Sessions: 6:30 – 7:15 p.m. – (Martin Family Lounge )\nFaculty Concert: 7:30 – 9:00 p.m – (Tribute Communities Recital Hall)\nLOCATION:\nMartin Family Lounge ( https://virtualtour.ampd.yorku.ca/yorku/music/martin-family-lounge ) | Accolade East Building – York University (Keele Campus)\nTribute Communities Recital Hall ( https://virtualtour.ampd.yorku.ca/yorku/music/tribute-communities-recital-hall ) | Accolade East Building – York University (Keele Campus)\nMaps and Directions ( https://maps.info.yorku.ca/2010/06/accolade-east/ )\nRegister for your FREE tickets HERE ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/york-university-department-of-music-showcase-tickets-1982831186455?aff=oddtdtcreator&keep_tld=true )\n
