SUMMARY:Supporting Your Journey: Academic Milestones & Immigration Compliance
DESCRIPTION:Graduate students are expected to meet key academic milestones throughout their programs—but what happens when those milestones are missed?\nThis session, co-hosted by the Faculty of Graduate Studies (FGS) and York International, will explore:\n\nKey academic milestones and their significance\nStudy permit conditions and compliance\nWhat students need to know to make proactive and informed decisions\n\nParticipants will also learn about available resources to help them stay on track academically and maintain their immigration status.\nDate and time: Thursday, February 26th at 10:30 a.m. (ET)\nLocation: Online via Zoom\nREGISTER TODAY! ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_oj5-ccLKTDmx40VhRpFp8w ) (link)\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/academic-milestones-and-immigration-compliance-wi26/
