SUMMARY:VAAH Open House 2026: Metamorphosis
DESCRIPTION:Each spring, the Visual Art & Art History ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-visual-art-and-art-history/ ) department proudly showcases the extraordinary talent, creativity, and critical insight of our students through a dynamic public exhibition. This annual celebration highlights an inspiring range of works produced across disciplines reflecting the depth, innovation, and diverse perspectives that define our program.\nJoin us to experience the energy of our studios, engage with emerging artists and see firsthand the ideas shaping the next generation of visual culture.\nVAAH Open House 2026: Metamorphosis \nDate: Wednesday, March 11, 2026\nTime: 5:00 p.m. – 7:00 p.m.\nLocation: The Joan & Martin Goldfarb Centre for Fine Arts ( https://maps.info.yorku.ca/2010/06/joan-martin-goldfarb-centre-for-fine-arts/ )\nFree Admission\n
