SUMMARY:President’s Reception in Vancouver
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the York U President’s Reception in Vancouver to connect with other alumni, expand your professional network and learn about the latest developments from your alma mater. This event will mark President Lisa Philipps’ first reception in Vancouver and will be an opportunity for York alumni to meet her for the first time. Whether you graduated recently, or many years ago, we would love to see you.\nYork U President’s Reception in Vancouver\nDate: Monday, April 20\nTime: 7 – 8:30 p.m.\nLocation: Al Porto Ristorante – Wine Room, 321 Water St, Vancouver, BC V6B 1B6\n
