SUMMARY:Inclusion Week: Empowered Expressions
DESCRIPTION:Empowered Expressions is a gentle, community-centered art and journaling session created to encourage advocacy, awareness and supportive practices for survivors. Through creativity, empowerment, and connection. This open event offers a calming space to express, reflect, and heal—no artistic background or experience needed. Come as you are; participation and sharing are always entirely optional. All community members are welcome to join in cultivating rest, resilience, and collective care.\nRegister here ( https://forms.office.com/r/HKTLJNXUH0 ).\n\n\n\n
