SUMMARY:Devised Theatre Festival 2026
DESCRIPTION:York University’s Devised Theatre class of 2026 is excited to present this year’s Devised Theatre Festival. The Festival consists of two different shows by two different companies consisting of students from the class, their crews, and the PM team.\nMemento Mori  (The Loose Screw Theatre Company)\nThursday March 3 – 7:30 pm\nWednesday, March 4 – 7:30 pm\nThursday, March 5 –  7:30 pm\nFriday, March 6 – 7:30 pm\nSaturday, March 7 – 2:00 pm | 7:30 pm\nLocation: Joseph G. Green Studio Theatre ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/joseph-g-green-studio-theatre/ )\n151 CFT (Centre for Film & Theatre)\nShow Description:\nDid you carefully read through the terms and conditions? A group of strangers find themselves trapped in a liminal space somewhere between life and death after signing up for a mysterious medical trial. Watch them as they confront their pasts, forge uneasy alliances, and figure out how to return their lives – while wrestling with the fact that their lives may not be worth returning to.\nContent Warnings:\nContent Warning: This show contains flashing lights, foul language, depictions of smoking, stimulated aggression, and discussions of death.\n____________________________________________\nWander (Strange People Theatre)\nWednesday, March 18 – 7:30 pm\nThursday, March 19 – 7:30 pm\nFriday, March 20 – 7:30 pm\nSaturday, March 21 – 2:00 pm\nSunday, March 22 – 2:00 pm\nMonday, March 23 – 7:30 pm\nLocation: 207 Accolade East Building (ACE) ( https://maps.info.yorku.ca/2010/06/accolade-east/ )\n83 York Blvd\nShow Description:\nIt’s 402 BC, a woman lies in bed writhing in pain. She feels something vicious inside her. It bites and scratches at her insides, begging to be released. Now, in the present day, a woman mirrors these same struggles. We seek to uncover women’s stories hidden under the foundation of the patriarchy.\n_________________________\nLOCATIONS \nJoseph G. Green Studio Theatre ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/joseph-g-green-studio-theatre/ )\n151 CFT (Centre for Film & Theatre)\n207 Accolade East Building (ACE) ( https://maps.info.yorku.ca/2010/06/accolade-east/ )\n83 York Blvd\nTICKET INFORMATION ( https://www.signupgenius.com/go/4090448ADAA2CA6F85-62232028-devised#/ )\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/devised-theatre-festival-2026/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:Accolade East Building (2nd Floor) @ 83 York Blvd
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/devised2026.jpg
END:VEVENT
