SUMMARY:Foundational Training: Goal Setting for Student Leaders
DESCRIPTION:This training is mandatory for all Student Leaders at Markham Campus. This workshop will challenge your understanding of leadership by exploring different definitions of leadership and inviting you to reflect on the qualities that matter most to you. You’ll also set personal leadership goals, helping you be intentional about the opportunities you pursue and mindful of the learning you gain through your experiences.\nRegister for Foundational Training ( https://forms.office.com/r/igzaz13ejV ).\n
