SUMMARY:Student-Alumni Mixer – Careers in Tech
DESCRIPTION:Career in Tech does not just mean working in the IT department! Technology is now part of every business – Finance, Law, Entrepreneurship to name a few. And the industry keeps creating careers in innovative fields – Artificial Intelligence (AI), Machine Learning (ML), Cyber Security and more.\nThis mixer is your chance to meet and mingle with successful York graduates in a variety of senior roles that work in the ever-changing field of Technology. You will learn about career paths, receive advice, and have your questions answered by the experts in their fields.\n \nRegister Now\n
