SUMMARY:Building Blocks For Child & Family Well-being: a Parent Skills Group
DESCRIPTION:This six-week online parent group series provides practical tools and strategies to support children’s emotional health and build positive family relationships. The program is offered virtually over the lunch hour, making it easy to access.\nWe address:\n\nManaging children’s emotional and behavioural challenges;\nAddressing sibling dynamics;\nSupporting your parenting team; and\nUnderstanding and supporting family members’ needs and strengths\n\nFamilies can expect evidence-based, supportive care in a warm and welcoming environment.\nEmail yupc@yorku.ca ( mailto:yupc@yorku.ca ) for more information or register here ( https://www.yorku.ca/health/yupc/wp-content/uploads/sites/441/2026/02/registration-form-Parent-Skills-Group-26.pdf )\nFull description ( https://www.yorku.ca/health/yupc/wp-content/uploads/sites/441/2025/09/BBFW-Recruitment.pdf ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/building-blocks-for-child-family-well-being-a-parent-skills-group/
