SUMMARY:Music & Literature Bonanza: Hispanic Expressions
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Music & Literature Bonanza: Hispanic Expressions, an interdisciplinary event exploring the intersections of Latin music, poetry and cultural identity.\nThe program features a keynote lecture on the poetics and global cultural impact of Bad Bunny, alongside live musical and literary performances.\nThis event brings together scholarship, artistic expression and community dialogue in celebration of contemporary Hispanic cultural production.\n
