SUMMARY:Meals Made Easy: Budget Bites
DESCRIPTION:Meals Made Easy is a beginner friendly cooking and wellness session designed to help participants to build confidence in the kitchen using simple ingredients to create a nutritious meal.\nWith recipes created by a registered nutritionist/dietitian, this interactive workshop will walk you through the essentials of balanced eating; including carbohydrates, protein, healthy fats, and micronutrients, all tailored to the needs of a demanding busy lifestyle. You’ll learn practical strategies for meal prepping, maintaining routine, and staying energized.\nOrganized by Athletics and Recreation, Markham Campus\n\n\n\n\n\nFormat: In-Person\n\nLocation: MK 1025 (JD Wellness Studio), Markham Campus\n\nAudience: All York Community\n\n\n\n\nRegister Online\n
