SUMMARY:Coast to Coast – a National Climate Café
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\nThe Coast to Coast Climate Café is a collaborative SDG Month event hosted by York University’s Office of Sustainability, the Wellness Impact Lab, and SDSN Canada. This welcoming, conversation-based space will bring people together from across the country to talk openly about climate change, sustainability, and how it all impacts our wellbeing. Through guided discussions and shared reflection, participants will explore climate challenges, exchange ideas, and build community while connecting to the Sustainable Development Goals. No expertise required- just curiosity, honesty, and a willingness to imagine more sustainable and hopeful futures together.\n\nOrganized by Office of Sustainability & Wellness Impact Lab.\n\nFormat: Virtual\n\n\n\n\nAudience: All York Community\nRegister Online\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/coast-to-coast-a-national-climate-cafe/
CATEGORIES:SDG Month,Well-being,Well-being Week
END:VEVENT
