SUMMARY:Reconnecting with the body, the art of tying a headscarf, & making bracelets
DESCRIPTION:\nParticipate in Wellbeing Week with a hands-on, feel-good session that blends movement, culture, and self-expression. This workshop invites you to reconnect with your body through gentle awareness practices, then explore the art and cultural significance of headwrap (foulard) styling or bracelet making.\n\n\n\nExpect creativity, confidence, and good vibes — no experience needed, just come as you are.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOrganized by Glendon Athletic Club\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFormat: In-Person\nLocation: Glendon Athletic Club\nAudience: All York Community\nRegister Online \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
