SUMMARY:Introduction of VR for Wellness and World Exploration
DESCRIPTION:Participants will learn the basics of virtual reality technology, and get hands-on experience with Quest headsets in this event planned for well-being week. Using a Quest headset, participants will immerse into sample content for education, wellness, world travel, and entertainment, and learn how to borrow VR equipment from the Library’s Media Creation Lab. Participants will also be introduced to our standalone VR Rooms, where more advanced content can be experienced using HTC Vive Pro headsets on high-powered computers.\nOrganized by Scott Library.\nFormat: In-Person\nLocation: Scott 206 – Demo Space\nAudience: All York Community\nRegister Online \nRegistration is required. There are 11 seats available.\n
