SUMMARY:Eat the Rainbow: Free 4th veggie at YU Eats
DESCRIPTION:In celebration of Nutrition Month and Well being Week, YU Eats is making it easier and tastier to boost your veggie intake. From March 2–6, visit Central Square Market, Stong, Winters, or Glendon dining halls and enjoy a 4th vegetable for free at the Create, Bok Choy, and Al Dente stations. It’s a simple way to build a more colourful plate, explore new flavours, and add extra nutrients to your meal. Whether you’re looking to eat a bit healthier or simply love loading up your bowl, this offer helps you get more value, variety, and veggies on campus.\nOrganized by Food and Vending Services.\nAvailable during operating hours of the Create, Bok Choy, and Al Dente stations\nFormat: In-Person\nLocation: Central Square Market, Stong, Winters and Glendon Dining Halls\nAudience: All York Community\n
