SUMMARY:YU eats Well-being Smoothie Promo: 10% off
DESCRIPTION:In celebration of Well being Week and Nutrition Month, YU Eats is offering 10% off all smoothies to help support digestion, sustained energy, and overall wellness. From March 2–6, visit Central Square Market, Markham Café, Stong, Winters, and Glendon dining halls to enjoy a convenient, fibre rich, nutrient dense snack between classes or after a workout. This campus wide promotion is an easy way to treat yourself while fueling your well being throughout the week.\nOrganized by Food and Vending Services.\nFormat: In-person Drop in. All day event while supplies last.\nLocation: Central Square Market, Markham Café, Stong, Winters, and Glendon dining halls. \nAudience: All York Community\n
