SUMMARY:Silent Book Club: Introvert-Friendly Reading Hour!
DESCRIPTION:Like the idea of meeting people but not the pressure of conversation? This event is all about low‑key connection. Sit together, read separately, and enjoy the quiet buzz of collective calm. Bring any book and leave the small talk behind. Refreshments provided, Hosted by the Library Mentors.\nOrganized by York University Libraries\nFormat: In-person Drop in\nLocation: Markham Campus Library, 3rd floor, Rm 3016\nAudience: All York Community\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/silent-book-club-introvert-friendly-reading-hour/
