SUMMARY:Top AI Prompts: Work smarter not harder
DESCRIPTION:Join your Organizational Learning and Leadership (OLL) team for a focused 30-minute session featuring our most recent top three Copilot prompts designed to help you work smarter and manage your daily tasks more effectively. In this session, our team will demonstrate how these prompts can support your productivity, simplify routines, and help you tackle common challenges at work. You’re welcome to bring your own favorite prompts to share with colleagues. You’ll leave the session with practical, actionable prompts you can start using right away to make your day a little easier and more efficient.\nThis session will showcase three powerful prompts:\n\nCreate a concise memory aid to support learning or reviewing any topic\nAnalyze survey feedback and translate insights into clear, actionable recommendations\nApply reverse prompting techniques to increase engagement and enhance collaboration with Copilot. \n\nKey Learning Outcome: Identify and apply the top three Copilot prompts demonstrated by the OLL team to boost productivity, streamline daily workflows, and address common workplace challenges, while also sharing and adopting effective prompts from peers.\nOrganized by Organized by Organizational Learning and Leadership, HR\nFormat: Virtual\nAudience: York Staff\nRegister Online\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/top-ai-prompts-work-smarter-not-harder/
CATEGORIES:Well-being,Well-being Week
END:VEVENT
