SUMMARY:Take Paws: Therapy Dogs
DESCRIPTION:Feeling the pressure of exams and looming deadlines?  \nStep away from the books and into a moment of calm with some four‑legged friends. Join us for a cozy, stress‑reducing wellness event featuring Corporate Canine’s certified therapy dogs – the friendly and curious Jacoby Pippin the Beagle, the gentle giant Marmite the Newfoundland and the fluffy, affectionate Olivia the Mini Bernedoodle.\nWhether you need cuddles, comfort or just a quiet moment to breathe, these pups are here to help you reset and recharge. \nLocation: The Second Student Centre – Studio C\nDate: Wednesday April 1s noon to 1 p.m.\nFree and open to all students – no registration needed\n
