SUMMARY:Winter Commuting Lunch & Learn
DESCRIPTION:Parking & Transportation Services would like to invite Staff and Faculty to our upcoming Lunch & Learn on Wednesday, Feb. 25 from noon to 1 p.m. Register now ( https://events.teams.microsoft.com/event/21a43432-7d9a-43d0-ada3-83aefd6f5fa7@640b9abc-b624-45bb-bed3-3d42e8c744dc ) and you’ll be entered to win a $25 gift card.\nWith our partners Smart Commute, you will learn about their carpooling program that matches you with other York community members, Emergency Ride Home benefits, and other sustainable commuting options to help save money and time.\nOther ways to get involved and informed during Winter Commute Month: \n\nDrop by our outreach table in Vari Hall on Thursday, Feb 12 from 10 a.m. to 1 p.m. We will be on-site to help gear up for the winter season. Stop by to get expert winter commuting tips and resources, as well as a hands-on demo of the Smart Commute tool.\nLog your trips in the Smart Commute App\nThis year, we’re giving away $100 gift cards! Whether you’re carpooling, taking the bus, or working from home, every log in the Smart Commute App counts as an entry.\nJoin a webinar\nFeb 11: Winter Cycling 101 (Gear & Safety) ( https://events.teams.microsoft.com/event/5b2b264a-ace7-4948-8f6a-d6cd085ff33f@640b9abc-b624-45bb-bed3-3d42e8c744dc )Feb 25: Safe Winter Commuting ( https://events.teams.microsoft.com/event/0c7165c3-627c-4042-bca8-b7f217b1c853@640b9abc-b624-45bb-bed3-3d42e8c744dc )\n\nSee you there!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/winter-commuting-lunch-learn/
