SUMMARY:Analyze that! How to make sense of your assignment instructions
DESCRIPTION:Do you ever feel uncertain about what your assignment instructions are asking you to do, or that the way you were taught to begin assignments in the past isn’t working now that you are studying at a higher level? This session will help you to write more successful assignments by learning how to break instructions down in to smaller, more manageable parts, prioritize information in instructions, clarify what common terms used in assignment instructions really mean, and make a checklist to guide and check your work.\nNo RSVPs.\nJust click to join!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/analyze-that-how-to-make-sense-of-your-assignment-instructions-4/
