DESCRIPTION:Join us for our planning skills series.\nThis series will take place on Feb. 3 and 24, as well as March 10 and 17, in Room HNES 142 from 12:30 to 2:30 p.m.\nLight lunch will be provided.\n\n🗺️Land Use Planning: Lot Creation and Plans of Subdivisions\n\n\n📅Feb. 3rd\n\n\n \n\n\n👥Approaches to Community Engagement\n\n\n📅Feb. 24th\n\n\n \n\n\n🏢 Project Management in Practice: Applying PM Principles to Complex Planning and City-Building Projects\n\n\n📅March 10th\n\n\n \n\n\n📄Pro Forma\n\n\n📅March 17th\n\n
