SUMMARY:Choose Grad York:  Coming to Canada – The International Student Experience
DESCRIPTION:This session is a part of Choose Grad York 2026, and is opened to all interested.\nComing to Canada: The International Student Experience is an engaging session designed to help prospective and newly admitted students understand what life in Canada truly looks like- from navigating academics and campus culture to settling into a new country with confidence.\nThrough real stories, practical guidance, and honest insights into the challenges and opportunities international students face, this session prepares learners to thrive both inside and outside the classroom. Attendees will leave with a clearer picture of what to expect, where to find support, and how to make the most of their Canadian journey.\nThis is a free event, however registration is required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_HZu10kxKRVub2_0wl7zWYg ).\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/the-international-student-experience/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
