SUMMARY:Choose Grad York: Discussion Panel with Current Scholars
DESCRIPTION:This session is a part of Choose Grad York 2026, and is opened to all interested.\nJoin us to learn more about the graduate student experience at York. Our student panellists will touch on the following topics:\n\ntheir application experience\nthe transition from undergraduate to graduate studies\nfunding, scholarships, etc\nprogram experiences\nresearch & supervision experience\nand much more!\n\nThis is a free event, however registration is required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_v93qKbofR-yRJQfRH7OmFw ).\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca.\n
