SUMMARY:Choose Grad York: Navigating A Graduate Degree with Dean MacLachlan
DESCRIPTION:This session is a part of Choose Grad York 2026, and is open to all interested.\nIn this webinar, our Vice Provost & Dean (Alice MacLachlan) will be speaking on the role of the student in a graduate degree, degree types and structures in the different disciplines, forming your individualised research ideas, and supports for personal and research development.\nThis is a free event, however registration is required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_vgBJEFhWS-eBL0IUHYZSFA#/registration ).\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca.\n
