SUMMARY:EUC MEGA Student Resource Fair
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday, February 11th, 2026 | 12 PM to 2 PM \nHNES 1st Floor Lounge\nJoin us for an exciting event that will bring together student clubs, health & wellness services, financial support resources, Co-op office, and experiential education opportunities – all inspired by feedback from the Fall 2025 Canadian Campus Wellness Survey!\nFeatured Opportunity – Candid Chats for Career Success\n12:30 PM to 1:30 PM | HNES Room 142\nJoin us for an honest conversation with industry professionals as they share their real-life journeys to success.\nThis session will include a featured guest:\nLaura Cristinzo, the Circularity Program\nManager at Fashion Takes Action\n
