SUMMARY:Fundamentals of Google’s Notebook LM
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop, you will learn to use Googles Notebook LM to build a study system that maximizes your limited time by transforming ebooks, digital notes and other sources into a personalized knowledge base.\nWe will cover how to generate custom study aids including: podcasts, mind maps, reports and others. You’ll also discover how to balance a busy schedule with efficient active-learning tools like AI-generated practice quizzes, flashcards and a Socratic tutor that simplifies complex academic topics.\nRegister here ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/2w1G6V5ARza6cpKQvwpYEg )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/fundamentals-of-googles-notebook-lm/
