SUMMARY:Internship with Hongkong Productivity Council (HKPC) Info Session
DESCRIPTION:In this Zoom info session, we will focus on the nine-week paid internship opportunity with HKPC (Hongkong)’s Summer InnoTalent Programme. This immersive programme offers tertiary students hands-on research, development and industry experience, FutureSkills workshops, field trips, job shadowing and an innovation pitch to senior executives.\nDetails on positions, qualifications and application are provided.\nMeeting Registration – Zoom ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/enpY3FlJSC2P6tCuqggPaQ?_x_zm_rtaid=gjxmek-zQ0moObcqU-Vr0A.1769800631050.afcaa88eac4c37e9579562822e7c0551&_x_zm_rhtaid=90#/registration )\n
