SUMMARY:GradForward Online Series: Academic Integrity, and Professional Skills Development Opportunities at York University
DESCRIPTION:Discover the tools and tips to thrive at York University and build your grad journey with confidence. Connect, learn, and grow through 30-minute online sessions for incoming and continuing graduate students.\nIn this session, learn about the mandatory Academic Integrity Module for new graduate students and related resources to assist you in your new academic journey. Building off these, the session will then focus on helpful resources and involvement opportunities to support your academic and career goals, including the Graduate and Postdoctoral Professional Skills (GPPS) program and the Individualized Development Plan (IDP). Hosted by our Graduate Academic Affairs team in the Faculty of Graduate Studies.\nEvent Details:\nDate: Thursday, September 10, 2026\nTime: 10:00 – 10:30 AM (EST)\nLocation: via Zoom Webinar\nRegistration is required: RSVP Link ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_LQlTk_1BQp6Ra_IA6NBVlQ )\n
