SUMMARY:Politics/Poetics of Migration: Gallery Opening
DESCRIPTION:The Harriet Tubman Institute ( https://research.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=282202 ) is proud to present Politics/Poetics of Migration, a new gallery exhibition showcasing the work of AMPD students and alumni. Please join us for an evening of cultural celebration featuring live African drumming and an engaging artist talk with the creators behind the collection.\nPolitics/Poetics of Migration\nLocation: (HNES 140) ( https://euc.yorku.ca/euc-technology-services/euc-technology-enhanced-spaces/ )\nDate: February 5, 2026\nTime: 12:30 – 2:30 pm\nFREE\nRegister HERE ( https://research.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=282202 )\nContact: tubman@yorku.ca ( mailto:tubman@yorku.ca ) for more information.\n
