SUMMARY:Webinar for Incoming Grad Students – You’ve Been Admitted! What’s Next?
DESCRIPTION:In this session, we will go over a checklist of useful resources such as: how to accept your offer, submitting required documentation to meet conditions, accommodations for students with a disability, setting up Passport York and your email account, how to register for academic terms, how to enrol in courses, getting your YU card, the cost of living in Toronto, transit options, health plans and services, attending GRAD@York and more!\n[We’ll also be available to answer questions you may have, to the best of our ability – and to direct you to the right place for any that we can’t]\nTopic:  You’ve Been Admitted! What’s Next?\nWhen: Tuesday, April 28\nTime: 12:00 – 1:00 PM (EST)\nLocation: via Zoom Webinar\nRegistration is required: yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_zoS3Y3aoT7-WMSHayO3xfw )\nShould you have any questions, please email us at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA ( mailto:FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA )\nWe hope to meet you virtually in April!\n
