SUMMARY:BEA’s Investment Bootcamp Demo Day
DESCRIPTION:The Black Entrepreneurship Alliance (BEA) proudly presents Demo Day, our fourth celebration of Black tech founders turning bold ideas into thriving, investable ventures, all competing for $20,000 in cash prizes. ​Over the past few months, founders in the BEA’s Investment Bootcamp have sharpened their capital strategies, refined their pitches and strengthened their business models with guidance from BEA mentors, partners and industry experts. Now, they take the stage to share their traction, stories and vision for what’s next. ​\nJoin us for an evening of:\n\n​Founder pitches from our latest Investment Bootcamp cohort ​\nCandid feedback from investors and ecosystem partners ​\nNetworking with founders, funders and community builders ​\nThe Alfred Anucha Award $10,000 in funding in honour of Alfred Anucha ​\nSurprise announcement you won’t want to miss ​The Startup Expo – an immersive display of our founders’ work, stories, and ventures ​\nFood & drinks celebrating our founders’ milestones ​\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/beas-investment-bootcamp-demo-day/
ORGANIZER;CN=The Black Entrepreneurship Alliance:MAILTO:thebea@yorku.ca
