SUMMARY:Lions Celebrate Black History Month
DESCRIPTION:Cheer on our York Lions as we host the Western Mustangs in our annual Black History Month basketball games and celebration of Black Excellence.\nDate: Friday, Feb. 6\nTime: Tip off for women at 6 p.m; for men at 8 p.m.\nLocation: Tait McKenzie Centre – main gym\nYork students can attend free.\nTickets may be purchased online at yorkulions.ca/tickets ( http://yorkulions.ca/tickets ) or at the front desk of Tait gameday starting at 5pm\nThis event will feature various performances, contests and activations.\nFollow us @yorkulions or visit yorkulions.ca/BHM ( http://yorkulions.ca/BHM ) for event details and updates.\n \n
