SUMMARY:Stretch and Destress
DESCRIPTION:Your brain’s been working hard, give your body a break. Join us for Stretch & Destress, a relaxing wellness session designed to help you unwind right before finals. Whether you’re feeling the pressure or just need a moment to reset, this is your chance to release tension, recharge your mind, and walk into exam season feeling focused, refreshed, and ready to perform at your best.  \nCome move, breathe, and destress with us, you deserve it. \nLocation: JD Wellness Studio – Room 1025\n\nLearn more ( https://reconline.yorkulions.ca/Program/GetProgramDetails?courseId=56cedea4-2622-4f64-8b1f-152d13db4b01 )\n \n\n
