SUMMARY:Virtual Side Event | 2026 ECOSOC Partnership Forum
DESCRIPTION:How can partnerships with universities accelerate local innovation and sustainable communities?\nThis virtual side event of the United Nations Economic and Social Council (ECOSOC) Partnership Forum brings together universities, youth-led organisations, UN actors and civil society to explore how academia-driven partnerships support action across SDGs 6, 7, 9, 11 and 17.\nOpen to policymakers, higher education leaders, researchers, students and civil society.\nRegister here ( https://luma.com/9h09yzre?mc_cid=4f48803f5f&mc_eid=1ca228501e )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/virtual-side-event-2026-ecosoc-partnership-forum/
