SUMMARY:What’s Next? Careers, Credentials, and Growth in Education
DESCRIPTION:Organized by the Faculty of Education Alumni Network (YUEAN), in partnership with the Faculty of Education Students’ Association (FESA), this event will bring together system leaders, faculty representatives, and career professionals to offer practical insight into:\n\nThe current climate in Ontario education and what it means for certification and hiring\nWhich AQs and professional development opportunities are most in demand\nCareer advancement strategies within and beyond the classroom\nGraduate studies, continuing education, and micro-credentials\nFollowing brief opening remarks, participants will choose two breakout sessions tailored to their interests, including OCT insights, school board perspectives, career advancement support, and graduate pathways.\n\nNote: Space is limited. Zoom access details will be sent to registrants closer to the event date.\n
