SUMMARY:10 Ways to Stand Out and Get Hired in 2026
DESCRIPTION:\nLearn how to strengthen your resume, enhance your online presence, and gain confidence in your applications and interviews at our upcoming complimentary webinar. This event is in collaboration with Devant, a career development platform built to keep alumni connected, supported, and thriving.\n\nLearn how to:\n\nPosition yourself to get noticed by recruiters\nOptimize your resume and LinkedIn profile\nPrepare for interviews using Devant’s AI-powered mock interview tools\nBuild in-demand skills through micro-courses and live events\nNavigate today’s competitive job market with clarity and confidence\n\nYou’ll also hear how alumni can access a full year of Devant career tools, networking events and recruiter connections for just $24.99 — an Alumni-Perks exclusive rate.\n10 Ways to Stand Out and Get Hired in 2026\nDate: Tuesday, Jan. 20\nTime: 12-1 p.m. ET\nLocation: Virtual\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/10-ways-to-stand-out-and-get-hired-in-2026/
