SUMMARY:Winter Career Fair
DESCRIPTION:\nDiscover Your Next Opportunity at the Winter 2026 Career Fair\n\n\n\nConnect with employers from a wide range of industries who are actively hiring for diverse roles at the Winter Career Fair, happening on Jan. 22, 2026. This is your chance to network, explore career paths, and learn about exciting opportunities—including part-time positions, summer jobs, internships, and full-time roles after graduation.\nYork students and recent graduates are invited to meet participating employers in person, ask questions, and make valuable connections that can help launch your career.\nDon’t miss this opportunity to stand out and take the next step toward your future!\nRegister on Experience York\n\n\n
