SUMMARY:Connections Café: Setting Intention for a New Year!
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Connections Café to start the year with clarity, focus, and community. Learn how to get back into the swing of the semester, build academic and mental readiness, and set meaningful intentions for the months ahead. Plus, take part in a fun and creative vision board activity—and connect with peers along the way!\nHosted by Student Accessibility Services, Learning Skills & Academic Success, and Student Counselling, Health, and Well-Being.\nRegister Here: https://forms.office.com/r/kpEX7YiNCp ( https://forms.office.com/r/kpEX7YiNCp )\n
