SUMMARY:PhD Pathways: Career Conversation
DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in a career outside of the academy? Wondering how to translate your PhD experience into a fulfilling career outside the university setting? This online session is designed for graduate students and postdoctoral researchers who are exploring career options.\nJoin us to hear directly from PhDs who have successfully transitioned into diverse roles across sectors. Through a candid conversation, speakers will share their career journeys, offer practical advice, and reflect on the challenges and opportunities they encountered along the way.\nParticipants will also have the opportunity to ask questions, engage with speakers, and expand their understanding of what’s possible with a PhD. Whether you’re actively planning a career outside of academia or just beginning to explore your options, this session will help you take the next step with confidence.\nEvent Details:\nDATE: Feb. 25\nTIME: 10:30 – 11:30 a.m.\nLOCATION: Online (Zoom)\n*Registration is required | RSVP Link\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/phd-pathways-career-conversation/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
