SUMMARY:Get Set for Success with SAS!
DESCRIPTION:Start the term off right at Markham Campus by connecting with the Student Accessibility Services (SAS) Team!\nWhether you need to send accommodation letters to professors, book your tests and exams in our Accommodated Testing Suite, or figure out if SAS is the right fit for you, we’re here to guide you through each and every step.\nDrop in virtually or in person, get your questions answered, and start the semester feeling confident and supported.\n*This event takes place on multiple dates*\n\nTuesday, January 6th\nWednesday, January 7th\nThursday, January 8th\nTuesday, January 13th\nWednesday, January 14th\nThursday, January 15th\n\nEach day, the hybrid “Get Set for Success” event will run in person at Suite 2010 and online via Zoom from 11am – 12pm and 1pm – 2pm (same times every day).\nZoom Meeting ID: 532 165 8492\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/get-set-for-success-with-sas/
CATEGORIES:Markham Student Accessibility Services
LOCATION:Markham Campus 2010 OR Zoom (Meeting ID: 532 165 8492)
