SUMMARY:Global Health (PhD)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Global Health? We invite you to attend our program session!\nYork University’s PhD program in Global Health will examine global health issues in relation to intersecting challenges of wealth disparity, environmental degradation, government policy and human rights. The program will prepare the next generation of health leaders with the knowledge and skills to address these challenges and improve health for people worldwide, helping to create the conditions that enable equity.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/yfamApVTSiWeqLC_56aC4A ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nFor any questions, please email us at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
