SUMMARY:Translation Studies (MA)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Translation? We invite you to attend our program session. Registration is required!\nThe MA in Translation Studies is the only graduate program in Toronto and southern Ontario dedicated to the advanced study of translation. The program offers students a full range of theoretical, conceptual and methodological tools necessary for a deeper analysis and understanding of issues related to translation. Applicants are required to demonstrate competence, to the satisfaction of the Admissions Committee, in French and English or in any other language and English.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/dGYH_VUGTSebUogWgHEn4A ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nFor any questions, please email us at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
