SUMMARY:Winter Welcome Week ❄️👋
DESCRIPTION:Ring in the New Year with the Student Life team at Markham Campus through fun activities happening all week! \nStop by the first floor atrium from 10 a.m to 2 p.m. each day of the week for a new activity.\n\nWarm Up and Welcome Back\nMonday, Jan 5 | 10 a.m. – 2 p.m.\nJoin us in the in the Atrium for Hot Chocolate and share your resolutions for 2026 in a fun w-interview!\nMANIFEST 2026\nTuesday, Jan 6 | 10 a.m. – 2 p.m.\n\nWant to manifest this year? Make your own vision board, or contribute to a campus vision banner.\nMinute to Win it! (And other challenges)\nWednesday, Jan 7 | 10 a.m. – 2 p.m.\n\nStop by the atrium to take part in quick challenges and win prizes.\nWinter Wishes Day\nThursday, Jan 8 | 10 a.m. – 2 p.m.\nWrite down your wishes for the year and contribute to wintery campus décor.\nGoodbye, 2025!\nFriday, Jan 9 | 10 a.m. – 2 p.m.\n\nDissolve your worries from the last year in a fun and sustainable way!\n \n \n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/winter-welcome-week-%e2%9d%84%ef%b8%8f%f0%9f%91%8b/
ORGANIZER;CN=Markham Campus Student Life:MAILTO:markhamstudentlife@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Student Life
LOCATION:Markham Campus 1st Floor Atrium
END:VEVENT
