SUMMARY:The AI-Enhanced Writer: Supporting Process, Product, and Academic Integrity (Online – April 30, 2026, 11:00-12:30 ET)
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop we will consider how AI is reshaping writing and research workflows, and what that means for teaching and assessing in writing-focused disciplines. Participants will learn about existing strategies, explore practical frameworks, and discuss case scenarios.\nLearn more and register with our registration form. ( https://teachingcommonsforms.apps01.yorku.ca/forms/view.php?id=1145872 )\n
