SUMMARY:Applying to Grad School at York: International Applications 101
DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join us for an ‘Applying to Grad School at York: International Applications 101’ session, to learn more about York University and our graduate admissions process. This session is intended for applicants who require a visa/study permit to study in Canada.\nThis session will run about an hour, and will cover “Why York”, eligibility, requirements, financial information, how to apply, and more.\nPlease note that during these sessions we will not be able to answer any questions about Schulich School of Business programs, or Osgoode Law School programs. For all other master’s programs, doctoral programs, and graduate diplomas, this is the session for you!\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_fx8CykvKQsKBGJ-ttW4O9w ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nFor any questions, please email us at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA ( mailto:FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA ).\n
