SUMMARY:Glendon & Markham Campus: Graduate Admissions at York
DESCRIPTION:Join us to learn more about the graduate programs available at Glendon Campus, and Markham Campus! This presentation will cover the following programs only:\nGlendon Campus\nConference Interpreting (MCI)\nÉtudes françaises (MA)\nÉtudes francophones (PhD)\nPublic & International Affairs (MPIA)\nTranslation (MA)\nMarkham Campus\nGraduate Diploma in Biotechnology (GDB)\nGraduate Diploma in Management (GDM)\nMaster of Biotechnology Management (MBM)\nMaster of Management Practice (MScMP)\nMaster of Public Policy, Administration & Law (Municipal Stream) (MPPAL)\nWe will cover admission requirements, eligibility, tuition, funding, scholarships, and how to apply. Questions welcome!\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_iBENy-WTSa6eIgWVo08ExQ#/registration ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nFor any questions, please email us at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
