SUMMARY:Arts, Media, Performance & Design: Graduate Admissions at York
DESCRIPTION:Join us to learn more about the graduate programs available in the School of Arts, Media, Performance & Design at York.\nThis presentation will cover the following:\nArt History & Visual Culture (MA & PhD)\nCinema & Media Studies (MA & PhD)\nDigital Media (MA, MSc, PhD)\nFilm (MFA)\nTheatre, Dance, & Performance Studies (MA & PhD)\nVisual Arts (MFA & PhD)\nWe will cover admission requirements, eligibility, tuition, funding, scholarships, and how to apply. Questions welcome!\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_Yi4KkRDJR2GwrdYRHDL4hg ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nFor any questions, please email us at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
