SUMMARY:General Graduate Admissions Drop In Hour (Virtual)
DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join us for a General Graduate Studies Admissions Drop In Hour! Join us to ask any questions that you might have about York University and our graduate admissions process.\nParticipants in this group session are able to ask questions via chat, and a representative will answer each question out loud.\nPLEASE NOTE: During these sessions we will not be able to answer any questions about Schulich School of Business programs, or Osgoode Law School programs.\nFor all other questions about graduate diplomas, master’s programs, and doctoral degrees, we look forward to having you attend the event.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_VfiCy0pUQXa4yrs4od4scA ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nFor any questions, please email us at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
