SUMMARY:I Didn’t Get In To Grad School at York (Or, I’m Afraid I Won’t). What Now?
DESCRIPTION:Don’t think that you’ll meet our admission requirements? Applied before, and not received an offer?\nJoin us to learn more about our basic requirements for graduate admission, our “unique applicants” category and how we consider extenuating circumstances, common refusal reasons, and upgrading options that are available, if needed.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_gN3ONLYvQyeubfe0JBVT7w ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nFor any questions, please email us at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
