DESCRIPTION:Join us to learn more about the graduate programs available in our Faculty of Health. This presentation will cover the following:\nCritical Disability Studies (MA & PhD)\nGlobal Health (PhD)\nHealth (MA & PhD)\nKinesiology & Health Science (MA, MSc, MFSc, PhD)\nNursing (MScN MScN PHP, PHCNP Grad Diploma, PhD)\nPsychology (MA, PhD)\nWe will cover admission requirements, eligibility, tuition, funding, scholarships, and how to apply. Questions welcome!\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_1ipMu1N2TWyAcoStZGvvfw ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nFor any questions, please email us at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
