SUMMARY:Drone Photography & Videography Intensive Course
DESCRIPTION:This course introduces participants to the artistic, technical and practical dimensions of drone-based photography and videography. Through lectures, demonstrations and hands-on training, students will gain visual literacy, explore different drone applications and practice real-world filming techniques.\nA microcredit certificate will be issued to all participants from CIFAL York.\nEvent Page ( https://www.yorku.ca/cifal/drone-photo-video )\nRegistration Page ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/drone-photography-videography-intensive-workshop-tickets-1965535343122?aff=oddtdtcreator )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/drone-photography-videography-intensive-course/
