SUMMARY:York University Globally Networked Learning (GNL) Info Session for Faculty (Zoom)
DESCRIPTION:This info session is open to all York faculty members and staff who are interested in innovative pedagogies that combine internationalization, experiential education, and co-teaching a course with an international partner.\n\nIn this virtual info session, we will introduce the pedagogy of GNL, share examples of past GNL projects, and share current calls for collaboration from international partners and the funding support for GNL.\nPlease register. which is required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/jw8DP1siQ9WYps-e-b8oeQ )\n\n
