SUMMARY:The AI-Enhanced Writer: Supporting Process, Product, and Academic Integrity (Online Workshop)
DESCRIPTION:This workshop can count towards the Certificates in AI Pedagogies ( https://www.yorku.ca/teachingcommons/certificates/ ).\nIn this workshop we will consider how AI is reshaping writing and research workflows, and what that means for teaching and assessing in writing-focused disciplines. Participants will learn about existing strategies, explore practical frameworks, and discuss case scenarios.\nTo join us, please complete our registration form here.  ( https://teachingcommonsforms.apps01.yorku.ca/forms/view.php?id=1145872 )\n
