SUMMARY:Teamwork Tools for Mature & Transfer Students
DESCRIPTION:This one hour workshop helps mature students master collaborative tools like Google Drive, Planner and Microsoft Teams for efficient group work.\nParticipants will learn how to organize files, set roles, and use assignment contracts to ensure accountability. York University resources will also be introduced to support effective collaboration.\nDate: Thursday, Jan. 22, 2026\nTime: 3:30 to 4:30p.m.\nLocation: 111 Central Square (ACMAPS Office)\nRegister Here ( https://machform.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=395586 )\n
