SUMMARY:Leveraging Online Professional Development Resources for Career Growth
DESCRIPTION:As graduate students and postdoctoral researchers navigate academic training and prepare for diverse career paths, online professional development platforms offer valuable and flexible support. This workshop introduces key resources, including Beyond the Professoriate and NCFDD, designed to help early-career scholars build skills, explore career options, and foster professional growth.\nParticipants will learn how to access and make the most of these platforms to support writing productivity, career exploration, time management, and more. With tools available on-demand, these resources are ideal for fitting professional development into busy schedules. Whether you’re planning a future in academia, industry, or beyond, this session will help you strategically use online tools to advance your goals.\nEvent Details:\nDATE: Monday, Jan. 19\nTIME: 10 to 11 a.m.\nLOCATION: Online (Zoom)\n*Registration is required | RSVP Link\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/leveraging-online-professional-development-resources-for-career-growth/
