SUMMARY:Frost & Focus Week at Markham Campus ❄️
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for exams and have fun doing it during Frost & Focus Week! Engage in fun activities like LEGO building, making your own buttons, or holiday themed arts and crafts. Looking for support before exams? Pop into group study sessions or calming study rooms designed to help you lock in, chat with a counsellor or befriend a peer mentor. Check out the events happening during the week!\n\nMini Moves, Major Goals: Design your very own buttons and stickers that will act as visual motivators for you to achieve your goals and connect with other students! Monday, November 24, 3 – 5 p.m., Makerspace. Sign up via eClass ( https://eclass.yorku.ca/mod/scheduler/view.php?id=3861105&what=datelist&subpage ).\nStudy Café: Lock in and get cozy at the upcoming Study Café hosted by Student Life. Need support? Peer mentors will be around to guide you along the way. Free refreshments provided.Tuesday, November 25, 2 – 6 p.m., MK 2050.\nConnections Café: Coffee with a Counsellor! The Connections Café is back. Connect with our counselling team over free coffee and explore ways to strengthen your self-advocacy and motivation. Wednesday, November 26, 11 to 1p.m., MK 2050. Event registration encouraged ( https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=GBNTNBFw1E-H8KQ4FsSb0JsmDdCy1ZNFkmOSHKF2otdUMFoxTEdETFAzMFZHMTBCNlEwVFdOV09RQy4u ).\nCozy Lego: Unwind, get cozy and build LEGO with Markham Student Council and professors in Creative Technologies and Communication, Social Media & Public Relations. LEGO will be provided. Wednesday, November 26, from 2:30 to 4:30 PM., MK 6075.\nStretch and Destress: Relax, release tension and reset your mind. Join the SWELL team for a drop-in stretching and wellness session to mindfully prepare for exam season! Wednesday, November 26, 12:15 to 1p.m. JD Wellness Studio.  Book at stretch session. ( https://eclass.yorku.ca/mod/scheduler/view.php?id=3875453 )\nCelebrate the Holidays with Student Life: Take part in holiday themed arts and crafts and reflect on all that you’ve accomplished during the year. Thursday, November 27, 11 a.m. to 4 p.m., First Floor Atrium.\nLearning Lounge. Find your perfect study space. Choose from the Quiet Room, Lo-Fi Music Room, or Collaborative Room to support your study needs. Free snacks available! Wednesday, December 3, 3 to 7p.m. MK 2030, MK 2040, MK 2050. Book a study slot ( https://eclass.yorku.ca/mod/scheduler/view.php?id=3875422 ).\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/frost-focus-week-at-markham-campus/
ORGANIZER;CN=Markham Campus Student Life:MAILTO:markhamstudentlife@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Markham Campus
