SUMMARY:Orientation to video interviewing: How to get that cinematic look!
DESCRIPTION:In this session, we’ll demonstrate how you can get that professional, cinematic look for your video interviews. We’ll cover lighting techniques, and talk about important components such as framing your shot, using camera settings effectively, and creating practical setups that help get the most from your interview subject.\n
