SUMMARY:Capturing Sound: Introduction to Field Recording
DESCRIPTION:An introduction to the world of field recording using Zoom handheld digital audio recorders. Learn essential recording techniques, file management, and creative uses for found sounds in music, podcasts, and ambient soundscapes.  This workshop is suitable for budding sound enthusiasts, musicians, and podcasters alike. No previous audio recording experience required.\n
