SUMMARY:International Education Week 2025
DESCRIPTION:York University joins education institutions around the world in celebrating International Education Week (IEW) 2025.\nIEW is an annual celebration of international education and exchange worldwide that highlights the importance of international education, promotes the benefits of education abroad and global engagement and recognizes the contributions of international students in strengthening intercultural understanding.\nThroughout IEW, events will be hosted by York in-person and online via zoom. Information about all events organized throughout the week can be found through the University’s IEW website ( https://www.yorku.ca/global-engagement/2025/10/29/international-education-week-2025/ ).\n \n
