SUMMARY:Family Ornament Painting Night hosted by the York U Vancouver Alumni Network
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to a festive event on Friday, Dec. 12, at Bella Ceramica Studio! Celebrate the season with a hands-on creative experience where you’ll design and decorate your own resin-pour Christmas ornaments. This family-friendly event is a wonderful way to get into the holiday spirit, connect with fellow York alumni and create keepsakes to treasure for years to come.\nEvent Details\nDate: Friday, Dec. 12\nTime: 6-8 p.m.\nLocation: Bella Ceramica Studio, 1475 Marine Dr, West Vancouver, BC V7T 1B8 ( https://share.google/HvQyYMwDuFI5r85pm )\nCost: $30 per adult and $5 per child (includes all materials and supplies)\nTicket prices have been subsidized, making this a great deal for our alumni community! Spots are limited, so register early to secure your spot!\n \n
