SUMMARY:From MENA and South America to Canada: Discovering Grad Studies at YorkU
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an inspiring webinar featuring York University graduate students from the Middle East, North Africa, and South America as they share their experiences and insights on choosing York – and Canada – for their graduate studies. Hear firsthand about their academic journeys, cultural transitions, and what makes studying at York such a rewarding experience. If you’re based in the MENA or South America region and considering pursuing graduate studies at York University, this is a great opportunity to hear directly from students who’ve made the journey, ask questions, and discover why York University – and Canada – could be the perfect next step for you.\nNovember 27, 2025\n9:00 a.m-10:00 a.m. (ET)\nRSVP Link: https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/ ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_qC87umsdT2ugNadDEhVmHA )\n
