SUMMARY:Heading North: Insights from U.S. Students on Their YorkU Grad Journey
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an engaging webinar featuring York University graduate students from the United States as they share their experiences and insights on choosing York – and Canada – for their graduate studies. Hear firsthand about their decision-making process, academic journeys, and life in Canada, and get tips on what to expect as an international student. If you’re based in the U.S. and considering pursuing graduate studies at York University, this is a great opportunity to hear directly from fellow American students, ask questions, and discover why York University – and Canada – could be the right fit for you.\nNovember 20, 2025\n12:00 p.m-1:00 p.m. (ET)\nRSVP Link: https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/\n
