SUMMARY:Take Paws: Therapy Dogs at Glendon Campus
DESCRIPTION:Feeling the pressure of exams and looming deadlines?\nStep away from the books and into a moment of calm with some four-legged friends. Join us for a cozy, stress-reducing wellness event featuring Corporate Canine’s certified therapy dogs— the gentle giant Juno the Great Dane and the ever-affectionate Packer the Golden Retriever.\nWhether you need cuddles, comfort or just a quiet moment to breathe, these pups are here to help you reset and recharge.\nLocation: Glendon Campus – Theatre\nDate: Wednesday, November 26\nTime: 11:45AM to 12:45PM\nFree and open to all students, no registration needed.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/take-paws-therapy-dogs-at-glendon-campus/
ORGANIZER;CN=Student Counselling, Health &amp; Well-being:MAILTO:schw@yorku.ca
