SUMMARY:EUC Career Workshop: Resume Reboot
DESCRIPTION:\nResume Reboot is an interactive dual-focused workshop for Faculty of Environmental and Urban Change (EUC) students.\nStudents will explore resumes through an employer’s lens and look at best practices to refresh their resumes. With guidance, students will work in pairs/small groups to provide actionable feedback on a selected portion of their peers’ resume.\n\nThis workshop is hosted by EUC’s Experiential Education team.\n\nStudents participating will be required to bring their resumes for editing.\nPLEASE REGISTER ( https://euc.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=306806 )\n\n
