SUMMARY:Graduate Program in Education Info Session/Open House (In-Person)
DESCRIPTION:The Graduate Program in Education: Language, Culture & Teaching ( https://www.yorku.ca/edu/students/graduate-programs/ ) invites prospective students to our upcoming Open House, where you can learn more about one of the most innovative and interdisciplinary graduate programs in Canada. For over twenty-five years, our program has brought together scholars, educators, and researchers committed to advancing new thinking in education, locally and globally.\nAt the Open House ( https://educationforms.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=218812 ), you’ll have an opportunity to explore how our program supports critical, creative, and justice-oriented approaches to education, learn about our MEd, PhD, and diploma options, and ask questions about carrer pathways after graduation.\nPlease RSVP ( https://educationforms.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=218812 ) by Nov. 10.\n
