SUMMARY:World at Midday: Raga Roots in Bombay Film Music
DESCRIPTION:\nImmerse yourself in a vibrant lunchtime concert tracing how the timeless art of Indian ragas inspired the golden age of Mumbai’s film music. \nFeaturing the renowned Bhattacharyya family – Pandit Shantanu Bhattacharyya, Durba Bhattacharyya, and Mitra Bhattacharyya — alongside Andrew Kay and Jonathan Kay on saxophones, and Sudhir Ghorai on tabla.\nA captivating journey through melody, rhythm, and cinema’s classical soul.\nDate: Thursday, November 6, 2025\nTime: 12:30 – 1:30 PM\nLocation: Martin Family Lounge\nFree Admission\n \n\n
