SUMMARY:Level Up | Your Money, Your Future: The building blocks to investing and fraud awareness
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an upcoming session that will teach you the fundamentals of investing and equip you with the knowledge and tools to make confident financial decisions, avoid common mistakes and become financially resilient.\nYour Money, Your Future: The building blocks to investing and fraud awareness\nDate: Nov. 17\nTime: 12 p.m. ET\nFormat: Zoom webinar\nThis educational session will dive into:\n\nAn overview of common registered accounts for investing\nInvestment products (e.g. stocks, mutual funds, ETFs)\nThe key principles of investing and how to get started\nFraud and scam awareness and how to protect yourself\n\n \n
