DESCRIPTION:Co-op & Career Centre \nInvesting your time, effort, and savings into your degree can be a lot to juggle! Are you wondering how to apply for on-campus job opportunities while studying in school? Are you interested in developing career readiness skills and experiences while financing your education? Join us in this beginner-friendly workshop to learn how you can find jobs on campus that meet your financial goals and needs. We’ll help you feel empowered in applying to Work/Study positions and achieving a balance between the commitments of your job, finances, and studies.\n
