SUMMARY:BE YU and Graduate Admissions at York University Workshop
DESCRIPTION:In partnership with Graduate Admissions, Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) invites you to an in-person workshop featuring Eileen Watson, Graduate Recruitment & Liaison Officer at the Faculty of Graduate Studies. This session will highlight the graduate and professional programs York has to offer, explain what graduate school is, how to apply, available financial support, and more. If you’re wondering what to do with your undergraduate degree after graduation, this workshop is for you!\nWorkshop details:\nDate: Tuesday November 4th\nTime: 10:00am to 11:00am\nLocation: Room 232 York Lanes.\nRegister for the event here ( https://machform.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=392222 )\n \n
