SUMMARY:Graduate Admissions 101 for Mature Students
DESCRIPTION:Have you considered pursuing a master’s, PhD or graduate diploma? Join graduate recruitment and liaison officer Eileen Watson to learn more about graduate studies at York – who’s eligible, how to apply and what programs we offer. This session is designed specifically for mature students to learn and explore their options for what comes next.\nLocation: 232 York Lanes (Second Floor)\nRegister Here ( https://machform.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=392804 )\n
