SUMMARY:Fast-Track Your Future: Earn a Bachelor’s + Master’s Degree in Just 5 Years
DESCRIPTION:Ready to go further, faster? If you’re a student who wants to make a big impact on the world — and save time doing it — the EUC 3+2 Pathway might be for you!\nThis unique program lets you complete both a Bachelor’s and a Master’s degree in just 5 years, combining three years in one of our undergraduate programs with two years in our Master in Environmental Studies (MES).\nWhether you’re passionate about climate action, urban sustainability, environmental justice, or global geography, this pathway offers an accelerated route to graduate-level research, leadership roles, and meaningful careers.\nIn this session, you’ll learn:\n\n✅ How the 3+2 pathway works and who it’s for\n✅ The four eligible undergraduate programs:\n\n Cities, Regions, Planning (BES)\nEnvironmental Arts & Justice (BES)\n Global Geography (BA)\nSustainable Environmental Management (BES)\n\n\n✅ What makes the MES program a leader in interdisciplinary environmental education\n✅ How to apply and what to expect from this accelerated academic journey\n\nIf you’re serious about making change and want to jump-start your career in the environment or urban planning sectors, this session will show you how.\nRegister ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/RRD0pIUWT2qr1hEAN1UK4w#/registration )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/fast-track-your-future-earn-a-bachelors-masters-degree-in-just-5-years-2/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Environmental &amp; Urban Change:MAILTO:
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Environmental &amp; Urban Change
LOCATION:via Zoom Online @ Zoom
END:VEVENT
