SUMMARY:Sudan, Remember Us – Documentary Screening and Reflection
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Sudan, Remember Us, a documentary by filmmaker Hind Meddeb that follows the courage and creativity of Sudanese youth from the 2019 revolution to the beginning of the 2023 conflict. The screening will be followed by light refreshments and an open reflection space.\nDate & Time: Wednesday, November 5, 2025, from 6:30 to 8:30 PMLocation: Calumet College, Room 100 (JCR), York UniversityRSVP link\nHosted by the Displacement & Health Relief Network (DHRN) in collaboration with the York University Sudanese Student Association (YUSSA).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/sudan-remember-us-documentary-screening-and-reflection/
