SUMMARY:The 2025 York University Alumni Awards
DESCRIPTION:A memorable evening awaits you at the York U Alumni Awards, as we honour our outstanding alumni.\nThese Awards celebrate alumni who exemplify the values of York, have made remarkable contributions to their fields, and changed the world for the better. On November 6, the tradition of honouring their contributions will continue.\nWe invite you to join us for a spectacular event filled with live entertainment, special guests, delicious food, and networking opportunities in celebration of York’s 2024 recipients. It will be an exciting evening and a fantastic show!\nThursday, Nov. 6\nTIFF Lightbox 350 King Street W., Toronto, ON M5V 3X5\n7 p.m. | Awards show\n8:30 p.m. | After-show social, food and networking\nDress code: Formal attire\nPlease note: Registration is closed as we are currently at capacity.\n
