SUMMARY:Responding to Students in Distress – for Teaching Assistants
DESCRIPTION:Responding to Students in Distress: This is a workshop for Teaching Assistants who would like to learn  how to manage situations where a student is experiencing distress. We will discuss the signs of distress, how to approach a student, referral options, and what you can do to take care of yourself during these times.\n\nDate: November 20, 2025\nTime: 10:00 am – 11:30 am\nRegistration ( https://forms.office.com/r/n4SqhSmyhK )\n
