SUMMARY:Tree Planting at Keele Campus
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a free planting event at Keele to connect with nature, meet great people and grow a greener campus together.\nThe tree planting will happen at the Arboretum, across from Stong and Calumet College.\nRSVP with the link ( https://sustainability.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=51571 ) to secure your spot!\nBrought to you by Regenesis YU, Office of Sustainability, Net Impact at York, Many Green Hands YU and Facilities Services, through a grant by the City of Toronto.\n
