SUMMARY:Learning by Doing: Fieldwork, Internships & Study Abroad at EUC
DESCRIPTION:At the Faculty of Environment and Urban Change (EUC), your education goes far beyond the classroom. In this session, you’ll discover how EUC’s experiential learning opportunities, from field courses and community-based projects to internships and international placements. We prepare you to tackle real-world challenges with real-world skills.\nExplore how you can:\n\nConduct field research in urban and natural environments\nWork with community partners on sustainability and justice projects\nTake part in internships and placements with NGOs, government, and industry\nJoin global learning experiences that connect local issues to global change\n\nYou’ll also hear directly from students who turned their passion into practice and gained career-ready experience along the way. If you’re the kind of learner who wants to get out there, get involved, and make change happen, this is the session for you.\nRegistration Link ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/SzsivRcYSzyisojiCcZQ8A#/registration )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/learning-by-doing-fieldwork-internships-study-abroad-at-euc/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Environmental &amp; Urban Change:MAILTO:
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Environmental &amp; Urban Change
LOCATION:Online Zoom
