SUMMARY:Passion to Profession: Become a Changemaker
DESCRIPTION:Do you care deeply about the environment, climate change, or social justice, but aren’t sure how to turn that passion into a career?\nThis session will show you how the Environment and Urban Change (EUC) programs can help you build a meaningful future doing work that matters. From environmental science to sustainable cities, environmental justice, and policy change — you’ll learn how EUC graduates are making a difference in government, nonprofits, business, education, and global development.\nYou’ll hear real stories from students who turned their love for the planet into action — and into jobs they love. We’ll also cover:\n– The kinds of careers EUC grads pursue\n– How EUC programs combine theory and hands-on experience\n– How to choose the right program path for your goals\nWhether you want to protect ecosystems, design greener cities, or fight for climate justice, this session will help you imagine your future and give you the tools to get there.\nLink to Register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/g5z4Gb3_TE-qSLReyHizbw#/registration )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/passion-to-profession-become-a-changemaker/
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Environmental &amp; Urban Change
LOCATION:Online Zoom
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Passion-to-Profession.png
