SUMMARY:Spirit Day Planting Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join the Office of Sustainability at 101 Central Square and celebrate Spirit Day with growth, connection and community at our hands-on Planting Workshop.\nLearn how to plant seeds and take cuttings to grow your own beautiful plants at home. Whether you’re a green thumb or a total beginner, this workshop is a fun and grounding way to get your hands dirty and your spirit lifted. All supplies provided — just bring your enthusiasm!\n
