SUMMARY:Institute for Technoscience & Society Virtual Seminar Series with Oliver Hainsom
DESCRIPTION:The Institute for Technoscience & Society ( https://www.yorku.ca/research/its/ ) at York University will host University of Michigan professor Oliver Haimson ( https://www.si.umich.edu/people/oliver-haimson ) as parts of its Virtual Seminar Series.\nDate: Nov. 5, 2025\nTime: Noon till 1:30 p.m.\nTitle: Trans Technologies\nDescription: Hamison will discuss his latest book Trans Technologies (MIT Press, 2025), which explores how technology creates new possibilities for transgender people, and how trans experiences, in turn, create new possibilities for technology. \nPlease register  ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_Fur1WjeDTqmRoZzac-rbrQ )to participate in the event.\n
