SUMMARY:Dance Innovations 2025
DESCRIPTION:Dance Innovations 2025 features the new choreographic works from fourth year BFA dance majors performed by students engaged in all levels of York’s programs in Dance.\nStudents are guided by faculty at every level of creation, performance, lighting design and production and it is the students who collaborate to run Dance Innovations, staged in the McLean Performance Studio, November 19, 20 and 21 at 7:00 p.m. and 8:30 p.m.\nCreative Direction: Terrill Maguire, Jennifer Jimenez & Bridget Cauthery\nDance Innovations\nSeries A: Wed, November 19 to Fri, November 21 at 7:00 p.m.\nSeries B: Wed, November 19 to Fri, November 21 at 8:30 p.m.\nFeatures new choreographic works by fourth year students with student lighting design and production support.\nLocation: McLean Performance Studio ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/mclean-performance-studio/ )\nTickets ( https://secure1.tixhub.com/yorku/online/index.asp ): $25.00 (regular) | $15.00 (students)\nAdvance (until Sunday Nov 16th): $ 20.00\nLimited Seating\nBox Office: 416-736-5888 | ampd.yorku.ca/boxoffice ( http://ampd.yorku.ca/perform/boxoffice )\n
