SUMMARY:The Tom Hendry Awards RBC Emerging Playwright Nominee Readings
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an evening of bold new voices in Canadian theatre.\nThe Tom Hendry Awards RBC Emerging Playwright Nominee Readings ( https://playwrightsguild.ca/event/rbc-emerging-playwright-nominee-play-readings/ ) will be hosted by the Toronto Reference Library in partnership with York University’s School of the Arts, Media, Performance & Design ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/ ).\nExperience fresh new works brought to life in live readings, followed by an engaging audience Q&A.\nDate: Friday, October 24, 2025\nTime: 7:00 PM\nLocation: Beeton Hall, Toronto Reference Library ( https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Toronto+Public+Library+-+Toronto+Reference+Library,+789+Yonge+St,+Toronto,+ON+M4W+2G8,+Canada/@43.6719053,-79.3888805,17z/data=!4m8!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x882b34ae90d62fe1:0x50fbc31e127f9314!2m2!1d-79.3868159!2d43.6718065?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAwNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D )\nAdmission is free — all are welcome!\n \n
