SUMMARY:Institutional Scaling of Ecological Footprint and Biocapacity Accounting
DESCRIPTION:This workshop is hosted by the International Ecological Footprint Learning Lab. It will provide a deeper understanding of methodologies used to apply Ecological Footprint and Biocapacity at the scale of institutions and enterprises, specifically universities.\nThe workshop will begin with a presentation from a panel of experts, followed with a question-and-answer period.\nThe event is virtual. Those interested in attending can register in advance ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_GMinTE-1QI2sR_Jy5hELGQ#/registration ).\n \n
