SUMMARY:Glendon Seminar: Translating European Political Culture to a New World Settler Colony: New France under Louis XIV
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Glendon Seminar, a new forum for researchers to share and discuss their work with colleagues.\nProfessor Colin Coates will present a talk titled “Translating European Political Culture to a New World Settler Colony: New France under Louis XIV.”\n📅 Date: Thursday, Oct. 2🕛 Time: Noon to 1 p.m. 📍 Location: YH B217, Glendon Campus\nAll are welcome to attend.\n
