SUMMARY:Mid-Career Conversations | Confidence Over Conformity: How to lead and avoid facing impostor syndrome
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Mid-Career Conversations, where Jackie Staub (BA ’01), Retail & Brand Strategy Leader, Executive Positions at L’Oréal, Coty and Estée Lauder will explore how confidence becomes essential even when feeling out of place.\nDrawing on stories from brand leadership, moments of creative divergence and decision‑making moments under pressure, Jackie will share practical lessons on showing up authentically, navigating pushback and finding the strength to stand by what you believe in.\n\n
