SUMMARY:Open Education 101
DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in learning more about open educational resources (OER) and how they can be incorporated into the classroom? Attend this workshop to learn about foundational OER and open education topics. During this session, attendees will learn about the following topics:\n\nWhat are OER\nOpen licensing basics\nAccessibility considerations and OER\nCommon OER creation tools, H5P & Pressbooks\n\nYork instructors, students, and staff who are interested in using, adapting or creating OER are encouraged to attend this hands-on workshop.\n
