SUMMARY:LAPS co-op/DEM internship and field placement panel with students
DESCRIPTION:Speakers: Student panellists, Dr. Nirupama Agrawal and a Faculty of Liberal Arts & Professional Studies (LA&PS) Co-op Representative\nTopic: LA&PS co-op/Disaster & Emergency Management Internship and Field Placement Panel with Students\nDate & Time: Thursday, Oct. 9, 2025 | 2:45 to 3:45 p.m.\nLocation: Harry Crowe Room (ATK 109), York University\nAre you a student, researcher, or practitioner in disaster and emergency management? Don’t miss this weekly opportunity to engage with cutting-edge research and expert speakers.\nThis seminar series offers:\n\nWeekly talks by researchers and professionals in emergency and disaster management\nPractical case studies, emerging methods, and collaborative discussions\nIn-person participation to connect and collaborate\n\n
