SUMMARY:En Las Nubes
DESCRIPTION:In May 2025, twenty-three York University students traveled to Costa Rica to participate in the PANF 3030/5030 Global Eco-Arts Residency course. This ten day intensive course comprised a series of workshops, gallery tours, creative class-based exercises, and participation in a local community festival at York University’s Las Nubes Eco-Campus and surrounding areas. Through these experiences, students were introduced to themes of environmental and community-based art, food sovereignty, site-specific art, and the ethics of community engagement.\nDATES: September 29 – October 3, 2025 | Opening Reception: October 1 – 5:30 p.m.\nTIME: 12:00 – 4:00 p.m.\nLOCATION: Gales Gallery ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/gales-gallery/ )\nFREE Admission\n
