SUMMARY:Grant Writing Workshop Series for Postdoctoral Researchers (online)
DESCRIPTION:York University’s postdoctoral researchers are invited to join a two-part funding workshop series designed to empower postdocs to secure research funding, both now and in the future.\nJoin Jane Ramachandran of Resonant Solutions, a seasoned expert with nearly three decades of grant-writing experience, for specialized sessions on finding and applying for grant funding.\nSession Two: Grant Application Budget Development\nWednesday, October 29, 2024 at 1:00 – 3:00 PM ET\nIn this interactive two-hour workshop, we’ll tackle the often tricky but crucial task of developing a successful budget for funding applications.\nYou’ll learn how to construct a well-balanced budget, explore key budget categories, understand the difference between cash and in-kind contributions, and gain confidence in finalizing your project’s financial plan. We’ll also cover rules of thumb and how to write a clear and compelling budget justification.\nCome prepared with a research idea or draft application to work on, or use the workshop sample to sharpen your skills before writing your own project budget.\nRecommended Prerequisite: Grants 101\nData and Recording Policy\nAttendees will have the opportunity to complete a very brief survey before and after the workshop to understand its impact and improve future events. All survey data is anonymous, and no identifying information will be collected. The teaching and presentation portions will be recorded for liability and further training purposes. The Q&A segment will not be recorded. No personal data will be shared nor sold.\nWhat’s Next?\nParticipants will be invited to sign up for a 30-minute advisory consultation, with opportunities for continued support on their grant applications.\nThe link will be provided to registrants before the workshop. Please register by Tuesday, October 28\nRegistration Link ( https://fgs.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=315559 )\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/grant-writing-workshop-series-for-postdocs-2/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies
LOCATION:Livestream/Online webinar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/pexels-pixabay-265152-scaled.jpg
