SUMMARY:Financial Empowerment: Scholarships, Awards and Bursaries Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Navigating the world of scholarships, awards, and bursaries can feel overwhelming, but it doesn’t have to be. Join us at the Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) for an informative workshop where you will learn about scholarship and bursary opportunities at York University, how to apply and understand eligibility requirements, and tips to prepare strong applications. This session is designed to equip you with information and strategies on the financial support available at York University that can help ease the burden of educational costs.\nTo reserve a spot, please complete the registration form ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/t48xN4oqQIKN-w5qLlh1Xg#/registration ).\nOpen to all York University students who are interested in maximizing their financial resources and planning ahead for academic success, with a special encouragement for those who identify as Black to participate.\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/financial-empowerment-scholarships-awards-and-bursaries-workshop-2/
ORGANIZER;CN=Black Excellence at York University:MAILTO:beyu@yorku.ca
