SUMMARY:President’s Reception in Ottawa
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an opportunity to connect with other alumni, expand your professional network and learn about the latest developments from your alma mater. Whether you graduated recently, or many years ago, we would love to see you.\nDate: Wednesday, October 29 \nTime: 6 – 8 p.m.\nVenue: The Albion Rooms Restaurant\nAddress: 33 Nicholas St, Ottawa, ON K1N 9M7\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/presidents-reception-in-ottawa/
