SUMMARY:Laptop & Learn: Discover York Academics Drop-In Sessions – Fall 2025
DESCRIPTION:Research Commons and the Discover York Academics (DYA) team are excited to offer weekly drop-in sessions this Fall to assist faculty members in creating their DYA profiles. These sessions will be available online.\n\nDiscover York Academics is a dynamic eCV platform that enables faculty to showcase their work, connect with peers, indicate availability for graduate supervision, and enhance visibility to industry and community partners. With automatic updates and data aggregation from public sites, your DYA profile will continuously reflect your latest research, publications, awards, and professional activities.\n\nJoin us every Friday at 12:00 noon from September 5 to December 19, 2025  for a step-by-step tutorial, with opportunities to ask questions and get real-time assistance.\n\n\nPlease register here for the sessions you wish to attend\n \n\nPlease note that you can sign up for multiple sessions at once. If you find the sessions helpful and wish to attend more, you can easily register again.\n\nTo learn more about DYA, please visit YULink: https://yulink-new.yorku.ca/group/yulink/discover-york-academics.\n\nFor a one-on-one user profile setup, book an appointment with DYA Project Manager Augustina Oguntoye: https://calendly.com/atoye-yorku/30min.\n\nIf you have any questions, please contact dyahelp@yorku.ca.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/laptop-learn-discover-york-academics-drop-in-sessions-fall-2025/
CATEGORIES:Research &amp; Innovation
END:VEVENT
