SUMMARY:Scholars’ Hub @ Home | The Narrative Shift: Building a brand that resonates
DESCRIPTION: Curious about what strategic marketing communications means in 2025? Success hinges on a deeper fluency: understanding your audience not only through data but through culture and gut and anticipating trends before they become headlines. This conversation explores why knowing your audience doesn’t equal understanding it, how brands can engage in cultural conversations and the mindset that will help build genuine trust and lasting relevance. \n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/scholars-hub-home-the-narrative-shift-building-a-brand-that-resonates/
