SUMMARY:Sensorium Meet & Greet
DESCRIPTION:Sensorium: Centre for Digital Art and Technology ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/sensorium/ ) at York University invites current members, faculty, and AMPD graduate students to join us for a Fall Meet & Greet in the Sensorium Loft to mark the beginning of the semester. This event will be a fantastic opportunity to meet each other informally, learn more about the Sensorium community, its upcoming events, and ways to get involved. Cupcakes and snacks will be served.\nDATE: Tuesday, September 23\nTIME: 3:00 p.m. – 6:00 p.m.\nLOCATION: Sensorium Loft, 4th floor\nGoldfarb Centre for Fine Arts (CFA)\nFree. RSVP HERE  ( https://ampd.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=226779 )\n
