SUMMARY:2SLBGTQIA+ Support Group
DESCRIPTION:Student Counselling, Health & Well-being (SCHW) is partnering with the Nellie Langford Rowell Library to offer a monthly, drop-in support group for York’s 2SLGBTQIA+ student community starting in October 2025.\nSCHW counsellors who identify as part of the 2SLGBTQIA+ community will facilitate this group to create a safe and positive space where stories can be shared and support given. Past topics covered include coming out, gender and sexuality, finding safe spaces on campus, managing stress, connecting with broader community supports and self-care.\nContact schw@yorku.ca ( mailto:schw@yorku.ca ) for more information.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/2slbgtqia-support-group/
