SUMMARY:Painting in Gratitude
DESCRIPTION:Painting in Gratitude\nCelebrate completing the first half of the fall term with SWELL! Take a moment to reflect on what we are grateful for. Express yourself creatively while sharing stories about the place or people that have made this year filled with many happy moments for you.\nWhy should you join?\nTake an intentional moment to reflect on the things that bring you peace and happiness\nExpress yourself artistically with no experience required\nHang out and connect with other students, or use the time for your dedicated “me” time\nRegister by enrolling into our eClass and selecting “I would like to attend.” under the event DIY Study Sessions: Build Your Own Exam Toolkit.\nOrganized by Athletics, Recreation and Student Counselling, Health and Well-being.\nLocation: MK 3040R (Experiential Education Hub), Markham Campus\nFormat: In-Person Event\nAudience: Students\nRegister Online\n
