SUMMARY:Paint & Sip with Black Excellence at York University
DESCRIPTION:Come hang out with Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) for a chill evening of painting, sipping, and good vibes. We’ll be creating a beautiful Caribbean seascape at night—think calm ocean waves, starry skies, palm trees swaying, and a glowing moon lighting up the scene. It’s the perfect mix of relaxation and creativity, and a great way to destress from the pressures of school and recharge your energy.\nNo experience needed, we’ve got all the supplies. Just bring yourself and your imagination.\nOrganized by ACMAPS.\nLocation: 103J CentralSquare, Keele Campus\nFormat: In-Person Event\nAudience: Black Students at York\nRegister Online\n
