SUMMARY:Virtual Wellness Coffee Hour
DESCRIPTION:Make a warm cup of coffee (or your preferred beverage) and chat with us about how wellness is imagined and perceived in countries around the world. We’ll get inspired by literature, music and conventional wisdom, so no prior knowledge required!\nFeel free to email uhip@yorku.ca by October 3rd any wellbeing quotes (in the original language as well as English) that you have been influenced by that you would like participants to know about. Be sure to cite the person/work where you got the quote, as well as its country/region of origin so participants can continue exploring wellness after the session.\nOrganized by York International.\nFormat: Virtual\nAudience: York Community\nRegister Online\n
