SUMMARY:YU Eats Presents: Fuel Your Wellness with Fruits & Veggies
DESCRIPTION:In celebration of Well-being Week from October 6–10, Food Services will be highlighting the importance of fruits and vegetables in everyday meals with special promotions across our YU Eats dining halls. At Central Square Market, Stong, Winters, and Glendon, you can add a 4th veggie for free at the pasta and stir-fry stations, making it easier to pack more nutrients into your plate. Plus, at Central Square Market, Stong, Winters, and Glendon, enjoy a refreshing snack with our 2 fruits for $2.99 deal. These offers are designed to support your well-being by making healthy choices more accessible and delicious!\nOrganized by Food Services/Dietitian- Ancillary Services.\nLocations: Central Square Market, Stong, Winters and Glendon Dining Halls\nFormat: In-Person\nAudience: York Community\n \n
