SUMMARY:2025 Dry-A-Thalon
DESCRIPTION:🏆 First Annual Dry-A-Thalon 🏆\n3 Events. 1 Month. Unlimited Glory.\nOctober 1st – October 31st\n💥 Think you’ve got what it takes?\nCompete in 1, 2, or all 3 events and see how far you can go in just 10 minutes. Winners are crowned based on distance, and prizes are up for grabs in each category!\n🔥 THE EVENTS:\n🏃‍♂️ RUN\nComplete your run on the SportsArt treadmills in the Fitness Centre\n🚴 BIKE\nUse the Keiser bikes in the Fitness Centre\n🏊 ROW (SWIM)\nHit the rowing machines in the Fitness Centre to simulate the swim\nOrganized by Athletics and Recreation.\nLocation: Tait McKenzie Fitness Centre, Keele Campus\nAccessibility: Space accessible through lift\nFormat: In-Person Event\nAudience: Students\nRegister Online\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/2025-dry-a-thalon/
CATEGORIES:Athletics &amp; Recreation,Well-being,Well-being Week
END:VEVENT
