SUMMARY:Scenic Caves Hike
DESCRIPTION:Before winter settles in, join us for an unforgettable adventure at Scenic Caves Nature Adventures — one of Ontario’s most breathtaking natural wonders! 🌲❄️ Nestled high above Georgian Bay, Scenic Caves offers a magical mix of towering cliffs, deep crevices, and panoramic views. Explore ancient caves and caverns carved out over thousands of years, wander along forest trails, and cross Ontario’s longest suspension footbridge for a truly epic photo op! 📸🌉This guided outdoor experience is the perfect way to embrace late fall before the snow flies — so layer up and get ready for a day of fresh air, fun, and exploration.\nOrganized by Athletics and Recreation.\nLocation: Bus leaves from the Tait McKenzie Centre, Keele Campus\nFormat: In-person Event\nAudience: All York Community\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/scenic-caves-hike/
CATEGORIES:Athletics &amp; Recreation,Well-being,Well-being Week
