SUMMARY:Paint Night
DESCRIPTION:Unleash your creativity and unwind with a brush in hand.\nTap into your artistic side and join us for a fun and relaxing Paint Night — no experience required! Guided by a local artist, you’ll be walked step-by-step through creating your own masterpiece in a cozy, laid-back setting.\nThis is your chance to socialize, de-stress, and express yourself through art. Whether you’re a seasoned painter or just looking for a unique way to spend your evening, Paint Night is all about the experience — not perfection.\nOrganized by Athletics and Recreation.\nLocation: Student Lounge at the Tait McKenzie Centre, Keele Campus\nFormat: In-person Event\nAudience: Students\nRegister Online\n
