SUMMARY:Teaching Kitchen – Black Creek Community Farm Tour
DESCRIPTION:Earth to Table Black Creek Community Farm Tour\nSeptember 16, 2025 – 1 to 3 p.m.\nExplore farm-to-table with a hands-on tour! Harvest, taste and prepare a food dish while learning about food systems and sustainability.\nImmerse yourself in the process as we delve into how food reaches our grocery stores, the problem of food waste, our reliance on fossil fuels for food transport and the impact of our food system on climate change. You’ll also learn practical ways to take action.\nYou’ll have the opportunity to harvest, taste and prepare fresh foods straight from the garden. Come ready to savour the fruits of your labour and leave with a deeper connection to the food you eat.\nRegister here. ( https://www.eventbrite.com/e/teaching-kitchen-earth-to-table-black-creek-community-farm-tour-tickets-1676572687039?aff=oddtdtcreator )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/teaching-kitchen-black-creek-community-farm-tour/
