DESCRIPTION:Calling all Aspiring and Inspiring Land Learners!\nJoin us for a collective wondering of Land as Pedagogy, welcoming all students, staff, and faculty as learners to Maloca Community Garden on Keele campus.\nPlease visit our RSVP form ( https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfAFYG8eKj5OZ6ImK994E0QcGpQegnu0LBXwtgITOdYTGD-XQ/viewform ) for more information, access notes, and to sign up. Please RSVP by September 19th!\nPresented by York’s DEDI in Teaching & Learning Community of Practice, with support from the Teaching Commons.\n
