SUMMARY:Globally Networked Learning (GNL) Initiatives for Faculty
DESCRIPTION:The Globally Networked Learning (GNL) team is excited to invite you to join the upcoming virtual GNL information session, which is open to all York faculty members and staff who are interested in innovative pedagogies that combine internationalization, experiential education, and co-teaching a course with an international partner.\n\nPlease register by using this LINK ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/M9sTqZFWRLCu4MMDqv9N3g ).\n\nThis Info Session will cover:\n\nWhat and why GNL\nGNL examples by York faculty members\nPedagogy of GNL \nQ&As \nCurrent call for GNL Proposals by external International Partners and $500 Award to support piloting your GNL initiatives \n\n
