SUMMARY:Supervision 101 at YorkU- Online
DESCRIPTION:Whether you are new to York University, new to grad studies or a seasoned graduate faculty member, you are warmly invited to join the Faculty of Graduate Studies’ Graduate Supervision Support Hub for an online workshop and facilitated discussion regarding graduate supervision.\nThe online workshop will feature:\n\nSupervisory best practices\nGuidelines and policies you will want to know\nReflections from graduate supervisors\nTime to reflect on your intended supervision style\n\nDate: Wednesday, November 12, 2025\nTime: 1:00pm–2:30pm (EST)\nLocation: Online via Zoom\nRegistration is required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/zd4y07jiSUaO4lk4OFyvbA#/registration )\n \nFor more information contact Tracy Bhoola, Manager, Graduate Supervision Support Hub tbhoola@yorku.ca ( mailto:tbhoola@yorku.ca ) or Associate Dean, Cheryl van Daalen-Smith fgsadacd@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsadacd@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/supervision-101-at-yorku-online/
