SUMMARY:Mid-Career Conversations | From Overlooked to Interviewed: Simple resume tweaks that work
DESCRIPTION:Whether you’re exploring your next step or aiming to level up in your career, your resume is one of the most powerful tools in your job search. In today’s hyper-competitive job market, even small tweaks can make a big difference. Join the Alumni Career Coach Sonia Sheechoria on Sept. 29 as she shares:\n\nHow to highlight your strengths in a way that gets noticed\nCommon mistakes to avoid that may be holding you back\nPractical strategies to tailor your resume for different roles\nSimple formatting and content changes that recruiters love to see\n\n \nDate: Monday, September 29\nTime: 12 – 1 p.m. ET\nFormat: Zoom meeting\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/mid-career-conversations-from-overlooked-to-interviewed-simple-resume-tweaks-that-work/
