TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Access and Equity in Teaching (Sep. 22-Oct. 24, 2025)
DESCRIPTION:This course can count towards the Certificates in University Teaching. ( https://www.yorku.ca/teachingcommons/certificates/#teaching-proficiency )\nAs educators, ensuring that we create and support learning environments that are both accessible and equitable is crucial. However, access and equity are complex and can present many challenges, whether we are creating and sharing course content, engaging students in “hot topics” through discussion, or deciding how best to administer high stakes assessments. In this fully online course, participants will learn by doing through ongoing participation in weekly learning activities. Together we will test out strategies for enhancing access and supporting equity, explore relevant principles and frameworks to inform our teaching, and troubleshoot common challenges.\nNote that registration for this course closes on September 19th, 9:00 am.\nRegister in the course. ( https://teachingcommonsforms.apps01.yorku.ca/forms/view.php?id=1135036 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/access-and-equity-in-teaching-sep-22-oct-24-2025/
ORGANIZER;CN=Teaching Commons:MAILTO:teaching@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies,Faculty of Graduate Studies (Programs),Teaching &amp; Learning
LOCATION:Online (URL will be sent in a reminder email prior to the event)
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/1_Access-and-Equity-in-Online-Teaching.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:York University
CLASS:PUBLIC
UID:MEC-14b14198b6e26157b7eba06b390ab763@events.yorku.ca
DTSTART:20251027T040000Z
DTEND:20251129T040000Z
