SUMMARY:Impacts and Issues of Misogynoir
DESCRIPTION:This is an interactive session where participants discuss the issue of misogynoir, which shows how sexism and racism manifest in black women’s lives to create intersecting forms of oppression”. Participants explore the detrimental impacts of internalized racism as well as engage in a discussion about healing and self-care.\nFind more information and registration through YU Learn ( https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=1853 ).\n \n
