SUMMARY:Grad Café: Paint a Tote Bag
DESCRIPTION:Grad Café is a relaxed, drop-in space for graduate students to unwind, connect with peers, and take a break from academic pressures. Unleash your inner artist while creating a personalized tote bag! Join us for a fun, relaxing afternoon of painting and crafting. Come as you are, just bring your creativity and leave with a stylish, one-of-a-kind tote to carry your grad school essentials\nRegister Now\n
