SUMMARY:Level Up | Introduction to Money Management
DESCRIPTION:The Level Up series is kicking off the fall with an exclusive introduction to financial literacy presented by TD Insurance. Join us for an informative session and get expert advice on how to manage your finances.\nIntroduction to Money Management\nDate: Sept. 22\nTime: 12 p.m. ET\nLearn about:\n\nStrategies for creating a budget\nHow credit works and affects financial health\nBasic investment tools like RRSPs and TFSAs.\n\n
