SUMMARY:Harriet Tubman Institute’s Open House 2025
DESCRIPTION:Welcome back! The Harriet Tubman Institute is happy to invite you to our 2025 Open House on Sept. 11. This yearly event is an opportunity to learn about Tubman’s research and initiatives, hear from campus partners, network with students and faculty, and take a tour of Black spaces at York. All are welcome to connect and celebrate the new academic year with us.\n \nSchedule:\n12:30 p.m.: Presentations and networking activities\n2:30 p.m.: Blackness at York University Tour\n
