SUMMARY:Experience Grad York | Lassonde School of Engineering—Graduate Programs
DESCRIPTION:Discover the future of innovation and impact through graduate studies at the Lassonde School of Engineering\nJoin us for a two-hour online session and explore exciting opportunities of graduate studies in Civil Engineering, Electrical Engineering and Computer Science, Digital Media, Mechanical Engineering and Earth and Space Science.\nWhether you’re passionate about building sustainable infrastructure, advancing AI and digital technologies, designing intelligent systems, or exploring the frontiers of space and planetary science, our master’s and doctoral programs offer the tools, mentorship and research opportunities to help you shape the future. Learn how you can become part of a vibrant academic community at York University’s Lassonde School of Engineering, where innovation meets purpose and your ideas can make a global impact.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/kqbIuXyQTC2iG3nGSSzbDg ).\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
