SUMMARY:Experience Grad York | Linguistics and Applied Linguistics (MA, PhD)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Linguistics & Applied Linguistics? We invite you to attend our program information session!\nThe Graduate Program in Linguistics and Applied Linguistics is well known for the excellence of its faculty, students and teaching. Our mission is to educate candidates in ways that will prepare them for careers in teaching, research, government and the private sector. Faculty research and supervision interests cover a broad spectrum of areas in Linguistics. Specializations include: Core Linguistics; Sociolinguistics; and Applied Linguistics.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/BDn0DW9uQBeEIvBlL7fkoQ ).\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
