SUMMARY:Experience Grad York | Economics (MA)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Economics? We invite you to attend our program session!\nThe Graduate Program in Economics is ranked among the top programs in Canada. Students can take both applied courses associated with professional economic skills useful for work in the private or government sector, along with technical and theoretical courses for a career in academia. Specializations include: Econometrics; Industrial Organization; International Money & Finance; International Trade; Applied Economic Theory.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/AlLycsSpT4-M2Lp8dQ_-NA ).\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
