SUMMARY:Experience Grad York | Communication & Culture (MA, PhD)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Communication & Culture? We invite you to attend our program session!\nOffered through a partnership between York and Toronto Metropolitan University, the program capitalizes on the facilities and resources shared by both universities. Students benefit from the real-world experience of professors in the fields of communications, the social sciences, humanities, media, and fine arts. The program offers three flexible areas of study: Media and Culture, Politics and Policy, and Technology in Practice. Unique in Ontario, this program combines academic and professional work.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/qw8zy_d-RCmaoFE9uMIVUQ ).\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
