SUMMARY:Experience Grad York | Schulich School of Business Specialized Masters Programs
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education with a Schulich School of Business Specialized Master’s Program? We invite you to attend our program session!\nThe Schulich School of Business is transforming the higher education experience.\nFinding a school that’s the right fit is important.\nSkills, aptitude, knowledge, personality—these qualities and much more make you unique. At Schulich, we respect that uniqueness.\nOur programs are designed to support your academic aspirations, your lifestyle, and your long-term goals. With responsive, innovative degrees, cutting-edge curriculum and flexible study options, we’re here to partner with you in realizing your full potential.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/x1TTA8WsRDuq3KFUtd_98w ).\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
