SUMMARY:Experience Grad York | Information Systems & Technology (MAIST)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Information Systems & Technology? We invite you to attend our program session!\nThe School of Information Technology provides the most current knowledge about information technologies and their application in modern organizations. The degree will prepare students for employment in a broad range of sectors such as health, business, and education. Students can choose courses from many IT areas, including Data Management and Analytics, Enterprise Computing, Complex Systems and Decision Support, and Financial Technologies. The program is offered both on a part-time and full-time basis.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/Ak6vfk2STj-FiU92gGABcg ).\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
