SUMMARY:Experience Grad York | Law (Research LLM, PhD)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Law? We invite you to attend our program information session!\nOsgoode’s Research Graduate Program is innovative, creative, rigorous, and challenges students to attain the highest standards of excellence in legal scholarship.\nThe breadth and depth of our LLM and PhD course offerings, coupled with the constantly evolving and thought-provoking approaches to legal study, brings outstanding students with critically important research projects from a diverse range of fields. These advanced degrees involving extensive, research-intensive study, are suitable for students who aim for an academic position or who want to gain further research expertise in the area of law.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/oeNTPvc-SEu5CDNePO9pww ).\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
