SUMMARY:Experience Grad York | Management Practice (MScMP)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Management Practice? We invite you to attend our program session!\nThe Master of Science degree in Management Practice is designed to provide future leaders in organizations with a robust understanding of management practices rooted in applied research and analysis that inform evidence-based decision-making. Students are provided the opportunity to focus on one specific area: Accounting, Marketing, Supply chain management, Entrepreneurship and innovation, and Managing professionals. The program can be completed on a full-time and part-time basis.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/d-LZuZH2SdO8wf4651c9Ng ).\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
