SUMMARY:Experience Grad York | Mathematics & Statistics (MA, MSc, PhD)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Mathematics & Statistics? We invite you to attend our program session!\nOur Graduate Programs provide both depth and breadth of knowledge in mathematics and statistics to help students tackle challenging problems in theory and applications. Many graduates go on to successful careers in academia, industry, and public service worldwide.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/qBT0BfLcRJmSj1btgCc2Ow ).\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
