SUMMARY:Zotero Basics: Citations and Bibliographies Made Easy
DESCRIPTION:Zotero is the best tool for managing citations and research—and it’s free and open source.  This introductory hands-on workshop will teach you how to use it to organize your citations and create your bibliographies.  If you’re new to writing and citing, Zotero can make things much easier: press a button and it will generate your bibliography!  But even if you’ve been researching and writing for a while, it’s never to late to see what Zotero can do and how it can help.  No experience required. This workshop covers just the basics; the other two go into more detail.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/zotero-basics-citations-and-bibliographies-made-easy-6/
