SUMMARY:Orientation to Green Screen Video Production
DESCRIPTION:In this session, we’ll demonstrate how to use the Markham Library’s green screen room to produce video projects. The content will cover the importance of getting even lighting on the green screen wall, framing your shots, and using green screen software to replace the green background with other visuals. We’ll also demonstrate a planning process for your video shoot, so you can use your studio time as effectively as possible.\n
