SUMMARY:Create a Data Management Plan for your Grant Application
DESCRIPTION:Do you need to prepare a Data Management Plan (DMP) for a grant application? Attend this workshop to learn about:\n\nThe value of a DMP\nUsing the DMP Assistant tool to access a funding application-stage DMP template\nSpecific sections & questions you should address in your funding application-stage DMP\n\nParticipants will walk away from this workshop with a set of practical resources and templates they can use to begin creating a DMP for their grant application. This workshop will be taught by the Libraries’ Research Data Management team.\nThis workshop is part of the Libraries’ 2025 Open Access Week programming. Participants may also be interested in completing the Libraries’ virtual Research Impact Challenge ( https://researchguides.library.yorku.ca/research-impact ) (October 20, 2025 to October 24, 2025) to learn more about research impact and visibility topics.\n
