SUMMARY:Zotero Note-taking: Reading and Annotating
DESCRIPTION:Zotero is the best tool for managing citations and research—and it’s free and open source.  This third of three workshops will take you beyond the basics of using Zotero to having it serve as a full research partner.  You will learn to: manage research notes using Zotero; use PDF annotation tools to create searchable notes and quotations based on article and book sources; export the annotations and notes into Word; and generate reports to help with assignments, papers, theses and other projects.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/zotero-note-taking-reading-and-annotating/
