SUMMARY:Makerspace Orientations: Game Pieces and Figurines
DESCRIPTION:Participants work on techniques that make their expensive games more affordable and create unique twists on classics like Catan, Chess, Monopoly, Warhammer, Battletech and many more. You’ll see demonstrations of designing and creating custom game pieces, followed by post-processing and painting techniques to achieve high-quality finishes. These methods enhance both the appearance and durability of game components.\n
