SUMMARY:GENIAL Student Entrepreneurship Competition
DESCRIPTION:We are inviting you to our 2025 GENIAL Student Entrepreneurship Competition!\n\nNetwork with entrepreneurs and professionals across various industries\nGet inspired by our keynote speakers\nEnjoy refreshments at free cocktail reception\n\nThursday, October 2, 2025, 5:30-8:30p.m. Glendon Campus\nRegistration is required ( https://genialpitch.eventbrite.ca/ ).\nTo learn more, visit GENIAL Workshops & Events ( https://www.yorku.ca/glendon/genial/workshops-events/ ).\nIf you have any questions, please contact Melissa at carmeli@yorku.ca.\n
