SUMMARY:Go Global Fair
DESCRIPTION:Dreaming of studying, researching, or interning abroad? The Go Global Fair is your one-stop event to explore exciting opportunities that can take your studies overseas! Meet York students who’ve been abroad in the past, chat with incoming exchange students visiting from around the world, and connect with our Global Learning team to find the perfect program for you.\nYou will also have the chance to speak directly with some of the YorkU faculties, partner universities, and global research and internship institutions – all here to share their unique programs and opportunities. From semester exchanges to summer schools, research placements to internships, discover how you can earn credits, gain new skills, and experience life in another country.\nDate: Wednesday, October 1st, 2025\nTime: 10:00AM – 2:00PM\nVenue: Vari Hall\nVisit this website for more information about exhibitors and newsletter sign-up: https://yorkinternational.yorku.ca/global-learning-fair/ ( https://yorkinternational.yorku.ca/global-learning-fair/ )\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/go-global-fair-3/
