SUMMARY:Open Doors York
DESCRIPTION:Step into campus life at Open Doors York—a special event that welcomes future students and their supporters to explore all that York has to offer. You’ll get to meet campus resources, departments, and faculties, and enjoy music, snacks, and even prizes!\nOpen Doors York is a vibrant campus-wide event designed to welcome new and returning students by showcasing key student services and resources.\nHosted in the Harry Arthurs Commons, the event offers an engaging atmosphere with music, games, snacks, and opportunities to connect with staff, student leaders, and peers. It’s a great way for students to explore what’s available to support their success and feel a strong sense of community as they begin the year.\nDetails can be found here ( https://yuconnect.yorku.ca/web/rsvp_boot?id=375292 ).\n
