SUMMARY:Discover Markham: Discover Unionville
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nJoin us for an exciting day of exploration in Unionville! This in-person event will take place in the heart of Unionville, where you can immerse yourself in the rich history and vibrant culture of this charming neighborhood. From quaint shops to delicious eateries, there’s something for everyone to enjoy. Take a stroll through the picturesque streets, visit local landmarks and discover hidden gems along the way. Whether you’re a long-time resident or a first-time visitor, there’s always something new to discover in Unionville. Don’t miss out on this unique opportunity to experience the best that this community has to offer.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/discover-markham-discover-unionville/
