SUMMARY:Experience Grad York | Dean’s Session: How to Write a Statement of Interest
DESCRIPTION:In this session, Vice-Provost and Dean Alice Maclachan will walk you through some essential steps for your graduate studies applications. Join us to learn more about:\n\nhow to write a statement of interest\nchoosing a graduate program\nfinding and approaching potential research supervisors\nother tips and tricks for putting your best foot forward in your graduate studies application\n\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_oLyCE2ysReCCGYLyjorZJQ ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nFor any questions, please email us at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/fa2025-egy-deans-session-how-to-write-a-statement-of-interest/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
