SUMMARY:Experience Grad York | Glendon: Graduate Admission at York
DESCRIPTION:Join us to learn more about the graduate programs available at Glendon College. This presentation will cover the following:\n\nÉtudes françaises (MA)\nÉtudes francophones (PhD)\nMaster of Public & International Affairs\nMaster of Translation\n\nWe will cover admission requirements, eligibility, tuition, funding, scholarships, and how to apply. Questions welcome!\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_JspIgQ8JR0-JkJx_S6jICQ ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nFor any questions, please email us at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
