SUMMARY:York U Alumni Mixer in Niagara
DESCRIPTION:This fall, step into the season with an unforgettable experience in the heart of the Niagara Region. On Thursday, September 25, join other alumni in an inviting atmosphere to connect, expand your professional network and spark meaningful conversations.\nWhether you graduated recently or many years ago, we would love to see you there.\nYork U Alumni Mixer in Niagara\nDate: Thursday, September 25\nTime: 6:30 – 8:30 p.m.\nTickets: $15 including wine tasting and canapés\nLocation: Ravine Vineyard Estate Winery, 1366 York Rd., St. Davids, ON L0S 1P0\n
