SUMMARY:Scholars’ Hub @ Home | The Science of Happy Families: Five key ingredients from clinical-developmental psychology
DESCRIPTION:Join Heather Prime, Associate Professor, Department of Psychology, Faculty of Health on Sept. 10 at 12 p.m. and learn about the building blocks to family well-being, including how everyday stressors can infiltrate family relationships—and what parents can do to buffer against them. We’ll explore evidence-based strategies for supporting children’s emotional and behavioural health, managing sibling rivalry, and fostering strong, connected parenting teams.\n\n
