SUMMARY:Campus Tour for Future Graduate Students
DESCRIPTION:Explore York University’s vibrant Keele Campus with a dedicated tour exclusively for prospective and incoming Master’s, Graduate Diploma, and PhD students, and their guests. Discover the resources, facilities, and opportunities available to support your academic and research aspirations at the graduate level.\nPlease note: this is a general tour of campus; due to volume, we will not be able to showcase all program-specific areas on campus, but we are happy to direct you on the map, should you wish to explore further on your own!\nPlease note that this tour will not cover the Schulich School of Business, or Osgoode Law School.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/book-a-tour ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/book-a-tour/ ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nFor any questions, please email us at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/campus-tour-for-future-graduate-students-4-531/
