SUMMARY:Grad Grab n’ Go
DESCRIPTION:Need a break but short on time? Swing by and grab free snacks, drinks, and quick resources for your grad school journey—no RSVP needed! It’s the perfect pit stop for fueling up and staying energized between classes or study sessions.\nNo registration or meeting link required. It is a daily drop-in event.\n
