SUMMARY:Grad Café: Charm Bracelets
DESCRIPTION:Grad Café is a relaxed, drop-in space for graduate students to unwind, connect with peers, and take a break from academic pressures. Join us for a creative and fun afternoon crafting your very own charm bracelet! It’s a perfect way to unwind, personalize your accessories, and connect with other grad students. Come as you are, just bring your creativity and leave with a unique piece of jewelry!\nRegister Now\n
