SUMMARY:National Portfolio Day 2025
DESCRIPTION:If you are thinking of pursuing a post-secondary education in art or design you will likely have to include a portfolio of your work as part of your application. At National Portfolio Day member schools, accredited art or design universities and colleges, will provide students with a unique opportunity to meet one on one with professional representatives. These reps are there for you to ask questions about their programs, and most importantly, get feedback on how to improve your portfolio so it can be successful part of your application.\nWe look forward to meeting you and seeing your work!\nAdmission is free.\nNational Portfolio Day at York University\nSaturday, November 1, 2025\n12:00 p.m. – 4:00 p.m.\nJoan & Martin Goldfarb Centre for Fine Arts ( https://maps.app.goo.gl/tnJt6J31rXdYinxX6 )\n86 Fine Arts Road, Toronto, Toronto, M3J 1P3\nREGISTER HERE ( https://nationalportfolioday.heydays.io/conventions/3255 )\nNational Portfolio Day – FAQ’s ( https://nationalportfolioday.org/faqs/#general )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/national-portfolio-day-2025/
