SUMMARY:Jazz Festival 2025
DESCRIPTION:The York University Jazz Festival, running November 24 – 26, showcases rising young talent from York University’s Department of Music.\nMonday, November 24 \n7:30 p.m.  – Small Ensembles |  | Directed by Tara Davidson ( https://www.taradavidson.ca/ )\n8:15 p.m.  – Small Ensembles |  | Directed by Sacha Williamson\n9:00 p.m.  – Small Ensembles |  | Directed by Michael Murray ( https://www.allaboutjazz.com/musicians/mike-murray/ )\nTuesday, November 25\n7:30 p.m.  – Small Ensembles | Directed by Kevin Turcotte ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/kevin-turcotte/ )\n8:15 p.m.  – Small Ensembles | Directed by Artie Roth ( https://artieroth.com/ )\n9:00 p.m.  – OP Ensemble | Directed by Mike Cadó ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/mike-cado/ )\nWednesday, November 26 \n12:30 p.m.  – R&B Ensemble | Directed by Mike Cadó ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/mike-cado/ )\n7:30 p.m.  – Jazz Orchestra | Directed by Mike Cadó ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/mike-cado/ )\nFree Admission\nMcLean Performance Studio \n
