SUMMARY:Transfer Student Orientation
DESCRIPTION:Transfer Student Success at York: Issues, Strategies, and Resources\nJoin us to explore strategies for transfer student success at York! This orientation session will highlight the issues transfer students face as they transition to university, explore strategies for transfer student success and provide an overview of campus resources that can support academic and personal success at York.\nLearning outcomes:\n\nLearn about the prevailing issues faced by transfer students\nApply a range of strategies to support your academic and personal success\nIdentify a range of campus resources that will support their well-being and success at York\n\n In-person session: Thursday, Aug. 21, 6 to 8 p.m.\nLocation: Vari Hall A\nRegistration begins at 5:30 p.m.\nRSVP for the session here: https://machform.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=386913 ( https://machform.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=386913 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/transfer-student-orientation/
