SUMMARY:Game On! With Peer Mentors
DESCRIPTION:Want to test your skills in a game off against a team of LA&PS upper-year students?\nJoin us for a virtual gaming event hosted by your amazing team of LA&PS First Year Experience Peer Mentors, featuring a variety of fun and interactive Jackbox games! Whether you’re a first-timer or a seasoned pro, there’s something for everyone. This is the perfect chance to make some new friends and have some fun before classes kick off in the fall. No experience needed—just bring your A-game!\nYou’ll also have the chance to meet our knowledgeable and enthusiastic upper-year Peer Mentors and ask any questions you have. Hope to see you there!\nHave questions about the session or your first-year experience before the event? Connect with us at lapsfye@yorku.ca!\nRegister Now\n
