SUMMARY:LA&PS Welcome Session
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to YorkU Lions!\nWant to set yourself up for success in your first year at York? Join us for a virtual LA&PS Welcome Session!\nEvery week from July until September, LA&PS Colleges will be hosting a virtual welcome session to help you feel confident and excited to take your first steps at York.\nDuring the session, we’ll answer questions like:\n\nWhat is the Faculty of Liberal Arts & Professional Studies at York University?\nWhat support is available to me before I arrive and during the school year?\nWhat are the best tips for a successful first year at York University?\nHow do I make connections with other students in my program?\nAnd more!\n\nYou’ll also have the chance to meet our knowledgeable and enthusiastic upper-year Peer Mentors and ask any questions you have!\nHave questions about the session or your first-year experience before the event? Connect with us at lapsfye@yorku.ca!\nCan’t wait to see you there!\nRegister Now\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/laps-welcome-session-mclaughlin-college-699-475-609-182-880-125-815/
