SUMMARY:Mature/Transfer Student Keele Campus Tour – Summer 2025
DESCRIPTION:Are you a new mature or transfer Student to York U? If yes, join a current undergraduate student for a comprehensive introduction to campus and support services for mature and transfer students during a campus tour. Meet staff and transition coaches from the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-Time Students (ACMAPS).\nRegister here: Mature/Transfer Student Keele Campus Tour- Summer 2025 Tickets, Multiple Dates | Eventbrite \n
