SUMMARY:Online Public Viewing at Allan I. Carswell Observatory
DESCRIPTION:Join us every Monday at 9:00pm EST to learn more about astronomy history for the week, and a chance to view the night sky, if weather permits! You can access our broadcast through our Youtube channel here ( https://www.youtube.com/@YorkUObservatory )!\nRefer back to the Observatory site ( https://www.yorku.ca/science/observatory/. ) for the most updated event information.\n
