SUMMARY:Scholars’ Hub @ Home | Interactive Analytics in Urban Operations and Planning
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\nUrban planning is becoming more data-driven, with interactive analytics enabling decision-makers to explore “what-if” scenarios and make faster, more informed choices. Interactive-OR.net applies Operations Research and Machine Learning to create user-friendly tools that support dynamic, model-driven decision-making without requiring technical expertise. Join Mehdi Nourinejad, Assistant Professor, Department of Civil Engineering, Lassonde School of Engineering on July 23 where he will highlight applications in emergency response, micromobility, road safety, construction scheduling and parking management.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/scholars-hub-home/
ORGANIZER;CN=Alumni Engagement:MAILTO:alumnievents@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Scholars-Hub-@-Home.png
END:VEVENT
