SUMMARY:The Wellness Impact Lab’s Gentleman’s Climate Café
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a one-of-a-kind Climate Café created by men, for men! A space where we talk honestly about fear, anger, grief, hope, and what climate change really means to us as sons, fathers, friends, and citizens.\nWhat you’ll experience:\n\nA guided, respectful conversation circle\nAn interactive Climate Conversation Game \nEmotional insight and mutual understanding\nTools for reclaiming climate courage\n\nFind us at the Dahdaleh Institute Boardroom (Room 2150)\nHosted by: The Wellness Impact Lab at York University Open to male-identifying students, faculty, staff, and community members.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/the-wellness-impact-labs-gentlemans-climate-cafe/
CATEGORIES:Bethune College,Calumet College,Colleges,Equity, Diversity &amp; Inclusion,Faculties,Health Education &amp; Promotion,Stong College,Teaching &amp; Learning,Well-being
