SUMMARY:Mitacs Research Fair
DESCRIPTION:Join us to meet, recognize and celebrate the global research and innovation of Summer 2025 Mitacs Globalink Interns through their research displays. This event offers a chance to learn more about the ongoing research and research opportunities at York University. We invite fellow Mitacs interns, faculty and staff from across campus to attend. \nPlease note that this is an invite-only event. If you are interested in attending, please contact Hetil Joshi (hetil25@yorku.ca ( mailto:hetil25@yorku.ca )) for more information. Registration is required.\nRegister here: SU2025 Mitacs Research Fair RSVP Form ( https://yorkinternational.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=1006376 )\n
