SUMMARY:The 64th Annual Conference of the Phytochemical Society of North America
DESCRIPTION:York University is hosting the 64th Annual Conference of the Phytochemical Society of North America at the Accolade East Building from June 24 to 28.\nEach year the annual conference’s goals are to provide a platform to share advances in phytochemistry; facilitate collaborations between scientists, clinicians, government, industry, and patients; provide junior scientists and trainees an opportunity to present their research; and promote equity in science in our selections of invited speakers / session chairs.\nRegister for the event.  ( https://www.psna2025.com/register )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/the-64th-annual-conference-of-the-phytochemical-society-of-north-america/
