SUMMARY:Integration of Globally Networked Learning into Nursing Education: York and Hong Kong Baptist University
DESCRIPTION:Join us to hear from nursing professors and students at York University and Hong Kong Baptist University about the process of initiating, implementing and researching the innovative pedagogical approach of Globally Networked Learning (GNL) into nursing education. This is a virtual event and registration is required: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/to4spFz7QJCtGeKE1Rsc7w ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/to4spFz7QJCtGeKE1Rsc7w )\n \n
