SUMMARY:Inspiring Hope: Education as a Catalyst for Change in Tumultuous – Times Faculty of Education Year-End Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an afternoon of insight and inspiration as we celebrate the Faculty of Education’s contributions to research, teaching, and community engagement at York University.\nExplore how education can spark transformation and inspire hope through:\n\nEngaging Roundtable Discussions\nInnovative Research Presentations\nThought-Provoking Conversations\n\nEveryone is welcome, and can register to attend ( https://eduforms.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=309675 ).\n
