SUMMARY:Create to Communicate Ethically: Making information that matters
DESCRIPTION:This hands-on workshop is designed to introduce you to useful practices and important resources to create academic outputs, combining text, visuals, data and more to effectively communicate your ideas. The session will cover the basics of copyright and how to ethically use and attribute others’ work. You will also explore Creative Commons resources so that you create your work responsibly. Finally, you will learn platform specific features to build your output effectively.\n
