SUMMARY:GRAD@York 2025 – Social Fair
DESCRIPTION:Are you an incoming graduate student? If so, we look forward to meeting you at GRAD@York: Navigating Grad Services Beyond Your Program!\nThis event will be an opportunity for you to meet with our FGS team and campus partners, to learn about a variety of resources and services available to support your graduate journey. We will have representatives from various academic and administrative services across the University. This event is being hosted in collaboration with the York University Libraries.\nDate: Tuesday, September 2, 2025\nTime: 12:00 PM – 2:00 PM\nLocation: Scott Library’s Collaboratory Space (Keele Campus)\n** THIS IS AN IN-PERSON EVENT **\nRegistration is required! RSVP Form  ( https://fgs.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=302699 )\nNote: A light lunch will be served.\nIf you have any questions, please email us at FGSINFO@YORKU.CA  ( mailto:FGSINFO@YORKU.CA )\n
