SUMMARY:InfoSession: Lab2Market Validate Program
DESCRIPTION:​Are you a researcher or graduate student curious about how your innovation can make an impact beyond the lab? Join YSpace for an Info Session on the Lab2Market (L2M) Validate program — where you’ll learn how to take your research out of the lab and into the real world.\n​What to Expect:\nThis information session will walk you through the L2M Validate program, including:\n\n​Who it’s for\n​What to expect during the program\n​How the $10K in funding can support your validation journey\n​Application tips and key deadlines\n\n​Whether you’re ready to apply or just exploring your options, this is a great chance to get your questions answered and see if L2M Validate is the right fit for your research journey.\n\n​About Lab2Market Validate\n​The Lab2Market Validate program is a four-month program that provides research teams, consisting of a graduate student and their faculty supervisor, with the opportunity to evaluate the commercial potential of their technology through a structured, data-driven market research process with $10,000 in funding to support the journey.\n​As an academic partner, YSpace, a division of the Office of Research and Innovation at York University, will deliver the Ontario cohort of the Lab2Market Validate program in partnership with Lab2Market, a national initiative that helps brilliant minds in graduate programs and postdoctoral programs reimagine their futures.\nRSVP TODAY! | https://lu.ma/qnvr0gpt ( https://lu.ma/qnvr0gpt )\n
URL:https://lu.ma/qnvr0gpt
