SUMMARY:Rainbow Grad Celebration hosted by the Sexuality and Gender Advocacy (SAGA) Alumni Network
DESCRIPTION:As York alumni, we invite you and a guest to join us at our upcoming Rainbow Grad Celebration. Celebrate with faculty, staff, graduates and allies, as we honour the 2SLGBTQIA+-identifying graduates of the Class of 2025. Dress to impress and enjoy food, music and heartfelt words from York community members. We hope to see you there!\nEvent Details:\nDate: Tuesday, June 3\nTime: 6 – 8 p.m.\nLocation: Martin Family Lounge, Accolade East, 4700 Keele St, North York, ON M3J 1P3\nAgenda:\n5:45 p.m.: Doors open\n6:15 p.m.: Dinner service\n6:50 p.m.: Recognition ceremony begins\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/rainbow-grad-celebration-hosted-by-the-sexuality-and-gender-advocacy-saga-alumni-network/
ORGANIZER;CN=Office of Alumni Engagement:MAILTO:alumni@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni,Equity, Diversity &amp; Inclusion,Equity, People &amp; Culture,Students
LOCATION:Martin Family Lounge, 219 Accolade East Building @ York University 83 York Boulevard Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/MicrosoftTeams-image-47.png
END:VEVENT
