SUMMARY:Scholars’ Hub @ Home | Where is Democracy Going?
DESCRIPTION:Around the world we have seen the rise of a populist politics associated with increasing authoritarianism and an attack on conventional democratic behaviour and participation. In response to this a variety of ’solutions’ have been touted. Join Dennis Pilon, Professor and Chair of the Politics Department, Faculty of Liberal Arts and Professional Studies on May 28 as he explores just what is motivating these recent changes in political behaviour and what kinds of responses may be required to challenge them.\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/scholars-hub-home-where-is-democracy-going/
