SUMMARY:Le pouvoir d’une image: Parler de développement durable en cours de linguistique française
DESCRIPTION:In a world where we are overwhelmed with information and images, how does linguistics help us understand the power of an image to promote environmental justice and raise awareness of sustainability issues? Students in the FR2100 6.0 (Introduction to French Linguistics) are answering that question by discussing images related to Sustainability Development Goals.\nPresentations are in French.\nIntroductory remarks by Genevieve Gill, Manager of Bilingual Programming and Communications, Learning For a Sustainable Future (LSF) .\nRegistration is required.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/le-pouvoir-dune-image-parler-de-developpement-durable-en-cours-de-linguistique-francaise/
ORGANIZER;CN=Marilyn Lambert-Drache:MAILTO:mlambert@yorku.ca
