SUMMARY:York U Alumni and Friends Career Webinar: From application to offer, excelling in job interviews
DESCRIPTION:An insightful webinar designed to equip alum with the skills and knowledge needed to excel in job interviews. Attendees will get a comprehensive overview of the interview process, including what to expect before, during and after the interview. Recent grads or seasoned professionals, this webinar will provide valuable tips and strategies to help alum navigate the job market with confidence.\nThis session will cover:\n\nTypes of Interviews: Understand the different formats, from traditional to behavioral and technical interviews, and how to prepare for each.\nCommon Interview Questions: Learn how to structure your answers to common questions, ensuring you present yourself confidently and effectively.\nAnalyzing Job Descriptions: Gain insights into how to decode job descriptions to tailor your responses and highlight your most relevant skills.\n\nWebinar Registration – Zoom\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/york-u-alumni-and-friends-career-webinar-from-application-to-offer-excelling-in-job-interviews/
ORGANIZER;CN=Office of Alumni Engagement:MAILTO:alumni@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni,Divisions and Special Areas
LOCATION:Zoom Link:
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Webinar-Photo-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
