SUMMARY:C4 Spring Capstone Day
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate C4 student success at the public, pan-campus event, Spring Capstone Day. This event will be held on April 25th from 2:00 p.m. until 5:00 p.m. C4 students wrap up their project journey by sharing their findings and competing for awards.\nThis event brings project partners and mentors together with the entire York community to celebrate the innovation, creativity, ambition, and impact of our students working on SDG-related projects.\nRegister for Capstone Day here ( https://www.yorku.ca/c4/events/spring-capstone-day-2025/ ).\n
