SUMMARY:YorkU Big Bioblitz
DESCRIPTION:York’s Big BioBlitz is LIVE! 🐝\nFrom April 1 – May 31, join us in exploring biodiversity across campus with the iNaturalist app! Whether you’re a nature newbie or seasoned spotter, every observation counts.\n✅ Download the iNaturalist app✅ Create an account✅ Search “York University BioBlitz” under the “Projects” tab and start uploading your nature sightings!\n📩 Have questions? DM us on Instagram at @yorkusustainability.🏆 Bonus: The participant with the most submissions will win a prize!\nLet’s get observing, YorkU!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/yorku-big-bioblitz/
