SUMMARY:Hands in the Soil: Tree Planting & Prep (Keele Campus)
DESCRIPTION:Regenesis@York, in partnership with The Office of Sustainability and Facilities Services, is hosting tree planting events this Spring at the Keele and Glendon Campuses.\nThe York community is invited to participate in these tree plantings events! It’s an opportunity to get outdoors, meet new people and have fun! These events will help create positive change – a greener campus with restored ecosystems to help mitigate climate change.\nPLEASE NOTE: There is a limited number of spots for tree planting. To participate you will receive a confirmation email with more details.\nPlease sign up with the registration form ( https://sustainability.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=47767 ) if you would like to participate.\nTree Planting– Keele Campus (at the Maloca Garden) \nTuesday, May 13, 1-3 p.m. \n
