SUMMARY:WWF Living Planet Leader Information Session
DESCRIPTION:“WWF Living Planet Leaders Certification – Info Sessions\n\n \n📅 Monday, April 15 | 11:30 A.M. – 12:30 P.M.\n📅 Wednesday, April 24 | 1:00 P.M. – 2:00 P.M.\n\n📍 Online via Zoom\n\n\nJoin us for the WWF Living Planet Leaders Certification hosted by York University’s Office of Sustainability. This interactive virtual workshop is designed to empower students to take meaningful action on sustainability and environmental issues—on campus and beyond through WWF.\n\n\nDuring the session, you will:\n• Learn about the Living Planet @ Campus program and how to get involved\n• Explore the impact of individual and collective actions on the environment\n• Connect with other York students passionate about sustainability\n• Discover opportunities to lead change at YorkU through WWF initiatives\n\n\nThis session is open to all York students, regardless of academic background. Everyone is welcome!\n\n👉 Register here\n🔗 Learn more about the Living Planet @ Campus program: https://www.yorku.ca/sustainability/getinvolved/wwf/“\n
