SUMMARY:Climate Fresk Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Climate Fresk Workshop – Hosted by the Office of Sustainability\n📅 Wednesday, May 7\n🕐 1:00 PM – 3:30 PM\n📍 Room 280N, York Lanes\nJoin us for an engaging Climate Fresk workshop to explore the science behind climate change and its impacts through an interactive, collaborative format.\nDuring the workshop, you will:\n• Collaborate with fellow participants using a deck of illustrated cards to better understand the climate crisis\n• Identify and connect the causes and consequences of climate change\n• Create and personalize your own “Fresk” once the connections are established\n• Share perspectives and discuss actionable solutions to address the climate emergency\nThis workshop is open to everyone, regardless of academic background. All are welcome to participate!\n👉 Register here ( https://sustainability.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=47920 )\nThe Climate Fresk is an association organizing group workshops on climate change for the general public. All the information on the cards comes from the IPCC (Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change.\nMore information on the Climate Fresk can be found here: (https://climatefresk.org/world/ ( https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fclimatefresk.org%2Fworld%2F%3Ffbclid%3DIwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAAR5uLlF9mzwGyHlZmTmjlR3NtUvUg9CfjzXIWxomPsq-5YmSAdJdMQuOWix9KQ_aem_jqvDc9kFTW1rChUXThPFwQ&h=AT3v4lQw26q0r82vebfifrffEUuTStfqlQ3Jeyd_oQE8HFPto2NfrL0WaF32woZttJqgX_W6wqLsTrVTHZyGSbP1Jwss81yKTbxjpsVhYEtQTebOfpppQo2eEp_GXCObGVtZgiv0_LnCF14XBn-d3SCJR5oRSJMHjhw&__tn__=-UK-R&c%5b0%5d=AT3_x6vpffaCqWcy-1yWfaL07KKyk442qkyRpVCBL85Isi5QURFF6911hu5spXPkIyY_Xe84uq1aQ43nXS2edCR-VKt7TbeKfvREW9tm-pTOwCf9GrMTXYGtz5XdS1m264VORr1QthXnPOJfsCbpLFTgR33D_1rEbHIplM-S2L8zLZreVv2ngPM2aLDN5mTyMuJRvUstbcqqdtyzmarouLsoQA ))\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/climate-fresk-workshop/
ORGANIZER;CN=Office of Sustainability:MAILTO:sustainability@yorku.ca
