SUMMARY:Osgoode’s Internationally Trained Lawyers Day
DESCRIPTION:Osgoode Professional Development is hosting its annual Osgoode’s Internationally Trained Lawyers’ Day (OITLD) on Wednesday, May 28, 2025.  The morning sessions will bring the National Committee on Accreditation, the Law Society of Ontario, and the Law Practice Program to provide information, details, and updates about their processes and policies.  The afternoon session will focus on networking skills and practice with an informative panel discussing the importance of this skill and opportunities for speed mentoring with a session co-hosted by ITLNCA NetworkS.\n\nTake advantage of early bird pricing until April 30—register today!\n
