SUMMARY:Managing your Finances in Today’s Economy
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an insightful session featuring York alum, Prakash Amarasooriya (BSc ’15), renowned financial literacy advocate who will explore strategies to manage your finances in today’s evolving economic landscape. This session is especially relevant as Canada’s economy faces uncertainty due to U.S. tariff threats. Prakash will help you understand how to make informed decisions while maintaining financial stability.\nThis 30-min session will cover:\n• How to see the Canadian economy in relation to your economic situation\n• Budgeting and expense management and practical strategies for prioritizing essential expenses and finding ways to manage rising costs\nDate: Thursday, April 24\nTime: 12-1 p.m.\nRegistration is required in advance. A Q&A period will follow the presentation.\n
