SUMMARY:Movie Night with the Sexuality and Gender Advocacy Alumni Network (SAGA)
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to invite you to a special 2SLGBTQIA+ drinks and movie night hosted in collaboration with the Queer Cinema Club and the Paradise Theatre! Join us for an evening of mingling and powerful cinema. We will be screening the film from Lizzie Borden’s radical and revolutionary ode to liberation and love: Born in Flames.\nThis is a great opportunity to reconnect with alumni, forge new connections and celebrate your love of cinema with the 2SLGBTQIA+ community. We look forward to seeing you there.\nMovie Night with SAGA: Born in Flames\nDate: Wednesday, April 23\nPre-screening reception\nTime: 6:30 p.m.\nPopcorn and drinks will be served!\nScreening\nTime: 8 p.m.\nTickets: $15\nDoors open 30 minutes before showtime.\nLocation: Paradise Theatre, 1006c Bloor St. W, Toronto, ON ( https://maps.app.goo.gl/SnqFzgAXKfUNKjZD9 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/movie-night-with-the-sexuality-and-gender-advocacy-alumni-network-saga/
