SUMMARY:Navigating Next Steps: A Conversation on Career Development for Postdoctoral Researchers
DESCRIPTION:FGS invites you to join your fellow postdocs for a conversation on career development. During the first hour you’ll hear from previous York postdocs as they discuss their career journeys, challenges, and successes.\nAdditionally, you will have the opportunity to connect with the postdocs who serve on the Faculty of Graduate Studies Council and to network with postdocs from across campus. This event is an opportunity to build professional connections and gain insights from fellow researchers.\nPanelists:\nSylvester Aboagye, Assistant Professor, School of Engineering, University of Guelph\nDe-Lawrence Lamptey, EMBARK Scientist at Holland Bloorview\nJulia Polyck-O’Neill, Assistant Professor, Communication and Media Studies, Memorial University\nWhen: Thursday, April 17 from 1:00-2:30pm\nWhere: 519 Kaneff Tower\nRSVP Link: https://fgs.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/ ( https://fgs.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=294838 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/navigating-next-steps-a-conversation-on-career-development-for-postdoctoral-researchers/
