SUMMARY:Q & A with Navid Khavari, Narrative Director, UBISOFT Toronto
DESCRIPTION:\nThis event, which takes place at 6 PM on April 1st in Founders Assembly Hall, is a special talk and Q&A with Navid Khavari. Navid has turned his passion for games and storytelling into a high-profile career in video game narrative design. This is an exciting opportunity for students: how do you break into the video game industry as a professional writer? Students are deeply interested in gaming, but it’s an intimidating and mysterious industry. Navid is exactly the person to dispel these mysteries and to give students the cutting-edge tips that will help them get their foot in the door. The event is hosted by Professor Matt Bucemi in the Writing Department, and food will be served.\nMore Information\n \n
