SUMMARY:2SLGBTQIA+ Support Group
DESCRIPTION:Are you a York U student who identifies with the 2SLGBTQIA+ community?\nWhether you are feeling anxious, overwhelmed, or simply looking to connect with more queer individuals, join us for a collaborative event between SCHW and the Nellie Library!\nThis gathering aims to create a nurturing and inclusive environment where 2SLGBTQIA+ students can share their experiences, find support, and building meaningful connections.\nRegister for the 2SLGBTQIA+ Support Group ( https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfr70sALyyomDUsja4Zvwjb-NXlqMSu-TDEnHfh4LjReVNLvA/viewform )\n
