SUMMARY:Employer Meet and Greet for Students with Disabilities
DESCRIPTION:Meet face-to-face with inclusive employers! \nDuring this event, you’ll have the opportunity to connect with organizations hiring for part-time, summer, internship, and fulltime positions after graduation while learning about their organization’s culture, hiring practices, and how you can apply for full-time positions after graduation and summer jobs/internships, in 2026. \nTo review the organization profiles, please visit our website. ( https://students.yorku.ca/employer-meet-greet )\nRegister now on Experience York! ( https://experience.yorku.ca/entityRedirect.htm?eventId=4715 )\n \n\nSet yourself up for success!\nAttend our Employer Meet & Greet for Students with Disabilities Success Webinar Series that will take place one week prior to the event, the week of January 20th. You will learn how you can stand out to employers by writing compelling resumés and cover letters, preparing for interviews and more! Find the full webinar/workshop series on our Events Calendar.\n
