SUMMARY:Fall Career Fair
DESCRIPTION:Come and meet employers in-person who are looking to hire York U students and recent graduates for a variety of opportunities, including part-time, summer, internship, and full-time positions after graduation.\nAt the fair there will be a Drop-In Station between 10 a.m. and 3 p.m. The drop-in service is a quick session for you to meet with a career professional to discuss your career, learn more about co-op or get advice on job search. This service is offered on a first-come, first-served basis.\n——-\n \nWebinar Series: Preparing for Career Fair Success!  \nFrom Sept 3 to Sept 15, learn how you can stand out to employers during our “Preparing for Career Fair Success” webinar series. Topics include resumé and cover letter writing, interview preparation, enhancing your LinkedIn profile and more. Find the full webinar schedule on our Events Calendar. ( https://experience.yorku.ca/emailStat.htm?action=redirect&email=1255&emailAddress=expyork@yorku.ca&url=https%3A%2F%2Fcareers.yorku.ca%2Fcalendar )\nLooking for more tips on preparing for the upcoming fair? Check out the Career Centre website!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/fall-career-fair-2/
