SUMMARY:YUMAN Launch and Alumni Gospel Choir Concert
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Saturday, April 5, for a special performance celebrating 20 incredible years of the York University Gospel Choir under the artistic direction of AMPD Professor Karen Burke, 2025 Juno nominee.\nFollowing the concert, the York University Music Alumni Network ( https://emclick.imodules.com/ls/click?upn=u001.wvj1UITJ0gqfV5RhmLyU-2BJ5Q8WIkTM5O9fpm4zmUmbIdirf9X78z3nVIKQ68UAPrAvQpZLSVOfdEowCl-2BljcufyxTBeEfoNxmbiHXgJAmnoSGfG5veuYY0Y-2B3-2FebT3uaIMqv_s7rEWSqnXGIm80S-2BUND-2Fa0RJ0IGUXgVlVIGi-2FA6FycdkqJm9JRn5lQrMPCbWxO2C8l9bNjE3N9s-2BzyzYXcOqzgfgArMGHv1M701AiTkgcYdBUBv1QzyB0jTaQTFtrQicFPv6NDx906urzPhCdFwV4Prq6TqroazlMmSe2qwHCbE12Ya-2BY-2FpTwiWuZdw5519unjuzbS2Rx9DxyunD80EofOhlYDfA6eXuuZyO9uGBnS84G5vzMhSQxnUx2TkF3eYWEHLA-2FcC-2F5PWZdUrjROKVC9tBGAzKlJpEjjXCFEwcrlPmebJB7QqqsG83LWFzussUsBOTn95DfXorAHIVfBtmWG3aJHdID7Y37oIAeno6dy51-2B3RDtcz6BoV1fS4bj8ZFkUgoDAvjsk3BP3-2FDiq8uIouf-2FMvMMb2pzrxI0F5Y73vF1COxm9aBkA0v40fy3QAKalgP7O93se7tLUp8kE6mU-2BCGSUcOYGwUBMxP6qRFX9KEVq7CEcjE13L1a6ciNWeYfe1azJlk2eqD2nKyhu2x3Q-3D-3D ) (YUMAN) is excited to invite you to a special afterglow to connect and commemorate this milestone together and officially launch YUMAN!\nGet involved and share your ideas to shape the future of our network, we look forward to seeing you there.\nDate: Saturday, April 5\nConcert: 7:30-9:30 p.m. (doors open at 7 p.m.)\nAfterglow: 9:30-10:30 p.m.\nTickets: General admission $20, students and seniors $15\nLocation: The Sandra Faire and Ivan Fecan Theatre\n
