SUMMARY:Becoming the Butterfly – film screening and roundtable
DESCRIPTION:A film screening and roundtable discussion on brain injuries, collaborative film and ethnography, hosted by Denielle Elliott.\nThe event focuses on a research project exploring the experience of brain injury through film. This event will be held at York’s Keele Campus, and involves a screening of the film, along with a roundtable discussion and Q-and-A.\n\nAll are welcome.\nEvent name: Becoming the Butterfly: Film Screening & Roundtable Discussion\nEvent date: Thursday, April 10\nEvent time: 6:30 to 8:30 p.m.\nRegistration: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/becoming-the-butterfly-a-film-screening-and-roundtable-discussion-tickets-1260318078299?aff=oddtdcreaor\n
