DESCRIPTION:Join us for a day of relaxation and creativity at our Therapy Dog & Collaborative Painting event hosted by YorkU’s President’s Ambassadors! Whether you need a moment to unwind, or want to explore your artistic side, this event is the perfect opportunity to relax and express yourself.\nThis event is open to all York students and we can’t wait to see you there!\n📅 Date: Wednesday, March 26, 2025\n⏰ Time: 2:00 – 4:00 PM\n📍 Location: Bethune College Rm. 112 & 115\n
