SUMMARY:Solarium X Lunarium
DESCRIPTION:Interdisciplinary Arts Capstone Studio (PANF 4990) is the culminating course for students in the Integrative Arts program. In its inaugural year, the course brings together students from Integrative Arts and across AMPD, including Theatre, Dance & Performance and Cinema & Media Arts.\nIn collaboration with the Aga Khan Museum in Toronto, students have developed projects inspired by the museum’s art objects and philosophy, with a special focus on the contemporary Light exhibition currently on display.\nThe final exhibition event will take place in both the Special Projects and Gales Galleries on the York University campus, with one space immersed in darkness, and the other immersed in light. Featured works will span a range of interdisciplinary art practices, including installation, animation, photography, visual art, dance, video, game design, digital media, and performance.\nJoin us for the closing event, where we’ll celebrate these works with live performances and food! We look forward to seeing you there.\nDates: March 24 – 28, 2024\nGallery Hours: Monday – Friday, 10am-5pm\nLocation: Gales Gallery & Special Projects Gallery Center for Fine Arts, York University\nClosing Event: Friday, March 28, 6 – 8pm\nArtists featured:\nMadison Armstrong\nIvan Ceria\nKayla Champis\nFelisha Forrester\nJustin Le\nMichelle Pan\nNisha Selvarajah\nSydney Simota\nEric Trudell\nMaggie Tsang\nKathleen Vela\nAmelia Winterbottom\nVictoria Wong\nJaidah-Leigh Wyatt\nJoselyn Zendejas Macin\nSpecial thanks to:\nSarah Parsons, Sascha Priewe, Bita Pourvash, Marianne Fenton, Hayley Andrew, Carmen Schroeder, Michael Irwin, the Aga Khan Museum, CEWIL Canada, and the School of the Arts, Media, Performance & Design (AMPD).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/solarium-x-lunarium/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:Gales Gallery, Accolade West Building, York University @ 89 York Blvd., Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/solarium.jpg
END:VEVENT
