SUMMARY:DM@YORKU 2025
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a celebration of work created by Digital Media Undergraduate and Graduate students.\nA week of open classes: March 31 – April 4, 2025\nCollaborative Project Development: Third year team projects\nDigital Media Project: Graduating student capstone projects\nBiomedia: Hybrid Art, Science and Computation: Stir the art/science pot\nCreative Data Visualization: How DM sees data\nCollaborative Project Development in Games: Third year team games\nInteractive Installation Based Gaming: Escape rooms\nVertical Studio-Lab: Warning – graduate students at work\nMedia Signal Processing: Realtime code + immersion in concert\nMonday, March 31\n2:30 p.m. – 5:15 p.m. – DATT 3700 Collaborative Project Development – 103 Accolade West Building\nTuesday, April 1\n4:00 p.m. – 5:00 p.m. – DATT 4600 Biomedia: Hybrid Art, Science and Computation – 103 Accolade West Building\n10:00 a.m. – 1:00 p.m.  – EECS 4700 Digital Media Project – 103 Accolade West Building\nWednesday, April 2\n9:45 a.m. – 12:15 p.m.  – DATT 3935 Creative Data Visualization – 102 Accolade West Building\n10:00 a.m. – 11:00 a.m. –  DATT 3701 Collaborative Project Development in Games – 103 Accolade West Building\n3:00 p.m. – 5:00 p.m. –  DATT 4310 Interactive Installation Based Gaming (max 10 people) – 326 Joan & Martin Goldfarb Centre for Fine Arts (CFA 326)\nThursday, April 3\n4:00 p.m. – 6:00 p.m. – DIGM 5020 + 6020 Vertical Studio-Lab I+II – 103 Accolade West Building\nFriday, April 4\n10:30 a.m. (lab 1\n1:00 p.m. (lab 2)\n3:30 p.m. (lab 3)\n5:30 p.m. (lab 4)\nDATT 2050 Media Signal Processing – 103 Accolade West Building\nFor more about Digital Media @ YorkU please visit us here ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-computational-arts/digital-media/ ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/dmyorku-2025/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:York University Keele Campus @ 4700 Keele St, North York, ON M3J 1P3, Canada
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/digital-media_program-banner-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
