SUMMARY:OMNI-RÉUNIS Super Spreader Seminar Series
DESCRIPTION:OMNI-RÉUNIS Super Spreader Seminar Series third installment for 2025 is here!\nThis time, Xuzhe Qian presents his research on  We look forward to your participation on: “Does opinion polarization necessarily imply conflict? Modelling and Modulation”\n📆Thursday, 27th March, 2025 from\n⏰10:30 to 11:30 a.m.\nIf you’re at York University’s Keele Campus, we invite you to join us at our lab located at the Petrie Science & Engineering Building (PSE), Room 018, 140 Campus Walk  REGISTER HERE ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/pGDCWIm4SnWLkBTKWRga1g ), and feel free to share this invitation with your colleagues, networks and other researchers.\nShould you have any questions, please contact Nolan Holder, OMNI-RÉUNIS Program Manager, at nholder@yorku.ca.\nWe hope to see you there!\n
