SUMMARY:Well-being Week Exclusive: Spirit Day Smoothies Discount
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Food Services\nYUEATS Dining will be offering red smoothies with a 10% discount on March 26th. The smoothies will be available at CSQ, Stong, Glendon & Winters.\nBeetlejuice Smoothie:\nA vibrant mix of fresh strawberries, crisp apples, nutrient-rich spinach, fragrant basil, earthy beets, and refreshing apple juice.\nMixed Berry Smoothie:\nA refreshing blend of orange juice, a medley of four juicy berries, and creamy vanilla yogurt\nFormat: Drop-by In-Person Event\nTimes:\n\nStong – 9 am to 10 pm\nCSQ – 10 am to 5 pm\nWinters – 9 am to 10 pm\nGlendon – 9 am to 10 pm\n\n
