SUMMARY:Webinar for Incoming Grad Students – Graduate Funding and Scholarships at York
DESCRIPTION:Graduate funding packages can be a deciding factor for many students when choosing a program that fits their needs. In this useful session, participants will obtain a comprehensive in-depth look at how the funding package is broken down both for Master’s and PhD students. Additionally, participants can gain an understanding about two types of funding, funds that are granted and funds that are earned, as well as external and internal scholarship opportunities. The information presented in this webinar is general and can be applied across different programs.\n[We’ll also be available to answer questions you may have, to the best of our ability – and to direct you to the right place for any that we can’t]\nTopic: Graduate Funding and Scholarships at York\nWhen: Thursday, May 29\nTime: 12:00–1:00 PM (EST)\nLocation: via Zoom Webinar\nRegistration is required: yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_GfyDU8MIRrSyI0VvcIMsSw )\nShould you have any questions, please email us at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\nWe hope to meet you virtually in May!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/graduate-funding-and-scholarships-at-york/
