SUMMARY:Webinar for Incoming Grad Students – Applying for Your Study Permit: A Guide for Graduate Students
DESCRIPTION:Planning to begin your graduate studies at York University? This webinar will cover important information to help you with applying for your Canadian study permit. Our licensed immigration specialists will walk you through key topics, including:\n\nRequired documents and how to prepare a complete application\nUnderstanding the Provincial Attestation Letter (PAL) process\nTips for avoiding common application mistakes\n\nThere will also be time for your questions at the end of the session!\nTopic: Applying for Your Study Permit: A Guide for Graduate Students\nWhen: Wednesday, May 7\nTime: 9:00–10:30 AM (EST)\nLocation: via Zoom Webinar\nRegistration is required: yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_lgaIB8RgTmqi-iLozbHl2A )\nShould you have any questions, please email us at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\nWe hope to meet you virtually in May!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/applying-for-your-study-permit-a-guide-for-graduate-students/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
