SUMMARY:Recruitment Session: Ipsos
DESCRIPTION:Join Ipsos for an Exclusive Event!\nIpsos is excited to invite students currently pursuing a bachelor’s degree or higher in analytical or insights-focused fields (such as economics, marketing, psychology, sociology, statistics, or related programs) to our upcoming private event. This is a fantastic opportunity to learn about Ipsos, explore our vibrant company culture, and discover potential career paths in the world of market research.\nEvent Details:\n\nDate: April 9th, 2025\nTime: 9:00 AM – 12:30 PM\nLocation: Ipsos Toronto Office\n\nAt this event, you’ll:\n\nGain an insider’s perspective on Ipsos and what it’s like to work with us.\nExplore exciting career opportunities in market research and analytics.\nNetwork directly with our hiring teams and get valuable insights into different career paths.\n\nRegister on Experience York! ( https://experience.yorku.ca/entityRedirect.htm?eventId=4693 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/recruitment-session-ipsos/
ORGANIZER;CN=Career Centre:MAILTO:career@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Co-op &amp; Career Centre,Students
