SUMMARY:Scholars’ Hub @ Home | The Trump Regime’s Predatory Imperial Moves
DESCRIPTION:Join us on April 3 for a provocative discussion with Ilan Kapoor, Professor of Critical Development Studies, Faculty of Environmental and Urban Change. He will address the political, economic and psychosocial factors explaining the Trump regime’s recent trade and land grab moves against the likes of Canada, Ukraine, Gaza, Greenland, and the Panama Canal. Professor Kapoor will also assess the likelihood of their success/failure.\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/scholars-hub-home-the-trump-regimes-predatory-imperial-moves/
