SUMMARY:Recruitment Info Session: Get Hired to Work On Campus!
DESCRIPTION:Want to learn how you can make money working on campus during Summer 2025? Attend a Get Hired to Work On Campus! Work/Study Information Session to learn more.\nIn this session, you’ll learn about:\n\nApplication deadlines\nWhat types of jobs will be available and where to apply\nEligibility requirements\nHow to put forward the best application\n\nNow more about this event on Experience York!\n
