SUMMARY:Tests, Midterms, Exams, Oh My! (Spirit Day Edition)
DESCRIPTION:Join Learning Skills Services to celebrate York Spirit Day! Do you have a test coming up? Learn tips and strategies you can use before, during, and after your test to feel prepared and confident. This workshop will also touch on strategies for answering different types of test questions and managing test nervousness. \n\nTest-taking tips and strategies!\nFriendly support and advice!\nGiveaways and prizes to be won!\nShow your #YUSpirit!\n\nThis is a hybrid event! Attendees can join in person in Ross South 117D or online via Zoom.\nRegister here! https://forms.office.com/r/qNTgUsCMgj ( https://forms.office.com/r/qNTgUsCMgj )\nImportant Notes: \n\nYou must register for this workshop with your YorkU email address. \nAfter registering, you will receive a confirmation email (if attending online) or a reminder email (if attending in-person).\nIf you are attending online, please read the confirmation email carefully for important information about how to login, how to access the presentation slides, and more helpful tips. \nHave questions about our workshops or how to register? See our workshops website and Frequently Asked Questions.  \nIn addition to workshops, Learning Skills Services has online resources for all of our workshop topics  \n\nThis workshop is hosted by Learning Skills Services \n
