SUMMARY:Eco-Arts & Media Festival: Art Exhibition Opening of Nature’s Wild and Newly Renovated Wild Garden Media Centre Opening
DESCRIPTION:\n\nDouble event\nArt Exhibition Opening of Nature’s Wild and the Newly Renovated Wild Garden Media Centre Opening\nTime: 6:00 PM\nLocation: Crossroads Gallery, HNES 283, 104 Scholars Walk\nTitle: Let Us Rot: Understanding Death Through Multispecies and Creative Collaboration\nArtist: Sabrina Rose Capista\nArt Exhibition\nLet Us Rot is a research-creation project that uses mixed media visual arts to explore rot, decomposition, and death as a vital component to the life of human and non-human species alike. This collection of works uses found organic materials in combination with other mediums to investigate what it might mean to commune with other-than-human life as a spiritual art practice.\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/eco-arts-media-festival-art-exhibition-opening-of-natures-wild-and-newly-renovated-wild-garden-media-centre-opening/
