SUMMARY:Deferring Admission: Key Immigration Considerations
DESCRIPTION:Considering deferring your admission to York University because of a study permit delay, refusal, or other reason? Join this webinar to learn how a deferral can impact your study permit application or status. We’ll cover: steps to request a deferral and key deadlines, how to maintain compliance with IRCC requirements during a deferral, and resources and support available to guide you. Gain the information you need to navigate the deferral and immigration processes smoothly.\nRegister Now\n
