SUMMARY:York U Spirit Day Campus Alumni & Donor Breakfast
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to the York U Spirit Day Campus Alumni & Donor Breakfast presented in collaboration with the new York University Staff Alumni Network.\nJoin other York staff and faculty who are alumni and/or donors for a campus-wide celebration of spirit and pride and enjoy a continental breakfast, coffee, tea and assorted beverages. Staff can also participate in fun activities and raffle draws.\nThis event is complimentary to attend, but registration is required.\nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday, March 26\nTime: 8 – 9:30 a.m.\nLocation: Alumni Lounge, 4700 Keele Street, York Lanes, 80 York Lanes Blvd., North York, ON, M3J 1P3 (Across from the YU Bookstore)\n\n
