SUMMARY:Principles for Effective Leadership
DESCRIPTION:Interested in learning what makes an authentic, effective leader? This workshop facilitated by Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) Student Success Mentor Leads will explore foundational leadership principles most commonly seen as vital to success. Students will learn strategies to enhance their leadership capacity and put into practice on an everyday basis. To reserve your spot, please complete our registration form ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/iPY_QHirTueQ_x7xb6kdYQ#/registration ).\n
