SUMMARY:York U Alumni & Friends Night at the Theatre: Life After
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to invite you to a special evening at the theatre. Join us at the Ed Mirvish Theatre in downtown Toronto to watch the musical production of Life After and receive a York alumni discount.\nIn celebration of this pre-Broadway musical, we invite you to an exclusive pre-show York U alumni mixer followed by the musical where you will save 25% off the regular price with our special group rate. Meet other theatre lovers and special guest, York alumna, Natalie Bartello (BFA ’04), the producer who brought the play Come From Away to life.\nYork U Alumni & Friends Night at the Theatre: Life After\nDate: April 23\nPre-show reception\nTime: 6 p.m.\nLocation: Ed Mirvish Mezzanine bar ( https://maps.app.goo.gl/4HfSRfSKMMqpchnV8 )\nRefreshments will be served.\nShow\nTime: 7 p.m.\nLocation: CAA Ed Mirvish Theatre ( https://maps.app.goo.gl/4HfSRfSKMMqpchnV8 ). 244 Victoria St. Toronto, ON. M5B 1V8\nDiscounted tickets are limited so be sure to RSVP today!\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/york-u-alumni-friends-night-at-the-theatre-life-after/
