SUMMARY:Neighbourhood Exploration – The Well
DESCRIPTION:Presented by York International\nJoin us for Neighbourhood Exploration to experience a journey that takes you beyond campus and the classroom. Each month we travel to a Toronto neighbourhood or local destination to discover new hidden spots, local businesses, parks and culture. This month we are exploring The Well, a vibrant mixed-use space featuring retail, dining, office spaces and events offering a glimpse of urban living.\nAudience: International Students\nFormat: In-Person Event. Outdoor event. Requires use of public, transportation and walking the downtown streets of Toronto.\nRegsiter Online\n
