SUMMARY:6th Annual Women & Girls Leadership and Sport Conference
DESCRIPTION:WOMEN & GIRLS LEADERSHIP AND SPORT CONFERENCE IS BACK!\nMay 2nd is the date to join us on York University’s Keele Campus for the 6th annual Women & Girls Leadership and Sport Conference!\n\nThis year, we will explore the Professionalization of Women in Sport, a hot topic as excitement for women’s sports in Canada reaches new heights with the PWHL’s second season, Toronto Tempo joining the WNBA as Canada’s Team, the Northern Super League debuting this spring, and the launch of the League One Volleyball Pro league in the USA.\nFind out more at yorkulions.ca/WGLSC ( https://yorkulions.ca/sports/2025/2/5/wglsc-2025-landing.aspx ).  \nTicket sales begin March 7th!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/6th-annual-women-girls-leadership-and-sport-conference/
ORGANIZER;CN=Athletics &amp; Recreation:MAILTO:
CATEGORIES:Athletics &amp; Recreation,Divisions and Special Areas
LOCATION:Executive Dining Room, ELC | Seymour Schulich Building, Keele Campus
END:VEVENT
