SUMMARY:Swap & Style Sustainability Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun and creative clothing swap and upcycling workshop designed for international students at York University! Bring clothes you no longer wear and exchange them for stylish second-hand pieces from Regenesis. Get creative by decorating your swapped clothes with fabric paint, markers, gemstones, and more!\nNot into fashion? No problem! We’ll also have a mug painting station so everyone can join in. This event is a great way to reduce waste, express your creativity, and connect with fellow students in a welcoming and sustainable space.\nDate: March 18, 2025\nTime: 6:00 PM – 8:00 PM\nLocation: York University – HNES building room 140\nRegister now to save your spot at this link: https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/swap-style-a-sustainable-fashion-workshop-tickets-1261668968849\n
