SUMMARY:Student Wellness Check-In (Hybrid Session)
DESCRIPTION:Presented by York International\nNow that it’s spring and close to the end of the winter term, it’s a perfect time to see how you can enhance your wellness as an international student, trainee or scholar. Whether it’s healthcare navigation, learning what wellness resources are available near you, what your health insurance covers, or even just to say hello, drop by and tell us what’s on your mind.\nAudience: International Students and Visiting Trainees and Scholars\nFormat:\n\nIn person (12-2pm) – 200 York Lanes\nVirtual (2-4pm) – Zoom Meeting\n\nRegister Online\nRegister by March 24, 2025\n \n \n
