DESCRIPTION:Join us for a virtual ‘Ask a Career Coach’ drop-in session, where alumni can connect with York’s Alumni Career Coach to navigate the current job market and explore how career coaching can support your professional growth. Whether you have questions about job searching, resume building, interview preparation or career transitions, we are here to provide personalized advice and guidance.  Drop in at any time during the session to get the support you need to advance your career.\nLearn more ( https://www.yorku.ca/alumniandfriends/alumni-career-coaching-services/ )\n \n
