SUMMARY:York U Alumni & Friends Career Webinar: Navigating The Turbulent Job Market
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an exclusive webinar designed specifically for York University Alumni, where we will delve into the intricacies of the 2025 job market. In this hyper-competitive landscape, standing out is more crucial than ever. Gain practical tips and strategies to enhance your job search and secure your dream job. Don’t miss this opportunity to gain valuable insights and take your career to the next level!\nLearning Objectives: \n\nResume and Cover Letter: Learn how to create standout resumes and cover letters that capture the attention of hiring managers.\nLinkedIn Optimization: Discover techniques to enhance your LinkedIn profile, making it a powerful tool for networking and job searching.\nInterviewing Confidence: Gain practical tips and strategies to excel in job interviews, leaving a lasting impression on potential employers.\n\n \n
