SUMMARY:Virtual Desk Stretch With SCHW (For Mature Students)
DESCRIPTION:Take a break from your studies and join a rejuvenating Virtual Desk Stretch Event for mature students!\n\nIn collaboration with Student Counselling, Health and Wellbeing, this online session is designed specifically for students to help alleviate the physical strain of long hours spent studying and attending online classes. Our experienced instructor will lead you through a series of easy-to-follow stretches and exercises that can be done right at your desk.\n\nNo special equipment or attire is needed—just a comfortable chair and a willingness to move! This event is perfect for students looking to incorporate more movement into their day, reduce stress, and promote a healthier study-life balance.\n\nPlus, stick around afterward for a quick and fun mental health trivia game on Kahoot. The quiz will cover wellbeing topics and how physical activities like stretching can support mental health and mood.\n\nRegister for Virtual Desk Stretch ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/bEspDEIHQ7eHefI8sxewbQ )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/virtual-desk-stretch-with-schw-for-mature-students-3/
ORGANIZER;CN=ACMAPS:MAILTO:acmaps@yorku.ca
