SUMMARY:Creative Arts Workshop: Watercolour Zentangles
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a relaxing and creative Watercolour Zentangle workshop at Calumet & Stong Colleges!\nIn this interactive session, explore the meditative art of Zentangles combined with watercolor, offering a perfect escape from school stress. This workshop provides an opportunity to unwind while learning how creative hobbies contribute to well-being.\nFacilitated by a Creative Arts Educator, you’ll explore new artistic techniques while connecting with others. Plus, discover helpful health and wellness resources available on campus to support your time at York University.\nCome for the art, stay for the insights, and leave feeling refreshed!\nRegister for Watercolour Zentagles\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/creative-arts-workshop-watercolour-zentangles/
