SUMMARY:UHIP Leave of Absence Information Session
DESCRIPTION:Presented by York International\nAre you a student who has recently applied for an academic leave of absence for the following reasons: unforeseen financial difficulties, a medical issue preventing you from studying or becoming a parent to a new child? If your faculty has granted the leave, you may qualify for a UHIP leave of absence too. Come to this bilingual virtual session to learn how to apply and the key deadlines.\nAudience: International Students\nFormat: Virtual Event\nRegister Online ( https://yorku.zoom.us/j/94034308214?pwd=L5xLTa2UDGRSICTBDa5P8UVyZKG1Dc.1 )\n \n
