SUMMARY:Therapy Dogs
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Student Accessibility Services\nFeeling stressed? Need a little boost? Join us for a relaxing Therapy Dog Session as part of Well Week at York! Spend some time with our friendly, furry companions to unwind, de-stress, and recharge your mind. This event is free and open to all staff and students. Don’t miss out on this paw-some opportunity to boost your wellness—one wag at a time!\nAudience: Students and Staff\nFormat: Drop-in In-person Event\nLocation: Winters Room 021\n
