DESCRIPTION:Presented by The Centre for Sexual Violence Response, Support & Education\nTake a break and recharge in this self-care workshop focused on managing burnout through stretching exercises. We’ll guide you through a series of simple stretches designed to release tension and promote relaxation. Learn the importance of self-care and how regular movement can help reduce stress and improve mental clarity.\nFormat: In-person\nLocation: MK 2000 Multifaith room, Markham Campus\nRegister Online\n
