SUMMARY:International Student Year End Celebration Event
DESCRIPTION:Presented by York International\nStep into the Garden of Time and celebrate a year of growth, resilience, and achievement at York International’s Year-End Student Celebration! Inspired by the Met Gala and YorkU Spirit, the evening will transport you through a journey of accomplishments and highlight the moments that shaped our year and the diversity of our student community. You are encouraged to wear floral or on-theme attire to embrace the celebration.\nA buffet dinner will be served, along with welcoming remarks and an acknowledgment of the volunteers who have supported our programming. The evening will include fun activities and networking opportunities, providing a chance to connect and celebrate together with peers, faculty and staff.\nIntended Audience: International Students\nFormat: In-person event\nLocation: York Lanes, 280N\nRegister Online ( https://yorkinternational.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=967777 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/international-student-year-end-celebration-event/
CATEGORIES:SDG Month,Well-being,Well-being Week
