SUMMARY:Innovate & Create: Experience York U Markham Campus
DESCRIPTION:“Innovate & Create: An afternoon at YorkU Markham Campus ” – A Hands-On Experience at York University’s Markham Campus!\nAre you an international student curious about innovation, technology, and creative problem-solving? Join us for this unique event—an exciting, hands-on experience designed to introduce you to the cutting-edge facilities at York University’s Markham Campus!\nOver the course of this immersive event, you’ll get the opportunity to:\n✅ Hear form our International Student and Immigration Advisor – Ask your burning questions about study permits and pathways to permanent residency\n✅ Explore 3D Printing & Design – Learn the fundamentals of 3D printing and watch your creation come to life!\n✅ Step into the Future with VR & Gaming – Experience our Visualization and Gaming Lab and see how technology is shaping industries.\n✅ Create in Our Media Studios – Get hands-on with photography, video production, and podcasting in our high-tech multipurpose studio.\n👥 Capacity: 20 students (limited spots available!)\nThis is your chance to experience university life firsthand, connect with future classmates, and explore exciting career possibilities in a fun and interactive way.\nSpots are limited—register now ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/innovate-create-experience-york-u-markham-campus-tickets-1259978633009?aff=oddtdtcreator ) and take your first step toward York University!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/innovate-create-experience-york-u-markham-campus/
