SUMMARY:Green Career Fair 2025
DESCRIPTION:Building the Workforce for a Sustainable Tomorrow\nThe Faculty of Environmental and Urban Change (EUC) and the Office of Sustainability at York University proudly present an inspiring event that unites aspiring professionals, visionary industry leaders, and innovative organizations dedicated to building a sustainable future.\nAs the world confronts urgent environmental challenges, the demand for skilled individuals in green careers has never been greater. This event offers an exceptional opportunity to engage in thought-provoking discussions, make valuable connections, and explore diverse career paths that make a tangible difference for our planet.\nJoin us for this empowering event, where passion fuels purpose.\nLet’s shape a greener, healthier future—together!\nDate: April 2nd, 2025\nTime: 10:00 AM – 4:00 PM\nCost: Free\nLocation: Vari Hall/ Central Square/ Health, Nursing, and Environmental Studies (HNES) Building.\nKey Activities:\n• Exhibitor Booths (EE and Office of Sustainability Lead): Showcase career opportunities with companies, organizations, and government agencies focused on green initiatives.\n• Networking Hub (C4 Classroom Lead): Facilitate networking to connect attendees with current C4 Partners and their projects.\n• EcoCanada Presentation: Insight into green career projections in Canada.\n• Alumni Sustainability Network Reception: Alumni sharing experiences and career advice.\n \nREGISTER ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/york-university-2025-green-career-fair-tickets-1095575248059 )\n
