SUMMARY:Amazing York Race
DESCRIPTION:🚨 AMAZING RACE STYLE OBSTACLE COURSE 🚨\nGet ready for an epic challenge! Compete in a fun-filled, action-packed obstacle course across multiple locations for Spirit Day #yuspirit\nRegistration opens March 12th and closes March 24th!\nHere’s the rundown:\n1. Location 1Expect a combination of agility challenges, ball control, and physical exercises that will test your coordination and speed.\n\n2. Location 2Prepare for tasks involving strength, balance, and precision, with a mix of movement and fun, interactive challenges.\n\n3. Location 3End with a series of skill-based challenges focused on agility, coordination, and a bit of luck to complete the course!\nImportant Notes:\n\nParticipants who sign up in multiple divisions (Men’s, Women’s, or Open) may be disqualified, so please ensure you’re only registered in one division. We reserve the right to remove individuals who violate this rule.\nWalk-ins will be allowed only if there is space in a heat. We would recommend registering to save your spot!\n\nPrizes for each Division (based on time completed):\n\n1st Place: Free nutrition session or body composition analysis + awesome merch\n2nd Place: Merch\n3rd Place: Merch\n\nCheck-In:\n\nCheck-in is 30 minutes before your heat time – gives you plenty of time to warm up!\n\nTime to challenge yourself and race for those prizes! 🏃‍♂️💨 Who’s ready for some fun?? 🙌\nRegister here: https://reconline.yorkulions.ca/program?classificationId=a7970366-e969-4306-9112-6babbaf77766\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/amazing-york-race/
ORGANIZER;CN=Athletics &amp; Recreation:MAILTO:
CATEGORIES:Spirit Day,Well-being
LOCATION:Tait McKenzie @ 4700 Keele St, North York, ON M3J 1P3, Canada
END:VEVENT
