SUMMARY:Sustainability Alumni Networking Event
DESCRIPTION:Members of the newly formed Sustainability Alumni Network are are invited to the first ever event of this kind. This is an opportunity to meet and connect with York alumni who are passionate about sustainability and environmental action.\nWe’ll be sharing updates on future initiatives, discussions and ways to get involved. Together, we can make a positive impact and strengthen our connections as York alumni dedicated to sustainability.\nDate: Thursday, Feb. 27\nTime: 6 – 8 p.m.\nLocation: Health, Nursing and Environmental Studies Lounge, Room 136, Keele Campus. ( https://emclick.imodules.com/ls/click?upn=u001.wvj1UITJ0gqfV5RhmLyU-2BJ5Q8WIkTM5O9fpm4zmUmbIdirf9X78z3nVIKQ68UAPr5MsC7z605nbLd-2FMA4eH-2FVqe57-2BQGNlopxa7n9q0JkSJIfgi57ajx5bzV6X8uHku6WhWW_l3MC6e5w-2BhjSFQd-2F0ZrtVkaN-2Baoir-2BuM3dtRIlWqk-2BMKuLA6AhexWO8LgrirwZ7snG9AFNyFld-2BA2SQv6zsJUQgJ9T0Uj7ODWyqWh2-2BvAmbPw3EkqjYs6UYJ5WHo9A1oPHoOsaXE4zc-2B3OviHIJXtCQOaPbeH1H0KEYV4sGUhFAzA1mOa-2FChNfz7SdYwPzCeVY2sJZv1e-2FsP7NvvZT3-2BSqpWrgKj2c0elm8fZDpXlDLSjNC-2B2mHorc2t-2BE-2FY8XoQxKcVX9Sy7PDkFujDmOCBovtTKKbSepwIUn4bpblqMRIhNxKrQ-2BPmObUXIlcGuMld9MK0fndPue6A84iV7wfgtWEkVMg2qTn89Zb1Rl7Na5vyLMjNrgIPowZRTG5WGSYqhnLxNdWteQmbWbNcSFP5r1dntGz4BZcdDC9dDYAFFM26YLSaDtgQxlAF6HRnijt63uN2yE6-2FAr1jftSxnKrdDXW-2BoosYmoNBJe3KhWQ0syG1FohjhWdLNYa6qxoeWoBOzbPnEx5CbdgMwHBvhnqUmg-3D-3D )\nLight refreshments will be served. We’d love to see you there!\nAlice Hovorka, Dean, Faculty of Environmental and Urban Change, will be in attendance to open the event. Connect with other change makers in your community and learn about our goals. In addition, as part of Black History Month, we will also be celebrating Black excellence and entrepreneurship in the sustainability space.\nFor more information, contact Yasmine Mensah, Alumni Engagement Officer at mensahy@yorku.ca. ( mailto:mensahy@yorku.ca )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/sustainability-alumni-networking-event-2/
