DESCRIPTION:Explore exciting opportunities at the Work-Study Student Job Fair at York University’s Markham Campus! Connect with hiring departments, discover diverse roles, and kickstart your on-campus work experience. Don’t miss this chance to enhance your skills and grow your career!\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Career Centre” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nSelect “Workshops & Webinars”\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\nEvent Link: https://experience.yorku.ca/entityRedirect.htm?eventId=4676\n
