SUMMARY:SHIFT 2025: DESN Grad Exhibition Show
DESCRIPTION:The DESN Class of 2025 at York University invites friends, family, designers, and industry professionals to their Grad Exhibition, SHIFT.\nWe are a team of 49 designers united in creativity – refining pixels, perfecting typography, and bringing this exhibition to life from the ground up.\nDate | Time: April 25, 2025 (3:00 – 10:00 p.m.) and April 26, 2025 (12:00  – 7:00 p.m.)\nLocation: Avant Garde ( https://www.avantgardetoronto.com/ ) (218 Merton Street, M4S 1A1\nRegister HERE ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/desn2025-shift-grad-showcase-tickets-1276308305499?aff=oddtdtcreator ) for your FREE ticket\nTo SHIFT is to challenge the conventional, to divert focus from the mundane and embrace a more imaginative, bold, and playful approach to creativity.  SHIFT is a safe space for self-expression, where randomness, humour, and shared uncertainty offers a sense of connection. By embracing the absurd, chaos transforms into something meaningful–a space where everyone can explore, express, and find a sense of belonging.\nMuch like the Shift key on a keyboard, which transforms text to uppercase and amplifies its presence, SHIFT amplifies voices, ideas, and narratives that break free from traditional expectations. We unapologetically shift away from conformity, offering a platform where the absurd becomes a powerful tool for deeper expression.\nWe can’t wait to welcome you at our grad show!\nSOCIALS\nInstagram ( https://www.instagram.com/shift.2025/ )\nLinkedIn ( https://www.linkedin.com/company/desn-grad-show/ )\nTikTok ( https://www.tiktok.com/@shift.2025 )\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/shift-2025-desn-grad-exhibition-show/
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies,School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:218 Merton Street, M4S 1A1
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/shift.jpg
END:VEVENT
