SUMMARY:We’re Listening! Library Census Day
DESCRIPTION:We’re Listening! Library Census Day & LibQUAL+® Survey \nOn Wednesday, February 26th, all YorkU Library branches, including our brand-new Markham Library, will be conducting a Library Census Day activity. Students, faculty, and staff visiting our libraries on that day will be encouraged to tap their YU-cards as they enter and exit the libraries. We will also be launching the LibQUAL+® Survey and your participation is crucial! By completing the survey you could win one of 50 YU-card top-ups of $25 each.   \nMore details and FAQ\n
