SUMMARY:Scholars’ Hub @ Home | Empowering Communities Through Inclusive Design
DESCRIPTION:Join us on March 12 for Scholars’ Hub where Shital Desai, Associate Professor, School of Arts Media Performance and Design and Director, Social and Technological Systems (SaTS) Lab will delve into how the Social and Technological Systems (SaTS) Lab at York leverages inclusive design to empower communities and dismantle barriers to accessibility. Learn how the lab’s interdisciplinary approach bridges social equity and technological innovation, creating solutions that prioritize dignity, agency, and collective well-being.\n\n
