SUMMARY:Canada’s 10th National Fair Trade Conference
DESCRIPTION:York University will host the 10th National Fair Trade Conference in Toronto welcoming a diverse group of fair trade thought-leaders, advocates and the business community from across the country.\nThis year’s conference will focus on the theme “Better Business, Brighter Future,” highlighting the importance of collaboration across sectors to create a more just and sustainable world.  \nOver the course of two days, participants – which can include students, researchers and more – will engage in enriching sessions, networking opportunities, and discussions focused on driving sustainable growth through responsible practices and policy reform.  \nFor more information and to register, visit the Fair Trade Canada website: https://fairtrade.ca/conference/ ( https://fairtrade.ca/conference/ )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/canadas-10th-national-fair-trade-conference/
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Environmental &amp; Urban Change,Faculty of Liberal Arts &amp; Professional Studies,Sustainability
