SUMMARY:Innovate & Create: March Break at York U Markham Campus
DESCRIPTION:IN-PERSON EVENT\nRegister at: https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/innovate-create-march-break-at-york-u-markham-campus-tickets-1223686642689?aff=oddtdtcreator ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/innovate-create-march-break-at-york-u-markham-campus-tickets-1223686642689?aff=oddtdtcreator )\n“Innovate & Create: March Break at YorkU Markham Campus ” – A Hands-On Experience at York University’s Markham Campus!\nAre you a Grade 11 or 12 student curious about innovation, technology, and creative problem-solving? Join us for March Break —an exciting, hands-on experience designed to introduce you to the cutting-edge facilities at York University’s Markham Campus!\nOver the course of this immersive event, you’ll get the opportunity to:\n✅ Explore 3D Printing & Design – Learn the fundamentals of 3D printing and watch your creation come to life!\n✅ Step into the Future with VR & Gaming – Experience our Visualization and Gaming Lab and see how technology is shaping industries.\n✅ Create in Our Media Studios – Get hands-on with photography, video production, and podcasting in our high-tech multipurpose studio.\n👥 Capacity: 20 students per day (limited spots available!)\nThis is your chance to experience university life firsthand, connect with future classmates, and explore exciting career possibilities in a fun and interactive way.\nSpots are limited—register now and take your first step toward York University!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/innovate-create-march-break-at-york-u-markham-campus/
