SUMMARY:Meet the Graduate Recruitment Team @ York U’s Keele Spring Open House 2025!
DESCRIPTION:Meet the Graduate Recruitment Team at York University’s Spring Open House 2025\nDate: March 15, 2025\nTime: 10:00 AM – 2:30 PM\nLocation: Second Student Centre, Second Floor Info Booth. Registration is required. ( https://www.eventbrite.com/e/meet-the-graduate-recruitment-team-york-us-keele-spring-open-house-2025-tickets-1205768398739?aff=oddtdtcreator )\nJoin us for a fantastic opportunity to meet and chat with the Graduate Recruitment Team at York University’s Spring Open House 2025! Join us at our information booth where you can ask all your questions about the application process, funding opportunities, scholarships & awards, and the support available for graduate students. Let’s shape your academic journey together!\nDon’t miss out on this chance to get all your burning questions about master’s degrees, doctoral programs, and graduate diplomas answered in person. See you there!\nThis information booth is happening as a part of the Spring Open House event at Keele Campus, York University.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/meet-the-graduate-recruitment-team-york-us-keele-spring-open-house-2025/
