SUMMARY:CHOOSE GRAD YORK (3-Day Grad Lunch Webinar)
DESCRIPTION:We’ve got a series of webinars planned to help you choose Graduate Studies at York University. Let us support your decision-making process!\n \nMARCH 11@ 12:00 pm (est) — Grad Webinar: Learning about Grad School from Our Alumni – PANEL\nEntering a master’s program or continuing into the PhD presents many considerations for students to think about. We want to help support future students in their decision-making process! Associate Dean Academic, Cheryl van Daalen-Smith, will be speaking with both master’s and doctoral alumni to learn about their graduate student experience, and how their degrees have supported their future aspirations. The panelists will bring rich perspectives to future students grappled with various questions and share resources available to graduate students in the Faculty of Graduate Studies.\nRegistration is required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_t_icitLqSH-w_PTrqU7VZg#/registration )\n \nMARCH 12 @ 12:00 pm (est) — Grad Webinar: Navigating Your Graduate Degree with Dean MacLachlan\nIn this webinar, our Vice Provost & Dean (Alice MacLachlan) will be speaking on the role of the student in a graduate degree, degree types and structures in the different disciplines, forming your individualized research ideas, and supports for personal and research development.\nRegistration is required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_egeeoxfaT5OZEjxhHpAuCA )\n \nMARCH 13 @ 12:00 pm (est) — Grad Webinar: Demystifying Graduate Funding\nGraduate funding packages can be a deciding factor for many students when choosing a program that fits their needs. In this useful session, participants will obtain a comprehensive in-depth look at how the funding package is broken down both for Master’s and PhD students. Additionally, participants can gain an understanding about two types of funding, funds that are granted and funds that are earned, as well as external and internal scholarship opportunities. The information presented in this webinar is general and can be applied across different programs.\nRegistration is required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_shfaGFngQICdYXbWsWIzaQ )\n \nShould you have questions, please contact out graduate recruitment team via email: FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA  ( mailto:FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/choose-grad-york-2025/
