TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Science Career Day!
DESCRIPTION:Calling all Science students! Do any of the following questions resonate with you? If yes, we planned a career-focused day just for you!\n\nAre you unsure where your BSc degree can take you?\nDo you wish someone could take a quick look at your resume and confirm if you’re on the right track?\nCurious to join the Science Co-op Program and gain paid, work experience?\nWant to hear from Science alumni who used their degree to jump into various career pathways? Hear their career stories and chat with them.\n\nCome out and attend Science Career Day! Whether you sign up for 1 session or all of them, we’d love to see you and help you navigate career questions.\nDid we also mention there’s FREE LUNCH between 12:30 – 1:30 pm?\nFor more details and to register for individual sessions, please log into Experience York (using Passport York) and sign up here: https://experience.yorku.ca/entityRedirect.htm?eventId=4642 ( https://experience.yorku.ca/entityRedirect.htm?eventId=4642 )\nSee you there!\nScience Co-op and Career Centre\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/science-career-day-2/
ORGANIZER;CN=Career Centre:MAILTO:career@yorku.ca
LOCATION:152 Founders Assembly Hall
END:VEVENT
