SUMMARY:Workshop: Grad Supervision 101 for New Faculty
DESCRIPTION:Whether you are new to York University, new to grad studies or a seasoned graduate faculty member, you are invited to join the Faculty of Graduate Studies’ Graduate Supervision Support Hub for a workshop and facilitated discussion regarding graduate supervision.\nThe online workshop for graduate supervisors will feature:\n\nSupervisory best practices\nResults from student and faculty surveys regarding graduate supervision at York University\nGuidelines and policies you will want to know\nReflections from graduate supervisors and students\nTime to reflect on your intended supervision style\n\nRegistration is required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_ifdvnf1sQluVFG1a4Vgx3g#/registration ) (click link)\nFor more information contact Tracy Bhoola, Manager, Graduate Supervision Support Hub tbhoola@yorku.ca ( mailto:tbhoola@yorku.ca ) or Associate Dean, Cheryl van Daalen-Smith ( mailto:fgsadacd@yorku.ca )\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/graduate-supervision-101/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
