SUMMARY:On-Campus Job Fair 2025
DESCRIPTION:Are you an undergraduate student and looking to find a summer 2025, fall/winter (2025-2026) and/or part-time job during the school year? Our On-Campus Job Fair is a great way to meet employers, build career related skills and gain work experience while studying at York! Thursday, February 6, 10:30 a.m. to 2.30 p.m. Vari Hall.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/on-campus-job-fair-2025/
ORGANIZER;CN=Career Centre:MAILTO:career@yorku.ca
LOCATION:1020 Vari Hall
END:VEVENT
