SUMMARY:Roundtable Discussion: Black Mature Student Experience at York University
DESCRIPTION:Join the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students (ACMAPS) and Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) for a roundtable discussion centered on the Black mature student experience at York University. Panelists will share personal stories and insights on the unique challenges and triumphs they encountered during their academic journeys. This conversation will explore the intersections of identity, academic life, and support systems, offering valuable perspectives for current and future students, as well as highlighting opportunities for institutional growth. Through thoughtful dialogue, we aim to deepen understanding and foster a more inclusive environment for Black mature students at York University.\nRegister here: https://machform.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=383844 ( https://machform.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=383844 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/roundtable-discussion-black-mature-student-experience-at-york-university/
ORGANIZER;CN=ACMAPS:MAILTO:acmaps@yorku.ca
