SUMMARY:*POSTPONED* Black Talk Real Talk at Markham Campus
DESCRIPTION:Join Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) as we celebrate and highlight the diverse African diasporic languages that have deeply influenced Western subcultures. Through highlighting the rich linguistic heritage and its impact on music, fashion, art, and everyday language, we aim to foster a greater understanding of how African diasporic communities have shaped global cultural landscapes.\nRegister through Experience York- https://experience.yorku.ca/entityRedirect.htm?eventId=4620 ( https://experience.yorku.ca/entityRedirect.htm?eventId=4620 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/black-talk-real-talk-at-markham-campus/
