SUMMARY:Choose Grad York: Panel Event: Learning about Grad School from Our Alumni
DESCRIPTION:This session is a part of Choose Grad York 2025, and is opened to all interested.\nFrom diversity in perspectives to numerous financial and personal resources, discover how York pushes the boundaries of graduate education from the perspective of students. In this session, alumni will discuss their life changing experiences at York University and address questions specific to international and domestic students as well as newcomers to Canada. Future students can receive inside tips on how to effectively construct personal statements, create a healthy work-life balance, access well-being resources and much more.\nThis is a free event, however registration is required.\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/choose-grad-york-panel-event-learning-about-grad-school-from-our-alumni/
