SUMMARY:Afro-Caribbean Marketplace
DESCRIPTION:​Discover the vibrant spirit of the Afro-Caribbean culture! This unique event showcases local businesses and startups, offering everything from authentic cuisine and handmade crafts to innovative services. Connect with dynamic entrepreneurs, explore diverse products, and celebrate the rich heritage of our community. Join us to support and uplift Afro-Caribbean talent and creativity at the heart of the university. Don’t miss out—experience the culture, shop the market, and expand your network!\nRegister here: Afro-Caribbean Marketplace · Luma ( https://lu.ma/l0q1gps6 )\n
