SUMMARY:Café historique with Rose Ndengue
DESCRIPTION:Join Professor Rose Ndengue as she gives a talk on Making the voices of Cameroonians audible/visible: methodological and epistemological approaches. Based on her research on the political participation of Cameroonians, this presentation aims to answer 3 closely correlated questions of a methodological and epistemological order: Is it possible to write a political history of women? How? (What sources? methodologies… ?) What are the epistemological and political implications? \nCoffee, tea, and snacks will be served, all are welcome!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/cafe-historique-with-rose-ndengue/
