SUMMARY:Artificial Intelligence: Creative Uses of AI in the Classrooms for Instructors
DESCRIPTION:Faculty Council, LA&PS is having a special meeting to discuss how AI can be used in the classroom for instructors and pedagogy. The meeting is open to the whole York Community!\nJoin Now\nThe different topics discussed during this session will be:\nExploring Current and Future AI-Driven Enhancements at York and eClass\nUsing AI for Your Course Planning\nApplication of AI in classroom\nGenAI Resources for Teaching & Learning at York\nGenerative AI and Academic Integrity: Supporting Responsible Use\nFurther information can be found in the event poster ( https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/AI-FC-Special-Meeting-Poster.pdf ).\n
