SUMMARY:Sustainability Alumni Networking Event
DESCRIPTION:We’re thrilled to welcome you to the newly formed Sustainability Alumni Network ( https://www.yorku.ca/alumniandfriends/york-university-sustainability-alumni-network/ )! Whether you graduated recently or years ago, we’re excited to bring together a community of alumni passionate about sustainability and environmental action.\nOur mission is to create a network that strengthens our connections to each other and to York U, supporting personal and professional growth through shared experiences and insights. Together, we’re building a space where sustainability-minded alumni can collaborate, learn and inspire each other, making a positive impact both locally and globally. Over time, we aim to foster meaningful connections, share industry insights and develop opportunities for impactful projects and partnerships.\nAs we kick off this journey, we’re also preparing for our upcoming Networking Launch Event – an opportunity to connect face-to-face, and introduce you to our goals and enjoy some light refreshments. We’d love to see you there!\nEvent Details:\nDate: Thursday, Feb. 27\nTime: 6-8 p.m.\nLocation: Health, Nursing and Environmental Studies Lounge, Room 136, Keele Campus.\nThis event is just the beginning. Whether you’re able to attend or not, we’ll be sharing updates on future initiatives, discussions, and ways for you to get involved. Our goal is to make this network as engaging and valuable as possible, and your input will be crucial in shaping its direction. Thank you for being part of this exciting new community. Here’s to making a positive impact together and to strengthening our connections as York University alumni dedicated to sustainability.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/sustainability-alumni-networking-event/
ORGANIZER;CN=Office of Alumni Engagement:MAILTO:alumni@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni,Sustainability
