SUMMARY:Webinar for Incoming Grad Students – Applying for Your Study Permit: A Guide for Graduate Students
DESCRIPTION:Planning to begin your graduate studies at York University? This webinar will cover important information to help you with applying for your Canadian study permit. Our licensed immigration specialists will walk you through key topics, including: o Required documents and how to prepare a complete application o Understanding the Provincial Attestation Letter (PAL) process o Tips for avoiding common application mistakes There will also be time for your questions at the end of the session!\nRegister Now\n
