SUMMARY:Welcome to York U: Immigration Tips and Next Steps for International Students
DESCRIPTION:Congratulations on your admission to York University! Join us for a live webinar designed to help you take the next steps in your journey to study in Canada. This session, led by a licensed immigration specialist from York International, will provide an overview of the study permit application process, introduce the services available to support you and guide you through important next steps, such as accepting your offer and paying your deposit. We’ll also touch on the benefits of studying in Canada, including opportunities for work experience and pathways after graduation. Co-hosted with the International Recruitment Office, it’s the perfect starting point as you prepare for your exciting future at York University!\nRegister Now\n
