SUMMARY:York Lions Basketball – Celebrating Black History Month
DESCRIPTION:Join the York Lions varsity basketball teams at the Tait McKenzie on Saturday, February 1st as they take on the Toronto Varsity Blues in our annual Black History Month games.  The women tip-off at 6pm with the men following at 8pm!\nIn this annual celebration of Black culture, you will enjoy a live DJ, bake sale and chances to win Black History Month Lions gear!\nTickets are on-sale at yorkulions.ca/tickets.  York students are free as always – simply show your valid YU Card at the front desk!\n\n
