SUMMARY:Orientation to Presenting on Camera: Tips and Tricks
DESCRIPTION:This orientation is designed to demonstrate how you can feel confident and natural in front of the camera. Whether you’re preparing for a video presentation, podcast interview, or social media appearance, we will provide practical advice on everything from body language and vocal delivery to eyelines and framing. We’ll show you how to manage nerves, project confidence, and create an impactful visual presence. Our expert tips and tricks will empower you to shine in the spotlight and leave a lasting impression on your audience, no matter what the platform.\n
