SUMMARY:Camera setup: Capturing stunning visuals (intermediate)
DESCRIPTION:This is an opportunity to get help with a project you’re already working on: bring your idea with you!\nLearn the fundamental concepts of image-recording (aperture, shutter, ISO), in-camera tools for photography/videography (white balance, exposure indicators) and technical guidelines. Experiment with different cameras and lenses and/or use your smartphone. This workshop focuses on technical aspects, but will introduce resources for exploring creative aspects of image recording.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/camera-setup-capturing-stunning-visuals-intermediate-2/
