SUMMARY:Video editing with DaVinci Resolve
DESCRIPTION:Learn the fundamental concepts of video and video editing with DaVinci Resolve, the popular software that has a robust free version. Understanding of this software’s interface and functionality is transferrable to many other video editing software. Workstations installed with Resolve will be available. Participants who want to use their laptops are encouraged to download and install Resolve beforehand.\n
