SUMMARY:Video Game Preservation Talk with Chris J. Young
DESCRIPTION:Sensorium: Centre for Digital Art and Technology ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/sensorium/ ), in partnership with Yifat Shaik and Digital Media ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-computational-arts/digital-media/ ) at YorkU, is pleased to present Video Game Preservation, a talk by Chris J. Young, Head of Collections & Digital Scholarship at UTM Library. Young will discuss the complexities and importance of preservation for video games with specific reference to the Syd Bolton collection at UTM.\nDate: Tuesday, February 25, 2025\nTime: 3:00 – 4:30 p.m.\nLocation: Sensorium Loft, CFA 4th Floor\nFree: Register HERE ( https://ampd.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=211446 )\n
