SUMMARY:Civilian Drone Open House
DESCRIPTION:The Civilian Drone Technology Open House is an exciting opportunity to explore the latest advancements in drone technology and their applications in civilian domains. This event brings together industry leaders, innovators, and researchers to showcase cutting-edge drone solutions, share insights, and demonstrate their potential to address real-world challenges.\nJoin us on January 23rd for an interactive afternoon focused on drone technology with our partners:\n– Illumin Drone Show Company Inc. who will be demonstrating their swarm equipment!\n– First Class Drones who will be demonstrating their state-of-the-art heavy-lift Alta X drone!\n– GeoVA Lab which will be showcasing their VR Sandbox with 3D models of drones that lets you practice flying and using advanced sensors and cameras with real-world mechanics!\nInfo & Registration: https://www.yorku.ca/cifal/cdoh/\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/civilian-drone-open-house/
