SUMMARY:Seneca College Program Pathways
DESCRIPTION:Join us to explore the exciting pathways available for current Seneca students interested in pursuing Cities, Regions, Planning (BES) and Sustainable Environmental Management (BES) at York University. This session will provide valuable insights into transfer credits, support services, and how to navigate your pathway to the Faculty of Environmental & Urban Change (EUC). Don’t miss this opportunity to learn how York can help you achieve your academic and career goals!\n
