SUMMARY:Change Your World Conference
DESCRIPTION:The goal of the Change Your World conference is to inspire youth in Ontario to be the next generation of environmentally active citizens. We welcome high school students and their teachers to this dynamic one-day conference that brings together youth and community organizations from across Ontario to discuss, collaborate and learn how to make sustainable and equitable change in our world.\nRegister here ( https://euc.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=259611 )\n \n
