SUMMARY:January Consent Action Week: Harm Reduction Seminar
DESCRIPTION:Join us for January Consent Action Week, a five-day event dedicated to promoting healthy relationships, communication, and personal well-being. Engage in interactive workshops, seminars, and activities covering essential topics like dealing with rejection, art therapy for emotional expression, and STI testing clinics for health awareness. Let’s learn, connect, and support each other in a safe and inclusive environment. All events are free and open to all York University Community Members!\nJoin us for an engaging and transformative workshop focused on consent and harm reduction. Through open dialogue we’ll explore practical strategies to foster mutual respect, clear communication, and safer spaces in our relationships and communities.\nRegister now ( https://community.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=67687 ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/january-consent-action-week-mindful-journaling-934-515-585/
ORGANIZER;CN=Office of Community Support &amp; Services:MAILTO:jthyriar@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Colleges,Faculties,Students,Well-being
LOCATION:280A York Lanes
END:VEVENT
