SUMMARY:January Consent Action Week: Art Therapy
DESCRIPTION:Join us for January Consent Action Week, a five-day event dedicated to promoting healthy relationships, communication, and personal well-being. Engage in interactive workshops, seminars, and activities covering essential topics like dealing with rejection, art therapy for emotional expression, and STI testing clinics for health awareness. Let’s learn, connect, and support each other in a safe and inclusive environment. All events are free and open to all York University Community Members!\nJoin us for art therapy, where you can explore emotions, reduce stress, and promote healing through the creative process of painting. The art workshop is planned to run for one hour, but we have the room booked for longer. Feel free to stay and continue painting or creating if you’d like after the workshop officially ends!\nRegister Now\n
