SUMMARY:AMPD Spring Open House 2025: Keele Campus
DESCRIPTION:Come and live the York University student experience as you engage with your program, meet our welcoming community and explore spaces you may call home, one day soon!\nIn this flexible event spanning our Keele campus, guests will have an opportunity to discover our academic programs, tour campus facilities and speak with professors, students and staff.\nExperience all that AMPD ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/ ) has to offer as you discover our exciting programs.\nIn this dynamic event at York University’s Keele campus, guests will have the opportunity to explore the School of the Arts, Media, Performance and Design ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/ ). Tour our world-class facilities ( https://virtualtour.ampd.yorku.ca/yorku/home/tours/ ), meet with students, and staff, and discover our innovative programs in fields such as Cinema and Media Arts ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-cinema-and-media-arts/ ), Music ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-music/ ), Visual Art and Art History ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-visual-art-and-art-history/ ), Design ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-design/ ), Computational Arts ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-computational-arts/ ), Theatre, Dance and Performance ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-theatre-dance-and-performance/ ) and Integrative Arts ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/integrative-arts/?gad_source=1&gclid=Cj0KCQjw99e4BhDiARIsAISE7P_yUXVkAW7BmJBwXke9KGCK4981L0NcI1oiEoOVoVtY8wWZMjS1VcgaAkQhEALw_wcB&gclsrc=aw.ds ). Take advantage of this event to learn about unique creative opportunities, from interdisciplinary collaborations to the latest in technology. You’ll also have the chance to connect with our current student ambassadors while exploring our classrooms, studios, art galleries, practice rooms, and performance spaces.\nAdmissions representatives will also be available to guide you through the application process, discuss financial aid options, and introduce you to essential student support services that will enhance your experience on campus. Bring all of your questions about life on campus, clubs, events, athletics and more. We can’t wait to see you!\nAMPD Spring Open House 2025\nSaturday, March 15, 2025\n10:00 a.m. – 2:30 p.m.\nAccolade West Building  ( https://maps.info.yorku.ca/2010/06/accolade-west/ )(Main Lobby)\n89 York Boulevard, York University Keele Campus\nRegister HERE ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/york-university-spring-open-house-2025-keele-campus-tickets-1148803093979 )\nAll ages and grade levels are welcome! If you are considering York in your future, we’d love to answer your questions, share information about our programs, and encourage your exploration.\nLet’s do it, Future Lions – We can’t wait to see you!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/york-university-spring-open-house-2025-keele-campus/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:Accolade West - York Univesriy @ 4747 Keele Street
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/fallcampus.jpg
END:VEVENT
