SUMMARY:Reckitt Virtual Information Session
DESCRIPTION:This event is open to all 3rd & 4th year YorkU Students who are considering a summer internship! (Schulich 3rd & 4th year BBA & MBA students are also welcome and should register via Handshake here- https://yorku.joinhandshake.com/edu/events/1685018).\nSchulich’s Centre for Career Design invites you to the Reckitt Virtual Information Session hosted on Tuesday February 11th, from 11:30AM -1:00 PM EST.\nCalling all summer interns! Are you looking for a fun and fulfilling summer internship working with some of the top brands in the CPG industry? If so, you are lucky to be reading this!\nReckitt is home to brands such as Lysol, Finish, Enfamil, Woolite and so much more. With internship positions in Sales, Marketing, Regulatory, Finance and Supply we are looking for top talent to join us this summer. Don’t miss our virtual info session happening on February 11 at 11:30am EST where you will be able to chat with our team and gain early access to the job posting before it is released to the public! See you soon Schulich!\nAbout Reckitt Benckiser\nEvery day, in everything we do, our purpose is to protect, heal and nurture in the relentless pursuit of a cleaner, healthier world. And we have a fight on our hands. A fight to make access to the highest quality hygiene, wellness and nourishment a right and not a privilege. Each of our products is designed to do exactly this. Our well-loved brands have been making a difference to people’s daily lives around the world for more than 200 years. Brands including: Durex, Dettol, Enfamil, Nurofen, Strepsils, Gaviscon, Mucinex, Nutramigen, Lysol, Harpic, Cillit Bang, Finish and Vanish.\nBy 2030, our ambition is to reach half of the world, every year. We’re a growing global community of over 43,000 people on a journey of transformation and sustainable growth. Together, our success will continue to positively impact communities everywhere, for a healthier planet and a fairer society.\nWant to learn more about us? Visit reckitt.com.\nNOTE: York students must use their @yorku.ca email address to register. This event is NOT OPEN to Non-York students or recent grads. The attendance link will be sent to you via email prior to the event.\nAs spots are limited we encourage you to register early to secure your place. Don’t miss this chance to engage with Reckitt and explore their exciting Summer internship opportunities!\nREGISTER HERE: https://schulich.co1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_2gyeCbSl7zpVoqy  ( https://schulich.co1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_2gyeCbSl7zpVoqy )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/reckitt-virtual-information-session/
CATEGORIES:Schulich School of Business
LOCATION:(URL will be provided in the email confirmation)
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/reckitt_logo.jpg
END:VEVENT
