SUMMARY:Write to Win: Writing a Valuable Statement
DESCRIPTION:This workshop aims to provide critical guidance to students applying for scholarships. Key areas of focus include how to write an exceptional scholarship statement, drawing from your personal, professional, and academic experiences and achievements. The workshop will be hosted and facilitated by the Black Excellence of York University (BE YU) Student Leads (Awwal Abass, Hiba Yassin, and James Ehiagwina), who have been honored with multiple scholarships and awards both within and outside of York University throughout their respective studies and disciplines.\nReserve your spot ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/qTM2q-XjQtiqYYy2BYKsug#/registration ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/write-to-win-writing-a-valuable-statement/
