SUMMARY:Leading with Patience
DESCRIPTION:This workshop facilitated by the Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) Team will examine the importance of patience in the leadership workplace. Explore different mechanisms to help you encourage patience in school and in the workplace. Through building on these skills, you will understand how to be resilient through patience, allowing you to become a powerful leader in theory and in practice.\nReserve your spot here ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJElcOCurjMtHdApEy6o3jW7ua50WK2VYtjP#/registration ).\n
