SUMMARY:Blue Monday Pop-Up Event
DESCRIPTION:Have you heard of Blue Monday? 💙 It’s the third Monday of January, often called the “saddest day of the year.” This day can feel tough due to cold weather, post-holiday blues and the pressure of a new semester.\nBut remember, you’re not alone, and we’re here to support you! 🌟 Join us on Jan. 22 for a special event to brighten your day with:\n☕ Free hot chocolate & popcorn\n💬 Friendly conversations with your peer mentors\n📚 Info on health & wellness resources\n \n \n
