SUMMARY:Prison Ecologies: A Conversation with Christophe Lewis, Lindsay Jennings and Vanessa
DESCRIPTION:The field of prison ecologies is growing, but to date most of the discussion has been abstract and has not included people with lived experience of incarceration. This session explores the ecological dimensions of the prison industrial complex as constitutive of lived relationships. Many dimensions of the nascent field of prison ecologies will be discussed in relation to the lived realities of long-lasting destructive impacts of incarceration.\nRegister here ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_jePeAqqURdeYMYDWuY_-GA#/registration ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/prison-ecologies-a-conversation-with-christophe-lewis-lindsay-jennings-and-vanessa/
