SUMMARY:Tour Night at the Allan I. Carswell Observatory
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a tour night at Allan I. Carswell Observatory every Wednesday 5:30-7:30 pm EST! During this tour you will get a chance to look at and learn about the 60 centi-meter telescope, the 1-meter telescope and the control room at the observatory and get all your astronomy questions answered. The 1-meter telescope is the largest telescope on any Canadian university campus! \nTickets are free but required to attend. Find all the updated event information and registration links on our website: yorku.ca/science/observatory/\n
