SUMMARY:Scholars’ Hub @ Home | Understanding Heart Health
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a discussion on the causes of atrial fibrillation, the most common arrhythmia of the heart and potential strategies for treating and preventing it. We will hear from Professor Backx, an expert on mechanisms of cardiac arrhythmias, inflammation of the heart, making heart tissues from stem cells and understanding the effects of exercise on heart function.\n\n
