SUMMARY:Experience Grad York: Looking Ahead–Applying to Graduate School in 2027
DESCRIPTION:This session will go over how to best prepare for graduate school applications when you still have a few years to go before formally applying. We’ll talk about application requirements and how you can start, or continue, to meet and exceed them.\nThis session is meant for folks who are currently in their undergraduate program, and plan on applying to graduate studies at least two years in the future if not more.\nYou are also welcome to attend if you are no longer in an undergraduate program, but still do not plan on applying to graduate studies for at least two years in the future if not more.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_Fh_LV-A4QQmLDwrvFwA-aA ).\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/experience-grad-york-looking-ahead-applying-to-graduate-school-in-2027/
