SUMMARY:Visas, Study Permits, Work Permits & More with York International
DESCRIPTION:In this session, a Student Advisor and Immigration Specialist from York International will go over the study permit and visa application process. They will provide tips on how to make a strong application, helps you understand the recent updates from Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada (IRCC) and provides information on any current travel restrictions to Canada.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_Bwmi25WOSnWbXk1z255kAg ).\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy.\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
