SUMMARY:Audio Recording & Audio Editing with Reaper
DESCRIPTION:Learn the basics of multitrack digital audio production to start creating high-quality audio content for podcasts, music projects, audio storytelling or research presentations. This hands-on session will use Reaper, a versatile digital audio workstation (DAW) and will cover initial setup, recording, editing, effects, and final rendering.\nParticipants are encouraged to bring their own laptops with Reaper installed (a free evaluation version is available). No prior experience with audio production is required.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/audio-recording-audio-editing-with-reaper/
