SUMMARY:Overview of Scoping and Systematic Reviews
DESCRIPTION:This workshop is an overview of scoping and systematic reviews; similarities and differences between these reviews, when to conduct each review. We will cover database selection, as well as keyword search strategies accompanied by hands-on rigorous database searching of two or three databases and different functionalities of each database. You will also learn how to translate a search from one database to another.\n
