SUMMARY:Introduction to Zotero: Citations and Bibliographies Made Easy
DESCRIPTION:Zotero is the best tool for managing citations and research—and it’s free and open source. This introductory hands-on workshop will teach you how to use it to organize your citations and create your bibliographies. If you’re new to writing and citing, Zotero can make things much easier: press a button and it will generate your bibliography! But even if you’ve been researching and writing for a while, it’s never to late to see what Zotero can do and how it can help. No experience required. This workshop covers just the basics, and the others in the series go deeper.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/introduction-to-zotero-citations-and-bibliographies-made-easy-2-506/
