SUMMARY:Orientation to video editing with DaVinci Resolve
DESCRIPTION:This session will provide an introduction to the basics of video editing within the free DaVinci Resolve software. We’ll demonstrate how to import and export footage and organize your files. We’ll also show you the software’s basic editing tools, audio mixing, basic colour grading, and multi-camera editing.\nPlease bring your laptop along so you can download and try the tools we’ll show you!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/orientation-to-video-editing-with-davinci-resolve/
