SUMMARY:Transfer Student Orientation (Winter term)
DESCRIPTION:We are thrilled to invite you to our Transfer Student Orientation. An event designed to help you navigate your new academic journey and ensure a successful start to the term. This orientation session will highlight the issues transfer students face as they transition to university, explore strategies for transfer student success, and provide an overview of campus resources that can support academic and personal success at York.\n📅Event details\nWhen: Wednesday, Jan. 8 at 5 p.m. (Eastern Time)\nWhere: Virtual via Zoom\n🔗Register in avance\nClick here to register for the meeting.\nOnce you register, you’ll receive a confirmation email with details on how to join the meeting.\n🎓Why attend?\n\nParticipants will be familiar with the prevailing issues faced by transfer students based on academic literature and our lived experience supporting transfer students.\nParticipants will be able to apply a range of strategies to support their academic and personal success.\nParticipants will identify a range of campus resources that will support their well-being and success at York.\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/transfer-student-orientation-winter-term/
CATEGORIES:Colleges,Faculties,Students,the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students
LOCATION:Atkinson Centre for Mature &amp; Part-Time Students @ Zoom Meeting
