DESCRIPTION:Student Counselling, Health & Well-being (SCHW) is hosting an in-person support group for York’s 2SLGBTQIA+ students, facilitated by counsellors who identify as part of the community. This is a safe space where stories can be shared, support given and self-care nurtured. SCHW looks forward to meeting you!\nRefreshments will be provided.\nFor more information and to confirm your attendance, email schw@yorku.ca.\n
