SUMMARY:Markham Community Skate Day
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Markham Civic Centre Outdoor Ice Rink on Saturday, Feb. 1, from 1 to 3 p.m. for a fun-filled day of skating, hot chocolate, popcorn and more at the annual Markham Community Skate Day, presented by York University.\nYork University President Rhonda Lenton will be in attendance with a number of faculty, staff, community partners and Markham residents. You’ll have an opportunity to connect with fellow community members and learn more about Markham Campus ( https://www.yorku.ca/markham/ ) and its innovative programs.\nNo skates? No problem. Skates are available to rent ( https://www.markhamskaterentals.com/ ).\n
