SUMMARY:Information Session – Graduate Program in Interdisciplinary Studies
DESCRIPTION:Do you have a desire to create your own unique area of inquiry? Do you strive to challenge and defy the traditional boundaries of university study? The YorkU Graduate Programme in Interdisciplinary Studies offers prospective students the opportunity to propose one’s own path to learning.\nLearn more about our Masters of Arts program at our next information session on January 16 at 11:00 AM (EST)\nRegistration is required: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUqfuGoqzsrE9XJ7a_JORr2ZjJ2UVKXS0s-#/registration  ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUqfuGoqzsrE9XJ7a_JORr2ZjJ2UVKXS0s-#/registration )\n \n
