SUMMARY:Danone (Recruitment Session)
DESCRIPTION:Join an engaging opportunity to connect with Danone Canada and learn about our mission to bring health through food to as many people as possible. Find out how you can kickstart your career with us and what your opportunities to grow and learn look like at Danone from experienced industry leaders.\nHow should students prepare for the recruitment session?\nDo research about Danone, understand the area of your interest, have knowledge about the industry\nWhat positions are you recruiting for? \nMarketing, Sales, Law, Insights & Strategy (at least 3)\nWhat are the qualifications required?\nAgility, organization, problem-solving, curiosity, relevant expertise in area\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Employer Events” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n
