SUMMARY:Industry Talks 2.0 with Filmmaker and Theatremaker – Katia Café-Fébrissy
DESCRIPTION:York University Motion Media Studio in collaboration with OYA Black Arts Coalition (OBAC) proudly present Industry Talks 2.0! Join us for an inspiring speaker series where you’ll gain exclusive insights from industry experts, connect with seasoned media professionals, and network at our social mixer—all while enjoying free refreshments. All are welcome!\nModerated by: Moussa Djigo\nGuest Speaker: Katia Café-Fébrissy\nDate: Thursday, January 23\nTime: 6 to 8 p.m.\nLocation: York U Motion Media Studio (777 Kipling Ave, Toronto M8Z 5Z4 ( https://www.google.com/maps/place/777+Kipling+Ave/@43.6293354,-79.5344583,17z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x882b37c42ee3634d:0x71bbaa56a0bb8f22!8m2!3d43.6293354!4d-79.5299522!16s%2Fg%2F11h0qx9c6?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI0MTIxMS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D ))\nFree. All welcome.\nRSVP: yumms@yorku.ca ( mailto:yumms@yorku.ca ). Registration required for entry.\nThis event is generously supported by the York U Motion Media Studio, Connected Minds, OYA Black Arts Coalition, and CineCares at Cinespace. \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/industry-talks-jan23/
