DESCRIPTION:Join Dolly Shao (MBA ’11) on Jan. 30 at 12 p.m. for Mid-Career Conversations. Known for her exceptional networking abilities, Dolly will share her wealth of experience and proven tactics on how to initiate engaging conversations and build and nurture meaningful, lasting relationships to help you thrive in any setting. You will walk away with a fresh perspective and eagerness to expand your network as you kick off 2025.\n
