SUMMARY:Level Up | How to Build Your Personal Brand on LinkedIn
DESCRIPTION:In today’s competitive job market, building a strong personal brand is essential to stand out and achieve your professional goals. LinkedIn, as the world’s leading professional network, provides unparalleled opportunities to showcase your expertise, connect with industry leaders, and create meaningful content.\nThis session will cover:\n\nKey elements of a standout profile, including how to craft a professional photo, compelling headline, and a summary that highlights your unique value.\nStrategies to expand your connections authentically and create a network that aligns with your career aspirations.\nTips for sharing content that reflects your expertise, engages your audience and positions you as a thought leader.\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/level-up-how-to-build-your-personal-brand-on-linkedin/
