SUMMARY:VCP presents LA&PS GOT TALENT
DESCRIPTION:Vanier College Productions (VCP), in collaboration with Founders College presents “LA&PS Got Talent”, a talent show taking place on Wednesday, March 26th in the Fred Thury Studio Theatre (Room 258 VC) from 6:30-9:00pm. The event is an opportunity for the LA&PS community to come together, mingle, and enjoy a showcase of our talented students.\nSIGN-UP to perform and showcase your talents for a chance to WIN a York University Bookstore Gift Card! Performances should be approximately 3 minutes in length and consist of ANYTHING you consider to be your talent (eg/ juggling, stand-up, belly dancing, magic, spoken word, singing, etc.). Please sign up NO LATER than Mon. Mar. 24th at 11:59 PM EST.\nIf you’d like to attend the show, PWYCA (Pay-What-You-Can-Afford) tickets will be available online or CASH ONLY at door.\n6:30 pm – Doors Open\n7:00-9:00pm – Show\nWe are inviting all performers and attendees to contribute to our Food Support Centre on campus by bringing non-perishable items to the show on Mar. 26th that will be donated to the community. Below is a list of the most needed items:\nFood items:\n• Canned Fruits\n• Canned Vegetables\n• Macaroni & Cheese\n• Canned Soups\n• Canned Milk\n• Juices\n• Pasta\n• Pasta Sauce\n• Canned Seafood\n• Canned Meat\n• Peanut Butter\n• Baked Beans\n• Cereal\n• Rice\nPersonal Hygiene Products:\n• Personal Soap\n• Bathroom Tissue\n• Body Wash\n• Lotion\nHousehold Cleaning Supplies:\n• Dishwashing Detergent\n• Laundry Detergent\n• Paper Towels\n• Cleaning Products\nFred Thury Studio Theatre, 258 Vanier College\nTo reach the theatre, take the stairs or elevator on the east side of Vanier College to the second floor.\nCASH ONLY tickets at the door\nPay-What-You-Can-Afford (Suggested $5)\nEmail: vcp@yorku.ca\nFacebook: @VanierCollegeProductions\nInstagram: @vancproductions\nWebsite\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/vcp-presents-vic-show-228-279-226-249-763-867-556-478-261-996-446-464-903-271-308-157-316-337-586-993-479-597-472-890/
ORGANIZER;CN=Vanier College Productions:MAILTO:smendes@yorku.ca, vcp@yorku.ca
