TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:VCP presents SHOW CHOIR
DESCRIPTION:Vanier College Productions’ Show Choir performs a unique show each year, comprised of new arrangements and mashups of Broadway showtunes and Top 40 hits. The show is fully choreographed, with costumes, lighting, ‘and all that jazz!’\nFeaturing an opening performance by VCP’s new Grad Choir.\nMusic Directed by Brian Goldenberg\nChoreographed by Julianna Greco\nAccompanied by Monica Xiao\nStage Managed by Max Kingsbury\nMar. 20-23, 2025\nThur-Sat @ 7:30pm\nSun @ 2:30pm\nFred Thury Studio Theatre, 258 Vanier College\nTo reach the theatre, take the stairs or elevator on the east side of Vanier College to the second floor.\nPay-What-You-Can-Afford Tickets\nSuggested Pricing: General $25 | VCP Alumni $20 | Students $15 | VCP Current Company $10\nAvailable online or CASH ONLY at door\nEmail: vcp@yorku.ca\nFacebook: @VanierCollegeProductions\nInstagram: @vancproductions\nWebsite\n
