DESCRIPTION:The Vanier Improv Company (VIC) returns with a variety of improv and sketch comedy to make you laugh right out of your seat! A great way to destress and have fun with a short 75-minute show.\nDirected by Ryk Simpson\nAssistant Directed by Montserrat Cadena\nStage Managed by Kate Roberston\nJan. 14 | Jan. 28 | Feb. 11 | Mar. 11 | Apr. 1\n8:00 pm\nFred Thury Studio Theatre, 258 Vanier College\nTo reach the theatre, take the stairs or elevator on the east side of Vanier College to the second floor.\nCASH ONLY tickets at the door\nPay-What-You-Can-Afford (Suggested $5)\nEmail: vcp@yorku.ca\nFacebook: @VanierCollegeProductions\nInstagram: @vancproductions\nWebsite\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/vcp-presents-vic-show-228-279-226/
ORGANIZER;CN=Vanier College Productions:MAILTO:smendes@yorku.ca, vcp@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:LA&amp;PS Colleges,LA&amp;PS Open to the Public,LA&amp;PS Student Success,LA&amp;PS Students All,LA&amp;PS Vanier College Productions
LOCATION:Fred Thury Studio Theatre, 258 Vanier College
END:VEVENT
