TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Graduate Admissions Drop In Hour
DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join us for a Graduate Studies Admissions Drop In Hour! Join this group session to ask any questions that you might have about York University and our graduate admissions process.\nParticipants in this group session are able to ask questions via chat, and a representative will answer each question out loud.\nPLEASE NOTE: During these sessions we will not be able to answer any questions about Schulich School of Business programs, or Osgoode Law School programs. For all other questions about graduate diplomas, master’s programs, and doctoral degrees, we look forward to having you attend the event.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_1Xq0P-gAQZa_b0Nk5DCvKg ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nFor any questions, please email us at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/graduate-admissions-drop-in-hour-213-956-347-181-475-873-657-211-842-794-138-238-342-192-115-883-578-836-513-580-266/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
