SUMMARY:Scholars’ Hub @ Home | Drinking water management in Nunavut ᐃᒥᑐᐃᓐᓇᕐᒥᑦ ᐊᐅᓚᑦᑎᓂᖅ ᓄᓇᕗᒻᒥᑦ
DESCRIPTION:Join Stephanie Gora, Assistant Professor, Civil Engineering, Lassonde School of Engineering, York University for Scholars’ Hub on Jan. 29 at 12 p.m. Attendees will learn the basics of drinking water provision and drinking water safety in remote Arctic communities in Nunavut and about the challenges and opportunities for innovation in these water systems.\n
