SUMMARY:2025 LA&PS Winter Welcome
DESCRIPTION:Two days of fun, food, puppies and more! 🎉 🐾 🍜\nMark your calendar and get ready for an unforgettable start to 2025 in the faculty of Liberal Arts & Professional Studies!\nKick off the new year with LA&PS Winter Welcome Days! Connect with friends, get ahead in your studies, make plans to enhance your degree, destress, and have some fun!\n\nFree food (hello, ramen and Timbits!)\nTherapy dogs to de-stress\nStudy, career and wellness supports to start the year strong\nFun activities like board games, karaoke and more!\n\nLocation: Vanier College & Founders College, Courtyard Level\nTime: 11-4 p.m. Drop in! See schedule below for specifics.\nLocation: LA&PS Courtyard (Courtyard level of Vanier College and Founders College)\nLET US KNOW YOU’RE COMING! \nRSVP Here\n \nLA&PS Winter Welcome Day 1\nWednesday January 8th, 11-4 p.m.\n\n\n\nEvent\nLocation\nDetails\n\n\nWinter Welcome Social\nVC001\n(LA&PS Community Hub)\nWarm ramen, hot chocolate, New Years’ vision boards, 2025 goal setting with LA&PS peer mentors, crafts and more! 🍜🥠📝\n\n\nEnhance your Degree Tabling\nVC001\nExplore resources and get advice on how to enhance your degree with LA&PS Co-op, Study Abroad, Awards and Bursaries and the Career Centre. 🚀🚀🚀\n\n\nGames Café \n \nTake on Professors! (12:30-2pm)\nVC010\nForge new friendships and enjoy epic fun with structured gameplay! Board games and Jackbox games!\nTake on your professors—yes, even the College Heads, Associate Deans and Dean JJ McMurtry—in an unforgettable showdown from 12:30 PM to 2:00 PM. Triumph never felt so sweet! 🎉🎮🎲\n\n\nTherapy Dogs \n(12-2pm)\nFC024E\nTake a stress-relieving break with some cuddly pups! ‍🐾🐾\n\n\nDrop-in Advising\nVC028\n“Beat the Lines!” with quick advising sessions. 👉📈🚀\n\n\nAcademic Support Fair \n(11-2pm)\nFC 034\n(LA&PS Study Hub)\nTimbits!! Check out the LA&PS Study Hub located just down the hall from the LA&PS Community Hub! Play “Are You Smarter Than a SNACK Tutor?” And find out what PASS, Writing Centre, Learning Skills, YU Explore, Academic Honesty, and the Nellie Library have to offer your academic success. 📚📝🤓🎓\n\n\nCommerce Information & Networking Social\n(2-4pm)\nFC 034\n \nSchool is better with friends! Connect with peers from your program and get all your program questions answered.\n\n\n\n \nLA&PS Winter Welcome Day 2:\nThursday January 9th, 11-4pm\n\n\n\nEvent\nLocation\nDetails\n\n\nWinter Welcome Social\nVC001\n(LA&PS Community Hub)\nWarm ramen, hot chocolate, New Years’ vision boards, 2025 goal setting with LA&PS peer mentors, crafts, and more! 🍜🥠📝\n\n\nStay Well this Winter Tabling\nVC001\nExplore resources for maintaining your mental and physical wellness this winter with special guests from SCHW, Public Health Nurses, The Centre, and Athletics & Recreation. Your health comes first!\n\n\nGames Café\nVC010\nFeaturing board games and Jackbox games for a fun-filled afternoon! 🎉🎮🎲\n\n\nTherapy Dogs \n(12-2pm)\nFC024E\nTake a stress-relieving break with some cuddly pups! 💖🐕\n\n\nDrop-in Counselling\n(11:30-3pm)\nVC 028\nCheck in with a counsellor and commit to your mental health in 2025! 💆❤️‍🩹\n\n\nAcademic Support Fair \n(11-2pm)\nFC 034\n(Study Hub)\nTimbits!! Check out the LA&PS Study Hub located just down the hall from the LA&PS Community Hub! Play “Are You Smarter Than a SNACK Tutor?” And find out what PASS, Writing Centre, Learning Skills, YU Explore, Academic Honesty, and the Nellie Library have to offer your academic success. 📚📝🤓🎓\n\n\nEconomics Information & Networking Social\n(2-4pm)\nFC 034\n \nSchool is better with friends! Connect with peers from your program and get all your program questions answered.\n\n\nKaraoke \n(2-4pm)\nVC 258\n(Fred Thury Studio)\nShine under the lights of the Fred Thury Studio and cheer on your friends! Learn about Vanier College Productions!🎤👩‍🎤🎶👨‍🎤🎤\n\n\nStudy Abroad this Summer! Information Session\n(2-3pm)\nVirtual\nRegister here ( https://www.yorku.ca/laps/events/summer-abroad-info-session-9/ )!\n\n\n\n \nMore Information\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/laps-winter-welcome-days/
ORGANIZER;CN=LA&amp;PS Colleges:MAILTO:lapscolleges@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:LA&amp;PS Colleges,LA&amp;PS Community Hub,LA&amp;PS Founders College,LA&amp;PS Future Students,LA&amp;PS McLaughlin College,LA&amp;PS New College,LA&amp;PS SNACK,LA&amp;PS Student Success,LA&amp;PS Students All,LA&amp;PS Students-Graduate,LA&amp;PS Students-International,LA&amp;PS Students-Undergrad,LA&amp;PS Vanier College,LA&amp;PS Vanier College Productions,Orientation and Transition
LOCATION:VC 001 - Vanier Renaissance Room
END:VEVENT
