SUMMARY:Media Music Concert XIII
DESCRIPTION:\nThe Media Music Club is excited to present its 13th annual concert, celebrating iconic music from a wide range of media, accompanied by a dynamic video display and stunning light show.\nThis year’s program features a diverse selection of music from blockbuster films, popular video games, international media, and even an original composition by Composition Competition winner, Hannah Mok.\nAll arrangements and performances will be brought to life by the talented students of York University’s Music Department, as well as community members from the Greater Toronto Area. Don’t miss this unique musical experience!\nStephanie Ammendolia, Conductor\nRob Carruthers, Assistant Conductor\nJacob Hendrickse, Guest Conductor\nHannah Mok, Guest Conductor\nJessica Smith, Guest Conductor\nFriday, January 31, 2025\n7:30 PM\nTribute Communities Recital Hall \nADMISSION\nAdvance Prices until Thursday, January 30, 2025\nAdvance Regular: $ 20.00\nAdvance Student: $ 15.00\nAdvance Senior: $ 15.00\nDay Of Performance Prices – Friday, January 31, 2025 \nRegular: $ 25.00\nStudent: $ 20.00\nSenior: $ 20. 00\nBox Office: 416-736-5888 | ampd.yorku.ca/boxoffice ( https://secure1.tixhub.com/yorku/online/index.asp )\nLivestream\n$ 10.00\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/media-music-concert-xiii-jan31/
