SUMMARY:Students and New Grads – Winter Career Fair 2025
DESCRIPTION:Meet Employers who are looking to hire York U students for a variety of opportunities, including part-time, summer, internship, and full-time positions after graduation.\nMore information\n \nGet ready for the career fair by attending our “ Preparing for Career Fair Success Webinar Series”, happening between Jan 7 to Jan 22.  Learn the inside scoop on impressing recruiters with your resumé, cover letter, LinkedIn profile, interview skills and more.\n\nJob Search & Networking Strategies Webinar- Jan 7, 2025 10am to 11:30am\nResume Writing – Jan 9, 2025 2:30pm to 4:00pm\nCover Letter Writing Webinar – Jan 10, 2025 10:45am to 11:45pm\nHow to Effectively Use LinkedIn Webinar – Jan 14, 2025 10am to 11:30am\nJob Search and Networking Strategies webinar – Jan 16, 2025 2pm to 3:30pm\nResumé Writing Webinar – Jan 17, 2025 10am to 11:30am\nCover Letter Writing Webinar – Jan 17, 2025 11:45am to 12:30pm\n\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Employer Events” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n
