SUMMARY:Jazz Festival 2025
DESCRIPTION:The York University Jazz Festival, running March 31 – April 2, showcases rising young talent from York University’s Department of Music.\nMonday, March 31\n7:30 p.m.  – Small Ensembles |  | Directed by Roy Patterson ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/roy-patterson/ )\n8:15 p.m.  – Small Ensembles |  | Directed by Roy Patterson ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/roy-patterson/ )\nTuesday, April 1\n7:30 p.m.  – Small Ensembles | Directed by Kevin Turcotte ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/kevin-turcotte/ )\n8:15 p.m.  – Small Ensembles | Directed by Kevin Turcotte ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/kevin-turcotte/ )\n9:00 p.m.  – Small Ensembles | Directed by Mike Cadó ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/mike-cado/ )\n9:45 p.m.  – OP Ensemble | Directed by Mike Cadó ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/mike-cado/ )\nWednesday, April 2\n12:30 p.m.  – R&B Ensemble | Directed by Mike Cadó ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/mike-cado/ )\n7:30 p.m.  – Jazz Orchestra | Directed by Mike Cadó ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/mike-cado/ )\nFree Admission\nMcLean Performance Studio \n
