SUMMARY:York Dance Ensemble presents Here and Now
DESCRIPTION:The Annual Department of Dance Showcase featuring the York Dance Ensemble presents Here and Now.\nThis performance features works by Artistic Director Syreeta Hector, the delicately expressive choreography of Jane Alison McKinney, and the dynamic, powerful presence of York Dance Alumni Emily Duckett. The program blends elements of modern dance with a variety of contemporary styles, reflecting the diversity of movement in today’s performance landscape. Energetic and vibrant, this show captures the enduring vitality of dance while offering a vision for its future.\nArtistic Director: Syreeta Hector\nDancers: Kaprice Myers, Conner McNeil, Robyn Haines, Jordyn Howe, Faith Pascoe, Grace Sokolow, Annie Spence, Jules Vance and Kaitlyn Wood\nCreators: Emily Duckett, Syreeta Hector, Jane Alison McKinney in collaboration with the York Dance Ensemble\nLighting Support and Production Support: Jennifer Jimenez\nJanuary 29 – 31, 2025\nLocation: Sandra Faire and Ivan Fecan Theatre ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/sandra-faire-and-ivan-fecan-theatre/ )\nTime: 7:30 p.m.\nAdmission: $25 | $20 advance purchase until Sunday, January 26 | $15 students\nBox Office: 416.736.5888 | ampd.yorku.ca/boxoffice\nTickets ( https://secure1.tixhub.com/yorku/online/index.asp )\nPhoto by Hana Yeung\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/yde2025/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:Sandra Faire and Ivan Fecan Theatre, 110 Accolade East Building, York University @ 83 York Boulevard, Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/hereandnow.jpg
END:VEVENT
