SUMMARY:ADMS 3520 Final Review Session hosted by the Accounting Alumni Network
DESCRIPTION:The York Accounting Alumni Network (YAAN) is excited to invite you to our ADMS 3520 Final Review Session, designed to help you prepare for success on your upcoming tax final exam.\nThis session is hosted by Meharleen Gaudh, co-chair of the Accounting Alumni Network (YAAN). Meharleen is York U BCom and PAcc alumni and is currently working at KPMG as a Tax Specialist. This session is tailored to students aiming to strengthen their understanding of key tax concepts and tackle challenging topics with confidence.\nThe event will feature a structured review of key tax topics led by experienced alumni who have excelled in tax courses. Meharleen will walk you through critical topics, share tips and strategies for approaching complex problems, and provide valuable insights to enhance your exam readiness.\nPlease note: Attendance is limited to the first 30 students on a first-come, first served basis, so secure your spot early!\nEvent Details:\n📅 Date: Monday, December 2\n⏰ Time: 7 – 10 p.m.\n📍 Location: Virtually on Zoom\nWe look forward to helping you ace your final exams! Please RSVP to confirm your attendance by registering using the link provided.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/adms-3520-final-review-session-hosted-by-the-accounting-alumni-network/
ORGANIZER;CN=Office of Alumni Engagement:MAILTO:alumni@yorku.ca
