SUMMARY:The Ecology of Allyship 2 REDDI Session
DESCRIPTION:In this followup to our session Orienting Yourself to Allyship, this workshop explores the multiple roles people can play in building solidarity across lines of difference, examples of solidarity movements, and personal reflections on how to find your own stake in movements. Please note, this is not an introductory or beginners workshop. You must attend Allyship Part 1 to join this session, or have previous organizing experience across lines of shared identities.\nRegister on YU Learn: yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=1606.\n
