SUMMARY:Black Inclusion: Historic and Current Efforts to Dismantle Anti-Black Racism REDDI Session
DESCRIPTION:This session will follow the birth and development of anti-Black racism both globally and locally, and the historic and ongoing efforts to dismantle it. Through case studies and scenarios, participants will be offered tools and examples of how to respond to anti-Black racism in effective and sustainable ways.\nRegister on YU Learn: yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=1602\n
