DESCRIPTION:\nThe Metrolinx Campus Recruitment Team is excited to share upcoming opportunities for your students to learn more about early career pathways at Metrolinx and timelines for hiring co-ops, interns and recent graduates.\nOur virtual event series, The Inside Track, is designed specifically for students and recent graduates interested in building a career with Metrolinx. These monthly sessions provide an insider’s perspective on our organization, various career paths, and hiring timelines, while also providing the opportunity for students to ask questions directly to our Campus Recruitment Team!\n\n\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Employer Events” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n\n\n
