SUMMARY:Employer Meet and Greet for Students with Disabilities
DESCRIPTION:Meet face-to-face with inclusive employers! During this event, you’ll have the opportunity to connect with organizations hiring for part-time, summer, internship, and fulltime positions after graduation while learning about their organization’s culture, hiring practices, and how you can apply for full-time positions after graduation and summer jobs/internships, in 2025.\nPreparing for Employer Meet & Greet for Students with Disabilities Success Series! \nTo help you succeed, attend our Preparing for Employer Meet & Greet: Diversity and Inclusion Recruitment webinar series that will take place during the two weeks prior to the event. You will learn how you can stand out to employers by writing compelling resumés and cover letters, preparing for interviews and more! Find the full webinar/workshop series on our Experience York.\n\n\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Employer Events” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n\n\n
