SUMMARY:Zynga’s Catalyst Program
DESCRIPTION:Date: December 3rd, 2024\nTime: 5:00pm to 6:15 pm\nKickstart your gaming career with Zynga’s Catalyst Program-tailored for aspiring UI/UX Designers and Technical Artists!\nIf you’re graduating from a Canadian college or university between June 2024 and May 2025, this new-grad internship is your chance to make your mark in the gaming world. Get hands-on experience working directly with our teams and even unlock potential full-time opportunities. Ready to dive in? RSVP for the INFO SESSION below to learn more about how you can be part of our next generation gaming talent!\n\n\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Employer Events” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n\n\n
