SUMMARY:Impacts and Effects of Microaggressions in the PSE Environment REDDI workshop
DESCRIPTION:This session will highlight the reality and pervasiveness of microaggressions within the context of post-secondary institutions. We will look at how and why microaggressions are harmful, discuss some tools to address and inhibit microaggressions, and offer opportunities to practice using these tools in order to foster a more inclusive and equitable campus environment. This session will focus specifically on the actions of individuals and groups in fostering inclusion and belonging.\nRegister on YU Learn: yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=1600\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/impacts-and-effects-of-microaggressions-in-the-pse-environment-reddi-workshop/
ORGANIZER;CN=Centre for Human Rights, Equity &amp; Inclusion:MAILTO:chrwkshp@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Equity, Diversity &amp; Inclusion
LOCATION:https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=549
