SUMMARY:Scholars’ Hub @ Home | Making York an AI-powered University
DESCRIPTION:An exploration of home-grown Gen AI solutions that are revolutionizing administration, research, and teaching and learning at York University. We will look at York’s journey to Generative AI, current initiatives and what the future looks like in terms of technological advancement.\n
