SUMMARY:Trauma Informed Yoga
DESCRIPTION:Date: Dec. 4\nTime: 3:30 to 4:30 p.m.\nLocation: Provided Upon Registration\n\nTrauma-Informed Yoga is a specialized form of yoga that recognizes the profound impact of trauma on individuals’ physical, emotional and mental well-being. This practice is designed to create a safe and supportive environment for participants, acknowledging their unique experiences and fostering a sense of empowerment and healing.\n\nIn collaboration with YFS Wellness. Registration required.\n\nRegister here: community.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=67517.\n
