SUMMARY:Markham: Lunch and Lounge – Good, Better, Best
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Lunch and Lounge Session from 11 a.m. to 1 p.m., featuring an interactive activity on “Good, Better, Best” language prompts exploring masculine vs. feminine language. This engaging session encourages reflection on the nuances of language and how it shapes our understanding of gender. Drop in for insightful conversation, connection and a relaxed lunch atmosphere as we dive into these thought-provoking prompts together.\n
