SUMMARY:Movie Night Extravaganza for Mature & Transfer Students
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an unforgettable evening of laughter, camaraderie and cinematic delight!\nThis fun movie night is designed exclusively for mature and transfer students looking to unwind and connect with fellow film enthusiasts.\nWe’ll kick off the night with a critically acclaimed film that is centred around your passions and purpose in life – Academy Awarding Winning Best Picture: Everything, Everywhere All at Once!\nDate: Monday, Dec. 2\nTime: 6:30 to 9:30 p.m.\nLocation: Nat Taylor Cinema (Ross North, 102)\nPopcorn and drinks will be served!\nRegister here: machform.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=381037 ( https://machform.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=381037 )\nThis event is hosted in collaboration with ACMAPS and YUMSO.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/movie-night-extravaganza-for-mature-transfer-students/
