SUMMARY:Calm & Create at Glendon
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Glendon for a relaxing and creative drop-in event designed to help you unwind and find your inner calm.\n At “Calm & Create: Holiday Card Calligraphy for Mindful Moments,” you’ll have the opportunity to learn basic calligraphy skills and create beautiful holiday cards. This event is perfect for anyone looking to reduce stress, practice mindfulness and promote good mental health during the busy holiday season. \nNo registration required, drop-in anytime between 10:30 a.m. and 2 p.m. in the Breezeway.\n
