SUMMARY:OMNI-REUNIS Super Spreader Seminar Series
DESCRIPTION:Another OMNI-REUNIS Super Spreader Seminar Series ( https://omni-reunis.ca/super-spreader-seminar-series/ ) fall instalment is here!\nThis time, our guest speaker will be Zahra Movahedi Nia, who will be presenting on “Developing A Surveillance Strategy And Early Warning System For Avian Influenza Outbreaks.” We look forward to your attendance on Thursday, Nov. 28 from 10:30 to 11:30 a.m.\nIf you’re at York University’s Keele Campus, we invite you to join us at our lab located at the Petrie Science & Engineering Building, Room 018, 140 Campus Walk. If you will be attending virtually or in person, please register here ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJAlcemhqjgrHNQmGYOaQsCMIyEjmw-hZv1R#/registration ), and feel free to share this invitation with your colleagues, networks and other researchers.\nShould you have any questions, please contact Nolan Holder, OMNI-REUNIS program manager, at nholder@yorku.ca.\nWe hope to see you there.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/omni-reunis-super-spreader-seminar-series/
