SUMMARY:Community Safety Month Tabling – Markham
DESCRIPTION:With November being Community Safety Month, York University’s Community Safety Department is hosting Community Safety Month activities from Nov. 25 to 29 that focus on promoting safety awareness, fostering community engagement, and providing resources and support to address safety concerns. During this week, a range of activities and workshops are organized to engage students, faculty and staff members on topics related to personal, community and environmental safety.\nTabling at all three campus locations will provide more information on the department and tips for how to maintain personal safety.\n\n\n\nMarkham – Wednesday, Nov. 27 at 10 a.m., The Atrium Lobby\n\n\n\n
