SUMMARY:Michael Garron Hospital’s Career Fair
DESCRIPTION:Michael Garron Hospital is hosting a Career Fair on Thursday, November 21!\nThis in-person event is open to all individuals who are interested in learning about working at MGH in clinical roles.\nJoin us to learn about working at MGH and visit the Ken and Marilyn Thomson Patient Care Centre ( https://www.tehn.ca/about-us/newsroom/michael-garron-hospital-celebrates-grand-opening-ken-and-marilyn-thomson-patient ) (Thomson Centre), one of Ontario’s newest hospital facilities. The Thomson Centre opened last year and provides eight floors of modern and bright care spaces.\nThose attending will:\n·         Have opportunities to interview on the spot\n·         Meet and network with department leaders\n·         Explore MGH’s current and future job opportunities\n·         Learn how MGH supports staff in all stages of their career development\nEvent Details \nLocation: Michael Garron Hospital, T1 Auditorium\nAddress: 825 Coxwell Avenue – Please use Sammon Avenue hospital entrance\nDate and time: Thursday, November 21, 12 to 1 p.m.\nPlease bring copies of your resume to this event as there will be several department managers present as well as opportunities to book an interview on the spot.\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Employer Events” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/michael-garron-hospitals-career-fair/
