SUMMARY:Enterprise Mobility Summer 2025 Internship Kick-Off Event!
DESCRIPTION:Are you looking for impactful, leadership driven paid internship opportunity for summer 2025? Come meet the campus recruitment team and leaders from Enterprise Mobility and learn more about their summer 2025 Management Internship Program.\nWith a full-time, paid Management Internship at Enterprise Mobility, you’ll have the opportunity to develop the skills you need for taking care of customers, managing vehicle fleets and building marketing strategies. You will have the full support of your team , allowing you to learn the business from the ground up and to understand how you can play a significant role in seeing it succeed.\nWe look forward to seeing you there!\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Employer Events” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n
