SUMMARY:Markham Santa Claus Parade
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the holiday season with us at the Markham Santa Claus Parade on Nov. 30! Look out for the York University Markham Campus festive float as we’ll be walking in the parade, spreading holiday cheer and driving awareness of our campus. \nBring the family, enjoy the holiday magic, and stop by to wave and learn more about York University Markham Campus and how we’re becoming a vibrant part of the community. \n For more info on the event, please visit Markham.ca.  \n\nDate & Time:\nSaturday, Nov. 30\n11 a.m. to 1 p.m. \n \nLocation:\nMain St. Markham (Highway 7 to 16th Ave.) \n
