SUMMARY:Global Entrepreneurship Week
DESCRIPTION:Join YSpace on in the Alumni & Career Lounge in York Lanes on the Keele Campus for an insightful week of entrepreneurial workshops as we celebrate Global Entrepreneurship Week November 8 – 12, 2024.\nJoin YSpace, Alumni Engagement & the Career Centre in celebrating Global Entrepreneurship Week as we bring together founders and ecosystem partners to give you first-hand, tactical insights on starting your own business. Light refreshments and raffle prizes will be there!\nLOCATION: ALUMNI AND CAREER LOUNGE @ YORK LANES (located across from the York University Bookstore)\nEVENT SCHEDULE:\n\nMonday November 18 – Crafting Success: Insights from an Entrepreneur’s Journey\n\n12PM – 1PM\nSpeaker: Rachel Kirby, Founder, Cocoon\n\nTuesday November 19 – Building Your Brand Identity: Social Media Strategies\n\n12PM – 1PM\nSpeaker: Maya & Megan, Founders, Why Not Agency\n\nWednesday November 20 – YSpace Support and Program Options for Startups\n\n12PM – 1PM\nSpeakers: YSpace Team\n\nThursday November 21 – Navigating the Startup Ecosystem: Resources for Aspiring Entrepreneurs\n\n12PM – 1PM\nSpeakers: Tina Singh, Founder & CEO, Bold Helmets\nSneha Punwani, Supervisor, IDEA Mississauga\nModerator: Marlina Ramchandran, Special Projects Manager, YSpace\nTo register, ensure to select the ticket for the date/event you want to attend.\nBECOMING AN ENTREPRENEUR WORKSHOP SERIES Tickets, Mon, Nov 18, 2024 at 12:00 PM | Eventbrite ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/becoming-an-entrepreneur-workshop-series-tickets-1072992893629?aff=oddtdtcreator )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/global-entrepreneurship-week/
