SUMMARY:Exam Prep for Mature Students (Learning Skills Services & ACMAPS)
DESCRIPTION:Do you have an exam coming up? Learn tips and strategies you can use before, during, and after your exam to feel prepared and confident. This workshop will also touch on strategies for answering different types of test questions and managing nervousness. \n Registration link: yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJ0pde-hqTwuE9BY8B8AibOgRWJfQ068yJP8 ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJ0pde-hqTwuE9BY8B8AibOgRWJfQ068yJP8 )\nImportant notes:  \n\nYou must register for this workshop with your York U email address. After registering, you will receive a confirmation email. Please read the confirmation email carefully for important information about how to login, how to access the presentation slides and more helpful tips.  \nHave questions about our workshops or how to register? See our workshops website and Frequently Asked Questions.  \nIn addition to workshops, Learning Skills Services has online resources for all of our workshop topics.\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/exam-prep-for-mature-students-learning-skills-services-acmaps/
CATEGORIES:Bethune College,Calumet College,Colleges,Divisions and Special Areas,Faculty of Education,Faculty of Environmental &amp; Urban Change,Faculty of Graduate Studies,Faculty of Graduate Studies (Programs),Faculty of Health,Faculty of Liberal Arts &amp; Professional Studies,International,Stong College,Students,the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students,The Centre
LOCATION:Atkinson Centre for Mature &amp; Part-Time Students @ Zoom Meeting
END:VEVENT
