SUMMARY:Understanding Mental Health & Cultivating Resilience Through Self-Care (for Mature Students)
DESCRIPTION:This workshop focuses on the mental health challenges university students often face. It will introduce key self-care strategies to enhance mental well-being, alleviate stress and build resilience. Participants will gain practical skills and learn about campus resources that can help them maintain a healthy balance and succeed both academically and personally.\n\nRegistration link:\n\nUnderstanding Mental Health & Cultivating Resilience Through Self-Care\n \nHosted in collaboration with ACMAPS and SCHW.\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/understanding-mental-health-cultivating-resilience-through-self-care-for-mature-students-2/
