SUMMARY:Financial Empowerment: Building Wealth – Understanding Financial Goals, Investments Basics & Retirement Planning
DESCRIPTION:Join Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) as we explore wealth creation under the theme: “Building Wealth: Understanding Financial Goals, Investments Basics & Retirement Planning.” Listen in as Tinotenda Mutsvangwa, financial advisor, makes understanding wealth creation simple. We can’t wait to see you there!\nRegister for the event here ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJAvf--sqjMuGNP1q59zf5Sm2VUfYzId2zIG#/registration ).\n
