SUMMARY:Tentacular Futures: Creative Technologies at Markham Campus
DESCRIPTION:“Tentacular Futures: Creative Technologies at the York University Markham Campus” examines entangled, emergent relationalities that involve the imbrications between technologies and ecosystems, geographies, and more-than-human actants.\nFeaturing the award-winning interactive art and technology of Megan Smith and Gao Yujie, The Remotions (with special guests Erin Goodpipe and Elder Lorna Standingready), Jane Tingley, Hector Centeno Garcia, Nava Messas Waxman, Vladimir Kanic, Sara Mozafari Lorestani.\nCurated by Rebecca Caines and Marissa Largo.\nDate: November 5 – December 1, 2024\nLocation: 1st Floor Gallery, Markham Campus ( https://www.yorku.ca/markham/?gad_source=1&gclid=Cj0KCQiA57G5BhDUARIsACgCYnywdzJz570z9pXECaYCDLq-v3LR3T7qUFKcC7392fo71hdbe58UBt8aAo-9EALw_wcB&gclsrc=aw.ds ), York University\nGallery Hours: 10:00 a.m. – 4:00 p.m. (Mon – Fri)\nFree Admission\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/tentacular-futures-creative-technologies-at-markham-campus/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:1 University Boulevard, Markham ON L6G 0A1
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/stars.jpg
END:VEVENT
