SUMMARY:EY’s Elevate You Conference: Virtual Information Session
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to announce that we will be holding two information sessions so that all students are able to join and attend to learn more about the conference and for the EY campus team to answer any questions that they may have. These sessions will be virtual and are open to any students that are interested in applying to the conference, especially if they are first and second year students who are pursuing their CPA designation post-graduation, hold a significant interest in a career in Assurance or Tax and are applying to EY during the 2025 CPA Spring Recruitment Cycle.\nThe topics that will be discussed in both information sessions:\n\nElevate You Conference Information\nUpskilling: Applications and Networking\nQ&A with EY Campus team\n\nIn addition, the Elevate You team will be updating the landing page on our EY website with Elevate You information. In addition, students that will be selected for an interview for the conference might get a chance to connect with an Assurance partner at EY.\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Employer Events” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/eys-elevate-you-conference-virtual-information-session-2/
