SUMMARY:[In-Person Session] Shaping Supervision Support for International Graduate Students
DESCRIPTION:\nJoin us to share your experiences, express your ideas, and contribute to the development of our Graduate Supervision Support Hub (GSSHub). \n\n\n \n\n\nDuring this discussion, we will explore various topics, including building relationships and community, types of support you would like to see in the GSSHub, the challenges you encounter as international students, and best practices that can enhance supervision and mentorship. \n\n\n \n\n\n\nRegistration is required | RSVP Form ( https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=GBNTNBFw1E-H8KQ4FsSb0DwH2oovUmFGkcYiM_JNYqhURE1FWTNESDZSUDBEWDRRNTZGMVY2WVVBQS4u&_cldee=_yUsLUIaTFcRf94LLRqSRl-0SlngKLJmKhHqw9iP951QGfzwhBPNqF3coH0yRoMO&recipientid=contact-ad4f1d1d8f00ee118f6d000d3ae92c49-12a7f3d1874c464bbb394e7d3e6d6561 )\n\n\n\n
