TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Networking Event w/ Deloitte x Achev
DESCRIPTION:Event Details:\n\nDate: November 22, 2024\nTime: 10 AM – 12 PM\nPlatform: Zoom\nDeadline to Register: November 8, 2024\n\nJoin us for an exclusive event with Deloitte, where students can connect with industry professionals and enhance their skills through engaging workshops and networking sessions!\nNote: Event is also open to students primarily in grades 11 and 12, as well as first and second year university students eager to build networks and connect with mentors.\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Employer Events” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/networking-event-w-deloitte-x-achev/
ORGANIZER;CN=Career Centre:MAILTO:career@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advising,Co-op &amp; Career Centre,Students,the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students
END:VEVENT
