SUMMARY:L’Oréal – Brandstorm
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to invite you to the L’Oréal – Brandstorm Information Session (On-Campus) information session hosted on Wednesday, November 20th, from 11:30AM -1:00 PM, at the Schulich School of Business (Seymour Schulich Building) in the Executive Dining Room.\nReady to level up your career game?  Join us at the L’Oréal Brandstorm info session and discover why L’Oréal is more than just makeup and skincare. With a portfolio of over 40+ world-renowned brands, we offer a dynamic range of opportunities for everyone.. L’Oréal is where creativity meets strategy, and it’s not just about beauty-it’s about being part of something bigger. Brandstorm is a case competition. Now, you are thinking that it’s just a case comp like any other? Think again! It’s your golden ticket to score a dream internship at L’Oréal. We’re talking data analytics, sales, cutting-edge tech, digital marketing and more that’ll blow your mind, push your limits and sharpen your skills. Don’t just watch from the sidelines-join us and make your mark with L’Oréal. It’s more than just a career-it’s a launchpad for your ambitions. We’re looking for visionaries, leaders, and doers. Ready to step up? Join the L’Oréal Brandstorm info session and let’s make it happen!\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Employer Events” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/loreal-brandstorm/
ORGANIZER;CN=Career Centre:MAILTO:career@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advising,Co-op &amp; Career Centre,Students,the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students
LOCATION:Executive Dining Room, ELC | Seymour Schulich Building, Keele Campus
END:VEVENT
