SUMMARY:Toronto South Detention Centre
DESCRIPTION:\n\nCareer Open House for the Toronto South Detention Centre.\nThis event offers a unique opportunity to learn more about the rewarding career paths in corrections and to meet our dedicated team. Please share this event with your clients and networks.\nEvent Details\nDate: Tuesday November 12th\nTime: 11:00 a.m.-2:00 p.m. and/or 4:00 p.m.-7:00 p.m.\nLocation: Toronto South Detention Centre, 160 Horner Ave, Etobicoke\nTravelling: TTC accessible and limited parking on site\nHighlights of the Event:\n\nSpeak to staff and learn about the following career opportunities in corrections: correctional officers, administrative staff, healthcare professionals, social workers, probation and parole officers, cleaners, maintenance, food services support and more.\nSeek insight on about operations of a correctional institution.\nReceive resume and interview tips from our HR staff directly to prepare you for your next role in Corrections\nBenefits Overview: Learn more about our total compensation package, including a pension, comprehensive benefits, a range of vacation and leave options, and access to many employee support and engagement programs.\nCareer Growth: Hear about opportunities for growth within a correctional institution including professional development, career progression, mentorship, and the variety of work.\n\nFor a listing of active job postings, please visit: Ontario.ca/correctionsjobs ( https://www.ontario.ca/page/careers-corrections )\nREGISTRATION REQUIRED  \n\nPlease bring a valid photo ID and Eventbrite confirmation code (electronic or print out)\nNo outside food or drinks permitted\n\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Employer Events” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/toronto-south-detention-centre/
ORGANIZER;CN=Career Centre:MAILTO:career@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advising,Co-op &amp; Career Centre,Students,the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students
LOCATION:160 Horner Ave, Etobicoke
END:VEVENT
