SUMMARY:Understanding Mental Health & Cultivating Resilience Through Self-Care (for Mature Students)
DESCRIPTION:This workshop focuses on the mental health challenges university students often face. It will introduce key self-care strategies to enhance mental well-being, alleviate stress, and build resilience. Participants will gain practical skills and learn about campus resources that can help them maintain a healthy balance and succeed both academically and person.\nRegister for Understanding Mental Health & Cultivating Resilience Through Self-Care ( https://forms.students.yorku.ca/view.php?id=397019 )\n
