SUMMARY:L’Oréal – Brandstorm Information Session
DESCRIPTION:Calling all York U students!\nReady to level up your career game? 🚀 Join us at the L’Oréal Brandstorm info session and discover why L’Oréal is more than just makeup and skincare. With a portfolio of over 40+ world-renowned brands, we offer a dynamic range of opportunities for everyone 🙌. L’Oréal is where creativity meets strategy 💡, and it’s not just about beauty – it’s about being part of something bigger 🌎. Brandstorm is a case competition. Now, you are thinking that it’s just a case comp like any other? Think again! 🤔 It’s your golden ticket to score a dream internship at L’Oréal. We’re talking data analytics, sales, cutting-edge tech, digital marketing and more that’ll blow your mind🤯, push your limits and sharpen your skills. Don’t just watch from the sidelines – join us and make your mark with L’Oréal. It’s more than just a career – it’s a launchpad for your ambitions 💯. We’re looking for visionaries, leaders and doers. Ready to step up? Join the L’Oréal Brandstorm info session and let’s make it happen! 🔥\nRegister here: schulich.co1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_9S9A8H4uStT3Cnk.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/loreal-brandstorm-information-session/
