SUMMARY:Georgina Job Fair
DESCRIPTION: \nAre you ready to take the next step in your career? Join us at the Georgina Ice Palace on October 24th, 2024, from 2:30 PM to 6:00 PM for an incredible job fair opportunity!\nDiscover Exciting Opportunities:\n\n\n\nCustomer Service Positions\nAdministration Roles\nWarehouse and Assembly Positions\nAnd much more!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWhy Attend?\n\n\n\nNetwork with top employers\nGain valuable insights to boost your job search\nEnhance your professional skills\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nJoin us for informative sessions with our featured employers:\n\n\n\n3:00 PM: Skills Training Centre – Learn about upcoming training and certification programs.\n4:00 PM: Loblaw/Witron – Explore positions available at the Distribution Centre in East Gwillimbury.\n5:00 PM: YSpace Georgina – Discover opportunities in Youth Entrepreneurship and other valuable programs.\n\n\n\nLoblaw will be hosting a session at 4:00 pm about the upcoming job opportunities.\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Employer Events” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/georgina-job-fair/
