DESCRIPTION:We’re thrilled to invite our university community – students, staff, faculty, alumni, partners, and the local Markham and York Region communities – to our first Community Open House event on Saturday, Nov. 16, from 1 to 5 p.m.\nJoin us to explore the state-of-the-art Markham Campus and its unique teaching and learning spaces. Experience the building’s sustainable design and get hands-on access to cutting-edge equipment, including 3D printers, the library MakerSpace with virtual gaming and more. Enjoy refreshments and exciting promotions throughout the event!\nRegister now ( https://president.apps01.yorku.ca/forms/view.php?id=342187 ).\n
