SUMMARY:Voices on the Move Podcast Launch
DESCRIPTION:Migration Matters and York University is proud to announce the launch of its latest podcast series, Voices on the Move, an in-depth exploration of the complex and urgent relationship between climate change and migration. The podcast features expert insights and personal stories from communities directly affected by climate-induced displacement, offering a fresh perspective on the consequences of environmental shifts on mobility, habitability and global migration patterns.\nJoin us for our podcast launch event to learn more about the new series and to celebrate the amplification of the voices of researchers, climate migrants and community leaders from around the world. Register here: yorku.ca/dighr/events/votm-launch.\n
