SUMMARY:24th Annual Canadian Universities Alumni Reception
DESCRIPTION:The Canadian Association of New York (CANY) cordially invites you to the 24th Annual Canadian Universities Alumni Reception. You are invited to attend an evening of celebration and connection, aimed at strengthening the bonds among individuals immersed in Canadian culture and education.\nThe evening will feature:\n• Networking opportunities with fellow Canadians and alumni in New York City.\n• A chance to meet representatives from several Canadian universities who will be present to share exciting advancements and developments at their schools.\n• The opportunity to learn about CANY’s benefits from esteemed partners and representatives.\nAttendees are encouraged to stop by the York U table to pick up a swag bag and catch up with Prikankshit Mor, Manager, Global Alumni Engagement.\n24th Annual Canadian Universities Alumni Reception\nDate: Tuesday, Nov. 12\nTime: 6:30 – 9:30 p.m.\nLocation: Tribeca Rooftop + 360°, 2 Desbrosses St, NY, 10013\nTickets: $60 for York alumni and $55 for alumni who are members of CANY.\nTickets for this event tend to sell quickly. We recommend following the CANY Instagram account @canadanyc ( https://www.instagram.com/canadanyc/ ). When tagging social media posts relating to the event, please use the hashtag #canadanyc.\nFor additional details and inquiries, please contact events@canadanyc.com.\n \n
