DESCRIPTION:CALLING ALL 1ST AND 2ND YEAR UNDERGRADUATE STUDENTS\nIt’s our FAVOURITE time of year – Canada’s Top Students (CTS) is around the corner! Apply today and be part of a once in a lifetime opportunity!\nCanada’s Top Students (CTS) is an event where we bring the brightest and best students from all over the country to join us for a once in a lifetime experience! Build your network, develop your skills, and kick-start your career today.\nWHEN: Friday, November 29th and Saturday, November 30th\nWHERE: In-person in Toronto, Ontario, Canada. Hotel accommodation will be provided.\nWHO: 1st & 2nd year undergraduate students\nApplications are due on October 25th, 2024 at 11:59PM EDT\nWhat are you waiting for? The Scotiabank Campus team is looking forward to reviewing your applications!\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Employer Events” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n
