SUMMARY:NielsenIQ Virtual Info Session (Recruitment Session)
DESCRIPTION:Learn about NIQ. Hear from leaders. Day in the Life.\nNovember 20, 2024 – 11:00 am to 12:00 pm\nPlease join us virtually to learn about NielsenIQ.\nYou’ll hear from business leaders on what we do and learn about our culture and what it’s like to work at NielsenIQ. The Info Session will focus on our Customer Success team.\nWho should attend\nIf you hold or are pursuing a post-secondary degree, this Info Session is for you. Don’t miss out – register today!\nDid you Know\nNielsenIQ is recognized as one of Diversity Inc.’s Top 50 Employers for Diversity & Inclusion and the Timmy Award Winner for Toronto Best Tech Company for Diversity, Best Tech Manager and NA Best Tech Company for Diversity.\nAs per the Federal Contractors Employment Equity Program, NielsenIQ is an equal opportunity employer committed to hiring and retaining a diverse workforce. We encourage all applicants, including Women, People with Disabilities, Aboriginal/Indigenous Peoples and Visible Minorities.\nWe hope you can join us to find out what it’s like to be part of NielsenIQ!\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Employer Events” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/nielseniq-virtual-info-session-recruitment-session/
