SUMMARY:The Big Leagues of Logistics: Amazon WWOps Careers Info Session for Student
DESCRIPTION:Amazon Worldwide Operations is on the hunt for the next generation of leaders to join our high-performing team. As we continue to push the boundaries of global logistics, we recognize the unique talents and mindset that college athletes can bring to this dynamic, fast-paced environment. The world-class skills honed on the playing field – decisive leadership, unwavering teamwork, composure under pressure – are exactly what it takes to excel at Amazon. Our operations rely on the ability to quickly assess complex situations, devise innovative solutions, and motivate diverse groups to achieve ambitious goals. These are the core competencies that make star athletes such sought-after candidates. If you’re a college athlete seeking an unparalleled opportunity to apply your talents in a dynamic, results-driven environment, we encourage you to explore Amazon Operations. We’re committed to providing the training, support, and advancement potential to turn your athletic skills into a successful, fulfilling career. Join us in redefining the future of worldwide e-commerce fulfillment. During this event, you’ll meet with several Amazon Operations leaders who were previously college athletes to discuss their journey to Amazon, what a day in the life in their role is like, how they’ve used their skills learned on the field/court to build a successful career, and more. We will also provide information on recruiting timelines, available opportunities, and how to stay connected. We are currently hiring for both internship and full time/post grad opportunities in North America.\nDate: Friday, October 18th, 1pm – 2pm EDT\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Employer Events” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/the-big-leagues-of-logistics-amazon-wwops-careers-info-session-for-student/
ORGANIZER;CN=Career Centre:MAILTO:career@yorku.ca
