SUMMARY:Amazon Operations Career Expo (Fair)
DESCRIPTION:The Amazon Operations Career Expo will highlight how current Amazonians define their career paths, an inside view into the company’s culture and offer their perspective on how you can successfully jump start your career within the Amazon Network. You will hear about the full-time Area Manager opportunities and during the interactive break-out sessions, you will have the opportunity to connect with leaders to ask questions, learn more about the position and hear about how they leveraged their educational experiences to grow within their respective roles. Career opportunities will be available for undergraduate students with a graduation date between December 2025 – August 2026 (internship) and upcoming/recent graduates with a graduation date between May 2023- August 2025 (full-time).\nFriday, October 11th 1pm-2pm EST\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Employer Events” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n
