SUMMARY:Scotland Study Abroad Program Information Session
DESCRIPTION:Exciting news! Our upcoming 2025 faculty-led study abroad programs ( https://yorkinternational.yorku.ca/faculty-led-study-abroad-courses/ ) are just around the corner, and we’re hosting information sessions to provide all the details you need.\nFA/THEA 3000 3.00: Edinburgh Production Practicum\n\nDestination: Edinburgh, Scotland\nDuration: July 27 to Aug. 22, 2025 (to be confirmed)\nDevelop original live performance productions for presentation at Edinburgh festival fringe.\nPlan international touring for live performance.\nProduce of professionally presented festival production in virtual reality, on screen, and in-person at the Edinburgh Festival Fringe and online.\n\nLearn more by joining our virtual information session (registration via the link) on Jan. 22, 2025 at 11 a.m.\n
