SUMMARY:Leadership AI in Health Care: Strategies for Safe and Effective Integration
DESCRIPTION:Integrating artificial intelligence (AI) into health care is no simple task. Leaders must navigate the challenges of technology, strategy, and operations while ensuring responsible and transparent use of AI. This forum will provide practical leadership and governance strategies to guide AI innovation in health care. We’ll explore how organizations and health systems can leverage AI to boost performance, improve patient care and reduce risks. Join us to unlock AI’s full potential in transforming health care for better outcomes and streamlined operations.\nThis is a virtual event via Zoom.\nRegister now: schulich.yorku.ca/krembilsummit ( https://schulich.yorku.ca/krembilsummit ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/leadership-ai-in-health-care-strategies-for-safe-and-effective-integration/
CATEGORIES:Schulich School of Business
