SUMMARY:Workshop: Grad Supervision 101 for New Faculty
DESCRIPTION:You are warmly invited to join the Faculty of Graduate Studies’ Graduate Supervision Support Hub for a workshop and facilitated discussion regarding Graduate Supervision. To express your interest in participating in this workshop, please use our registration form ( https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=GBNTNBFw1E-H8KQ4FsSb0DwH2oovUmFGkcYiM_JNYqhUOEFITk81Mk9VTjkzUlNSWVVFM1hBRE9PRS4u ) (linked) to sign up. Post-lunch light refreshments will be served.\nThe workshop will feature:\n• Supervisory best practices\n• Guidelines and policies you will want to know\n• Reflections from graduate supervisors\n• Time to reflect on your intended supervision style\nNovember 12, 2024\n1:00pm-3:15pm\nYork Lanes 280N, Keele Campus (In-Person)\nRSVP TODAY! Registration Form ( https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=GBNTNBFw1E-H8KQ4FsSb0DwH2oovUmFGkcYiM_JNYqhUOEFITk81Mk9VTjkzUlNSWVVFM1hBRE9PRS4u ) (linked)\nFor more information, contact Tracy Bhoola, Manager, Graduate Supervision Support Hub at tbhoola@yorku.ca ( mailto:tbhoola@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/supervision-101-for-new-faculty/
