SUMMARY:Boundaries Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Student Counselling, Health & Well-being\nJoin us for a workshop on how to manage setting boundaries in your relationships with others. Boundary issues arise in all relationships, and if handled poorly, can lead to conflict, or even the end of relationships. This workshop will define and discuss boundaries, and then review stratagies for navigating tricky issues in all of your relationships (family, friends, romantic, etc.).\nIntended Audience: Students\nFormat: Drop-by event\nLocation: Room MK2050, Markham Campus\n \n
