SUMMARY:Key Behaviours of a Healthy Team
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Organizational Learning and People Excellence, Human Resources\nUnderstanding the key behaviours that contribute to a healthy team is essential for nurturing a cohesive, effective and healthy team environment, which in turn fosters a positive organizational culture. Research shows the importance of healthy teams and their positive impact on communication, trust and achieving shared goals. In this course, participants will learn and apply behaviours to advance healthy teams, using a variety of strategies and tools.\nIntended Audience: York U Employees\nFormat: Virtual Event\nRegister here\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/key-behaviours-of-a-healthy-team/
