SUMMARY:Black Men’s Grooming in Focus: Past, Present, & Future
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we explore Black men’s grooming and its evolution. Has Black men’s grooming evolved? If so, is this a good thing? And what might Black men’s grooming look like in the future? These are some of the questions we will explore as we seek to connect the past, present and future with Black men’s grooming in focus. This workshop will be led by the male Student Success Mentor Leads in the Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) program.\nIntended Audience: All students are welcome; Black males are encouraged to attend\nFormat: In-person\nRegister here ( https://machform.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=379393 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/black-mens-grooming-in-focus-past-present-future/
