SUMMARY:Drop-in Recreational Programming, Group Classes & Seminars
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Athletics & Recreation\nCheck out the various drop-in recreation programs, seminars, and classes for your wellness that are offered by York University Athletics and Recreation.\n\nEvents include:\n\nDance: Including Mindful Dance, a unique blend of mindfulness and dance with Bollywood, Jazz Funk, or Hip Hop, Afro-Dance, a blend of various West African dances and high-intensity interval training, Contemporary Dance, beginner-friendly dance class where your expression unfolds, Bollywood with the joy of Bollywood dance combined with a full-body workout, and Zumba.\nSkin Care Seminar on connection between diet and skin health, and learn holistic approaches to clearing and preventing acne.\nYoga & Meditation including Intro to Pranayama , Balanced Yoga, Power Yoga & Yoga Retreat\nMarital Arts including Muay Thai & Jiu Jitsu.\nFitness sessions such as Boot Camp & Spin.\n\nIntended Audience: Students\nFormat: In-person events\nRegister here\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/drop-in-recreational-programming-group-classes-seminars/
