SUMMARY:Virtual Desk Stretch with SCHW
DESCRIPTION:Presented by ACMAPS – Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-Time Students in collaboration with SCHW\nTake a break from your studies and join us for a rejuvenating Virtual Desk Stretch Event!\n\nIn collaboration with Student Counselling, Health and Well-being, this online session is designed specifically for students to help alleviate the physical strain of long hours spent studying and attending online classes. Our experienced instructor will lead you through a series of easy-to-follow stretches and exercises that can be done right at your desk. No special equipment or attire is needed—just a comfortable chair and a willingness to move! This event is perfect for students looking to incorporate more movement into their day, reduce stress, and promote a healthier study-life balance.\nIntended Audience: Mature Students\nFormat: Virtual event\nClosed Captioning Available\nLocation: The Bennett Centre for Student Services, SCHW Office, Room N110\nRegister here ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUoduCprDotG9ZwHiBYn-Qc1zrEVWN61BsK )\n \n
