SUMMARY:Well-being & YU Podcast Team – Financial Well-being
DESCRIPTION:When you think of well-being, do you often overlook your financial well-being? Join us for a Well-being Week special podcast episode where Karen Warner, Manager of Scholarships and Bursaries at York University, talks with our host Susu B. about why financial health matters, too. Karen shares practical advice and resources to help students better manage their finances. By the end of the podcast, you’ll see how you can connect to various financial supports on campus to enhance your journey to well-being.\nIntended Audience: Students\nFormat: Podcast episode\nTranscription of episode available\nListen here\n \n
