SUMMARY:York Lions Basketball Home Opener
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Athletics & Recreation\nFeeling a sense of belonging at a school or workplace boasts many benefits for our overall well-being, and attending a sporting event with friends and colleagues is a fantastic opportunity to connect in a fun and energetic environment to help achieve this.\nJoin us in cheering on your York Lions varsity basketball teams on Friday, October 25 at these evening events!\nYork vs. Laurier at Tait McKenzie. Tip-off times: Women @ 6 p.m., Men @ 8 p.m.!\nThese are our basketball home openers and will feature extra promotions including free giveaways and in-game contests.\nYork students are free to attend all Lions home events — Simply show your YU-card at the door!\nLocation:Tait McKenzie Centre\nTickets ( https://york.universitytickets.com/ ) – Students are FREE, contact Kelly Chen chkelly@yorku.ca ( mailto:chkelly@yorku.ca ) if you’re staff/faculty\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/york-lions-basketball-home-opener/
CATEGORIES:Well-being,Well-being Week
END:VEVENT
