SUMMARY:York Lions Men’s Hockey
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Athletics & Recreation\nFeeling a sense of belonging at a school or workplace boasts many benefits for our overall well-being, and attending a sporting event with friends and colleagues is a fantastic opportunity to connect in a fun and energetic environment to help achieve this.\n\nJoin us in cheering on your York Lions men’s hockey team on Friday, October 25 in this daytime event. York vs. Toronto at Canlan Arena. Puck-drop at noon!\n\nYork students are free to attend all Lions home events — Simply show your YU-card at the door!\n\n\nLocation: Canlan Arena\nTickets ( https://york.universitytickets.com/ ) – Students are FREE, contact Kelly Chen chkelly@yorku.ca if you’re staff/faculty\n \n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/york-lions-mens-hockey/
CATEGORIES:Well-being,Well-being Week
