SUMMARY:3×3 Basketball
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Glendon Athletic Club\nGet ready for a slam-dunk experience at the Glendon Athletic Club’s Student 3×3 Basketball Event!\nChallenge yourself and your friends to a thrilling game of 3×3 basketball, where skill and teamwork take center stage. Whether you’re a seasoned player or a rookie, this event is your chance to showcase your talents, make new friends and immerse yourself in the exciting world of basketball. The atmosphere will be buzzing with music to keep the energy high, with delicious food to fuel your competitive spirit and exciting prizes up for grabs! It’s not just a game — it’s an unforgettable experience filled with camaraderie, laughter and the joy of the game.\nIntended Audience: All York community\nFormat: In-person\nLocation: GAC Gymnasium\nRegister here\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/3x3-basketball/
CATEGORIES:Glendon,Well-being,Well-being Week
END:VEVENT
