SUMMARY:Women’s Self-defense workshop
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Glendon Athletic Club\nIn this 2-hour introductory Wen-Do Women’s Self Defence workshop, participants will learn simple, effective physical and verbal self-defence skills, develop their ability to recognize and deal with threatening situations, share inspiring real-life stories of resistance, and have a lot of fun in the process. Women of all shapes, sizes and fitness levels, with and without disabilities, cis and trans women, are welcome to attend.\nIntended Audience: York Community identifying as women\nFormat: In-person\nLocation: GAC Group Exercise Studio\nNot wheelchair accessible on the second floor\n\nRegister here\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/womens-self-defense-workshop/
CATEGORIES:Glendon,Well-being,Well-being Week
END:VEVENT
