SUMMARY:Speed Painting: Fall Foliage!
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Faculty of Health: Calumet & Stong Colleges\n\nTake a break, decompress and take part in this self-care-oriented workshop! Speed Painting is a calm and easy way to learn the methods for making a painting and also about the significance of these methods. Together, we’ll make beautiful paintings to welcome fall.\n\n\n\nIntended Audience: All York community\nFormat: In-person event\nLocation: Stong College Room 101\nRegister Here\n \n\n
