SUMMARY:Well-Being Week Viral Cucumber Salad
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Food Services, YU Eats\nSometimes you just need to eat an entire cucumber. Come join us at the Dining Hall for a refreshing and healthy social activity during Well-Being Week! We’re excited to host a table with delicious ingredients to make your own cucumber salad.\nWe supply the ingredients, you assemble and shake it up!\nIntended Audience: Students\nFormat: In-person drop-by event\nLocation: Winters Dining Hall\nAccessible space and able to accommodate additional accessibility needs upon request\nRegister here ( https://www.eventbrite.com/e/well-being-week-viral-cucumber-salad-winters-tickets-1015861999587?aff=oddtdtcreator )\n
