SUMMARY:York International Neighbourhood Exploration
DESCRIPTION:Join our Neighbourhood Exploration to get off campus and explore the vibrant areas of Toronto as part of a walking tour. Discover new neighbourhoods, businesses, culture and architecture while becoming comfortable navigating the city’s public transit system. Don’t miss out on this adventure! This is a unique way to see new places and spend time outdoors while meeting new people.\nIntended Audience: Undergraduate Students\nFormat: In-Person Event\nDestination: Yorkville (Yonge & Bloor)\nMeeting Location: York University Subway Station (north side) @ 1:00pm\nRegister here ( https://yorkinternational.yorku.ca/event/neighbourhood-exploration-8/?instance_id=16053 )\n \n
