SUMMARY:Fostering Individuality: Creative Leadership
DESCRIPTION:What is creative leadership? Perhaps you are interested in applying creativity to your role as a leader but don’t know how. Join Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) Student Success Mentor Leads as we examine strategies to apply creative thinking to your leadership role, how to understand creativity styles and how to express them, and to apply innovative ways to solve problems and lead a group.\nTo reserve your spot, please complete our registration form ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUpdOmrrD0rHNY1vG9N5f6L29O5Vd_EH4St#/registration ).\n \n
