SUMMARY:Do the Work: Intervening on Ableism
DESCRIPTION:Building on the previous sessions in this mini-series, this participatory workshop will ask attendees to practice interventions in scenarios of ableism, exclusion and discrimination. Groups will brainstorm solutions and try them out, and feedback will be offered to encourage growth and skill development. This session relies on participants being familiar with the concepts explored in the mini-series Preventing Sex and Gender Harassment and Discrimination.\nRegister: yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=1260.\n
