SUMMARY:The Emotionally Intelligent Leader
DESCRIPTION:What does it mean to be a successful leader? Is a caring leader more effective than a dominant leader? Join Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) Student Success Mentor Leads as we teach students how to empathize appropriately with team members, how to lead a team successfully with respect in diversity and inclusion, and to identify and set goals for students to meet academic expectations.\nTo reserve your spot, please complete our registration form ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJModOCorzguHdS3C6Jwwce8vJZKP231ATOf#/registration ).\n \n
