SUMMARY:Effective Insights and Approaches from Universal Design Principles
DESCRIPTION:Participants will develop an understanding of universal design and academic integrity in an educational environment and consider the ways universal design can become part of a teaching strategy. Discussion and activities will offer opportunities for participants to obtain strategies for ensuring academic integrity while also providing inclusive learning experiences for all.\nRegister: yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=1259.\n
