TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Virtual Speed Friending: Fostering Social Well-Being
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an engaging virtual event designed to enhance your social well-being and connect with fellow participants. Our Virtual Speed Friending event highlights the essential role social interaction plays in our overall health.\nParticipate in quick, meaningful conversations during our Speed Friending Rounds, where you’ll connect with other students in breakout rooms using conversation starters on personal interests, goals and stress management strategies. Afterward, participants will reflect on their experiences and share insights as a group.\nDon’t miss out on this opportunity to build meaningful connections and support your social well-being.\n\nRegister for Virtual Speed Friending ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYlc-qppz8tEtR5WvrsfDQieRJrzmRF3WQ- ).\nWe look forward to seeing you there!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/virtual-speed-friending-fostering-social-well-being-2/
ORGANIZER;CN=Student Counselling, Health &amp; Well-being:MAILTO:schw@yorku.ca
