SUMMARY:Leadership Coaching
DESCRIPTION:What does it mean to be a good coach? How can coaches save and/or change lives? This workshop, facilitated by Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) Student Success Mentor Leads, will explore the core components of coaching, what the BE YU program offers in terms of coaching for leaders and how to find your coaching style. To reserve your spot, please complete our registration form ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJwqde2uqjwrGdLvl1k2oqWh_tLie5S-npwg#/registration ).\n \n
