SUMMARY:York’s Fair Trade Fair
DESCRIPTION:The York community is invited to York U’s Fair Trade Fair to celebrates Fairtrade & Campus Sustainability Month, in addition to Fair Trade Canada’s 30th anniversary.\nThe event aims to bring together vendors, students, and community members to promote awareness and appreciation for fair trade. This is a fantastic opportunity for you to learn about fair trade.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/yorks-fair-trade-fair/
ORGANIZER;CN=Office of Sustainability:MAILTO:sustainability@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Liberal Arts &amp; Professional Studies,Sustainability
LOCATION:Vari Hall
