SUMMARY:Do the Work: Dialogue Across Differences
DESCRIPTION:Through a series of engaging activities and reflection exercises participants who take part in this workshop will be able to:\n\nidentify personal limitations to engagement in dialogue across differences;\nidentify what they need to engage in meaningful conversation through respectful dialogue without the intention of persuasion; and\ndevelop personal strategies to manage emotions in order to look past individual differences and hear the humanity of someone’s lived experiences.\n\nThis session is being offered twice in October.\nRegister: yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=1574.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/do-the-work-dialogue-across-differences-4/
CATEGORIES:Equity, Diversity &amp; Inclusion
LOCATION:https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=549
