SUMMARY:Institute for Technoscience & Society Seminar Series – In-person Seminar & Design Workshop with Prof. Koray Caliskan
DESCRIPTION:The Institute for Technoscience & Society is hosting Prof. Koray Caliskan from the Parsons School of Design, The New School, New York on Oct. 9.\n\n11 a.m.: Book Talk: New Monies & Their Materials: Cryptocurrencies, Blockchains, and their Global Communities\n\n12 p.m.: Lunch\n\n1 p.m.: Sociology & Design Workshop: Dismantling Google Search Engine\n\nLocation: 305 York Lanes\n\nAll are welcome!\n
