SUMMARY:Online Public Viewing at the Allan I. Carswell Observatory
DESCRIPTION:Join us every Monday at 9 p.m. to learn about astronomy history for the week, and a chance to view the night sky live through the one-metre telescope (if weather permits). You can access the broadcast through our YouTube channel. \nRefer back to the Observatory site for updated event information.\n
