SUMMARY:York University Live Tele Tube at Allan I. Carswell Observatory
DESCRIPTION:Join us every final Friday of the month at 7:30 p.m. through our YouTube channel to learn more about what we are up to at the York U Observatory.  \nRefer back to the Observatory site for the most updated event information.\nThis Friday, Sept. 25, Alan Chan from the Australian National University will give a live talk on YouTube. The talk is titled: “The Dark Side of the Universe.”\n
