SUMMARY:LA&PS Summer Study Abroad Program Info Session
DESCRIPTION:Please register for one of our upcoming Study Abroad Info Sessions to learn more about the LA&PS Summer Study Abroad/Away Program and the courses we are offering in 2025. Sessions will be 1 hour long and will cover all program info while giving you an opportunity to ask questions.\nInfo Session Dates and Locations:\n-Thursday, October 24, 2024, 2-3 pm on Zoom\n-Monday, October 28, 2024, 3-4 pm in Ross Building South room 802\n-Thursday, November 7, 2024, 2-3 pm on Zoom\n-Monday, November 11, 2024, 3-4 pm in Ross Building South room 802\n-Thursday, November 21, 2024, 2-3 pm on Zoom\n-Monday, November 25, 2024, 3-4 pm in Ross Building South room 802\n-Thursday, December 5, 2024, 2-3 pm on Zoom\n-Monday, December 9, 2024, 3-4 pm on Zoom\n-Thursday, January 9, 2025, 2-3 pm on Zoom\nRegister For Summer Abroad Info Session 1\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/laps-summer-study-abroad-program-info-session-3/
