DESCRIPTION:York’s annual Graduate & Professional Studies Expo provides students and new graduates with an opportunity to explore educational opportunities. Connect with recruiters from business and law schools, education programs, graduate studies programs, professional schools, and colleges to learn about their educational opportunities and improve your chances of getting into the program of your choice.\nFind our list of participating exhibitors ( https://careers.yorku.ca/students-and-new-grads/services-events/gpse ).\n
