SUMMARY:Effective Reading Strategies for Mature Students
DESCRIPTION:Academic reading is different than reading for pleasure – it’s an active process. Learn how to identify important information and practise strategies to become a more effective and efficient reader.\nImportant notes: \n\nYou must register for this workshop with your York U email address. After registering, you will receive a confirmation email. Please read the confirmation email carefully for important information about how to login, how to access the presentation slides and more helpful tips. \nHave questions about our workshops or how to register? See our workshops website and Frequently Asked Questions. \nIn addition to workshops, Learning Skills Services has online resources for all of our workshop topics \n\nThis workshop is hosted by Learning Skills Services. \nRegister here: yorku.ca/scld/events/acmaps-lss-reading-strategies-796 ( https://www.yorku.ca/scld/events/acmaps-lss-reading-strategies-796/ ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/effective-reading-strategies-for-mature-students/
