SUMMARY:Interrogating the Future: Essays in Honour of David Fasenfest
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the launch of Interrogating the Future: Essays in Honour of David Fasenfest. \nThe event includes presentations by editors and contributors to this volume, including:\n\nTom Brass, formerly of Cambridge University;\nRaju Das, York University;\nRobert Latham, York University;\nMichael Burawoy, University of California, Berkeley;\nRicardo Dello Buono, Manhattan University; and\nAlfredo Saad Filho, SOAS, University of London.\n\nRemarks by David Fasenfest, Wayne State University and adjunct professor, Faculty of Environmental & Urban Change, York University.\nFor more information, email msgap@yorku.ca.\n
