DESCRIPTION:Join us and other international students for an opportunity to connect with your associate dean of global and community engagement (MJ Maciel Jorge) as well as various Faculty of Liberal Arts & Professional Studies (LA&PS) professors from different programs in a relaxed setting. Learn tips on how to make the best of your time at York University and how to excel in your studies, while enjoying some free snacks. Register here: forms.office.com/r/jzArdCAzVN ( https://forms.office.com/r/jzArdCAzVN ).\n
