SUMMARY:Mindfulness & Stress Relief for Mature Students
DESCRIPTION:Trying to discover effective techniques to enhance your mental wellbeing?\nJoin us for a serene experience at our Mindfulness and Stress Relief workshop hosted by Student Counselling, Health and Wellbeing!\nThis session aims to focus on integrating mindfulness into your daily practice to aid in stress management through meditation practices, mindfulness resources, and a stress release stretch routing.\nDo not miss the opportunity to start or enhance your mindfulness journey to stress reduction and overall wellness.\nWe look forward to supporting you in finding your inner peace and balance.\nRegister for Mindfulness & Stress Relief for Mature Students ( https://forms.students.yorku.ca/view.php?id=388384 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/mindfulness-stress-relief-for-mature-students/
