SUMMARY:National Day for Truth and Reconciliation 2024
DESCRIPTION:Each year, Sept. 30 marks the National Day for Truth and Reconciliation.\nThe day honours the children who never returned home and survivors of residential schools, as well as their families and communities. Public commemoration of the tragic and painful history and ongoing impacts of residential schools is a vital component of the reconciliation process.\nPlease join us for various activities at the Schulich School of Business to commemorate this important day.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/national-day-for-truth-and-reconciliation-2024/
CATEGORIES:Schulich School of Business
LOCATION:Rob and Cheryl McEwen Graduate Study &amp; Research Building @ 4700 Keele Street
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/unnamed.png
END:VEVENT
