SUMMARY:Diversity and Inclusion Career Day: Indigenous Student & Employer Networking Session
DESCRIPTION:As a part of the Diversity and Inclusion Career Day, the Centre of Indigenous Student Services (CISS) welcomes you to meet and mingle with employers and recruiters from various organizations in Canada in an intimate, casual setting. Enjoy some light refreshments and have fun getting to chat with different companies about your top career interests and what opportunities might be coming up at various organizations. For more details, please contact cissinfo@yorku.ca ( mailto:cissinfo@yorku.ca ).\n
