SUMMARY:Diversity and Inclusion Career Day: Launching your Tech Career: Tools and Opportunities
DESCRIPTION:As part of the Diversity and Inclusion Career Day, join this session to discover essential tools to boost your career readiness for tech and tech-adjacent jobs! This session is designed to guide Black students through the landscape of tech and tech-adjacent opportunities, offering insights into building essential skills, accessing training, and navigating industry challenges. Learn how TECHNATIONs Career Ready Program (a student work placement program SWPP) can support your career growth.\nHow do I register through Experience York?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Career Centre” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nSelect “Workshops & Webinars”\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n
