SUMMARY:Diversity and Inclusion Career Day: Taking Up Space
DESCRIPTION:As a part of the Diversity and Inclusion Career Day, this session is designed to explore imposter syndrome. Join us to learn how to confidently ‘take up space’ in your professional life. We will address overcoming self-doubt, crafting a strong professional image, and using effective communication to assert your presence. Empower yourself to thrive and shine in your career!\nHow do I register through Experience York?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Career Centre” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nSelect “Workshops & Webinars”\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n
