SUMMARY:Discover BMO: Corporate Areas
DESCRIPTION:Join us to Discover BMO’s Line of Business, Corporate Areas!\nExplore the exciting world of Corporate Areas in this focused session. Our team, alongside BMO industry professionals, will guide you through the recruitment timelines, outline what we seek in successful candidates, and explain what you can expect from a career in this field here at BMO.\nThis event features a panel of seasoned experts, eager to share their experiences, insights, and career journeys. You’ll also have the opportunity to ask your questions directly to those who know the industry best.\nIf you’re keen to understand the intricacies of BMO’s Corporate Areas Line of Business and discover where you might fit in, this session is a must-attend!\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Employer Events” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n
