SUMMARY:Scotiabank’s Women in Global Banking & Markets Event
DESCRIPTION:Title: Discover Scotiabank’s Women in Global Banking and Markets\nDate/Time: Wednesday, October 16th from 5:30-7:00pm ET.\nLocations: Scotiabank Office in downtown Toronto, specific location details and instructions will be sent to students who are invited to attend\nNotes: As the event is in person, we have a cap on attendees.  In the registration form, students will be asked to submit a few sentences on why they’re interested in attending the event, and the steps they have taken towards a career in GBM.  Selected attendees will be invited to attend and receive additional details on the location\nEvent Description:\nOur Women in Global Banking and Markets (GBM) in-person event is for female-identifying students in ANY academic program who are eager to pursue a career in the financial industry within GBM.\nThis event will provide you with insights on the different areas within the business line – we have teams such as Global Business Payments, Regulatory Business Initiatives, Global Wholesale Operations, Global Capital Markets, and many more! You’ll get to hear from leaders within the space and how they have navigated their careers thus far. Whether you’re in an Undergraduate or Master’s program, studying Math, or Commerce, or Engineering (or anything else!), we invite you to discover GBM and Scotiabank at this event.\nYou can apply to attend by completing the form below. Since the event is in-person, we have a limited capacity and can only accept a certain number of people to attend. Only those invited to attend will receive full event details.\nDate: Wednesday, October 16th, 2024\nTime: 5:30-7:00pm\nLocation: Scotiabank Office in downtown Toronto, specific location details and instructions will be sent to students who are invited to attend\nApplication deadline: October 9th at 11:59pm EDT.\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Employer Events” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/scotiabanks-women-in-global-banking-markets-event/
ORGANIZER;CN=Career Centre:MAILTO:career@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advising,Co-op &amp; Career Centre,Students,the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students
