SUMMARY:Procter & Gamble (P&G)’s – Information & Networking Session
DESCRIPTION:\nThe Campus team at Procter & Gamble is hosting an info session and networking session and we’d love to see you there!\nThis event presents a unique opportunity to learn about one of the leading consumer goods companies in the world and explore potential career paths with us! Join us on Thursday, October 3 from 5:30 PM – 7:00 PM!\nEnjoy our panel from current and previous co-op students as well as new grad Associates in Business and STEM who have been in your shoes! Our panelists will be diving into the intersections of business and technology in the banking world, speak about their experiences, share what they’ve learned throughout the process and provide tips and tricks you can use.\nImportant Information:\n\nYou must be a current post-secondary student, enrolled at York University to attend\nEvent sign-ups will close on Wednesday, October 2 at 11:59PM\n\nIn-Person Event\nAttire: Business Casual\nWhen: Thursday, October 3: 5:30 PM – 7:00 PM\nTarget Audience: Open to all students seeking Winter/Summer 2025 co-op opportunities.\nWhere: Schulich Auditorium\nSession Details:\n\nDiscover P&G:\n\nDiscover an overview of what we do and how we operate. Learn about our core values and the innovative approaches that drive our success.\n\n\nBust some Myths:\n\nJoin us as we’ll address some common myths around working at P&G, providing clarity on what it truly means to work with us.\n\n\nLearn how you can make an Impact at P&G:\n\nWe’ll discuss our core values that will guide you to grow at P&G. We’ll also share what our hiring process is like, our current job openings, and how you can apply for roles that align with your career goals.\n\n\nNetworking Opportunity with P&Gers:\n\nExpand your professional network and ask any lingering questions.\n\n\n\nGuest Speakers\nGain insights from our Keynote Speaker Shilpa Mukhi, the VP of Sales at Walmart, who will share valuable perspectives on the working at P&G and offer guidance on career development.\nIn addition to registration through Experience York, you must register via the link below:\nEvent Sign-up Link: https://schulich.co1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_41TOdhqVCZrJupU ( https://schulich.co1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_41TOdhqVCZrJupU )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/procter-gamble-pgs-information-networking-session/
ORGANIZER;CN=Career Centre:MAILTO:career@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advising,Co-op &amp; Career Centre,Students,the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students
