SUMMARY:Experience Grad York—Administration (PhD)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education with a PhD in Business Administration at the Schulich School of Business? We invite you to attend our program session. Registration is required | schulich.my.salesforce-sites.com\nSchulich’s PhD in Administration ( http://schulich.yorku.ca/programs/phd/ ) invites you to attend our program webinar on October 17, 2024 from 10:00 AM – 11:00 AM EST.\nLearn more about the program, admission requirements and procedures, academic content and research, financial aid opportunities, and life as a doctoral student at the Schulich School of Business.\nApplications for the Fall (September) 2025 intake are now open. The application deadline is December 9, 2024. You may Start or Continue Your Application HERE ( http://schulich.yorku.ca/admissions/how-to-apply/ ).\nWe’ll be joined by the PhD Program Director Peter Darke, Assistant Director of Recruitment & Admissions Carl Sachs, 7 additional faculty members (each responsible for a different subject/research area), and a current PhD student.\nJoin us for this online session to learn if the PhD in Administration program might be right for you!\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy.\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/egy-schulich-phd/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies,Graduate Program in Administration,Schulich School of Business
LOCATION:Online Zoom
