SUMMARY:Top Tips from Excellent Teachers – Meet the 2024 EEA Education Award Winners
DESCRIPTION:Looking for some inspiration for your teaching from award-winning instructors?\nOn Oct. 2, the Centre for Teaching & Learning in Economics (CTaLE) will host an online webinar with top tips from this year’s winners of the European Economics Association’s teaching awards.\nThe hour-long conversation with the award winners, which includes Karen Bernhardt-Walther, a York U assistant professor of economics, will ask them for their thoughts on what is needed to achieve excellence in teaching and is sure to spark some inspiration for the start of the academic year.\nRegister by Sept. 29th at lnkd.in/eesfBkKc.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/top-tips-from-excellent-teachers-meet-the-2024-eea-education-award-winners/
ORGANIZER;CN=CTaLE:MAILTO:
CATEGORIES:Teaching &amp; Learning
LOCATION:(URL will be provided in the email confirmation)
END:VEVENT
