SUMMARY:Introduction to CNC Milling
DESCRIPTION:Presenter: Jacob Turola\n\nA quick interactive session on how to use the CNC mill to cut, engrave and carve out designs. Uses range from function to just for fun. Learn about what tools to use, good practices and good use cases.\nAll are welcome to join regardless of academic background or skill level and please bring a laptop if you have one.\n\n\n
