SUMMARY:Zotero for Collaborative Research Projects
DESCRIPTION:Presenter: William Denton & Anna St.Onge\n\nZotero is the best tool for managing citations and research—and it’s free and open source. This series of live online workshops are designed to take participants beyond the basics of using Zotero to having it serve as a full research partner.  By the end of this live session, participants should be able to: share a Zotero collection with a specific group of colleagues or the public; successfully locate existing and shared Zotero collections; collaborate with colleagues to build and share a directory of sources; and understand how Zotero stores paywalled or subscription resources.\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/zotero-for-collaborative-research-projects-2/
