SUMMARY:Camera Basics
DESCRIPTION:Presenter: Tim Huynh\n\nLearn the fundamental concepts of image-recording (aperture, shutter, ISO), in-camera tools for photography/videography (white balance, exposure indicators) and technical guidelines. Experiment with different cameras and lenses and/or use your smartphone. This workshop focuses on technical aspects, but will introduce resources for exploring creative aspects of image recording.\n\n
