SUMMARY:Publishing Your Research Data in a Data Repository
DESCRIPTION:Presenter: Stephanie Quail & Harshita Singh\n\nThis live Zoom workshop introduces the guiding principles of data publishing. You will learn how to prepare your data for sharing and long-term access, and how to select a data repository that meets your needs. A brief overview of the data deposit process for York University’s Dataverse will also be provided. The other Zoom workshops in this series cover: Best Practices for Managing Research Data (Oct. 9th) and Creating a Data Management Plan (Oct. 24th).\n\n
