SUMMARY:Zotero Notes and Annotations
DESCRIPTION:Presenter: William Denton\n\nZotero is the best tool for managing citations and research—and it’s free and open source. This series of live online workshops are designed to take participants beyond the basics of using Zotero to having it serve as a full research partner.  By the end of this live workshop, participants should be able to: manage research notes using Zotero; use PDF annotation tools to create searchable notes and quotations based on article and book sources; export the annotations and notes into Word; and generate reports to help with assignments, papers, theses and other projects.\n\n
