DESCRIPTION:Presenter: Stephanie Quail & Harshita Singh\n\nThis live Zoom workshop discusses Data Management Plan (DMP) requirements for a variety of funding agencies. It also covers how to use the Canadian DMP Assistant tool, which helps simplify the process of creating a DMP for your research project. The other Zoom workshops in this series cover: Best Practices for Managing Research Data (Oct. 9th) and Publishing your Research Data in a Data Repository (Nov. 5th).\n\n
