SUMMARY:Network Visualization in Gephi
DESCRIPTION:Presenter: Alexandra Wong\n\nLearn to create your own network graph to visualize the relationships between entities. Using the free software Gephi, participants will learn how to express relationships as data and how to create and refine their own network visualizations. This workshop will teach participants how to create a network graph with a specific sample dataset, but the principles of network visualizations and how to use Gephi will be applicable to all disciplines.\n\n
