SUMMARY:Zotero Introduction: Easier Citations and Research Management
DESCRIPTION:Presenter: William Denton\n\nZotero is the best tool for managing citations and research—and it’s free and open source.  This introductory hands-on workshop will teach you how to use it to organize your citations and create your bibliographies.  If you’re new to writing and citing, Zotero can make things a lot easier—you can press a button and it will generate your bibliography!  But even if you’ve been researching and writing for a while, it’s never to late to see what Zotero can do and how it can help.  This workshop covers the basics, and the others in the series go deeper into all the features.\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/zotero-introduction-easier-citations-and-research-management/
