SUMMARY:Best Practices for Managing Research Data
DESCRIPTION:Presenter: Stephanie Quail & Harshita Singh\n\nThis live Zoom workshop introduces the general principles and best practices for data collection, storage, documentation, and sharing. You will learn about emerging principles, resources and tools that will help you plan and implement research data management best practices throughout the data lifecycle and enable data reuse where appropriate. The other Zoom workshops in this series cover: Creating a Data Management Plan (Oct. 24th) and Publishing your Research Data in a Data Repository (Nov. 5th).\n\n
