SUMMARY:Indigenous Resources and Citations
DESCRIPTION:Presenter: Cora Coady\n\nLearn how to search effectively for Indigenous resources. This workshop will explain the ins and outs of searching for community-specific information, will guide you through key databases for Indigenous resources and will discuss specialized citations for citing Elders and Oral histories.\n\n
