SUMMARY:Environmental Studies Association of Canada (ESAC) Fall Social and Webinar
DESCRIPTION:On Oct. 8, ESAC will be hosting a hybrid seminar along with an in-person networking session at our new host institution, the Faculty of Environmental & Urban Change at York University. The evening will feature presentations from the Ecological Footprint Initiative.\nThe Ecological Footprint Initiative, a data analytics research hub at York University in the Faculty of Environmental & Urban Change, produces the National Ecological Footprint and Biocapacity Accounts for every country in the world from 1961 to 2023.\nRegister for the event here: ESAC Fall social and webinar — Environmental Studies Association of Canada ( https://www.esac.ca/events-1/esac-fall-social-and-webinar ).\n
