SUMMARY:Procter & Gamble (P&G) – Information & Networking Session
DESCRIPTION:Calling all York U students!\nWe are excited to invite you to Procter & Gamble’s (P&G’s) information session on Oct. 3 from 5:30 to 7 p.m. in the Schulich Auditorium. This event presents a unique opportunity to learn about one of the leading consumer goods companies in the world and explore potential career paths with us.\nHere’s what you can expect during the session:\n\nDiscover P&G with an overview of what we do and how we operate. Learn about our core values and the innovative approaches that drive our success.\nBust some myths with us, as we’ll address some common myths around working at P&G, providing clarity on what it truly means to work with us.\nGain insights from our keynote speaker Shilpa Mukhi, the VP of Sales at Walmart, who will share valuable perspectives on the working at P&G and offer guidance on career development.\nLearn how you can make an impact at P&G. We’ll discuss our core values that will guide you to grow at P&G. We’ll also share what our hiring process is like, our current job openings and how you can apply for roles that align with your career goals.\nNetworking opportunity with P&Gers to expand your professional network and ask any lingering questions.\n\nThis event is open to all York students. Please note: York U email address is required to register, and York U student identification will be required at event check-in. As spots are limited, we encourage you to register early to secure your place. Don’t miss this chance to engage with one of the world’s top employers and explore exciting career opportunities.\nREGISTER HERE: schulich.co1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_41TOdhqVCZrJupU ( https://schulich.co1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_41TOdhqVCZrJupU ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/procter-gamble-pg-information-networking-session/
