SUMMARY:GENIAL Student Entrepreneurship Competition
DESCRIPTION:We are inviting you to our 2024 GENIAL Student Entrepreneurship Competition. \n\nNetwork with award-winning entrepreneurs and professionals across various industries.\nGet inspired by our keynote speakers.\nEnjoy refreshments at free cocktail reception.\n\nThursday, Sept. 26, 5:30 to 8:30 p.m., Glendon Campus. \nRegistration is required. To RSVP, visit pitchgenial.eventbrite.ca ( http://pitchgenial.eventbrite.ca/ ).\nTo learn more, visit Workshops & Events – Glendon ENtrepreneuriat et Innovation A L’international (GENIAL) (yorku.ca) ( https://www.yorku.ca/glendon/genial/workshops-events/ ).\nIf you have any questions, contact Melissa at carmeli@yorku.ca ( mailto:carmeli@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/genial-student-entrepreneurship-competition/
