SUMMARY:Ontario Shores: Recovery College Co-Design Course
DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in collaborating with others to create mental health programming for students here at York University? Then this course is for you!\nIn collaboration with Ontario Shores Centre for Mental Health Sciences, Student Counselling, Health & Well-being (SCHW) is launching the “Recovery College”. A Recovery College provides health and well-being courses that strive to support students in living their best life by covering diverse topics like health, well-being and personal mental health recovery.\nWhat will we do?\nYou and your peers will come together with SCHW and Ontario Shores to brainstorm ideas for Recovery College courses, which will be offered in winter 2025. You will decide on the course topics, the content and how you would like to engage students. As students, you and your peers know your needs better than anyone else.\nWhat will we learn?\n\nYou will learn about Recovery College, Co-Design and the Recovery College process.\nHow to work as a member of a team to design and co-create relevant and impactful mental health-related courses.\nHow to leverage your experiences as a post-secondary student navigating wellness as a source of strength and value.\n\nThis co-design program will run virtually every Friday over 5 weeks (except reading week) from 11AM to noon.\nParticipation is open to all students.\nHonorarium Information\nNote: Participants must attend all 5 co-design sessions in order to receive the honorarium.\nIn exchange for your support, participants will be receive a credit to be used towards any “Outdoor Experience ( https://reconline.yorkulions.ca/Program/GetProgramDetails?courseId=f559d020-b9d7-487f-92a5-89a0d97a3f17 )” offered by York U’s Athletics and Recreation up to $125.00.\nSpots are limited and given out first-come-first-served. Those selected to participate will be contacted with further details and zoom joining instructions.\nRegister for Recovery College Co-Design ( https://forms.students.yorku.ca/view.php?id=386528 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/ontario-shores-recovery-college-co-design-course/
