SUMMARY:Ask a Nurse Drop-by Tabling Session
DESCRIPTION:Consult a healthcare professional\nStudents juggle a lot, from academics and work to family and friends. It can be hard to prioritize your own health and well-being at the same time.\nAsk a Nurse is a confidential service for York students. Speak to Public Health Nurses from Student Counselling, Health & Well-being about your health-related questions, without an appointment. There is a lot of health-related information online and it can be difficult to tell what’s reliable. Our goal is to answer your questions, find solutions and connect you to the most helpful resources. Come see us in-person or get in touch online ( https://students.yorku.ca/health/ask-a-nurse )!\n*This service is provided in English*\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/ask-a-nurse-drop-by-tabling-session-2/
ORGANIZER;CN=Student Counselling, Health &amp; Well-being:MAILTO:schw@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Ask a Nurse,Glendon,Glendon Current Students,Health Education &amp; Promotion,Student Counselling, Health &amp; Well-being,Students,the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students
LOCATION:Glendon Campus (Centre of Excellence) @ 2275 Bayview Avenue, Toronto, Ontario, M4N3M6
END:VEVENT
