SUMMARY:AHF x Scotiabank Networking Event
DESCRIPTION:AHF x Scotiabank Networking Event\nAre you an Indigenous, Black or women of colour interested in careers in financial services?\nAccelerate Her Future, a career accelerator by and for Indigenous, Black and women of colour pursuing careers in Business and STEM, is thrilled to team up with Scotiabank for a virtual Group Coffee Chat event on October 2, 2024, 5:00-6:00 pm ET.\nGet to know Scotiabank and the awesome business lines and programs they hire for. This session consists of a presentation by the Scotiabank Campus Recruitment team followed by networking in breakout rooms to learn more about future internship/co-op and new grad opportunities.\nCome prepared to get to know Scotiabank, while they get to know you! This is a great opportunity that allows women to raise their voices, ask questions and network with one another. All that’s required is a positive attitude, a cup of tea/coffee (zen vibes) and your authentic self!\nDate: October 2, 2024\nTime: 5:00-6:00 pm ET\nPlace: Virtual\nRSVP: Submit your expression of interest to attend by September 25, 2024, via this form.\n\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/ahf-x-scotiabank-networking-event/
