SUMMARY:Discover RBC (Recruitment Session)
DESCRIPTION:As we head onto on-campus recruitment season for our Winter and Summer roles, we will be hosting virtual and in-person information sessions on the following dates to promote and support your students and peers in their application journey (please use your computer browser instead of phone to register/apply, as some phones have trouble accessing the link):\n\nSeptember 10th at 1:00pm EST (Virtual, English) via this link ( https://feedback.achievers.com/l/F2JPQzA.c8 )\nSeptember 11th at 1:00pm EST (Virtual, Français) via this link ( https://feedback.achievers.com/l/F2JPQzA.c8 )\nSeptember 19th at 5:30pm PST (In-person, Vancouver) via this link ( https://feedback.achievers.com/l/kMwqR7B.c8 )\nSeptember 24th at 5:30pm EST (In-person, Toronto) via this link ( https://feedback.achievers.com/l/dGKGD2v.c8 )\n\nNote that our virtual sessions are open to all, however, our in-person events in Vancouver and Toronto will be application-based, with successful applicants notified via email invitation by September 17th.\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/discover-rbc-recruitment-session/
ORGANIZER;CN=Career Centre:MAILTO:career@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advising,Co-op &amp; Career Centre,Students,the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students
