SUMMARY:Sun Life Account Executive Development Program (AEDP) – Recruitment Session
DESCRIPTION:Do you want to learn more about the Account Executive Development program?\nRegister for one of our virtual information sessions where you will have the chance to learn more about the program, Tuesday, September 24th, 2024.\nEnglish at 2:00pm – 2:45pm EST\nFrench at 3:00pm – 3:45pm EST\nRegister by September 23rd at 5:00pm\nSun Life will be hosting virtual information sessions giving new grads the chance to learn about the AEDP. Students will be able to register for this event through the VIRTUAL INFO SESSION ( https://pages.beamery.com/sunlifecareers/page/aedpevents ) or CAREER POSTING ( https://pages.beamery.com/sunlifecareers/page/aedp ) links.\nHere are some important details to note:\n\nCandidates must have graduated from an accredited program this past spring (May 2024) or be heading into their final year of studies (expected graduate date May 2025).\nThe job application period will be open from Monday, August 26 through to Tuesday, October 1, 2024.\nThe virtual information sessions are taking place on Thursday, September 19 and Tuesday, September 24, 2024 available in English and French. The last day to register is September 18, 2024, at midnight.\nWe have included to this email social media badges that can be used to share the opportunity with your students:\n\nAEDP Now Hiring\nAEDP Virtual Information Session\n\n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/sun-life-account-executive-development-program-aedp-recruitment-session/
ORGANIZER;CN=Career Centre:MAILTO:career@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advising,Co-op &amp; Career Centre,Students,the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students
