SUMMARY:Film Screening – ‘Plastic People: The Hidden Crisis of Microplastics’
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Price Family Cinema, Accolade East Building, on Tuesday, Oct. 8 at  6 p.m. to see the landmark feature #PlasticPeopleDoc, a groundbreaking film that sheds light on how microplastics have entered our bodies and why this health crisis is so pressing. There will be an exclusive Q-and-A with the filmmakers following the screening.\nRegistration link: sustainability.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=34332.\nWatch the trailer: plasticpeopledoc.co.\nSponsors:\nCinema & Media Arts, AMPD\nDisaster & Emergency Management (DEM), LA&PS, FGS\nOne WATER\nThe Office of Sustainability\n \n \n
