SUMMARY:Rakuten Kobo (Recruitment Session)
DESCRIPTION:Rakuten Kobo is a technology, publishing, and e-commerce company based out of Toronto, Canada. We are a global company, with offices in Toronto, Canada, and Darmstadt, Germany, from which we serve 30+ million customers in almost 190 countries.\nThe focus of our organization is to be a company built by booklovers for booklovers. We believe people should be able to read anywhere in the world, on any device, and in any language. We offer our own e-reader devices,?a collection of millions of eBooks and audiobooks, and offer a self-publishing platform for millions of authors.??\nFurthermore, we currently offer 30+ early career opportunities in numerous areas, including technology, business, publishing, and more. Our roles can be worked remotely or in a hybrid manner, depending on your preference. Finally, they can range from 4 – 16 months in length, in addition to permanent opportunities.\nIf you are interested in learning how you could make an impact on millions of readers worldwide or have any questions, please join us for a one-hour information session on INSERT DATE via the Zoom link below. If you have any questions, please feel free to reach out to Andrew McNabb, Early Careers Recruiter, at andrew.mcnabb@rakuten.com or connect with him via LinkedIn.\nIn the meantime, if you want to do some additional research, you can find additional information on our early career opportunities here, learn what it is like working at Rakuten-Kobo here, and learn more about our company here.\nPlease find the Zoom link and login information below:\nZOOM INFORMATION \nTopic: Early Careers Event – York University – Information Session – Virtual – Fall 2024\nTime: Sep 16, 2024 05:00 PM Eastern Time (US and Canada)\nZoom Link ( https://rakuten.zoom.us/j/96425531398?pwd=vpbejfh8ubPgdHaSFZSuu6eRW7JUWq.1 )\nJoin from PC, Mac, Linux, iOS or Android\nPassword: 509042\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/rakuten-kobo-recruitment-session/
ORGANIZER;CN=Career Centre:MAILTO:career@yorku.ca
