SUMMARY:OMERS and Oxford Virtual Information Session (Recruitment Session – Winter 2025)
DESCRIPTION:\nEvent Description:\nThank your for your interest in attending this event! In this virtual information session hosted by OMERS and Oxford, you will have the opportunity to learn about our organization, upcoming Winter 2025 student positions, followed by Q&A!\nVirtual event\nWhen: Thursday, September 12th  5:30 pm – 6:30 p.m. (EST)\nWhere: Virtual (The Virtual meeting link will be emailed to participants within 24 hours of registering)\n\nPlease register through Experience York and this LINK ( https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=ZvfxVs7KG06ev4GVBpG-8Dot4ItJyANKq7hh-oaYns1UOVU3SlVYRVQ3RDFEOEhVMzFQV04zUDlSQy4u )\n\nAudience\n\nOpen to all Liberal Arts & Professional Studies students seeking Winter 2025 co-op opportunities\n\nSession Details\n\nLearn about our Organization\nDiscover Co-op Opportunities\nMeet our Experts\nQ&A Session\n\nDon’t miss out on this chance to launch your career! Register Now!\nAttendance: Registrants must join the event on time. Those arriving late will not be admitted. \n\n\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Career Centre” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nSelect “Workshops & Webinars”\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n\n\n
