SUMMARY:CIBC Recruitment Session
DESCRIPTION:\nThe Campus team at CIBC is hosting an info session and panel discussion and we’d love to see you there!\nLearn why CIBC is your employer of choice and how you can kick start your career with a culture that fits your needs. On Thursday September 12 from 4-6PM you’ll get the inside scoop on our application process and when to apply. Enjoy our panel from current and previous co-op students as well as new grad Associates in Business and STEM who have been in your shoes! Our panelists will be diving into the intersections of business and technology in the banking world, speak about their experiences, share what they’ve learned throughout the process and provide tips and tricks you can use.\nImportant Information:\n• You must be a current post-secondary student, enrolled at York University to attend\n• Event sign-ups will close on Friday, September 6 at 11:59PM\n• This event will be held in person at York University\nIn addition to registration through Experience York, you must register via the link below: https://cibc.wd3.myworkdayjobs.com/campus/job/Toronto-ON/Campus-Events–Winter-2025-Recruitment_2418576 ( https://cibc.wd3.myworkdayjobs.com/campus/job/Toronto-ON/Campus-Events--Winter-2025-Recruitment_2418576 ).\n4:00PM – 4:30PM: Info session (all about CIBC, the recruitment cycle)\n4:30PM – 5:00PM: Student/ Associate panel (talking about their experience, their co-op terms, skills that they’ve learned, etc.)\n5:00PM – 6:00PM: Networking\n\n\nHow do I register through Experience York?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Career Centre” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nSelect “Workshops & Webinars”\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/cibc-recruitment-session/
