SUMMARY:York Lions Varsity Football Game
DESCRIPTION:Come cheer on the York Lions Football team on Saturday, Sept. 14 – kick off at 4 p.m. – at the York Lions Stadium (230 Ian MacDonald Blvd.). Bring your friends and your noisemakers!\nWe’ll need all the energy and loud cheers to win. Watch an exciting game as we face the Windsor Lancers. There will be free giveaways, fun contests to participate in and chances to win prizes such as the Lions Shuffle at halftime. Look out for Yeo, the York U mascot, to take photos with. You can bring food and snacks to the game!\nA reminder that York students are FREE! You just need to show your YU Card or prove you’re a York U student at the door. You can grab tickets in advance to skip the line by visiting the York Lions website and reserving a spot online: yorkulions.ca/tickets.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/york-lions-varsity-football-game/
ORGANIZER;CN=Athletics &amp; Recreation:MAILTO:
CATEGORIES:Faculties,Students
