SUMMARY:2SLGBTQIA+ Halloween Alumni Mixer
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to invite you to the Halloween Alumni Mixer, hosted by the Sexuality and Gender Advocacy Alumni Network ( https://www.yorku.ca/alumniandfriends/2022/06/introducing-the-sexuality-and-gender-advocacy-alumni-network/ ) (SAGA). \nJoin us for an evening of food, mingling, and Halloween fun! Come dressed in your best costume for a chance to win a fantastic prize in our best costume contest. \nThis is a fantastic opportunity to reconnect with fellow alumni, forge new connections, and celebrate Halloween in style with the 2SLGBTQIA+ community. We are excited to gather for an evening of fun, laughter, and shared experiences. We look forward to seeing you there and enjoying a memorable night together! Please RSVP to confirm your attendance. \nAgenda\nArrival and Registration: 6-6:15 p.m.\nOpening Remarks: 6:15-6:25 p.m.\nEngagement Activity: 6:25-6:40 p.m.\nFood and Mingling: 6:40-7:30 p.m.\nRaffle and best costume winners: 7:30 – 7:50 p.m.\nClosing Remarks: 7:50 – 8 p.m.\nEvent Details\nDate: Tuesday, Oct. 29\nTime: 6-8 p.m.\nLocation: Earls Kitchen + Bar, 601 King St W, Toronto, ON M5V 1M5 ( https://www.google.com/maps/place/Earls+Kitchen+%2B+Bar/@43.6441589,-79.4004451,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x4a381cdc480905b2?sa=X&ved=1t:2428&ictx=111 )\nFor more information, please email Yasmine Mensah, Alumni Engagement Officer at mensahy@yorku.ca. ( mailto:mensahy@yorku.ca )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/2slgbtqia-halloween-alumni-mixer/
ORGANIZER;CN=Office of Alumni Engagement:MAILTO:alumni@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Banner_Eblast_Template_2024_768x301.jpg
END:VEVENT
