SUMMARY:Industry Talks 2.0
DESCRIPTION:York University Motion Media Studio in collaboration with OYA Black Arts Coalition (OBAC), CineCares, and Connected Minds proudly present Industry Talks 2.0!. Join us for an inspiring speaker series where you’ll gain exclusive insights from industry experts, connect with seasoned media professionals, and network at our social mixer—all while enjoying free refreshments (pizza!).\nModerated by CMA Screenwriter, Fabio Montanari.\nGuest Speaker, Ian Iqbal Rashid, award-winning writer and director\nDate: Thursday, September 26\nTime: 6 to 8 p.m.\nLocation: York U Motion Media Studio (777 Kipling Ave, Toronto M8Z 5Z4 ( https://goo.gl/maps/TmtstHtA5Pr2WgFG8 ))\nFree. All welcome.\nRSVP: yumms@yorku.ca ( mailto:yumms@yorku.ca ). Registration required for entry.\n\n\n \n
