SUMMARY:Level Up | Young Alumni Fall Mixer
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to invite you back to Keele campus as the Level Up series returns with the Young Alumni Fall Mixer!\nJoin us on Tuesday, Oct. 8 at the Break Room (formerly The Underground) on Keele campus for an evening of socializing, games and delicious food and drinks. Meet fellow young alumni and grow your professional and social networks in a fun arcade setting. Games include: air hockey, foosball, videogames, basketball and more!\nLevel Up | Young Alumni Fall Mixer\nDate: Tuesday, Oct. 8\nTime: 6:30 to 8:30 p.m. Doors open at 6 p.m.\nLocation: Break Room, York University Student Centre, Keele Campus, 4700 Keele Street, Toronto\nTickets: $10 (includes games, light food and one bar drink per person)\n
