DESCRIPTION:Join us for an empowering information session where we’ll guide you through the extensive resources and opportunities available at the York University Career Centre. Discover how our services can support your career development, from job search strategies and resume building to networking and interview preparation. Don’t miss this chance to unlock your potential and take the next step in your career!\n\n\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Career Centre” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nSelect “Workshops & Webinars”\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n\n\n
