SUMMARY:Experience Grad York – English
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in English? We invite you to attend our program session. Registration is required | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUkfuigqzojH9WI_nswqPbbIH2pqIqA5BA_ )\nOur faculty and courses represent a compelling range of theoretical, historical and critical approaches to literature across the historical sweep of English-language works in all genres from their very beginnings to today’s global spectrum of voices and expressive forms. Over the past three generations, our forward-thinking research and engaging teaching methodologies have helped shape literary scholarship across the world. Study with prize-winning graduate faculty in American, British, Canadian, Postcolonial, Diasporic and World Literatures.\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/experience-grad-york-english/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
