DESCRIPTION:Join YUBAN (York University Black Alumni Network ( https://www.yorku.ca/alumniandfriends/york-university-black-alumni-network/ )) and BGBN (Schulich Black Graduate Business Network ( https://oneschulich.yorku.ca/bgbn/home-(copy-2)/ )) for an exciting career fair. This event offers a unique opportunity to connect Black identifying alumni, undergraduate and graduate students with top employers, provide an opportunity to network with professionals, and explore a variety of career paths.  Enterprise Mobility, American Express, Group M, CIBC and others will be in attendance!\nDon’t miss out on a chance to take the next step in your career journey. Mark your calendars and prepare to make meaningful connections with top industries. \nAgenda:\n5:30 PM – 5:40 PM: Welcome and Opening Remarks\n5:55 PM – 6:05 PM: Employer Introductions\n6:05 PM – 7:20 PM: Networking and Career Booths\n7:20 PM – 7:30 PM: Closing Remarks\nLocation: McEwen Atrium, Schulich School of Business\nFor more information, please contact YUBAN at yorkublackalumninetwork@gmail.com or BGBN at bgbn@schulich.yorku.ca \n
