SUMMARY:Meditation
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by Athletics & Recreation, this class focuses on relaxing the body and mind through a guided mediation to help you increase your focus. With an introductory focus, this 30 minute class will also have an education component to help you learn in slow steps!\nThis class runs every Thursday starting from September 12th until December 12th (excluding Reading Week) from 2:30 pm to 3 pm in the Student Counselling, Health and Well-being office located at the Bennett Centre for Student Services room N110\nWe ask that you arrive 10 minutes early as you will need to go through a check-in process and to help the class start on time.\nRegistration is required.\nTo register, you must have a Fitness Membership ( https://reconline.yorkulions.ca/ ), and check-in closes 5 minutes after the class has started. Timeslots for future classes will be released seven (7) days in advance. Please book only for when you can attend, to be courteous to your fellow members\n If you are unable to participate in a session you registered for, please cancel your registration with the following steps:\n\nLog into your online account (reconline.yorkulions.ca ( https://reconline.yorkulions.ca/ ) or App)\nClick on your Profile (Top Right)\nClick on Program\nSelect the session you want to cancel\nClick the 3 dots to the right and Cancel\n\n \nFor more information, please contact Client Services at taitmck@yorku.ca ( mailto:taitmck@yorku.ca )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/meditation/
