SUMMARY:Education Unleashed: Career Paths Beyond Teaching
DESCRIPTION:We are thrilled to invite you to the Education Unleashed: Career Paths Beyond Teaching event, presented by the Faculty of Education Alumni Network.  \nThe theme of this event is centered around the question, “What professional pathways can a degree in education lead to in addition to the classroom?” Our event aims to explore the diverse and dynamic career opportunities in education. \nThe event will feature a panel where our distinguished guest speakers will share insights into their career and education trajectories. They will answer questions and provide valuable perspectives on how their education degrees have paved the way for their success in various fields. \nFollowing the panel, there will be a roundtable discussion with attendees, including current students and alumni. This will be an excellent opportunity to engage in meaningful conversations, ask questions, and network with professionals and peers who share your interests. \nThis event is open to our community of alumni and current graduate and undergraduate students.   \nWe look forward to seeing you there and sharing this enriching experience with you. Please RSVP to confirm your attendance. \nAgenda:  \nArrival and Registration: 6 – 6:10 p.m.\nOpening remarks by Dr. Robert Savage, Dean of the Faculty of Education: 6:10 – 6:20 p.m.\nPanel Discussion: 6:20 – 6:50 p.m.\nIntermission: 6:50 – 7:15 p.m.\nRoundtable Discussions: 7:15 – 7:45 p.m.\nClosing Remarks: 7:45 p.m. – 8 p.m.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/education-unleashed-career-paths-beyond-teaching/
