SUMMARY:Personality & Career Choice Webinar (Career Exploration)
DESCRIPTION:Find out how your personality may influence your career choices and clarify important aspects of yourself through the lens of one of the world’s most widely used assessments: the Myers Briggs Type Indicator (MBTI). You’ll come away with an estimate of your Type but most importantly, a profile of who you are and what’s most important to you in your career.\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Career Centre” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nSelect “Workshops & Webinars”\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n
