SUMMARY:World @ Midday: Atish Mukhopadhyay
DESCRIPTION:North Indian Classical Music and The Sarod\nAtish Mukhopadhyay ( https://www.facebook.com/sarodatish/ ) stands as one of the rare virtuosos of the Sarode in the contemporary panorama of North Indian Classical Instrumental musicians. A dedicated scholar of traditional music, he proudly carries the legacy of the ‘Maihar Senia Gharana of Baba Allauddin Khan,’ serving as its direct representative and torchbearer. With a career marked by high critical acclaim and numerous accolades for his musical excellence, Atish Mukhopadhyay has left an indelible mark on the world of classical music.\nThursday, October 10, 2024\nMcLean Performance Studio ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/mclean-performance-studio/ )\n12:30 – 1:30 p.m.\nFREE\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/world-midday-atish-mukhopadhyay/
