SUMMARY:Understanding and Creating Data Visualizations
DESCRIPTION:This workshop will provide a comprehensive introduction to data visualization. It will cover the topics of how to start creating your own data visualization for academic purposes, as well as how to find, read, and cite data visualizations. This introduction will include where to find data, tips on crafting a visual narrative, how to choose the right visualization tool for your needs, and how to create visualizations with accessibility and equity in mind.\n
