SUMMARY:LAPS: Graduate Admission at York
DESCRIPTION:Join us to learn more about the graduate programs available in the Faculty of Liberal Arts & Professional Studies. This presentation will cover the following programs\nCommunication & Culture (MA & PhD)\nDevelopment Studies (MA)\nDisaster & Emergency Management (MDEM)\nEconomics (MA & PhD)\nEnglish (MA & PhD)\nFinancial Accountability (MFAc)\nGender, Feminist, & Women’s Studies (MA & PhD)\nHistory (MA & PhD)\nHuman Resources Management (MHRM & PhD)\nHumanities (MA & PhD)\nInformation Systems & Technology (MAIST)\nInterdisciplinary Studies (MA)\nLinguistics and Applied Linguistics (MA & PhD)\nPhilosophy (MA & PhD)\nPolitical Science (MA & PhD)\nProfessional Accounting (Graduate Diploma)\nPublic Policy, Administration & Law (MPPAL)\nScience & Technology Studies (MA & PhD)\nSocial Anthropology (MA & PhD)\nSocial Work (MSW & PhD)\nSocial & Political Thought (MA & PhD)\nSocio-Legal Studies (MA & PhD)\nSociology (MA & PhD)\nWe will cover admission requirements, eligibility, tuition, funding, scholarships, and how to apply. Questions welcome!\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_NBRtINdzSdqYF1l4rq412Q ).\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ).\nFor any questions, please email us at FGSINFO@YORKU.CA ( mailto:fgsinfo@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/laps-graduate-admission-at-york-2/
