SUMMARY:Indigenous Graduate Welcome Reception & Lunch
DESCRIPTION:The Centre for Indigenous Knowledges and Languages is hosting a welcome reception & lunch on September 5th from 130-330pm for new and returning Indigenous graduate students. We are also extending this invitation to any graduate students who are actively engaged with or doing research with Indigenous Peoples/Communities.\nThis will be an opportunity to connect with other Indigenous graduate students and allies doing community-focused work. Researchers from CIKL will be in attendance to talk about the work of the Centre and how we can help support your journey at York!\nRegistration is required: bit.ly/4cyHLdm ( http://bit.ly/4cyHLdm )\n\n
