SUMMARY:York U Alumni Dinners in California
DESCRIPTION:York University is heading to California and we hope to see you there!\nYou’re invited to join industry leaders from your alma mater at one of our upcoming alumni dinners in the Bay Area, hosted by Susana Gajic-Bruyea, Vice-President, Advancement and Julie Lafford, Assistant Vice President, Alumni Engagement.\nNetwork with fellow alumni, reminisce about your time on campus and learn about York’s latest initiatives. Whether you graduated recently, or many years ago, we would love to see you.\nYork U San Francisco Alumni Dinner\nDate: Monday, September 16\nTime: 6 – 8 p.m. PT\nLocation: The Vault Garden Plaza Level – outside 555 California Street, San Francisco, CA, 94104 (Check in at the host stand under York University)\nRSVP: https://give.yorku.ca/s/1853/adv/form.aspx?sid=1853&gid=2&pgid=1679&cid=3239  ( https://give.yorku.ca/s/1853/adv/form.aspx?sid=1853&gid=2&pgid=1679&cid=3239 )\nYork U Palo Alto Alumni Dinner\nDate: Tuesday, September 17\nTime: 6 – 8 p.m. PT\nLocation: Telefèric Barcelona Palo Alto, 855 El Camino Real #130 Palo Alto, CA 94301, United States\nRSVP: https://give.yorku.ca/s/1853/adv/form.aspx?sid=1853&gid=2&pgid=1682&cid=3243 ( https://give.yorku.ca/s/1853/adv/form.aspx?sid=1853&gid=2&pgid=1682&cid=3243 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/york-u-alumni-dinners-in-california/
ORGANIZER;CN=Office of Alumni Engagement:MAILTO:alumni@yorku.ca
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/California.jpg
