SUMMARY:CIAN Seminar: A survey of law and neuroscience, by Prof. Jeffrey Schall
DESCRIPTION:The Centre for Integrative & Applied Neuroscience (CIAN) presents its first seminar of the year.  Join us on Sept. 13 for Jeffrey Schall’s “A Survey of Law and Neuroscience.”\nThis presentation will survey the scope of this interdisciplinary area by summarizing the contents of the second edition of his co-authored law school coursebook, Law and Neuroscience.\nSchall joined York University in 2021 after rising through the ranks at Vanderbilt University. His research has been focused on the neural mechanisms of decision-making. He has been collaborating for several years with legal scholars at Vanderbilt and elsewhere under the auspices of the MacArthur Foundation Research Network on Law and Neuroscience.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/cian-seminar-a-survey-of-law-and-neuroscience-by-prof-jeffrey-schall/
