SUMMARY:NSERC Q&A Information Session for Grad Students
DESCRIPTION:The Faculty of Graduate Studies is pleased co-host a virtual NSERC Q&A Information session on Tuesday, September 10, 2024, from 11:00 AM – 12:00 PM EST. Program Officers from NSERC will be present to answer questions from students prior to the upcoming doctoral and master’s competitions in the fall.\nOptional: Watch select informational videos at your convenience before the Q&A session. You can view them here.\nPlease register to indicate your interest. The Zoom details will be shared with registrants prior to the event.\nShould you have any questions, please email our Research Officer at nshibli@yorku.ca.\n
