SUMMARY:Drop-In Information Sessions: Disaster and Emergency Management Program (MDEM & PhD)
DESCRIPTION:York University has a thriving graduate program in Disaster & Emergency Management, offering both a longstanding Masters degree (MDEM), and a new PhD program starting in September 2025. Drop by for virtual sessions every Wednesday from 12pm-1pm (EST) to meet the Graduate Program Director and the Graduate Program Assistant who will be able to answer any of your questions about the programs, or to direct you to the right place.\nZOOM LINK TO JOIN:\nhttps://yorku.zoom.us/j/94372212284?pwd=iUupMBoUtxImbENEUPULa12t9IQL9R.1 ( https://yorku.zoom.us/j/94372212284?pwd=iUupMBoUtxImbENEUPULa12t9IQL9R.1 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/dem-drop-in-weekly-sessions/
