SUMMARY:Visit AMPD at Open Doors York
DESCRIPTION:Doors to our state of the art facilities will be open to incoming students on Tuesday, September 3rd. Please join us for the opportunity to explore and experience the Tribute Communities Recital Hall ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/tribute-communities-recital-hall/ ) and the Sandra Faire and Ivan Fecan Theatre ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/sandra-faire-and-ivan-fecan-theatre/ ).\nStudent ambassadors will also be leading guided tours of additional AMPD facilities at 11:30 a.m. and 1:00 p.m. departing from the CIBC Lobby ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/cibc-lobby/ ).\nAMPD staff will be on site to welcome you and answer questions. We look forward to seeing you!\nDate: Tuesday, September 3, 2024\nTime: 11:00 a.m. – 3:00 p.m.\nAMPD Tours: 11: 30 a.m. | 1:00 p.m.\nLocation: CIBC Lobby ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/cibc-lobby/ ) | Tribute Communities Recital Hall ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/tribute-communities-recital-hall/ ) | Sandra Faire and Ivan Fecan Theatre ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/sandra-faire-and-ivan-fecan-theatre/ )\nYork University\nMain Floor ACE (Accolade East Building)\n83 York Blvd\nToronto, ON M3J 2S5\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/visit-ampd-at-open-doors-york/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:Main Floor ACE (Accolade East Building) - 83 York Blvd
