SUMMARY:Planting Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Ground yourself through the healing elements of nature as you experience the art of planting. Join us for a hands-on planting workshop where you’ll learn the basics of gardening, including how to select the right plants, prepare the soil, and care for your garden. This interactive session will provide practical tips and techniques for creating a thriving green space, whether you’re a beginner or an experienced gardener. All materials will be provided.\nThis event is open to all students, staff, and faculty and will take place at the York University Greenhouse (G106 Farquharson Building. Located opposite the elevator).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/planting-workshop/
