SUMMARY:KPMG Kareer Kickoff with Audit and Tax (Recruitment Session)
DESCRIPTION:KPMG Kareer Kickoff: Fall Recruitment Event Series\nWe are hosting a series of events for students interested in learning more about KPMG, our recruiting process, and network with our professionals across all service lines and functions.\nPlease see the upcoming event details listed below for more information.\nKPMG Kareer Kickoff:\n             KPMG Kareer Kickoff with Audit, Tax and Advisory:\n\nDate and Time: Monday, August 26th from 5:00 PM – 7:00PM EST\nLocation: KPMG Downtown Toronto Office (Bay-Adelaide Centre)\nTarget Audience: Students interested in Audit, Tax, and Advisory\n\n            KPMG Kareer Kickoff with Audit and Tax:\n\nDate and Time: Wednesday, August 28th from 5:00 PM – 7:00PM EST\nLocation: KPMG Vaughan Office\nTarget Audience: Students interested in Audit and Tax\n\nLink to register: https://forms.office.com/e/VtAB3urxnT ( https://forms.office.com/e/VtAB3urxnT )\nRegistration deadline: Sunday August 18th at 11:59 PM EST\n\n
