SUMMARY:Oracle NetSuite – Launch Your Career in Software Consulting
DESCRIPTION:\nCurious how you can develop your career in tech?\nJoin us for a “Back to School Kick Off” virtual event!\nThis interactive session will cover the role and career options of the\nentry-level Associate Functional Consultant position at Oracle NetSuite,\n#1 Cloud Enterprise Resource Planning ERP in U.S. & Canada.\nDate: Thu, Aug 15th, 2024\nTime: 1pm EST-2pm EST\nRSVP: Register for the event through this link:\nREGISTRATION LINK ( https://apexapps.oracle.com/pls/apex/f?p=10412:1::::RP,1:P1_EVENT_ID:SADWBGTHEW&cs=1NsPXqkB-JZxRQqi97Us2noJS-LXucnw4ivqlFak516DWwVBwSWem17bgLzQbOc6iaeAaylMjrYcgEwNKrz1GAA )\nDirect links to apply to full-time Associate Functional Consultant roles:\nUS Associate Functional Consultant ( https://eeho.fa.us2.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/jobsearch/job/249859/?utm_medium=jobshare )\nCanada Associate Functional Consultant ( https://eeho.fa.us2.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/jobsearch/job/250068/?utm_medium=jobshare )\nVisit oracle.com/campus ( https://oracle.com/campus ) to learn more!\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/oracle-netsuite-launch-your-career-in-software-consulting/
