SUMMARY:Accelerate Your Future: Automotive Careers Expo for Black Students
DESCRIPTION:Accelerate Your Future: Automotive Careers Expo\nDate: August 15, 2024\nVenue: Toronto, ON\nArrival: 9:30am | Departure: 3:10pm\nRegistration Link: https://forms.gle/dFcM218iTdA4h2pw7 ( https://forms.gle/dFcM218iTdA4h2pw7 )\nEvent Overview:\nAccelerate Auto is thrilled to announce an activation event in Toronto aimed at promoting the\nautomotive industry as an exciting career path for senior high school and college/university\nstudents. The aim of this event is to provide a platform for young aspiring individuals\ninterested in the automotive industry to meet potential employers. Our goal is to facilitate\nconnections that could lead to co-op placements, internships, and full-time employment\nopportunities.\nEvent Objectives:\nRaise awareness about career opportunities in the automotive industry.\nInspire and educate students about the diverse roles available, from technicians and\nengineers to software developers and IT professionals.\nShowcase the industry’s commitment to equity, diversity, and inclusion.\nProvide networking opportunities with industry leaders and professionals.\nTarget Audience:\n100 Black Participants\nSenior high school students\nCollege and university students\nKey Activities:\nWorkshops and Panels: Interactive sessions led by industry experts to educate\nstudents about various career paths in the automotive industry.\nNetworking Opportunities: Students will have the chance to connect with industry\nprofessionals, mentors, and role models.\nVendor Exhibits: Diverse vendors, including OEMs, dealerships, banks, and auto\ngroups, will showcase their work and engage with students.\nHands-On Activities: Practical workshops where students can learn and experience\ndifferent aspects of the automotive industry.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/accelerate-your-future-automotive-careers-expo-for-black-students/
ORGANIZER;CN=Career Centre:MAILTO:career@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advising,Co-op &amp; Career Centre,Students,the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students
END:VEVENT
