SUMMARY:McCain – CPA Pre-Approved Rotational Program (Recruitment Session)
DESCRIPTION:Calling all aspiring CPAs ? Join McCain for a Virtual Info Session on August 13 from 12PM – 1PM ET\nto learn more about our company and CPA Pre-Approved Rotational Program for new grads based in\nToronto!\nJoin us for:\nAn overview of McCain and our products\nAn inside look into McCain’s CPA Pre-Approved Rotational Program\nA chance to meet members from our Global Finance and HR Teams\nA rundown of how to get your application noticed when applying\nP.S. Every attendee will have the opportunity to win a coffee chat with a member from our McCain\nteam! Stay tuned for more information on this.\nDeadline to sign up is August 5 at 11:59PM ET, RSVP NOW: https://forms.office.com/r/9Fv1EycKSB  \n
