SUMMARY:Empowered Economies: Sustainable Development for a Better Tomorrow
DESCRIPTION:Sustainable Economic Growth and Prosperity Speaker Series\nThe United Nations Sustainable Development Goals (UN SDGs) provide a comprehensive framework for addressing global challenges and achieving sustainable development. This webinar will explore how the SDGs can be the foundation for economic development, growth and prosperity. Presenters will explore how the SDGs can be integrated into day-to-day activities to effectively create positive economic, social and environmental impacts in their communities. The series will cover various topics that play a role in sustainable economic development, including entrepreneurship; equity, diversity and inclusion; supply chain management; import/export; water management; and community development.\nSpeaker: Alia Abbas, economic development professional and founder of Alia Consulting.\nRegister: yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_g2V224fKQfWHpQsx4lRwWA.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/empowered-economies-sustainable-development-for-a-better-tomorrow/
ORGANIZER;CN=CIFAL York:MAILTO:cifalpresident@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Research &amp; Innovation
LOCATION:(URL will be provided in the email confirmation)
END:VEVENT
