SUMMARY:Black Excellence at York University’s (BE YU) Welcome Event
DESCRIPTION:The Black Excellence at York University’s (BE YU) Welcome Event is designated to recognize and celebrate our incoming post-secondary, Black-identifying students. The rationale for this gathering is to foster inclusivity among Black students as they anticipate their transition to the university atmosphere. Students will have the chance to network with their fellow peers, upper-year students and essential departments at York U.\nPlease register for the event here ( https://machform.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=368858 ). We look forward to seeing you in attendance.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/black-excellence-at-york-universitys-be-yu-welcome-event/
