SUMMARY:Experience Grad York – Research Graduate Program in Law (LLM/PhD)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Law (Research LLM/PhD)? We invite you to attend our program session. Registration is required | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJwod-Cpqj4sHtSXgwPtGi9rxXaFIaPqkUrK )\nOsgoode is one of Canada’s oldest and most prestigious law schools with a reputation for academic excellence. Our degree programs are known for the breadth and depth of their constantly evolving course offerings and their ground-breaking approaches to the study of law. Through an innovative, creative and rigorous course of study, students are challenged to attain the highest standards of excellence in legal scholarship.\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
