SUMMARY:Experience Grad York – Osgoode Professional Development
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Law (Osgoode Professional Development)? We invite you to attend our program session. Registration is required | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_mubzKps3QbGlVZgdOemR3g )\nThis session discusses in detail the licensing process to practise law in Canada, the NCA process, and how our programs can be used to prepare yourself to become a lawyer in Canada as well as meet NCA requirements.\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
