SUMMARY:Experience Grad York – Biotechnology (Graduate Diploma) and Biotechnology Management (MBM)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Biotechnology Management? We invite you to attend our program session. Registration is required | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJAlcOuvpzkqEtDLEkqC6FwFDw74X_eE4HRS )\nThe Master’s in Biotechnology Management focuses on how modern biotechnology management is performed and surveys the scientific, ethical, and societal contexts. The program is designed to appeal to students who hold a Bachelor of Science degree in Biology, Biological Sciences, Biotechnology, Life Science, or a related discipline, and have little to no work experience in Biotechnology.\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
