SUMMARY:Experience Grad York – Management (Graduate Diploma)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in the Graduate Diploma in Management? We invite you to attend our program session. Registration is required | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJwkduCgqTktG9SG_0tKE7KbWR4qLNHPtLcs )\nThe Graduate Diploma in Management provides students who have non-business backgrounds with a robust understanding of the field of management and key skills required in managing an organization. Through a set of modules, students are introduced to major areas in management, including organizational theory, accounting, finance, operations management, organizational behaviors and law. The 2-term program can be taken concurrently with other graduate programs or as a direct-entry diploma for candidates who seek to advance their careers.\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
