SUMMARY:Experience Grad York – Professional Accounting (Graduate Diploma)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in the Graduate Diploma in Professional Accounting? We invite you to attend our program session. Registration is required | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJIocemqqDsvHdNF5Uhc2W2xIhK_WXXbMskF )\nA program designed for students who want to get a head start in earning their Chartered Professional Accountant (CPA) designation. Class sizes are capped at 25 students, and a variety of workshops and networking events help further prepare students for their professional career. The program offers three start times (fall, winter or summer) and can be completed on a full-time or part-time basis.\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/experience-grad-york-professional-accounting-graduate-diploma/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies,Faculty of Liberal Arts &amp; Professional Studies,Graduate Diploma in Professional Accounting
LOCATION:Online Zoom
