ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies,Faculty of Liberal Arts &amp; Professional Studies,Graduate Program in Philosophy
LOCATION:Online Zoom
