SUMMARY:Experience Grad York – Economics
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Economics? We invite you to attend our program session. Registration is required | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJEpduuvpjIvH9U-wihGBujtzRS_eY3y4qix )\nThe Graduate Program in Economics is ranked among the top programs in Canada. Students can take both applied courses associated with professional economic skills useful for work in the private or government sector, along with technical and theoretical courses for a career in academia. Specializations include: Econometrics; Industrial Organization; International Money & Finance; International Trade; Applied Economic Theory.\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
