SUMMARY:Experience Grad York – Communication & Culture
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Communication & Culture? We invite you to attend our program session. Registration is required | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJMtcuiprDIuEtVJySACzI5jQzkapTZwNTn8 )\nOffered through a partnership between York and Ryerson, the program capitalizes on the facilities and resources shared by both universities. Students benefit from the real-world experience of professors in the fields of communications, the social sciences, humanities, media and fine arts. The program offers three flexible areas of study: Media and Culture, Politics and Policy and Technology in Practice. Unique in Ontario, this program combines academic and professional work.\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
