SUMMARY:Experience Grad York – Geography
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Geography? We invite you to attend our program session. Registration is required | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJEkdu6hqT0iH9TMLCO3NlTG1ToRyBHmYfqy )\nOne of Canada’s leading programs in Geography offers students the chance to explore multiple ways of knowing the world based on social sciences, humanities and physical-biological sciences. The spirit of sustainability and social justice animates the research work conducted by our community of exceptional students and faculty. Nearly all of our graduate students are engaged in fieldwork.\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/experience-grad-york-geography/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Environmental &amp; Urban Change,Faculty of Graduate Studies,Graduate Program in Geography
LOCATION:Online Zoom
