TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Thriving in Transition as a Mature Student: Building Habits for University Success
DESCRIPTION:This workshop empowers mature students during their transition into university life. We explore effective habit formation, discuss strategies for thriving and tap into new-found power through intentional habits. Whether you’re returning to education after a break or starting fresh, this workshop equips you with practical tools for success. Join us in forming effective habits as you begin your academic journey.\nLearning Outcomes:\n\nUnderstanding Habit Formation: Participants will learn the science behind habit creation, including cues, routines and rewards. We’ll explore how to establish positive habits aligned with academic and personal goals.\nIdentifying Key Components: Analyze the key components of habit formation and understand their role in shaping daily routines and achieving long-term goals.\nPractical Techniques: Learn the six-step process for habit formation, applying it to shape daily routines and achieve long-term success.\nCreating Effective Habits: Discover how intentional habits impact overall well-being. Address study routines and self-regulation, breaking old patterns and embracing habits that enhance learning and well-being as a mature student.\nRegister here: yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJIlcOyuqzMtGdM8V_rPg3_YE6dIXFg-wDh2 ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJIlcOyuqzMtGdM8V_rPg3_YE6dIXFg-wDh2 ).\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/thriving-in-transition-as-a-mature-student-building-habits-for-university-success-3/
ORGANIZER;CN=ACMAPS:MAILTO:acmaps@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Bethune College,Calumet College,Colleges,Faculties,Faculty of Education,Faculty of Environmental &amp; Urban Change,Faculty of Graduate Studies,Faculty of Graduate Studies (Programs),Faculty of Health,Faculty of Liberal Arts &amp; Professional Studies,Faculty of Science,Lassonde School of Engineering,Osgoode Hall Law School,School of Continuing Studies,Stong College,Students,the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students
LOCATION:Zoom (online platform)
END:VEVENT
