SUMMARY:Transfer Student Orientation (In-Person)
DESCRIPTION:Join us to explore strategies for transfer student success at York U.\nTransfer Student Success at York: Issues, strategies and resources\nThis orientation session will highlight the issues transfer students face as they transition to university, explore strategies for transfer student success, and provide an overview of campus resources that can support academic and personal success at York.\nLearning outcomes:\n\nParticipants will be familiar with the prevailing issues faced by transfer students based on academic literature and our lived experience supporting transfer students.\nParticipants will be able to apply a range of strategies to support their academic and personal success.\nParticipants will identify a range of campus resources that will support their well-being and success at York U.\n\nRegister Now! ( https://machform.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=369941 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/transfer-student-orientation-in-person/
ORGANIZER;CN=ACMAPS:MAILTO:acmaps@yorku.ca
