SUMMARY:Mature Student Orientation (Online Session)
DESCRIPTION:Join us on this transformative journey, where we empower you to thrive as a mature student.\nResiliency, Resources & Reflection: Navigating University Life as a Mature Student\nThis orientation session focuses on building resilience and thriving strategies specifically tailored for mature students. We will explore the five-factor model of resilience, practical techniques, campus resources and self-reflection to empower you on your academic journey.\nLearning outcomes:\n\nLearn Diana Brecher’s five-factor model of resilience and how it contributes to flourishing as a mature student.\nDiscover various campus resources that support your well-being and academic success.\nExplore positive reflection techniques to enhance resilience and personal growth. Learn how to seamlessly integrate resilience and resources into your university life.\n\nRegister here: yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJwrf-GtrjwtGt1XYk5la0n_tmthEJrAbKq3#/registration ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJwrf-GtrjwtGt1XYk5la0n_tmthEJrAbKq3#/registration ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/mature-student-orientation-online-session/
