SUMMARY:How to Effectively Use LinkedIn
DESCRIPTION:Wondering how to use LinkedIn effectively to enhance your job search? Curious about leveraging features to build your professional network? Join our webinar to discover tips and strategies for maximizing your LinkedIn profile, connecting with industry professionals and utilizing the platform’s tools to advance your career. Don’t miss out on this opportunity to unlock LinkedIn’s full potential!\nHosted by Jasmine Morton\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nRegister for How to Effectively Use LinkedIn ( https://experience.yorku.ca/events.htm?evtId=4036 )\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/how-to-effectively-use-linkedin-6/
