SUMMARY:Career Centre Services Overview
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an empowering information session where we’ll guide you through the extensive resources and opportunities available at the Career Centre. Discover how our services can support your career development, from job search strategies and resumé building, to networking and interview preparation. Don’t miss this chance to unlock your potential and take the next step in your career!\nHosted by Roma Kozinska\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nRegister for the Career Centre Services Overview ( https://experience.yorku.ca/events.htm?evtId=4038 )\n\n
