TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:York Day Alumni Dinner at National Bank Open
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the annual York Day Alumni Dinner and celebrate with other alumni tennis fans. Connect with fellow alumni, enjoy delicious food and take a chance to win amazing prizes.\nTo gain entry into the York Day Alumni Dinner at National Bank Open, you and each of your guests must have purchased an August 7 session ticket to the National Bank Open.\nLearn more about the alumni discount ( https://yorku.alumni-perks.com/perks/tennis ) and purchasing tickets to National Bank Open (for any of the sessions) or call 1.877.283.6647.\nYork Day Alumni Dinner at National Bank Open\nDate: Wednesday, August 7\nTime: 5 – 7 p.m.\nLocation: Audi VIP Lounge, Sobeys Stadium at York University, 1 Shoreham Drive, North York, ON, M2N 3A6\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/york-day-alumni-dinner-at-national-bank-open/
ORGANIZER;CN=Office of Alumni Engagement:MAILTO:alumni@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/AlumniDinner_Event-Listing.jpg
END:VEVENT
