SUMMARY:Well-being Fest
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Well-being Fest!\nHead over to York Lions Stadium to enjoy a sunny break at Well-being Fest. Try out some new games and make some new friends while playing cornhole, kan jam, connect 4 and more. The teams from Student Counselling, Health & Well-being and Athletics & Recreation will be tabling throughout – drop-by to learn about services and upcoming events!\nNo registration required.\n
