SUMMARY:Department of English presents John Edwards with Rachel Tomasic
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday, July 10\n11:30 a.m. to 2:30 p.m.\nSLH 107\nLutenist John Edwards is the artistic director of The Musicians In Ordinary, which explores the repertoire of the Renaissance and Baroque.\nEdwards will give a lecture and demonstration, accompanied by singer Rachel Tomasic, on the Music of Shakespeare, to be performed on period instruments.\n \n
