SUMMARY:MES @ York Planning Alumni Committee 18th Annual Social
DESCRIPTION:You’re invited to the 18th Annual ‌MES @ York Planning Alumni Committee (MYPAC) Social! Join fellow alumni and current students for an evening of networking, catching up and celebrating our Environmental Studies community.\n18th Annual MYPAC Social\nWhen: 📅 Thursday, Oct. 10\nWhere: 📍Leña Restaurante\nTime: 5:30 p.m. to 9:30 p.m.\nThis is MYPAC’s most anticipated event of the year. Click here to RSVP!\nAbout MYPAC\nMYPAC was formed in 2004 by several York alumni, students and faculty members. MYPAC’s initiatives include the following:\n\nhost the annual MYPAC Social;\nmanage the MYPAC mentorship program;\nraise money for student initiatives and events; and\nsupport speaking programs.\n\nIf you have any questions about MYPAC initiatives, email mypac.executive@gmail.com.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/save-the-date-for-the-upcoming-mypac-18th-annual-social/
