SUMMARY:Astronomer in Residence Application Open for Summer 2024!
DESCRIPTION:Announcing a new astronomer in residence this week, June 24 to 30, with the Allan I. Carswell Observatory and the Killarney Provincial Park. Join Veronika Dornan on-site and online for a week of astronomy. Her blog for her astronomer in residence tenure can be found here: yorku.ca/science/observatory/air/astronomer-in-residence-blog.\n\nFor the full schedule of this week’s events on-site, visit ontarioparks.ca/park/killarney/events.\n\nJoin our astronomers in person if you are visiting the park, and enjoy the dark skies and telescope views.\nImage credit: Veronika Dornan, 2024.\n\n
