SUMMARY:Dance Innovations 2024: Lifting the Veil
DESCRIPTION:Dance Innovations 2024: Lifting the Veil  features the new choreographic works of 21 fourth year BFA dance majors performed by students engaged in all levels of York’s programs in Dance. The two series of Lifting the Veil feature world premieres by fourth year choreographers and Professor Bridget Cauthery’s new work for the third year Performance class.\nStudents are guided by faculty at every level of creation, performance, lighting design and production and it is the students who collaborate to run Dance Innovations, staged in the McLean Performance Studio, November 20, 21 and 22 at 7:00 p.m. and 8:30 p.m.\nArtistic Director and 4th year Choreography Course Director: Susan Lee\nCourse Director 3rd year Performance: Bridget Cauthery\nProduction Manager, Lighting Designer and Course Director: Jennifer Jimenez\nStage Manager: Sophia Fabiano\nDance Innovations: Lifting the Veil \nSeries A: Reclamation – Wed, Nov 20 to Fri, Nov 22 at 7:00 p.m.\nFeatures a world premiere by Professor Bridget Cauthery performed by the 3rd year Performance class and new choreographic works by fourth year students with student lighting design and production support.\nSeries B: Revolution – Wed, Nov 20 to Fri, Nov 22 at 8:30 p.m.\nFeatures new choreographic works by fourth year students with student lighting design and production support.\nLocation: McLean Performance Studio ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/mclean-performance-studio/ )\nTickets ( https://secure1.tixhub.com/yorku/online/index.asp ): $22.00\nAdvance (until Sunday Nov 17th): $ 16.00\nLimited Seating\nBox Office: 416-736-5888 | ampd.yorku.ca/boxoffice ( http://ampd.yorku.ca/perform/boxoffice )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/dance-innovations-2024lifting-the-veil/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:McLean Performance Studio, 244 Accolade East Building, York University @ 83 York Blvd. Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/posterimage.jpg
END:VEVENT
