SUMMARY:RBC CPA Pre-Approved Program Event
DESCRIPTION:Students are invited to join for an In-person Session to learn more about RBC’s Pre-Approved CPA Program where they will meet Senior Leaders, Alumni, and the Program Team!\nSpeakers: Alumni and the CPA Program Team\nDate – July 10, 2024\nTime – 03:00 pm EST – 4:30 pm EST\nLocation: – Downtown Toronto (After signing up, eligible students will receive the invite for the event)\nInvited Students:  Students entering their final year of studies (Bachelor’s, post-grad or Master’s) with an interest and passion for obtaining their CPA designation and be eligible to start the program from October 2025\nStudents can submit their interest for attending by July 03, 2024, 11:59pm EST: RBC- CPA Pre-Approved Program: In-Person Information Session\nProgram Page: https://jobs.rbc.com/ca/en/cpa-pre-approved-program ( https://jobs.rbc.com/ca/en/cpa-pre-approved-program )\nWhile RBC thanks all interested applicants, only those who are shortlisted to attend will be contacted.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/rbc-cpa-pre-approved-program-event/
