SUMMARY:Queering Place
DESCRIPTION:\nWhat does it mean to Queer Place? Is it a mark, a gesture, a way of being?\n\n\nJoin us in the Maloca Garden for four sessions of medicine planter and pathway making with Joce Two Crows and the Maloca team.\n\nWe will weave plants, medicines and digital storytelling together as we create planter installations out of tires as spaces for welcome, rest and contemplative in QUEERy-ing.\nRegister on Eventbrite ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/queering-place-tickets-923914211277?utm-campaign=social&utm-content=attendeeshare&utm-medium=discovery&utm-term=listing&utm-source=cp&aff=ebdsshcopyurl ).\n
