SUMMARY:AI for Your Career Search
DESCRIPTION:Join this workshop to explore the exciting intersection of AI and career advancement and equip yourself with the essential skills to thrive in the evolving job market. You will gain insights into leveraging AI tools for uncovering job opportunities, optimizing resumes and cover letters, and navigating AI-driven interview processes. AI can also be used to help you create your online brand and explore possible career directions.\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Career Centre” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nSelect “Workshops & Webinars”\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n
