DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate Pride Month with SCLD’s Mixer for Black, Indigenous, and Peope of Colour folks who are Queer and/or Trans.\nJoin us on June 26 at 3 p.m. at the Winters College Junior Common Room.\nCome for fun games, including board games, delicious snacks, speed-friending and bingo!\nThe dress code is: WEAR YOUR FAVOURITE COLOUR!\nSee you there!\nRegister here: york-socd.ticketleap.com/bipoc-queer–trans-mixer/details ( https://york-socd.ticketleap.com/bipoc-queer--trans-mixer/details ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/bipoc-queer-trans-mixer-2/
ORGANIZER;CN=Student Community &amp; Leadership Development:MAILTO:
CATEGORIES:Equity, Diversity &amp; Inclusion,Pride Month
LOCATION:Junior Common Room #012 Winters College @ 012 Winters College, Winters Junior Common Room
