SUMMARY:Pride Care Package Making
DESCRIPTION:This Pride Month, the Centre for Student Community & Leadership Development (SCLD) wants to celebrate by promoting care, love, health and wellness.\nCome celebrate with us on June 18 in Vari Hall, Room 3009, by assembling care packages – either for yourself, for a loved one or for us to give away.\nAny remaining packages will be distributed to York University community members by SCLD in the following days.\nAll materials will be provided by SCLD, but you are free to bring additional ones if desired, keeping in mind that the packages will be smaller in size.\nRegister here: york-socd.ticketleap.com/pride-care-package-making ( https://york-socd.ticketleap.com/pride-care-package-making/ ).\n
