DESCRIPTION:Governance, Science & Technology of Mass Evacuation Speaker Series Panel\nMass Evacuation & First Nations\n\nTara K. McGee, professor, University of Alberta;\nJennifer Jesty, emergency resiliency manager, Union of Nova Scotia Mi’kmaq;\nMaia Foster-Sanchez, Stronger Together: Evacuation Partnerships;\nMichelle Gervais, Stronger Together: Evacuation Partnerships; and\nEric Kennedy, assistant professor, Disaster & Emergency Management, School of Administrative Studies, York University.\n\nSession 2, Tuesday, June 18, 2 to 3 p.m. (EDT)\nRegister here: yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_SOz-LHPcRl2WNRIRGJ8MAQ#/registration ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_SOz-LHPcRl2WNRIRGJ8MAQ#/registration ).\n \n
