DESCRIPTION:The objective of the T.A.S.T.E. (Talk About Studies To Employment) Mentoring Program is to provide York Students and new graduates with an opportunity to connect with professionals in their field of interest. During the meeting, the mentor shares information about their job, industry and organization, and students get the opportunity to ask questions, receive guidance and gain industry insights.\nRegister for this orientation session to get all the information you need to join this program.\nHow do I register?\nTo register for this event, follow the steps below:\n\nLog-in to Experience York ( https://experience.yorku.ca/home/home.htm )\nSelect “Career Centre” in the menu on the left-hand side of the page\nSelect “Workshops & Webinars”\nNavigate to the event you want to register for in the events calendar\nSelect the event and click the “Register for the event” button in the event listing\n\n
