SUMMARY:Learn about the Building Ontario Businesses Initiative Act – Virtual Drop-in Session
DESCRIPTION:Strategic Procurement is hosting two hour-long, virtual drop-in sessions to discuss the provincial government’s new Building Ontario Business Initiative Act and how it impacts purchasing on behalf of the University.\nCommunity members will learn more about the act and how to make their purchases compliant. Following the 15-minute overview, the remainder of the session will be reserved for live questions. Community members can join at any time during the hour-long session to ask their question(s).\nDates:\n\nWednesday June 5, 1:30 to 2:30 p.m.\n\nJoin session here\nMeeting ID: 940 0483 2758\nPasscode: 747631\n\n\n\n\nWednesday June 19, 1:30 to 2:30 p.m.\n\nJoin session here\nMeeting ID: 978 6040 4844\nPasscode: 327922\n\n\n\nFor immediate questions, learn more at Building Ontario Businesses Initiative Act | Purchase Good and Services (yorku.ca) or reach out to Strategic Procurement at purchase@yorku.ca.\n
