SUMMARY:Celebrate June Bike Month with Transportation Services and Partners
DESCRIPTION:Join Parking & Transportation Services in celebrating June Bike Month on June 5, from 11 a.m. to 1 p.m. in front of Vari Hall (VH Plaza).\nTransportation Services ( https://www.yorku.ca/transportation/ ) is partnering with Bike Share Toronto ( https://bikesharetoronto.com/ ), Cycle York ( https://regenesis.eco/en/cycleyork ) and Smart Commute ( https://www.smartcommute.ca/public/home.aspx?customsubsite=NorthTorontoVaughan ) to offer the York community a range of resources, including Toronto cycling maps, quick bike repairs and safety handbooks. This event provides participants with the opportunity to connect with various biking communities and to learn more about their services and sustainable initiatives.\nParticipants can also spin a prize wheel to win prizes.\n
