SUMMARY:Class of 2024 EUC Convocation Reception
DESCRIPTION:The Faculty of Environmental & Urban Change is hosting a reception to celebrate our Class of 2024 grads!\nAs part of your convocation day, we would like to extend a heartfelt invitation to our Class of 2024 EUC Convocation Reception for you, your family and friends to visit your home away from home to celebrate your achievements. The reception will take place on Friday, June 14 at 2 p.m. at the Health, Nursing & Environmental Studies Building, Room 140, following the convocation ceremony.\nThis reception is dedicated to celebrating your success with fellow graduates, faculty members and loved ones. Enjoy food, music, a photo booth and remarks from our community. It’s a wonderful opportunity to connect with the academic community and celebrate your journey while looking forward to the future.\nPlease register by June 7 to join us at the reception: euc.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=241113.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/class-of-2024-euc-convocation-reception/
