DESCRIPTION:The Faculty of Environmental & Urban Change at York University is hosting its first-ever summer camp. This experience is the place to be for young minds ready to make a difference!\nAre you a high-school student starting Grade 10, 11 or 12 in September? Join us for a week of learning, growing and fun. Our camp has exciting activities, workshops, and guest speakers to inspire and empower the next generation of changemakers.\nRegister now: euc.yorku.ca/future-changemakers-summer-program ( https://euc.yorku.ca/future-changemakers-summer-program/ ).\n
