SUMMARY:Practical AI: Introducing Students to Co-Writing with AI
DESCRIPTION:What does authorship mean when GenAI can do so much? We explore the SHARP (Streamline, Heighten, Arrange, Ratify, Prove) framework for scholarly co-writing with artificial intelligence (AI), developed at York’s Teaching Commons and pilot-tested over summer 2024. By the end of this session, participants will be able to introduce students to an adaptable approach for academic writing alongside AI while maintaining accountable authorship.\nClick here to register ( https://teachingcommonsforms.apps01.yorku.ca/forms/view.php?id=1083951 ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/practical-ai-introducing-students-to-co-writing-with-ai/
