SUMMARY:An Overview of Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) and Panel Discussion
DESCRIPTION:This session is designed to provide incoming first-year students with an overview of the overall functions of the BE YU program. We will also host a panel of upper-level Black students who will highlight their experience at York University. They will share the resources they’ve used throughout their duration at York as well as discuss their experiences in their personal and professional journeys.\nThe team is excited to host you and we look forward to seeing you all there. You can register for the event here ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJEpd-ygpj4rGdaEeMVVMKTJK9pq1e4iqJwB#/registration ). If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us at beyu@yorku.ca ( mailto:beyu@yorku.ca ).\n
