SUMMARY:Rainbow Grad Celebration hosted by York’s Sexuality & Gender Advocacy Alumni Network (SAGA)
DESCRIPTION:We are thrilled to invite you to the York Rainbow Grad Celebration. York’s Sexuality & Gender Advocacy Alumni Network (SAGA) warmly welcome York U alumni who identify as members of the 2SLGBTQIA+ community to join this celebration along with professors, staff and allies.\nRainbow Grad Celebration\nDate: Wednesday, June 5\nTime: 6 – 8 p.m.\nLocation: York University, Schulich School of Business, 4700 Keele St, North York, ON M3J 1P3 ( https://emclick.imodules.com/ls/click?upn=u001.wvj1UITJ0gqfV5RhmLyU-2BJ5Q8WIkTM5O9fpm4zmUmbIdirf9X78z3nVIKQ68UAPrxdfarSNPRNf2M8bUCm-2BHGHb-2FJUOy8fvCBKU-2FFnq2ucsUTF2DvUHgCFWn15i25-2BgH-cjE_s7rEWSqnXGIm80S-2BUND-2Fa0RJ0IGUXgVlVIGi-2FA6FycdkqJm9JRn5lQrMPCbWxO2C1NX19Pu3FxG5WgoIFXWvS0IksiZWkMrTGpdviIHiWEdPTovZwBqeY1rnwiNdoG6D8aJ6Xa8GkaOe1X0osjcLTv1vp-2FhKgIWY2YQPz5-2BrWI7ufnOcT41DQGGxTjphOup1XqmCGQuXliKUMAZAHFINH5-2FuvVPdt1T7niMff-2FyhQJBF-2BEMVrrKTBAqcIoLsrs3V9xGLbvOeYabST4eKb-2B5RRX0EDw8WTkMAhA8cx5G5gt-2BxxJ5ogXRVPjThuKfEN6wB8FZ5MXE3aUf4w5FnSCpaA9mlGEcs3W0QosZo0pq9DdvrBFz1e4zHkaAYhBp5aThFhmNJ17ryYZo7Ll3x-2BEavVW3haMq-2BotSHTNWdQgCUTfWQxMMXXCIH8tkZk-2BlLkPjwQYsqSfFUj6xtoQPRIqpZaOY5hr9C2iX9BxTBjZDu1QhLk6xpi-2BK8XOBpBoGJH5FNetdrM9UQ60-2FOWSE-2FGFFjeA-3D-3D )\nYou and a guest are invited to attend an evening of celebration, along with faculty, staff, classmates, alumni, friends, family and allies. Dress to impress and enjoy food, music, photo ops and heartfelt words from favourite members of the community.\nAs SAGA celebrates the accomplishments of its grads, the group also acknowledges the work that remains to achieve equity. This event is being held in partnership with the Division of Advancement, Division of Students, Division of Equity, People and Culture and the Centre for Human Rights, Equity and Inclusion.\nThis celebration is complimentary to attend, but registration is required. For more information, please email Yasmine Mensah at mensahy@yorku.ca.\n
