SUMMARY:Scholars’ Hub @ Home | Selfie Harm: The Effects of Social Media on Body Image
DESCRIPTION:Join Dr. Jennifer Mills, Professor and Clinical Psychologist in the Faculty of Health on May 8 at 12 p.m. for Scholars’ Hub where she will provide an overview of her research from the past six years on the relationship between social media and body image. She will talk about how she came to study this topic and the evolution of her research questions, the research methodologies she uses and the results of several studies she has conducted at York.\n \n
