SUMMARY:York U Broadway Night in NYC: Mary Jane
DESCRIPTION:We’re proud to announce the Broadway debut of our very own York alumna Rachel McAdams (BFA ’01) in Mary Jane at Samuel J. Friedman Theatre. In celebration of this Broadway debut, you are invited to an exclusive York U alumni mixer on May 30, followed by the stage play where you will save 25% off the regular price with our special group rate.\nDate: Thursday, May 30\nReception: 5 p.m. Doors open: 4:45 p.m. (refreshments included)\nLocation: Living Room Bar W New York – Times Square\nShow: 7 p.m.\nLocation: Samuel J. Friedman Theatre ( https://maps.app.goo.gl/aGcM5qL9agM2bHP79 )\n
