SUMMARY:LA&PS Open House
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\nYork University’s Faculty of Liberal Arts & Professional Studies (LA&PS) is one of the largest and most diverse Faculties in Canada. With more than 90 programs, we deliver a unique learning experience where you can combine traditional liberal arts with professional studies.\nDon’t miss the opportunity to visit our Keele Campus to discover what it would be like to study at LA&PS. Ask questions and connect with our LA&PS program representatives, in addition to the Co-op team and Academic Advisors. You will meet professors from our programs, discover helpful tips about student life and learn more about your next steps towards becoming a member of the LA&PS community.\nCampus tours, snacks, tea and coffee will be available throughout the day. See you there!\nRegister Today!\n\n\n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/laps-open-house/
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Liberal Arts &amp; Professional Studies,LA&amp;PS Future Students,LA&amp;PS Open to the Public,LA&amp;PS Students All,Recruitment,Students
