SUMMARY:How to Make Career Decisions Webinar for Students with Disabilities
DESCRIPTION:This webinar is customized for York students with disabilities only.\nAre you feeling stuck with your career decision making and not sure how to move forward? Attend this webinar to learn the steps of making informed career decisions and how a growth mindset is essential for your personal and career success. Partnership of York’s Career Centre and Student Accessibility Services.\nTo register: experience.yorku.ca/events.htm?evtId=3881.\nIf you require accessibility needs to access this webinar, contact the Career Centre as soon as possible so we can assist you with accessing this webinar career@yorku.ca.\n
