SUMMARY:VPD ADERSIM EOC VR Open House
DESCRIPTION:Presented by CIFAL York and DEXR Lab from York University in partnership with The Grid, XPERTVR and UP360 are thrilled to announce an exclusive Tech Open House event centered around our cutting-edge Extended Reality (XR) Lab. This event will showcase the latest innovations in virtual reality (VR) and artificial intelligence (AI), offering students and faculty a hands-on look at how these technologies are reshaping educational experiences.\nLocation:\nVictor Phillip Dadaleh ADERSIM LAB\nSchulich School of Business\nRm. N004 (Basement Floor)\n111 Ian MacDonald Blvd\nYork University, Keele Campus\n\nOpen to: students, faculty and staff.\nNo registration required.\n
