SUMMARY:Ottawa Alumni Networking Mixer
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an opportunity to reconnect with other alumni and expand your professional network at our upcoming alumni mixer. Whether you graduated recently, or many years ago, we would love to see you.\nOttawa Alumni Networking Mixer\nDate: Tuesday, May 21\nTime: 6-8 p.m.\nLocation: Starling Restaurant & Bar ( https://maps.app.goo.gl/QQAFLAueB7SN6yPE7 ) 54 York St Ottawa, ON K1N 5T1\nTickets are $10. Hors d’oeuvres and refreshments will be served.\n
