SUMMARY:Mid-Career Conversations | How to Grow Your Career with LinkedIn
DESCRIPTION:Join Dr. Nidhi Sachdeva (MA ’09) for our final Mid-Career Conversations session for the 2023-24 year on May 13 at 12 p.m. In this session, Dr. Sachdeva will share key strategies and actionable tips to optimize your LinkedIn profile and engage with your audience authentically. She will also explore tangible ways to elevate your online presence and leverage LinkedIn’s potential for career growth.\n \n
