SUMMARY:Loblaw Event: Loblaw Early Talent Virtual Summit
DESCRIPTION:Weren’t able to join us for the in-person Early Talent Summit in February? Now’s your chance  to connect, engage, and gain valuable insights into the exciting career opportunities within our organization!\nJoin us April 25th 1-2:30pm for an afternoon tailored for new grad business students like you, featuring insightful discussions, networking opportunities with our esteemed colleagues, and an in-depth exploration of full-time recruitment at Loblaw. We’ll be highlighting colleagues and roles across the country from our Finance, Category Management, Retail Merchandising, Loblaw Real Estate, Procurement, Operations, Marketing & Brands teams.\nRegister for our Loblaw Early Talent Virtual Summit today! https://tryhellohire.com/schedule/loblaw-early-talent-virtual-summit-1 ( https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/tryhellohire.com/schedule/loblaw-early-talent-virtual-summit-1__;!!GUxQW5qUiFhLkzdRaA!b0ez_cKMYJLuNREkzTF1h4QXjoK3Uvrq_1abIomr9cCQGHEhUb7zy3KULvvEXlm-qOk7JOfmz0-aIO23P7koIYigj2lD4Oq5p-Ih$ )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/loblaw-event-loblaw-early-talent-virtual-summit/
