SUMMARY:Correctional Services Recruitment Unit – Women in Enforcement (Fair)
DESCRIPTION:The Correctional Services Recruitment Unit, in collaboration with Fleming College, 599 Brealey Dr. Peterborough, will be hosting its first Women in Enforcement Career Event.\nCome out to Fleming College to find out about local careers for women in Provincial and Federal Correctional Services, OPP, and Youth Justice Services.\nTalk to recruiters, network with staff, and learn about opportunities and supports for correctional officers, probation & parole officers, nurses, social workers, addiction counselors, crisis negotiators,\nK9 officers, Deputy Superintendents, Staff Sergeants, Volunteer Coordinators, etc.\nPlease see the link below to register on Eventbrite:\nhttps://www.eventbrite.ca/e/women-in-enforcement-career-fair-tickets-882925803847?aff=oddtdtcreator ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/women-in-enforcement-career-fair-tickets-882925803847?aff=oddtdtcreator )\n
