SUMMARY:Resumé & Cover Letter Writing Webinar (Job Search)
DESCRIPTION:Find out how to effectively target your Resumé and Cover Letter. Present your experiences, education and skills in a way that showcases your assets and piques employers’ interest in you.\n** PLEASE NOTE THIS WILL BE AN ONLINE WEBINAR **\nTo participate in an online webinar, you will need a computer (with speakers or headphones), internet access, and a Zoom desktop application (Zoom) installed on your computer. You will receive the URL of the webinar with the Zoom Meeting ID in a reminder email after you have registered for the event. On the day of the event, you will join the webinar and ask your questions via chat.\n\n\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n\n\n
