DESCRIPTION:Join us to learn more about the graduate programs available at the new Markham Campus at York. This presentation will cover the following:\nGraduate Diploma in Biotechnology\nGraduate Diploma in Management\nMaster of Biotechnology Management\nMaster of Management Practice\nMaster of Public Policy, Administration & Law (Municipal Stream)\nWe will cover admission requirements, eligibility, tuition, funding, scholarships, and how to apply. Questions welcome!\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_ZnWOGuW2SYKsDNR8Q3YQSg ).\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ).\nFor any questions, please email us at FGSNEWS@YORKU.CA ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n
