SUMMARY:EGY Drop In Hour: Bring Your Questions
DESCRIPTION:This session is open to anyone who has questions about graduate admissions at York. There is no structure or agenda, just a chance for folks to get the answers they’re looking for. Feel free to drop in at any point between 6:00pm and 7:00pm (EST) with your questions about a master’s, PhD, or graduate diploma.\nPlease note that this session will not be able to address questions about programs in the Schulich School of Business ( https://schulich.yorku.ca/ ), or the Osgoode Hall Law School ( https://www.osgoode.yorku.ca/ ).\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_CZLez681T9OsxBElm2tzXg ).\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nFor any questions, please email us at FGSNEWS@YORKU.CA ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n
