SUMMARY:LA&PS Co-op Information Session
DESCRIPTION:Before applying to the LA&PS Co-op Program, students must attend a mandatory information session. The session provides an overview of the program, academic eligibility requirements, application and job search process, program expectations and non-refundable fees.\nRegistration: Please note registrants should only register and attend one Co-op information session. Registering for multiple info sessions causes a block in the system when students attempt to apply to the program.\nZoom Link: The Zoom link and password will be emailed to registrants the morning of the info session.\nAttendance: Registrants must join the Zoom meeting on time. Those arriving late will not be admitted and will be required to attend an alternate session. Please cancel your registration if you are unable to attend.\nRegister Now\n
