LAST-MODIFIED:20240416
PRIORITY:5
SEQUENCE:9
TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Co-op Program Drop-in for Students (in-person)
DESCRIPTION:Students, get your questions answered!\nDo you have questions about applying to the LA&PS Co-op Program?\nHave questions about accessing the Co-op Job Board?\nDo you need information on how to arrange a career support appointment?\nWould you like assistance connecting to career readiness resources, such as resume templates, LinkedIn Learning pathways, and employer recruitment events?\nDo you have other questions about the Co-op Program?\nWe’d love to answer your questions! Join our team for in-person office hours where you can meet with Co-op Coordinators to ask questions and seek advice.\nThis session is open to all LA&PS undergraduate students. To learn more about the LA&PS Co-op Program, visit our website and attend an Information Session!\nRegistration: registration not required\nMeeting Room: Ross South 916\nMore Information\n
URL:https://experience.yorku.ca/events.htm?evtId=3969
ORGANIZER;CN=LA&amp;PS Internship Program:MAILTO:lapscoop@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:LA&amp;PS Career and Employer Events,LA&amp;PS Department of Anthropology,LA&amp;PS Department of Communication &amp; Media Studies,LA&amp;PS Department of Economics,LA&amp;PS Department of English,LA&amp;PS Department of Equity Studies,LA&amp;PS Department of French Studies,LA&amp;PS Department of History,LA&amp;PS Department of Humanities,LA&amp;PS Department of Languages, Literatures &amp; Linguistics,LA&amp;PS Department of Philosophy,LA&amp;PS Department of Politics,LA&amp;PS Department of Social Science,LA&amp;PS Department of Sociology,LA&amp;PS Founders College,LA&amp;PS McLaughlin College,LA&amp;PS New College,LA&amp;PS School of Administrative Studies,LA&amp;PS School of Gender, Sexuality and Women's Studies,LA&amp;PS School of Human Resources Management,LA&amp;PS School of Information Technology,LA&amp;PS School of Public Policy &amp; Administration,LA&amp;PS School of Social Work,LA&amp;PS SCOLAPS,LA&amp;PS Student Success,LA&amp;PS Students-Undergrad,LA&amp;PS Vanier College
LOCATION:Ross Building 4700 Keele Street Toronto ON, Canada M3J 1P3
END:VEVENT
