SUMMARY:Spring Capstone Day 2024
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate York University students and their success!\nCapstone Day is a showcase, at which students present their completed capstone and pre-capstone projects and compete for awards. This is a great opportunity for students to share their project experience and develop professional skills to enhance their career readiness.\nCelebrate C4 (cross-campus capstone classroom) student success at this public, pan-campus event, which will be held on April 26 from 2 to 5:30 p.m. C4 students will wrap up their project journeys by sharing their findings and competing for awards.\nThis event brings project partners and mentors together with the entire York community to celebrate the innovation, creativity, ambition and impact of our students working on project related to the United Nations Sustainable Development Goals (UN SDGs).\nEvent schedule:\n\nProject touring 2 to 5 p.m.\nAwards ceremony 5 to 5:30 p.m.\n\nRegister: C4’s Spring Capstone Day April 26th 2024 Guest Registration Form (office.com).\nEmail c4class@yorku.ca ( mailto:c4class@yorku.ca ) with any questions.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/spring-capstone-day-2024/
CATEGORIES:Earth Month,Students
LOCATION:Collaboratory, Scott Library (Second Floor) @ 4700 Keele St, North York, ON M3J 2S5
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/LifeScience_Students_standing4-scaled.jpeg
END:VEVENT
