SUMMARY:PowerPlay Challenge: A York U Energy Showdown
DESCRIPTION:Athletics & Recreation is hosting it’s first ever PowerPlay Challenge: A York U Energy Showdown!\n\n\n\n This Earth Day, watch three varsity athletes, fitness enthusiasts, and staff members compete to generate the most electricity on the new SportsArt fitness equipment at Tait Mackenzie Fitness Centre.\n\n\n\nThis event will be streamed via Instagram ( https://instagram.com/yorkulions ) and YouTube ( https://www.youtube.com/@yorkulions ). Be sure to tune in!\n
