SUMMARY:Webinar: Grad Studies at York University’s Markham Campus
DESCRIPTION:Join us to learn more about the graduate programs available at the new Markham Campus at York, for Fall 2024 admission. This presentation will cover the following:\n\nGraduate Diploma in Biotechnology\nGraduate Diploma in Management\nMaster of Biotechnology Management\nMaster of Management Practice\nMaster of Public Policy, Administration & Law (Municipal Gov’t Stream)\n\nWe will cover admission requirements, eligibility, tuition, funding, scholarships, and how to apply.\nQuestions are welcome!\nRegistration is free. Register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYqcemgrzsrGNKRzxqMHQ3j3B2m5LSF1o5V )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/grad-at-yorks-markham-campus/
