SUMMARY:Stop Food Waste Day with YUeats
DESCRIPTION:You’re invited to our Stop Food Waste Day Table at Stong Dining Hall on April 11th, between 11 a.m. and 1 p.m.\nStop Food Waste Day is globally celebrated on April 24, with YUeats getting the party started earlier.\nWe will have a “Toss Against Waste” game with trivia, plant seed starter sets to giveaway,  Stop The Waste Pledge, samples of our waste not salad and more.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/stop-food-waste-day-with-yueats/
