SUMMARY:Schulich School of Business Research Day 2024
DESCRIPTION:\nRSVP HERE: schulich.yorku.ca/researchday2024.\n\n\nJoin the Schulich community for Research Day 2024, a biennial event that celebrates the innovative research and creative achievements of Schulich researchers.\nHighlights of the event include:\n\na research poster gallery showcasing the breadth of research at Schulich;\na thought-provoking plenary panel discussion, expert conversations on Schulich’s trailblazing research;\na presentation of the prestigious Dean’s Research Awards; and\nan academic excellence reception in honour of our award recipients.\n\nIt is a unique event to learn about Schulich’s current research expertise.\nWe will have the opportunity to look over the shoulders of faculty and PhD students at the forefront of new research ventures and celebrate the research excellence of the Schulich School of Business.\n—\n\nThis event is free.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/schulich-school-of-business-research-day-2024/
ORGANIZER;CN=Schulich School of Business:MAILTO:admissions@schulich.yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Schulich School of Business
LOCATION:Rob and Cheryl McEwen Graduate Study &amp; Research Building @ 4700 Keele Street
END:VEVENT
