SUMMARY:Markham Campus Student Reception
DESCRIPTION:Whether you’re just exploring, or you just submitted your application and you’re in the home stretch heading towards your future in post-secondary studies, you won’t want to miss this event. If you’re curious about what to expect next, asking questions like:\n\nHow do I accept my offer?\nWhen will I hear back about scholarships?\nWhen do I have to apply for residence?\nHow do I enroll in classes?\n\nYou’ll find all the answers you’re looking for and much more on Saturday, April 6 at the Toronto Marriott Markham (170 Enterprise Boulevard). Our professors and staff are thrilled to meet York University’s Markham Campus inaugural Class of 2028 and hear about what matters most to you as you prepare to embark on a new journey.\nYou’ll have a chance to ask questions about program structure, specific courses, meet your professors and connect with student services staff. Get a feel for the campus’s close-knit, student-centred approach designed to connect you to all the resources and supports you need to thrive as you transition into your program.\nRSVP: eventbrite.ca/e/markham-campus-student-reception-tickets-809091192537?aff=yueventlist.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/markham-campus-student-reception/
