SUMMARY:Dialogue on Disability Disclosure in the Workplace for Students With Disabilities Webinar (Career Exploration)
DESCRIPTION:This webinar is customized and is for York students with disabilities. Do you have questions regarding whether or not you should disclose your disability to an employer? If you decide to disclose your disability, do you wonder when and how you should do it? In this webinar you will get tips and suggestions regarding timing and method(s) of disclosure and have the opportunity to discuss your questions and concerns regarding disclosure at the workplace. Partnership of the Career Centre and Student Accessibility Services (SAS).\nIf you require accessibility needs to access this webinar, please contact the Career Centre as soon as possible so we can assist you with accessing this webinar career@yorku.ca\n** PLEASE NOTE THIS WILL BE AN ONLINE WEBINAR**\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n
