SUMMARY:Personality and Career Choice Webinar (Career Exploration)
DESCRIPTION:Find out how your personality may influence your career choices and clarify important aspects of yourself through the lens of the Myers Briggs Type Indicator (MBTI), one of the world’s most widely used assessments. You’ll come away with an estimate of your Type, and, more importantly, a profile of who you are and what’s most important to you in your career.\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n
