SUMMARY:Science Co-op Program
DESCRIPTION:Elevate your career readiness with the Science Co-op Program, one of the fastest-growing experiential education programs at YorkU! Join the information session to discover exclusive job search services, paid co-op opportunities, the enrollment process, and insights into what awaits you in the program. If you are interested in a deeper and more enriching educational experience, don’t miss out on this information session!\nCo-op is offered to the following science programs:\n\nBiology\nBiochemistry\nBiotechnology\nBiomedical Science\nChemistry\nEnvironmental Biology\nEnvironmental Science”\n\nRegister here(Zoom Link)\nWelcome! You are invited to join a meeting: Coop Info Session. After registering, you will receive a confirmation email about joining the meeting.\n
