SUMMARY:Newly Admitted: The Transfer Process with LA&PS and ACMAPS
DESCRIPTION:Thank you for your interest in learning more about your new offer to York University as a transfer student! This webinar is a collaborative offering between the Office of Admissions and Recruitment, The Faculty of Liberal Arts & Professional Studies (LA&PS) and the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students (ACMAPS).\nIf you are a transfer student and have an offer to a program within the Faculty of Liberal Arts & Professional Studies, join our webinar to learn more about:\n\nYork’s Campuses and Resources\nAcademic Advising\nTransfer Credit Process\nSupport Services\n\nThe information session will be 1 hour in length and 30 minutes to address any questions live in our Q+A.\nThis session is hosted by Krenare Aliovski, Transfer and Mature Recruitment Officer, Tammy Astrafallie, Student Success & Academic Advisor in the Faculty of Liberal Arts & Professional Studies and Navinie Somaroo-Durga, Coordinator, Mature Student Success in the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students.\nWe look forward to meeting you online!\n
