SUMMARY:20 Now Documentary Premiere
DESCRIPTION:Did you know 55 per cent of Toronto’s total carbon emissions come from buildings? 🏢\nA group of undergraduate students working under the umbrella of the C4 course invites you to a documentary premiere!\nJoin us for a fun and engaging evening on March 27 to learn more about all the options to get our buildings to net zero through the documentary 20 NOW. 🎥\nTogether, let’s pave the way for a greener future in Toronto. 🌿\nDinner and snacks will be provided. For entry, please fill out the following registration form.\nAttire: dress up, it’s a movie premiere!\n
