DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a paw-some event! Join us for a delightful gathering aimed at creating a positive and comforting space for York University students ahead of exam season. Come treat yourself to delicious pizza, connect with fellow students and our alumni team, and experience the joy of interacting with a therapy dog. Don’t miss out on this chance to de-stress, unwind and recharge in good company.\nNoon to 1 p.m.: Enjoy some delicious pizza, join in exciting games and get a chance to enter for an amazing prize in our raffle draw. Plus, be inspired by encouraging messages from our esteemed alumni to fellow students.\n1 to 2 p.m.: Unwind with the soothing presence of a therapy dog, ready to spread joy and comfort to all attendees.\n
