SUMMARY:Zotero Tune Up
DESCRIPTION:Have you attended one of the Libraries’ sessions on Zotero ( https://www.zotero.org/ ), the free, open-source citation management tool? Are you still having trouble with configuring and customizing the tool on your laptop? Do you still have questions? A problem with Zotero that you want to talk through with other users?\nIf you answered “Yes” to one or more of these questions, consider registering to attend the Zotero tune-up, an in-person workshop and drop-in help session. During the workshop, librarians and archivists will help troubleshoot your citation problems, demonstrate a feature of the software, or help you figure out just what is going wrong with your Zotero installation\nRegister in advance at:https://yorku.libcal.com/event/3778355\n
