SUMMARY:York U Alumni Receptions in China
DESCRIPTION:As we usher in the Year of the Dragon, we invite you to join us at one of our upcoming alumni receptions near you. Reconnect with old friends, exchange ideas and engage in insightful conversations with accomplished alumni who have excelled in their respective fields.\nDate: Tuesday, April 2, 2024\nTime: 6:30 – 8:30 p.m.\nLocation: JW Marriott Hotel Shanghai at Tomorrow Square, Meeting Room 3, 399 Nan Jing West Road, Huangpu, Shanghai, China, 200003\nTickets: $15 CAD (includes refreshments)\nRSVP here  ( https://give.yorku.ca/s/1853/adv/form.aspx?sid=1853&gid=2&pgid=1413&cid=2818 )\n\nDate: Thursday, April 4, 2024\nTime: 6:30 – 8:30 p.m.\nLocation: InterContinental Beijing Sanlitun, Tulip Room, No. 1 South San Li Tun, Chaoyang, Beijing, China, 100600\nTickets: $15 CAD (includes refreshments)\nRSVP here ( https://events.yorku.ca/events/york-u-beijing-alumni-reception/ )\nFor any questions about these events, please reach out to Prikankshit Mor, Manager, Regional Alumni Programs at morps@yorku.ca.\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/york-u-alumni-receptions-in-china/
