SUMMARY:The York University Alumni Awards
DESCRIPTION:A memorable evening awaits you at the York University Alumni Awards, as we honour our outstanding alumni.\nThese Awards celebrate alumni who exemplify the values of York, have made remarkable contributions to their fields, and changed the world for the better. On April 3, the tradition of honouring their contributions will continue.\nWe invite you to join us for a spectacular event filled with live entertainment, special guests, delicious food, and networking opportunities in celebration of York’s outstanding recipients of 2023. It will be an exciting evening and a fantastic show!\nWednesday, April 3, 2024\nGlenn Gould Studio, 250 Front St. West, Toronto\n6:15 p.m. | Doors open\n8:30 p.m. | After-show social, food and networking\nDress code: Formal attire\n \n
