SUMMARY:Exam Prep for Mature and Transfer Students
DESCRIPTION:Do you have a test coming up? Learn tips and strategies you can use before, during, and after your test to feel prepared and confident. This workshop will also touch on strategies for answering different types of test questions and managing test nervousness. \nJoin ACMAPS and Learning Skills Services for the exam prep workshop that could help you in any of your exams!.\n*Please note that you must register with a York U email address. After registering, you will receive a confirmation email containing information about joining the workshop. \nRegistration link: yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJckcO-tqzkjGtJPmu8mP-C-AGvrYoPI8RxS. \n
