SUMMARY:Supporting Open & Respectful Dialogue Program info session
DESCRIPTION:\nSupporting Open & Respectful Dialogue\n\n\n\nThe supporting Open & Respectful Dialogue Program ( https://www.yorku.ca/vpepc/strategic-priorities-initiatives/respectful-dialogue/ ) offers funding, logistical support and resources to students, staff and faculty members who are trying to develop conversation and connections across differences.\nOur goal is to support good ideas, intentions and efforts by York community members, so we have tried to make the application process as simple and accessible as possible.\nPlease get in touch if you have any questions or would like some guidance: epcinfo@yorku.ca ( mailto:epcinfo@yorku.ca ).\nJoin an upcoming session to find out more.\nUpcoming Information Sessions\nTuesday, March 19, 4 to 4:30 p.m.\nJoin Zoom meeting:\nyorku.zoom.us/j/99745796531?pwd=NlVZK09pT1h4MDE5OTJMaVBpVGI3UT09&from=addon ( https://yorku.zoom.us/j/99745796531?pwd=NlVZK09pT1h4MDE5OTJMaVBpVGI3UT09&from=addon ).\nMeeting ID: 997 4579 6531\nPasscode: 027012\n—\nWednesday, March 20, noon to 12:30 p.m.\nJoin Zoom meeting:\nyorku.zoom.us/j/96952756267?pwd=dXdqYU92TXZxb0VXNTJZTmljUitnQT09&from=addon ( https://yorku.zoom.us/j/96952756267?pwd=dXdqYU92TXZxb0VXNTJZTmljUitnQT09&from=addon ).\nMeeting ID: 969 5275 6267\nPasscode: 129398\n\n
