PRIORITY:5
SEQUENCE:2
TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Information Session: Northumbria University, UK
DESCRIPTION:AMPD students, you’re invited to embark on a journey studying in the North-East of England at Northumbria University. Located in the heart of Newcastle Upon Tyne, Northumbria offers a diverse range of programs taught by some of the best academics the country has to offer. Also, dive into the culture and explore some of the historic landmarks that make the Northeast truly beautiful!\nRegister now! \n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/information-session-northumbria-university-uk/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:Livestream/Online webinar
END:VEVENT
