CREATED:20240312
LAST-MODIFIED:20240312
PRIORITY:5
SEQUENCE:3
TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Domestic Graduate Admissions at York
DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join us for a Graduate Admissions Session for Domestic Applicants—learn more about York University and our graduate admissions process. This session is intended for applicants who are Canadian citizens or permanent residents.\nThis session will run about an hour, and will cover “Why York”, eligibility, requirements, financial information, how to apply, and more.\nPlease note that during these sessions we will not be able to answer any questions about Schulich School of Business programs, or Osgoode Law School programs. For all other master’s programs, doctoral programs, and graduate diplomas, this is the session for you!\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJwoceivrzwpE9XSdzg9zFEtqDfhYr5u-QF_ ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nFor any questions, please email us at FGSNEWS@YORKU.CA ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n
