SUMMARY:Women & Girls Leadership and Sport Conference 2024
DESCRIPTION:In keeping with tradition, we are pleased to share the return of the Women & Girls Leadership and Sport Conference (WGLSC) for its fifth year as presented by York University Athletics.\nThis year’s topic, “Beyond Bodies: Examining Gender Rights in Sport,” brings together critical conversation on inclusion in the high-performance landscape.\nJoin us April 26 for the fifth annual WGLSC being hosted on the York University Keele Campus, and join a community invested in the empowerment and advancement of women in sport.\nTickets on sale now: yorkulions.ca/WGLSC ( https://yorkulions.ca/sports/2024/1/31/wglsc-2024-landing.aspx ).\nWe look forward to seeing you April 26 #leadHERS!\n
