SUMMARY:Glendon Career Fair 2024
DESCRIPTION:Calling all current students and recent graduates!\n \nAre you looking to:  \n\nmeet employers who are hiring;  \nshowcase your skills; or  \nclarify your career goals and next steps?  \n\nIf so, come to the Glendon Career Fair on Wednesday, March 27 from 1 to 4 p.m.\nMany organizations will be at the event in person to speak with students and recent graduates about job opportunities, career pathways and bilingual employment.\nFinally, for the list of participating employers and to know how to register for this event, check out our web page via the link below:\n \nglendon.yorku.ca/career-skills-centre/glendon-career-fair.   \nIf you have any further questions, please feel free to contact us at cdc@glendon.yorku.ca.  \n
