SUMMARY:Level Up | How to accelerate your career with personal branding
DESCRIPTION:Join this session to hear from marketing expert and York alumnus, Basim Salim (BCom ’10), on how to develop and refine your personal brand.\nThis session will cover:\n\nThe role of personal branding in career advancement: exploring why a strong personal brand can differentiate you in a competitive job market.\nLeveraging LinkedIn for personal branding: offering hands-on tips for optimizing profiles, networking and utilizing LinkedIn features for personal branding.\nThe trifecta of career growth: explaining the three activities you need to be engaging in consistently to find new opportunities, grow your network and land your dream job.\n\n \n
