SUMMARY:Black Excellence After York
DESCRIPTION:The York University Black Alumni Network (YUBAN), in collaboration with the student group Black Excellence at York University invite you to a post-Black History Month dinner & networking event called Black Excellence After York.\nEnjoy a business-casual networking event for Black students and alumni that will include dinner and roundtable networking discussions, led by an Alumni Mentor, on the following topics:\n\nPhotography, Art and Activism;\nBlack Women Empowerment;\nBusiness, Entrepreneurship, Financial Freedom and Wealth Building;\nMusic, Dance and Identity; and\nAcademic Excellence and Achievement.\n\n
