SUMMARY:Solar Viewing Event at Downsview Park
DESCRIPTION:The Allan I Carswell Observatory will be travelling to Downsview Park for a special session of solar observing (if clear) and eclipse information. To register for the event, visit Solar Viewing: Learn about the Eclipse! | Downsview Park.\nAll of our events are free, and we will have some safe solar viewing glasses for distribution while supplies last.\nWe are also hosting not one but two eclipse bloggers, professors Robin Metcalfe and Bruce Waters, on their eclipse journeys on our website. To follow along, get flyers, sign up for events and check out our resources, visit yorku.ca/science/observatory/solar-eclipse-2024.\n
