SUMMARY:Investing in the Future – Navigating the World of Blockchain, Digital Assets and Cryptocurrency
DESCRIPTION:Blockchain technology has enabled a diverse array of digital assets. From cryptocurrencies such as Bitcoin and Ethereum to non-fungible tokens (NFTs) and stablecoins, digital assets are reshaping how we perceive value and ownership.\nIn this panel discussion, our speakers will delve into the Blockchain theory and the fundamental concepts behind it, how it operates, its potential applications, and its adoption in the financial services sector and other industries. They will also discuss the possibility of digital assets fulfilling their promise of transparency, efficiency and trust. We would like to invite you to join us and participate in an interactive session with the panellists by bringing in your questions.\nhttps://schulich.yorku.ca/current-students/investing-in-the-future/#section-register\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/investing-in-the-future-navigating-the-world-of-blockchain-digital-assets-and-cryptocurrency/
ORGANIZER;CN=Schulich School of Business:MAILTO:admissions@schulich.yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Schulich School of Business
