SUMMARY:Explore Your Options for Undeclared Major Students (Career Exploration)
DESCRIPTION:This workshop is customized for York undeclared major students only. Are you wondering how your degree may relate to your future career direction? This presentation will provide an introductory overview of career exploration, online career resources, and how the Career Centre can help you build a foundation for your academic and career success.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
