SUMMARY:Bank of America – Global Corporate & Investment Banking | Summer 2025 (Recruitment Session)
DESCRIPTION:At Bank of America, you have the power to make a difference and shape the future that we live in. We are looking for Summer Analysts who can demonstrate energy, a drive to succeed and a strong desire to make a difference – is that you?\nWe’re pleased to invite you to apply to attend our virtual 2025 summer analyst information session. During this session, you’ll get an opportunity to learn about our Canada Global Corporate & Investment Banking business and summer 2025 internship opportunities from members of our Global Corporate & Investment Banking teams.\nIf you expect to graduate between December 2025 and June 2026, and are interested in Summer 2025 internship opportunities, please submit your application to register for the event.\nOnly those eligible for the Summer 2025 Program will receive a link to attend, as space is limited.\nEvent Start/End Time\nDate: Thursday, March 7, 2024\nTime: 5:30pm -6:15pm EST\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/bank-of-america-global-corporate-investment-banking-summer-2025-recruitment-session/
