SUMMARY:Study Creative Technologies at York University
DESCRIPTION:ABOUT THE EVENT\nJoin us for an exciting webinar event showcasing the Creative Technologies program at York University, led by our esteemed professors: Michael Darroch and Hector Centeno Garcia. Anchored in critical entrepreneurship, our Bachelor of Fine Arts (BFA) program empowers students to explore multidisciplinary creative skills and technological expertise. Through hands-on learning experiences, we emphasize the importance of social applications and contexts of creative technologies.  \nDuring this webinar, you’ll learn how the Creative Technologies is structured and the courses that we offer, explore how innovative solutions contribute to emerging industries, and how our students are at the forefront of shaping the future of technology and creativity.  \nMarch 22, 2024\n8:30 am to 9:30 am (EST)\nRegister HERE ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_IP8rbschTD2znWgETcDCRQ#/registration )\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/study-creative-technologies-at-york-university/
