SUMMARY:Webinar: Award-Winning Innovations in Youth Homelessness Prevention
DESCRIPTION:Making the Shift is hosting an engaging conversation with their 2023 Youth Homelessness Prevention Awards winners: Niginan (Keri Cardinal) and Wyndham House (Kristen Cairney), and honourable mentions CHMA – Kelowna (Mike Gawlick) and NFA-Y (Matt Forget).\nJoin us to learn about the approach of their successful youth homelessness prevention initiatives: Niginan Housing Ventures ( https://makingtheshiftinc.us3.list-manage.com/track/click?u=9a010747f6584a0ffdd9871d6&id=99459808f8&e=094bbdc250 ), Concurrent Specialized Youth Hub ( https://makingtheshiftinc.us3.list-manage.com/track/click?u=9a010747f6584a0ffdd9871d6&id=2cb8c40387&e=094bbdc250 ), Preventing Discharge to No Fixed Address for Youth ( https://makingtheshiftinc.us3.list-manage.com/track/click?u=9a010747f6584a0ffdd9871d6&id=67f76a6835&e=094bbdc250 ) and Bright Mindz ( https://makingtheshiftinc.us3.list-manage.com/track/click?u=9a010747f6584a0ffdd9871d6&id=3a9f483698&e=094bbdc250 ), as well as lessons they have learned through these projects.\nRegister: yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_N3mqWd5uT1iHjw-Hvd58GQ#/registration.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/webinar-award-winning-innovations-in-youth-homelessness-prevention/
