SUMMARY:Study in France! Visit with the Campus France representative
DESCRIPTION:Interested in an opportunity to study in France?\nJoin us for this information session with a representative from Embassy of France during their visit to York University. Learn more about study opportunities in France, the higher education system and have your questions about visa procedure, accommodations, health insurance and more answered.\nWhether you have already been admitted to an exchange program in France, or are interested in exploring options for the future, this is the info session for you!\nThis is a hybrid event. You can join us online, or in-person at Board Room 200E/York Lanes.\nWhatever your preference, please register in advance! ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJItf-CqqzgjE9NWTGcRpujqOvBVDEH-15ur )\nLearn more about York U French partner institutions on the Go Global Website ( https://yorkinternational.yorku.ca/where-can-i-go/#F ).\n
