SUMMARY:Winter Well-being Week
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Winter Well-being Week, running from March 4 to 8, 2024. The week’s theme is Caring for Your Physical and Nutritional Health. During Well-being Week (and every week), we invite York community members to learn about and prioritize healthy eating and being active. Winter Well-being Week demonstrates our commitment to the United Nations Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs). The activities planned show how we’re leading on SDG #3: Good Health & Well-being by promoting healthy lifestyles.\nBrowse the event agenda! ( https://www.yorku.ca/well-being/well-being-week/winter-well-being-week/ )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/winter-well-being-week/
CATEGORIES:SDG Month
END:VEVENT
