SUMMARY:GNL Information Session for York Faculty and Instructors
DESCRIPTION:York University Faculty members and Instructors are welcome to join us at our next Globally Networked Learning (GNL) information session! The session is open to all York faculty members who are interested in innovative pedagogies that combine internationalization, experiential education and co-teaching a course with an international partner. \nSession participants will:\n\nLearn how to integrate GNL-enhanced activities in their courses including developing new and/or enhancing existing partnerships through GNL.\nHear from York GNL faculty course leaders on their experiences\nBe provided information about GNL supports and resources available to York faculty members, including the GNL Award.   \n\nPlease register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJ0tcuitrDojGNyT807ztg3DhW9-O7qfnd5k#/registration ) in advance of the information session! \n
