SUMMARY:Hike at Maple Town
DESCRIPTION:Come visit Mountsberg with us! Travelling by bus, participants will head to Mountsberg Conservation Area, part of Halton Conservation. Mountsberg is currently in its maple season and has many sweet ways to celebrate this Ontario winter classic! Maple Town includes: barn animals, maple sugar demonstration at the Candy Cabin, sap-to-maple syrup presentation at the Sugar Shack, historical sites, maple trivia trail and other great activities for additional purchase on site. This could be the peak of your semester!\nTransportation by bus, park access and snack included in registration fee.\nWho can participate? All York Community members\nAccessibility Information: three trail options available, including one that is fully wheelchair accessible\nRegister now! ( https://reconline.yorkulions.ca/Program/GetProgramDetails?courseId=f559d020-b9d7-487f-92a5-89a0d97a3f17 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/hike-at-maple-town/
