SUMMARY:Grounding Techniques 101
DESCRIPTION:Sometimes, life can be stressful. This presentation will focus on understanding what happens when stress leads us to have problems with self-regulation and the ways grounding can be used to help us manage the stress we encounter in our lives.\nFormat: Online session\nWho can participate? Students\nAccessibility Information: Closed captioning available\nEmail thecentre@yorku.ca to register\n
