SUMMARY:Cyber Security Awareness: Digital Well-being
DESCRIPTION:In an era where our lives are increasingly digital, cybersecurity has become a paramount concern. With our personal information residing online, the importance of safeguarding it has never been greater. Threats such as viruses, phishing and hacking tactics are constantly evolving, aiming to compromise personal and institutional data for malicious purposes. Though York has implemented a range of measures to mitigate these threats, we all have a role to play in cybersecurity defense.\nIn this webinar we’ll not only heighten your awareness of cybersecurity issues, but also strive to equip you with the knowledge and tools essential for maintaining vigilance and safeguarding your digital presence.\nWho can participate? All York community members\nAccessibility Information: Closed captioning available\nRegister now! ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUkceurrTwrHtA26hCT9lvuYZhLgFllcyt_#/registration )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/cyber-security-awareness-digital-well-being/
CATEGORIES:Health Education &amp; Promotion,Student Accessibility Services,Student Counselling, Health &amp; Well-being,Students,The Centre,Well-being,Well-being Week
