SUMMARY:Black and Bold
DESCRIPTION:LA&PS colleges, Black Excellence at York University (BE YU), and Student Community & Leadership Development (SCLD) present Black and Bold. This is a panel discussion with Dr. Paige Wyatt, Asia Mohamed, and Khunda Murray on Black excellence in the educational, legal and medical world. Hear from our panellists about their experiences navigating the professional world and how Black excellence is represented in its own light.\nAlso, enjoy a performance from York University’s Gospel Choir and learn about the importance of choir in Black culture.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/black-and-bold/
ORGANIZER;CN=Black Excellence at York University:MAILTO:beyu@yorku.ca
