SUMMARY:Dokkyo University Partner Information Session
DESCRIPTION:\nGlobal Internships\n\n\nITTP provides a great opportunity for your students to gain insights on education in a different cultural setting, along with first-hand teaching and learning classroom experience. ITTP is initiated and coordinated by GAO, together with two EdUHK affiliated schools located on campus. Students enrolled in ITTP are covered by the prevailing Student Exchange Agreement with EdUHK.\n\n\nEligible Applicant: Education-related major with good academic standing\n\n\nDuration: 5 weeks to 1 semester; 4 days per week in general\n\n\nHost School: The EdUHK Jockey Club Primary School (JCPS) & The EdUHK Early Childhood Learning Centre (ECLC)\n\n\n\nRelated Video\nProgram Website\n\n\nRegister!\n
