SUMMARY:Global Chat for Osaka University of Economics
DESCRIPTION:At Osaka University of Economics (OUE) we offer a number of different international educational exchange programs which provide students from other countries with unique educational and cultural awareness exchanges. We encourage students who have an interest in Japan and Japanese culture to apply, participate, and take advantage of these wonderful opportunities to enhance their experiences and broaden their perspectives through their involvement in these creative cultural exercises. Two examples of which we are particularly proud are our ‘Horizons Summer Program’ and our ‘Internship Program’. Both of these will be discussed in some detail during the Global Chat with OUE, and we encourage you to join us for each of the sessions as outlined in the attached itinerary. You will also have the opportunity to talk with some of our students, ask any questions you may have, get details regarding the application procedures, and get to know us and see what we can offer you through these unique and welcoming opportunities.\nRegister!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/global-chat-for-osaka-university-of-economics/
CATEGORIES:International
LOCATION:Live on Zoom @ Zoom
END:VEVENT
