SUMMARY:Strategies for Navigating Academic Harassment for Graduate Students
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\nEmpower graduate students to conduct knowledge mobilization with confidence in our webinar on addressing and preventing online hate and harassment. This webinar draws on the report “The Internet Isn’t All Rainbows: Exposing and Mitigating Online Queerphobic Hate Against 2SLGBTQ+ Organizations” to share lessons learned and how graduate students can adopt our key recommendations to develop their safety plans for research projects.\n\n\n\n\nRegistration\n
