SUMMARY:Transitioning into second year (for Faculty of LA&PS Mature/PT/Transfer students)
DESCRIPTION:This workshop is for students in the Faculty of LA&PS. It is being offered in collaboration with ACMAPS and LA&PS Advising.\nDo you know what your next steps are for transitioning into second year? Do you need help understanding your degree requirements? Would you like to review the enrolment procedure? Are you interested in taking a course(s) in Summer 2024? Would you like a step-by-step guide in understanding your grade report and academic decision? Would you like to learn more about available resources on campus to help with making your academic journey successful? Please join us for a workshop led by an LA&PS advisor that will help you review and understand your next steps as you transition into your 2nd year at York University. \nRegistration is needed. Click here to register: yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJEoduugrzIjHNbGXMG3fnrBkhayTEmzf-9h.\n
