SUMMARY:Well-being During Challenging Times
DESCRIPTION:Transitioning to university is challenging enough during the best of times. The quality of our well-being impacts everything from academic success and physical health to our ability to manage stressors and our relationships with loved ones.\nJoin the Health Education & Promotion team to:\n\ndiscover mental health and well-being supports on and off campus;\nlearn wellness strategies to optimize your learning and manage stress; and\ndebunk university lifestyle myths about health and nutrition and find accessible ways to make change.\n\nTo register, click here ( https://forms.students.yorku.ca/view.php?id=307478 ).\nBefore attending the presentation, please fill out our anonymous Pre-Test Form (it takes less than one minute to complete): forms.office.com/r/N7Yq8KWFmG ( https://forms.office.com/r/N7Yq8KWFmG ).\nThis form helps us ensure our presentation meets the needs of the student body.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/well-being-during-challenging-times/
