SUMMARY:Screening of Twice Colonized
DESCRIPTION:\nYou are cordially invited to attend a special screening of Twice Colonized, an impactful documentary film that highlights the journey of Aaju Peter, a distinguished Inuit lawyer. \n\nFollowing the screening, there will be an engaging panel discussion featuring Aaju Peter herself, with the conversation guided by Professor Angele Alook.\n\n\nDate: Tuesday, Feb. 13 \n4:30 to 6 p.m. Film Screening\n6 to 6:30 p.m. Panel Discussion \nLocation: Osgoode Helliwell Centre, Room 1014\nPlease share with your teams and amongst your networks.\n\n\n
