DESCRIPTION:York University Black Staff Network – inaugural event – Lunch & Learn\nOn Feb. 21, YUBSN will be hosting a Lunch & Learn from 12 to 1:30 p.m. to hear from Vivian Kaye ( https://viviankaye.com/ ), who will be speaking about motivation and self-empowerment.\nRegister here: York University Black Staff Network – Inaugural event – Lunch & Learn ( https://laps.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=2199654 ).\n
