SUMMARY:Learn more about sustainable commuting with Smart Commute (Winter Commute Month)
DESCRIPTION:Parking Services, in partnership with Smart Commute, encourages you to participate in Winter Commute Month in February.\nWarm up your commute and take advantage of your work commute by exploring walking, rolling, sharing a ride or taking transit. If you’re working from home, remote work reduces driving trips, too.\nEnter our contest by remembering to log all your sustainable commutes and trips on the Smart Commute Tool for a chance to win a $100 gift card.\nVISIT US FOR MORE INFORMATION\nIf you have any questions or want to learn more about sustainable commuting, our team will be tabling in Vari Hall on Feb. 15 from 10 a.m. to 1 p.m.\n
