SUMMARY:York International Career Conversations Alumni Panel: Careers in Business (Career Conversations)
DESCRIPTION:Brought to you in partnership between the Career Centre and York International. \nCurious to know how international students thrive in their chosen field after graduation? Have questions about the real world and the job market? Join this panel discussion to hear from former international students about their Canadian career experiences in business! The panel discussion will focus on navigating the “real world” as international alumni, tips and tricks that helped them find success, and more! The panel discussion will be followed by an open forum where students will have an opportunity to ask the panelists their own questions.\nMeet the Panelists!\nSamir Janmohamed\nPolicy and Public Affairs Specialist at Ontario Chamber of Commerce\nBA 2018, Economics and International Development Studies\nShivam Nagpal\nManager, Reporting & Insights at RBC\nBA 2022, Finance\nFikayo Aderoju\nFounder and Executive Director at Project Impacting Lives\nBA 2022, Economics\nMore to come!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre Events calendar.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/york-international-career-conversations-alumni-panel-careers-in-business-career-conversations/
