SUMMARY:Inspiring Ways to Explore Your Career Interests for Mature and Transfer Students Webinar (Career Exploration)
DESCRIPTION:This webinar is customized for York’s mature students registered with the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students (ACMAPS).\nJoin this online webinar to learn about York’s Career Decision Making Model, and how it can help you move forward in your career as a mature student. You will also discover the range of hybrid career supports York’s Career Centre provides and be introduced to campus resources. In partnership with Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students (ACMAPS).\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre Events calendar.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
