SUMMARY:Capoeira Workshop with Professora Lang Liu
DESCRIPTION:February is Black History Month! Come learn about the Brazilian martial art that began as a form of enslaved peoples’ resistance: Capoeira talk and workshop with Professor Lang Liu, author of Bimba’s Rythm is One, Two, Three: From Resistance to Tranformation through Brazilian Capoeira. All are welcome!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/capoeira-workshop-with-professora-lang-liu/
ORGANIZER;CN=History Department:MAILTO:lapshist@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Glendon History
LOCATION:Glendon Campus (YH170 across from cafeteria)
END:VEVENT
