SUMMARY:Introduction to Zotero: making citing easier
DESCRIPTION:This introductory, hands-on workshop will teach you how to organize your citations and create your bibliographies with ease. You can do a lot with Zotero ( https://www.zotero.org )!\nRegister at: yorku.libcal.com/event/3778359 ( https://yorku.libcal.com/event/3778359 ).\n
