SUMMARY:Graduate student research skills workshop
DESCRIPTION:Need help starting your research and navigating York University Libraries?\nIn this workshop you will learn how to get the most out of the library and the complications with information.\nThe fundamentals of Omni will be explored. ProQuest Dissertations and Theses Global, newspaper databases and Web of Science will also be discussed.\nRegister for this event at: yorku.libcal.com/event/3778929 ( https://yorku.libcal.com/event/3778929 ).\n
