SUMMARY:Reading and annotating with Zotero
DESCRIPTION:Zotero ( https://www.zotero.org ) is a free, open-source  tool to manage and track bibliographic citations. This series of live workshops are designed to take participants beyond the basics of using Zotero to having it serve as a fully fledged research partner.\nBy the end of this live workshop, participants should be able to:\n\nmanage research notes using Zotero, and generate reports to help with assignments, papers and projects including theses;\nuse PDF annotation tools to create searchable notes and quotations based on article and book sources; and\nuse a tablet/iPad to create PDF annotations (highlights, notes, etc.) that can be seen and searched in Zotero.\n\nRegister at: yorku.libcal.com/event/3778945 ( https://yorku.libcal.com/event/3778945 ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/reading-and-annotating-with-zotero/
CATEGORIES:Libraries
LOCATION:(URL will be provided in the email confirmation)
