SUMMARY:Organizing Zotero collections
DESCRIPTION:Zotero ( https://www.zotero.org ) is a free, open source tool to manage and track bibliographic citations. This series of live workshops are designed to take participants beyond the basics of using Zotero to having it serve as a fully fledged research partner.\nBy the end of this live workshop, participants should be able to: contrast the use of collections, tags and related items for managing Zotero content; and manage tags and related items easily using recent new features added to the software.\nRegister at: yorku.libcal.com/event/3778947 ( https://yorku.libcal.com/event/3778947 ).\n
