SUMMARY:Scott Library Tour
DESCRIPTION:Curious about what your library has to offer? Join our Library Discovery Tours on Tuesday, Jan. 30, from 1 to 2 p.m. Led by student success mentors, these tours introduce key online resources like Omni, a walk-through of our special collections, and interactive Q-and-A sessions at various stops. Also, catch a brief overview of our digital services at the lobby. Don’t forget to RSVP on our registration page ( https://yorku.libcal.com/event/3782531 ) to secure your seat. Explore your library, and discover new resources and services!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/scott-library-tour/
