SUMMARY:Level Up | Get hired: What recruiters look for in new grads
DESCRIPTION:Featuring recruitment specialists and hiring managers from a variety of industries, this special alumni panel will discuss ways new graduates can increase their chances of success when job hunting. Join alumni Judith Fernando (BHRM ’18), Stewart Pei (HURS ’07), and Christine Madigan (BEd ’17, BA ’17) for Level Up on Feb. 13 at 12 p.m.\nPanelists will discuss:\n\nWhat companies and organizations look for in new talent .\nResume and interview tips, including virtual interviews.\nThe dos and don’ts when interacting with recruiters and hiring managers.\n\nRegistration is required in advance. Attendees will have the opportunity to ask questions during the Q&A portion of the panel discussion.\nDate: Tuesday, Feb. 13, 2024 | 12 p.m. ET\nFormat: Zoom webinar\nHost: Ali Rushdi (MBA ’19), Omnichannel Manager, Boehringer Ingelheim Canada\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/level-up-get-hired-what-recruiters-look-for-in-new-grads/
