SUMMARY:PepsiCo Beverages Sip & Chip Event (Networking Event – Employer Event)
DESCRIPTION:PepsiCo Beverages is thrilled to host our very first Sip & Chip Event in 2024! We’re actively seeking Summer Supply Chain and Sales Co-ops students, as well as Sales New Graduates to join our team!\nPlease note that this is an invite only event. We ask that students apply to the Sip & Chip ( https://globalcampus-pepsico.icims.com/jobs/275337/pepsico-beverages-sip-%26-chip-event-%28february-15th-2024%29/job?mode=view ) posting and we will send details over if they are qualified candidates.\nEvent Details:\nDate – February 15th 2024\nTime – 6-9PM\nLocation – Mississauga (more details to follow)\nBelow are the roles we are hiring for:\nToronto\nSupply Chain Co-ops ( https://globalcampus-pepsico.icims.com/jobs/270227/pepsico-beverages-supply-chain-engineering-coop/job?mode=view )\nSales Co-ops ( https://globalcampus-pepsico.icims.com/jobs/273258/pepsico-beverages-sales-coop/job?mode=view&mobile=false&width=696&height=500&bga=true&needsRedirect=false&jan1offset=-300&jun1offset=-240 )\nSales New Graduates ( https://globalcampus-pepsico.icims.com/jobs/244417/pepsico-sales-leadership-program/job?mode=view )\nHamilton\nSales New Graduate ( https://www.pepsicojobs.com/main/jobs/146993?lang=en-us&previousLocale=en-US )\nSales Co-op ( https://www.pepsicojobs.com/main/jobs/271104?lang=en-us&previousLocale=en-US )\nCambridge\nSales New Graduate ( https://www.pepsicojobs.com/main/jobs/247159?lang=en-us&previousLocale=en-US )\nSales Co-op ( https://www.pepsicojobs.com/main/jobs/274133?lang=en-us&previousLocale=en-US )\nOrillia\nSales New Graduate ( https://www.pepsicojobs.com/main/jobs/247008?lang=en-us&previousLocale=en-US )\nSales Co-op ( https://www.pepsicojobs.com/main/jobs/271113?lang=en-us&previousLocale=en-US )\nLondon\nSales Co-op ( https://www.pepsicojobs.com/main/jobs/271105?lang=en-us&previousLocale=en-US )\n\n\n\n\nTo check more info for this event, login to Experience York and access the Employers Events calendar.\n\n\n\n\n
