SUMMARY:Networking for Beginners (Employer Events)
DESCRIPTION:Do you find networking a challenge? Not sure where to start? Attend this workshop in partnership with the Career Centre to learn how to network at events, build your elevator pitch through hands-on activities, and gain tips and strategies on improving your professional communication skills.\nThe perfect elevator pitch can help you stand out to professionals in your field and give them a sense of what you’re looking for so they can help you advance your career, whether it’s putting you in touch with a hiring manager or telling you about relevant opportunities.\nBy the end of this workshop, you will be able to…\n\nLearn about the value in networking in various settings\nLearn about elevator pitch basics and practice their pitches with other attendees\nGet tips on speaking with confidence\nIdentify tools and resources available to them to build their network\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Employers Events calendar.\n\n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/networking-for-beginners-employer-events/
ORGANIZER;CN=Career Centre:MAILTO:career@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Co-op &amp; Career Centre
