SUMMARY:Discovering Careers as a Mature Student (Career Conversations | Networking Event – Employers Event)
DESCRIPTION:Connect with accomplished professionals who were mature students at York University. Meet alumni who are currently enjoying their careers and get the inside scoop on what it’s really like to work in the field. During this panel, professionals will share their personal stories about breaking into the field, how their career paths took them from graduation to where they are now, and what knowledge, skills and experience helped them succeed in their jobs. The panel discussion will be followed by an open forum where students will have an opportunity to ask the panellists their own questions.\nRegistration: Experience York ( http://careers.yorku.ca/online-system/ ), open to mature and part-time students only.\nBrought to you in partnership between the Career Centre and the Atkinson Centre for Mature & Part-time Students.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/discovering-careers-as-a-mature-student-career-conversations-networking-event-employers-event/
