SUMMARY:Inspiring Ways to Explore Your Career Interests as a Mature and Transfer Student Webinar
DESCRIPTION:\nJoin this online webinar to learn about York’s Career Decision-Making Model, and how it can help you move forward in your career as a mature/transfer student.\nYou will also discover the range of hybrid supports provided by Career Education & Development and be introduced to campus resources. This webinar is presented in partnership with the Atkinson Centre for Mature & Part-time Students (ACMAPS).\nLocation: online via Zoom\nRegistration required: Experience York.\n\n\nPartnership of the Career Centre and the Atkinson Centre for Mature & Part-time Students.\n\n
