SUMMARY:Winter Commute Month – February
DESCRIPTION:Warm up your commute this February. Take advantage of your work commute by exploring walking, rolling, sharing a ride or taking transit. If you’re working from home, remote work reduces driving trips, too. \nParking Services, in partnership with Smart Commute, brings you the Winter Commute contest for the month of February. Remember to log all your sustainable commutes and trips on the Smart Commute Tool for a chance to win a $100 gift card.\nHow to participate:\n\nTake a sustainable mode of transportation during the month of February, including walking, transit, carpooling, cycling or remote work.\nRegister and log into smartcommute.ca.\nSimply log a trip for an entry ballot for a chance to win a $100 e-gift card.\nEvery trip logged during the contest (maximum two per day) is an entry into the random draw for the prizes.\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/winter-commute-month-february/
ORGANIZER;CN=Parking Services:MAILTO:parking@yorku.ca
END:VEVENT
