SUMMARY:Finding Balance: Navigating School and Personal Stress During Mid-Term Exam Season
DESCRIPTION:With mid-term exams approaching and deadlines looming, the challenge of maintaining good mental health amid these stressors becomes paramount. We invite you to join Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) ( https://students.yorku.ca/be-yu ) as we explore the various factors influencing our mental well-being. Discover strategies to enhance your mental health, particularly as we transition into the demanding mid-term exam period. Registration required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYvfuusqjMoGdQ-fGFkUyFt4zJniqd-3Y04#/registration ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/finding-balance-navigating-school-and-personal-stress-during-mid-term-exam-season/
