SUMMARY:Black Leaders and Community Builders
DESCRIPTION:The Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) ( https://students.yorku.ca/be-yu ) team presents the Black Leaders and Community Builders workshop.  This workshop aims to recognize Black individuals who are committed to working toward the educational, professional advancement and development of Black communities. These leaders have a reputation for empowering the youth and creating positive change in York University and our society, to accelerate education and professional/career opportunities. Registration required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJAtcO2vqTsjGt2OMKiMekdWEYWX7_L7inMy#/registration ).\n
