SUMMARY:Coils and Curls: Everything Black Hair
DESCRIPTION:Join Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) ( https://students.yorku.ca/be-yu ) for their Coil and Curls: Everything Black Hair event. This event is the first event of a two-part series designed to celebrate the beauty of Black hair and its relationship with the Black community and society large. This series works to address the versatility of hair across the Black community and demonstrate its uniqueness when it comes to personal experience. Registration required ( https://machform.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=360536 ).\n
