SUMMARY:BE YU presents: Thriving as a Newcomer in Canada
DESCRIPTION:To kick off our Black History Month series, join Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) for a thought-provoking panel discussion, where our panellists will share personal experiences and insights on navigating challenges as international Black students in Canada. Gain valuable perspectives on their journeys and coping mechanisms, and receive advice for a successful transition. Don’t miss this opportunity to engage in a meaningful dialogue and foster connections within our community. Registration required ( https://machform.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=360232 ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/be-yu-presents-thriving-as-a-newcomer-in-canada/
