SUMMARY:Outdoor Recreation Snow Tubing
DESCRIPTION:Participants will receive a hill pass that grants them unlimited snow-tubing rides during the allocated two-hour time slot. Snow tubing is a thrill-seeking activity that requires no skill or previous experience. You’ll fly down the hill in a single-person tube and be taken back to the top by the “magic carpet.” Participants will also have access to warm up in the resort chalet and purchase food from the various restaurants and eateries.\nRegistration closes one week prior to the event.\nFor more information about the Outdoor Experience Program, including pricing, and to register, visit the program website.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/outdoor-recreation-snow-tubing/
