SUMMARY:Outdoor Recreation XCountry Skiing
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we travel by bus to Hardwood Ski for a day of cross-country skiing. Learn all the ins and outs of cross-country skiing from the Nordic skiing instructors, then put your skills to use and leisurely ski the beautiful snowy trails with your friends. We will enjoy some downtime with snacks in the cozy chalet, and return home by bus. With no experience needed, the registration fee includes all the equipment necessary to ski, plus lessons and trail passes.\n
