SUMMARY:Vision Beyond A Glance | Big Thinking Lecture Series
DESCRIPTION:As the inaugural event for the Big Thinking Lecture Series, this talk will feature Distinguished Research Professor John Tsotsos as he explores the meaning of vision and consider how we look at our world while doing everyday activities. We effortlessly perform visual tasks many times a day. But how?\nLearn more at yorku.ca/research/bigthinking.\n
