SUMMARY:Green Career Fair 2024
DESCRIPTION:Exploring Climate Careers to Achieve Net Zero\nDate: Jan. 18\nTime: 10 a.m. to 4 p.m.\nLocation: Health, Nursing & Environmental Studies (HNES) Building\nWebsite: euc.yorku.ca/experiential-education/green-career-fair-2024 ( https://euc.yorku.ca/experiential-education/green-career-fair-2024/ )\nGet ready for the Green Career Fair 2024. Join us for a day of exciting opportunities, education, and networking dedicated to sustainable careers and eco-friendly initiatives. Discover leading vendors and eco-conscious sponsors, engage in informative workshops and explore a world of environmentally responsible career choices.\nDownload our attendee checklist ( http://euc.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Green-Career-Fair-Attendee-Checklist.pdf ) to come prepared.\nMore about the event:\nThe Green Career Fair event is an opportunity for green employers to connect with interested youth, students and alumni on net-zero career fields, as well as promote discussions about career opportunities within the sustainability sector. Initially conceived by the Green Career Centre, ( https://www.greencareer.ca/ ) York University is partnering to host the Green Career Fair, thanks to the generous support of the Sustainability Innovation Fund. This collaboration represents a significant milestone in our commitment to promoting sustainability and environmental awareness, and we are excited to provide a platform that showcases diverse green career opportunities to our students and professionals.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/green-career-fair-2024/
