SUMMARY:York Dance Ensemble: ReGeneration
DESCRIPTION:ReGeneration: Annual Department of Dance Showcase featuring the York Dance Ensemble highlights choreography by faculty members Mary Fogarty ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/mary-fogarty/ ) and Susan Lee ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/susan-lee-2/ ), and talented fourth year student choreographers Jaelyn Jones and Travis Keith. This eclectic collection of dance works draws its inspiration from a wide range of sources such as quantum physics, a sound check, crochet and bird flight.\nChoreographers: Mary Fogarty, Jaelyn Jones, Travis Keith, Susan Lee\nArtistic Director: Susan Lee\nDirector of Design: Jennifer Jimenez\nLighting Design: Ian Garret ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/ian-garrett/ ), Aaron Kelly ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/aaron-kelly/ ), Eric Koski-Harja, Christian Sears\nFebruary 14-16, 2024\nLocation: Sandra Faire and Ivan Fecan Theatre\nTime: 7:30 PM\nAdmission: $22 | $15 advance purchase until Sunday, Feb. 11\nBox Office: 416.736.5888 | ampd.yorku.ca/boxoffice\nTickets ( https://secure1.tixhub.com/yorku/online/index.asp )\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/regeneration/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:Sandra Faire and Ivan Fecan Theatre, 110 Accolade East Building, York University @ 83 York Boulevard, Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/dance.jpg
