SUMMARY:Coping with Exam Anxiety
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever frozen on a final?  Found yourself unable to recall material during the exam and then recalled everything afterwards?  Had trouble focusing on exam questions because of interfering thoughts or feelings of anxiousness?   \nWhether you are coping with the workload of final assignments and project deadlines piling up, or feeling anxious about completing your exam in real-time, our workshop focuses on practical strategies around anxiety management for exam season.   \nMeet with other peers who share best-practices and tried and tested methods on supporting you through your finals.  \nTo register, Click here! ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJwrcuChpzosH9DWHNfrmTqTI9KkhzJxEqf- )\nBefore attending the presentation, please fill out our anonymous Pre-Test Form (it takes less than 1 minute to complete): https://forms.office.com/r/2BmSfpNCnc \nThis form helps us ensure our presentation meets the needs of the student body. \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/coping-with-exam-anxiety-7/
