SUMMARY:A Student’s Guide to Improving Sleep
DESCRIPTION:When it comes to the topic of sleep, it seems we can’t get enough. \nIn this workshop will explore the impacts of poor sleep habits on our minds and bodies, and how we can both prioritize our sleep and find practices to optimize whatever amount of sleep you are getting!  \n To register, Click here! ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUqc-CqqD0sHdajujENXrBKgq3H1N2DEaeX )\nAll our online workshops require York University authentication (passport York). Please login into your zoom account prior to clicking the meeting link.   \nBefore attending the presentation, please fill out our anonymous Pre-Test Form (it takes less than 1 minute to complete): https://forms.office.com/r/x9zDjghBir \nThis form helps us ensure our presentation meets the needs of the student body. \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/a-students-guide-to-improving-sleep-6/
