SUMMARY:Healthy Boundaries & Relationships
DESCRIPTION:University life provides many changes, including our relationships with others. We are constantly meeting new people and developing new and exciting relationships of all kinds, including platonic to romantic!   \nThis workshop provides you with a guide on building healthy relationships by discussing topics such as how relationships change, red flags to look out for, foundations for a healthy relationship, creating better boundaries, and meeting people at York.   \nJoin us for an interactive session with lots of fun and learning.   \nTo register, Click here! ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJIrf-urqzwpE9Q9P6TVyJQSOJZM_49odzKX )\nAll our workshops require York University authentication (passport York). Please login into your zoom account prior to clicking the meeting link.    \nBefore attending the presentation, please fill out our anonymous Pre-Test Form (it takes less than 1 minute to complete): https://forms.office.com/r/rRrUnSAhMQ \nThis form helps us ensure our presentation meets the needs of the student body. \n
