SUMMARY:Sexual Health Foundations (Online Workshop)
DESCRIPTION:Many of us may have awkward memories of Sex-Ed classes in high school or our parents trying to sit us down and give us ‘the talk.’ But knowing about sexual health, consent, and safe sex can help keep yourself and others safe regardless if you are engaging in sexual activity or not.  \nHealth Ed Peers are here to provide you with all the 101 knowledge you may need about safer sex, sexually transmitted diseases, infections, or mitigating the risk of pregnancy.  \nThis workshop is open and welcoming to all levels of knowledge and experience.  \n  To register, Click here! ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJckd-2qqDMsHNauZVtVvCOZo5nQAYrOn4lt )\nBefore attending the presentation, please fill out our anonymous Pre-Test Form (it takes less than 1 minute to complete): https://forms.office.com/r/juPt9aHbaw \nThis form helps us ensure our presentation meets the needs of the student body. \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/sexual-health-foundations-online-workshop-2/
