SUMMARY:Painting with Health Education & Promotion
DESCRIPTION:Studies have shown that most people who try art as a form of therapy or stress relief have experienced significant reductions in their cortisol levels when doing so. Painting allows for emotional release because it stimulates the creative side of your mind while focusing your attention in one place, which can lower anxiety. In this way, the creative outlet improves your mental health significantly.\nJoin the Health Education and promotion team in taking advantage of the benefits of art therapy and taking a break to paint and connect with likeminded students.\n \nTo register, Click here! ( https://forms.students.yorku.ca/view.php?id=303572 )\n
