SUMMARY:Wen-Do Self Defense Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wanted to try your hand at martial arts or self-defense? You’re in luck, because the Centre is hosting a Wen-Do Self-Defense class on the evening of Tuesday, January 23rd. Join us to learn and practice physical and psychological self-defense techniques. Open to cis- and transgender women, as well as non-binary folks.\n
