SUMMARY:Sexual Health Foundations (Online)
DESCRIPTION:Many of us may have awkward memories of sex-ed classes in high school or our parents trying to sit us down and give us “the talk.” But knowing about sexual health, consent, and safe sex can help keep yourself and others safe, regardless of if you are engaging in sexual activity or not.  \nHealth Education & Promotion are here to provide you with all the knowledge you may need about safer sex, sexually transmitted diseases, infections or mitigating the risk of pregnancy.  \nThis workshop is open and welcoming to all levels of knowledge and experience.  \n To register, click here ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJMocOisrz0tGNXPRTMZixUpbCncEbbKgSbU ).\nAll our online workshops require York University authentication (Passport York). Please login into your Zoom account prior to clicking the meeting link.   \nBefore attending the presentation, fill out our anonymous Pre-Test Form (it takes less than 1 minute to complete): forms.office.com/r/juPt9aHbaw. \nThis form helps us ensure our presentation meets the needs of the student body. \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/sexual-health-foundations-online/
