SUMMARY:Concerto Competition Concert
DESCRIPTION:Professor Mark Chambers conducts the York University Symphony Orchestra in a concert featuring 2023 Concerto Competition winners. The concert will feature works by Saint-Saëns, Vinter, Mozart, Debussy, Mendelssohn and more.\n2023 Winners\nAdamo Monardo, cello\nJessica Smith, horn\nAdrian Pereira, violin\nMorgan Alper-Wilson, soprano\nTan Tan, piano\nJake Whitla, alto saxophone\nAdmission: $20 | $15 students & seniors.\nBox Office: Purchase tickets online HERE ( https://secure1.tixhub.com/yorku/online/index.asp ) or phone 416-736-5888\nMaps & Directions ( https://map.concept3d.com/?id=1200#!m/325781 )\n\n
