SUMMARY:Are We There Yet?
DESCRIPTION:Are We There Yet? is a collaborative artists’ introspection following an exploration of self-identity in flux alongside the domestic spaces one exists in. Departing from the confines of the idea of a static childhood home with the utmost influence, Are We There Yet? displays a variety of multimedia, textile and found object-based artworks to re-contextualize the gallery as the artists’ autonomous home space.\nLocation: Gales Gallery ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/gales-gallery/ ) (105 Accolade West Building)\nHours: 10 a.m. to 4 p.m.\nDates: Jan. 15 to 19\nReception: Jan. 18 at 5 p.m.\nArtists\nSiah McTavish\nTaranpreet Takhar\nShirley Pourlotfi\nGhost Passarella\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/arewethereyet/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:Gales Gallery, 105 Accolade West Building (ACW), York University @ 89 York Blvd., Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/arewethereyet.jpg
END:VEVENT
