SUMMARY:Our Approach to Space Situational Awareness Image Analyses & Compression
DESCRIPTION:DISTINGUISHED LECTURE IN EMERGING & SYSTEMIC RISKS\nOur Approach to Space Situational Awareness (SSA)\nImage Analyses & Compression\nDr. Regina Lee, professor, space engineering\nLassonde School of Engineering, York University\nVirtual Session 12: Thursday, Jan. 18, noon to 1 p.m.\nRegistration: yorku.ca/research/yemerge/lectures.\n
