SUMMARY:Experience Grad York: Master of Biotechnology Management
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in the Master of Biotechnology Management? We invite you to attend our program session. Registration is required | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJIode-sqjMrHdfwJcJJTq-N-rlkel4xeXAv )\nThe Master’s in Biotechnology Management is a graduate program designed to provide students who hold a Bachelor of Science degree in Biology, Biological Sciences, Biotechnology, Life Science, or related discipline, and have little/no work experience in Biotechnology, with practical interdisciplinary training in Biotechnology and Management to enhance their competitiveness and employability in the biotechnology management related sectors. Students are awarded two credentials upon completion of the program requirements, a Master’s in Biotechnology Management and a Graduate Diploma in Management.\nJoin us to learn more about our programs!\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy.\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsnews@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/experience-grad-york-master-of-biotechnology-management/
