SUMMARY:Deloitte Canada’s campus recruitment Winter 2024 virtual info session (Recruitment Session)
DESCRIPTION:Deloitte Canada’s virtual info session is back! Join Deloitte January 11, 2024.\nRegister today: https://cvent.me/BbMevb ( https://cvent.me/BbMevb )\nAt this session, you will have the opportunity to learn about Deloitte Canada’s services and understand the impact they are making for our people, country, clients, and communities.\nExplore your potential with Deloitte and learn about the endless opportunities for learning, growth, and development.\nPostings for internship, co-op, and new grad roles will be live on December 18, 2023. Apply on: careers.deloitte.ca?\n#DeloitteCareers #WherePotentialComesToLife\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n
