SUMMARY:Experience Grad York: I Didn’t Get In, Now What?
DESCRIPTION:Join us to learn more about I Didn’t Get In, Now What? . Registration is required | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register\nDon’t think that you’ll meet our admission requirements? Applied before, and not received an offer?\nJoin us to learn more about our basic requirements for graduate admission, our “unique applicants” category and how we consider extenuating circumstances, common refusal reasons, and upgrading options that are available, if needed.\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsnews@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n
