SUMMARY:Experience Grad York: Grad Drop In Hour: Bring Your Questions!
DESCRIPTION:Join us to learn more about “Join us for a Grad Drop In Hour”. Registration is required | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_mxcm7NCUQpeIontOEIwhcg )\nThis session is open to anyone who has questions about graduate admissions at York. There is no structure or agenda, just a chance for folks to get the answers they’re looking for. Feel free to drop in at any point between 12:00pm and 1:00pm (EST) with your questions about a master’s, PhD, or graduate diploma.\nPlease note that this session will not be able to address questions about programs in the Schulich School of Business ( https://schulich.yorku.ca/ ), or the Osgoode Hall Law School ( https://www.osgoode.yorku.ca/ ).\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsnews@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/experience-grad-york-grad-drop-in-hour-bring-your-questions/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
