SUMMARY:Orientation to Career Serivces (Educator Events)
DESCRIPTION:Are you ready to embark on your professional journey with confidence and clarity? Join us for an empowering session where we’ll guide you through the wealth of resources and opportunities available through the York University Career Centre.\nThis session will be held in the York Lanes Pop-up lounge accross from the bookstore.\nThere will be limited seating so come early to secure a chair.\n\n\n\n\n\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n\n\n\n\n\n
