DESCRIPTION:Join us to learn more about Health: Grad Admission at York. Registration is required | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_t0dP8qpXRbuAXX8o3aJ_cQ ) \nJoin us to learn more about the graduate programs available in our Faculty of Health. This presentation will cover the following:\nCritical Disability Studies (MA & PhD)\nGlobal Health (PhD)\nHealth (MA & PhD)\nKinesiology & Health Science (MA, MSc, MFSc, PhD)\nNursing (MScN MScNPHP, PhD)\nPsychology (MA, PhD)\nWe will cover admission requirements, eligibility, tuition, funding, scholarships, and how to apply. Questions welcome!\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsnews@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n
