SUMMARY:Experience Grad York: Visas, Study Permits, Work Permits & More
DESCRIPTION:Join us to learn more about Visas, Study Permits, Work Permits & More with York International. Registration is required | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_n7sxVMkGTpWI24YoqYKLnw )\nIn this session, a Student Advisor and Immigration Specialist from York International will go over the study permit and visa application process. They will provide tips on how to make a strong application, helps you understand the recent updates from Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada (IRCC) and provides information on any current travel restrictions to Canada.\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ). \nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsnews@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n
