SUMMARY:Time Management for Mature & Transfer Students
DESCRIPTION:Where does the time go? How much study time is enough? Learn practical, personalized approaches to managing your time that work for you. This session is offered in collaboration with the Atkinson Centre for Mature & Part-time Students (ACMAPS) and Learning Skill Services.\nRegistration for this workshop is required.\nRegistration link: yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUldO2vpjwqEtf2CtZ165uN-mDu2kZoZqPu ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUldO2vpjwqEtf2CtZ165uN-mDu2kZoZqPu ). \n
