SUMMARY:Classroom Expectations for Mature and Transfer Students
DESCRIPTION:What is the mature and transfer student life like? What can mature and transfer students expect in classes? The Atkinson Centre for Mature & Part-time Students (ACMAPS) will be hosting a virtual workshop – facilitated and based on experiences of fellow seasoned student peers – designed to help mature and transfer students feel more knowledgeable, better equipped and thus more comfortable engaging with diverse classroom settings.\nRegistration required: yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJEuduiqqTIjHtRfEatlBX49MAFG8qeX5fxk#/registration ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJEuduiqqTIjHtRfEatlBX49MAFG8qeX5fxk#/registration ).\n
