SUMMARY:Trivia Night in Honour of Consent Action Week
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun night of trivia on Wednesday, January 24th! Snacks will be available. Small prizes are up for grabs, courtesy of the Centre for Sexual Violence Response, Support, and Education. In light of Consent Action Week, some categories will revolve around consent, queer history, and related topics.\n
