SUMMARY:INTACT Open house event – Summer 2024 Internships (Recruitment Session – Employer Event)
DESCRIPTION:Open House: Tech & Labs Edition. This event gives students interactive access to learn how they can launch their tech careers with Canada’s largest home, auto and business insurance provider.\nIn 2023, we hosted two Open House editions in our Montréal and Toronto offices welcoming hundreds of students who went on to find internship opportunities with us, in various fields of interest. We’re very proud of our proven track record in securing full-time employment for interns after graduation, as well.\nThis time, we’re exclusively focusing on internship opportunities with our Tech and Labs teams. Our diverse field of experts work at the intersection of what exists and what’s possible. We want to meet IT/Tech students in your institution who are eager to build and transform technology that impacts millions of Canadians who use our products, starting summer of 2024.\nWe’re excited to partner with you to fuel the passion, talent, and ambition of students enrolled in your institution. Here are the important details about the Open House to share with your students:\nDate: January 23, 2024\nTime:  From 6 to 8 pm\nWhere: 700 University Ave, 15th Floor, Toronto, ON\n\n\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Employers Events calendar.\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/intact-open-house-event-summer-2024-internships-recruitment-session-employer-event/
