SUMMARY:playGround Festival (2024)
DESCRIPTION:playGround Festival is York’s annual student-run theatre festival dedicated to giving emerging artists within the York community the opportunity to conceptualize, develop, and present new and original work. For 32 years, the playGround Festival has served as a creative outlet for hundreds of participants to take on all the roles that go into organizing the event, while receiving hands-on experience in the process. Students take on roles as playwrights, dramaturgs, actors, designers, crew, stage managers, and more!\nLOCATION: Joseph G Green Studio Theatre ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/joseph-g-green-studio-theatre/ )\nDATES: February 13th-16th\nTICKETS – $7 | Box Office: 416.736.5888\nSERIES A\nFeb. 13, 7:30pm\nFeb. 14, 7:30pm\nFeb. 16, 2:00pm\nSERIES B\nFeb. 14, 1:00pm\nFeb. 15, 7:30pm\nFeb. 16, 7:30pm\nThere will be a 10 Minute Intermission for both Series A and Series B.\n \n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/playground-festival-2024/
