SUMMARY:Life & Careers at BMO Bank of Montreal (Networking Event – Employer Event)
DESCRIPTION:Join the Life & Careers at BMO panel discussion and get the inside scoop on what it is really like to work in the banking industry. During this panel, professionals will share their personal stories about breaking into the field, how their career paths took them from graduation to where they are now, what knowledge, skills and experience helped them succeed in their jobs and what types of career opportunities are available at BMO. The panel discussion will be followed by an open forum where students will have an opportunity to ask the panelists their own questions.\nAs the 8th largest bank in North America by assets, BMO provides personal and commercial banking, global markets, and investment banking services to more than 12 million customers.\n\n\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Employers Events calendar.\n\n\n
