SUMMARY:Life & Careers at HOOPP (Healthcare of Ontario Pension Plan | Networking Event – Employer Event)
DESCRIPTION:Life & Careers at HOOPP (Healthcare of Ontario Pension Plan)\nFor the third year in a row, HOOPP was selected as one of Greater Toronto’s Top Employers by Canada’s Top 100 Employers, and this year has also been listed in the 2023 Career Directory as an organization that is an ideal place for students and recent graduates to start their careers!\nJoin the Life & Careers at HOOPP panel discussion and get the inside scoop on what it is really like to work in the pension industry. During this panel, professionals will share their personal stories about breaking into the field, how their career paths took them from graduation to where they are now, what knowledge, skills and experience helped them succeed in their jobs and what types of career opportunities are available at HOOPP. The panel discussion will be followed by an open forum where students will have an opportunity to ask the panelists their own questions.\n**Space is limited**\n\n\n\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n\n\n\n
