SUMMARY:Navigating your Career in Canadian Politics (Job Search Workshops)
DESCRIPTION:(IN PERSON & ONLINE) Navigating your Career in Canadian Politics!\nAre you studying Canadian Politics, and aiming for a career in Government or related organizations? If so, this workshop is tailored for you! The Career Centre will present you with a full range of information, from what we offer to help you in your career journey, to how to explore a variety of opportunities related to your degree or interests, to specifically how to search for jobs in the Federal, Provincial and Municipal governments. This session will be jam packed with resources and tips, ensuring you acquire both knowledge and practical tools for reaching your career goals!\n\n\n\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n\n\n\n
