SUMMARY:Media Music Concert XII
DESCRIPTION:\nPresented by the Media Music Club, the annual Media Music Concert is a showcase of film, television and video game music arranged and performed by York University music students and community members.\nThis year, along with the regular ensemble, the show will feature solo vocalists, instrumental soloists as well as a trombone feature from a member of our York University community. Music from various forms of multimedia will be featured, including video games, cinema, Bollywood and more!\nStephanie Ammendolia, Conductor\nMubassar Chaudhry, Assistant Conductor\nDevonte Ellis, Guest Conductor\nFriday, February 16, 2024\n7:30 PM\nTribute Communities Recital Hall \nADMISSION\nAdvance Prices until Thursday February 15, 2024\nAdvance Regular: $ 20.00\nAdvance Student: $ 15.00\nAdvance Senior: $ 15.00\nDay Of Performance Prices February 16, 2024\nRegular: $ 25.00\nStudent: $ 20.00\nSenior: $ 20. 00\nBox Office: 416-736-5888 | ampd.yorku.ca/boxoffice ( https://secure1.tixhub.com/yorku/online/b_otix.asp?cboPerformances=2088&cboEvent=963 )\n.  \n\n
