SUMMARY:Aristotle University of Thessaloniki, Greece -Information Session
DESCRIPTION:During the session, the students will have the chance to get valuable insights into life at the Aristotle University of Thessaloniki and familiarize themselves with the University’s academic program, faculties, schools and departments, as well as the student services and clubs they can join. They will, also, get information about the application process, accommodation and student health insurance. Finally, they will find out how they can get in touch with other international students and the International Relations Department that will support them throughout their stay in Greece.\nRegister!  ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYlcO2sqTgjGdUwZVVyddbYp4BD3Mx3ceGL )\n
