SUMMARY:New Year Alumni Mixer in Vancouver
DESCRIPTION:Jointly hosted by the York U Vancouver Alumni Network and the Schulich Vancouver Alumni Chapter, this event will be a night to remember. Join other York graduates for an evening of networking, reminiscing and building new connections.\nIf you know of anyone who might be interested in attending, please forward this email to them. We look forward to seeing you there!\nDate: Thursday, Jan. 4, 2024\nTime: 5:30 – 8 p.m. PST\nLocation: Rogue Kitchen & Wetbar, 601 W Cordova St, Vancouver, BC V6B 1E1\nTickets: $15 (Appetizers will be served. Cash bar available)\n \n
