SUMMARY:Scholars’ Hub @ Home: Getting to know Africa and its people: Confronting popular stereotypes
DESCRIPTION:As the world gets more connected, due primarily to contemporary globalization and international migration, it is important to understand other people and their cultures. Join Dr. Joseph Mensah on January 31 at 12 p.m. for Scholars’ Hub where he will present on the continent of Africa and its people and culture in an effort to subvert prevailing negative stereotypes surrounding Africa.\n
