SUMMARY:Scholars’ Hub @ Home: Surviving our fiery future: Learning to live with wildfire
DESCRIPTION:Join Eric Kennedy, associate professor of disaster and emergency management, on Jan. 17 at 12 p.m. as he discusses the interconnected sources of our wildfire crisis and what can be done to address them. He will also consider some of the challenges with the emphasis on firefighting and suppression, and discuss some of the paradigm shifts that will be needed to live safely with wildfires in the future.\n \n
