DESCRIPTION:The difference between a growth and a fixed mindset may come easy to most people, but how can one recognize its effect on a struggling team? In this workshop, join Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) Peer Leads as we learn how to understand relationships and the differences between the two mindsets. Students will learn how to apply resilience and perseverance personally and professionally, just as leaders would. To reserve your spot, please complete our registration form ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJEoduirpzkiHdykR_UmZozrXjIyMKBdXCD1#/registration ).\nThis session is open to all students at York and students who identify as Black are encouraged to attend.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/overcoming-fear-of-failure-6/
ORGANIZER;CN=Black Excellence at York University:MAILTO:beyu@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:BE-YU,Learning Commons,Students
LOCATION:Zoom
END:VEVENT
