SUMMARY:Negotiation Tips for Leaders
DESCRIPTION:It is often said that leaders are good negotiators, but where do you begin to learn? Join Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) Peer Leads as we examine what it means to be a good negotiator and the core frameworks and principles around negotiation and problem solving. By the end of this session, students will have a better sense of how to negotiate and build consensus on a team, all while building great relationships. To reserve your spot, please complete our registration form ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYvf-CqqDgrEtzdIY7q0ZTVNZkBJD9msrnN#/registration ).\nThis session is open to all students at York and students who identify as Black are encouraged to attend.\n
