SUMMARY:Academic Accommodations and University
DESCRIPTION:This session is for perspective students, their families and support team to ask questions about the transition to university. All high-school students and their families (or other support persons) who have questions or concerns about the transition to university for students with disabilities are invited to attend.  The session will take place virtually, via Zoom.\nWe will discuss:\n\nthe supports and academic accommodations available through Student Accessibility Services at York;\ndocumentation required to access academic accommodations; and\ntransition planning.\n\nRegistration\nRegister online before Jan. 18.  To register, complete this Registration Form ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYrd-CvqTIiE9OUgVRytk_zyMNK0D4Btbtq ).  After registering, you will receive a confirmation email containing information about joining the Zoom session.\nQuestions? Email projecta@yorku.ca ( mailto:projecta@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/academic-accommodations-and-university/
ORGANIZER;CN=Student Accessibility Services:MAILTO:sasinfo@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Student Accessibility Services
