TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Sensory-Friendly Arts & Crafts for International Day for Persons with Disabilities
DESCRIPTION:Join us to celebrate International Day for Persons with Disabilities with a sensory friendly session of Arts & Crafts session.\nHave you been looking for a chill, nice, sensory experience to meet others and do some fun activities? Come craft with us on Dec. 4 from 1 to 3 p.m. in the Winters Senior Common Room.\nCome connect with Student Accessibility Services and learn about their resources while doing some fun crafts and eating great snacks.\nRSVP here: york-socd.ticketleap.com/sensory-friendly-arts–crafts/details ( https://york-socd.ticketleap.com/sensory-friendly-arts--crafts/details ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/sensory-friendly-arts-crafts-for-international-day-for-persons-with-disabilities/
ORGANIZER;CN=Student Community &amp; Leadership Development:MAILTO:
CATEGORIES:Equity, Diversity &amp; Inclusion,Student Accessibility Services,Students
LOCATION:Senior Common Room (021), Winters College @ 76 Winters Ln, North York, ON M7A 2C5, Canada
END:VEVENT
