LOCATION:Glendon Campus (Centre of Excellence) @ 2275 Bayview Avenue, Toronto, Ontario, M4N3M6
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/GGD-—-LinkedIn-Sponsored-Ad-4-FR55-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
