SUMMARY:Dance Audition Prep Workshop 
DESCRIPTION:Register for the upcoming Open Practice Audition to learn more about the Dance ( https://dance.ampd.yorku.ca/ ) (BFA) program offered by York University School of the Arts, Media, Performance, and Design.\nParticipants will have the opportunity to walk through the audition process in a no-pressure environment; get to know our instructors, students, and spaces, ask questions about the program and the application/audition process, and stay for an exclusive viewing of the tech/dress rehearsal for our fall curricular performance, Dance Innovations.\nTuesday, November 21, 2023\n5:00 pm to 7:00 pm\nStudio E (ACE 249), Accolade East Building ( https://maps.info.yorku.ca/2010/06/accolade-east/ ), York University Keele Campus (Campus Map ( https://map.concept3d.com/?id=1200#!ce/34557?ct/29101,29093?s/ ))\nRegister HERE ( https://www.eventbrite.com/e/open-practice-audition-york-university-department-of-dance-tickets-741640806617 )\nNOTE: Please reserve only 1 event “ticket” per student/participant. Each student/participant may bring up to two guests (family members, guardians, etc.).\nWhat to wear: Clothing that allows you to move freely, safely, and comfortably.\nWhat to bring: Just yourself! No ballet slippers or specific footwear necessary.\n \n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/dance-audition-prep-workshop/
