SUMMARY:From Student to Trusted and Successful Insurance Broker (Alumni Career Chats)
DESCRIPTION:\nAre you interested in learning about the path to becoming a successful Insurance Broker? In this information-packed workshop, York University’s Alumni, Ani Grigoryan, will share tips and strategies that helped her to obtain the Registered Insurance Broker Ontario License (LLQP) as well start Life License Qualification Program (LLQP) Certification during her time studying at York University in Business Economics program. Anna Makaryan, Ani’s mother and Founder & Director of AM Investments and Insurance Solutions Inc., will also share the steps to obtaining the LLQP in Ontario, British Columbia, Saskatchewan, and Alberta as well as provide key insights to managing a successful career as an Insurance Broker including how to “close” and build instant rapport and the power of having a growth mindset. Attend this workshop at York University Keele Campus to gain valuable insights from industry professional and tips to help you kickstart your Insurance Broker journey!\nTo register for this event,  log in to Experience York and access the Employers Events calendar.\nMeet Our Alumni!  \n\n\n\n\nAnna Makaryan\nAnna Makaryan is an experienced and knowledgeable Insurance Broker who works with the leading insurance companies of Canada as well as banks. She is a holder of Masters Degree in Finance and through the delivery of tailored advice and professional investment and insurance strategies, she works with each individual, their families and business to enable them to realize their financial goals and ideal solutions. She is the Founder and Director of AM Investments and Insurance Solutions Inc. Anna also has a growing AGA (Associated General Agency) where she mentors and guides many licensed brokers to become trusted professionals in the Insurance Industry.\n\n\n\n\nAni Grigoryan\nAni Grigoryan, York University Alumni, is Anna Makaryan’s daughter who is a previously RIBO Licensed Insurance Broker. She is in the process of obtaining her LLQP License. Ani is here to share her knowledge and experience on how to balance it all while being a full-time student.\n\n\n\n \n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/from-student-to-trusted-and-successful-insurance-broker-alumni-career-chats/
ORGANIZER;CN=Career Centre:MAILTO:career@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni,Co-op &amp; Career Centre
LOCATION:4700 Keele Street, York Lanes, 80 York Lanes Blvd., North York, ON, M3J 1P3
END:VEVENT
