SUMMARY:Classical Piano Showcase
DESCRIPTION:Canada Music Week (November 19-25, 2023)  is an annual event where music teachers, students and their families gather together in local communities to celebrate Canadian music, culture, and creativity. For the first time, York University’s classical piano area will take part in this celebration of Canadian composers.\nThe Department of Music’s ( https://music.ampd.yorku.ca/ ) classical piano students perform music by Alexina Louie, Marjan Mozetich, Nathaniel Dett and many more incredible creators.\nEveryone is welcome to come and experience the beautiful diversity of Canadian creation, through shared live musical experiences.\nThursday, November 23, 2023 \n12:30 PM\nTribute Communities Recital Hall \nFREE ADMISSION\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/classical-piano-showcase-nov23/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:Accolade East Building, Tribute Communities Recital Hall @ 83 York Boulevard, Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/classicalpianoshowcase.jpg
