SUMMARY:York U Holiday Mingle in London
DESCRIPTION:York University is heading to London in December and we hope to see you there!\nJoin us for the York U Holiday Mingle in London and network with other alumni, recall your time on campus and learn about York’s latest initiatives. This event will be hosted by Susana Gajic-Bruyea, Vice-President, Advancement and Julie Lafford, Assistant Vice-President, Alumni Engagement.\nThe cost of this event is $10, which includes hors d’oeuvres and one drink. Alumni are welcome to bring one guest.\nDate: Tuesday, Dec. 5, 2023\nTime: 6:30 – 8:30 p.m.\nLocation: The Groucho Club, The Club Room, 45 Dean St., London, UK, W1D 4QB ( https://maps.app.goo.gl/hjEm5AZUpu4qSdGQA )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/york-u-holiday-mingle-in-london/
