SUMMARY:Graduate Writing Series – Part 5: Afterlife of Your Project
DESCRIPTION:What happens after you complete your thesis is a question many graduate students may be wondering. This workshop aims to introduce students to how they can share their research, including learning to navigate the publishing world, understanding the peer-review process and journals, and attending and creating conference presentations.\nThis workshop is part five of a five part graduate writing series, hosted by LA&PS Colleges in collaboration with The Writing Centre.\nRegister Here\n
