DESCRIPTION:This unique session is a hands-on clinic where participants will receive personalized, direct support from our staff on resume edits, as well as offer free professional headshots for your LinkedIn profile. Make sure to bring a copy of your resume and our expert quality services will help you move to the head of the interview stack and impress employers. Resume edits will be tailored towards your goal and overall strategy.  \nThe Faculty of Environmental & Urban Change (EUC) is excited to announce its partnership with Green Career Centre to host York University’s inaugural Green Career Fair on January 18th, 2024! To support the YorkU community in preparation for the career fair, EUC will be hosting Ready, Set, GROW! Lunch & Learn Series. This professional development series will run from Oct 26th to Dec 5th on alternating Tuesdays and Thursdays during the lunch hour (12PM or 1PM) as a hybrid format open to the community (in-person seating limited). RSVP to tap into our workshops and learn more on how you can become green career ready for the workforce!  \n
