SUMMARY:Ready, Set, GROW! Lunch & Learn Series: Green Excellence – Green Career Pathways
DESCRIPTION:Discover the expansive (but not overwhelming) green career pathways that you can embark upon through our EUC program streams. This session will walk you through industry market trends, green skills needed, and showcase alumni profiles that serve as an exemplary guide. Designated job boards resources will be shared to help you commence with ease. \nThe Faculty of Environmental & Urban Change (EUC) is excited to announce its partnership with Green Career Centre to host York University’s inaugural Green Career Fair on January 18th, 2024! To support the YorkU community in preparation for the career fair, EUC will be hosting Ready, Set, GROW! Lunch & Learn Series. This professional development series will run from Oct 26th to Dec 5th on alternating Tuesdays and Thursdays during the lunch hour (12PM or 1PM) as a hybrid format open to the community (in-person seating limited). RSVP to tap into our workshops and learn more on how you can become green career ready for the workforce!   \n
