SUMMARY:Decolonizing, Equity, Diversity and Inclusion Self-Reflection Toolkit Launch
DESCRIPTION:The York University community is invited to the launch ( https://forms.office.com/pages/responsepage.aspx?id=GBNTNBFw1E-H8KQ4FsSb0P31WzSalr9OvyHEhf_td1JUQTBaMk9aUThKMVpQUEgzSEsyV05SQlI3Vi4u&web=1&wdLOR=c9708471F-2F53-4310-8409-E9244C7F6B10 ) of the Decolonizing, Equity, Diversity and Inclusion Strategy ( https://www.yorku.ca/dedi-strategy/ ) (DEDI) toolkit on Thursday, Nov. 16, from 1 to 2 p.m.\nThis one-hour event will show community members how to engage with the toolkit and give a preview of some of the activities included in the course.\nThe toolkit is available at yorku.ca/yulearn ( https://www.yorku.ca/yulearn/ ) for the community to add to their learning courses at any time.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/decolonizing-equity-diversity-and-inclusion-self-reflection-toolkit-launch/
ORGANIZER;CN=CHREI:MAILTO:chrwkshp@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Equity, Diversity &amp; Inclusion
LOCATION:Location: Zoom Meeting
END:VEVENT
