SUMMARY:Music Audition Prep Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Want to study music at York?\nOur Music Audition Prep Workshop is for you!\nIn this 90-minute session, you will:\n\nlearn how to prepare for all the elements of our music audition: sight reading, performance and interview\nget tips on how to choose your audition pieces\nfind out more about our music program and admission process\nask questions at our live Q&A session\ntake a tour of the Music Dept\n\nFriends and family are welcome.\nAdmission to the Music Audition Prep Workshop is free but pre-registration is required.\nSaturday, November 11, 2023\n1:00-2:30pm\nTribute Communities Recital Hall\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/music-audition-prep-workshop-nov11/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:Accolade East Building, Tribute Communities Recital Hall @ 83 York Boulevard, Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/auditionprep.jpg
END:VEVENT
