SUMMARY:Resumé & Cover Letter Writing Workshop (for International Students | Job Search)
DESCRIPTION:\nFind out how to effectively target your Resume and Cover letter. Present your experiences, education and skills in a way that showcases your assets and piques employers’ interest in you.\nBy the end of this workshop, you will be able to…\n\nUnderstand the purpose of resume and cover letters\nLearn about the resume format guidelines\nIdentify the common resume mistakes\nLearn how to customize and tailor your resume and cover letter for different positions\nGain insights on how to write an effective cover letter\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n\n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/resume-cover-letter-writing-workshop-for-international-students-job-search/
