SUMMARY:Aim High, Degrow: Dialogues on Degrowth
DESCRIPTION:Session 4 in February: “Degrowth and systems: back to the caves or back to the future?”\nDate/Time: Monday, Feb. 12 at 11:30 a.m. EST\nDescription: Discussion around the role of technology in a degrowth future, and in particular in the energy and food sectors. Does degrowth involve technological development, and to what extent? What does convivial technology mean and does it have a future?\nSpeakers:\nJulia Steinberger\nToni Ruuska\nModerator:\nMark Winfield\nRegister at yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN__n1oQk1jRs6X7DPGBCRKew#/registration ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN__n1oQk1jRs6X7DPGBCRKew#/registration ).\n
