SUMMARY:Information Session: GL/LIN 2515 6.00 Italian: A Linguistic Introduction
DESCRIPTION:\nDestination: Italy\nDuration: June 17th – July 4th, 2024\nThis course introduces students to the contemporary perspectives of the Italian language and includes a practical component in Italy. Through this, students can explore the historical, social, and political aspects that have contributed to the formation of modern-day Italian.\nLearn more by joining our information session (Registration via the link):Virtual via Zoom on November 2nd 2024 @11:30am: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYoceCqrjgqHdDnUG7ov4qnYHp1xraqwDgw\n\n
