DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in a career in healthcare consulting? KPMG’s Healthcare and Life Sciences Management\nConsulting Practice would like to meet you!\nKPMG’s Healthcare & Life Sciences Practice helps clients to address their most pressing concerns including\ncontinuously streamlining operations to unlock value, deliver bottom-line improvements and enhance quality\nand service levels. As a healthcare consultant with KPMG, you’ll support operations improvement, care\nsystem re-design, digital health and workforce engagements working directly with senior leadership and\nclients across the Healthcare industry.\nThis information session is for applicants looking to apply for internship roles starting in May\n2024 within KPMG’s Healthcare and Life Sciences Consulting practice.\n\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Employers Events calendar.\n
