SUMMARY:What You Need to Know About Starting a Career in Sales’ (Employer Events)
DESCRIPTION:Jarvis Consulting Group is hosting a virtual workshop on ‘What You Need to Know About Starting a Career in Sales’ on Tuesday, November 14th, from 12p.m. to 1p.m.!\nThis virtual workshop will be hosted by Jarvis’ very own Lead Account Executive, Tommy Sumi! This opportunity will allow for students to gain valuable insight on careers in sales. Join us to learn essential strategies for successfully entering into a new sales role with confidence, drive, and grit!\nThis is a great opportunity to learn about sales as a career path if you’re a student who may not be sure what you want to do after graduation. We’ll talk about the traits well suited for jobs in sales, how to impress a sales hiring manager or leader, and how to succeed in a sales role. We hope to see you there!\nRegister for free now and join us for an unforgettable event!\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Employers Events calendar.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/what-you-need-to-know-about-starting-a-career-in-sales-employer-events/
