SUMMARY:Canadian Universities Alumni Reception
DESCRIPTION:The Canadian Association of New York (CANY) invites you to the 23rd Annual Canadian Universities Alumni Reception on Wednesday Nov. 15 at 6:30 p.m. at the Tribeca Rooftop.\nDon’t miss this great opportunity to meet and network with fellow Canadian university alumni in NYC. We will also be joined by representatives from many of Canada’s universities and CANY partners.\nAll Canadians, alumni of Canadian universities and friends of Canada are welcome to attend. Alumni from sponsoring universities are eligible to register at a discounted ticket price.\nTicket price includes cocktails, beer, and wine open bar and passed hors d’oeuvres. We will also be holding a draw for valuable prizes from our partners.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/canadian-universities-alumni-reception/
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni,Glendon Alumni &amp; Friends,Regional Alumni Events
