SUMMARY:Canada’s Top Student Registration – 1st and 2nd Year Students (Competition – Employer Event)
DESCRIPTION:Do you want to be one of Canada’s Top Students?!\nThe Scotiabank Campus Team is proud to announce that one of our GREATEST annual events is quickly approaching!\nCanada’s Top Students (CTS) is a full-day conference for 1st and 2nd year undergraduate students from across the country to come together for an unforgettable experience. Join us on November 25, 2023, to grow your professional network, push yourself outside of your comfort zone, and compete to become Canada’s Top Students! We’re looking for passionate, creative, and authentic students who are willing to go the extra mile.\nDo you have what it takes to be one of Canada’s Top Students? Here’s your chance to show us what you’ve got!\nApply before it’s too late!! Applications close November 8th at 11:59 PM EST.\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/canadas-top-student-registration-1st-and-2nd-year-students-competition-employer-event/
