SUMMARY:Aim High, Degrow: Dialogues on Degrowth, Session 2
DESCRIPTION:Session 2 in December: “Decolonization and feminism: does degrowth cut it?”\nDate/Time: Thursday, Dec. 14 at 11:30 a.m. EST\nDescription: Discussion around how degrowth is (or not) aligned with decolonial and feminist approaches. Where are the synergies and where are the contradictions between decolonization and feminism, and degrowth?\nSpeakers:\nCorinna Dengler\nWendy Harcourt\nModerator:\nEllie Perkins\nRegister at yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_eBunCS_ATRWa42MOW0ozjA#/registration ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_eBunCS_ATRWa42MOW0ozjA#/registration ).\n
