SUMMARY:The BE YU Social Event: Tea, Tunes, and Talks
DESCRIPTION:The Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) champions the academic, professional, and personal success of the Black student community at York. We are here to support them and to maximize their student experience.\nJoin the BE YU Team for our Tea, Tunes, and Talks Social Event on Friday November 3rd from 3-5pm in room HNES 248. In addition to an afternoon of fun and music, students will get a chance to gain knowledge about BE YU and what we offer, while also learning more about the team members.\nYou can register for the event here.\nIf you have any questions, please feel free to email us at beyu@yorku.ca.\n
