SUMMARY:Mental Health Workshop
DESCRIPTION:With exams approaching, deadlines looming, and the semester drawing to a close, the challenge of maintaining good mental health amid these stressors becomes paramount. We invite you to join us at the Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) as we explore the various factors influencing our mental well-being. Discover strategies to enhance your mental health, particularly as we transition into the demanding exam period. To reserve a spot, please complete the registration form. \n This session welcomes all York University students, with a special encouragement for those who identify as Black to participate. \n
