SUMMARY:Immigration Workroom: Study Permit Extension + PGWP
DESCRIPTION:Weekly in-person Q&A hosted by our York International Student Advisors and licensed immigration specialists to help answer questions about your study permit extension and/or post-graduation work permit application.  This is a group advising session. An international student advisor will be available to help you with IRCC’s online application system, the application forms and any questions you may have.  To prepare and make the most of this session, review the Study Permit Extension and PGWP application guides on our Immigration Application Resource Page ( https://yorkinternational.yorku.ca/immigration-application-resources/ ). The expectation is that you will have reviewed the materials, attempted to complete the application on your own and bring any outstanding questions to the session. You will need a laptop and digital copies of all your documents (including passport and study permit) to be able to finish your application in the workroom.\nREGISTRATION: sign up here ( https://yorkinternational.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=761949 ). LOCATION: 242 York Lanes\nThank you. We look forward to speaking with you soon!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/immigration-workroom-study-permit-extension-pgwp/
