SUMMARY:Share your views about future priorities for York University Libraries
DESCRIPTION:The search for the next dean of York University Libraries (YUL) has begun. All members of the York community are invited to attend an open session to discuss issues, opportunities and challenges for the Libraries over the next five to 10 years and share their thoughts on the development of candidate criteria for the next dean.\nThe online session will take place on Thursday, Oct. 26 from 3 to 4 p.m. here via Zoom.\nCommunity members are also welcome to share their views through an online survey. Any questions about this process may be directed to Jessica Wyman, senior academic policy and recruitment officer, Office of the Provost & Vice-President Academic, at jwyman@yorku.ca ( mailto:jwyman@yorku.ca ).\n
