SUMMARY:Pre-Arrival Webinars: Look Ahead at your First Year at York
DESCRIPTION:Join York International for our Pre-Arrival Webinar series, where we connect with new incoming international students to provide timely and important information you need to know.\nRegister here!\n In this webinar, Looking Ahead at your First Year at York, we provide students with information they need to know about their first academic year at York University, including deadlines, holidays, exams, and more. A Canadian academic year might be different than what you are used to – join us to learn what the upcoming year will look like and to feel prepared.\nThis webinar focuses on:\n\nA first year student’s academic calendar at York University.\nImportant deadlines, holidays, and academic terminology.\nHelpful student resources with academic information.\n\n
