SUMMARY:Grad Hub: Academic Writing 101 for Graduate Students
DESCRIPTION:Writing can be difficult, especially at the graduate level. In this virtual session, we discuss practical strategies for leveraging free academic writing services through the Writing Centre at York University. Your research is important. Join us to learn how to improve your academic performance by enhancing your writing skills.\nBy the end of this session, you will be to:\n\nIdentify the tools, services and support available through the Writing Centre and how to access them\nUnderstand the fundamentals of academic writing through reviewing and comparing different writing samples\nLearn tips, strategies and various approaches to improve their academic writing.\n\nSpots are limited. Please note that you will need to pre-register for this session ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJIvd-ysrT8qHdCFrDuKsKL-TtxyEGk17b6t ).\n
URL:https://yorkinternational.yorku.ca/event/grad-hub/?instance_id=9630
