SUMMARY:Dance Innovations 2023: Infinite Corners
DESCRIPTION:Dance Innovations 2023: Infinite Corners features the new choreographic works of 25 fourth year BFA majors performed by students engaged in all levels of York’s programs in Dance. As we find ourselves in a time of recuperation following the pandemic, these creators are asking: what does it mean to move forward now? How are we coming alive in our collaborative work differently? If infinite corners lead to circles and cycles, the goal of this production is to enliven the ideas, processes, and narratives that are important to this group of emerging artists. The two series of Infinite Corners feature world premieres by fourth year choreographers and by Professor Susan Lee for the Department’s third year Performance class. Students are guided by faculty at every level of creation, performance, lighting design and production and it is the students who collaborate to run Dance Innovations, staged in the McLean Performance Studio, November 22, 23 and 24 at 7pm and 8:30pm.\nArtistic Director and 4th year Choreography Course Director: Tracey Norman ( https://dance.ampd.yorku.ca/profile/tracey-norman/ )\nCourse Director 3rd year Performance: Susan Lee ( https://dance.ampd.yorku.ca/profile/susan-lee/ )\nProduction Manager, Lighting Designer and Course Director: Jennifer Jimenez ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/jennifer-jimenez/ )\nStage Manager: Sophia Fabiano\nDance Innovations: Infinite Corners \nSeries A: Continuous – Wed, Nov 22 to Fri, Nov 24 at 7 pm \nFeatures a world premiere by Professor Susan Lee in collaboration with the 3rd year Performance class and Professor Don Sinclair (Computational Arts), and new choreographic works by fourth year students with student lighting design and production support.\nSeries B: Unbounded – Wed, Nov 22 to Fri, Nov 24 at 8:30 pm\nFeatures new choreographic works by fourth year students with student lighting design and production support.\nLocation: McLean Performance Studio ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/mclean-performance-studio/ )\nTickets ( https://secure1.tixhub.com/yorku/online/index.asp ): $22.00\nAdvance (until Sunday Nov 19th): $ 15.00\nLimited Seating\nBox Office: 416-736-5888 | ampd.yorku.ca/boxoffice ( http://ampd.yorku.ca/perform/boxoffice )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/dance-innovations-2023-infinite-corners/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:McLean Performance Studio, 244 Accolade East Building, York University @ 83 York Blvd. Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/posterimage.jpg
