SUMMARY:Victorian Studies Network at York Research Symposium
DESCRIPTION:The Victorian Studies Network at York (VSNY) is hosting its 15th annual symposium. The widely interdisciplinary program includes presentations by York-affiliated faculty and grad students representing fields from English to Engineering, the Library to Fashion History.\nFor 15 years, the VSNY has been connecting researchers and enhancing connections among graduate students, post-docs, and faculty. Our goal is to facilitate interdepartmental and interdisciplinary work, to enrich our personal and collective experience of research in the field, and to showcase York as a centre for Victorian studies.\nKindly RSVP to Prof. Lesley Higgins 19higgins55@gmail.com.\nLearn more\n
