SUMMARY:Health Fair – Glendon
DESCRIPTION:Inspire yourself, empower your health! \nJoin the Health, Education and Promotion team at the first ever York University Health Fair! From 11-3 at the Centre of Excellence Lobby, stop by for games, activities and to hear from all our partners about how they can support your health. At the Health Fair you can:\n\nStart your adventure to better health by picking up your “passport” and having it stamped at the booths you visit\nWalk through a giant set of inflatable lungs and an inflatable brain to learn more about your vital organs\nParticipate in games and enter contests to win prizes\nMeet our new Public Health Nurses and learn how they can support you\nand so much more!\n\n \n
