SUMMARY:CineSiege 2023
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\nIn its 21st year, CineSiege is an annual showcase screening of outstanding productions created in the previous year by undergraduate students in the Department of Cinema and Media Arts at York University. CineSiege features a juried selection of short films, chosen by industry leaders in Canadian film and media.\nWe hope you can join us to celebrate the next generation of filmmakers!\nHOST\nFranco Nguyen ( https://www.cbc.ca/mediacentre/bio/franco-nguyen#:~:text=Franco%20Nguyen%20is%20a%20comedian,Breakout%20Fest%20and%20StandUP%20NBC. ) is an actor, writer, director and comedian. He is a co-creator, writer, executive producer and star of the award winning and critically acclaimed sketch comedy series, TallBoyz. He is a Bob Curry Fellow, and was previously a cast member of the Second City Touring Company Toronto. He has won four Canadian Screen awards, including, Best Writing Sketch Variety, Best Ensemble and Best Sketch Series.\nCineSiege 2023\nThursday, November 16, 2023\n7:00 PM – 10:30 PM\nThe Royal ( https://maps.app.goo.gl/Pu9jhvdmUeN7UrcZA ): 608 College Street, Toronto, ON M6H 1M2\nFREE Admission \nTICKETS  ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/cinesiege-2023-tickets-740596152027?aff=oddtdtcreator )\nThis event is made possible with the continued support of our founding sponsor, Cinespace.\n\n \n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/cinesiege-2023/
