SUMMARY:A Student’s Guide to Physical Activity (Online)
DESCRIPTION:Did you know that maintaining your physical activity can benefit you in many aspects of life, even beyond your physical health?\nHowever, with the many barriers we face as students, it can sometimes feel challenging to jump start your physical activity journey. Join the Peer Health Educator Team as they combat these barriers and guide you through:\n\nan introduction to physical activity and the many related benefits for students;\nhow to combat barriers to engaging in physical activity as students; and\nresources and tips for how to begin your physical activity journey.\n\nBefore attending the presentation, fill out our anonymous Pre-Test Form (it takes less than one minute to complete): forms.office.com/r/CmV65JxUpY ( https://forms.office.com/r/CmV65JxUpY ).\nThis form helps us ensure our presentation meets the needs of the student body.\nClick here to register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJ0rfuuqrDojHdFKXMHwyl7fINM-X2yq-5t6 ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/a-students-guide-to-physical-activity-online/
