SUMMARY:ESL Café at the ESL OLC: Language & Culture – How are they connected?
DESCRIPTION:We will explore how languages we speak reflect our cultural values, practices, and traditions. We will discuss, compare, and practice intercultural communication through language games and interactive scenarios/quests. \nPlease note: these ESL Café sessions are part of the English Conversation Partner Program and registration is restricted to program participants. If you’re interested in attending an ESL Café Session, the ESL OLC hosts weekly sessions throughout the summer. Click here to learn more. \n
