SUMMARY:York International Pre-Arrival Webinars: Building your Timetable
DESCRIPTION:Join York International for our Pre-Arrival Webinar series, where we connect with new incoming international students to provide timely and important information you need to know.\nRegister here!\nIn this webinar, Building your Timetable, we provide students with information they need to prepare for course enrollment. From navigating how to enroll in classes to learning about important considerations, this webinar offers students a chance to meet with faculty supports.\nThis webinar focuses on:\n\nThe general course enrollment process at York University.\nFaculty specific course enrollment processes.\nImportant considerations students should think about when building their academic timetable.\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/york-international-pre-arrival-webinars-building-your-timetable/
