SUMMARY:Go Global Chat: Japan
DESCRIPTION:\nSo many places, so many opportunities… to go abroad! Find the right fit for you at an information session. Discover different opportunities to work, study and research at partner universities around the world.\nLearn More \nAt Global Chats the Global Learning team invites current and previous exchange students to come and share their experiences about the countries and cities you can go to, cost of living, student life, courses they took abroad, the university they went to, get tips on what to pack, and how you can travel to other countries during your trip abroad.\nRegister today!\nStudent volunteer: Minna Yamada-Boudsamad (outgoing)\nUniversity: Waseda University (Japan)\n\nPlease Note: You can register for more than one session! More information will be sent out prior to each session.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/go-global-chat-japan/
