SUMMARY:Global Learning Partner Info Session: Deakin University
DESCRIPTION:\nSo many places, so many opportunities… to go abroad! Find the right fit for you at an information session. Discover different opportunities to work, study and research at partner universities around the world.\nLearn More!\nDeakin is a highly ranked, internationally recognised university that aims for excellence in all its activities. With its four campuses located in the state of Victoria, Australia, as well as an innovative online campus, Deakin offers an engaging learning experience and will provide you with the perfect study environment to succeed.\nOur student exchange program will give you the chance to explore a new culture, gain a global perspective, make friends from all over the globe and discover the world from down under. During our information session, we will provide you with the necessary details on Deakin’s academic system, how to apply for the exchange program and to choose your subjects. We will also cover topics such as insurance, visa, and accommodation and what else to expect.\nWe look forward to getting you started on this experience of a lifetime.\nRegister!\n
URL:https://yorkinternational.yorku.ca/event/partner-info-session-deakin-university/?instance_id=9722
