DESCRIPTION:Study at one of YorkU’s global partners for 2-6 weeks in the summer. Programs take place between May-August each year and provide students with the opportunity to explore a new city/country, experience a different culture, and earn credits towards their degree. Summer programs are rich with experiential learning activities that make the most of your time away. Learn a new language. Try a new cuisine – the world is your classroom! Come to an information session.\nRegister today!\nInterested in studying abroad at Hochschule Bonn-Rhein-Sieg (H-BRS) Germany? Join us for a virtual information session, hosted by colleagues from H-BRS and Lassonde School of Engineering to learn more about the semester exchange and dual-degree programs available. Don’t miss out on this opportunity to internationalize your degree!\n \n
