SUMMARY:Global Learning Partner Info Session: University of New South Wales
DESCRIPTION:Study at one of YorkU’s global partners for 2-6 weeks in the summer. Programs take place between May-August each year and provide students with the opportunity to explore a new city/country, experience a different culture, and earn credits towards their degree. Summer programs are rich with experiential learning activities that make the most of your time away. Learn a new language. Try a new cuisine – the world is your classroom! Come to an information session.\nUNSW Sydney is one of Australia’s leading research and teaching universities and one of the top 20 universities in the world. Join us to learn more about UNSW, our location in Sydney, and the exchange program that you can take part in, including international student support, campus facilities, clubs & societies, accommodation, our academic calendar and term options, and the application process. \n
