SUMMARY:Vancouver Networking Event
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Vancouver Alumni Networking Event on Oct. 26, 2023. This event will mark the official launch of York University’s Vancouver Alumni Network.\nHosted by Julie Lafford, Assistant Vice-President, Alumni Engagement, this event will provide networking opportunities and a chance to reconnect with fellow alumni.\nTickets are $10, and hors d’oeuvres and beverages will be served. Guests are welcome, and alumni are encouraged to forward this invitation to anyone who they feel may benefit from attending.\nDate: Thursday, Oct. 26, 2023\nTime: 6:30 – 8:30 p.m.\nLocation: Cactus Club Cafe, 1085 Canada Place, Vancouver, BC, V6C 3E1 ( https://maps.app.goo.gl/1arTRErsLqUro46Q7 )\n
