SUMMARY:York University Summit on Generative AI in Higher Education
DESCRIPTION:Dive into the future of higher education as we explore the profound impact of generative artificial intelligence at the three-day York University Summit.\n\nDay 1: Experience the Faculty Showcase, featuring York faculty members from across various disciplines. Learn about how they are integrating and responding to generative AI in their teaching practices.\nDay 2: Join our “Critical Perspectives on Generative AI Panel” as scholarly experts dissect the current state and prospects of generative AI research. Delve into discussions that will shape the narrative of AI’s role in academia.\nDay 3: Hear directly from the primary stakeholders – the students. This panel brings together the voices of postsecondary learners, shedding light on the real-world impact, challenges, and opportunities they face with generative AI in their educational journey.\n\nJoin the Teaching Commons and its co-hosts as we explore the transformative role of AI in reshaping the landscape of higher education, both at York University and across the global academic community. Click here to reserve your spot now! ( https://teachingcommonsforms.apps01.yorku.ca/forms/view.php?id=1022376 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/york-university-summit-on-generative-ai-in-higher-education/
ORGANIZER;CN=Teaching Commons:MAILTO:teaching@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Artificial Intelligence,Teaching &amp; Learning
LOCATION:(URL will be provided in the email confirmation)
END:VEVENT
