SUMMARY:Celebrating 10 years of the Professional LLM in Canadian Common Law
DESCRIPTION:Osgoode Professional Development is proud to celebrate the 10th anniversary of the Professional LLM in Canadian Common Law program. To mark this momentous occasion, we’re inviting alumni of the program to a reunion celebration. This milestone event will bring together esteemed alumni and faculty from across the nation to reflect on a decade of academic achievement and legal innovation.\nLet’s honour the program’s contributions to shaping the legal landscape in Canada and toast to the next decade of success.\nJoin us on Oct. 24 as we commemorate a decade of excellence in legal education! ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/osgoodepd-celebrates-10-years-of-the-llm-in-canadian-common-law-tickets-671588107107?aff=YFileEvents )\n
