SUMMARY:Deloitte Consulting – Toronto Firm Tour for Students (Employer Event)
DESCRIPTION:***Register by Sep 29***\nDeloitte’s Business Strategist Pathway (which encompasses Operations Transformation and Monitor Deloitte consulting groups) recruiting team are excited to be hosting a Toronto Deloitte firm tour for 2nd and 3rd year undergraduate students interested in pursuing a career in consulting at Deloitte. The event will provide insights into our “Business Strategist” pathway as well as provide students with the opportunity to meet Deloitte professionals, hear from a panel of leaders, enjoy refreshments and tour our office. We are targeting to invite ~20 students from your school. This event will be in advance of our internship recruitment cycle, offering students an amazing opportunity to experience the culture of Deloitte first hand.\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Employers Events calendar.\n \n
