SUMMARY:Leading with LA&PS-Your Values and Leadership
DESCRIPTION:The way we choose to lead is greatly influenced by our core values. They shape the things we prioritize as a leader, the way we behave as a leader and how we react in our environments. Considering its importance in our leadership, its important for students to reflect on their core values and take time to consider how it impacts their own philosophy of leadership and how it effects how they want to be lead.\n
