DESCRIPTION:The Department of Finance Canada has launched its annual Economist and Policy Analyst University Recruitment campaign for 2023-2024.\nAs one Canada’s Top Employers for Young People for 2023 we are looking for talented, creative and motivated individuals to contribute to the analysis and design of economic and social policies that will improve the quality of life of Canadians, their families and their communities.\nAll university students that are able to successfully complete their Master’s degree in economics, public policy/administration, finance, international studies or their Law degree by December 31, 2024 are invited to apply to the Economist and Policy Analyst stream that is at the heart of advancing the Department of Finance’s mandate.\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Employers Events calendar.\n
