SUMMARY:EUC Black Community Space and Mentorship Program Launch
DESCRIPTION:🚀 Join us for an exciting launch event! 🌟\n \n📅 Save the Date: October 5th 🕚 Time: 11:00 AM – 1:00 PM 📍 Location: HNES 248\n \nWe’re thrilled to announce the kickoff of our Black Mentorship Program and a dedicated Black Space in EUC! ✨Come connect, inspire, and empower with us. Faculty, students, staff, and alumni, you’re all invited! 🎓Let’s celebrate, foster growth, and enjoy some delightful light refreshments together. 🍪☕\n \nUse the link below to RSVP. Walk-ins welcome! Meet in front of the 2nd floor EUC lounge.\n \nhttps://euc.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=201624\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/euc-black-community-space-and-mentorship-program-launch/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Environmental &amp; Urban Change:MAILTO:
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Environmental &amp; Urban Change
LOCATION:HNES 248 @ 4700 Keele St, North York, ON M3J 1P3, Canada
END:VEVENT
