SUMMARY:Beginner’s Bodyweight Bootcamp with Health Education & Promotion
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday October 4th, 2023\n9:30AM-10:30AM\nIn-person at the Second Student Centre: Studio C\nDescription:\nDo you know that physical activity is associated with increased cognitive and academic performance? Join Health Education and Promotion for a strength and conditioning bootcamp to get your heart pumping and muscles moving. Open to all levels, our boot camp will be comprised specifically of bodyweight movements that can be done anywhere, anytime, no equipment necessary. We will help you hone your form, teach progressions, and help you get stronger.\n \nTo register, Click here! ( https://forms.students.yorku.ca/view.php?id=257758 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/beginners-bodyweight-bootcamp-with-health-education-promotion/
