SUMMARY:Calumet & Stong Colleges Spirit Day Event: Community Mural
DESCRIPTION:York University will be celebrating Spirit Day on October 4, 2023. Spirit Day takes place once a year, during which time the York community is invited to participate in festivities where we celebrate and recognize the people who continue to make this University a success, including our students, faculty and staff.\nCommunity Mural\nCollaborating on a mural will establish a sense of pride and ownership within York community members. Participants, guided by a facilitator will work together to contribute to the painting process. The mural will physically transform a public space, showcasing how small and intentional efforts completed in unity can lead to larger impacts on our collective sense of belonging.\nLocation: Samuel J. Zack’s Gallery, Stong CollegeTime: 11:00 a.m. to 3:00 p.m\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/calumet-stong-colleges-spirit-day-event-community-mural/
