SUMMARY:Teaching Kitchen – No-Bake Energy Bites
DESCRIPTION:\nCelebrate Fall Well-Being Week (Oct. 2 to 6) ( https://www.yorku.ca/well-being/well-being-week/ ) with us with a brain-health food.\n\n\n\nJoin us for an exciting and interactive Teaching Kitchen event. Learn how to make delicious no-bake energy bites with fair-trade ingredients to celebrate Fair-trade Month. Our executive chef and dietitian will guide you through the entire process, sharing their tips and tricks along the way.\n\n\n\nDuring this in-person event, you’ll have the opportunity to get hands-on experience and enhance your culinary skills. Immerse yourself in the vibrant flavours as you prepare this easy and packed with energy bites.\n\n\n\nWhether you’re a beginner or an experienced cook, this event is perfect for anyone looking to expand their culinary knowledge. Don’t miss out on this chance to learn, have fun and connect with fellow food enthusiasts.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/teaching-kitchen-no-bake-energy-bites/
ORGANIZER;CN=YUeats:MAILTO:food@yorku.ca
