SUMMARY:St. Michael’s Hospital Interprofessional Resource Team Online Job Fair (Employer Event)
DESCRIPTION:St. Michael’s Hospital (SMH) is an adult trauma center as well as a central hub for neurosurgery and cardiovascular care. It is known as the Urban Angel for providing care to the unhoused. As a medical/surgical nurse within the Interprofessional Resource Team (IRT), you will be trained in medical-surgical areas, including Stroke/Neurology, Respirology, Nephrology/Urology, Orthopedics, General Internal Medicine, and General Surgery.\nWorking in the IRT is an excellent opportunity for new graduates looking to start their careers and more experienced nurses who enjoy variety in patient care and work environments.\nCome join our team and amazing work culture! The IRT at SMH truly believes in supporting their members and upholding a cheerful work environment, in which our staff truly enjoy being part of the team!\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Employers Events calendar.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/st-michaels-hospital-interprofessional-resource-team-online-job-fair-employer-event/
