DESCRIPTION:Are you ready to elevate your career journey and skills this Fall? ??\nLook no further! The CGI Campus Team is rolling out an unmissable series of ?Fall? workshops and webinars with insider insights into Business and IT Consulting and getting the most out of your co-op experience, as well as tips on AI-powered job searches, networking strategies, personal and professional brand building, and PowerPoint mastery.\nJoin CGI’s Fall workshops and webinars to tap into insights from industry experts, recent grads, and co-op students on the CGI teams. Your journey to success begins here – register now! ??\n\n\n\n\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Employers Events calendar.\n\n\n\n\n
