SUMMARY:Survalent’s Career Fair (Employer Event)
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAre you looking to make an impact? Do you want to be part of an organization with its eye on the ball and looking to grow? Then look no further. Survalent is a growing organization with an entrepreneurial spirit second to none. Survalent, is one of the leading companies offering advanced distribution management systems worldwide. From software development to system implementation, from product marketing to sales, and corporate teams, there’s sure to be something of interest to you!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nRSVP your attendance by emailing hr@survalent.com, and include your contact\ninformation and resume by October 2nd,2023.\n\n\n\n\nTo check for this event, login to Experience York and access the Employers Events calendar.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
