SUMMARY:Rakuten Kobo (Recruitment Session – Employer Event)
DESCRIPTION:Here at Rakuten Kobo, we are a global reading service offering millions of eBooks and audiobooks and best-in-class eReaders and apps. We believe people should be able to read anywhere, in any language, on any device.\nIf this is something you’d like to be a part of, our early career opportunities are built to provide experiences tailored to your skills, interests, and goals. Learn more through our website.\nHow should students prepare for the recruitment session?\nPlease research our organization and the roles we offer through our linked website. It would be good to know our products as well.\n\n\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Employers Events calendar.\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/rakuten-kobo-recruitment-session-employer-event/
