SUMMARY:Discovering Canadian Banking & Wealth Management at Scotiabank (Recruitment Session – Employer Event)
DESCRIPTION:Discovering Canadian Banking & Wealth Management at Scotiabank is an interactive event to learn about opportunities for all students. Learn about the unique student programs available at Scotiabank and dive deeper into various areas within Canadian Banking & Wealth Management such as Retail Products & Performance, Private Banking, Commercial Banking, MD Financial and many more. This event is geared towards current students interested in pursuing a career in Banking. Come network with members of the Scotiabank team and learn how to stand out in the recruitment process!\n\n\n\n\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Employers Events calendar.\n\n\n\n\n
