SUMMARY:Discovering Strategic Functions & Technology at Scotiabank (Recruitment Session – Employer Event)
DESCRIPTION:Discovering Strategic Functions & Technology at Scotiabank is an interactive event to learn about opportunities for all students seeking co-op and new grad opportunities. Learn about the unique student programs available at Scotiabank and dive deeper into various areas within Technology, CID&A, and Strategic Functions such as Software Development, Product Management, Compliance, Global Risk Management, Tangerine Bank and many more. This event is geared towards current students interested in pursuing a career in Banking. Come network with members of the Scotiabank team and learn how to stand out in the resume-free recruitment process!\n\n\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Employers Events calendar.\n\n\n
