SUMMARY:Alumni Night Social
DESCRIPTION:Atkinson Professional Accounting Association and the YorkU Accounting Alumni Network are excited to invite you to our Alumni Night Social taking place on September 29th, 2023 from 6 p.m. to 9 p.m. This event guarantees an evening filled with exciting activities such as pool, darts, table tennis, air hockey, and table football. It is also a valuable opportunity to network with fellow York alumni!\nDate: Sept. 29th\nTime: 6-9 p.m.\nLocation: near Downtown Toronto (exact location TBA closer to event date)\nLimited spots are available!\nSign up now so you won’t miss out on this exciting opportunity.\nDeadline to sign up: September 27th\nSelected candidates will receive the invitation by September 27th.\nIf you have any question, email us at info@yuapaa.com\n
