DESCRIPTION:Hosted by the Faculty of Environmental & Urban Change at York University, Change Your World 2023 will bring together high school students and teachers with York U experts and our community partners from across Ontario to learn how we can make positive change for a just and sustainable future.\nThis year’s event will be held on Thursday, February 22, 2024 at the York University’s Keele Campus.\nLearn more at changeyourworld.yorku.ca.\nQuestions? Email eaction@yorku.ca ( mailto:eaction@yorku.ca )\n
