SUMMARY:EUC hosts OAGEE Fall Conference 2023
DESCRIPTION:The Faculty of Environmental & Urban Change welcomes members of the Ontario Association of Geographic and Environmental Educators to York University on Oct. 12 and 13.\n\nThe theme of this year’s Fall conference focuses on how Geography is not only the science of where, why there and why care, but is the discipline that embodies all key qualities of #SpaceForAll both in the classroom and our global communities.\n\nRegistration is open to OAGEE members only. For more information visit OAGEE’s conference website.  ( https://sites.google.com/view/2023oageeaegeo/ )\n
