SUMMARY:Hong Kong Studies Group Meet and Greet
DESCRIPTION:The Hong Kong Studies Group (HKSG) welcomes York faculty, undergraduate and graduate students to its second Meet and Greet on Wednesday, Oct. 4.\nTo continue to grow a vibrant community of graduate students and faculty on Hong Kong Studies at York, we hope we can have a chance to meet and know more about each other, our research/study interest, and your hope for HKSG. Students new to York are especially welcome.\nA Hong Kong-style light lunch and refreshments will be served but you are also welcome to bring their own lunch if preferred.\nPlease RSVP at: https://forms.office.com/r/t9amTjtM5q ( https://forms.office.com/r/t9amTjtM5q ) if you are planning to attend. We look forward to meeting you there.\nQuestions to: ycar@yorku.ca ( mailto:ycar@yorku.ca )\n
