SUMMARY:At the Margins: Call for Papers
DESCRIPTION:At the Margins is excited to share its Call for Papers for its second issue on the theme of the M/other(ed) Tongue. The journal is open to Indigenous, Black, Brown, and/or Asian graduate students at York University who are interested in sharing their work and learning more about the publishing process. Abstracts/proposals are due by November 1, 2023.\nLink: https://sites.google.com/view/at-the-margins/submissions?authuser=1  ( https://sites.google.com/view/at-the-margins/submissions?authuser=1 )\nFor more information, please connect with Shyam Patel via email: patels12@yorku.ca ( mailto:patels12@yorku.ca )\n
