SUMMARY:Calumet & Stong Colleges Spirit Day Event: Team Jeopardy
DESCRIPTION:York University will be celebrating Spirit Day on October 4, 2023. Spirit Day takes place once a year, during which time the York community is invited to participate in festivities where we celebrate and recognize the people who continue to make this University a success, including our students, faculty and staff.\nTeam Jeopardy\nTeam Jeopardy promotes knowledge sharing, problem-solving, and effective communication within a group. Participants pool their collective knowledge and skills to answer questions about York and the topic of living healthy. The game allows participants to draw on their collective intelligence while learning new and fun facts about our campus.\nLocation: Stong College 101 (MDR)\nTime: 12:00 p.m. to 2:00 p.m.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/calumet-stong-colleges-spirit-day-event-team-jeopardy/
ORGANIZER;CN=Calumet College:MAILTO:scchelp@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Calumet College,Colleges,Faculty of Health,Spirit Day,Stong College
LOCATION:Stong College MDR (SC 101) 
END:VEVENT
