SUMMARY:A Student’s Guide to Meal Planning on a Budget
DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in learning about strategies to use going grocery shopping? Do you find yourself not having enough time to meal prep for the week?   \nDuring this 1-hour session, Health Education and Promotion will take you on a grocery shopping trip where they will break down ways to shop on a budget while showing students how to understand nutrition labels. Afterwards, we will go over meal planning and how students can fit meal prep in their busy schedules.  \nTo register, click here! ( https://forms.students.yorku.ca/view.php?id=270316 )\nBefore attending the presentation, please fill out our anonymous Pre-Test Form (it takes less than 1 minute to complete): https://forms.office.com/r/JdnkbH1Rwh \nThis form helps us ensure our presentation meets the needs of the student body. \n
