SUMMARY:BE YU Financial Literacy II – Investing Young
DESCRIPTION:Join Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) for our Investing Young financial workshop where we will dive into the world of personal finance. This workshop will explore the various investment vehicles and the types of investments. If you are interested in building wealth or just learning about investing, then this session is for you. To reserve a spot, please complete the registration form. \nThis session is open to all students at York, and students who identify as Black are encouraged to attend. \n
