SUMMARY:BEYU Financial Literacy I – Scholarships, Grants and Bursaries
DESCRIPTION:Join Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) as we dive into our first event of our new series: Financial Literacy. This workshop will focus on the differences between scholarships, grants, and bursaries, as well as discuss the value of these three awards to students. Furthermore, students will be provided tools, tips, and tricks to finding and applying to the best scholarships, grants, and bursaries overall. To reserve a spot, please complete the registration form. \nThis session is open to all students at York, and students who identify as Black are encouraged to attend. \n
