DESCRIPTION:Mark your calendar! We’re inviting staff, alumni and donors to the York U Spirit Day Campus Alumni and Donor Breakfast presented in collaboration with the York University Staff Alumni Network.\nJoin Julie Lafford, Assistant Vice-President of Alumni Engagement, for a raffle and giveaways, and take part in a campus-wide celebration of spirit and pride.\nEnjoy a complimentary continental breakfast, coffee, tea, and assorted beverages. This event is free to attend, but registration is required.\nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday, Oct. 4, 2023\nTime: 8 – 9:30 a.m.\nLocation: Alumni Lounge, 4700 Keele Street, York Lanes, 80 York Lanes Blvd., North York, ON, M3J 1P3 (Across from the YU Bookstore)\n
