SUMMARY:EUC Discover General Information Session
DESCRIPTION:Interested in learning more about our undergraduate programs at the Faculty of Environmental & Urban Change? Join us for an information session to explore the seven undergraduate programs – Cities, Regions, Planning (BES), Environmental Arts & Justice (BES), Ecosystem Management (BES), Sustainable Environmental Management (BES), Global Geography (BA) and Undeclared Major (BA/BES) – as well as gather more information about hands-on learning opportunities, scholarships, awards, admission requirements and student life. We look forward to seeing you there!\nTo register, visit: yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJ0tfuiurTMpHNBb6fcH-tXUVm8pO-wJkL4G .\n
