SUMMARY:A Student’s Guide to Improving Sleep
DESCRIPTION:When it comes to the topic of sleep, it seems we can’t get enough. In this workshop will explore the impacts of poor sleep habits on our minds and bodies, and how we can both prioritize our sleep and find practices to optimize whatever amount of sleep you are getting!  \nTo register, click here: A Student’s Guide to Improving Sleep at Bethune College (yorku.ca) ( https://forms.students.yorku.ca/view.php?id=267540 )\nBefore attending the presentation, please fill out our anonymous Pre-Test Form (it takes less than 1 minute to complete): https://forms.office.com/r/x9zDjghBir \nThis form helps us ensure our presentation meets the needs of the student body. \n
