SUMMARY:Leveraging Your Ph.D. and Postdoctoral Research Experience Outside of Academia
DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in a career outside of the academy? Do you want to learn more about how to navigate the world of post-academic careers as a PhD and Postdoc?\nDuring this online session, connect with professionals to learn how to navigate the world of post-academic careers, find out about employer expectations, hiring practices and how to leverage higher education while exploring career opportunities. The discussion will be followed by an audience Q & A session where you will have the opportunity to ask the panelists your questions.\nPanelists:\nDr. Adrina C. Bardekjian, MFC, PhD\nDr. Daniel Santa Mina, M.Sc, PhD\nDr. Masaō Ashtine, M.Sc, MBA, PhD\nHosted by New College, Faculty of LA&PS, in partnership with the Career Centre.\nRegister Here\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/leveraging-your-ph-d-and-postdoctoral-research-experience-outside-of-academia/
ORGANIZER;CN=LA&amp;PS Colleges:MAILTO:lapscolleges@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:LA&amp;PS Colleges,LA&amp;PS Founders College,LA&amp;PS McLaughlin College,LA&amp;PS New College,LA&amp;PS Students-Graduate,LA&amp;PS Vanier College
LOCATION:Zoom Webinar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Grad-Cafe-1.png
END:VEVENT
