SUMMARY:Dr. Katherine Dowling and Dr. Amy Hillis in Concert
DESCRIPTION:This York Music noon-hour concert features York Music faculty, Dr. Katherine Dowling and Dr. Amy Hillis ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/amy-hillis/ ). They will perform a recital featuring works for violin and piano by composers from western art music including a brand-new, world premiere by York’s own, Matt Brubeck. York Music’s newest faculty member, Dr. Melissa Davis ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/melissa-davis/ ) will also perform as a special guest! This concert is free and open to everyone.\nThursday, September 28, 2023\n12:30 PM\nTribute Communities Recital Hall\nFREE ADMISSION\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/dr-katherine-dowling-and-dr-amy-hillis-in-concert/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:Accolade East Building, Tribute Communities Recital Hall @ 83 York Boulevard, Toronto
