DESCRIPTION:A bilingual entrepreneurial competition is coming to Toronto! Support the next generation of entrepreneurs by attending to business presentations, judged by a panel, and for which you will get the chance to vote. Presented by the Glendon ENtrepreneuriat et Innovation A L’international (GENIAL) team and Desjardins, this pitch presentation competition will showcase innovative projects developed by Glendon students who want to develop their entrepreneurial spirit. A networking-cocktail will be offered.\nREGISTER HERE\n
