SUMMARY:CERLAC Graduate Student Orientation Session
DESCRIPTION:CERLAC Graduate Student Orientation Session\nThursday, Sept. 21\n2 to 3:30 p.m.\nIf you cannot come to the meeting in person, you can register for the event here: yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJEkdeugrDMiHNFoxUiakJfKFHEM94oLIfqe ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJEkdeugrDMiHNFoxUiakJfKFHEM94oLIfqe ).\nYou are also invited to a CERLAC Get Together after the orientation session in the eighth-floor common area.\nCERLAC offers graduate students many opportunities and resources, among them: a diploma program, essay and award prizes, mentorship, workshops, graduate research conferences, membership status, workspace, social and cultural activities.\n
