SUMMARY:Guillevin (Virtual | Recruitment Session – Employer Event)
DESCRIPTION:Come meet the team at Guillevin International and learn about all the exciting opportunities for professional development and personal growth within one of the largest distributors of electrical components in Canada! Gain valuable insight into the supply chain industry and hands-on experience in all business areas including financial management, human resources, operations & logistics, sales, and warehouse & inventory management through Guillevin’s many full-time and co-op/internship opportunities. Whether you’re a new grad or a returning student, expand your network and explore working with a leading Canadian company in the supply chain industry!\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Employers Events calendar.\n\n
