SUMMARY:CMA NXT – Marketing Careers Night  (Networking -Employer Event)
DESCRIPTION:The Canadian Marketing Association’s CMA NXT ( https://cmanxt.ca/ ) will be hosting another virtual Marketing Careers Night on Wednesday, September 20th, 2023, at 5 pm EST – 6:30 pm EST. Four marketing professionals from different business sectors will be sharing their career paths followed by a Q&A session. Our marketing professionals come from Danone, Junction59 (Agency), RBC Insurance, and The Princess Margaret Cancer Foundation (NFP).  \nStudents and new marketers will get a better understanding of all the different directions they can take in marketing as well as what a day in the life looks like as a marketing professional.\nThis event is free and open to all students and new marketers across Canada (non-CMA members are welcome). Please note, if you cannot attend the event at that time, still register as we will send you a recording in the post-event email and you can watch the recording when you have time.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Employers Events calendar.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/cma-nxt-marketing-careers-night-networking-employer-event/
