SUMMARY:Student Guide to Meal Planning
DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in learning about strategies to use going grocery shopping? Do you find yourself not having enough time to meal prep for the week?\nDuring this 1-hour online session, the peer health educators will take you on a grocery shopping trip where they will break down ways to shop on a budget while showing students how to understand nutrition labels. Afterwards, the peers will go over meal planning and how students can fit meal prep in their busy schedules.\nWe hope to see you there! Please register in advance ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJ0kd-qurDwsE9zDj6PexEJpfaS87dhMSnHp ).\nBefore attending the presentation, please fill out our anonymous Pre-Test Form ( https://forms.office.com/r/JdnkbH1Rwh ) (it takes less than 1 minute to complete).\n
