SUMMARY:Melbourne Alumni Social
DESCRIPTION:We are delighted to announce that York University will be sending a delegation to Australia this month. During our trip, we hope to reconnect with alumni Down Under and meet you in person.Join Dr. Rhonda Lenton, President and Vice-Chancellor of York University, for an informal evening of connection and conversation. Mingle with other alumni, reminisce about your time at York and hear the latest updates about how the university is delivering on our commitment to creating positive change in communities abroad and at home.\nAlumni are welcome to bring one guest. Appetizers and a complimentary drink will be provided.\nDate: Tuesday, Oct. 3, 2023\nTime: 6 – 7:30 p.m.\nLocation: Bar Nacional, 727 Collins Square, Docklands, VIC, 3008, Australia\n
