SUMMARY:PwC Canada – Consulting & Deals (non-CPA) (Recruitment Session – Networking Event)
DESCRIPTION:Be a part of The New Equation at PwC Canada. We’re a member of the PwC global network of firms and provide you opportunities to be part of an inclusive and diverse culture where we nurture, value, and uplift one another for their unique voice and experiences. We provide opportunities for you to grow, thrive in work and life, and bring your whole self to work. During our Information Session, learn more about Consulting & Deals (non-CPA) at PwC Canada, our open opportunities, application process, and make meaningful relationships with our PwC Professionals. We invite you to join us and discover how the skills, insights and connections you develop will help you shine and benefit you for life.\n\n\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n\n\n
