SUMMARY:Canadian Engineering Graduate Studies Fair
DESCRIPTION:Today’s great challenges demand great engineers and scientists! Push the boundaries and make a difference in the world by pursuing graduate studies.\nDiscover the graduate studies options available to you across Canada at the Canadian Engineering Graduate Studies Fair. Top graduate schools across Canada will be touring the country to connect with the next generation of engineers and scientists and the fair will be stopping at Lassonde on Friday, September 29.\nDon’t miss this opportunity to network with recruiters from Concordia University, McGill University, McMaster University, Queen’s University, Toronto Metropolitan University, University of British Columbia, University of Toronto, University of Waterloo, and York University.\nWhether you’re passionate about research or want to take your career to the next level, graduate programs can help propel you to new heights.\n\nDuring the fair, you can learn more about graduate studies options in engineering and science and explore how graduate programs can empower you to tackle local and global challenges.\nFor additional details, visit our website ( https://lassonde.yorku.ca/academics/cgec ).\nRegister ( https://www.engineeringgradstudies.com/register/ )\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/canadian-engineering-graduate-studies-fair/
ORGANIZER;CN=Lassonde School of Engineering:MAILTO:communications@lassonde.yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Lassonde School of Engineering
LOCATION:Lassonde Building Lobby
END:VEVENT
