DESCRIPTION:Jarvis Consulting Group is hosting a virtual workshop on ‘How to Stand Out as a Developer Workshop‘ on Tuesday, September 12th, from 12p.m. to 1p.m.!\nThis is an opportunity for students to learn strategies on how they can successfully differentiate themselves in the software development world. Our workshop will provide insights on everything from what to do as a new grad interested in software development through to how to stand out in technology based interviews, and ending with getting off to a strong start in a new software development role.\n\n\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n\n\n
