SUMMARY:PwC Canada – GTA & SWO (Recruitment Session- Employer Events)
DESCRIPTION:Learn more about our full-time, co-op, and summer internship CPA and non-CPA opportunities in Assurance, Risk Assurance and Tax in the GTA and SWO region. Gain insight into our application process and network with PwC Professionals to understand how you can be part of the New Equation at PwC Canada.\nAttendance will be at a limited capacity. Please register to attend by September 4th and we’ll confirm your attendance by September 5th.\nFood and refreshments will be provided at this events.\n\n\n\n\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n\n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/pwc-canada-gta-swo-recruitment-session-employer-events/
ORGANIZER;CN=Career Centre:MAILTO:career@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Co-op &amp; Career Centre
LOCATION:Off-campus
