SUMMARY:City of Toronto – General Recreation, Skate, Ski and Aquatics (Recruitment Session – Employer Events)
DESCRIPTION:Get connected with recreation staff to learn about:\nworking in recreation for the City of Toronto\ncurrent job postings\nwhat qualifications are needed\nhow to apply online\nInfo sessions will also provide time in each session to ask staff questions.\nWe encourage applicants to attend one of our in-person recruitment events that will give students/applicants an opportunity to have hands on technical support from a City of Toronto Staff members to create an online Job Profile and apply for any posted positions on Recreation Jobs (toronto.ca).   I have also attached our flyer with details of upcoming in-person events in your area.  In addition, we are also hosting virtual recreation job information sessions.  For details on the upcoming virtual sessions, please go to How to Get Hired in Recreation – City of Toronto.\n\n\n\n\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n\n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/city-of-toronto-general-recreation-skate-ski-and-aquatics-recruitment-session/
