SUMMARY:Go Global Information Session – Exchange (Killam Fellowship)
DESCRIPTION:Are you considering an exchange in the United States for the academic year 2024-25? The Killam Fellowships Program is an outstanding opportunity for exceptional undergraduate students from universities in Canada. Participate in this transformative exchange program and spend either one semester or a full academic year in the United States. The Killam application is due on December 1st, 2023. Join one of our information sessions to explore the timeline and application process for these incredible opportunities. Discover the world through the Killam Fellowships Program! \nRegister!  ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJcuduCvrTMtEtbZrGXTdWqAYKZAmQ22CX9e )\n
