SUMMARY:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Finance?
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Finance? We invite you to attend our program session. Registration is required | Registration Form ( https://schulich.my.salesforce-sites.com/pmtx/evt__sitewebmeeting?id=a0b5b00004bdd3VAAQ )\nThe Schulich Master of Finance (MF) provides students with the robust real-world training and analytical foundation needed for a rewarding career in modern finance.\nStudents will develop their understanding of corporate finance, risk management, private equity, compliance and more. Courses place a strong emphasis on real-world applications and context. Critical topics in governance, ethics and the legal aspects of finance are embedded in the MF curriculum.\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsnews@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/are-you-thinking-of-pursuing-your-graduate-education-in-finance/
