SUMMARY:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Business Analytics, or Management in Artificial Intelligence?
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Business Analytics, or Management in Artificial Intelligence? We invite you to attend our program session. Registration is required | Registration Form ( https://schulich.my.salesforce-sites.com/pmtx/evt__sitewebmeeting?id=a0b5b00004bdcnWAAQ )\nThe Schulich Master of Business Analytics will provide you with the technical, quantitative expertise and strategic mindset to support data-driven business decision-making.\nWith increased data available via new technologies, many industries such as banking, healthcare, retail and e-commerce are acknowledging the importance of analytics and hiring specialized professionals to analyze big data, create value and drive decision-making.\nThe 12-month full-time Master of Management in Artificial Intelligence (MMAI) is designed to meet the growing need for talented professionals with the skills and advanced applied knowledge to develop, evaluate, refine and implement AI-related applications and technologies.\nThe immersive curriculum offers a technical foundation in natural language processing, computational methods and modeling, paired with core business skills. Students will explore a critically evolving ethical landscape as they confront moral topics in AI, such as algorithmic bias, data privacy and intelligent agent autonomy.\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsnews@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/are-you-thinking-of-pursuing-your-graduate-education-in-business-analytics-or-management-in-artificial-intelligence/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies,Faculty of Graduate Studies (Programs),Schulich School of Business
LOCATION:Online Zoom
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/FGS_Banner_1.png
