SUMMARY:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Administration?
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Administration? We invite you to attend our program session. Registration is required | Registration Form ( https://schulich.my.salesforce-sites.com/pmtx/evt__sitewebmeeting?id=a0b5b00004bdcWjAAI )\nThe Schulich doctorate comprises four tightly linked phases of study: coursework to acquire in-depth knowledge of your field of study; a comprehensive examination to demonstrate your mastery of the subject matter; defense of a formal research proposal; and a dissertation.\nFrom the outset of the PhD program, you are invited to start thinking about the direction of your research. Scholarly development through the presentation and publication of papers with professors and other students is a cornerstone of the program.\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsnews@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n
