SUMMARY:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Management Practice?
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Management Practice? We invite you to attend our program session. Registration is required | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJ0uc-murzIjGtCkclAqp832CT2Eu2m7gOyk )\nThe Master of Science degree in Management Practice is designed to provide future leaders in organizations with a robust understanding of management practices rooted in applied research and analysis that inform evidence-based decision-making. Students are provided the opportunity to focus on one specific area: Accounting, Marketing, Supply chain management, Entrepreneurship and innovation and Managing professionals. The program can be completed on a full-time and part-time basis.\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsnews@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n
