SUMMARY:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Health?
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Health? We invite you to attend our program session. Registration is required | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJwtcO6srzwpGdedZ8HP2jQiD6SwFMjgvgwF )\nThe Graduate Program in Health is an exciting learning environment that focuses on real-world and applied research questions related to health. The program emphasizes how societal, economic, political, organizational, and cultural processes influence health. Through theoretical and conceptual approaches from multiple disciplines, students are trained to approach health research in an interdisciplinary way. The program offers two fields of specialization: Health Policy & Equity and Health System Management & Health Data Analytics.\nTo learn more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York week, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsnews@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n
