SUMMARY:Grand Reopening of the Allan I. Carswell Astronomical Observatory
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the grand reopening of the Allan I. Carswell Astronomical Observatory on Wednesday, September 6th, 2023 from 8-10 p.m.!\nTickets are free, but due to limited capacity, attendees should reserve their spot on Eventbrite. \nTo join the tour, come to the 3rd floor of the Petrie Science and Engineering building (PSE) from 8-10pm, and walk to the blue Observatory doors.\nRefer to the directions below or view the York Keele Campus Map.\n\nBuilding #17: Petrie Science and Engineering building\nStarting September 6th, we will be resuming in-person public tours of the Observatory every Wednesday evening after sunset. To view the most recent start times and book a free ticket, visit the “Upcoming Events” section on the Observatory website.\nWe hope to see you there!\n
URL:https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/allan-i-carswell-observatory-grand-reopening-tickets-710723542247?aff=oddtdtcreator
