SUMMARY:Mumbai Alumni Reception
DESCRIPTION:We’re thrilled to share that York University will be sending a delegation to India this September.\nDuring our multi-city trip, we look forward to connecting with our graduates and invite you to join us at an event near you. Come meet other alumni, reminisce about your time at York and learn about our commitment to creating positive change in communities both at home and abroad.\nAll events are free to attend, but registration is required. Hors d’oeuvres and a complimentary drink will be provided. Alumni are welcome to bring one guest.\n \nHosted by: Julie Lafford, Assistant Vice President, Alumni Engagement\nDate: Monday, September 25, 2023\nTime: 7 – 9 p.m.\nLocation: Four Seasons Hotel Mumbai, 1/136, Dr. E Moses Rd, Worli, Mumbai – 400 018 ( https://goo.gl/maps/iASB1S43Ha2bQxmv8 )\nRoom: Library\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/mumbai-alumni-reception/
