SUMMARY:The Emotionally Intelligent Leader
DESCRIPTION:What does it mean to be a successful leader? Is a caring leader more effective than a dominant leader? Join Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) peer leads as we teach students how to empathize appropriately with team members, how to lead a team successfully with respect to diversity and inclusion, and how to identify and set goals for students to meet academic expectations. To reserve a spot, complete the registration form ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJwlfuCuqTkvHd3i0NKgOaeNX9MP1my4cbOx#/registration ).\nThis session is open to all students at York, and students who identify as Black are encouraged to attend.\n
