SUMMARY:Establishing Effective Boundaries for Leaders
DESCRIPTION:Interested in learning about what it takes to be a powerful leader? Join Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) peer leads as we highlight the fundamental skills and models used by leaders, and how they work in practice. Students will learn and build on tools to further their leadership capacity and implement them on a daily basis. To reserve a spot, complete the registration form ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJEkcOiprT0sH91rXY9G2y7tEfE55r7WzLyh#/registration ).\nThis session is open to all students at York, and students who identify as Black are encouraged to attend.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/establishing-effective-boundaries-for-leaders-4/
ORGANIZER;CN=Black Excellence at York University:MAILTO:beyu@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:BE-YU,Students
LOCATION:Zoom
END:VEVENT
