SUMMARY:Principles for Effective Leadership
DESCRIPTION:Interested in learning what makes an authentic, effective leader? This workshop, facilitated by Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) peer leads, will explore foundational leadership principles most commonly seen as vital to success. Students will learn strategies to enhance their leadership capacity and put it into practice on an everyday basis. To reserve a spot, complete the registration form ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJ0ocOGtrjwvHtCgZXXs2oIppaUj6WSvgDZ2#/registration ).\nThis session is open to all students at York, and students who identify as Black are encouraged to attend.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/principles-for-effective-leadership-3/
ORGANIZER;CN=Black Excellence at York University:MAILTO:beyu@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:BE-YU,Students
LOCATION:Zoom
