SUMMARY:The Emotionally Intelligent Leader
DESCRIPTION:What does it mean to be a successful leader? Is a caring leader more effective than a dominant leader? Join Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) peer leads as we teach students how to empathize appropriately with team members, how to lead a team successfully with respect to diversity and inclusion, and to identify and set goals for students to meet academic expectations. To reserve a spot, complete the registration form ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJMsduigrDIqGde1r7FGnBd07D99jLaj4qaf#/registration ).\nThis session is open to all students at York, and students who identify as Black are encouraged to attend.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/the-emotionally-intelligent-leader-4/
ORGANIZER;CN=Black Excellence at York University:MAILTO:beyu@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:BE-YU,Students
LOCATION:Zoom
END:VEVENT
