SUMMARY:Motivation and Productivity
DESCRIPTION:This workshop, facilitated by Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) peer leads, will examine the relationship between motivation and productivity, coupled with how to build leadership. Learn about mechanisms that can help enhance your self-motivation and productivity levels in school and at home. To reserve a spot, complete the registration form ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJIqf-uhpjotE9xMvfehP1nkRsrEd4yU7QVB#/registration ).\nThis session is open to all students at York, and students who identify as Black are encouraged to attend.\n
