SUMMARY:Dubai Alumni Reception
DESCRIPTION:York University is heading to Dubai in September and we hope to see you there!\nYou’re invited to attend our Dubai Alumni Reception. Network and socialize with other alumni, recall your time on campus, and learn about York’s latest initiatives. This event will be hosted by Julie Lafford, Assistant Vice President, Alumni Engagement.\nThis event is free to attend, but registration is required. Hors d’oeuvres and a complimentary drink will be provided. Alumni are welcome to bring one guest.\nDubai Alumni Reception\nDate: Wednesday, September 20, 2023\nTime: 6 – 8 p.m.\nLocation: The Ritz-Carlton, Dubai International Financial Centre, PO Box 482032, DIFC, Salon Room ( https://www.google.ca/maps/search/The+Ritz-Carlton,+Dubai+International+Financial+Centre,+PO+Box+482032,+DIFC,+Salon+Room/@25.2125165,55.276824,17z/data=!3m1!4b1?entry=ttu )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/dubai-alumni-reception/
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni,Regional Alumni Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Untitled-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
