SUMMARY:Go Global Information Session – Exchange
DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in going abroad for the academic year 2024-25? An academic exchange allows students to study abroad for one or two semesters (4-8 months) at one of our many partner universities worldwide. Students will travel to a different country, earn credits towards their degree, and learn about their academic field from an alternative perspective. Don’t miss out on this opportunity of a lifetime! Come to an Information session and learn how this is possible. \nRegister! ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYucuqsqjksGtNLX76xcZVx7DtmEFJxzjw2 )\n
