SUMMARY:Scotiabank: Discover Expedition – Women in Leadership Program (External Events)
DESCRIPTION:Students must register for the event in order to receive event links.  The registration deadline for each event is the morning of the event date at 9 AM EST which is stated in the form.\nThis opportunity is ONLY for master’s and MBA female-identifying students who are currently enrolled in one of your educational institutions and are COMPLETING their degree before May 2024.\nEvent Description: The Expedition Women in Leadership Program is focused on identifying, developing, and retaining high-performing diversity talent. Expedition is an 18-month rotational program with three rotations across Canadian Banking, Wealth Management, and/or Global Risk Management, giving Associates the opportunity to lead and/or support strategic projects and initiatives that have a direct impact on the bank’s strategic priorities. Come learn more about the Expedition Program, the culture at Scotiabank, application timelines for the program and so much more! This event will have an interactive portion to allow for Q&A.\n \nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/scotiabank-discover-expedition-women-in-leadership-program-external-events/
