SUMMARY:Open House at the Harriet Tubman Institute
DESCRIPTION:Welcome back to campus! The Harriet Tubman Institute will be hosting its annual Open House on Thursday, Sept. 14 from noon to 2 p.m. in the Resource Centre (314 York Lanes). We will hear about this year’s events and programming from our new director, Dr. Omosalewa Olawoye-Mann; our artist-in-residence, Dr. Brainerd Blyden-Taylor; and a student representative from the Graduate Caucus. \nWe will be providing lunch and refreshments as we celebrate an exciting new year ahead.\nRegister on Eventbrite.\n
