SUMMARY:2023 MYPAC Walking Tour @ Dr. Lilian McGregor Park
DESCRIPTION:Join us on our 2023 Walking Tour on Aug. 30 at 4:30 p.m. (rain date is Aug. 31).\nAlumna Orli Schwartz (MES ’20) from Lanterra Developments Ltd. will be presenting about Dr. Lillian McGregor Park and how it was built, which involves parkland dedication from three surrounding condo developments: The Britt, 11 Wellesley and Tea House Condominiums. Spots are limited.\nMeeting point: Clover Hill Park\nFollowing the tour, join us for a mix and mingle. Details TBD. Sign up for more information: https://euc.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=191629.\n \n\nAbout MYPAC\n\n\nThe MES York Planning Alumni Committee (MYPAC) was formed in 2004 by several York alumni, students and faculty members. MYPAC’s initiatives include the following:\n\nhost the annual MYPAC Social;\nmanage the MYPAC mentorship program;\nraise money for student initiatives and events; and\nsupport speaking programs.\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/2023-mypac-walking-tour-dr-lilian-mcgregor-park/
ORGANIZER;CN=MES @ York Planning Alumni Commitee:MAILTO:mypacexecutive@gmail.com
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni,Faculty of Environmental &amp; Urban Change
LOCATION:Dr. Lillian McGregor Park
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Dr-Lillian-McGregor-Park_220101-084-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
