SUMMARY:MES @ York Planning Alumni Committee 17th Annual Social
DESCRIPTION:Welcome back to school!\nReturn to the classroom to meet up with your fellow MES alumni. We are hosting our most anticipated event at the Enoch Turner Schoolhouse in the Distillery district on Thursday, Sept. 28 at 6:30 p.m. We look forward to hosting you in this beautiful, historic space.\nEvent details:\n17th Annual MYPAC Social\nDate: Thursday, Sept. 28\nTime: 6:30- to 10 p.m. EST\nLocation: Enoch Turner Schoolhouse \nAddress: 106 Trinity Street, Toronto\nTickets: students $22.63; general admission $54.58. Cash bar.\nRegistration required.\nDress code: business casual\nTicket sales directly support MYPAC initiatives. MYPAC supports alumni and students through: case competitions, scholarships, walking tours, networking events etc. Your support is greatly appreciated.\n \n\nAbout MYPAC\n\n\nThe MES York Planning Alumni Committee (MYPAC) was formed in 2004 by several York alumni, students and faculty members. MYPAC’s initiatives include the following:\n\nhost the annual MYPAC Social;\nmanage the MYPAC mentorship program;\nraise money for student initiatives and events; and\nsupport speaking programs.\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/mes-york-planning-alumni-committee-17th-annual-social/
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni,Faculty of Environmental &amp; Urban Change
LOCATION:106 Trinity St, Toronto, ON M5A 3C6
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/MYPACSocial.jpg
END:VEVENT
