SUMMARY:Fall Wellness Week: Learn about Graduate Student Wellness Services
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by the Faculty of Graduate Studies. This session will allow participants to learn about the various services and resources available to graduate students via Internal York: FGS, OSCR, REI, The Centre, Employee Well-Being, Learning Skills, SAS, etc., and External Services. There will also be some time dedicated to Q&As with our Wellness team.\nZoom Registration link: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUodeysqTwuE93lhvrmyPe0mm1C1J92_RA1 ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUodeysqTwuE93lhvrmyPe0mm1C1J92_RA1 )\n
