SUMMARY:Fall Wellness Week: Coping with Stress as a Graduate Student
DESCRIPTION:The Graduate Student Wellness Services (GSWS) in the Faculty of Graduate Studies will present a session that will allow participants to share barriers to wellness and what helps them to manage them. The facilitator (s) will present some skills/suggestions, but the core of the session will be more centred around “wisdom harvesting” from one another, hopefully tying into the theme and also around the connection.\nZoom Registration Link: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJEqc-6vpzIoHtw7Dl3lK1PgVe81yH_IUhn7 ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJEqc-6vpzIoHtw7Dl3lK1PgVe81yH_IUhn7 )\n
