SUMMARY:Fostering Black Scholars – 2023 Scholarship Success Workshop
DESCRIPTION:The Faculty of Graduate Studies is pleased to invite students to the inaugural Fostering Black Scholars Scholarship Success Workshop. The goal of this workshop is to share new funding opportunities to support Black scholars, and provide advice for how to leverage these supports.\nThe workshop will feature speakers including seasoned Black faculty members and graduate scholars that hold prestigious awards, who will speak on their personal experiences and scholarship successes.\nThe workshop will be hosted via Zoom on Monday, August 28th, 2023 from 10:00am-12:00pm.\nRegistration is required: RSVP Form ( https://fgs.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=244147 )\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/2023-scholarship-success-workshop/
