SUMMARY:AMPD Industry Talks: Screenwriting with Nikki Foy
DESCRIPTION:YORK UNIVERSITY MOTION MEDIA STUDIO\nin collaboration with\nOYA BLACK ARTS COALITION (OBAC)\npresent\nIndustry Talks Series\nHosted by INGRID VENINGER Director, Motion Media Studio\nGuest Speaker NIKKI FOY Screenwriter\nDate: Friday, September 29, 2023\nTime: 6 p.m. to 8 p.m.\nLocation: York U Motion Media Studio (777 Kipling Ave, Toronto M8Z 5Z4 ( https://goo.gl/maps/TmtstHtA5Pr2WgFG8 ))\nFree event.\nRegistration required for entry.\nRSVP: bminor@yorku.ca ( mailto:bminor@yorku.ca )\nABOUT THE SPEAKERS \nIngrid Veninger \nIngrid Veninger ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/ingrid-veninger/ ) is a writer, director, producer, full- time faculty at York University and Director of the Motion Media Studio at Cinespace. She has produced 15 feature films with premieres at TIFF, Rotterdam, Locarno, Busan, Whistler, Rome, Hot Docs and Karlovy Vary with retrospectives of her work at the Canadian Film Institute in Ottawa and FemCine in Chile.\nNikki Foy \nNikki Foy ( http://www.nikkifoy.com/ ) is a screenwriter and graduate from York University’s Screenwriting program – which welcomes only 10 students annually. Currently a lead writer on Star Wars: Outlaws, Nikki has previously written AAA games (Far Cry 6, Watch Dogs: Legion), mobile games (Kim Kardashian: Hollywood, Originals: Interactive Story Series), short films, and sketch comedy.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/ampd-industry-talks-with-nikki-foy/
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni,School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/industrytalks1.jpg
END:VEVENT
