SUMMARY:KPMG Virtual Digital Talent Day Event for STEM Students (External Events)
DESCRIPTION:Digital Talent Day will include networking opportunities, keynote speakers, product demos, and panel discussions from professionals across the firm. It’s a great opportunity for students to learn more about KPMG and meet representatives from the business before we get into our fall recruitment cycle. We will have representatives from various practices including Cyber Security, Risk Consulting, Tax Innovation, Deal Advisory, Data Science, and many more!\nRegister by August 14\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n \n
