SUMMARY:TO Live Front of House Job Fair (External Events)
DESCRIPTION:TO Live Front of House Job Fair\nMonday August 14th, 2023\nAre you passionate about performing arts and live entertainment, and looking to start your career? TO Live invites you to our job fair!\nTO Live operates and programs three performing arts venues, including Meridian Hall and St. Lawrence Centre for the Arts in downtown Toronto, and Meridian Arts Centre in North York. Our vision is to build a better city through the arts, and we are\nlooking to expand our team to do so!\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n
