SUMMARY:Discussion Panel with Black Scholars: The Journey Thus Far!
DESCRIPTION:Learn about various experiences (application, student, academic and research) from some of our current Black graduate scholars at York! This panel will be facilitated by our Associate Director of Research, Scholarships & Awards, Richolette Freckleton.\nRegister: yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_4m1weDrkSOuryOaPYU3D4w )\n
