SUMMARY:Drop In Hour: Bring Your Questions!
DESCRIPTION:This session is open to anyone who has questions about graduate admissions at York. There is no structure or agenda, just a chance for folks to get the answers they’re looking for. Feel free to drop in at any point between 6:00pm and 7:00pm (EST) with your questions about a master’s, PhD, or graduate diploma.\nPlease note that this session will not be able to address questions about programs in the Schulich School of Business (https://schulich.yorku.ca/ ( https://schulich.yorku.ca/ )), or the Osgoode Hall Law School (https://www.osgoode.yorku.ca/ ( https://www.osgoode.yorku.ca/ )).\nRegister: yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_z2bE8vQJR0aWeKMUfa3OSQ )\n
