SUMMARY:Breaking Down the Revision Process: MRP/Thesis
DESCRIPTION:Revising is a challenging part of the MRP/Thesis process, and fundamental in developing our ideas and communicating them succinctly and coherently. In this workshop, students will learn effective editing techniques, learn how to create a revision plan/build multiple drafts, and work towards our final drafts. Students will also develop editing techniques and will be connected to the ample resources available at the Writing Centre.\n*In collaboration with the LA&PS Writing Department*\n \nJoin Here\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/breaking-down-the-revision-process/
ORGANIZER;CN=LA&amp;PS Colleges:MAILTO:lapscolleges@yorku.ca
