SUMMARY:Staying on Track: MRP/Thesis
DESCRIPTION:As graduate students balance multiple priorities and obligations, staying on track with their MRP/Thesis may be difficult. The purpose of this workshop is to provide students with goal-setting techniques, time and project management and organizational strategies to avoid burnout and ways to set and manage reasonable expectations.\n*In collaboration with the LA&PS Writing Department*\n \nJoin Here\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/staying-on-track-mrp-thesis/
