SUMMARY:Getting Started on your MRP/Thesis
DESCRIPTION:Beginning your MRP/Thesis can be quite daunting. This workshop aims to help graduate-level writers get started. This session will focus on choosing a topic, learning how to turn your ideas into a proposal, selecting an advisor, beginning your research, planning and drafts, and setting expectations.\n*In collaboration with the LA&PS Writing Department*\nJoin Here\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/getting-started-on-your-mrp-thesis/
