DESCRIPTION:Allan I. Carswell observatory is holding an in-person sky-observing tour on the ‘Arboretum Lane Parking Garage’ just across from the ‘York University Petrie Science and Engineering’ building at 9:00 pm August 9th, 2023. \n \nEventbrite tickets are free but required for entry and can be accessed through the following link: https://www.yorku.ca/science/observatory/. So join us for a magical night of observing the night sky!\n \n \n \nImage Credit: Nakul Sethuram\n
