SUMMARY:Summer Capstone Day
DESCRIPTION:\nJoin us for Summer Capstone Day on August 17th at 2 pm, a vibrant, pan-campus event celebrating the success of C4 students! Witness their remarkable journey as they share their project findings and compete for awards.\nThis event is a true collaboration, bringing together project partners, mentors, and the entire York community. Let’s celebrate the innovation, creativity, ambition, and impact of our students working on SDG-related projects.\nRegister now ( https://forms.office.com/pages/responsepage.aspx?id=GBNTNBFw1E-H8KQ4FsSb0AroPG_XBCRJv5eTPXb4ABhURUJSUlBBOVlEQlZYU1RSMDNER0g4QjBTWi4u ) to be a part of this exciting showcase! Learn more about the remarkable achievements of our students at Summer Capstone Day. ( https://www.yorku.ca/c4/events/summer-capstone-day/ )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/summer-capstone-day-2023/
