SUMMARY:Black Excellence Welcome Event
DESCRIPTION:Dear Students,\nThe Black Excellence at York University (BE YU), presents its summer Black Excellence Welcome Event on Aug. 16, 2023, from 5 to 8 p.m. in-person at the University’s Second Student Centre.\nThe BEYU Welcome Event is designed to celebrate incoming post-secondary students that self-identify as Black. The theme, “BEYU and Getting to Know You,” is aimed at delving into the Black student experience in post-secondary, building personal and professional relationships, and celebrating the achievements of our incoming York students that attending York represents.\nThe team is excited to host you and we look forward to seeing you all there. You can register for the event here ( https://forms.students.yorku.ca/view.php?id=235431 ). If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us at beyu@yorku.ca ( mailto:beyu@yorku.ca ).\nBest,\nThe BE YU Team\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/black-excellence-welcome-event/
CATEGORIES:BE-YU
END:VEVENT
