TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Webinar: Introducing the Student Systems Renewal Program (SSRP)
DESCRIPTION:The Student Systems Renewal Program (SSRP) is excited to announce its first-ever webinar. Taking place on Tuesday, Aug. 1 from 1 to 2 p.m. and open to all staff and faculty, the SSRP team will provide attendees with a general overview of the program’s transformational projects, focusing on the direct changes and benefits for students, faculty and staff.\nThose who attend will have an opportunity to:\n• learn about the SSRP’s suite of seven projects and progress to date.\n• find out how you can engage with, prepare to use and adopt the new technologies.\n• gain deeper insights into how these transformational projects will directly affect you, your colleagues and students.\n• speak directly with program staff and ask questions.\nQuestions can be submitted in advance using this form ( https://vpfa.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=48920 ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/webinar-introducing-the-student-systems-renewal-program-ssrp/
CATEGORIES:Faculties
LOCATION:https://yorku.zoom.us/j/93953998793?pwd=aGxURU5XMEkyYjloR0tHUjhjb2w4Zz09#success
END:VEVENT
