SUMMARY:An Introduction to Black Excellence at York University
DESCRIPTION:Dear Students,\nThe Black Excellence at York University (BE YU), presents An Introduction to Black Excellence at York University. The session is offered as part of the YU Prep program on July 27, 2023, from 4:30 to 6 p.m. in room DB 0010.\nThis session is designed to provide incoming first-year students with an overview of the overall functions of the BE YU Program. This workshop will highlight the members of the team, the opportunities the programs provide, and how it helps students maximize their success in their post-secondary careers.\nThe team is excited to host you and we look forward to seeing you all there. You can register for the event here ( https://forms.students.yorku.ca/view.php?id=240035 ). If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us at beyu@yorku.ca ( mailto:beyu@yorku.ca ).\nBest,\nThe BE YU Team\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/an-introduction-to-black-excellence-at-york-university/
CATEGORIES:BE-YU
LOCATION:Victor Dadaleh building (building code DB) 0010
END:VEVENT
