SUMMARY:EY’s LEAD Consulting Conference (External Events)
DESCRIPTION:Are you looking for a way to leverage your education to fuel a career in the dynamic world of consulting? If you are a Science, Technology, Engineering or Math, or a BComm/BBA student with an interest in getting an early start in the recruiting process, then this is the program for you!\nAs a part of this conference, you will be taking part in an interactive challenge that will help you hone your leadership skills and adapt to different challenges. In addition, you will have the opportunity to learn from a diverse panel of speakers who will share insights on what it takes to succeed in the industry. You will also see what EY is doing to develop our workforce diversity and some of the many initiatives that we have in place, all of which make EY an incredibly unique firm to work for.\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/eys-lead-consulting-conference-external-events/
ORGANIZER;CN=Career Centre:MAILTO:career@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Co-op &amp; Career Centre
LOCATION:Off-campus
