SUMMARY:Oxford Properties Networking Mixer (External Events)
DESCRIPTION:Attention students looking for a Summer 2024 work opportunity with Oxford Properties!\nOxford Properties is hosting a Networking Mixer in Toronto on Wednesday August 2ndfrom 5:00 – 7:00pm. If you are searching for a Summer 2024 student opportunity within Real Estate, then you do not want to miss this event!\nYou will have the opportunity to meet directly with the hiring teams for our Summer 2024 positions, including Investments, Development, and Asset Management. It is encouraged you bring a copy of your resume with you!\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n
