SUMMARY:Summer 2023 Undergraduate Research Conference
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by the Faculty of Science, the Summer 2023 Undergraduate Research Conference is an opportunity for recipients of NSERC Undergraduate Summer Research Awards (USRA), Earle Nestmann Undergraduate Research Awards (ENURA), Dean’s Undergraduate Research Awards (DURA), and York Science Scholars Awards (YSSA) to present their summer research and to meet other awardees.\nStudents from the Faculties of Science, Health, and Environment & Urban Change, and Glendon College will be sharing their research projects and findings through talks and poster presentations.\nDate: August 16, 2023\nTime: 8:30AM – 3:30PM\nLocation: Life Sciences Building Lobby\nTo view the conference schedule, please visit the Summer 2023 Undergraduate Research Conference ( https://www.yorku.ca/science/research/undergraduate-research/summer-2023-undergraduate-research-conference/ ) page.\n
