SUMMARY:Les secrets derrière l’écran : Le parcours d’un(e) conseiller(ère) en cybersécurité chez CGI (External Events)
DESCRIPTION:The CGI team has been working on some exciting workshops and webinars planned for the upcoming few months as an opportunity for students to learn more about the work we do at CGI, as well as polish their skills in interviewing, resume writing and other areas. These webinars and workshops will be hosted virtually.\nHere is the schedule:\nWebinars (English & French)\nJuly 19 – 1:00-2:00 pm ET: Les secrets derrière l’écran : Le parcours d’un(e) conseiller(ère) en cybersécurité chez CGI\nAugust 10 – 1:00-2:00 pm ET: Behind the Screens: .Net\nAugust 17 – 1:00-2:00 pm ET: Behind the Screens: Business Analysis\nCareer Ready Workshops (English & French)\nJuly 6 – 1:00-2:30 pm ET: Interview Tips\nAugust 23 – 1:00-2:30 pm ET: Journée de simulation d’évaluation pour nouveaux diplômés\nAugust 23 – 2:00-3:00 pm ET: LinkedIn Tips\nTo register for this event, login to Experience York and access the Career Centre calendar.\n
