SUMMARY:Richmond Hill Ribfest
DESCRIPTION:Join York University’s Markham Campus team at the Richmond Hill Ribfest to learn more about York’s newest campus in York Region. Enjoy the three-day outdoor festival full of music and activities, featuring professional rib teams from across North America. Stop by our tent to participate in complementary family activities, prizes, giveaways and more, courtesy of Markham Campus. Visit Richmond Hill’s website to learn more about Ribfest ( https://www.richmondhill.ca/en/things-to-do/ribfest.aspx ).\nDate & Time\nFriday, July 21 from 12 – 10 p.m\nSaturday, July 22 from 11 a.m. – 10 p.m.\nSunday, July 23 from 11 a.m. – 8 p.m.\nLocation\nRichmond Green Park\n1300 Elgin Mills Road East\nRichmond Hill, ON L4S 1M5\n
