SUMMARY:York U Alumni Dinner at National Bank Open
DESCRIPTION:Going to the National Bank Open on August 8? Join us after the day session or before the evening session for the annual York Day Alumni Dinner and celebrate with other alumni tennis fans! For only $25,* add even more value to your tennis ticket, connect with other alumni in the Cadillac VIP Lounge, enjoy delicious food (menu below), and maybe even walk away with a prize.\nRSVP today ( https://give.yorku.ca/s/1853/adv/form.aspx?sid=1853&gid=2&pgid=1129&cid=2397 )—we look forward to seeing you soon!\nYork Day Alumni Dinner at National Bank Open\nTuesday, August 8\n5 – 7 p.m. ET\nCadillac VIP Lounge\nSobeys Centre at York University\n1 Shoreham Drive\n* In order to gain entry into the York Day Alumni Dinner at National Bank Open (located on the Sobeys Centre grounds), you and each of your guests must have purchased an August 8 session ticket to the National Bank Open; alumni discount available via the link below.\nLearn more about the alumni discount  ( https://www.yorku.ca/alumniandfriends/benefit/ways-to-save/#nationalbankopen2023 )and purchasing tickets to National Bank Open (for any of the sessions) or call 1.877.283.6647.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/york-u-alumni-dinner-at-national-bank-open-2/
