SUMMARY:Learn To Network Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Do you find networking a challenge? Not sure where to start? Attend this workshop in partnership with the Career Center to learn how to network at events, build your elevator pitch through hands-on activities, and gain tips and strategies on improving your professional communication skills.\nThe perfect elevator pitch can help you stand out to professionals in your field, and give them a sense of what you’re looking for so they can help you advance your career, whether it’s putting you in touch with a hiring manager or telling you about relevant opportunities.\nAll attendees will be entered into a draw to win 1 of 3 opportunities to get professional headshots taken for FREE!\nDuring this workshop, participants will have the opportunity to:\n• Get tips on speaking with confidence\n• Learn more about crafting the perfect elevator pitch\n• Hear elevator pitches from other students\n• Receive expert guidance on your own elevator pitch\nFree light refreshments and snacks will be provided to those who attend.\nRegister!  ( https://yorkinternational.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=711486 )\n
URL:https://yorkinternational.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=711486
ORGANIZER;CN=York International:MAILTO:goglobal@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:International
LOCATION:280N York Lanes
END:VEVENT
