SUMMARY:Canada Day Celebration in NYC
DESCRIPTION:Join the Canadian Association of New York (CANY) at Houston Hall for the best Canada Day party in New York City on Wednesday, June 28. As York alumni, you’re entitled to a discounted ticket.\nDon’t miss this great opportunity to network with fellow Canadian alumni. Celebrate with old and new friends while you enjoy drinks, appetizers, an event raffle and music by Canadian artists.\nSpace is limited, so we recommend that you get your tickets early (tickets will not be sold at the door).\nTickets range between $45 and $65. Click here for details about ticket pricing.\nJoin the LinkedIn group for York alumni in New York and expand your network.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/canada-day-celebration-in-nyc/
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni,Regional Alumni Events
