SUMMARY:Campus Walking Tour & Social for Grad Students
DESCRIPTION:LA&PS Colleges would like to welcome all LA&PS graduate students (MA, PhD, Postdoc) to join us on a campus walking tour. Take this opportunity to learn how to better navigate when on campus. The tour will conclude at New College (Atkinson building) with some refreshments.\nYou will also get the chance to meet and connect with New College Head, Professor Zachary Spicer and the rest of the New College team.\nThe group will meet in front of the York University subway station at 2:00pm.\nTo register, click here ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/campus-walking-tour-social-for-grad-students-tickets-638031087157 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/campus-walking-tour-social-for-grad-students/
