SUMMARY:BIPOC Queer & Trans Mixer
DESCRIPTION:We understand that pride month events can be overwhelming and not accessible for everyone. For this reason, SCLD wants to provide a low-pressure chill space for BIPOC queer and trans students to mingle and meet others like them. Come join us for fun activities and delicious food on June 22, from 2 to 4 PM. Dress code: wear your favourite colour!\nThe location is to be announced, the link to sign up is https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=GBNTNBFw1E-H8KQ4FsSb0FCX_fBTqC9OlO39gzL_hkFUQkJKMUVNRjUwWjQ2WENTUlFSSUdQUlJLNS4u ( https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=GBNTNBFw1E-H8KQ4FsSb0FCX_fBTqC9OlO39gzL_hkFUQkJKMUVNRjUwWjQ2WENTUlFSSUdQUlJLNS4u )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/bipoc-queer-trans-mixer/
