SUMMARY:Atrium Tour at Allan I. Carswell Observatory
DESCRIPTION:Allan I. Carswell observatory is holding an in-person sky-observing tour on the ‘Arboretum Lane Parking Garage’ just across from the ‘York University Petrie Science and Engineering’ building at 9:00 pm June 7th, 2023. Eventbrite tickets are free but required for entry and can be accessed through the following link: https://observatory.info.yorku.ca/. So join us for a magical night of observing the night sky! \n \nRefer back to the Observatory site for the most updated event information.\n
