SUMMARY:Bike Month
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate Bike Month on June 13th from 11am – 3pm in front of Vari Hall in the Common Green Space to learn more about cycling in Toronto and the chance to win fun prizes!\nBike Month is a celebration to encourage everyone to get cycling, learn new riding skills and for fun events to connect with new people! Ride your bike for your commute to work, on your lunch break, while running errands in your neighbourhood, or for a ride with friends and family!\n
