SUMMARY:#DisplayYourPride Drop in Photo Booth
DESCRIPTION:Come join us at the Vari Hall Kiosk to #DisplayYourPride! Come snap a few photos to celebrate Pride Month and post them using the hashtag.\nDisplay your pride is a cross-institutional virtual event held by universities across Ontario where we celebrate Pride Month by displaying out pride.\nDrop by the Vari Hall kiosk on June 13 any time between 11 AM and 3 PM and snap pictures and eat some snacks to celebrate Pride Month.\n
