SUMMARY:SexGen’s All Gender Drag Ball – Existence is Resistance
DESCRIPTION:This Pride Month, York University’s SexGen Committee will host an outdoor lunchtime All Gender Drag Ball that will feature members of the York Community and other performers. Drag performers will be recognized for their unique performances with awards and honoraria. Attendees will have the opportunity to enjoy some free ice cream and slushies. \nThe event will be held at the Harry Arthurs Commons, in person, at York university on Wednesday, June 14 from noon to 2 p.m. \n
