SUMMARY:Wednesday Webinars – Ask Me Anything with International Student Ambassadors
DESCRIPTION:Join York International for our pre-arrival Wednesday Webinar series, where we connect with new incoming international students to provide timely and important information you need to know.\nRegister here! ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJEsdeGpqjotHd3AznHyOzwME5ejaRTXPk40 )\nIn this webinar, Ask me Anything (AMA) with International Student Ambassadors, you will hear current and newly graduated York International Students share their experiences, challenges and expectations of coming to Canada, to Toronto and to York University.\nAdditionally, you will hear tips and honest advise they wish they received when they were in their first year of university. Have a question? This webinar will feature multiple Q&A and chat opportunities for you to ask questions about academics, student life and more.\nDon’t miss out on this opportunity to learn more about living and studying in Canada through students who have been through it all!\n
URL:https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJEsdeGpqjotHd3AznHyOzwME5ejaRTXPk40
ORGANIZER;CN=York International:MAILTO:goglobal@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:International
LOCATION:(URL will be provided in the email confirmation)
END:VEVENT
