SUMMARY:Pride Awareness Part 2: Toronto Pride Parade
DESCRIPTION:Part 2 Pride awareness:\n\nHundreds of thousands of people line the streets of Toronto to watch the Pride parade. The procession is full of colour floats, dancers, drag queens and marchers waving flags.\n\nRegister here! ( https://yorkinternational.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=704894 )\n\nNOTE: Please download, sign, and then upload this waiver form ( https://drive.google.com/file/d/1helvv0RRNxhr0XOo4tGoVJrmG4XzQ4cH/view ).\nUSE YOUR YORKU EMAIL (username@yorku.ca) TO ACCESS THE WAIVER FORM. Notice that it is username@yorku.ca and not username@my.yorku.ca. If you are still having trouble accessing the form, please email pratika@yorku.ca\n\n📍Location: Downtown Toronto / Church Street\n
URL:https://yorkinternational.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=704894
