SUMMARY:Culture Cuisine Series: Taste of Iran
DESCRIPTION:Let’s come together for the Cultural Cuisines series where we go together off-campus to explore different dishes from around the world. What better way to explore a culture than by trying out its authentic flavors? So, join us in our quest for diversifying taste buds while learning more about each other’s cultures and traditions.\nRegister! ( https://yorkinternational.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=670673 )\nPlease sign the waiver form ( http://2023 Waiver Form - Culinary Cuisine - June 16.pdf ) once you register!\n
