SUMMARY:Think Like an Employer
DESCRIPTION:Not sure what exactly you have to offer a Canadian employer? You likely have more than you think!\n\nThis workshop – designed around the Career Decision Making Model – will help you identify and articulate your skills and accomplishments gained during your time at York. In addition, you will be able to learn how to highlight value of your international experience while writing an engaging and job-winning résumé.\n\nRegister!  ( https://yorkinternational.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=679080 )\n
