SUMMARY:Celebrate Diversity, Embrace Unity: Pride 2023 at Glendon
DESCRIPTION:Glendon will welcome 2SLGBTQIA+ students, staff and faculty for a gathering called: “Celebrate Diversity, Embrace Unity.” This event will include a roundtable conversation focusing on the diversity of identities, backgrounds and perspectives within the community and needs and priorities in order to create a more inclusive space at the university. The roundtable will be followed by a social mixer. Snacks and refreshments will be served.  \nThe roundtable conversation will take place in a hybrid format. To join virtually, please click on the zoom link here ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJAoduCqrTMjGNweNtxoemQKZi9NxawgcEE7 ). No prior registration is required.  \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/celebrate-diversity-embrace-unity-pride-2023-at-glendon/
CATEGORIES:Glendon,Glendon Current Students,Glendon Salon Francophone,Pride Month
LOCATION:Glendon Campus, York University @ 2275 Bayview Ave., Room YH A-304
