SUMMARY:Black Grad Celebration hosted by York’s Black Alumni Network
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by York’s Black Alumni Network (YUBAN), register to celebrate and recognize the achievements of the Black identifying members of the Class of 2023.\nBlack-identifying grads, and up to two guests, along with the professors, staff, classmates, alumni, friends, family, and allies are invited to join this evening of mingling and celebrating. YUBAN also acknowledges that, while we are delighted to celebrate Black grads, much more work remains to be done to counter anti-Black racism achieve much deserved equity.\nThis celebration is free to attend, but registration is required. You can expect to socialize with food, music, a photobooth, and short remarks from our community.\nDate: June 28, 2023\nTime: 6:00 – 8:30 p.m. ET\nLocation: Keele Campus\n
