SUMMARY:Rainbow Grad Celebration hosted by York’s Sexuality & Gender Advocacy Alumni Network (SAGA)
DESCRIPTION:Intentionally organized during PRIDE, join York’s Sexuality & Gender Advocacy Alumni Network (SAGA) at the Rainbow Grad Celebration!This inaugural event for York U will celebrate and recognize the achievements of the 2SLGBTQIA+ members of the Class of 2023. Current grads are invited to bring up to two guests to join your celebration and we warmly welcome the professors, staff, classmates, alumni, friends, family, and allies of our grads, especially those who self-identify as members of the 2SLGBTQIA+ community. While we celebrate the achievement of our grads, SAGA also acknowledged the work that remains to achieve equity.This celebration is free to attend, but registration is required. You can expect to socialize with food, music, and short remarks from our community.\nDate: June 29, 2023Time: 6:00 – 8:30 p.m. ETLocation: Keele Campus\n
