SUMMARY:Info Session: Tec de Monterrey
DESCRIPTION:Experience the vibrant culture of Mexico while pursuing your dreams of studying abroad. Join us at York International on June 8th at 11am to discover the incredible opportunities awaiting you at Tec de Monterrey.\n \nExpand your horizons and gain valuable international experience that will shape your future. Explore the world-class programs, immerse yourself in the lively atmosphere, and learn about the unique student life in Mexico. Don’t miss out on this chance to transform your education and broaden your perspective.\n \nRegister now and embark on an unforgettable journey at Tec de Monterrey!\n \nThis is a virtual event:\n\nThursday, June 8th, from 11:00 AM – 12:PM (1 hour)\nRegister here ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJAucOqgrDosE9QVCtRppeEQ4beLrr8EFl6z ) !\n\n
