SUMMARY:Sustainable Futures Challenge 2023
DESCRIPTION:Calling all innovators, problem solvers and collaborators!\nMake a difference this summer through the Sustainable Futures Challenge.\nDuring this three-day event, you’ll get a chance to work with fellow York students to design a future where we give as much as we take. Show off your problem-solving skills, gain experience and network with community partners in the sustainability sector! In collaboration with the York University Sustainability Office, the Faculty of Environmental & Urban Change and the YU Experience Hub.\nA small registration fee is needed to secure your spot!\nFor more information about the event, checkout the Eventbrite link ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/sustainable-futures-challenge-tickets-632726992467 )\n
