SUMMARY:York University Pride 2023 Opening Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Join the Centre for Human Rights, Equity and Inclusion (CHREI) in collaboration with the Office of Institutional Events and Student Community & Leadership Development for the York University Pride 2023 Opening Ceremony.\nAll York community members are invited to attend. After the ceremony and opening remarks, attendees can enjoy free treats, snap a selfie with York’s mascot Yeo and learn about 2SLGBTQIA+ resources and services available at York. Engage in the conversation on social media using #YUPride and share what a campus free of homophobia and transphobia looks like, feels like and sounds like to you.\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/york-university-pride-2023-opening-ceremony/
