SUMMARY:Alumni Lounge
DESCRIPTION:Pop-up Alumni Lounge coming soon to York Lanes!\nWe are excited to welcome alumni to enjoy this space, created specifically for our valued York U alumni. The Alumni Lounge will be open weekdays and some weekends from May 27 to June 23. You’ll find us across from the YU Bookstore in York Lanes.\nIf you haven’t already, register now for your York U Alumni Perks ( https://yorku.alumni-perks.com/ ), you will be kept up to date on deals offered to you by our valued partners in our digital space. And you can reconnect with fellow grads in our comfortable physical space as you enjoy a refreshment and share memories of your student days.\nIf you have any questions or would like to learn more about alumni programs and opportunities please email alumni@yorku.ca ( mailto:alumni@yorku.ca )\nHOURS DURING CONGRESS 2023\nSaturday May 27 11AM – 5PM\nSunday May 28 11AM – 5PM\nMonday May 29 9AM – 7PM\nTuesday May 30 9AM – 7PM\nWednesday May 31 9AM – 7PM\nThursday June 1 9AM – 7PM\nFriday June 2 9AM – NOON\nHOURS DURING JUNE CONVOCATION EVENTS\nMonday to Friday 11AM – 5PM\nSaturdays and Sundays CLOSED\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/alumni-lounge/
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Header.jpg
