SUMMARY:Classroom Expectations for Mature & Transfer Students
DESCRIPTION:What is the mature and transfer student life like? What can mature and transfer students expect in classes? ACMAPS will be hosting a virtual workshop—facilitated and based on experiences of fellow seasoned student peers—designed to help mature and transfer students feel more knowledgeable, better equipped, and thus more comfortable in engaging with diverse classroom settings.\nNotes: Registration is required.\nRegister here: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJctfuGhrTwiGd2s3DWEbxPWgABgT722e3wb ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJctfuGhrTwiGd2s3DWEbxPWgABgT722e3wb )\n
