DESCRIPTION:This workshop will help participants gain an understanding of how to recognize racism, how it can manifest, and what its impacts are. Participants will learn about strategies to address barriers to inclusive spaces and become familiar with relevant tools, policies, and legislation within the York context.\nRegister here. ( https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=730 )\n
