SUMMARY:eClass Session for Mature and Transfer Students
DESCRIPTION:eClass is an important platform that you will need to get accustomed to while you are at York! eClass is an online learning management system that professors use to distribute course materials, where you will do some of your exams, submit your assignment, and find important course-related information and announcements. This session will give you a live demonstration and tutorial on how to access all these features, to make sure you are ready for your upcoming classes!\nRegistration is needed. Click here to register:\nhttps://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJIpd-6srjItG9auGhbsBh0TnP1DMONIT4uF ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJIpd-6srjItG9auGhbsBh0TnP1DMONIT4uF )\n
