SUMMARY:Tips for Learning @ York U for Transfer Students
DESCRIPTION:Students transferring to YorkU from college or another university face different challenges and experiences than those coming straight from high school. This workshop, called Tips for Learning @ YorkU, is designed to help transfer students better understand the keys to mastering university-level learning and put you on the path to academic success. This session is brought you by the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-Time Students (ACMAPS) in collaboration with Learning Skills Services.\nRegistration is needed. Click here to register –\nhttps://www.yorku.ca/scld/events/tips-transfer/  ( https://www.yorku.ca/scld/events/tips-transfer/ )\n
