SUMMARY:Professional Writing Students’ Association Fifth Annual Symposium
DESCRIPTION:The York University Professional Writing Students’ Association (PWSA) invites you to the PWSA’s Fifth Annual Undergraduate Symposium Sententia: ways of thinking, ways of being, ways of writing.\n \nOn Friday, April 28, you will see multimodal presentations from undergraduate students of Ontario universities, followed by Q&A sessions. We would love for you to join as an audience member this year and potentially a panelist member next year.\n\nPlease RSVP by Wednesday, April 26 to receive the zoom link: https://forms.gle/4dvsnbBVdtSv4NBUA\n\nCheck out the 2022 Symposium – Metanoia. For more information about the PWSA click here.\n
