TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Osgoode’s Internationally Trained Lawyers Day (OITLD)
DESCRIPTION:\nJoin us on May 24 for OITLD 2023, Osgoode’s Internationally Trained Lawyers Day\n\nOITLD is a unique opportunity for legal employers, lawyers and law graduates from different countries, and those who may otherwise be going through the process of accreditation or licensing alone, to learn, share and celebrate internationally trained talent across Canada.\nOur main focus is to provide internationally trained lawyers and law graduates an in-depth understanding of the unique paths available in reaching their goals and contributing to the Canadian legal profession.\n\n \nThis year’s event will be hybrid. Join us in person for the full day or  register to be part of our morning sessions online. Here’s a glimpse of what you can expect. ( http://osgoodepd.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/OITLD23-Agenda.pdf )\nRegister today to save your spot!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/osgoodes-internationally-trained-lawyers-day-oitld/
ORGANIZER;CN=Osgoode Professional Development:MAILTO:OsgoodePD@osgoode.yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:International,Osgoode Hall Law School
LOCATION:Osgoode Professional Development Centre @ 1 Dundas Street West
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Edited_OPD_York_Jan.7th2020-56-scaled-e1681410710256.jpg
END:VEVENT
