TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:OMNI-RÉUNIS Super Spreader Seminar on Mathematical Modelling to Identify Optimal Dosing for Cancer and Covid-19 Vaccines on April 20 from 11 am-12 pm EST
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the OMNI-RÉUNIS Super Spreader Seminar Series on April 20 from 11 am-12 pm EST with Dr. Suzan Farhang-Sardroodi, who will discuss her work on Mathematical Modelling to Identify Optimal Dosing Schedules for Cancer and Covid-19 Vaccines.\nRegister now to attend: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUqdO-vrTIjE9Hv76Vk8HOPK737krbUp2r0  \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/omni-reunis-super-spreader-seminar-on-mathematical-modelling-to-identify-optimal-dosing-for-cancer-and-covid-19-vaccines-on-april-20-from-11-am-12-pm-est/
ORGANIZER;CN=Huaiping Zhu:MAILTO:huaiping@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Health,Faculty of Science,Research &amp; Innovation
LOCATION:Zoom Session
