SUMMARY:Graduate Admissions—Virtual Drop-In Hour
DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join us for a virtual graduate studies office hour! Join us to ask any questions that you might have about York University and our graduate admissions process.\nParticipants are able to ask questions via the chat feature, and a representative will answer each question out loud. Please note that during these sessions we will not be able to answer any questions about Schulich School of Business programs, or Osgoode Law School programs.\nFor all other questions about graduate diplomas, master’s programs, and doctoral degrees, we look forward to having you attend the event. This is a virtual drop-in event. You can join the virtual office hour at any time to ask questions and do not need to remain online for the session’s entire duration.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_r6gGvtWXQqSmTZptDwOR_g )\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nFor any questions, please email us at FGSNEWS@YORKU.CA ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n
