SUMMARY:Teaching Kitchen: Learn to make Vietnamese Spring Rolls (Free!)
DESCRIPTION:YUeats invites you to take a break from studying and participate in our upcoming Teaching Kitchen series, a free cooking class featuring the delicious Vietnamese Spring Rolls.\nThis free cooking class offers an exciting opportunity to learn how to make delicious spring rolls from scratch, with the guidance of a dietitian and an expert chef. Not only will you discover new techniques and flavour combinations, you’ll also come away with a newfound appreciation for Vietnamese cuisine and learn ways in increase you vegetable intake without compromising on flavour!\nDate: Keele – April 12 and Glendon – April 13\nTime: 2:30-3:30\nCost: Free\nPlease register ( https://www.yorku.ca/foodservices/2023/04/03/teaching-kitchen-series-april-12-stong-dining-hall-april-13-glendon-marche/ ) to confirm your attendance, as spaces are limited.\nThis is an excellent chance to meet new people, have fun and indulge in some fantastic food, all in one hour.\n
