SUMMARY:OMNI-RÉUNIS SSSS Seminar: Fear (Un)Learning in Infectious Disease Modeling on April 6, 11:00-12:00 EST
DESCRIPTION:Join OMNI-RÉUNIS Super Spreader Seminar on Incorporating Fear (un)Learning Mechanisms in Infectious Disease Modeling by Avneet Kaur on April 6, 2023, from 11:00-12:00 EST.  \nThis seminar explains how to effectively manage epidemics by modelling the disease and human responses to information, policies, and socioeconomic contexts. Learn about effective epidemic management through Fear-Based Infectious Disease Modeling: Insights from Avneet Kaur.\nTo attend, please register using the link below:\nhttps://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUqdO-vrTIjE9Hv76Vk8HOPK737krbUp2r0 \n
