SUMMARY:Inaugural Grand Community Iftar at Keele Campus
DESCRIPTION:\nYork University’s Student Life: The Centre for Student Community and Leadership Development ( https://www.yorku.ca/scld/ ) (SCLD), in partnership with the Keele and Glendon Muslim Student Associations, will present an inaugural Grand Community Iftar on April 6, from 6 to 9 p.m., in the Second Student Center, Keele Campus.\n\n\n\nAll are welcome and invited, including folks from all faiths, to join and enjoy an array of guest speakers and performers for an evening of unity, solidarity and celebration of Islam. \n\n\n\nGuest speakers, du’a, breaking of the fast and Maghrib prayer will be observed and followed by a community dinner.\n\n\nTickets are required and can be purchased here. All students, staff and faculty are welcome to attend.  \n\n\n\nProceeds from ticket sales will be donated towards earthquake relief in Türkiye and Syria by way of Human Concern International.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/inaugural-grand-community-iftar-at-keele-campus/
CATEGORIES:Students
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/IFTAF-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
