SUMMARY:Navigating YU: Summer 2023 (For Newly Admitted Mature & Transfer Students)
DESCRIPTION:Will it be your first time on-campus for Summer 2023? Don’t know where to go? Don’t know who to talk to? Join ACMAPS as we explore Keele Campus buildings, resources, services, and answer many of your burning questions! By attending this virtual workshop, participants will learn building abbreviations, explore key websites like eClass and, as a result, grow more comfortable in navigating York University, whether in-person or online. We are eager to support YU!\n* Note: This workshop will be offered on the morning of April 25th and the afternoon of April 27th. However, the content being delivered will be the same.\nApril 25th at 11:00am – https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYtfuqgrDMsG9xUUFVUDHvjvelA2LVBAvG0 ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYtfuqgrDMsG9xUUFVUDHvjvelA2LVBAvG0 )\n
