SUMMARY:Newly Admitted: The Transfer Process with the Faculty of LA&PS
DESCRIPTION:This session is designed for newly admitted transfer student to a program within the Faculty of Liberal Arts & Professional Studies at York University. Attend online to learn more about your next steps in the application process, accepting your offer, transfer credit, course enrolment, and student services. There will also be a chance to ask your questions in our live Q+A session after the presentation.\nThis session is brought to you in collaboration with Student Recruitment, LA&PS Advising and the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-Time Students (ACMAPS).\nRegistration link: https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_ynFx5og4Qk64yVUscBUFjw ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_ynFx5og4Qk64yVUscBUFjw )\n
