SUMMARY:Classrooms to Careers: Dialogue on Disability Disclosure in the Workplace
DESCRIPTION:This webinar is part of the Career Centre’s week-long webinar series Classrooms to Careers for Students with Disabilities ( http://careers.yorku.ca/classrooms-to-careers ).\nDo you have questions regarding whether or not you should disclose your disability to an employer? If you decide to disclose your disability, do you wonder when and how you should do it? In this webinar you will get tips and suggestions regarding timing and method(s) of disclosure and have the opportunity to discuss your questions and concerns regarding disclosure at the workplace.\nRegistration through Experience York ( http://careers.yorku.ca/experienceyork ) is required. If you require accessibility needs to access this webinar, please contact the Career Centre as soon as possible so we can assist you with accessing this webinar. Email us at career@yorku.ca\nIn partnership with Student Accessibility Services.\n
