SUMMARY:Keele Campus 20-Minute Cleanup
DESCRIPTION:York University has ambitious plans to become one of the most sustainable universities in Canada. Achieving this goal requires members of the York community to uphold their shared responsibility to support sustainability actions and initiatives on our campuses. This Earth Month, do your part by participating in a 20-minute clean-up to beautify our campuses, reduce land and water pollution, and protect biodiversity.\nREGISTER HERE: https://bit.ly/3ZkCkbe ( https://bit.ly/3ZkCkbe )\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/keele-campus-20-minute-cleanup/
