SUMMARY:LA&PS Exam Jam
DESCRIPTION:Get Your LA&PS Exam Jam On! \nFeeling stressed out? 😧 On April 5th from 11 – 4pm, LA&PS Colleges invite you to head on over to Founders Assembly Hall (FC152) and get your Exam Jam on!   \nThis fun event will feature a variety of free activities meant to help your mental health, well-being, and academic confidence as you head into exam season. No registration required.  \nSee our full schedule and list of activity rooms below to check out all the ways you can participate!   \n Founders Assembly Hall – FC152 \n\n\n\n11:00am – 4:00pm \nMini Canvas Painting  \n\n\nBalloon Animal Making  \n\n\nStress Ball Making  \n\n\nColouring Tables – LA&PS Peer Mentor Program & The Centre  \n\n\nFriendship Bracelet Making  \n\n\nButton Making  \n\n\nTake Love, Leave Love – LA&PS Peer Mentor Program  \n\n\nJournaling Table – Her Campus  \n\n\nCampus Resource Tables – LA&PS International, LA&PS Peer Mentor Program, Writing Centre, PASS and SNACK, Athletics & Recreation, Student Counselling, Health& Wellbeing  \n\n\nLA&PS Exam Jam Raffle – participate for a chance to win a free York hoodie!  \n\n\nFree snacks! \n\n\n\nMcLaughlin Senior Common Room – MC140 \n\n\n\n1:00pm – 2:00pm  \nDe-stress Yoga Session – Athletics & Recreation  \n\n\n2:30pm – 3:30pm  \nMindfulness Meditation Session – Student Counselling, Health & Wellbeing  \n\n\n\n Founders Junior Common Room – FC024E \n\n\n\n11:00am – 12:00pm \nQuiet Study Room   \n\n\n12:00pm – 1:00pm  \nTherapy Dogs – St. John’s Ambulance  \n\n\n1:00pm – 4:00pm  \nQuiet Study Room  \n\n\n\n Founders Dining Hall – FC015A \n\n\n\n11:00am – 12:00pm  \nStudy Room  \n\n\n12:00 – 1:00pm \nAcademic Success Workshop – LA&PS Peer Mentor Program  \n\n\n1:00pm – 3:00pm \nStudy Room  \n\n\n3:00pm – 4:00pm  \nAcademic Success Workshop – LA&PS Peer Mentor Program \n\n\n\n Arthur Haberman Room – FC023 \n\n\n\n11:00am – 4:00pm  \nDrop-in Writing Review – Writing Centre  \n\n\n\nFounders Computer Lab – FC034 \n\n\n\n11:00am – 4:00pm  \nPASS and SNACK Exam Review Sessions \n\n\n\n
