SUMMARY:Canadian Universities Alumni Networking Reception
DESCRIPTION:Get together with other alumni in London, UK!\nYork University is pleased to sponsor the 4th Canadian Universities Alumni Networking Reception hosted by the Canada UK Chamber of Commerce. Continuing the success of the first three Canadian university alumni mixers, a fourth is being held at the Royal Over-Seas League in London.\nBringing together alumni from multiple Canadian universities, the event offers a unique opportunity for networking between friends both old and new. Complimentary tickets are limited and are available to York alumni on a first come, first served basis.\nEvent Details:\nDate: April 20, 2023\nTime: 6:30 – 9 p.m.\nLocation: Royal Over-Seas League, Over-Seas House, Park Place, St James’s Street, London, SW1A 1LR  \n
