SUMMARY:Sustainability and Climate Action Conference
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Sustainability & Climate Action Conference hosted by Many Green Hands YU on March 31st (4 P.M. to 6:30 P.M.) in CLH B. Opportunities include networking with inspiring members of the York University community and learning about the many ways you can get involved in environmental volunteering, leadership and career building. We hope to spark interesting conversations about taking climate action in our community! Register here: https://MGHYUsustainabilityconference.eventbrite.com.\n\nGuest Speakers:\n\n\nMike Layton –  Chief Sustainability Office, York University\nNicole Arsenault – Sustainability Program Director, York University\nLauren Castelino – Co-Executive Director, Regenesis; Founder, Green Career Centre; YorkU Alum\nArt McDonald – Fitness & Wellbeing Manager, York University\nSayeh Dastgheib-Beheshti – Faculty of EUC PhD Candidate, York University\n\n\n\nTitle: Sustainability & Climate Action Conference\nDate; March 31, 2023\nTime; 4 P.M. to 6:30 P.M.\nLocation; Curtis Lecture Hall B\nURL/hyperlink to more information: https://MGHYUsustainabilityconference.eventbrite.com\n\n
