SUMMARY:Lecture by Dr. Nick Ogden (PHAC) on Modelling Public Health Decisions for Emerging Infectious Diseases
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\n\nPlease join us for an insightful talk on “Modelling for Public Health Decisions in Response to Emerging Infectious Diseases” by Dr. Nick Ogden (PHAC) and moderated by Dr. Huaiping Zhu (York University, OMNI-RÉUNIS) and opening remarks by Dr. Jennifer Steeves (Associate Vice-President, Research, York University). This event will take place on Thursday, March 16, from 11:00-12:15 EST as part of the Distinguished Lecture Series, OMNI-RÉUNIS.\nTo register, follow the link below: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJElduihrj4pG90j4WSUNy4KpmtfYyOPVHIh  ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJElduihrj4pG90j4WSUNy4KpmtfYyOPVHIh )\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/lecture-by-dr-nick-ogden-phac-on-modelling-public-health-decisions-for-emerging-infectious-diseases/
