SUMMARY:York University Jazz Festival: April 3-5, 2023
DESCRIPTION:The York University Jazz Festival, running April 3-5, showcases rising young talent from York University’s Department of Music.\nMONDAY APRIL 3\n7:30 -8:00 PM  – Small Ensembles   | Directed by Roy Patterson ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/roy-patterson/ )\n8:15 – 8:45 PM  – Small Ensembles  | Directed by Anthony Michelli ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/anthony-michelli/ )\n9:00 – 9:30 PM  – Small Ensembles  | Directed by Kelly Jefferson ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/kelly-jefferson/ )\n9:30 – 10:00 PM  – Small Ensembles  | Directed by Al Henderson ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/al-henderson/ )\nTUESDAY APRIL 4\n7:30- 8:00 PM  – Small Ensembles  | directed by Lorne Lofsky ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/lorne-lofsky/ )\n8:15 -8:45 PM  – Small Ensembles  | directed by Kevin Turcotte ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/kevin-turcotte/ )\n9:00 -9:30 PM  – Small Ensembles   | directed by Noam Lemish ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/noam-lemish/ )\nWEDNESDAY APRIL 5\n8:15 – 9:15 PM  – Jazz Orchestra |Directed by Mike Cadó ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/mike-cado/ )\n \nFREE \nLOCATION: Martin Family Lounge ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/martin-family-lounge/ ) (219 Accolade East Building)\n
