SUMMARY:Dance Nation
DESCRIPTION:Somewhere in America, an army of pre-teen competitive dancers plots to take over the world. And if their new routine is good enough, they’ll claw their way to the top at Nationals in Tampa Bay. A play about ambition, growing up, and how to find our souls in the heat of it all.\nClick HERE ( https://docs.google.com/document/d/1CdGgoM6QwhW1OB-HiNjLtMZJRJJ2LVvBtjlsq69ZRos/edit ) for the Dance Nation Access Guide\nBOX OFFICE INFORMATION\nPreview Tickets (March 25 & 26): $8.00\nRegular Tickets:$17.00\nOnline advance ticket purchasing highly recommended.\nPurchase tickets HERE ( https://secure1.tixhub.com/yorku/online/index.asp )\nLength of Performance: 1 hour & 45 minutes\nVENUE\nSandra Faire & Ivan Fecan Theatre\nAccolade East, York University\nPERFORMANCE SCHEDULE\nSaturday March 25 – 7:30pm (Preview)\nSunday March 26 – 7:30pm (Preview)\nTuesday March 28 – 7:30pm (Opening)\nWednesday March 29 – 1pm & 7:30pm\nThursday March 30 – 7:30pm\nFriday March 31 – 1pm (Relaxed Performance)\nFriday March 31 – 7:30pm\nSaturday April 1 – 2pm (Closing)\n
