SUMMARY:Department of English presents Dr. Derek Beaulieu
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday, March 8 from 11:30-\n12:30pm\nDr. Derek Beaulieu is the author of twenty-six books of poetry, conceptual fiction, critical writing, as well as over 200 chapbooks and 6 edited volumes. He is also Director of Literary Arts at the Banff Centre for Arts and Creativity.\nJoin us via Zoom for a reading and talk on his recently launched (mixed media) poetry book Surface Tension (Coach House Books, 2022).\nPlease email Course Director Suzanne Zelazo for Zoom link suzannezelazo@gmail.com\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/department-of-english-presents-dr-derek-beaulieu/
