SUMMARY:Gender Gimmick
DESCRIPTION:Gender Gimmick is a group exhibition featuring work that explores wrestling through the lens of drag and gender performance. Emily and Amir explore professional wrestling’s tendency to push masculinity and femininity to their extremes and create character’s to guide their journey into identity and performance.\nSpecial Projects Gallery ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/special-projects-gallery/ )\nMarch 20 – 25\nGallery Hours: 9:00 AM – 4:00 PM\nReception: Wed, March 22 (1-4PM)\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/gender-gimmick/
