SUMMARY:York University President’s Reception in NYC
DESCRIPTION:York is back in New York!\nWe’re thrilled to be visiting the Big Apple in just a few weeks and we hope you can join us for an alumni reception while we’re there.\nAttendees will have a chance to meet and hear from York University President and Vice-Chancellor Rhonda Lenton, connect with fellow alumni and learn more about how York is helping to fulfill the Sustainable Development Goals of the United Nations.\nYou’ll also have a chance to hear from some of York’s leading researchers, who will be in town for the UN 2023 Water Conference, taking place March 22-24.\nThis is a great opportunity to reconnect with your alma mater and expand your professional and personal network in New York by making connections and building relationships with those in your field.\nTickets are free but registration is required. Dress code is business casual attire. Hors d’oeuvres and refreshments will be served.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/new-york-presidents-reception/
ORGANIZER;CN=York Alumni Engagement:MAILTO:alumnievents@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni,Regional Alumni Events
LOCATION:105 W 28th St. 2nd Floor, New York, NY 10001, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/NYReception-Social.jpg
END:VEVENT
