SUMMARY:York University & The Canadian Black Chamber of Commerce MOU Signing
DESCRIPTION:President Rhonda L. Lenton & Dr. Jamila Aman, Executive Director, The Canadian Black Chamber of Commerce cordially invite you to an event to celebrate the official signing of a memorandum of understanding recognizing the collaboration between York University and The Canadian Black Chamber of Commerce.\nEvent Details:\nMonday, March 13 at 10:00 a.m. inside of the Tribute Communities Recital Hall.\nAccolade East Building ( https://www.google.com/maps/dir/43.8331566,-79.3240221/Accolade+East+Bldg,+83+York+Blvd,+North+York,+ON+M3J+2S5/@43.8098784,-79.5641322,11z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m9!4m8!1m1!4e1!1m5!1m1!1s0x882b2e24bf73dcab:0xd9125a796619a45!2m2!1d-79.4997392!2d43.7728354 )\n83 York Blvd, North York, ON, M3J 2S5\nIf you plan to attend, please submit your RSVP by Monday, March 6:\ngo.yorku.ca/yorkuandcbccmou  ( https://go.yorku.ca/yorkuandcbccmou )\nThe official signing will be followed by a panel discussion along with networking and refreshments.\n
URL:http://go.yorku.ca/yorkuandcbccmou
LOCATION:Accolade East Building, Tribute Communities Recital Hall @ 83 York Boulevard, Toronto
