SUMMARY:YU Got This! Academic Tips & Tools for End of Term
DESCRIPTION:It’s already March!\nJoin this unique workshop hosted by the YorkU Learning Commons ( https://learningcommons.yorku.ca/ ) to help you tackle your final assignments, papers, tests and exams. We’ll answer key questions like –\n\nHow can I create an effective study plan?\nHow do I find good research sources?\nHow can I tackle essay and multiple choice exams?\n\nYou’ll learn tips and strategies to help you manage your end-of-term workload more effectively and with much less stress. And, you’ll gain access to resources on Research ( https://www.library.yorku.ca/web/ ), Writing ( https://writing-centre.writ.laps.yorku.ca/ ), Numeracy ( https://www.yorku.ca/laps/snack/ ), Language ( https://eslolc.laps.yorku.ca/ ), and Learning Skills ( https://www.yorku.ca/scld/learning-skills/ ) all in one great workshop!\nThe YU Got This! workshop is being hosted as part of Procrastination Awareness Week (PAW). Learn more and register: www.yorku.ca/scld/events/paw ( https://www.yorku.ca/scld/events/paw/ )\nDon’t let procrastination get its claws in you! Learn more at Procrastination Awareness Week ( https://events.zoom.us/ev/ApNs2gDe7WUnoxtSCcviRJ87w3GmjqzM-RlHHOBT_Y4P16fkKhsw~AggLXsr32QYFjq8BlYLZ5I06Dg )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/yu-got-this-academic-tips-tools-for-end-of-term-4/
