SUMMARY:OMNI-RÉUNIS Seminar-Introducing Sampy: A New Python Library for Agent-based Modeling in the Epidemiology of Zoonotic Diseases
DESCRIPTION:Join us on March 9, 2023, from 11 am-12 pm EST, for our Super Spreader Seminar Series talk with Dr. Francois Viard on Introducing Sampy: A New Python Library for Agent-based Modeling in the Epidemiology of Zoonotic Diseases.\nThis event will explore how to use SamPy, a new Python library that makes it possible to build large-scale agent-based models on desktop computers.\nTo register, click on the link below: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUqduqtrTgoEtW8Up2bx6PmR_g2_iIgLmOp  ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUqduqtrTgoEtW8Up2bx6PmR_g2_iIgLmOp )\n
