SUMMARY:Teaching and Learning Videos: call for talent
DESCRIPTION:Want to appear in upcoming York University social media marketing campaigns?\nYork University’s team at the Office of the AVP Teaching & Learning (AVP, T&L) is looking for student and instructor models to appear in videos being filmed in the spring of 2023 at Keele Campus. The videos are related to technology-enhanced teaching and learning practices, specifically HyFlex formats.\nYou DO NOT need to have taught or taken a HyFlex course in order to participate, as response prompts will be provided. You will be able to offer your expertise in the more general field of technology enhanced teaching and learning and help to build awareness and cultivate interest in academic innovation taking place at York!\nPlease note, compensation in the form of a $25 bookstore gift certificate and refreshments on-site will be provided to those who participate.\nFilming will take place on Wednesday March 15th and you’ll be given a 90-minute window to attend between the hours of 10am-1pm.\nRegistration required: https://forms.office.com/r/aPQgd9RjCD ( https://forms.office.com/r/aPQgd9RjCD )\n
