SUMMARY:OMNI-RÉUNIS Super-Spreader Seminar Series talk with Dr. Kamal Acharya
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Super Spreader Seminar Series: Seminar 7 on Thursday, February 16, 2023, from 11:00-12:00 EST.\nSSSS Seminar 7 is about evaluating diagnostic tests, particularly the performance characteristics of diagnostic tests with reference to paratuberculosis diagnosis. The presenter for this seminar is Dr. Kamal Acharya, a veterinary epidemiologist.\nLink to register: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUqduqtrTgoEtW8Up2bx6PmR_g2_iIgLmOp  ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUqduqtrTgoEtW8Up2bx6PmR_g2_iIgLmOp )\n
