SUMMARY:Global Health Students’ Association EDI Panel
DESCRIPTION:The Global Health Students’ Association is hosting a virtual EDI panel event to celebrate Black History Month! We hope you will join us to engage in open and informal conversations with Global Health professionals (and professionals in related fields) about equity, diversity, and inclusion (EDI), past successes, and future efforts to decolonize Global Health.\nEmail york.ghsa@gmail.com ( mailto:york.ghsa@gmail.com ) to register and for the Zoom link.\n
