DESCRIPTION:Based on our identified gaps and needs, the general aim of this initiative is to strengthen equitable and responsive public health systems that leverage Southern-led responsible AI solutions to improve prevention, preparedness, and response to emerging and re-emerging infectious disease outbreaks.\nFirst session:\nResponsible AI Healthcare Applications for Developing Countries\nDr. Collins N. Udanor\nAssociate Professor of Computer Science (Artificial Intelligence), Department of Computer Science, University of Nigeria Nsukka\nFor more info please visit: https://www.yorku.ca/cifal/ai4pep ( https://www.yorku.ca/cifal/ai4pep )\nwww.ai4pep.org ( http://www.ai4pep.org )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/ai-for-global-health-challenges-and-lessons-leanred-bi-weekly-webinar-series/
