SUMMARY:The Emotionally Intelligent Leader
DESCRIPTION:What does it mean to be a successful leader? Is a caring leader more effective than a dominant leader? Join Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) Peer Leads as we teach students how to empathize appropriately with team members, how to lead a team successfully with respect in diversity and inclusion, and to identify and set goals for students to meet academic expectations.\nThis session is open to all students at York and students who identify as Black are encouraged to attend.\nTo reserve your spot, please complete our registration form ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYodO-prj0iEtUbPkr3hLqFEy9ehkkK_M_a ).\n
