SUMMARY:Nellie Library Pop-up Book Sale
DESCRIPTION:The Nellie Langford Rowell Library is pleased to invite you to our second Pop-up Book Sale. We have a wide range of fiction and nonfiction, including books from the collections of Professors Patricia McDermott, Marlene Kadar, Sheila Cavanaugh, and Kamala Kempadoo.\nAll texts are available at affordable prices, ranging from $0.50 to $2.00 (cash only) and we offer ‘bundled’ prices: the more you buy, the more you save!\nOur first Pop-up Book Sale was a huge success, and we look forward to welcoming many first-time and returning readers!\nEvent info\n
