SUMMARY:Grad Webinar: Learning about Grad School from Current Scholars
DESCRIPTION:This session is a part of Choose Grad York 2023, and is opened to all interested.\nEntering a master’s program or continuing into the PhD presents many considerations for students to think about. We want to help support future students in their decision-making process! Associate Dean Academic, Cheryl van Daalen-Smith, will be speaking with Eleni Marino, Ramesh Venkatesaperumal, & Zahra Nader to learn more about their individual experiences as current scholars at York. The panelists will bring rich perspectives to future students grappled with various questions and share resources available to graduate students in the Faculty of Graduate Studies\nThis is a free event, however registration is required.\nRSVP | https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_rvtL0VlzRJuvK0aeepJ9wA ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_rvtL0VlzRJuvK0aeepJ9wA )\nHave a question? Email us at fgsnews@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/learn-from-grad-scholars-23/
