SUMMARY:Grad Webinar: Navigating Your Degree with Dean Loebel
DESCRIPTION:This session is a part of Choose Grad York 2023, and is opened to all interested.\nIn this webinar, our Dean and AVP Graduate (Thomas Loebel) will be speaking on the role of the student in a graduate degree, degree types and structures in the different disciplines, forming your individualised research ideas, and supports for personal and research development.\nThis is a free event, however registration is required.\nRSVP | https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_CBa1AZMFTA-VZBNnpWgRnQ ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_CBa1AZMFTA-VZBNnpWgRnQ )\nHave a question? Email us at fgsnews@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n \n
