SUMMARY:Mid-Career Conversations: Black Excellence and Entrepreneurship
DESCRIPTION:A virtual event series, Mid-Career Conversations were created for alumni to connect and hear the stories and experiences of other Mid-Career professionals.\nEach event features a Mid-career alumni storyteller sharing their own journey and highlights from their career.\nJoin Nadine Spencer (BA ’94, BA’04) Chief Marketing Officer of BrandEQ Group. on Feb. 16 at 12pm.\nIn this session Nadine will share:\n\nHer experience starting and growing a business.\nHer work with the Black Business and Professional Association.\nFighting discrimination in the professional/entrepreneurial arena.\nThe 50-30 Challenge – Taking our seat at the table.\n\n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/mid-career-conversations-black-excellence-and-entrepreneurship/
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni
