SUMMARY:Information Session Night – Master of Human Resource Management Program
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for our Winter Info Session presenting our unique Executive style MHRM program at York University’s School of HRM:\nWhen: Thursday March 2, 2023\nTime: 6:15-7:30PM\nWhere: Via Zoom. Zoom details will be provided prior to session date to all those who have RSVP’d\nBy attending this session, you will learn how you can earn a Master’s degree in HRM while working, as well as:\n\nUnderstand how pursuing this graduate program may fit with your career at the moment\nLearn how obtaining this degree may further enhance your future career options\nAttendees will have a chance to engage in a Q&A session both with the Graduate Program Director and Graduate Program Administrator and have any specific academic/application related questions answered\n\nPlease RSVP HERE ( https://shrm.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=59423 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/information-session-night-master-of-human-resource-management-program/
