SUMMARY:A Black Student’s Guide for Career Success
DESCRIPTION:The ‘Celebrate While We Educate’ event supported by York University’s Student Community & Leadership Development (SCLD) for Black History Month presents BSIP and BSMPs collaboration in hosting a discussion panel segment on the theme of  “A Black Students Guide for Career Success.”  The panel discussion will revolve around the topics PURPOSE + RESILIENCE, NEGOTIATING COMPENSATION + BENEFITS and MENTORSHIP + NETWORKING exploring panel members’ experiences and expertise in hopes for the audience to gain insightful additions for career success in their various professions.\nStudent Registration link – https://tinyurl.com/BHMCelebrate\n
