SUMMARY:Markham Community Skate Day
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Markham Civic Centre Outdoor Ice Rink ( https://www.markham.ca/wps/portal/home/recreation/programs/skating-and-hockey ) on Saturday, February 11, from 1 p.m. to 3 p.m. for a fun-filled day of skating, hot chocolate and more at the annual Markham Community Skate Day, presented by York University.\nYork University President Rhonda Lenton will be in attendance as well as a number of faculty, staff, community partners and Markham residents. You’ll have an opportunity to connect with fellow community members and learn more about York’s new Markham Campus ( https://www.yorku.ca/markham/ ) and its innovative programs.\nNo skates? No problem. Skates are available to rent ( https://www.markhamskaterentals.com/ ).\n
