SUMMARY:Nellie Library Annual Undergraduate Student Conference & Poetry Slam: Final Call for Projects
DESCRIPTION:The Nellie Langford Rowell Library ( https://www.yorku.ca/laps/nellie-library/ ) is excited to announce our Third Annual Nellie Library Undergraduate Student Conference & Poetry Slam! The Nellie looks forward to showcasing the amazing work being produced by York University’s strong, committed, and creative students!\nThe Conference is open to third- and fourth-year undergraduate students and the Poetry Slam is open to all undergraduate students. All presentations will engage with feminist, anti-racist, intersectional, interdisciplinary and/or decolonizing approaches. We encourage multi-media presentations, including, but not limited to written papers, posters, poetic presentations, storytelling, and visual projects.\nWe are seeking presenters and volunteers to moderate the panels. We look forward to hearing from you!\nThe Nellie Team\n(Brenda, Senzile, Srin, Shri, Smriti, Zi)\nRegistration\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/nellie-library-annual-undergraduate-student-conference-poetry-slam-first-call-for-projects/
