SUMMARY:York U President’s Reception in Singapore
DESCRIPTION:Asia-Pacific-based alumni are invited to attend the York U President’s Reception in Singapore.\nThis is your opportunity to connect with York alumni in your area, strengthen your social and professional networks, reminisce about your time at York and hear the latest news from your alma mater.\nEvent Details:\nDate: Thursday Feb. 23, 2023Time: 7-9:30pmLocation: Fairmont Singapore, 80 Bras Basah Road, Singapore, 189560\nTickets are free but registration is required.\nRegister here. ( https://give.yorku.ca/s/1853/adv/form.aspx?sid=1853&gid=2&pgid=923&cid=1957 )\n \n
