SUMMARY:Winter Career Fair 2023
DESCRIPTION:Meet Employers who are looking to hire York U students for a variety of opportunities,including part-time, summer, internship, and full-time positions after graduation.\nVisit our webpage to learn more about the participating organizations:: https://careers.yorku.ca/students-and-new-grads/services-events/career-fairs. ( https://careers.yorku.ca/students-and-new-grads/services-events/career-fairs. )\nHow to Prepare\nPrioritize employers you want to target\n– Check out the attendee list\n– Make a check list of the employers you are interested to talk to and prepare for an informational interview\n– Prepare thoughtful and focused questions to show genuine interest in the organization\nGet ready for the Career Fair:https://careers.yorku.ca/students-and-new-grads/services-events/career-fairs/tips ( https://careers.yorku.ca/students-and-new-grads/services-events/career-fairs/tips )\nRegister for our upcoming “Preparing for Career Fair Success” workshops.\n
URL:https://careers.yorku.ca/students-and-new-grads/services-events/career-fairs.
ORGANIZER;CN=Career Centre:MAILTO:career@yorku.ca
