SUMMARY:EGY WI23 – PhD in Global Health
DESCRIPTION:Join the inaugural doctoral program in Global Health, with our first cohort starting in September 2024! The Doctoral Program in the School of Global Health will prepare future leaders in research, practice, and policy-related scholarly pursuits, who contribute to transformational change in global health. The program will cultivate critical and solutions-focused inquiry, enabling students to engage in interdisciplinary original research that provides a foundation for advancing the next generation of leadership needed to address the global health challenges of the 21st century.\nLearn more about a PhD in Global Health by joining this virtual session.\nRegister today: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJMld-CsrzIiHtyp9GaeAlarP_JYgxKYr94- ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJMld-CsrzIiHtyp9GaeAlarP_JYgxKYr94- )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/egy-wi23-global-health/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
