SUMMARY:WORKSHOP 7: WHAT’S THIS?
DESCRIPTION:Name that this!\nThat this.\nThat this there. Name that this.\nBut to which this are you referring?\nExactly my point.\nWhich this?\nWait whuuut?\nThis this here.\nWait – this is going nowhere.\nThis is a vague reference. Let’s learn how to avoid “this,” *lol*, in this week’s Grammar On!\nNo RSVPs. Just click to join!\nJoin Zoom meeting\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/workshop-7-whats-this/
ORGANIZER;CN=Writing Centre:MAILTO:jroberts@yorku.ca, dbaus@yorku.ca, lapswrit@yorku.ca
