SUMMARY:Establishing Effective Boundaries for Leaders
DESCRIPTION:Interested in learning about what it takes to be a powerful leader? Join Black Excellence at York University (BE YU) leads as we highlight the fundamental skills and models utilized by leaders, and how they work in practice. Students will learn and build on tools to further their leadership capacity and implement them on a daily basis. \nTo reserve your spot, please complete our registration form ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJ0kce-oqTkpGdUGOA6CYpTFBBQGyLkkkSP9 ).\n
