SUMMARY:York Circle Lecture Series: Coping in Silence: COVID’s Impact on Marginalized Communities
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\nPlease join us on Sunday, Jan. 29, 2023 at 10am ET for part two of our York Circle lecture series, with host and moderator Jennifer Steeves, associate vice-president research (AVPR), as some of York’s leading faculty members present on a wide variety of interesting topics related to this year’s theme – The Pandemic: COVID’s impact on Canada’s health care system.\nCoping in Silence: COVID’s Impact on Marginalized Communities\nDate: Sunday Jan. 29, 2023\nTime: 10am ET\nRegister here\n\n\n\n\n\n
