SUMMARY:Sexual Health Foundations
DESCRIPTION:Many of us may have awkward memories of sex-ed classes in high school or our parents trying to sit us down and give us “the talk”. But knowing about sexual health, consent and safe sex can help keep yourself and others safe regardless of whether you are engaging in sexual activity or not.\nHealth Ed peers are here to provide you with all the 101 knowledge you may need about safer sex, sexually transmitted diseases, infections, or mitigating the risk of pregnancy. This workshop is open and welcoming to all levels of knowledge and experience.\nTo reserve your spot, please complete our registration form.\nBefore attending the presentation:\n\nLog into your Zoom account (with your Passport York credentials) prior to clicking the meeting link.\nFill out our anonymous Pre-Test Form (it takes less than 1 minute to complete). This form helps us ensure our presentation meets the needs of the student body.\n\n \n
