SUMMARY:Writing Workshop Series for Graduate Students
DESCRIPTION:Facilitated by Dr. Hallie Wells and Dr. Karīna Vasiļevska-Das, these online workshops are designed to help you develop and refine a writing practice and gain concrete techniques to embolden your writing. The sessions follow a trajectory from the beginning of the writing process (developing and refining your writing practice) through to the final stages of revising and submitting. The format of the workshop is interactive and collaborative, as we allocate time for trying out specific activities as well as for discussion and sharing with other participants.\nConsistent participation is encouraged, but you are also welcome to choose the sessions that most speak to you.\nFor additional details on each session, please visit: https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/gpps-opportunity/writing-workshop-series-for-graduate-students/ ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/gpps-opportunity/writing-workshop-series-for-graduate-students/ )\nPlease click here to register. ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJ0pdeCrqD0vGdUmx7ss-bsSPZfFrqgvijIb )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/writing-workshop-series-for-graduate-students-2/
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies
