SUMMARY:Canada-in-Asia Conference (CIAC)
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\nYork is proud to be a sponsor of the inaugural Canada-in-Asia Conference (CIAC).Taking place in Singapore in February and organized by the Asia Pacific Foundation of Canada and Universities Canada, CIAC will bring together Asia-based Canadian alumni and other affiliated individuals to connect and collaborate.You’re invited to attend the conference and enjoy networking opportunities, panel discussions and the chance to connect with the Canadian alumni community in Asia.\nCanada-in-Asia Conference (CIAC)Date: Feb. 21-23, 2023Location: Fairmont Singapore’s Raffles City Convention CentrePaid Registration: Space is limited. Please register using code ALUMNI350 for the alumni discount.\nRegister here ( https://www.canada-in-asia.ca/ )\n\n\n\n
