SUMMARY:Consent Action Day: Sexual Body Confidence
DESCRIPTION:Sexual confidence isn’t a look or a sexual technique – it’s about skills in pleasure, consent, and partner communication. Have you ever felt shy about your body? Nervous about connecting on dating apps? Unsure about sexual anatomy? This workshop will have tips for building body confidence, unlearning shame, and building more pleasure in your experiences. Join Sex and Pleasure Educator, Luna Matatas to explore skills for dating and solo pleasure – bring your questions!\nTo reserve your spot, please complete our registration form.\n
