SUMMARY:Yoga Session
DESCRIPTION:Join our Health Ed peers as they guide you through a yoga flow that will deepen your mind-body connection. Not only will it be an effective exercise routine, but it will also incorporate soulful wisdom to help guide you in coping with life stressors. This Vinyasa styled class combines the practice of asanas (yoga poses), pranayama (breathwork), and meditation to create a well-rounded yoga practice. It aims to combine traditional style with modern style yoga techniques which will empower students with the ability to transfer the values they learn on the mat into their daily lives off the mat.\nTo reserve your spot, please complete our registration form.\n
