SUMMARY:Youth-led Online Grief Event
DESCRIPTION:Exploring the diversity in which youth experience grief & spotlighting supports available.\nIn partnership with Power Project Global and the Faculty of Health,\nUnsinkable is producing a youth-led mental health event that\nharnesses the power of story to ignite conversations around the\nspectrum of grief.\nThe pandemic has forced our youth to feel loss in many diverse\nways. With loss, comes grief and the increased need for support\nthrough these healing conversations.\nNow, this is NOT your typical boring webinar. We are creating\na fun and interactive experience to show youth they are not\nalone and encourage them to join the conversation.\nRegister today at:\nhttps://www.eventbrite.ca/e/2023-grief-event-tickets-441168004377 ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/2023-grief-event-tickets-441168004377 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/youth-led-online-grief-event/
