SUMMARY:Webinar: Coping with Stress as a Student
DESCRIPTION:Well-being Week: Caring for your mental health!\nJoin FGS as we discuss coping with stress as a student. This virtual webinar is free and open to ALL students, postdocs, staff, faculty and alumni of York University.\nThe session will allow participants to share barriers to wellness while in PSE and also share what helps. Facilitator(s) will present some skills/suggestions, but the core of the session will be more centred around “wisdom harvesting” from one another, hopefully tying into the theme also around connection.\nRegistration is free | https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJIpfuysqDIvH9UrK-8yW80H-Cso6eMcFqaH ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJIpfuysqDIvH9UrK-8yW80H-Cso6eMcFqaH )\n
