SUMMARY:EGY WI23 – Schulich School of Business Specialized Masters Programs
DESCRIPTION:The Schulich School of Business is transforming the higher education experience.\nFinding a school that’s the right fit is important.\nSkills, aptitude, knowledge, personality – these qualities and much more make you unique. At Schulich, we respect that uniqueness.\nOur programs are designed to support your academic aspirations, your lifestyle, and your long-term goals. With responsive, innovative degrees, cutting-edge curriculum and flexible study options, we’re here to partner with you in realizing your full potential.\nJoin our session ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJ0of-Gsqj4vHtJyZMMi-IpdaCqmdaLWL8yy ) to learn more about our Specialized Masters Programs:\nAccounting  ( https://schulich.yorku.ca/programs/macc/ )\nArtificial Intelligence  ( https://schulich.yorku.ca/programs/mmai/ )\nBusiness Analytics  ( https://schulich.yorku.ca/programs/mban/ )\nFinance  ( https://schulich.yorku.ca/programs/mf/ )\nManagement  ( https://schulich.yorku.ca/programs/mmgt/ )\nMarketing  ( https://schulich.yorku.ca/programs/mmkg/ )\nReal Estate & Infrastructure  ( https://schulich.yorku.ca/programs/mrei/ )\nSupply Chain Management  ( https://schulich.yorku.ca/programs/mscm/ )\n
