SUMMARY:EGY WI23 – I Don’t Think I’ll Get In to Graduate School: Now What?
DESCRIPTION:Don’t think that you’ll meet our admission requirements? Applied before, and not received an offer?\nJoin us ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_0B8P2t3lQjK0OLT7e06foQ ) to learn more about our basic requirements for graduate admission, our “unique applicants” category and how we consider extenuating circumstances, common refusal reasons, and upgrading options that are available, if needed.\n
