SUMMARY:Graduate Admissions—Virtual Drop-In Hour
DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join us for a virtual graduate studies office hour! Join us to ask any questions that you might have about York University and our graduate admissions process.\nParticipants are able to ask questions via the chat feature, and a representative will answer each question out loud. Please note that during these sessions we will not be able to answer any questions about Schulich School of Business programs, or Osgoode Law School programs.\nFor all other questions about graduate diplomas, master’s programs, and doctoral degrees, we look forward to having you attend the event. This is a virtual drop-in event. You can join the virtual office hour at any time to ask questions and do not need to remain online for the session’s entire duration.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYsfuCvqzMvHdwB5uPcWg1fuMlBMOXCjt0f )\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nFor any questions, please email us at FGSNEWS@YORKU.CA ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/graduate-admissions-virtual-drop-in-hour-13-881-777-404-344-718-127/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies,Faculty of Graduate Studies (Programs),Glendon Masters in Public &amp; International Affairs,Graduate Diploma in Management,Graduate Diploma in Neuroscience,Graduate Diploma in Professional Accounting,Graduate Program in Art History,Graduate Program in Communication and Culture,Graduate Program in Critical Disability Studies,Graduate Program in Dance,Graduate Program in Design,Graduate Program in Development Studies,Graduate Program in Digital Media,Graduate Program in Disaster &amp; Emergency Management,Graduate Program in Earth &amp; Space Science,Graduate Program in Economics,Graduate Program in English,Graduate Program in Environmental Studies,Graduate Program in Film,Graduate Program in Financial Accountability,Graduate Program in Gender, Feminist and Women's Studies,Graduate Program in Geography,Graduate Program in Health,Graduate Program in History,Graduate Program in Human Resources Management,Graduate Program in Humanities,Graduate Program in Information Systems &amp; Technology,Graduate Program in Interdisciplinary Studies,Graduate Program in Kinesiology and Health Science,Graduate Program in Linguistics &amp; Applied Linguistics,Graduate Program in Management Practice,Graduate Program in Nursing,Graduate Program in Philosophy,Graduate Program in Psychology,Graduate Program in Public Policy, Administration and Law,Graduate Program in Science &amp; Technology Studies,Graduate Program in Social &amp; Political Thought,Graduate Program in Social Anthrolology,Graduate Program in Social Work,Graduate Program in Socio-Legal Studies,Graduate Program in Sociology,Graduate Program in Visual Art
LOCATION:Online (Zoom)
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/office-hours-featured-image.jpg
