SUMMARY:York International • Ontario-Rhône-Alpes (ORA) Student Exchange Information Session
DESCRIPTION:The ORA University Student Exchange Program is a collaborative initiative with 10 institutions in Rhône-Alpes ( https://www.yorku.ca/ouinternational/rhone-alpes-universities/ ) and 12 universities in Ontario. Initiated in 1991, the program exchanges up to 65 full time students from each region in the regular exchange program. Since then 2 more programs have been developed; a Summer Research Program and a Summer Language Program. Click here for more info ( https://www.yorku.ca/ouinternational/ora/ ).\nThe session will consist of a presentation and a Q & A period.\nRegister here\nAfter registering, you will receive a confirmation email containing information about joining the meeting.\n
URL:https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUld-iqrD0pG9av11JudldtYNfkm5akh8IW
ORGANIZER;CN=York International:MAILTO:goglobal@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Glendon International Studies,International,LA&amp;PS Students-International,Students
LOCATION:Live on Zoom @ Zoom
END:VEVENT
