TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Marché d’hiver de Glendon
DESCRIPTION:\nNotre Marché d’hiver du campus Glendon est de retour cette année! Joignez-vous à nous le mardi 6 décembre, de 16 h à 20 h, au manoir Glendon. Venez trouver des idées cadeaux uniques ou vous laisser tenter par divers produits gourmands. Ouvert au public. #GLMarchédHiver\nLe marché d’hiver aura lieu dans le manoir Glendon, l’ancienne demeure d’Edward Rogers Wood, éminent financier et philanthrope torontois du début des années 1900. Le domaine Wood est devenu le campus fondateur de l’Université York en 1959. Venez découvrir notre riche histoire et parcourez notre magnifique campus hivernal situé sur 35 hectares de parcs naturels et de jardins.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/glendons-winter-market-234/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:York University
CLASS:PUBLIC
UID:MEC-8aa71aee354f4cae862cabcf498ae1f6@events.yorku.ca
DTSTART:20221206T210000Z
DTEND:20221207T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20221123T145400Z
CREATED:20221123
LAST-MODIFIED:20221125
PRIORITY:5
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Glendon Campus Marché d’hiver (Winter Market)
DESCRIPTION:\nOur Glendon Campus Marché d’hiver (Winter Market) is back again this year! Join us on Tuesday, December 6, from 4 PM to 8 PM, in Glendon Hall. Come and find unique gift-giving ideas or treat yourself to various gourmet foods and local artisans.\nOpen to the public. Admission is FREE. #GLMarchédHiver\nThe Glendon Campus is located on the former country estate of Edward Rogers Wood, a prominent Toronto financier and philanthropist of the early 1900s. Glendon became the founding campus of York University in 1959. The Marché d’hiver is held in Glendon Hall, the main residence of the Wood family, built in 1924, and the perfect setting for a Winter Market (including a “Gone with the Wind” Instagram-worthy winding staircase!). Take a couple of hours out of your busy schedule to walk our beautiful wintery grounds – located on 85 acres of natural parklands and gardens – and enjoy some festive cheer.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/glendons-winter-market/
CATEGORIES:Glendon
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
