SUMMARY:Strategic Research Plan: Community Chat
DESCRIPTION:The Vice-President Research & Innovation (VPRI) has launched a series of ongoing community consultations regarding the 2023-28 Strategic Research Plan for York University. All York community members are welcome to provide their feedback in-person at these community chats.  Please be reminded that our next community chat will be taking place on Tuesday, Nov. 29 from 11 a.m. to noon in Room 305B Lumbers.\nAll are invited to engage in an unstructured feedback session to discuss the next Strategic Research Plan development and provide input.\nFor more information on upcoming November community chats and the Strategic Research Plan, click here ( https://www.yorku.ca/research/strategic-research-plan-2023-2028/ ).  If you aren’t able to meet in person please share your thoughts via our feedback portal ( https://research.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=11767 ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/strategic-research-plan-community-chat/
CATEGORIES:Research &amp; Innovation
LOCATION:305B Lumbers Building
END:VEVENT
