SUMMARY:Misogynoir and the Impacts in the Workplace
DESCRIPTION:Misogynoir is the discrimination and violence faced by black women and will be examined from a systemic lens focusing on education, employment, the justice system and health care system. Panelists will be providing concrete examples, and ways in which participants can engage in creating safer spaces for black women and meaningfully contributing to changing attitudes, beliefs and policies. \nTo register, email thecentre@yorku.ca ( mailto:thecentre@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/misogynoir-and-the-impacts-in-the-workplace/
