SUMMARY:Glendon Holiday Social
DESCRIPTION:President Rhonda Lenton invites all students, staff, faculty members and course instructors to celebrate the end of the Fall term at York University’s Holiday Social. Join us for cookies, cocoa, cider and other holiday festivities at the Keele and Glendon Campuses as we kick off the holiday season. \nWe will be accepting non-perishable food items for donation at both the Glendon and Keele Campuses. Donations from Glendon will be provided to the North Harvest Food Bank, and donations from Keele will be provided to the York Federation of Students Food Support Centre.\nOn December 6, The Glendon Bookstore will offer a 25 percent discount on all branded ceramic mugs which can be purchased in store. The Bookstore will have cleaning supplies available at the event.\nPlease note, York University strongly recommends wearing a mask in all indoor settings, except when eating or drinking.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/glendon-holiday-social/
CATEGORIES:Colleges,Faculties,Glendon,Students
LOCATION:The East Quad (green space across from Glendon Hall) 
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/HolidaySocial_Eheader-1-1-scaled.jpg
