SUMMARY:Metrolinx  Pop Up Event
DESCRIPTION:Metrolinx is coming to York University on Tuesday, November 29,  from 12 pm to 3 pm at the Vari Hall Rotunda.\nMetrolinx is currently undertaking the largest transportation investment in Ontario’s history, while also operating GO Transit, UP Express and PRESTO. If you are interested in knowing more about who they are, what they do, local projects, and student discounts, feel to come out to speak with the Toronto West Community Engagement team. They are committed to providing you with the information you need to get the answers you desire.\nCan’t make it? Send them an email or give them a call with your questions at TorontoWest@metrolinx.com or 416 202 6911, and they will assist you with the information you need.\nFor information about what they are working on and to stay informed, you can read the latest news on our blog, get engaged, subscribe to the Toronto West Newsletter or follow them on twitter @GOExpansion for updates on their work.\nWe are all looking forward to seeing you at the event!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/metrolinx-pop-up-event/
