DESCRIPTION:We are excited to promote the OBW Student Exchange Program and our partner universities in the beautiful region of Baden-Württemberg in Germany to Ontario students. Students are invited to an information session hosted by Tina Bebensee, OBW Coordinator in Baden-Württemberg, and Agnes Poleszczuk, OBW Coordinator in Ontario. The session will be held on Tuesday, November 15th, from 10:00 to 11:00 am.\nThe session will consist of a presentation of the OBW program and a Q & A period. Please share the following link with your students:\nhttps://uni-konstanz-de.zoom.us/j/91487466528?pwd=TmlDQy8vb0dUcW9FZHFZTTRJWmk2dz09\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/obw-student-exchange-program-info-session/
