SUMMARY:The Ecology of Allyship (Part 2)
DESCRIPTION:In this follow up to the session Orienting Yourself to Allyship, this workshop explores the multiple roles people can play in building solidarity across lines of difference. It offers examples of solidarity movements, and personal reflections on how to find your own stake in movements.\nPlease note, this is not an introductory or beginners’ workshop. You must attend Allyship Part 1 to join this session or have previous organizing experience across lines of shared identities.\nNov. 24, 1 to 2 p.m.\nRegister here:  https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=543 ( https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=543 )\n \n \n \n \n
