SUMMARY:Creating Your Gender Journey: Using art and story to unpack trans experiences
DESCRIPTION:Come hang out, meet other trans folx and explore gender through interactive art and writing-based activities. No artistic ability or writing skills are required. We’ll talk about coming out, dysphoria, identifying next steps and creating a plan, medical transition and more.\nThis in-person event is facilitated by Jay Jonah, a trans-masculine social worker who specializes in supporting trans and non-binary folx.\nRegistration is required. To reserve your spot, please email thecentre@yorku.ca.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/creating-your-gender-journey-using-art-and-story-to-unpack-trans-experiences/
