SUMMARY:Why Do We Need More Languages–The Multimedia Language Centre and ESL Open Learning Centre Open Door Event
DESCRIPTION:The Multimedia Language Centre (MLC) and the ESL Open Learning Centre (OLC) are inviting you to join us for the interactive Open Doors event.\nEvent: Why Do We Need More Languages? Learning about Global Languages and Cultures – The MLC and ESL OLC Open Doors Event (opening ceremony)\nTime and Date: 1:00 – 2:20 pm, November 1st\nLocation: Ross South S117 (MLC)\nDescription: Come and join us to see the posters on global languages and cultures, discuss opportunities and challenges of learning languages, engage in interactive activities, and converse with other multilingual students.\nThe interactive poster exhibition runs from November 1st to November 15th. Students are welcome to visit the MLC during these two weeks.\nWe look forward to welcoming York University students!\n
