SUMMARY:Ottawa Alumni Reception
DESCRIPTION:President and Vice-Chancellor, Dr. Rhonda L. Lenton is hosting the Ottawa alumni reception on Wednesday Nov. 2, 2022.\nReconnect with fellow alumni in the region, enjoy passed appetizers and a complimentary drink and hear the latest news from your alma mater.\nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday, November 2, 2022\nTime: 6-8pm\nLocation: Quebec Suite, Fairmont Château Laurier, 1 Rideau Street, Ottawa, ON K1N 8S7\nRSVP by Tuesday November 1, 2022. Tickets are complimentary, and registration is required.\nRegister ( https://give.yorku.ca/s/1853/adv/form.aspx?sid=1853&gid=2&pgid=887&cid=1898 )\n
