SUMMARY:Lassonde School of Engineering 10th Anniversary Alumni Reception
DESCRIPTION:Lassonde School of Engineering alumni can join Dean Jane Goodyer to celebrate science and engineering at York, and the first 10 years of Lassonde as a school.\nCome and enjoy great conversation, interactive food experiences, and complimentary drinks. Reconnect and reminisce with fellow alumni, hear the latest about your school, and experience Toronto’s historic Roundhouse. Previously a steam locomotive repair facility, the Roundhouse is now home to Steam Whistle, one of Canada’s most beloved independent brewers and beautifully engineered celebration spaces.\nDetails\nDate: Tuesday, November 1, 2022 | 6pm ET\nLocation: Steam Whistle – The Roundhouse, 255 Bremner Blvd, Toronto, ON  M5V 3M9\nRSVP by Tuesday, October 31.  Tickets are complimentary, and registration is required as space is limited.\n
