DESCRIPTION:\nYork U alumni in Vancouver are invited to attend the Vancouver alumni mixer. \n\nThis is an opportunity to strengthen your social and professional network, reminisce about your time at York and hear the latest news from your alma mater.\n\n\n \n\n\nDate/Time: Tues Nov 22nd 2022 | 6-8pm PT\n\n\nLocation: Cactus Club Coal Harbour, Private Dining Room\n\n\nAddress: 1085 Canada Pl, Vancouver, BC V6C 3E1\n\n\n \n\n\nTickets are free but registration is required. Guests will enjoy their first drink on us, unlimited soft drinks and hors d’oeuvres throughout the evening. We hope to see you there!\n\n\n \n\n\nFor any questions, please contact Ellie Coult, Manager, Regional Alumni Programs at ecoult@yorku.ca.\n\n\nRegister ( https://give.yorku.ca/s/1853/adv/form.aspx?sid=1853&gid=2&pgid=892&cid=1906 )\n
