SUMMARY:Beast A La Mode
DESCRIPTION:York University Department of Dance faculty member Syreeta Hector will present new choreography entitled Beast A la Mode at the Fleck Dance Theatre, Harbourfront Centre between Nov 2-5th as part of the ProArteDance Fall Season.\nBeast A La Mode by Syreeta Hector ( http://syreetahector.com ) examines the powerful influence the environment has over identity, aspects of ourselves that are revealed or concealed depending on different locales and social context. Beast A La Mode investigates the uneasy contradictions of character we develop in order to survive everyday life, and highlights our essential need to compete depending on circumstance. Beast A La Mode was created through the Creative Encounters Program with ProArteDanza\nThis piece was originally workshopped through the Creative Encounters Residency Program, and will premiere in the ProArte fall season at the Fleck Dance Theatre Harbourfront Centre from November 2nd- November 5th.\nLocation: Harbourfront Centre ( https://harbourfrontcentre.com/event/season-2022/ ): Fleck Dance Theatre (235 Queens Quay West)\nDates: November 2-5, 2022\nTime: 8:00PM ​\nTickets\nChoreographer: Syreeta Hector\nCollaborators: Sasha Ludavicius, Jake Poloz, Kelly Shaw, Eleanor van Veen, Evan Webb\nPartners: Choreographers Workshop at ProArteDanza\nVideo Trailer ( https://vimeo.com/465497347 )\nSyreeta Hector is a dance artist and educator in Toronto, Ontario. As a highly accomplished performer, Syreeta has worked for internationally recognized companies like Adelheid Dance Projects, Danny Grossman Dance Company, Peggy Baker Dance Projects, Political Movement, and Toronto Dance Theatre. She is a proud graduate of The National Ballet School’s Teacher Training Program, The School of Toronto Dance Theatre, and has achieved her Master of Arts in Dance Studies from York University.\n\nThis event is a part of the York University Year of the Arts ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/year-of-the-arts/ ), presented by the York University School of the Arts, Media, Performance & Design (AMPD).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/beast-a-la-mode/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:Harbourfront Centre
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/beastalamode.jpg
END:VEVENT
