DESCRIPTION:We want your feedback!\nWe invite York community members to join our engagement sessions happening virtually and in-person at the Keele and Glendon campuses in fall 2022. The sessions will allow community members to share their input, feedback, and recommendations on priorities to inform for the development of York’s Well-being Strategy to enhance well-being on our campuses. This feedback will be used to create a Draft Well-Being Strategy that will come back to the community for further feedback and review. \nParticipants will be asked to provide feedback on various aspects of well-being and support in identifying and prioritizing student needs.\nPlease note: this session is designated for 2SLGBTQIA+ students.\nComplete the student engagement session registration form to reserve a spot.\nIf you are unable to attend, you may also share input through the Student Well-being Strategy feedback form.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/virtual-well-being-strategy-engagement-session-2slgbtqia-students/
CATEGORIES:Well-being
LOCATION:Zoom
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Student-Sessions-event-image-768-x-300.jpeg
END:VEVENT
