SUMMARY:Career Readiness Community Welcome Event
DESCRIPTION:It’s never too early to start thinking about your career! The LA&PS Experiential Education Office is thrilled to invite you to join our new LA&PS Career Readiness Community launching this Fall!\nWhy Join?\n-Meet other students at LA&PS who are in your program and year of study\n-Explore what kinds of careers you might enjoy and be interested in\n-Stay connected to career readiness resources and events across campus\n-Take part in professional development modules, workshops, and networking events\n-Find out how to get an on-campus work-study position\n-Start to understand your transferable skills and how to talk about them in interviews\n-Learn how to attain a paid internship in your upper years\nJoin us for a virtual welcome event.\nRegistration\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/career-readiness-community-welcome-event/
