SUMMARY:York Spirit Day – FUN & GAMES
DESCRIPTION:Join the York community for lawn games and giveaways from 11am-3pm on both campuses!\nKeele Campus:\nCheck out the Bear Pits in Central Square, as well as Vari Hall for games and photo opportunities! From giant Jenga to foosball, all community members are encouraged to visit the Bear Pits for a little fun and games.\nWhile you’re there, drop by Vari Hall and the Red Zone for giveaways and a photobooth! Wear your red and white to show your YorkU pride and enter our social media contest for prizes! #yuspirit\nGlendon:\nCheck out the COE for games and a photo opportunities! From giant Jenga to foosball, all community members are encouraged to visit the Quad for a little fun and games.\nWhile you’re there, drop by the the Welcome Centre for giveaways and a photobooth! Wear your red and white to show your YorkU pride and enter our social media contest for prizes! #yuspirit\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/york-spirit-day-fun-games/
