SUMMARY:Sustainability at York Spirit Day
DESCRIPTION:The Office of Sustainability is thrilled to partner up with Regenesis York to host a sustainability component to the Spirit Day – an opportunity to get outdoors for tree planting, campus clean-up and more! We will work together to create positive change by creating a greener campus, restoring ecosystems to help mitigate climate change. Click this link to learn more and register by October 16! https://go.yorku.ca/sustainability-spirit-day ( https://go.yorku.ca/sustainability-spirit-day )\nA special thank you to the City of Toronto and York University’s Facilities Services for their help in making this event possible.\n
