DESCRIPTION:Explore. Engage. Experience – Exchanges, summer schools, internships and more at one of York University’s Global Learning Fairs! We’re back and excited to share with our student community the programs that are available at our or 300 global partners in more than 65 countries worldwide.\nVisit the Global Learning Fair webpage ( https://yorkinternational.yorku.ca/global-learning-fair/ ) for more information, including confirmed exhibitors that is updated daily!\nDon’t miss out on the opportunity to travel abroad, earn credits towards your degree and build skills that build your resume. Speak with students from abroad studying at York this semester or students who have travelled abroad in the past and learn first-hand the value of participating in a global learning opportunity.\n
