SUMMARY:Q & A with an LA&PS Academic Advisor
DESCRIPTION:Do you have questions about your degree requirements? Do you need clarification on a specific rule or legislation at York? Do you have academic questions/concerns about your York program? Please join us for a Question & Answer session with a Liberal Arts & Professional Studies Academic Advisor.\nRegister Here:\nhttps://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJMvceiqrzwuHdP44pSJPaTr-n_WveCXuv5u  ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJMvceiqrzwuHdP44pSJPaTr-n_WveCXuv5u )\n
