SUMMARY:Meditation Focused on Academics and Life Challenges
DESCRIPTION:Scott Pope, a trained Psychotherapist, from Student Counselling, Health and Well-being will provide an array of meditation styles that will help you to de-stress and increase positivity as it relates to your academic challenges and overall life challenges. A few types of meditation styles Scott focuses on are progressive relaxation, visualization,  loving-kindness, focused and body scan. These are drop in sessions and do not require registration.\nJoin Zoom Meeting: https://yorku.zoom.us/j/95536284223?pwd=SVFSazkvVkZISXVVL2lHSjlLNGd2Zz09 ( https://yorku.zoom.us/j/95536284223?pwd=SVFSazkvVkZISXVVL2lHSjlLNGd2Zz09 )\n
