DESCRIPTION:POSTPONED UNTIL SPRING\nOnce a year the York community is invited to participate in festivities where we celebrate and recognize the people who continue to make this University a success, including our students, faculty and staff.\nJoin others in the community at 11 a.m. on the Harry W. Arthur Commons for a historic photo with the giant York U flag! All community members are encouraged to come out in their York colours and gear for this Spirit Day photo.\n****\nDo you want to be a special part of York University’s inaugural Spirit Day class photo?\nAre you an active member of the community?\nCan you hold a item of 30 lbs for a short period without assistance?\nAre you available to be on campus, Wed. Oct. 19, 2022 at 11:00 a.m.?\nVisit: http://go.yorku.ca/spiritdayphotokeele ( http://go.yorku.ca/spiritdayphotokeele )\n
