SUMMARY:Dean’s Fireside Chat with Kathleen Taylor (MBA/JD ’84, Hon LLD ’14)
DESCRIPTION:The Dean’s Leadership Dialogues feature the Schulich School of Business’ most accomplished alumni and business leaders from around the world in a thoughtful and engaging fireside chat with Schulich Dean Detlev Zwick.\nKathleen (Katie) Taylor is Chair of the Board of RBC and the next Chancellor of York University. She has served on the board since 2001, where she has chaired the Human Resources and Corporate Governance Committees, and served on the Audit and Risk Committees. Ms. Taylor also serves as Chair of Altas Partners, a Toronto-based private equity investment firm.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/deans-fireside-chat-with-kathleen-taylor-mba-jd-84-hon-lld-14/
