SUMMARY:CineSiege 2022
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\nIn its 20th year, CineSiege is an annual showcase screening of outstanding productions created in the previous year by undergraduate students in the Department of Cinema and Media Arts at York University. CineSiege features a juried selection of short films, chosen by industry leaders in Canadian film and media.\nWe hope you can join us to celebrate the next generation of filmmakers!\nCineSiege 2022\nMonday, October 24, 2022\n7:00 PM – 10:30 PM\nParadise Theatre ( https://paradiseonbloor.com/ ): 1006c Bloor St W, Toronto, ON M6H 1M2\nFREE\nTICKETS  ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/cinesiege-2022-tickets-432989803157?lang=en-ca&locale=en_CA&status=30&view=listing )\nAfter Party\nImmediately following screening (approx. 10:30pm)\nHurricane’s Roadhouse Restaurant\nAddress: 963 Bloor St W, Toronto, ON M6H 1L7\nThis event is made possible with the continued support of our founding sponsor, Cinespace.\n\nThis event is a part of the York University Year of the Arts ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/year-of-the-arts/ ), presented by the York University School of the Arts, Media, Performance & Design (AMPD).\n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/cinesiege-2022/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
LOCATION:Paradise Theatre: 1006c Bloor St W, Toronto, ON M6H 1M2
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/CineSiege2022_Ampd-event-page2.jpeg
END:VEVENT
