SUMMARY:Canadian Universities Alumni Reception in New York
DESCRIPTION:The Canadian Association of New York (CANY) invites you to the 22nd Annual Canadian Universities Alumni Reception on Wednesday, Nov 16 from 6-9pm at the Tribeca Rooftop.\nJoin us for a fun evening and gather with friends old and new to reminisce about your days in Canada.\nYork University is proud to be a sponsor of this event, and York alumni are eligible to register at a discounted price. Ticket price includes cocktails, beer and wine open bar and passed hors d’oeuvres.\nDon’t miss this great opportunity to meet and network with fellow Canadian alumni in NYC.\nBe sure to register early as this event typically sells out.\nDetails\nDate: Wednesday, November 16, 2022 | 6pm ET\nLocation: 2 Desbrosses St. (between Hudson and Greenwich St.) New York City , New York 10013\nCost: $55 for York alumni\nRegister ( https://www.canadanyc.com/events/EventDetails.aspx?id=1665352 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/canadian-universities-alumni-reception-in-new-york/
