DESCRIPTION:Following a session on inclusive pedagogies last June, we are continuing the dialogue on the topic this year and we are starting with a session on October 14th from 1:00 to 2:30 pm on Zoom. We will also be looking for co-leads to create a Glendon community of practice with three sessions during the year. The initiative is supported by the Teaching Commons, Centre for Human Rights, Equity and Inclusion, and the office of the vice-principal academics.\n
