SUMMARY:Black Mental Health Conference
DESCRIPTION:Insightful discussions will be had on how we can all collaborate to bring in resources into our communities to help combat systemic barriers that contribute to mental health stressors. Our guest speakers feature staff from CEE Toronto, African Caribbean Black Business Network, Rexdale Community Legal Clinic, Career Foundation and Sankofa Family and Community Services. The conference booklet is available ( https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rjeyMlVPmNy9jo3KsR6AQSGB8567AV_T/view ), it features Black businesses and therapists, please do not hesitate to connect with them.\nLunch will be provided and there will be a short raffle to win a $10 Tim Horton gift card for in-person guests.\nIn-person registration\nJoin Zoom\n
