SUMMARY:Graduate School Applications and Academic Cover Letters Workshop
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop, participants will receive an overview of crucial strategies and considerations for writing academic personal statements or cover letters. Additional elements of the graduate school application process will be discussed, such as developing one’s CV, structuring research proposals, and obtaining reference letters.\nNo RSVPs.\nYork University\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/graduate-school-applications-and-academic-cover-letters-workshop/
ORGANIZER;CN=Writing Centre:MAILTO:jroberts@yorku.ca, dbaus@yorku.ca, lapswrit@yorku.ca
