SUMMARY:Zotero Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Zotero is a free and open-source software that enables you to organize your research, create bibliographies and insert citations or footnotes in your assignments. Zotero will help you collect, organize, and cite journal articles and other information sources. This workshop teaches you how to install Zotero and how to use some of its main features. This workshop will introduce participants to the main functions of Zotero and will include a hands-on component.\nNo RSVPs. Just join Zoom!\nJoin\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/zotero-workshop-2/
ORGANIZER;CN=Writing Centre:MAILTO:jroberts@yorku.ca, dbaus@yorku.ca, lapswrit@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:LA&amp;PS Students All,LA&amp;PS Students-Graduate,LA&amp;PS Students-Undergrad,LA&amp;PS Writing Centre,LA&amp;PS Writing Department
LOCATION:Zoom Webinar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Writing2_James-Robertson_James-Robertson.jpg
