SUMMARY:Grammar On! Workshop 1: Are you Clause-trophic?
DESCRIPTION:If thinking about independent and dependent clauses gives you clausetrophobia, then come on out to The Writing Centre’s first Grammar On! power-hour – on Zoom – this Wednesday morning at 10:30 for a fun and engaging lesson on clauses!\nNo RSVPs. Just click on link to join!\nJoin Zoom meeting\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/grammar-on-workshop-1-are-you-clause-trophic/
ORGANIZER;CN=Writing Centre:MAILTO:jroberts@yorku.ca, dbaus@yorku.ca, lapswrit@yorku.ca
