SUMMARY:York Strategic Research Plan Open Forum
DESCRIPTION:Have your say about the development of the York Strategic Research Plan 2023-2028\nJoin Vice-President Research & Innovation Amir Asif for an open forum to launch the consultation process for the University’s Strategic Research Plan (2023-2028).\nThe open forum will be held on Wednesday September 28, from 1pm to 3pm in the Dr. Robert Everett Senate Chambers, N940 Ross Building, Keele Campus.  All students, faculty and staff are welcome to join in-person.  The purpose of the open fourm is to reflect on our progress over the last five years and discuss the goals, value and objectives that will help share the continued development of research at York and learn more about the rollout of the consultation process and upcoming events being organized.\nTo RSVP to this event, click here: ( https://research.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=137801 )\nQuestions can be sent in advance through our online feedback portal that is available here: ( https://research.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=11767 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/york-strategic-research-plan-open-forum/
ORGANIZER;CN=Office of Vice-President Research &amp; Innovation:MAILTO:barbb@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Research &amp; Innovation
