SUMMARY:Red Bull Flugtag 2022 Viewing
DESCRIPTION:Join ITE York U to visit the Red Bull Flugtag Canada 2022 at Ontario Place. We are meeting at York University Subway Station on Saturday, September 24 at 10:00 am. We have some surprises for you.\nFlugtag challenges wacky engineers and fearless pilots to fulfill their dream of flying. First, they construct their flying machine. Then they take a leap of faith. Or, as is more often the case, plunge into the waters below. Are you up for it?\nOntario Place Address: 955 Lake Shore Blvd W, Toronto, ON M6K 3B9\n\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/Qd9JvhTSpYLw47nP6 ( https://goo.gl/maps/Qd9JvhTSpYLw47nP6 )\n\n
