SUMMARY:Tri-Council & OGS Application Workshop – Doctoral Session #1
DESCRIPTION:The Faculty of Graduate Studies is pleased to invite students to the 2022 Tri-Council & OGS Application Workshops. The goal of these workshops is to give students the tools to write effective and strategic proposals for the Ontario Graduate Scholarship and Tri-Council Fellowship/Canada Graduate Scholarship competitions. Please note that this session will be tailored for students applying to doctoral-level competitions.\nWorkshops will be run virtually over Zoom, and the link will be shared after registration closer to the workshop date.\nPlease register here ( https://fgs.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=123536 ) by 8:00am on September 15, 2022 to attend!\nPlease note that this session and Session #2 on September 22 will be identical.\n
