SUMMARY:York University Los Angeles Alumni Cocktail Mixer
DESCRIPTION:York Alumni in the Los Angeles area are invited to our YorkU LA Alumni Cocktail Mixer, being held on Sept. 29.\nThis is your opportunity to connect with fellow alumni in your city, strengthen your personal and professional network, reminisce about your time at York and hear the latest news from your alma mater.\nTickets are free but registration is required ( http://give.yorku.ca/s/1853/adv/form.aspx?sid=1853&gid=2&pgid=869&cid=1874 ). Guests will enjoy their first drink on us, unlimited soft drinks and hors d’oeuvres throughout the evening.\nThis event will be hosted by Julie Lafford, Assistant Vice-President of Alumni Engagement at York and Tammy Kim-Newman, Associate Director, Employer and Alumni Engagement. We hope to see you there!\nFor any enquiries, please contact Ellie Coult, Manager, Regional Alumni Programs at ecoult@yorku.ca ( mailto:ecoult@yorku.ca ). No longer Los Angeles based? Update your contact info here ( https://www.yorku.ca/alumniandfriends/update-contact-information/ ) to receive relevant invitations.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/york-university-los-angeles-alumni-cocktail-mixer/
ORGANIZER;CN=York Alumni Engagement:MAILTO:alumnievents@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni,International,Regional Alumni Events
LOCATION:9355 Culver Blvd, Culver City, CA 90232
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/LAMixer-768x300-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
