SUMMARY:Level Up | Grad Studies Alumni Panel: How grad school fueled my career!
DESCRIPTION:Thinking about grad school or simply curious about your options? Join alumni as they share their candid experiences as grad students, why they decided to enroll in a master’s program, what they wished they knew before beginning their studies, and tips on how to prepare an effective graduate school application.\n RSVP | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_FXq1J486QIWF1RoMmGLE7w )\n \n
