TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Canada-UK Chamber of Commerce Canadian Universities Alumni Networking Reception
DESCRIPTION:York University is proud to be a sponsor of this year’s Canada-UK Chamber of Commerce Canadian Universities Alumni Networking Reception, taking place on Oct. 6, 2022.\nWe’d like to invite York alumni residing in the UK to attend and enjoy an evening of networking. Expand your professional network, mingle with fellow Canadians in London and catch up with your alma mater in Princess Alexandra Hall at the exclusive Royal Over-Seas League Club.\nThere will be a business card draw taking place at the mixer with a range of great prizes available.\nTickets are on sale at £16.76 including VAT and fees (for members of the Canada-UK Chamber of Commerce) and £32.93 including VAT and fees (for non-members). There may be a small number of tickets available at a discounted rate for York alumni. Please contact Ellie Coult, Manager, Regional Alumni Programs at ecoult@yorku.ca ( mailto:ecoult@yorku.ca ) for more details.\nLink to purchase tickets: https://www.canada-uk.org/2022-events/3rd-canadian-university-alumni-mixer ( https://www.canada-uk.org/2022-events/3rd-canadian-university-alumni-mixer )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/canada-uk-chamber-of-commerce-canadian-universities-alumni-networking-reception/
ORGANIZER;CN=York Alumni Engagement:MAILTO:alumnievents@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni,Regional Alumni Events
LOCATION:Over-Seas House, Park Pl, St James's St, London SW1A
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/UK-Event-Oct-2022-768x300px.jpg
END:VEVENT
