SUMMARY:Employer Campus Recruitment Event: Healthcare of Ontario Pension Plan (HOOPP)
DESCRIPTION:We invite you join us and learn about HOOPP, our winter co-op 2023 opportunities and to network with our team! We have co-op opportunities in: Finance, Investment Management, Risk & Internal Audit, Plan Operations and Information Technology & Facilities Services.\nWho we are\nWe’re the Healthcare of Ontario Pension Plan (HOOPP), a defined benefit pension plan that exists to provide Ontario’s hospital and community-based healthcare workers with a secure pension. We proudly serve over 420,000 members across the province who provide valued healthcare services at more than 620 employers. Our team is focused on providing our members a stable and reliable income that starts in retirement and is paid for life. We are one of Canada’s largest and most respected pension plans. Because of what we do every day, Ontario’s healthcare workers can count on us being there for them at the end of their careers.\nLog in\n
