SUMMARY:Employer Campus Recruitment Event: IBM (Winter 2023 Opportunities)
DESCRIPTION:“Understanding the hiring process and what’s important to make your resume stand out can be a challenge….but have no fear, we are here to help!\nMark your calendars for 2:30 PM EST on September 21, 2022 because the members of the Campus Talent Acquisition team will be presenting on how to get your application noticed by hiring teams and what goes into the application process! During this session, they will cover resume-writing best practices beyond the surface level tips, and what makes an ideal candidate for IBM (hint: work experience is not always the most important detail!)\nYou’ll also have time to ask your questions to the team. Looking forward to seeing you there!”\nWho: Open to those seeking internships in Winter 2023\nPresenters : IBM Campus Recruitment Team\nJudith Fernando\nStarrlee DeGRace\nVictoria Kazakis\nLog in\n
