SUMMARY:2022 NSERC Q-and-A Session
DESCRIPTION:The Faculty of Graduate Studies is pleased to invite you to the 2022 NSERC Q&A Session on Wednesday, Sept. 7 at noon EST.  The session is hosted by NSERC for students to ask questions prior to the upcoming doctoral competitions in the Fall.\nPlease note the following instructions from NSERC:\nNSERC’s Q-and-A sessions are supported by a series of informational videos available on the NSERC YouTube channel (updates for 2022 are currently in progress). These videos are intended to completely replace the presentation portion of NSERC sessions, thus allowing NSERC staff and applicants to engage in an in-depth and detailed Q&A session. Participants should watch these videos in advance and come to the Q&A session with specific questions in mind:\n\nPlaylist – Scholarships & Fellowships program application tutorials (English) ( https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL6ox0GB7vXYlhaAY7mEqwmMqYK9TGCp1E )\nListe de lecture – Tutoriels sur la présentation de demandes aux programmes de bourses ( https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLW6knVGZzKrsJ1iI_nGLoZSQOUwO7ykXr )\n\nTo attend the Q-and-A session, please see the webinar information below:\nNSERC 2022 Q-and-A Session – York University & Nipissing University\n \nDate and time:\nWednesday, Sept. 7, 2022 at noon| Eastern Time (US & Canada), (UTC-04:00)\nJoin link:\nhttps://nsercvideo.webex.com/nsercvideo/j.php?MTID=m497d71b10f9e79df6a4dafb2dff54a9e ( https://can01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnsercvideo.webex.com%2Fnsercvideo%2Fj.php%3FMTID%3Dm497d71b10f9e79df6a4dafb2dff54a9e&data=05%7C01%7CAlice.Lam%40NSERC-CRSNG.GC.CA%7C33397ca709b7417488d408da81eeaccd%7Cfbef079820e34be7bdc8372032610f65%7C1%7C0%7C637965159359853009%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&sdata=THbsN8kfzCYdgOehWJhANgQxiPxNwctWiWtCDGmzcWY%3D&reserved=0 )\nWebinar number:\n2430 089 9094\nWebinar password:\nNSERC2022 (67372202 from phones)\nJoin by phone\n1-844-426-4405 Canada Toll Free\n+1-613-714-9906 Canada Toll (Ottawa)\nAccess code: 243 008 99094\nIf you have any questions please contact Casey Nakada, Scholarships & Awards Coordinator, at cnakada@yorku.ca ( mailto:cnakada@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/2022-nserc-q-and-a-session/
