SUMMARY:Connect with Mature & Transfer Students!
DESCRIPTION:Are you new to York University? Would you like to meet fellow mature and transfer students? Come out to our meet and greet on Thursday, September 1st, 2022, from 3 pm to 4 pm, to chat with the York University Mature Student Organization executive members, as well as ACMAPS staff and peer mentors! Registration is required. To register, click HERE ( https://machform.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=342411 )!\nThis event will be held in-person, in Vanier College room 113.\n
