SUMMARY:Employer Campus Recruitment Event: CIBC (Winter 2023 Co-op Opportunities)
DESCRIPTION:The Campus team at CIBC is hosting a Day in the Life session, where you’ll get to hear 3 career journeys from folks who started as Co-ops and converted to full-time roles.\nThere will be a panel session focused on 3 ‘hot careers’, where you can learn about some of the diverse career paths at CIBC and how you can kickstart your career with us!\nRegister for the event by September 8th, 2022 at 11:59 PM EST.\nLogin\n
