SUMMARY:Employer Campus Recruitment Event: Canada Pension Plan Investment Board (CPPIB)
DESCRIPTION:CPP Investments Info Session: Are you a student looking to learn more about career opportunities in the investment industry? Join our Campus Advisors for an information session to get prepared for the upcoming recruiting season at CPP Investments. Get to know our programs across Credit Investments, Private Equity, Capital Markets & Factor Investing, Finance, Analytics & Risk, Public Affairs & Communications and Total Fund Management. Get to know our investment professionals and culture within our firm, learn more about our recruitment timelines and our virtual interview process.\nRegister for this event by 12:00 pm EST on Monday, September 5, 2022.\nLogin\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/employer-campus-recruitment-event-canada-pension-plan-investment-board-cppib/
