SUMMARY:York University’s Go Global SDGs in Action Student Challenge Info Sessions
DESCRIPTION:YorkU Students Create Local and Global Impact!\nAre you a YorkU student passionate about reducing global inequalities? Are you interested in creating a local and global impact by leading your own SDGs action projects? Join the SDGs in Action Student Challenge to gain global skills, implement your own SDGs project in collaboration with your peers from around the world, be mentored by global experts, and receive up to $8000* to study, research, or work in the communities you’ve impacted!\nRegistration\n
