SUMMARY:Practical Strategies for Grading: Focus on Feedback for Science
DESCRIPTION:\n\nDear all science graduate students and post-docs,\n\nYou are all invited to join us for a hands-on workshop, which has been specially designed for graduate students in the Faculty of Science, we will explore practical strategies for providing feedback on student work.\n\nIn this context, we will discuss components of positive feedback, different modes of delivery, as well as effective time management. Participants will apply the strategies we discuss to sample assignments and consider how they might apply to their own teaching and grading contexts.\n\n\nhttps://teachingcommonsforms.apps01.yorku.ca/forms/view.php?id=902409\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/practical-strategies-for-grading-focus-on-feedback-for-science/
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Science
LOCATION:(URL will be provided in the email confirmation)
END:VEVENT
