DESCRIPTION:Dear all interested science instructors,\nYou are invited two join us for our two bi-monthly informal meetings on Teaching & learning for Fall 2022 led by our Pedagogical Chair, Tamara Kelly.\nAll instructors are welcome to join the meetings, where we will discuss teaching and learning strategies, issues, and ideas in an informal way.\nFall Meetings:\n\nWednesday, September 21 @ 1:30-2:30 p.m. \n\n\n\n\nJoin Zoom Meetinghttps://yorku.zoom.us/j/99617851985?pwd=bjVCNHB3eTBlejNkZFpRR1lGOUNzQT09&from=addon \n\n\n\n\nWednesday, November 23 @1:30-2:30 p.m. \n\n\n\n\nJoin Zoom Meetinghttps://yorku.zoom.us/j/98239943872?pwd=YzRRUFo1UFZmdWlJeWJuZzBScXJlUT09&from=addon \n\n\n\nIf you have any questions or ideas, please email Ashley Nahornick (ashleynk@yorku.ca), or Dr. Tamara Kelly (tljkelly@yorku.ca)\n
