SUMMARY:FSc. Science Education Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Dear all interested science instructors,\nThe Science Pedagogy Chair, Dr. Tamara Kelly, and the Science Committee on Teaching & Learning (CoTL) would like to invite you to join us for the launch of the Faculty of Science Book Club for the 2022-23 academic year. \nWe will be creating an email group for all those interested, to receive information about meetings and follow-up information. If you are interested, in joining this book club, please sign-up here: https://forms.office.com/r/YvK224HwEt \nOur book club will meet once a month on third Tuesday of the month from 3-4 p.m. via hyflex (zoom and in-person). The dates are: \n\nSeptember 20 \nOctober 18 \nNovember 15 \nDecember 13 \n\nOur first book will be: Sathy, V., & Hogan, K. A. (2022). Inclusive teaching: Strategies for promoting equity in the college classroom. \nIf you have any questions, or comments, please contact me Ashley Nahornick (ashleynk@yorku.ca) or Dr. Tamara Kelly (tljkelly@yorku.ca) \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/fsc-science-education-book-club/
