SUMMARY:Stong College Alumni Golf Tournament
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday, September 7, 2022, is the date of the 4th annual Stong Alumni Golf Day, which will take place again this year at the beautiful Silver Lakes Golf Club north of Holland Landing, near Bradford.\nGroups will commence tee-offs at 9am  Registration is limited to the first 40 golfers.  The cost for 18 holes of golf (including power cart) is $79.10 per player (includes HST). There will be prizes for specific shots on designated holes and refreshments available afterwards at the clubhouse.\nOrganize your own foursome or sign up as a single, twosome or threesome and be placed in a group! Bring along a family member or friend – guests are most welcome to attend. Non-golfers are welcome to join us after the golf on the spacious outdoor patio (beginning around 1pm).\nFor more info and to register, please contact:\nRalph Gauthier ’74,  ralphgauthier@msn.com, 705.431.8514 (voice only)\nSteve Dranitsaris ’73, sdrano@rogers.com, 647.880.4214 (voice or text)\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/stong-college-alumni-golf-tournament/
ORGANIZER;CN=Ralph Gauthier:MAILTO:ralphgauthier@msn.com
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni,Stong College
LOCATION:21114 Yonge St, East Gwillimbury, ON L9N 0J8
END:VEVENT
