SUMMARY:Open Office Hour—Graduate Admissions
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education and want to find out more about graduate admissions? We invite you to attend our virtual program session. RSVP | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_5_cPcO0mSoKPIiygi9akqg )\nThis session is open to anyone who has questions about graduate admissions at York. There is no structure or agenda, just a chance for folks to get the answers they’re looking for. Feel free to drop in at any point between 6:00pm and 7:00pm (EST) with your questions about a master’s, PhD, or graduate diploma.\nPlease note that this session will not be able to address questions about programs in the Schulich School of Business ( https://schulich.yorku.ca/ ), or the Osgoode Hall Law School ( https://www.osgoode.yorku.ca/ ).\nTo learn about more sessions being offered, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ). \nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsnews@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/open-office-hour-graduate-admissions-2/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
