SUMMARY:I don’t think I’ll get in to Grad School… What now?
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education and want to discover some strategies for improving your chances of acceptance? We invite you to attend our virtual program session. RSVP | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_ZRBb8tSFT0GmjuZL5fn_9Q )\nDon’t think that you’ll meet our admission requirements? Applied before, and not received an offer?\nJoin us to learn more about our basic requirements for graduate admission, our “unique applicants” category and how we consider extenuating circumstances, common refusal reasons, and upgrading options that are available, if needed.\nTo learn about more sessions being offered, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ). \nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsnews@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/i-dont-think-ill-get-in-what-now/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
