SUMMARY:Visas, Study Permits, Work Permits and More with York International
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education and want more information on visas, study permits, work permits and more? We invite you to attend our virtual program session. RSVP | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_eL8Aty6UQN-y0DutiwXvWQ )\nIn this session, York’s International Student Advisor and Immigration Specialist Mayoori Malankov will go over the study permit and visa application process. She provides tips on how to make a strong application, helps you understand the recent updates from Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada (IRCC) and provides information on any current travel restrictions to Canada.\nTo learn about more sessions being offered, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ). \nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsnews@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/visas-study-permits-work-permits-and-more-with-york-international/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
