SUMMARY:Graduate Admissions for the Faculty of Liberal Arts & Professional Studies
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education and are wondering about graduate gdmissions for the Faculty of Liberal Arts & Professional Studies? We invite you to attend our virtual program session. RSVP | yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_-1-ntweRT-uJOnTMh_yPbw )\nJoin us to learn more about the graduate programs available in the Faculty of Liberal Arts & Professional Studies. This presentation will cover the following programs\n\nCommunication & Culture (MA & PhD)\nDevelopment Studies (MA)\nDisaster & Emergency Management (MDEM)\nEconomics (MA & PhD)\nEnglish (MA & PhD)\nFinancial Accountability (MFAc)\nGender, Feminist, & Women’s Studies (MA & PhD)\nHistory (MA & PhD)\nHuman Resources Management (MHRM & PhD)\nHumanities (MA & PhD)\nInformation Systems & Technology (MAIST)\nInterdisciplinary Studies (MA)\nLinguistics and Applied Linguistics (MA & PhD)\nManagement Practice (MScMP)\nPhilosophy (MA & PhD)\nPolitical Science (MA & PhD)\nPublic Policy, Administration & Law (MPPAL)\nScience & Technology Studies (MA & PhD)\nSocial Anthropology (MA & PhD)\nSocial Work (MSW & PhD)\nSocial & Political Thought (MA & PhD)\nSocio-Legal Studies (MA & PhD)\nSociology (MA & PhD)\n\nTo learn about more sessions being offered, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ). \nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsnews@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsnews@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/graduate-admissions-for-the-faculty-of-liberal-arts-professional-studies/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
