SUMMARY:FGS Session: 2022 Grant Writing Workshop (SSHRC)
DESCRIPTION:The Faculty of Graduate Studies is pleased to invite students to the Summer 2022 Grant Writing Workshop. The goal of this workshop is to give students the tools to write effective and strategic proposals for the upcoming Vanier Canada Graduate Scholarship, Ontario Graduate Scholarship, and Tri-Council (SSHRC, NSERC and CIHR) Fellowship competitions. Please note that this session will be tailored to students whose research areas fall under the SSHRC mandate.\nThe workshop will feature a variety of speakers including past SSHRC award recipients, the Faculty of Graduate Studies Wellness Team, and an expert team of faculty members. The workshop will be held on Thursday, August 18th, 2022 from 9:00am to 1:30pm over Zoom (link provided upon registration). We look forward to a productive workshop with you!\nTo RSVP, please fill out this form: https://fgs.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=200668 ( https://fgs.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=200668 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/2022-grant-writing-workshop-sshrc/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies,Graduate Program in Art History,Graduate Program in Communication and Culture,Graduate Program in Critical Disability Studies,Graduate Program in Development Studies,Graduate Program in Digital Media,Graduate Program in English,Graduate Program in Environmental Studies,Graduate Program in Film,Graduate Program in Gender, Feminist and Women's Studies,Graduate Program in Geography,Graduate Program in Humanities,Graduate Program in Interdisciplinary Studies,Graduate Program in Management Practice,Graduate Program in Philosophy,Graduate Program in Psychology,Graduate Program in Science &amp; Technology Studies,Graduate Program in Social &amp; Political Thought,Graduate Program in Social Anthrolology,Graduate Program in Social Work,Graduate Program in Socio-Legal Studies
LOCATION:(URL will be provided in the email confirmation)
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Internship.jpg
END:VEVENT
