SUMMARY:Walking Tour: Energy Evolution Plan @ Regent Park
DESCRIPTION:Join the MES @ York Planning Alumni Committee (MYPAC) for a Regent Park Walking Tour on Aug. 18 at 4:30pm.\nAlumnus David MacMillan (BSC ’09, MES ‘14)  from the City of Toronto will be presenting about the Energy Generation Plan.\nSpots are limited. Meet at the corner of Oak Street and Sackville Street by the Regent Park Community Garden ( https://goo.gl/maps/FvjhPWfeWrVxGfKh9 ) and following the tour, join us for a mix & mingle at House on Parliament ( https://goo.gl/maps/Fwe6d87meF2XY7UB8 ).\nRegister today! ( https://euc.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=141270 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/walking-tour-energy-evolution-plan-regent-park/
ORGANIZER;CN=MES @ York Planning Alumni Commitee:MAILTO:mypacexecutive@gmail.com
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Environmental &amp; Urban Change
LOCATION:Corner of Oak Street and Sackville Street by the Regent Park Community Garden
