DESCRIPTION:Student Community and Leadership Development’s Student Engagement Club Ambassadors will be hosting drop-in sessions to chat, answer your questions and provide guidance about the many club activities for York University students.\nDrop by our virtual Zoom sessions (Mondays from 12 to 1 p.m. and Fridays from 2 to 3 p.m.) or our hybrid sessions (Wednesdays from 12 to 1 p.m. and Thursdays from 2 to 3 p.m.) in person at Vari Hall, Room 1005, Keele Campus.\nFor more information, join the Student Engagement Discord or email us at yuengage@yorku.ca\nDiscord: https://discord.com/invite/XxnMq7E8EX\nZoom: https://yorku.zoom.us/j/92744061665?pwd=aVRMSDBVb1d1d2JEQk1WclBaVWNqZz09#success\n
