DESCRIPTION:For the third Summer in a row, the City of Markham is helping residents stay active with Open Street Markham, presented by York University.\nThe Open Street initiative was created to allow for more outdoor space and opportunities for residents to get active during the COVID-19 pandemic.\nFor full details and schedule, visit the website: https://www.markham.ca/wps/portal/home/neighbourhood-services/walking-and-cycling/news-and-events/03-openstreet-2022/ \n
