SUMMARY:International Mature & Transfer Students: Let’s Talk Canadian Culture, eh!
DESCRIPTION:As a new international mature and/or transfer student to York University you may or may not know how diverse the campus is and how you might “fit in.”\nYou might be interested in the Canadian culture and what values are important as well as how the culture is represented or defined.\nWhat makes Canadian culture unique from other cultures?\nThis session will also touch on Canadian terminologies/slang that will help you adapt into your new environment/surroundings. Registration is required.\nRegistration link: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJcrdeihrT8jGty2jAG-9VfGNC8jO1zmnmEW\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/international-mature-transfer-students-lets-talk-canadian-culture-eh/
ORGANIZER;CN=ACMAPS:MAILTO:acmaps@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Colleges,Divisions and Special Areas,Event Planners Network,Faculties
LOCATION:Atkinson Centre for Mature &amp; Part-Time Students @ Zoom Meeting
END:VEVENT
