SUMMARY:Campus Tour for Mature & Transfer Students
DESCRIPTION:We look forward to guiding you through our outstanding facilities and community, as you make new friends and ask all of your questions about university life. Your tour guides are current students who will give you an insider’s perspective on life at York.\nHealth & Safety Disclaimer\nAll guests of York University must complete and clear COVID-19 screening using YU Screen prior to attending campus. Face masks are currently not required, but still strongly encouraged for group activities such as campus tours when physical distancing may not be possible. Please review York U’s mask policy before coming to campus. By signing up for an in-person campus tour, guests acknowledge and agree to comply with health and safety protocols for guests at York University’s Keele campus.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/campus-tour-for-mature-transfer-students/
