SUMMARY:SCLD: SECA Drop-In
DESCRIPTION:SCLD’s Student Engagement Club Ambassadors will be hosting drop-in sessions to chat, answer your questions, and provide guidance.\nDrop by our virtual Zoom sessions (Mondays and Fridays) or our hybrid sessions (Wednesdays and Thursdays) in-person at Vari Hall, Room 1005.\nFor more information, join the Student Engagement Discord or email us yuengage@yorku.ca!\nDiscord: https://discord.com/invite/XxnMq7E8EX\nZoom: https://yorku.zoom.us/j/92744061665?pwd=aVRMSDBVb1d1d2JEQk1WclBaVWNqZz09#success\n
