SUMMARY:Fourth Summer Global Health Intern Symposium at the Dahdaleh Institute for Global Health Research
DESCRIPTION:Please join us at the fourth Summer Global Health Intern Symposium to celebrate the work of researchers participating in the Dahdaleh Institute internship program.\n\n\n\nPresentation Title\nPresenter(s)\n\n\nWar, Environmental Disasters & Damage\nVictoria Cassar\n\n\nGlobal Health Equity\nKaysie Ngo\n\n\nGlobal Antimicrobial Resistance\nNoor Aman\n\n\nGovernance Aspects of Antimicrobial Resistance Surveillance\nFiona Harris\n\n\nHealthcare Litigation in Brazil\nMichelle Mao\n\n\nAI & Noncommunicable Diseases Prevention Policy\nAngel Conje\n\n\nDentistVRy\nEssete Makonnen Tesfaye & Isabella Garito\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nRegister here: https://www.yorku.ca/dighr/events/4th-summer-global-health-intern-symposium/ ( https://www.yorku.ca/dighr/events/4th-summer-global-health-intern-symposium/ )\n
URL:https://www.yorku.ca/dighr/events/4th-summer-global-health-intern-symposium/
CATEGORIES:Research &amp; Innovation
