SUMMARY:Student Organization Showcase
DESCRIPTION:SCLD is hosting Student Organization Showcases this summer! York Lions from all years and programs are invited to come check out Student Organizations like the Robotics Society, YAMA Anime and Manga Association, York Cheerleading and more at Vari Hall! Our student organizations have exciting activities planned and are very eager to get students involved.\nThe dates and times SCLD will be hosting Club Showcases are:\n* June 30 from 3:30-5:30 p.m.\n* July 13 from 3:30-5:30 p.m.\n* July 20 from 12:30-2:30 p.m.\n* July 26 from 12:30-2:30 p.m.\n* August 3 from 1:30-3:30 p.m.\nWe have an ice cream truck on July 20 so come grab some free ice cream, make new friends (including our mascot — Yeo), and find new ways to get involved on campus!\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/student-organization-showcase-3/
