SUMMARY:North Star Community Emancipation Day Celebration
DESCRIPTION:On Sunday, July 31, from 2 to 5 p.m. York University’s Athletics & Recreation is proud to stand with the local Jane & Finch Black community leaders, to reflect and celebrate together the inaugural North Star Community Emancipation Day.\nThis event is free to attend and is open to all York University community members. It will feature performances, keynote speakers, and a charity basketball game. Plus, attendees receive a free ice cream (while supplies last).\nFor more information on this event, visit yorkulions.ca ( https://yorkulions.ca/sports/2022/7/8/emancipationday2022.aspx )!\n
