SUMMARY:FilipiNEXT presents Topline: Filipinx Diaspora and Sonic Aspirations in the City
DESCRIPTION:Screening, Q & A, and live performances by creator, Romeo Candido, and lead actor, Cyrena Fiel.\nSpecial performance from Alexis Estropia and Gregory Dy Sun (Filipino Student’s Association at York)\nTopline: Filipinx Diaspora and Sonic Aspirations in the City\nJuly 13, 2022\n7-9 p.m.\nInnis Town Hall, ( https://townhall.innis.utoronto.ca/ ) 2 Sussex Ave, Toronto\nTICKETS \nMore information: https://filipinext.ca/schedule ( https://filipinext.ca/schedule )\n
