SUMMARY:Career Conversations – LAPS Talks
DESCRIPTION:Are you a fan of TED Talks? Well, then you’re going to love our new LAPS Talks series! Join us on July 13 at noon on Zoom to hear from three of our LA&PS international student alumni as they provide insight and tips on:\n\nHow to build your professional network and brand as an international student; \nHow to gain that infamous ‘Canadian experience’ before graduating as an international student; and\nHow to set yourself up for success after graduation (what to do in your final year to land that first job out of school).\n\nIn partnership with LAPS International Team\nFor more information about this event and to register, login to Experience York.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/career-conversations-laps-talks/
CATEGORIES:Co-op &amp; Career Centre,Faculty of Liberal Arts &amp; Professional Studies
LOCATION:Virtual (Zoom)
