SUMMARY:C4: Cross-Campus Capstone Classroom Information Session
DESCRIPTION:Want to save the world and earn credits at the same time? Interested in widening your career network? Looking for ways to supercharge your resume? Ready to gain more professional skills— like teamwork, project management, and leadership? \nIf you have said yes to any of these questions, then C4 is for you. \nAttend our virtual information session, running every Wednesday 10 to 11 a.m. to learn more about the course!\nhttps://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJMkd-Csqz8rGtx7OZFm7rbnL9GSLW9UmEdi\n
