SUMMARY:Academic Integrity Awareness Week
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for the Second Annual Faculty of Science Academic Integrity Awareness Week. We would like to invite Faculty, Instructors, and Staff to a week of highlighting people, workshops, and support to showcase academic integrity and learning in the Faculty of Science at York. The focus of this year’s academic integrity week is increasing awareness.\nDates: Monday, August 29 – Thursday, September 1, 2022\nTime: 10am – 11am EST, except Monday, August 29 which is NOON\nTopics: Each day we will be hosting a live zoom presentation on different topics\nFor more information and the full event schedule, please visit the Faculty of Science ( https://www.yorku.ca/science/academic-integrity-awareness-week/ ) website.\nRegister Now\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/academic-integrity-awareness-week/
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Science:MAILTO:fscomms@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Science
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/2022_AcademicIntegrityAwareness-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
