TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Summer 2022 Undergraduate Research Conference
DESCRIPTION:On August 18, 2022, the Faculty of Science will host the annual Summer Undergraduate Research Conference. The conference is an opportunity for recipients of NSERC Undergraduate Summer Research Awards (USRA), Dean’s Undergraduate Research Awards (DURA), and York Science Scholars Awards (YSSA) to present their summer research and to meet other awardees.\nFor full details, visit the Faculty of Science ( https://www.yorku.ca/science/research/undergraduate-research/summer-2022-undergraduate-research-conference/ ) website.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/summer-2022-undergraduate-research-conference/
