SUMMARY:Meditation Focused on Academics & Life Challenges (Drop-In)
DESCRIPTION:Scott Pope, a trained psychotherapist, from Student Counselling, Health and Well-being will provide an array of meditation styles that will help you to de-stress and increase positivity as it relates to your academic challenges and overall life challenges. A few types of meditation styles Pope focuses on are progressive relaxation, visualization, loving-kindness, focused and body scan. These are drop in sessions and do not require registration.\nJoin Zoom Meeting: https://yorku.zoom.us/j/93343794878?pwd=ZVRncmFWYXF2ckhXRFpHVkZGeUNLdz09Meeting ID: 933 4379 4878Passcode: 605157\n
