SUMMARY:Designing a Meaningful Career
DESCRIPTION:Join this webinar to learn how to develop a holistic approach to your career exploration, discover how to identify feelings of languishing, and gain tips on building your resilience. You will also be introduced to online resources and the range of hybrid supports Career Education & Development provides to help you create a meaningful future.\n
