SUMMARY:Can You Dig It?
DESCRIPTION:The Native Plant Garden at HNES (Health, Nursing, and Environmental Studies) invites you to a lunch and gardening session on June 21 from 11 a.m. to 2 p.m.\n\nCelebrate the successful fruiting of our pawpaw tree! \nHelp weed some invasive garlic mustard to restore the true pre-COVID-19 beauty of our garden\nLearn about native species and bring some seeds to your garden\n\nRSVP to attend at silvasol@yorku.ca. \n
