SUMMARY:Bringing Your Whole Self to Work w/ SAGA and TBLGAY
DESCRIPTION:Join the Sexuality and Gender Advocacy (SAGA) Alumni Network at York U on June 30 at noon. Two speakers will be sharing their journey of transitioning from school to work and discussing the importance of bringing their whole selves to work. A moderated group discussion will follow. The two speakers will be Israa (She/Her) and Zoey (She/Her), and the discussion will be moderated by TBLGAY. Come share with us the things that make you YOU and how you bring those everywhere you go!\nTo register, please go to this link:\nhttps://www.universe.com/events/bringing-your-whole-self-to-work-wsaga-tickets-KD674Y\n
