SUMMARY:FGS Webinar: Vanier CGS Info Session (Summer 2022)
DESCRIPTION:The Vanier Canada Graduate Scholarships (Vanier CGS) aims to attract and retain world-class doctoral students by supporting students who demonstrate both leadership skills and a high standard of scholarly achievement in graduate studies in social sciences and humanities, natural sciences and engineering, and health.\nThis Information Session will provide an overview of the award and the application process. There will also be an opportunity to hear from current Vanier recipient(s) and time for a Q&A period.\nPlease note, the program will take place on Wednesday, June 15, 2022 from 1:00–2:00pm\nRSVP | https://fgs.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=200668 ( https://fgs.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=200668 )\n
URL:https://fgs.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=200668
ORGANIZER;CN=Faculty of Graduate Studies:MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
