SUMMARY:Exploring Gender: Finding self, community, and support during PRIDE
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever questioned your gender? Are you unsure of what gender exploration could look like? Want to know how to access gender affirming care – including HRT and surgeries? Do you want to connect with other trans and non-binary folx during Pride?\nJoin us for an hour of conversations and gender exploration, facilitated by Jay Jonah. Jay is a trans-identified social worker with 10+ years of experience supporting trans folx from across the gender spectrum.\nFor access to this virtual event, please email Student Counselling, Health & Well-being at schw@yorku.ca ( mailto:schw@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/exploring-gender-finding-self-community-and-support-during-pride/
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies,Pride Month,Student Counselling, Health &amp; Well-being
LOCATION:Zoom
