SUMMARY:Issues and Impacts of Misogynoir (REDI Series)
DESCRIPTION:This is an interactive session where participants discuss the issue of misogynoir, which shows how sexism and racism manifest in Black women’s lives to create intersecting forms of oppression.” Participants explore the detrimental impacts of internalized racism as well as engage in a discussion about healing and self-care.\nSign up here: https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=301 ( https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=301 )\nThis session is part of the Summer 2022 REDI mini-series on Gender & Sexuality Inclusion and is being delivered in recognition of Pride Month. Join us for other REDI sessions ( https://rights.info.yorku.ca/redipd-summer/ ) and special events throughout June. ( https://www.yorku.ca/yupride/ )\n \n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/issues-and-impacts-of-misogynoir-redi-series/
