SUMMARY:Scholars’ Hub @ Home | Pandemic possibilities: Sexuality, gender and youth in the time of COVID-19
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Professor Jen Gilbert, Faculty of Education\nHow will stay-at-home orders, virtual schooling, canceled proms, viral TikTok dances, boredom, and omnipresent doom inspire, or perhaps constrain, new sexual and gender formations? This presentation explores how the experience of living with and through the pandemic has shaped young people’s sense of their genders and sexualities.\nRegister: https://bit.ly/3PPPGsq ( https://bit.ly/3PPPGsq )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/scholars-hub-pandemic-possibilities-sexuality-gender-and-youth-in-the-time-of-covid-19/
