SUMMARY:Alumni Networks |  Master of Financial Accountability alumni network: Interview tips and networking
DESCRIPTION:Join us Wednesday, May 25 at 6:30pm ET for a relevant and engaging talk by Mike Mokhtar (MFAc ’13), owner of Mike Mokhtar Personal Corporation, titled “How to Control an Interview.” Afterwards, audience members will have the opportunity to ask Mike questions and further benefit from his insight.\nThe evening continues in breakout rooms, each hosted by a leader from our alumni network with expertise in a different field. Leaders will first introduce themselves and then host breakout room discussions about their field of expertise. We hope you will bring some questions of your own to ask our experts! Participants are divided based on interests stated on the registration form.\nRegister: https://bit.ly/3PqPCPM ( https://bit.ly/3PqPCPM )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/alumni-networks-master-of-financial-accountability-alumni-network-interview-tips-and-networking/
ORGANIZER;CN=York Alumni Engagement:MAILTO:alumnievents@yorku.ca
