SUMMARY:OMNI Distinguished Lecture Series on Modelling of Infectious Diseases
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to join OMNI-RÉUNIS’ second lecture as part of our Distinguished Lecture Series of 2022! We’ve invited Dr. Matt Keeling to present on “COVID-19 in the UK: Data, Models, Projections and Policy.” \nRegister here: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJIlce2srDMqEtCoyaUUo1LuQcoxRSFt84JY ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJIlce2srDMqEtCoyaUUo1LuQcoxRSFt84JY )\n—\nOMNI-REUNIS 2022 Distinguished Lecture Series ( https://omni-reunis.ca/omni-reunis-distinguished-lecture-series/ )\nTitle: COVID-19 in the UK: Data, Models, Projections and Policy\nSpeaker: Dr. Matt Keeling, Professor in the Mathematics Institute and the School of Life Sciences at the University of Warwick (UK), Director of Zeeman Institute (SBIDER), and Deputy Director of Mathematics for Real-World Systems Centre for Doctoral Training\nDate and time: June 1, 2022 from 11 a.m. to 12:15 p.m. (EDT)\nAbstract: click here -> https://bit.ly/3Nh0cH8 ( https://bit.ly/3Nh0cH8 )\nModerator: Dr. Mark Lewis, Senior CRC in Mathematical Biology, Professor in the Departments of Mathematical and Statistical Sciences and Biological Sciences at the University of Alberta and Co-Director of OMNI-RÉUNIS\nLanguage of talk: English\nRegistration: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJIlce2srDMqEtCoyaUUo1LuQcoxRSFt84JY ( https://can01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fyorku.zoom.us%2Fmeeting%2Fregister%2FtJIlce2srDMqEtCoyaUUo1LuQcoxRSFt84JY&data=05%7C01%7Chelene.carabin%40umontreal.ca%7Cf2581500276f4320654408da377155da%7Cd27eefec2a474be7981e0f8977fa31d8%7C1%7C0%7C637883257155009795%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&sdata=EOmnI6SHnLFK1dhrqABSPw56sCce2Rh6Kntt5H3XveM%3D&reserved=0 )\nIf you have any questions about the event, do not hesitate to contact us at omni-reunis@york.ca ( mailto:omni-reunis@york.ca ). Kindly share this invitation with your networks!\nOrganizers: Dr. Huaiping Zhu (York University), Dr. Hélène Carabin (Université de Montréal), Dr. Mark Lewis (University of Alberta), Dr. Arne Ruckert (University of Ottawa), and Natasha Ketter (York University)\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/omni-distinguished-lecture-series-on-modelling-of-infectious-diseases-2/
