SUMMARY:LaMarsh Graduate Student Symposium
DESCRIPTION:You are cordially invited to this year’s virtual LaMarsh Graduate Student Symposium, where we recognize the students who received the 2021-2022 Graduate Student Research Award and learn about their work.\nThe event will also feature a panel discussion on the topic of “Community and Participatory Based Research” which will be moderated by  LaMarsh Director Jonathan Weiss.\nWe are happy to announce our panel discussion will feature multiple faculties celebrating the interdisciplinary nature of LaMarsh. With a desire to ensure a variety of perspectives, we will hear from faculty, post-docs as well as graduate students on the panel.\nPlease register in advance for this meeting using the following link:\nhttps://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYtd-6tpz4rEtRmjbKD1EnKX26xQjjZ6uMR ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYtd-6tpz4rEtRmjbKD1EnKX26xQjjZ6uMR )\nAfter registering, you will receive a confirmation email containing information about joining the meeting.\nWe look forward to seeing you there!\n
