SUMMARY:Organize your Argument
DESCRIPTION:You’ve done your research, and you’re ready to go. But how to put all your work in an order that makes sense? What parts of your research do you keep and what parts do you leave out? In this Writing Centre workshop, registered students will bring either a completed Introduction, or a (mostly) completed draft suitable for reverse outlining and revise it using the practical advice provided by the instructor. Peer and then Instructor feedback will follow. You’ll need a stable internet connection, microphone, and a word processor to participate (group work included).\nPlease register in order to receive the Zoom link.\n \nRegister here\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/organize-your-argument-2/
