SUMMARY:Remote Experiential Education: Mobile Live Streaming of Outdoors Field Trips into the Virtual Classroom (TIF Presentation)
DESCRIPTION:What are the best technologies to use to live stream from the field into the virtual classroom, both from the instructor’s and from the student’s point of view?\nEarly results will be presented, following hands-on research with different devices, streaming platforms and pedagogical tools in two courses, during Summer and Fall 2021, based on a grant from the YU Academic Innovation Fund, Category III, Scholarship of Teaching and Learning (SoTL). (Charles-Antoine Rouyer, Glendon)\nZoom Access (Room 3): https://yorku.zoom.us/j/98031811832  ( https://yorku.zoom.us/j/98031811832 )\nFull Schedule: https://event.fourwaves.com/tif2022/schedule ( https://event.fourwaves.com/tif2022/schedule )\n
