SUMMARY:IBM Campus Recruitment Event – Fall 2022 Co-op Opportunities
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\nUnderstanding the hiring process and what’s important to make your resume stand out can be a challenge….but have no fear, we are here to help! Mark your calendars for 2:30 PM EST on May 24, 2022 because the members of the Campus Talent Acquisition team will be presenting on how to get your application noticed by hiring teams and what goes into the application process! During this session, they will cover resume-writing best practices beyond the surface level tips, and what makes an ideal candidate for IBM (hint: work experience is not always the most important detail!) You’ll also have time to ask your questions to the team. Looking forward to seeing you there!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nRegister here\n\n\n\n
