SUMMARY:BlackBerry Campus Recruitment Event – Fall 2022 Co-op Opportunities
DESCRIPTION:in the Campus team at BlackBerry for an info session – learn about what BlackBerry is all about today. The Campus recruiters will give you insight on how to work towards joining BlackBerry for the Fall term in many different student roles across the organization.\nWhat we will present:\n• Co-op positions that can range between 4 or 8 months starting in September 2022\n• How & When to apply for 2022 Fall Co-ops\n• Opportunity to discuss the Internship Roles with the Campus Recruiters\n• Q & A session\nRegister here\n \n
