SUMMARY:Dig 4 the Future Reverse 4’s Beach Volleyball Tournament
DESCRIPTION:YU Dig 4 the Future is hosting three tournaments in one at the electric Polson Pier! Join us Saturday, June 11 for our first annual reverse 4’s co-ed beach volleyball tournament. There’s fun for all and proceeds support the Mosher Silver Women’s Volleyball Legacy Award in providing York University Women’s Volleyball Athletes with Scholarships.  \nBuild your team, choose your division, and get signed-up today!  Don’t want to compete but have lots of fun? Consider our recreation division! Super competitive and have college and university experience, join our competitive division. Are you 35 years old or over and have that competitive itch? Join ourmaster’s division! \nRegister HERE ( https://york.universitytickets.com/w/event2.aspx?id=1518&r=18a1ef9a63664ee69a8e026f3979ae03 ) today!\nIf you need assistance or are a single player looking for a team, email Jen Neilson at neilsonj@yorku.ca.\n
