TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Meditation Focused on Academics & Life Challenges (Drop-Ins)
DESCRIPTION:Scott Pope, a trained psychotherapist, from Student Counselling, Health and Well-being will provide an array of meditation styles that will help you to de-stress and increase positivity as it relates to your academic challenges and overall life challenges. A few types of meditation styles Pope focuses on are progressive relaxation, visualization,  loving-kindness, focused and body scan. These are drop-in sessions and do not require registration.\nJoin Zoom Meeting – https://yorku.zoom.us/j/97919390915?pwd=RkpzQWVFUm9LVHpwRjkxZ2MybXZ2Zz09 ( https://yorku.zoom.us/j/97919390915?pwd=RkpzQWVFUm9LVHpwRjkxZ2MybXZ2Zz09 )\nMeeting ID: 979 1939 0915\nPasscode: 622871\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/meditation-focused-on-academics-life-challenges-drop-ins-13/
