SUMMARY:Academic Survival Kit for Transfer Students: Meet the Learning Commons Team!
DESCRIPTION:Do you wonder what academic resources are available at York University to help you navigate academic tasks and assignments? If so, this workshop is for you!\nThe Academic Survival Kit for Transfer Students will provide you with:\n• An introduction to the Learning Commons, where our friendly partners can help you learn key academic skills to succeed at York.\n• Information on the Writing Centre resources and services that enhance your ability to produce effective academic and professional writing.\n• Key takeaways on how the ESL Open Learning Centre can help you improve your academic English language skills including reading, listening, speaking, and writing essays.\n• A strong understanding of how the Libraries can help you learn strategies and approaches to engage in effective library research for assignments and develop solid academic integrity and citation practices.\nRegistration link: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYkdO-hrDopGtMFkvVRl79CsItiYNCoRU2N ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYkdO-hrDopGtMFkvVRl79CsItiYNCoRU2N )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/academic-survival-kit-for-transfer-students-meet-the-learning-commons-team-2/
ORGANIZER;CN=ACMAPS:MAILTO:acmaps@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Students
LOCATION:(URL will be provided in the email confirmation)
END:VEVENT
