SUMMARY:Vancouver Alumni Happy Hour
DESCRIPTION:PLEASE NOTE: The venue for this event has changed! We’re excited to accommodate even more alumni at District Bar and Restaurant on Robson St.\nVancouver, it’s been a while.\nYou’re invited to join York University at our Vancouver Alumni Happy Hour Mixer on Thursday, May 19. Meet fellow York alumni in your city and enjoy an evening of conversation and connection, after so long apart. Your first drink is on us – all alumni will receive a complimentary drink ticket and appetizers will be served.\nA delegation from York will be in attendance to share the latest info from campus. We can’t wait to meet you!\nAttendance is free however, registration is required.\nRegister: https://bit.ly/3vebhCI ( https://bit.ly/3vebhCI )\nCOVID-19 restrictions: This event will follow all B.C. provincial government and local health authority (Vancouver Coastal Health) guidelines.\nPlease contact Ellie Coult, Manager, Regional Alumni Programs for more details ecoult@yorku.ca ( mailto:ecoult@yorku.ca ).\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/vancouver-alumni-happy-hour/
ORGANIZER;CN=York Alumni Engagement:MAILTO:alumnievents@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni,Regional Alumni Events
LOCATION:121 Robson St, Vancouver, BC V6B 6P5
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/YorkU-Alumni-Regional-Event-Vancouver.png
END:VEVENT
