SUMMARY:Scholars’ Hub @ Home | Ukrainian sovereignty and identity: A critical discussion on the war in Ukraine
DESCRIPTION:Karen Krasny, Associate Professor, Faculty of Education\nThe world is witnessing Russia’s unprovoked attack on Ukraine in what is the largest conventional, nation-state to nation-state military attack on a European democracy since the second world war. This presentation will provide attendees with critical insights into the events leading up to the present invasion and what is at stake geo-politically and within the context of escalating global humanitarian crises.\nRegister: https://bit.ly/3Kf9Yb1 ( https://bit.ly/3Kf9Yb1 )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/scholars-hub-ukrainian-sovereignty-and-identity-a-critical-discussion-on-the-war-in-ukraine/
