SUMMARY:Scholars’ Hub @ Home | Bee the Change
DESCRIPTION:Sheila Colla, Associate Professor, York Research Chair (Tier 2) in Interdisciplinary Conversation Science, Faculty of Environmental and Urban Change\nAmro Zayed, York Research Chair in Genomics and Professor, Department of Biology, Faculty of Science\nJust ahead of World Bee Day on May 20, tune in to hear more about the status of pollinators here in Canada. Dr. Colla and Dr. Zayed will discuss how the average person can help save declining pollinators and contribute important scientific data while having fun!\nRegister: https://bit.ly/3vHHpxB ( https://bit.ly/3vHHpxB )\n
