SUMMARY:GRADitude | Investing: Where to start?
DESCRIPTION:Thinking about investing but not sure how to get started? Join this session with York U alumnus Fahad Rana (BA ’17) who will cover a whole range of topics for beginners including how to invest and what vehicle to invest in (TFSA/RRSP, etc.), and insight on where to focus your money when starting out (stocks, index funds, ETFs, etc.)\nHosting this event is Alamgir Khandwala (BAS ’17), Manager, Corporate Accounting and Financial Reporting at Moneris and 2022 York U Top30 Alumni Under 30 recipient. He will be joined by our speaker, alumnus Fahad Rana (BA ’17), Portfolio Analyst & Trader at Scotiabank.\nRegistration is required in advance, and the audience will have an opportunity to ask questions.\nRegister: https://bit.ly/3vcq6We  ( https://bit.ly/3vcq6We )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/graditude-investing-where-to-start/
ORGANIZER;CN=York Alumni Engagement:MAILTO:alumnievents@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni
LOCATION:Virtual
