SUMMARY:Designing a Meaningful Career for Masters and PhD Students Only
DESCRIPTION:This webinar is customized for masters and PhD students. Join this webinar to learn how to develop a holistic approach to your career exploration, discover how to identify feelings of languishing, and gain tips on building your resilience as a graduate student. You will also be introduced to online resources and the range of hybrid supports Career Education & Development provides to help you create a meaningful future. In partnership with the Faculty of Graduate Studies (FGS).\nTo register for this event, login to  Experience York. ( http://careers.yorku.ca/experienceyork )\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/designing-a-meaningful-career-for-masters-and-phd-students-only/
