DESCRIPTION:Join us to hear what we learned from surveys of managers and frontline workers in Ontario immigrant-serving agencies about the impacts of the pandemic and its lessons for the future of the settlement sector.\nChair: Debbie Douglas, OCASI\nPresenter: John Shields, Ryerson University\nDiscussant: Tara Bedard, Immigration Partnership, Region of Waterloo\nThis event will be streamed live at https://youtu.be/BQugGClSgyc\n
