DESCRIPTION:Open to all York University Community Members\nIn support of North American Occupational, Safety and Health Week, the Canadian Centre for Occupational Health and Safety (CCOHS) will be providing a session on mental fitness and relaxation!\nImprove your focus, lower your stress and increase your productivity with mental fitness. Pause, relax and reflect as you exercise your brain and join in a short-guided meditation session.\nTo register, please click here ( https://dohs.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=82049 ).\n
