SUMMARY:NAOSH Week: Athletics & Recreation – Yoga Retreat
DESCRIPTION:Open to all York University Community Members\nIn support of North American Occupational, Safety and Health Week, Athletics & Recreation will be providing a Yoga Retreat!\nIntegral yoga for the mind and body, Yoga Retreat promotes holistic health, de-stress, and well-being by strengthening, increasing endurance, and stabilizing the mind, body and breathing.*\nMove towards wellness in your own unique way through postures, breathing exercises, and a wide range of meditations.**\n*Breathing exercises will include activating balancing and calming breathing exercises.\n**Meditations will range from: active relaxation, moments of mindfulness, focus on breathing, affirmation-based meditation, and visualization meditation.\nTo register, please click here ( https://dohs.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=82049 ).\n
