SUMMARY:Mindfulness to Celebrate the End of Exam Season
DESCRIPTION:How is the quality of your self-care during exam season? Still have some exams/finals to get through? We are cheering you on as we wrap up the winter semester. You’re so close!\nCome take a break with us and celebrate your successes through mindfulness practice. We have two practices for folks to try out. One is a sitting meditation practice with the focus on  letting go and radical self-acceptance. The other is an expressive dance/movement experience to help you plant new seeds of hope.\nPresented by mindfulness teacher Scott Pope and DMT (Dance Movement Therapist) Shaila Khan.\n*No dance or mindfulness experience is necessary to attend\nhttps://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJcscO6prz0tGdG8AmOFtpJ1tBGWko9Nt5G5\nPlease log into your York U Zoom account in order to access this workshop.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/mindfulness-to-celebrate-the-end-of-exam-season/
