SUMMARY:2022 York University Research Awards Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Research excellence and innovation at York University are flourishing. Our researchers − recognized pioneers in their fields − are deeply committed to advancing innovative research projects across the vast spectrum of disciplines for the social, economic, cultural, environmental and other well-being of society.\nEach spring, the President and the Vice-President Research & Innovation of York University take the opportunity to acknowledge York’s research award winners, and recognize the remarkable achievements of York’s community over the past year.\nThe 2022 awards also recognize York University researchers for their prominent role in better understanding the impacts of COVID-19.\nWatch the live-stream event on April 19 and join in on the conversation online by tweeting to @YUResearch with the hashtag #YUResearch.\n \n
URL:https://www.yorku.ca/research/york-president-vpri-acknowledge-research-leaders/
