SUMMARY:Dean’s Leadership Dialogues | Jasper Cheung (MBA ’90), President, Amazon Japan GK
DESCRIPTION:Join Schulich School of Business Dean Detlev Zwick for a dynamic and thoughtful fireside chat with Jasper Cheung (MBA ’90), president of Amazon Japan GK on Wednesday, May 11 at 8 a.m. EDT. This event will be live-streamed.\nCheung joined Amazon after more than 10 years of corporate finance experience for companies in Asia and North America. He began his Amazon career as finance director for Amazon.co.jp in December 2000, before becoming president of Amazon, K.K. in April 2001, and being named president of Amazon, G.K. in May 2016.\nRegister now at https://schulich.yorku.ca/about/our-dean/leadership-dialogues/dld-jasper-cheung/  ( https://schulich.yorku.ca/about/our-dean/leadership-dialogues/dld-jasper-cheung/ )\n
