SUMMARY:Newly Admitted: The Transfer Process with the Faculty of Science
DESCRIPTION:Are you a new transfer student in the Faculty of Science for Fall 2022? If yes, this session is for you! Attend and learn how to dissect the transfer credit assessment, terminologies used on the assessment, various roles of university staff, how credits are allocated at York depending on your program, how much time you will be spending at York U to complete your degree, what is a program checklist and why is it important.\nThis session is brought to you in collaboration with Recruitment, Science Advising and the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-Time Students (ACMAPS).\nRegistration information – https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJMsceGrqTgrHteGV9sxS_PLKS-W1uKMspco ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJMsceGrqTgrHteGV9sxS_PLKS-W1uKMspco )\n
