SUMMARY:SUNDIAL Premiere
DESCRIPTION:This winter, 16 students participated in a course called: Shooting the Set (Isolation Edition) with course instructor, Ingrid Veninger. Join these students across the School of the Arts, Media, Performance and Design (AMPD) from Theatre, Film Production, Screenwriting, Media Arts and Studies as they present a very unique collaborative film project entitled SUNDIAL. Even though these students have never met in person, this collective of creatives managed to complete this exciting feature film project during an 11 week period.\nSUNDIAL PREMIERE & Live Q&A\nWednesday, April 6, 2022\n3:00 PM\nREGISTER HERE ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJwvdO6rrjovG9OZg2e-BSDrfL9gfwf79OwH )\nVirtual Event\nFILMMAKERS\nSHEEL ACHNANI\nQIMENG (LILY) AN\nDAMILOLA AYODEJI\nZEESHAN BAIG\nTHEO BOW\nTAYLOR CROWLEY\nALI HAJILOU\nCINDY HUYNH\nMARIANNA KOKKINOS\nSIDDHARTH KOYAL\nMARIA KURI\nANGIE LAWRENCE\nISABELLA (BELLA) LISCIO\nCAROLINE MANJALY\nNATALIA MORALES-CACERES\nNICHOLAS (NICK) REID\n \n\n
