SUMMARY:Employer Recruitment Session: City of Toronto – Spring/Summer 2022 Jobs
DESCRIPTION:The City of Toronto has many different part time jobs available each year for people aged 14 and over. Current recreation job postings are available online.\nRecreation jobs offer seasonal and year-round part-time opportunities with flexible work hours and quality work teams in a unionized environment.\nParticipants can expect the following:\n• What jobs are currently available for Spring/Summer 2022\n• What prospective applicants can expect in these available jobs\n• An overview of the application process\n• Tips on interview preparation\n• Opportunity to ask questions\nProgram Area Representatives and Recruitment Officers will be available to answer any questions related to specific jobs and the application process.\nRecreation jobs offer seasonal and year-round part-time opportunities with flexible work hours and quality work teams in a unionized environment.\nFor more information about this event and to register, visit the Career Education & Development Calendar in Experience York: careers.yorku.ca/experienceyork\n
