SUMMARY:Your rights and freedoms: Is it important to know about them?
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wondered about your rights and freedoms? What about the right of others? When would it be appropriate or reasonable for the government to limit your rights? If you want to be an advocate for your own rights or the rights of others, this is the workshop for you! Join the Canadian Civil Liberties Association (CCLA) for a fun and engaging workshop that looks critically at these important issues.\nRegister here\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/your-rights-and-freedoms-is-it-important-to-know-about-them/
