SUMMARY:Career Conversations: Spotlighting Black Excellence
DESCRIPTION:Interested in connecting with accomplished Black professionals? Thinking about how you can achieve career success in your field of interest?\nJoin us on March 22 to meet our panel of accomplished alumni and hear about their successes and challenges pursuing careers in a range of different industries. Panelists will share their career journeys, offer insights and tips for job searching and provide information on recruitment in their field for current students and new graduates.\nFollowing a moderated panel discussion, you’ll have the opportunity to ask your own questions.\n#BlackExcellence #BlackStudentSuccess\nREGISTER HERE: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJwlfumtrz0oHtF3pnRff3ZcrJKgz-cZ31BH ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJwlfumtrz0oHtF3pnRff3ZcrJKgz-cZ31BH )\n
