SUMMARY:Peace and Security in Indo-Pacific Asia: IR Perspectives in Context
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\nPeace and Security in Indo-Pacific Asia is for the informed, the interested, and the engaged. Sorpong Peou brings together the skills of the pedagogue with the knowledge of the scholar. Peou’s excellent book provides both the lay reader and the specialist with six important theoretical frameworks which should provide the basis for better appreciation of what a security community in Indo-Pacific Asia means in our world today. There are very few scholars who understand the region like Peou.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nRegister here \n\n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/peace-and-security-in-indo-pacific-asia-ir-perspectives-in-context/
