SUMMARY:Dean’s Leadership Dialogues | Vito Paladino
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to join Schulich Dean Detlev Zwick for a dynamic and thoughtful fireside chat with Vito Paladino (BBA ‘99, MBA ‘11), president of Audi Canada on Thursday, April 7 at 7 p.m.\nThis event will be held in person and will be live-streamed.\nRSVP Now ( https://schulich.yorku.ca/about/our-dean/leadership-dialogues/dld-vito-paladino/ )\nVito Paladino (BBA ‘99, MBA ‘11) is the president of Audi Canada. In 2013 Vito moved to Audi Canada as the director for sales operations leading the company to new records. Audi Canada became the fastest-growing premium car brand with an increase in sales of 75 per cent over five years. He has been the president of Audi Canada since September 1, 2020.\n\nThe Dean’s Leadership Dialogues feature our School’s most accomplished alumni and business leaders from around the world in a thoughtful and engaging fireside chat with Schulich Dean Detlev Zwick.\n\n\n\n\nThe Leadership Dialogues provide a dynamic and interactive platform for members of the Schulich community and the public to engage with inspirational thought leaders and business pioneers on a wide range of issues – everything from leadership and sustainability to diversity and digital transformation. All the events will be recorded, so those who cannot attend can watch them later.\nLearn more about the Dean’s Leadership Dialogues. ( https://schulich.yorku.ca/about/our-dean/leadership-dialogues/ )\n\n\n\n\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/deans-leadership-dialogues-vito-paladino-bba-99-mba-11-president-audi-canada/
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni,Schulich School of Business,Students
LOCATION:McEwen Auditorium, Seymour Schulich Building @ Seymour Schulich Bldg, 111 Ian MacDonald Blvd, North York, ON M3J 1P3, Canada
END:VEVENT
