DESCRIPTION:\n\n\nVCP’s Show Choir performs its annual show, comprised of new arrangements and mashups of Broadway showtunes and Top 40 hits. Selections will include songs from Hamilton, Moulin Rouge, Dirty Dancing, In the Heights, A Chorus Line, Aladdin, Cinderella, Mulan, and songs made famous by the Black Eyed Peas, Green Day, Harry Styles, Spice Girls, Black Pink and ABBA!\nMusic Directed by Brian Goldenberg\nChoreographed by Julianna Greco\nAssistant Music Directed by Isabel Misquitta-Yip\n\nPay-What-You-Can-Afford Tickets $10, $15, $25, $50 or “name your own price”\n\nWebsite: yorku.ca/laps/vcp ( http://yorku.ca/laps/vcp )\nEmail: vcp@yorku.ca\nFacebook: @VanierCollegeProductions I\nnstagram: @vancproductions\nTwitter: @VanCProductions\nYouTube: @VanCProductions\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nRegister here\n\n\n\n\n
