SUMMARY:Terminal Station
DESCRIPTION:Terminal Station is a drawing exhibition by Visual Arts majors Abbie Mauno and Yuki Tam. We invite you to sit with us for a moment and experience a world where dreams and reality blur together, where discomfort and relief co-exist, and where the mundane transforms into the philosophical. A few seconds can change your life forever.\nExhibition: March 21-25-25, 2022\nGales Gallery ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/gales-gallery/ )\nHours: M-F (9am-4pm)\nOpening Reception: March 23, 2022 (1pm-3pm)\n\n
