SUMMARY:Jazz Festival (2022)
DESCRIPTION:JAZZ FESTIVAL  (MARCH 15-17 2022)\nThe York University Jazz Festival, running March 15-17, showcases rising young talent from York University’s  Department of Music.\nTUESDAY MARCH 15\n8:00 – 9:30 PM  – Jazz Orchestra |Directed by Mike Cadó ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/mike-cado/ )\nTICKETS:\nLivestream (Sliding Scale: $5-$25)\nIn-Person ($15) – Tribute Communities Recital Hall ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/tribute-communities-recital-hall/ )\nBOX OFFICE ( https://music.ampd.yorku.ca/box-office/ )\nWEDNESDAY MARCH 16\n7:30 – 8:00 PM  – Small Ensembles   |Directed by Roy Patterson ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/roy-patterson/ )\n8:15 – 8:45 PM  – Small Ensembles  | Directed by Anthony Michelli ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/anthony-michelli/ )\n9:00 – 9:30 PM  – Small Ensembles  | Directed by Artie Roth ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/artie-roth/ )\n9:45 -10:15 PM  – Small Ensembles   | Directed by Sundar Viswanathan ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/sundar-viswanathan/ )\nTICKETS:\nLivestream Only (Sliding Scale: $5-$25)\nBOX OFFICE ( https://music.ampd.yorku.ca/box-office/ )\nTHURSDAY MARCH 17 \nTICKETS: Livestream Only (livestream tickets – sliding scale $5-$25)\n7:30- 8:00 PM  – Small Ensembles  | directed by Lorne Lofsky ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/lorne-lofsky/ )\n8:15- 8:45 PM  – Small Ensembles  | directed by Kelly Jefferson ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/kelly-jefferson/ )\n9:00 -9:30 PM  – Small Ensembles  | directed by Kevin Turcotte ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/kevin-turcotte/ )\n9:45 -10:15 PM  – Small Ensembles   | directed by Noam Lemish ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/profile/noam-lemish/ )\nTICKETS:\nLivestream Only (Sliding Scale: $5-$25)\nBOX OFFICE ( https://music.ampd.yorku.ca/box-office/ )\n \n \n
