SUMMARY:“Reflections on relating and situating key terms: Indigenization and decolonization”
DESCRIPTION:Through the shared reflections and experiences of our presenter, this presentation will build awareness and foster understanding to support effective and positive application of key terms within institutional and mainstream settings. Discussion will focus on the key terms of Indigenization and decolonization, and reflect on how they may situate and relate to enable Indigenous resurgence and self-determination while building institutions serving for the mutual benefit of all in Canada.\nDaniol Clair Coles\n \nRegistration\n \n \n \n \n
