SUMMARY:Dean’s Leadership Dialogues | The Leader’s Compass: Vision and Values
DESCRIPTION:The Dean’s Leadership Dialogues feature our School’s most accomplished alumni and business leaders from around the world in a thoughtful and engaging fireside chat with Schulich Dean Detlev Zwick.\n\n\n\n\nThe Leadership Dialogues provide a dynamic and interactive platform for members of the Schulich community and the public to engage with inspirational thought leaders and business pioneers on a wide range of issues – everything from leadership and sustainability to diversity and digital transformation. All the events will be recorded, so those who cannot attend can watch them later.\nLearn more about the Dean’s Leadership Dialogues. ( https://schulich.yorku.ca/about/our-dean/leadership-dialogues/ )\n\nMarch 1, 2022, 7:00 pm (virtual)\nThe Leader’s Compass: Vision and Values\nKim Parlee (IMBA ’95)\nVP, TD Wealth, and Host of Moneytalk on BNN Bloomberg and CTV\nDuring her time at BNN, Kim has conducted over 15,000 live interviews with CEOs, prime ministers, and other leaders. Together, they will share their insights and stories about the role of personal values and vision in these ambiguous and challenging times.\nRegister: https://bit.ly/3GUbcXn ( https://bit.ly/3GUbcXn )\n\n\n\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/deans-leadership-dialogues-the-leaders-compass-vision-and-values/
