SUMMARY:Moving Forward: Women in Leadership
DESCRIPTION:Featuring women alumni from York who are currently in leadership roles. This webinar will talk about what inspires this diverse group of women leaders, how they have overcome obstacles along their career paths, and more. Join our panelists as we discuss their path to success and hear valuable advice and insights.\nOur panelists:\n\nDeryn Rizzi, MA, Disaster and Emergency Management ‘13, Fire Chief at City of Mississauga\nMarsha Greene, BA, Creative Writing, ‘03 Showrunner of The Porter (on CBC and BET+)\nSharon Zohar, CEO at The Big Push\n\nHosted by Lily M. Cho, Associate Dean, Global & Community Engagement.\nIncludes Q&A session.\n \nRegister Here \n
