SUMMARY:Summer Abroad Program, Information Session
DESCRIPTION:\nOur Summer Abroad program at Las Nubes EcoCampus will run from May to August 2022.\nThe emphasis of the program is on experiential education, building on our long-standing relationships with diverse communities and groups in Southern Costa Rica. Courses usually take a community-based approach, developing collaborative projects that provide learning opportunities.\nThe following is the schedule of courses offered in Summer 2022:\n\n\n\nMay 2 to May 11, 2022\nGL/SP/COMS 4608\nNarratives in/of Costa Rica. Individuals, Communities and their Voices (GL/SP/COMS 4608)\n\n\nMay 13 to May 22, 2022\nENVS 4810B\nEnvironmental Arts and Food Sovereignty in Costa Rica (ENVS 4810B)\n\n\nMay 13 to May 22, 2022\nGEOG 4050\nNature, Neoliberalism, Political Ecology: The Politics of Water in Costa Rica and Latin America (GEOG 4050)\n\n\nMay 24 to June 2, 2022\nEDUC 3700\nEducation for a Sustainable Future (EDUC 3700)\n\n\nJune 4 to June 13, 2022\nENVS 4120\nNatural History: Environmental Education in Costa Rica (ENVS 4120)\n\n\nJune 15 to June 24, 2022\nENVS 4446\nProtected Area Management in Costa Rica (ENVS 4446)\n\n\nJune 26 to July 5, 2022\nCVIL 4045\nFundamentals of Ecological Engineering\n\n\nJuly 7 to July 16, 2022\nIHST 4000\nDeterminants of Health: Local to Global\n\n\nJuly 18 to July 27, 2022\nHH/PSYC 3450/6710\nEnvironmental Psychology\n\n\nJuly 29 to August 7, 2022\nENVS 4215\nGlobalization and Indigenous Peoples (ENVS4215)\n\n\nAugust 9 to August 18, 2022\nENVS 4810A\nConservation and Development for Social-Environmental Sustainability and Well-being (ENVS 4810A)\n\n\n\nTo attend this session, register ( https://euc.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=100798 ) in advance.\nFor more information visit the Study Abroad ( https://lasnubes.euc.yorku.ca/education/programs/ ) section.\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/summer-abroad-program-information-session/
ORGANIZER;CN=Las Nubes Project:MAILTO:lasnubes@yorku.ca
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Environmental &amp; Urban Change
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/2022-Las-Nubes-Study-Abroad-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
