SUMMARY:“Last Stop: the Underground Railroad in St. Catharines.”
DESCRIPTION:Adrian Petry\nAdrian will explore the conditions which encouraged, at its peak, over 800 Freedom Seekers to settle in St. Catharines between the 1820s and 1860s after their journey on the Underground Railroad, and the narratives of their lives in Freedom.\n \nRegistration\n
