SUMMARY:Alumni Opportunities for Mature Students
DESCRIPTION:As you prepare to graduate as a Mature Student, York’s Alumni Engagement Team will answer your questions and make sure that you know how to make the most of alumni benefits and opportunities. We’ll highlight our new Alumni Perks app, featuring discounts to Blue Mountain, Canada’s Wonderland, York U gifts, and more! We’ll show you how to remain connected to other alumni through groups aligned with your studies, work, interests and region! We’ll even show you how to continue learning from your favourite York profs – but without assignments or exams!\nThis session will be presented by Aly Gampel, associate director, Alumni Programs, on behalf of the Alumni Engagement Team, & ACMAPS. Please feel free to send questions you’d like addressed to agampel@yorku.ca ( mailto:agampel@yorku.ca ).\nRegistration link:\nhttps://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJcpdumrrzgrHtcvuXH_vKkUgsoNGoTgsWYS ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJcpdumrrzgrHtcvuXH_vKkUgsoNGoTgsWYS )\n
