SUMMARY:Get To Know Us! EUC Black Caucus
DESCRIPTION:In light of the recently endorsed EUC Black Inclusion Action Plan 2020-2025, the first dialogue of the year will start off by highlighting the Black Caucus at the Faculty of Environment and Urban Change.\nThe group established 2019 is a student led group that represents and advocates for the collective interests of Black EUC students, graduates, undergraduates as well as recent graduates in all matters of departmental policy and action at York University. The EUC Black Caucus seeks to build community among Black EUC students, faculty, and the larger university, with consideration for the diverse experiences and interests of Black students.\nEvent Zoom link: https://yorku.zoom.us/j/98375327896?pwd=YVkyWkZzd0RyWmd6WnBsYkcyOENQdz09 ( https://yorku.zoom.us/j/98375327896?pwd=YVkyWkZzd0RyWmd6WnBsYkcyOENQdz09 )\n
