SUMMARY:SCLD Game Night: Among Us
DESCRIPTION:\nDrop by the first Game Night of the winter term!\nUnwind, take a break from studying and meet new people. Join in a variety of games such as Codenames, Among Us and more. Game nights are led by students on the Student Engagement Team, and will be hosting Among Us for the upcoming game night.\nThursday, Feb. 17 from 6 to 7:30 p.m. \nRegister here:\nhttps://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJcrceqorDkrGdO-r9wWvCo52pG35R0c–dz ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJcrceqorDkrGdO-r9wWvCo52pG35R0c--dz )\nCan’t wait to see you there!\n\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/scld-game-night-among-us/
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Liberal Arts &amp; Professional Studies
END:VEVENT
