SUMMARY:Perfecting Your Cover Letter
DESCRIPTION:This workshop is open to all students in the faculty of LA&PS, not just those seeking to join the Internship Program. The Zoom Link and password will be emailed to all registrants on the day of the webinar. This session will provide you with cover letter writing techniques, including: Writing effective cover letter introductions to grab the attention of the reader Using expository writing and the SAR (situation-action-result) formula to share stories Making your personal experiences and achievements relevant to the work of a company.\nLog in\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/perfecting-your-cover-letter-3/
ORGANIZER;CN=LA&amp;PS Experiential Education:MAILTO:lapsintr@yorku.ca, hbrempon@yorku.ca
