SUMMARY:Perfecting Your Resume
DESCRIPTION:This workshop is open to all students in the faculty of LA&PS, not just those seeking to join the Internship Program. The Zoom Link and password will be emailed to all registrants on the day of the webinar. This session will provide you with resume-writing techniques, including: Using a resume introduction to effectively bypass applicant tracking software (ATS) Showcasing your school projects and assignments as practical experience Articulating your skills and accomplishments when describing previous experiences.\nLog in\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/perfecting-your-resume-3/
