SUMMARY:Inclusion Week 2022 Fireside Chat: Solidarity and Liberation – How do we organize across difference?
DESCRIPTION:This panel discussion on solidarity will include explorations of historic and current, global and local efforts toward building more equitable and caring futures.\nGuest speakers include Shanese Indoowaaboo Steele, a writer, activist, facilitator and equity consultant with Shaneseanne Consulting; and Wazhmah Osman, a filmmaker, writer and assistant professor at Temple University.\nRegister here ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_Krt2ZhThS9SG73GLur1Biw ). For more information about the workshops, panellists and our keynote speaker, and to register, visit: https://rights.info.yorku.ca/inclusion-week-2022/.\n \n
