SUMMARY:Inclusion Week 2022 Workshop: The Ecology of Allyship (Part 2)
DESCRIPTION:This interactive workshop deepens the exploration of concepts of allyship and solidarity.\nThis is the second part of the Allyship session presented in collaboration with Student Community & Leadership Development (SCLD). This is not an introductory or beginner’s workshop.\nTo join this event, participants must have attended an Orienting Yourself to Allyship Part 1 session or have previous organizing experience across lines of shared identities. Email any questions or inquiries to chrwkshp@yorku.ca. ( mailto:chrwkshp@yorku.ca )\nRegister here ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJcrf-ysrjIpGNBsoWcyxFIycvyiWIrCBtxn ).\n
