SUMMARY:Leveraging Your PhD in STEM Outside of Academia Online Panel Discussion (For York PhD Students and Postdocs)
DESCRIPTION:PLEASE REGISTER HERE: https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_rgTmwxBJREqOLlE_W3RpUw ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_rgTmwxBJREqOLlE_W3RpUw )\nAre you interested in a career outside of the academy? Do you want to learn more about how to navigate the world of post-academic careers as a Ph.D.?\nDuring this online session, connect with professionals in areas such as government, think tanks, and non-academic research and learn more about hiring practices, employer expectations, and how to leverage higher education while exploring career opportunities. The panel will be followed by student Q & A  sessions where you will have the opportunity to ask the panelists your questions.\n
