SUMMARY:Leveraging Your PhD in Social Science and Humanities Outside of Academia Online Panel Discussion (For York PhD Students and Postdocs)
DESCRIPTION:PLEASE REGISTER HERE: https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_WaqdW1h3TXaMNi8btZwZLA ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_WaqdW1h3TXaMNi8btZwZLA )\n \nModerator: Carolyn\nDate: Wednesday, March 9, 2022\nTime: 2:00 – 4:00 p.m.\nLocation: Zoom\nAre you interested in a career outside of the academy? Do you want to learn more about how to navigate the world of post-academic careers as a Ph.D.?\nDuring this virtual panel, you will have the opportunity to connect with professionals that are currently leveraging their PhDs outside of academia. You will get the chance to learn more about hiring practices, employer expectations, and how to leverage your higher education while exploring career opportunities. The virtual panel will be followed by student Q & A  sessions where you will have the opportunity to ask the panelists your questions.\n
