SUMMARY:Picture a Scientist: A Lassonde EDI Panel Discussion
DESCRIPTION:When you picture a scientist, what do you see?\nJoin us for a panel discussion exploring equity, diversity and inclusion in science and engineering inspired by the documentary Picture a Scientist. We encourage everyone to watch the documentary prior to attending the panel discussion. It can be found through the York University Libraries and is available on Netflix.\nHear from a panel of engineers and scientists at varying career levels as they discuss the impact of this documentary, their experience as members of underrepresented groups in STEM, and how we can take action to make science more equitable for all.\nClick here to register.\n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/picture-a-scientist-a-lassonde-edi-panel-discussion/
