SUMMARY:Improving the Economy while Enhancing the Environment Dialogue (IEEED) Speaker Series
DESCRIPTION:Calling all students in Canadian universities: Have you heard about the SARIT Scholarship (www.saritscholarship.com ( http://www.saritscholarship.com/ )) where you can share your thoughts on what you would do if you were Prime Minister of Canada as well as win prizes including $100,000, $50,000 and $25,000 scholarships plus 20 micro-mobility electric vehicles.\nWould you like to learn from experts about critical issues that affect the economy and the environment, the link between them, and get the chance to ask challenging questions?\nCIFAL York and the Bergeron Entrepreneurship in Science and Technology (BEST) at York, are organizing a stimulating and informative speaker series to provide experts on these issues that will also help you prepare for this scholarship competition.\nJoin us every Wednesday from Feb. 9 to March 23, from 12:30 to 2 p.m.\nFor registration and more information, visit ieeed (yorku.ca) ( https://www.yorku.ca/cifal/ieeed/ )\n\n \n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/improving-the-economy-while-enhancing-the-environment-dialogue-ieeed-speaker-series/
