SUMMARY:Intellectual Property Seminar for York U Researchers
DESCRIPTION:Innovation York ( https://innovationyork.ca/ ) is hosting an online Intellectual Property (IP) Seminar ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/intellectual-property-seminar-for-york-u-researchers-tickets-253275502847 ) for York University researchers. It is open to all York University faculty, research trainees and research students who are interested in building IP literacy.\nIP Seminar for York U Researchers\nJoin us to learn about IP rights, why they matter, and how IP strategies can be applied to your research.\nDate: Feb. 15, 2022 11 a.m. to noon\nSpeaker: Anil Bhole, Lawyer, Patent Agent and Trademark Agent at Bhole IP LAW\nRegister to join: https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/intellectual-property-seminar-for-york-u-researchers-tickets-253275502847 ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/intellectual-property-seminar-for-york-u-researchers-tickets-253275502847 )\n*It is an online event. Details on access to Zoom meeting will be shared upon registration.\n
