SUMMARY:Meditation Focused on Academics & Life Challenges (Drop-In)
DESCRIPTION:Scott Pope, a trained Psychologist, from Student Counselling, Health and Well-being will provide an array of meditation styles that will help you to de-stress and increase positivity as it relates to your academic challenges and overall life challenges. A few types of meditation styles Scott focuses on are progressive relaxation, visualization, loving-kindness, focused and body scan. These are drop-in sessions and do not require registration.\nWe hope you can take some time and join us via zoom:\nhttps://yorku.zoom.us/j/93109917921?pwd=RERKTkhIOVA5ZEtCZXlFRGRFL2Z5dz09 ( https://yorku.zoom.us/j/93109917921?pwd=RERKTkhIOVA5ZEtCZXlFRGRFL2Z5dz09 )\nMeeting ID: 931 0991 7921\nPasscode: 318663\n
