SUMMARY:York Circle @ Home | Cycles of inequality and exploitation in nation-building
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by Dr. Rebecca Pillai Riddell, Academic Chair of The York Circle, this virtual lecture series will showcase York’s leading faculty members engaging in lively panel discussions and Q&A sessions on key themes related to this year’s topic: “Oh Canada! The True North Strong and Free?” The series will be held over four sessions throughout the year.\nRegister: https://bit.ly/3Hed2mM ( https://bit.ly/3Hed2mM )\n
