SUMMARY:2021 L.L. Odette Sculptors in Residence Public Talk
DESCRIPTION:York University’s Department of Visual Arts and Art History cordially invite you to attend a public lecture by BUSH Gallery members Tania Willard and Peter Morin, the 2021 L.L. Odette Sculptors in Residence.\nPlease join us as the artists discuss the work completed while in Residence at the L.L. Odette Sculpture Studio, and in collaboration with VISA 4090Z- Sculpture Intensive course. The artists will discuss their land-based collaborative project BUSH Gallery, decolonial artistic praxis, and approaches to artistic pedagogy in this one-hour live Zoom session.\nWednesday, February 16, 2022\n5 – 6 p.m.\nFREE\nREGISTER HERE ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJItdeyvqT8vHNGFXbv-jZZOAxPyDz48UVUs )\n
