SUMMARY:Bell Let’s Talk Day! Trans and Non-Binary Support Group
DESCRIPTION:Join Student Counselling, Health & Well-being’s (SCHW) monthly online group to meet other York students navigating gender in a relaxed and safe space.  Our group is facilitated by Jay Jonah, a trans-masculine social worker who specializes in supporting trans and non-binary folx.\nThis group is a space to share as much or as little as you want. Ask questions, listen in, or chat and make some new friends!\nOpen to all trans, non-binary, gender-non-conforming folx, and those who are questioning their gender.   ●●●●●●●●●●●\n
