SUMMARY:Graduate Admissions – Virtual Office Hours
DESCRIPTION:Throughout January, join our Grad Officer, Eileen Watson, to discuss questions you may have about graduate admissions, our programs, as well as graduate-level study at York University. This is a virtual drop-in event.  You can join the virtual office hour at any time to ask questions and do not need to remain online for the session’s entire duration.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more, visit https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJIvc-ytrD8tHtVM-YjGvOkK55LIdm-ypZK_ ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJIvc-ytrD8tHtVM-YjGvOkK55LIdm-ypZK_ )\nLearn more about our Graduate Programs | https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate\nHave questions, email us at FGSNEWS@YORKU.CA\n
