SUMMARY:International Transfer Students: Learn how to Travel Around Toronto
DESCRIPTION:As a new student in a big city, travelling can be overwhelming. There are many forms of transportation in various countries. Knowing what routes exist and what types of transportation services are available is important to keep in mind. Across Toronto, transportation options include the subway, streetcar, bus, GO Transit, Züm, YRT, bike share, taxi, Uber and more. This session will identify and assist you in learning what each transportation system offers and explain the monthly bus pass system.\nRegistration is required. Registration Link:  https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJEvc-GsrTksG9J3HCmbhfOH6c_SeoIS6gwI ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJEvc-GsrTksG9J3HCmbhfOH6c_SeoIS6gwI )\n
