SUMMARY:Online Session: Writing Workshop Series for Graduate Students
DESCRIPTION:Facilitated by Hallie Wells, PhD, the workshops are designed to help you develop and refine a writing routine, learn concrete writing strategies to embolden your writing, offer tools for seeking and processing feedback, and provide techniques for finishing revisions. Participants are welcome to attend all eight sessions or choose certain sessions.\nTopic 7: Asking for What You Need: Handling Feedback\nWhen: Thursday, March 31 – 2 to 4 p.m.\nRegister here: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJ0tf-GtqjIoEtcYBVETkSHeCEBwznBmGw8m\n
