SUMMARY:EGY W22 – Graduate Diploma in Professional Accounting (PACC)
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education? Or, looking to take the next step in your life and career? The Faculty of Graduate Studies at York University invites you to Experience Grad York—a free virtual event spanning two days in February.\nThe School of Administrative Studies’ Graduate Diploma in Professional Accounting is a CPA Ontario accredited program designed for students who want to get a head start in earning their Chartered Professional Accountant (CPA) designation! The Graduate Diploma in Professional Accounting is offered three times a year in the fall, winter and summer, and can be completed on a full-time or part-time basis.\nJoin us to learn more about this dynamic program.\nRegister today ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ) on the Experience Grad York website!\n
