SUMMARY:EGY W22 – Visas, Study Permits, Work Permits and More with York International
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education? Or, looking to take the next step in your life and career? The Faculty of Graduate Studies at York University invites you to Experience Grad York—a free virtual event spanning two days in February.\nIn this session, York’s International Student Advisor and Immigration Specialist Mayoori Malankov will go over the study permit and Visa application process. She provides tips on how to make a strong application, helps you understand the recent updates from Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada (IRCC) and provides information on the current travel restrictions to Canada.\nRegister today ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ) on the Experience Grad York website!\n
