TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Future Students: AMPD at National Portfolio Day (Virtual)
DESCRIPTION:Are you considering post-secondary studies in Visual Art? Visit our virtual booth at National Portfolio Day.\nPlease have a portfolio of your best work ready to receive one-on-one feedback from our faculty members.\nFeatured programs:\nYork University Visual Art – Studio Art – BFA ( https://vaah.ampd.yorku.ca/programs/bfa/ )\nOur professors are professional artists and designers who practice and exhibit their work internationally. They’ll be on hand to review your work and give you useful tips on perfecting your portfolio.\nWe look forward to meeting you and seeing your work!\nAdmission is free.\nAMPD at National Portfolio Day\nDATE: Friday, February 18, 2022\nTIME: 1PM – 5 PM (EST)\nREGISTER NOW\nFor more information please visit https://nationalportfolioday.org/ ( https://nationalportfolioday.org/ )\n \n
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/future-students-ampd-at-national-portfolio-day-virtual-199-430-788-827/
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design
